-- GossipTitleMapData.lua, generated data (no code after the tables).

local M = QE_GossipMap

M.zhCNtoEN = {
    ["$C，战歌峡谷急需增援，帮助我们对抗银翼哨兵吧。在那里你可以赢得战歌前锋部队的尊敬！你有勇气加入战斗吗？"] = "$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?",
    ["$C，战歌峡谷迫切需要增援。如果你愿意助我们一臂之力的话，你将获得前所未有的荣誉。银翼哨兵对你的所做所为也会表示敬意。你愿意加入战斗吗？"] = "$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch.  But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills.  As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf.  Will you join the battle?",
    ["$C，战歌峡谷需要援助。你能帮助我们攻打战歌前锋吗？"] = "$C, we need your assistance at Warsong Gulch.  Will you aid us in our fight against the Warsong Outriders?",
    ["$N，你好。"] = "Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat.",
    ["$N，我已经查明魔苔在整个黑海岸的影响有多么的猖獗。泰达希尔和我们周围大地的堕落的确引起了塞纳里奥议会德鲁伊以及所有的暗夜精灵的关注。$B$B我的目标就是查出为什么会发生这样的事并将其制止。"] = "$N, I've come to find out how rampant the effects of Fel Moss are throughout Darkshore. The corruption of Teldrassil and our surrounding lands really concerns the druids of the Cenarian Circle, and all Night elves.$B$BIt is my goal to find out why this has happened and to put an end to it.",
    ["$c，如果那就是你的愿望，那么去战士区找克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈。他是阿拉索联军的代表，能帮助你到达阿拉希盆地。"] = "If that is your wish $c, then you will need to speak to Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior's Terrace.  He is a representative of The League of Arathor and can help you to get to Arathi Basin.",
    ["$g先生:女士;，你想去哪里？只需要花几个小钱，你就可以搭乘狮鹫快速到达目的地。"] = "Where is it ye would like to go $g lad : lass;? For just a few coin my Gryphons can get ye there faster than even the swiftest horse.",
    ["$g嗨，帅哥，你想去格罗姆高吗？我听说那里的丛林整日雾气腾腾的，也许我们可以一起度个短假，我让你看看真正的丛林虎怎么样？:来吧，参观一下奇妙绚丽的荆棘谷丛林。你可以在水晶般的蓝色海岸线上惬意地洗日光浴，而我却站在这难以忍受的高温下整天傻看着我的兄弟弗雷萨！尽情享受你的旅程吧！;"] = "$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;",
    ["$g尊敬的先生:女士;，在你掌握制皮的更多知识之前，我还不能帮助你，对此我感到很遗憾。跟法多恩或达丽亚娜谈谈。他们能教你所需的技能。"] = "I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require.",
    ["$g小伙子:姑娘;，你准备好动身前往奥特兰克山谷了吗？让部落尝尝失败的滋味！"] = "Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?",
    ["$g小伙子:姑娘;，你可以去卡拉诺斯雷酒酿制厂外找谢尔比·石火。她会好好照顾你的宠物的。"] = "Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.  She'll take good care of any pets ye might have.",
    ["$g小伙子:姑娘;，努力吧。苦干和决心——那就是成功之道！书本知识是远远不够的。"] = "Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need.",
    ["$n！你回来陪我说话解闷儿啦？你心肠真好，而且你这身衣服看起来相当不错呢！$B$B你不知道我见到你有多高兴。我呆在这儿真是太寂寞了，这些粗俗的灵魂又没法看见我。感谢你为我们所做的一切，我是永远不会忘记的！$B$B谢谢你过来看我，别拘谨。"] = "$n! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!$B$BYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!$B$BThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger.",
    ["$n，你对我们在奥特兰克山谷的处境有什么想法？你准备好跟霜狼氏族作战了吗？"] = "$n, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley?  Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?",
    ["$n，在战场上看到你这样经验丰富的家伙真好！很抱歉，我们军队的物资过低，无法发动对部落的大规模地面攻击。$B$B跟我们的军需官谈谈，他会给你供给任务的。"] = "$n, it's good to see veterans like you in the field!  I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available.",
    ["$n，很高兴再次见到你！你玩得开心吗？$B$B想要来掰手腕吗？不，当然不……你想要保护好自己的手臂！"] = "$n, it's good to see you again!  Are you having fun at the Faire?$B$BWant to arm wrestle?  No, of course not... you want to keep your arm!",
    ["$n，必须消灭银翼哨兵！你做好进入战歌峡谷的准备了吗？"] = "$n, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?",
    ["$n，我不介意听到这个。不，你绝不能进入灼热峡谷，决不可能。我告诉你多少次了——我绝对不会让你进去的！你难道听不懂吗？你难道是兽人假扮成的？看我口型，不！$B$B如果我让你进去，那么每个人都会想要进去。不久之后，你最好的朋友，你的远房亲戚，然后你远房亲戚的朋友，然后所有的人就会来我这里想要进去。以前发生过这样的事情……好吧，我们不谈以前的事情。"] = "I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!$B$BIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened. ",
    ["$n，我如何才能在大地母亲的心目中继续你的深造呢？"] = "$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?",
    ["$n，我已经看到了你的潜力。现在拿上锤子准备开工吧，你需要大量的练习才能提高自己的水平。"] = "I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice.",
    ["$n，欢迎回到大锻炉。你是来拜访我的，还是准备进行下一阶段的训练？"] = "Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?",
    ["$n，眼下，奥特兰克山谷的雷矛卫队需要你助战，共同打败霜狼氏族。这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会！你想要参加战斗吗？"] = "$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?",
    ["$n，这真是你做的吗？真是一件精美的作品。我会继续训练你的，相信总有一天你可以达到皇家铸甲匠的水准。"] = "$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself.",
    ["$n，阿拉希盆地急需增援。在这危急时刻，正是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。我恳求你去城中寻找阿拉希盆地的军官。"] = "Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city.",
    ["<你靠近沃科尔时，他一点都不理睬你。他好象集中精力关注他的绷带以防脱落。过了一会儿，他抬头看你，有一点惊诧。>$B$B噢，对不起，$c。现在不太合适。我希望你能理解。"] = "<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>$B$BOh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand.",
    ["<卡兰叹了口气。>$B$B我想……我想你是对的。$B$B哥沙克告诉我你的酋长有个大计划，一个可能会改变联盟和部落关系的计划。关于这点你知道些什么？"] = "<Kharan sighs.>$B$BI suppose... I suppose you are right.$B$BGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?",
    ["<卡兰清了清喉咙。>$B$B我们艰难地穿过灼热峡谷的隧道，进入了这片饱经蹂躏的荒地。现在回想起来，这事情十分蹊跷。我们所遇到的危险只不过是在这个地区生存的一些野生动物，我们很容易就赶走了它们。$B$B我们轻松地抵达了黑石山，并毫不费力地穿过了这座由巨石砌成的堡垒。"] = "<Kharan clears his throat.>$B$BWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.$B$BWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup.",
    ["<塔希斯呻吟着>$B$B或许还有时间……听仔细了，凡人。$B$B我穿越了虚空，我探索了未知的世界……我与一个强大的邪恶存在定下了微妙的协议……$B$B<塔希斯咳出了鲜血。>$B$B你……你是否能相信，即使是艾露恩也不再怜悯我，$r？现在我要死在这里了，要以这种方式……"] = "<Tarsis groans.>$B$BThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.$B$BThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...$B$B<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>$B$BWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, $r? To die here, in this manner now...",
    ["<安多洛夫严肃地看着你。>$B$B如果它会流血，我们就能杀了它。"] = "<Andorov looks at you grimly.>$B$BIf it bleeds, we can kill it.",
    ["<德米提恩笑了。>$B$B愚蠢的家伙，你的奖励就是痛苦地死去！"] = "<Demitrian laughs.>$B$BYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!",
    ["<德米提恩跪倒在地。>$B$B你已经找回了主人的牢笼！$B$B我期待这一天已经很久很久了，我的愿望终于实现了。$B$B必须解放我的主人！"] = "<Demitrian falls to his knees.>$B$BYou have recovered my Master's eternal prison!$B$BOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.$B$BHe must be released!",
    ["<普瑞斯托女士怒视着你。>"] = "<Lady Prestor glares at you.>",
    ["<纳瑞安将一封未打开的信贴到他的前额。>$B$B这是什么……嗯……天鹅绒！$B$B是吗？"] = "<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>$B$BWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!$B$BAm I right?",
    ["<艾瑞斯点着头。>$B$B这只眼睛见证了许多恐怖和惊奇的事情。$B$B它会显现出观察者理应看到的场景。"] = "<Eris nods.>$B$BThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.$B$BIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see.",
    ["<雷矛中士向你敬礼。>$B$B姓名，军阶和编号，士兵！这是你唯一需要提供给那些肮脏的霜狼走狗的信息！"] = "<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>$B$BName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!",
    ["<高图斯啐了一口唾沫。>$B$B我是部落的勇士，$n。让我愤怒的是得知我们的敌人正坐在离卡加斯不到一天路程的堡垒中，密谋着要对我们发起攻击。$B$B我渴望摆脱责任的束缚，以酋长的名义将他们消灭。$B$B但是，我们都有各自必须承担的职责。"] = "<Goretooth spits.>$B$BI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.$B$BHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.$B$BAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill.",
    ["“……”$B$B牛头人德鲁伊的尸体静静地躺着，看起来他好像终于离开了这个世界。"] = "'...'$B$BThe body of the tauren druid lies still and unmoving.  It would seem as though he has finally passed from this world to his promised great beyond.",
    ["“在为战争采集资源这方面，你做得太棒了！”他们说，“你一定会得到晋升的！”然而他们真正的意思是，“你会和一群小不点的矮人一起被部署在希利苏斯的某个虫巢外面，卡恩斯！”$B$B多谢提携，中尉！"] = "'Great job collecting resources for the war,' they said, 'Have a promotion,' they said.  What they really meant is 'You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!'$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!",
    ["“牛头人语？”$B$B牛头人德鲁伊满怀期望地看着你，但是你显然无法跟她沟通。她微笑着指向自己，然后指着你。最后她向南面的道路指了几下。$B$B或许她是在说那里有能跟你进行交谈的德鲁伊？"] = "'Taurahe?'$B$BThe tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the south.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road?",
    ["“达纳苏斯语？”$B$B暗夜精灵德鲁伊满怀期望地看着你，但是你显然无法跟她沟通。她微笑着指向自己，然后指着你。最后她向北面的道路指了几下。$B$B或许她是在说那边有能跟你进行交谈的德鲁伊？"] = "'Darnassae?'$B$BThe night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the north.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?",
    ["一个强大的人类魔法师传闻就在北部生活；他为了某种不为人知的原因一直在看守着那片大地。我自己没有亲自去过，但是据说访问者在那里很受欢迎，如果他们愿意为他办些差事的话甚至可以赢得他的好感。"] = "A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him.",
    ["一个很好的问题！我们马戏团这里有很多东西出售。如果您对食物和饮料感兴趣的话，那么您可以去斯塔姆和塞兰妮亚的小店看看。我最喜欢的就是暗月特别套餐。  如果您想要购买一些特别的东西，那么兰拉出售的货物将会很适合您。她擅长于从世界各地收集稀有的东西。  另外从到处跑来跑去的弗里克那里购买可以用于投掷的球和宠物青蛙。"] = "An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food and drink, then head over to Stamp and Sylannia's booth. My favorite is the Darkmoon Special Reserve.If you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.And then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets.",
    ["一个志趣相投的团体可以成为一支非常强大的力量。克拉姆会帮助你们达到这个目的。你可以在雷霆崖电梯旁边中部高地的底层的公民信息中心找到他。"] = "A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.",
    ["一个新手采药师？那你该找神殿花园的菲罗迪恩·唤月聊聊。他或许有些专业诀窍要传授给你。"] = "A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.",
    ["一个术士，嗯……好吧，如果你想在附近继续做那种事情，你最好管好你的恶魔，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我不喜欢恶魔，但是我喜欢杀死他们。你明白我的话了吗？  现在你不要再烦我了，马上消失去荒弃的洞穴。你会在那里找到那个术士，瑟斯哈特。"] = "A warlock, eh...  Well, if you've got a mind to be doing that sort of thing around here then ye best keep yer demons on a leash $gboyo : girlie;.  I don't like demons, but I love putting mah axe to them.  Ye get me?  Now you just leave me be and go get lost in The Forlorn Cavern.  That's where you'll find that warlock, Thistleheart.",
    ["一个术士？好吧，如果我是一个术士，我可能会待在这附近最黑暗的地方……那就是狮王之傲旅店的地下室。你应该先到那里去看看。"] = "A warlock?  Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement.  That's where you should look first.",
    ["一个潜行者？嗯……我曾听说过那个科瑞恩·塞尔留斯在那些阴暗的地方游荡。找她谈谈，看看你能学到点什么。"] = "A rogue?  Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types.  You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn.",
    ["一个潜行者？我不习惯跟那些家伙打交道，但我相信詹诺克就是你要找的训练师。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅店找到他。"] = "A rogue?  I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["一个烹饪培训师？那好吧，你到大熔炉东北方的铜壶铁罐店去。达瑞尔·瑞克努索会教你制作极好的菜肴，那肯定会让你获得新生的！"] = "A Cooking trainer is it?  Well then, get yerself over to the Bronze Kettle on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.  Daryl Riknussun will teach ye to make a mighty fine dish that's sure to put the life back in ye!",
    ["一个猎人？好的，那么你会想跟矮人区的索尔芬·石盾谈谈。  哦，你一定要告诉他如果我再次介入他的宠物生意，他就可以去培训那些监牢里的猎人了！"] = "A Hunter is it?  Well, then you will want to speak with Thorfin Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.  Oh, and you be sure to tell him that if I step in his pet's business one more time, he's going to be training other hunters from behind bars in the Stockade!",
    ["一个真正的专家知道他的局限，而我并不羞于承认你的技能超越了我。我想让你到阿祖拉之塔拜访基塔·费温德。她很有声誉。"] = "A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason.",
    ["一个神奇的冬幕节……啊……小$G男孩:女孩;。好孩子在烟林牧场当地的任何小卖部都有特别的，嗯，折扣。真棒。"] = "A wondrous Winter's Veil to you... uh... little $G boy : girl;.  Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor.  Yum.",
    ["一个纯净的样品就是在非故意情况下未被腐蚀的样品。我们需要尽可能在最基本，最正常的环境中找到这样的生物。$B$B这意味着某个全无文明痕迹或是未受艾泽拉斯某个种族所影响的地方。某块……处女地。"] = "A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.$B$BThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched.",
    ["一个裁缝是吗？哦，如果你在这儿呆的时间够长你就会最终听到关于乔吉奥·波利罗的谈论。他现在已经领导潮流几个月了。如果你希望跟他学习，你能在法师区的外圈找到他。"] = "A tailor is it?  Well, if you hang out here long enough you'll eventually hear word of mouth about Georgio Bolero.  He's been setting the trends for some months now.  If you wish to learn from him, you can find him over in the Mage Quarter in the outer rim.",
    ["一个邮筒？你要发信，或者也许你要收一封信？我希望是个好消息！在达那苏斯中心银行外面就有一个邮箱。"] = "A mailbox?  You have a letter to send, or perhaps have received one?  I hope it's something good!  There's a mailbox right outside of the Bank in the center of Darnassus.",
    ["一位名叫劳尔娜·晨光的女祭司住在多兰纳尔，我认为你可以在旅店北面找到她。"] = "A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn.",
    ["一切都完了……"] = "All is lost...",
    ["一千年前，阿纳克洛斯和鹿盔封印安其拉大门时，三位族人牺牲了自己的性命，将其拉虫人禁锢在这些大墙内，流沙之战宣告结束。$B$B他们曾立下誓言，一旦甲虫之墙开启，他们就将召唤麦琳瑟拉、亚雷戈斯和凯雷斯特拉兹。$B$B因此……我们来了。"] = "A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.$B$BEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.$B$BAnd fall it did... and so we came.",
    ["一场猛烈的风就要来了——我可以通过我裸露膝盖的疼痛判断出来。我就是希望我们不要被狂风困住。"] = "A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don't get caught up in it.",
    ["一定要来看看暗月马戏团为你带来的各种千奇百怪的东西！"] = "Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!",
    ["一旦你建造了这个装置，你就将被传送到可爱的加基森！几乎使用这个装置的人都发现在其立即到达了这里！$B$B有报告说，有别人试图用一种坏的版本来替换我们的产品，但是我相信我们不久之后就可以解决这个问题……"] = "Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be whisked away to lovely Gadgetzan!    Nearly everyone who has used the device has arrived on the pad here looking just the way they did when they began!There have been some reported problems with transportees being replaced by their evil selves from an alternate universe, but I'm sure we will have that worked out soon...",
    ["一瓶雷霆啤酒外加格雷姆罗克做的菜就足以让你饱餐一顿。如果你想成为一名厨师的话，就该去参加他的培训。"] = "A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock's cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook.",
    ["一股强大的邪恶力量正在蠢蠢欲动，$R。你感觉到了没？$B$B啊！当然你无法感觉到。把你的护甲和武器给我吧，我会让它们恢复活力。"] = "A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?$B$BBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor.",
    ["一艘鲁瑟兰的渡船会从泰达希尔底部的鲁瑟兰村出发前往奥伯丁。达纳苏斯的传送门会让你安全抵达鲁瑟兰村。"] = "A Rut'theran Ferry leaves for Auberdine from Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.  The portal in Darnassus will allow you to reach Rut'theran safely.",
    ["万圣节快乐！你喜欢我的面具吗？非常吓人呢！"] = "Happy Hallow's End!  Do you like my mask?  Very scary!",
    ["上层暗夜精灵曾经统治这座城池，他们在此演练威力强大的奥术。现在他们受到诅咒，灵魂在这片土地上游荡，恶鞭军官纳迦侵占了精灵的城市。纳迦一定在废墟中搜寻那些上层精灵的神器。"] = "Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts.",
    ["不……你不能坐在我的膝盖上，$g伙计:女士;。"] = "No... you can't sit on my lap.",
    ["不借助刀具或是毒药离开这儿就算完成任务。"] = "Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.",
    ["不可思议。太不可思议了。你给了我们启迪，$n。"] = "Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n.",
    ["不可思议，不是吗？所有这些神器和残骸。$B$B我不清楚是什么给我留下了更为深刻的印象，它们的规模，还是它们背后的故事。要学习的东西还很多。我们能找到其中的关联……$B$B你知道那个传闻吗，听说许多种族与暗夜精灵有着相同的遗产。"] = "Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.$B$BI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...$B$BDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?",
    ["不幸的是，对于拥有像你这样经历的人来说我没有什么可教的，我的朋友。去找暗夜精灵希尔瓦娜·林月，她住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"] = "You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student.",
    ["不幸的是，对于拥有像你这样经历的人来说我没有什么可教的，我的朋友。找到暗夜精灵希尔瓦娜·林月，她住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"] = "Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
    ["不幸的是，血蹄村中没人懂得裁缝技能，但是你可以在雷霆崖找到训练师。出了村子，沿着北面的道路走。乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部，然后问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"] = "Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators.  Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions.",
    ["不知道玛洛尼是如何采集到那些最为娇嫩的草药的。显然你得向他多多学习。他就住在多兰纳尔的旅店东边。"] = "Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["不管我是不是瑟银兄弟会的，只要有个黑铁矮人敢靠近我，我一定会让他们尝尝我的厉害！现在，你想去哪里呢，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？"] = "Thorium Brotherhood or not, if one of them Dark Iron gets near to me they'll taste my mattock up the side of their head!  Now, where can I send ya $G lad : lass;?",
    ["不能帮你。你比我更懂药剂。还有，我还要看着罐子。去找那边的Yelmak谈谈。他懂得很多药剂的知识。"] = "Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions.",
    ["不要告诉任何人我说过，就当我什么都不知道！如果你还想学习，你应该与店主宾斯匹德谈谈。"] = "Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear.",
    ["不要让市场上的人类愚弄了你，$g小伙子:姑娘;。有了侏儒建造的那条地铁运输线，你可以很轻松地把货物从铁炉堡运送过来。如果那些家伙要收你运费的话，那么就告诉他们你要到我这里来买东西。"] = "Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me.",
    ["不要那样从阴暗中走出来。下次你要先给女生一点警示。"] = "Don't come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning. ",
    ["不要靠得太近，$N。我手中的铁锤可能会敲到你的脑袋。"] = "Don't get too close, $n. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer.",
    ["不错，我确实知道一种罕见的炼金术配方。让我来教你吧！"] = "Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe.  Let me teach you!",
    ["不随意浪费东西是我们的传统文化。当我们不得不杀死某种生物时，我们会加以利用，不让它白白丧命。  要是你想学习剥皮的话，就去工匠区找艾拉迪尔吧。"] = "As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste.  When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain.  If you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace.",
    ["不，不，在你准备好跟我学习之前你还需要很多训练！去跟那个保守的业余人士玛考布·维恩谈谈。他就是那个埋在书里的人。"] = "No, no, you'll need FAR more training before you're ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He's the one buried in books over there.",
    ["不，回答我，$N：$B在洛丹伦瘟疫爆发之前，是谁变成了巫妖王？"] = "Now, answer me this, $n:$BWhich creature became the Lich King before spreading the plague across Lordaeron?",
    ["不，在丹莫罗是没有炼金师的。你最好去铁炉堡……去工匠区找侏儒。"] = "Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh.  Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town.",
    ["不，恐怕我不能帮你。你的技能远胜于我！如果你想学习更多的知识，跟达纳苏斯工匠区的暗夜精灵泰龙尼斯谈谈。他拥有令人惊异的技能！"] = "Nope, can't help you, I'm afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's amazing!",
    ["不，我不认为在艾尔文森林中有附魔师。但是，在暴风城中有个名叫鲁坎的家伙，他开了一家商店。你可以去找他，看他是否能训练你。"] = "Nope, don't think there are any Enchanters here in Elwynn Forest.  There's a guy named Lucan who runs a shop up in Stormwind though.  You could check with him and see if he will train you.",
    ["不，我并不清楚。似乎那主要与地域有关。有些种类称为泥浆怪，有些称为泥浆怪。似乎这属于个人偏好。$B$B每次我遇到软泥怪、淤泥怪或泥浆怪时，它们从根本上都是一种生物。不同之处在于它们的环境，这也是我们需要一份纯净的样本的原因。"] = "No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.$B$BEvery time I've encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample.",
    ["不，这儿没人能教你草药学。你最好去铁炉堡碰碰运气。"] = "Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here.  I think ye'll have better luck in Ironforge though.",
    ["与克尔苏加德一样，我也是一个来自肯瑞托议会的法师，更相似的是，我与他都在寻找着埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。我们的命运似乎就这样交织在一起了，$c。"] = "Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, $c.",
    ["与自然的交流沟通是其他任何事情都无可比拟的……至少暗夜精灵是这么告诉我的。我并不擅长跟花草树木交谈，但是我想塔尼莎能帮助你。她居住在法师区外侧的炼金材料店。"] = "There's nothing quite like communing with nature... or at least that's what the night elves tell me.  I'm not much for talking to flowers and trees, but I'm sure Tannysa could help you out.  She's over in the Mage Quarter outside of Alchemy Needs.",
    ["与部落之间的战争已经到了白热化的阶段，$n。联盟需要大量的物资，我们应竭尽所能，提供帮助。"] = "The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $N.  This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it's quite necessary that all of us do our part to help.",
    ["世上第一套无畏护甲是专为血色十字军领袖莫格莱尼设计并锻造的。当穿上全套的无畏护甲之后，这位大领主看上去就像是一位来自扭曲虚空的恶魔。$B$B哎……我至尽还忘不了那时的情景，莫格莱尼高举着灰烬使者，在成百上千的天灾军团士兵中穿入穿出，燃烧着敌人与自己的生命，带起一阵阵烈炎与烟尘，身后留下敌人被烧成灰烬的尸骸。"] = "The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.  Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.$B$BAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet.",
    ["世间动物死时会将它们的生命和兽皮赐予我们。要是你能尊重它们的牺牲，或许剥皮者这个职业会适合你的。去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区，找艾拉迪尔谈谈，学习更多知识。"] = "In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.",
    ["东方的水晶塔接受蓝色，黄色，还有绿色的水晶。$B$B它专注于使用蓝色水晶作为主要力量之源而产生的能量。有两种可能的效果：一种对精神有益，而另一种产生一种破坏性的护盾。$B$B精神水晶需要蓝色和绿色的水晶。这将会增加你的勇气。$B$B尖刺水晶需要蓝色和黄色的水晶。这会产生一个对攻击者造成伤害的护盾。"] = "The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.$B$BIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.$B$BCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.$B$BCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers.",
    ["丹莫罗一带是没有狮鹫管理员的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。如果你想骑狮鹫去什么地方的话，就必须去铁炉堡。"] = "Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, $glad : lass;.  Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere.",
    ["丹莫罗这里可没有剥皮匠，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要学习剥皮的话，就到铁炉堡去找找吧。"] = "Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained.",
    ["为了与大陆保持联系，我们会定期派出角鹰兽在鲁瑟兰村和黑海岸之间传递信息的。"] = "To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore.",
    ["为了增进暗夜精灵和人类的联盟关系，我千里迢迢带来了由泰达希尔最好的工匠制作的东西。我这里的东西应有尽有，请随意挑选。"] = "Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask.",
    ["为了学习更多的术士知识，你在我面前表现谦卑是很明智的做法$N。"] = "It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge.",
    ["为了所有神圣高贵的爱，请告诉我你是来把我们从这片被遗忘之地带走的。虽然我是与马绍尔探险队一起的，我愿给你我口中的金牙，只要你让我爬进你的背包并离开这个地方。"] = "For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land.  Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place.",
    ["为了让上来观光的旅行者安全地下去，我可以为你提供翅膀。"] = "To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need. ",
    ["为了部落，$c！奥特兰克山谷需要你。"] = "Lok'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?",
    ["为什么不让我们见识一下你的能耐呢？如果你完成任务我会很高兴对你继续深造！"] = "Why don't we see just what you're capable of? If you complete the task I shall be happy to further your training! ",
    ["为什么当你要用到发条式同步协调陀螺仪的时候它们总是无影无踪呢？"] = "Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?",
    ["为什么我们需要这样的服务？荒弃的洞穴的潜行者霍夫丹·黑须已经给我们惹了一大堆麻烦，我是不是还要留意你一下？"] = "Now why would ye be needing the services of one of those types?  We get enough trouble out of that rogue, Hulfdan Blackbeard, over in The Forlorn Cavern, do I need to be turning my eye to you as well?",
    ["为什么是现在，$R？我不明白。要做的事情还有很多……"] = "Why now, $r? I just do not understand it. So much work to be done...",
    ["为冒险家服务是我的荣幸，因为他们即将成为英雄。"] = "It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making.",
    ["为此你需要到奥格瑞玛去。只需沿着从剃刀岭出去的路穿过峡谷就会到达那里。到了那里,你可以问问步兵以得到进一步的指引。"] = "You'll need to head to Orgrimmar for that.  Just follow the road heading out of Razor Hill to the north through the canyon and you'll come to it.  When you get there ask one of their grunts for further directions.",
    ["乌布雷克·火拳总是极其认真地照顾动物。如果你想让他帮你照看宠物的话，就去武器大厅找他吧，他通常跟那些猎人在一起。"] = "Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously.  He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two.",
    ["也许你应该对着这些套在我愤怒的拳头上的扩音器讲话。"] = "Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY.",
    ["也许这里不是最好的开店的地方……"] = "Maybe this wasn't the best place for a shop after all...",
    ["事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。"] = "I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way.",
    ["事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。$B$B但如果你中了蛆毒或食尸鬼疫病的话，我可以帮助你。"] = "I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way.$B$BIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you.",
    ["亡灵天灾带来的灾难就快结束；一场难以控制的颠覆行动会将我们推向顶峰！你务必要帮助我们！"] = "The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!",
    ["亡灵天灾带来的灾难还在这片区域蔓延，在扭转局面，摧毁亡灵天灾之前，我们要走的路还很长。收集必要的资源，尽力帮助我们吧！"] = "The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!",
    ["亨德尔已经被我们逮捕了，$n。谢谢你。$B$B尽管审讯的进展会比较缓慢，但我向你保证，他会告诉我们他所知道的一切。$B$B眼下还请你耐心等待。如果我需要你的帮助，就会马上联系你。$B$B在那之前，请享受塞拉摩之旅，我邀请你作为联盟的朋友来到我们城市，要待多久随便你。"] = "Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance.",
    ["人们从森林植物中制造的东西难道不令人震惊吗？说真的，月神对我们已经很慷慨了。"] = "Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty.",
    ["人总是要休息的。在血蹄村的西边，旅店老板考乌斯经营着一家很大的旅馆，为人们提供休息之所。你去那儿找他吧。"] = "There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation.  On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest.  You will find him there.",
    ["人类和他们所谓的阿拉索联军想把我们赶出阿拉希盆地。我可不这么想，$c！你得动身前往那儿，证明该离开阿拉希盆地的是他们而不是污染者，准备好了吗？"] = "The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?",
    ["人类在贫瘠之地的边界处建了一座旅店，他们叫它树荫旅店。几个星期前，这家旅店被烧掉了。$b$b酋长让我们别去搭理那些人类——除非他们越过边境，不过看来有人违背了酋长的意愿。$b$b他让我负责查明事情的真相。如果你想帮忙的话，就去查看一下树荫旅店的废墟，把你能找到的线索都给我带回来。"] = "The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.$b$bThe Warchief told us to leave the humans alone, so long as they didn't cross our borders, but it appears someone violated his wishes.$b$bHe has put me in charge of getting to the bottom of it. If you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me.",
    ["人类宣称尘泥沼泽是他们的领地，但是石锤部族在我们的帮助下将他们赶了回去。"] = "The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back.",
    ["什么事，$c？你在汇报吗？"] = "Yes, $c? Are you reporting in?",
    ["什么事？你没有看到我很忙吗？"] = "What is it? Can't you see I'm busy?",
    ["什么事？你没看见我很忙吗？"] = "What now?  Can't you see I'm rather busy?",
    ["什么是圣光兄弟会？好吧……简单来说，我们就是银色黎明的核心成员，一群不受虚伪的道德与懦弱的自省这类毫无用处的人类感情所限制的人。你可以把我们视作血色十字军，只是我们没有那么缺乏纪律性和领导力，也不那么愚蠢和盲目地狂热。$B$B别去询问血色十字军指挥官任何有关我们的话题。$B$B也别让泰罗索斯知道我刚才说了些什么，要不然，他要是找上门来，我还非得把他揍爬下不可……联军两大领袖打架可是个丑闻，会引起冲突的。"] = "What is the Brotherhood of the Light? Well... We are all members of the Argent Dawn at the core - members of the Argent Dawn that aren't held in check by morals, guilt and useless human emotion. Consider us Scarlet Crusade minus the stupidity, lack of leadership, and blind zealotry.$B$BDon't let the Scarlet Commander tell you otherwise.$B$BAnd don't let Tyrosus know I said that... It would be a terrible shame if I had to brutally maim him should a brawl break out.",
    ["什么，你找不到那里？到精神谷湖里的黑石南小屋去，就在力量谷往上靠西的地方。"] = "What, you can't port there?  Go to the Darkbriar Lodge next to the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["什么？"] = "What?",
    ["什么？但是怎么可能呢？不！这不可能！我已经很小心了……他不可能知道的！$B$B你撒谎！你撒谎，你欺骗了我，去死吧！"] = "What?  But how?  No!  This is not possible!  I have been so careful... he could not know!$B$BYou lie!  You lie, and now you'll die for your deceit!",
    ["什么？你为什么在烦我？哎呀，我打赌你甚至不能制造一件高质量的长袍！去找斯诺恩谈谈，等你水平提高以后再来找我！"] = "What? Why are you bothering me? Why, I bet you can't even create a high quality robe! Go talk to Snang and come back when you're worthy of my talents!",
    ["什么？你打扰我了，你最好赶快找到一个说得过去的理由。"] = "Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so.",
    ["什么？你要什么东西？"] = "What? You want something?",
    ["什么？我不认为暴风城里有术士训练师。  不过……在法师区的那家名叫“已宰的羔羊”的旅店中有一些与恶魔有关的活动，我想你应该去那里看看。"] = "What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. Although... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there.",
    ["什么？我在干什么？你眼睛不好使吗？我是一个梦想家，亲爱的$g先生:女士;，我梦想我们的将来会更加美好。很明显，我是个梦想家。$B$B然而，有些人却在想尽办法把我们困在平庸的泥沼里。我告诉过他，我是一个梦想家，而范达尔却回答说，“哦，我们似乎还缺一些挖水沟的。”$B$B我会帮助塞纳里奥议会弄走周围的泥堆，直到平庸的枷锁从我们身上卸下的那一天。"] = "What am I doing?  Do you lack vision?  I am a dreamer, good $g sir : lady;, and I dream of a better future for us all.  Clearly, I am a visionary.$B$BThere are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality.  I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, 'Well, the world needs ditch diggers too.'$B$BUntil such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around.",
    ["什么？我当然是一个铁匠。什么，你认为矮人是打铁最有效率的种族？好吧，可能是那样。去找一个矮人来帮你！"] = "Yeah? Of course I'm a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!",
    ["今天不太开心？尝尝这些樱桃馅饼吧。"] = "Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie.",
    ["今天是春节的最后一天，祝你来年万事顺意！"] = "It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!",
    ["今天碰巧是你的幸运日；我完成了超级商人680型的维护工作，因此有大量物品以超低的价格出售。你自己去看看吧……我的兄弟考克认为他的贸易机器人1000型会胜过我的。"] = "This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680's maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot.",
    ["今天要我送你去哪里，$c？"] = "Where can I send you today $c?",
    ["从事某种专业的学习是一个长期的过程，但是回报很丰厚。你想选择什么样的专业？"] = "The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?",
    ["从你的站姿我可以看出你不是战士。$B$B你为什么不做点安全的事，比如读书什么的。"] = "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior.  $B$BWhy don't you go do something safe, like read a book.",
    ["从前我欢迎过黑暗，因为它是夜晚的姐妹。现在总是漆黑一片，甚至在白天也是这样，而森林迫切需要给养。除非我们快些行动，否则这扩散的瘟疫就会遍布整个世界。"] = "Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world.",
    ["从我们呆在环形山这里开始，达丹加就喜欢上了遍布这里的巨大的血瓣花苗芽。$B$B我敢肯定她会喜欢，如果你愿意带给她一大堆花苗芽的话……"] = "Since we've begun our stay in the crater, Dadanga's taken a liking to the large bloodpetal sprouts that grow all over the place here.$B$BI'm sure she'd enjoy a snack, if you feel like bringing her some...",
    ["从暴风城入口直走，就在贸易区。"] = "It is located in the Trade District citizen.  It is nearly straight on from the entrance of Stormwind.",
    ["从这里离开，$c，不然他们也会把你锁住的。"] = "Get away from here, $c, or they'll put you in chains as well.",
    ["他们将尸体交给了我，他将尸体投进了深坑。"] = "They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit.",
    ["他们差点把我的兄弟洛克希给派来了。他连自己的狗都照顾不了，还是让那些能够展现血色十字军实力的人来这里吧。"] = "They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner.",
    ["他们并未意识到自己已经死了，$r。他们受到诅咒，在头脑中保留了这个城镇被毁灭之前的记忆，大部分是这样，还有一部分人更为不幸。$B$B你认为是亡灵天灾所为？那时亡灵天灾还不存在呢，就算是它们的话，我们也会与它们展开一场恶战的。$B$B不，这场恐怖而极具破坏性的瘟疫源于通灵学院，它摧毁了整座城镇，无人生还。$B$B让我独自承受这悲伤吧。"] = "They don't realize that they're dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.$B$BYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.$B$BNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.$B$BNow leave me to my sorrows.",
    ["他们挂起灯笼是为了庆祝春节。"] = "They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival.",
    ["他们说小洞不补大洞……什么来着？啊，我记不得了。反正是愚蠢的说法。"] = "They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway.",
    ["他们说我愚蠢，我要证明自己的实力。我要关注所有的罐子，证明它们都能煮东西。我的好运就要来了！谁是愚蠢的人，嗯？嗯！？"] = "They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?",
    ["他们说我被祝福了：新世纪需要被聆听的传讯者。"] = "They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age.",
    ["他变得越来越胖而且越来越堕落，你可以闻到他身上发出臭味，他很脏所以我觉得他要去洗洗。$B$B好吧，不说这些奇怪的东西了。你从哪里来，我能帮你什么忙吗，$c？"] = "He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash.$B$BEnough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?",
    ["他名叫鲁伯特·鲍什。我听说他在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店楼上的某间房间里。"] = "Rupert Boch is his name.  I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town.",
    ["他在法师区，那儿有一间名叫炼金材料店的小商店。你会在前往法师区的沿途看到各种各样奇怪的商店，但是如果你沿着外围走的话，你一定会找到它的。"] = "Tucked away in the Mage Quarter, there is a little shop called Alchemy Needs.  You're bound to see all sort of strange shops on your way through the Mage Quarter, but if you stick to the outer rim you'll be sure to find it.",
    ["他给你蜂蜜酒$b$b他给你啤酒$b$b他总是过着快乐的生活$b$b这么多年他为我们每个人都服务过$b我们叫他微笑的吉姆。"] = "He'll bring you mead$bHe'll bring you beer$bA grinning face from ear to ear$bHe's served us all from year to year$bWe call him Smiling Jim.",
    ["付钱给我，我就说……$B$B哦，是你，$n！别介意……"] = "Pay me and I'll talk...$B$BOh hey, it's you, $n! Nevermind about that...",
    ["仰望天空吧，$C。这片区域已经有一千年没有见过龙族了！我就知道，那些其拉虫人在策划着什么阴谋！"] = "Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!",
    ["任何与部落——特别是兽人——交战的机会都是不容错过的。你可以在战歌峡谷中得到充分的历练，到武器大厅去找莱兰迪斯谈一谈吧，她会送你去战歌峡谷的。"] = "Any chance to fight against the Horde, especially orcs, is a good time if you ask me. You'll find plenty of battle in Warsong Gulch, that you will. Head on over to the Hall of Arms and speak with Lylandris. She'll set you on your way.",
    ["伙计，欢迎来到藏宝海湾。希望你在这儿度过一段快乐而……嗯，平静的日子。如果你口渴的话，我们这儿有很多饮料；如果你担惊受怕的话，我们这儿还有很多保镖。$B$B现在，我这个卑微的地精仆从能为你做些什么呢？呃，你又能为我做些什么呢？"] = "Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?",
    ["似乎黑龙的势力范围已经超越了燃烧平原，扩展到暴风城了！人们揭下了篡位者的面具并将他流放出境。"] = "It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted.",
    ["住在雷酒酿造厂的一名法师或许能教你一些新的魔法。我想他名叫玛济斯·石衣。"] = "There's a mage at the Thunderbrew Distillery who might be able to teach you some new spells.  I believe his name is Magis Sparkmantle.",
    ["作为一个法师，你是极少数可以操纵传送门魔法来帮助你回到这里的$r之一。如果你准备好了，我现在就可以教你。"] = "As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.",
    ["作为一名法师，你是少数可以召唤传送门返回这个地方的$r。如果你已经准备就绪，我就可以教你这种法术。"] = "As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.",
    ["作为探险者协会的一员，我曾在这片区域搜寻古代器物。据说冬泉谷有许多不可思议的物品……很多物品都受到严密的保护。"] = "Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded.",
    ["作为灰谷猎场最强大的野兽，沙普塔隆可以在这片大地自封的卫兵——暗夜精灵的陪伴下自由的漫步。沙普塔隆在这里南部寻找猎物，尽情的撕裂着毫无防备的旅客。$B$B要想杀死这样一个野兽需要极大的努力，$N。我希望你在猎杀这个野兽时运气好一点！"] = "The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.$B$BTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!",
    ["作为萨尔手下最强大的二十名战士，我们被称为萨尔近卫军。$B$B在等待奥格瑞玛的命令时，我要求在诅咒之地边境建立一座营地。但是数星期过去了，酋长那里还是没有任何消息传来，我们开始变得有些焦躁不安了。$B$B$n，那是个错误的决定。我曾经年轻而又雄心勃勃，无所畏惧。这支部队在我的指挥下开进了诅咒之地。$B$B不久之后我就开始后悔了。"] = "Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers.$B$BI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.$B$BIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.$B$BA decision I would later regret.",
    ["作为驻扎在这里的工头，我的职责就是确保在这里所进行的所有事情，从工作到休息和放松都包含着一定的令人厌烦的成分。$B$B如果你发现某件你被要求去做的事情过于简单或者没有什么好抱怨的话，请立即向我报告。"] = "As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.$B$BIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately.",
    ["作为黑海岸的一名年轻的暗夜精灵，我遇到了一队暮光之锤的成员。他们待我如同亲人，因此我背叛了对艾露恩的信仰，听信了他们的蛊惑之言。$B$B直到艾露恩的幻影从我眼前闪过，我才幡然省悟。$B$B我满怀悔恨，开始向艾露恩祈祷。"] = "As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer.$B$BIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.$B$BIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune. ",
    ["你……你好，$n。对不起，我正从伤势中恢复过来。$B$B那些血色十字军比我料想的要凶猛的多。他们几乎在里面干掉了我。$B$B你也应该多加小心。我不愿看到他们先发制人。"] = "He... hello, $n. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.$B$BThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.$B$BYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you.",
    ["你……现在是你帮助被遗忘者最好的时机。好好听着，我不喜欢重复我说过的话。$B$B我们现在极度缺乏布料。绷带和任何布料储存量都很低，我们希望接受捐赠来补充库存。你的捐赠不会有任何经济补偿——这就是捐赠的含义——你的捐赠一定会为我们所赏识。"] = "You there... it is in your best interest to aid the Forsaken during these dire times.  Listen closely, as I dislike repeating myself.$B$BWe currently find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  Bandages and simple textiles are running low, and donations are being accepted to bolster sagging inventories.  While you'll not receive financial compensation - hence what donation means - your aid will not go unnoticed.",
    ["你一定是在寻找铁匠阿古斯。如果你需要接受训练的话，他通常在闪金镇监督铸造工作。"] = "You must be looking for Smith Argus.  He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training.",
    ["你一定是在说泰姆·狂暴图腾。去猎人高地找他。"] = "Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise.",
    ["你一定是要找舍伦尼·洛巴尔特。沿着布瑞尔东南方的道路走，然后在十字路口向东走。她就居住在路边的某个营帐中。"] = "That would be Shelene Rhobart.  Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection.  She's at a camp along the side of the road.",
    ["你一直进行得不错，$n。我听到好消息了……"] = "You're shaping up nicely, $n. I've heard good things...",
    ["你不会失望的，旅行者。裁缝是一种充满乐趣的工作。"] = "You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor.",
    ["你不喜欢骑狮鹫，嗯。你很幸运，我们有一个替代品可以让你稳稳地立在地上。那就是侏儒们的公共交通工具，矿道地铁。在矮人区的后面，非常方便。"] = "You don't have the stomach for the gryphon ride, huh.  Well lucky for you, we have an alternative where you can keep your feet on the ground... more or less.  It's the gnomish mover of people, the Deeprun Tram.  Conveniently located in the back of the Dwarven District.",
    ["你不是德鲁伊！"] = "You're not a druid!",
    ["你不是战士……你为什么在我的训练课程中一天都坚持不下去！$B$B一个以为自己是战士的$c，哈哈！"] = "Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior.  Ha!",
    ["你不是术士而且我没时间理你。走开！"] = "You're no warlock and I've no time for you.  Begone!",
    ["你不算太聪明吧？嗯，如果我是兽栏管理员的话，我应该是在马厩附近吧？去那边找莫加努斯吧。"] = "Not too clever are you?  Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable?  Look for Morganus over there.",
    ["你不能通过。你不是我们的人，也没有发出过挑战。"] = "You may not pass.  You are not our kin, nor have you issued the challenge.",
    ["你与塞拉摩卫兵一起训练过吗？"] = "Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?",
    ["你为什么不到狮王之傲看看呢？那里的厨师可能会教你几道好菜。"] = "Why don't you try looking in the Lion's Pride Inn?  The cook there might be able to teach you a few good recipes.",
    ["你为什么想找卡普拉克谈谈？没关系。到剃刀岭西南角的洞穴顶部找他。不过你一定不要把手放错地方！"] = "Why would you want to talk to Kaplak?  Nevermind.  Look for him on top of the burrow in the southwest corner of Razor Hill.  Just make sure that you keep your hands in your own pockets!",
    ["你会在力量谷中央的奥格瑞玛银行外面找到它们中的一个。"] = "You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["你会在城镇西北端发现卡罗莱·安尼斯正试图炸掉她的房屋。为什么你不去看看你能否帮她？"] = "You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town.  Why don't you go see if you can help her?",
    ["你会在奥格瑞玛找到双足飞龙管理员的。沿着公路向北走到那里去，并向一个奥格瑞玛步兵询问更多指示。"] = "You'll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions.",
    ["你会在战士区的护卫队中找到希达奈尔，她敏锐的眼睛扫视着森林，寻找着胆敢进入我们美丽的城市的敌人。"] = "You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city.  ",
    ["你会在荣誉谷找到那个地精和他的玩具商店的。"] = "You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.",
    ["你会在那边的石火旅店旁边找到一个邮箱。那就在铁炉堡大门的北面。"] = "You can find a mailbox right o'er by The Stonefire Tavern.  It's just north of the gates of Ironforge.",
    ["你似乎正在寻求知识。也许你在找寻锻造之道，也许我能在这条道路上指引你。但是一旦你决定从事铁匠这个职业，你就应该学会聆听钢铁中的那些灵魂的呼喊。"] = "You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling.",
    ["你做得很好……是时候见见老板了。找到乔瑟夫并告诉他你准备好了。"] = "You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready.",
    ["你做得怎么样啦！"] = "How you doin' mon!",
    ["你做得比我要好！你需要一个经验比我还要多的人。那就是安尼希尔，一个在达纳苏斯工匠区生活的暗夜精灵女士。"] = "You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Ainethil, a night elf lady who lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
    ["你傻了吗？你一路上竟然没有看到任何该死的骨头丁零的玩意？$B$B<洛汉叹了一口气。>$B$B如果在户外的话，你很容易就能在东西瘟疫之地发现各类骷髅生物。相信我，你一定不会错过它们的，当然，它们要是看见了你，也不会错过你……$B$B如果你喜欢地下城，那就去斯坦索姆或者通灵学院，那里也能拿到白骨碎片。"] = "Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?$B$B<Rohan sighs.>$B$BIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.$B$BIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments.",
    ["你具有成为一名熟练猎人的潜质吗？嗯，$g年青人:姑娘;，时间会告诉我们一切的。在与军事区的雷格努斯交谈之前，别对着别人的眼睛射击。"] = "Do ye have the potential to be a skilled hunter?  Well $gladdie : lassie;, only time will tell.  Just don't ye go shooting at apples atop peoples' heads till ye've spoken with Regnus o'er in the Hall of Arms.",
    ["你准备好迎接更大的挑战了！见见我右边的弗兰克林·洛伊德。从现在开始他会指导你。"] = "You are ready for greater things! See Franklin Lloyd, to my right. He will guide you from now on.",
    ["你制造药剂的技术已经在我之上。去幽暗城的炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他可以继续你的训练，而你也可以亲眼目睹他的人民所遭受的苦难。"] = "Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people's plight.",
    ["你制造药剂的技能需要再高超一些才能当我的学生。在此期间，在那边的希尔瓦娜·林月或米拉·法拉科纳可能会帮助你。"] = "Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there.",
    ["你去哪儿？如果你想快些到那里，那就别犹豫了！"] = "Where are you going?  Well if you're looking to get there quickly, then look no further!",
    ["你可以从这个码头找到去塞拉摩的路。记住我的话，那些地方对从联盟去的人们是非常不安全的。一定要小心谨慎。"] = "You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back.",
    ["你可以到中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行存放你的财物。"] = "You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.",
    ["你可以去找吉尔曼·石手谈谈。我知道他在矮人区有一栋房子，但我不知道确切的地方。如果我是你的话，我就会去那边看看。"] = "Gelman Stonehand would be the one to talk to. I think he has a house over in the Dwarven District but I can't remember exactly. I would check over there.",
    ["你可以听到吗，陌生人？嗡嗡的声音一天比一天响。这些水晶一定是把那些虫子逼疯的元凶。"] = "Can ye hear it, stranger? The humming is gettin' louder with each passing day. These crystals must be what's driving these bugs crazy.",
    ["你可以在中心高地上找到雷霆崖银行。"] = "The Thunder Bluff Bank can be found on the lower rise.",
    ["你可以在力量谷中部的银行外面找到接收你情书的地方。"] = "You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["你可以在北边的码头搭船前往鲁瑟兰村和达纳苏斯。南边的码头是穿越无尽之海通往米奈希尔港的航线。祝你一路平安！"] = "On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Menethil Harbor on Khaz Modan.  Safe journeys to you!",
    ["你可以在去达纳苏斯的路上看到拉德纳尔在他的屋外练习手艺。你应该停下来看看他有什么可以教你的。"] = "You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you.",
    ["你可以在国王的觐见室中找到赫塔希姆。她能帮助你前往阿拉希盆地，阿拉索联军需要援助来打败污染者。"] = "In the King's audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers.",
    ["你可以在多兰纳尔周围找到众多的训练师，他们有丰富的经验可以传授给你。你想要找哪一位？"] = "You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?",
    ["你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的老板凯达米尔提供的床上安稳地睡一觉。"] = "A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.  ",
    ["你可以在布瑞尔东南边的恐惧之末旅店的楼上的一间房间找到范斯·安德格鲁姆。"] = "You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill.",
    ["你可以在恐惧之末旅店楼上的平台找到法师训练师凯恩·火歌的，恐惧之末旅店就在布瑞尔的东南端。我猜你现在去的话有点晚了，他不会再登记给你房间了。"] = "You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill.  I guess he checked in too late to get a room.",
    ["你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷里找到派尔·沉默行者。他可以教给你你想要的。"] = "You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave.",
    ["你可以在武器大厅找到我们的常驻马厩管理人乌布雷克·火拳。他将替你喂养和照料宠物。"] = "Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand.  He'll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for.",
    ["你可以在法师区的炼金材料店外面找到塔尼莎。"] = "You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter.",
    ["你可以在穿过城镇的道路东南端的恐惧之末旅店里面找到旅店老板瑞尼。"] = "You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town.",
    ["你可以在花园区的月亮井旁边找到塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩。到法师区的北边，教堂广场的西边就可以找到花园区了。"] = "Well, you can find Theridan or Maldryn by the moonwell in the Park.  Just head to the western area of Stormwind, north of the Mage District, but west of the Cathedral Square.",
    ["你可以在英雄谷东北边的那个城堡平台上找到狮鹫管理员。"] = "You can find the gryphon master on the northeast rampart overlooking the Valley of Heroes.",
    ["你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷里找到姚恩·深刺。"] = "Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village.",
    ["你可以在贸易区的暴风城接待中心里找到奥德文·拉弗林。"] = "You can find Aldwin Laughlin at the Stormwind Vistor's Center in the Trade District.",
    ["你可以在达纳苏斯银行找到你存放财物的地方，它就在我们神奇的城市中央。"] = "You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.",
    ["你可以在雷霆崖的中央高地找到拍卖行。在双足飞龙飞行点下方附近找找吧，愿你的先祖保佑你。"] = "The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider's Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.",
    ["你可以在雷霆崖的最低处寻找，就在离银行不远的地方。"] = "It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there.",
    ["你可以试着在奥格瑞玛解决你的问题，就在这里的北方。或许某个奥格瑞玛步兵可以帮你。"] = "You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar.  That's to the north.  Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you.",
    ["你可能不会像一个银手骑士那样追寻光之踪迹，但是你总可以向我们寻求帮助。"] = "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.",
    ["你听到狩猎的召唤了吗，$c？你必须仔细聆听，但是召唤从你的内心传来。他从我们所有人内心传来。"] = "Do you hear the call of the hunt, $c?  You must listen closely, but the call comes from deep within you.  It comes from deep within all of us.",
    ["你听说地铁了是吗？那可真是一样不错的交通工具！你会在矮人区的后部找到它。哦，一定记得在地铁行进时把你的胳膊和腿放到地铁里面。"] = "You've heard about the Tram have you?  What a ride that thing is!  You'll find it in the Dwarven District towards the back.  Oh, and be sure to keep your arms and legs inside the tram while the tram is in motion.",
    ["你听说过我的名字吗？或许我们俩很早就相识了……$B$B我认为我得名于某个重要人物……"] = "Does my name sound familiar to you? Maybe we knew each other a long time ago...$B$BI think I'm named after someone important...",
    ["你和我都无法想象当他们的灵魂被强行从躯体中剥离出来的时候有多么痛苦。他们没有死，但是他们也不是活着的。他们成为了一具具行尸，只会听从主人发号施令。$B$B干出这些惨绝人寰的事情的就是这里的恶魔首领拉瑟莱克，他把我的战友都变成了奴隶。其中的九个被他绑定在黑暗之门附近，其余的九个则被他的爪牙们瓜分。"] = "Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.$B$BLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates.",
    ["你喜欢这地毯吗？我亲自把动物杀死并剥皮的。但愿所有的半人马能被同样容易的击倒。"] = "You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily.",
    ["你喝过雷霆啤酒吗？那可是好东西！"] = "Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It's good stuff!",
    ["你在努力上进……现在甚至已经超过我了！你应该与铁炉堡的宾斯匹德谈话！（他会？她会？）让你见识那些我所做不到的！"] = "You're working your way up... higher than me, at this point! You should talk to Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge! (He'll? She'll?) show you more than I ever could!",
    ["你在卡兹莫丹不会找到更好的老鼠肉烧烤店的！"] = "You'll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!",
    ["你在学习好基础知识之前不能学我的技艺。如果你对训练感兴趣的话就去找卡玛瑞谈谈。"] = "You can't study my techniques until you've learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training.",
    ["你在寻找一个德鲁伊的训练师？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅店南面的月亮井去见见卡尔。"] = "You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["你在寻找一个炼金术老师是不是？我也刚从那里回来。你会在侏儒集会的工匠区找到浆泡小姐的。  ：：叹气：：……为什么我没有服下蓝色药剂呢。"] = "Yer looking for an Alchemy trainer are ye?  Just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.  ::sigh:: ...why o' why didn't I take the blue potion.",
    ["你在寻找劳迪克。你会在南面的森金村外的暗矛海滩找到他。"] = "You're looking for Lau'Tiki.  You'll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen'jin Village to the south.",
    ["你在寻找哪种专业的训练师？"] = "Which profession trainer are you looking for?",
    ["你在寻找尤萨恩·静水。你可以在村子的西面找到他，他就在石牛湖钓鱼。"] = "You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake.",
    ["你在寻找格罗达尔和暗火营地？在被称作暗影裂口的地下洞穴里找到他们。有两条通道可以进入洞穴，一条在智慧谷的南面，另一条在暗巷区里面。"] = "You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave?  Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow.  There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag.",
    ["你在寻找米什基。她在森金村南面有一间小屋。"] = "You're looking for Mishiki.  She has a hut to the south in Sen'jin Village.",
    ["你在寻找约翰森？哦，我不该说太多，不过……或许你该问问塔顶的科鲁克莱德，他会告诉你……"] = "You looking for plucky?  Well, you didn't hear me say this, but... maybe if you ask Kronkrider up in the tower, he'll tell you...",
    ["你在寻找部落大使馆里的乌特伦。在力量谷的西边你可以找到他。"] = "You're looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["你在寻找霍格拉尔？那你找过旅店吗？啊！如果你在找一个潜行者，而他同时还是一个矮人，你应该从旅店开始！先去看一下。"] = "Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already.",
    ["你在开玩笑，是吗？我认为你在寻找那个矮家伙，索恩斯·火石。他就在楼下。现在快逃吧！"] = "You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!",
    ["你在成为大师的旅途上又达到了新的高度。让我们看看能不能让你更上一层楼……"] = "You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further...",
    ["你在我这里学不到新的东西了；你知道的已经很多了。如果你想得到更多培训的话，去找雷霆崖中央高原西北方商店里的牛头人尤纳谈谈。替我向她致意，怎么样？"] = "You won't learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?",
    ["你在找什么？"] = "What are you looking for?",
    ["你在找寻一个潜行者？我认为詹诺克很适合你的描述。你为什么不到多兰纳尔的旅馆里去找他谈谈呢？"] = "You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["你在看我吗，$g小伙子:姑娘;？"] = "You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?",
    ["你在缝纫艺术方面做得很好，我必须承认。现在，让我们看看你到底有多棒……"] = "You're doing very well in the art of tailoring, I must admit. Now, let's see how good you REALLY are...",
    ["你在锻造方面的技术已经非常高超了，$n。该做出决定了。有两条路你可以选择：武器制造工匠或是装甲制造工匠。$B$B注意，当你做出决定以后，就不能回头了。每个方向的守则都不允许你三心二意。"] = "Your skill in blacksmithing is exceptional, $n. The time has come to make a decision. There are two paths you may choose: The way of the weaponsmith or the art of the armorsmith.$B$BBe warned, when you have chosen to dedicate yourself to a path, there is no going back. The discipline each path requires leaves no room for hybrids.",
    ["你在魔法方面的知识真是很出色。如果你愿意的话，还有很多要学的。跟塔兰丹谈谈，他在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"] = "You have truly excelled in your knowledge of enchanting. There is much more to learn, if you are willing. Speak to Taladan, in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus.",
    ["你大概没想到会在洞穴中找到我，是吗？$B$B我叫科琳，我实在没法告诉你我是怎么到这儿来的，但是我可以告诉你，这个洞穴现在就是我家了！$B$B我在这儿研究环形山里随处可见的奇怪水晶。"] = "You probably weren't expecting to find me in this cave, were you?$B$BMy name's J.D., and I really can't tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this cave is my home now!$B$BI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater.",
    ["你好$c--欢迎来到我们征服灰谷的前线！如果你在找事做的话，那么你算来对地方了。我总是在寻找体格健壮的人来给部落带来荣誉！"] = "Greeting $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place.  I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!",
    ["你好, $c。我今天情绪很差，所以除非你能帮我，否则我更愿意自己呆着。"] = "Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone.",
    ["你好。"] = "Good day to you.",
    ["你好。你想要学一些战斗技巧吗？"] = "Greetings.  You seek instruction in the art of war?",
    ["你好。如果你是来找皮件的，那么你会看到我的货品做工精细。"] = "Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted.",
    ["你好。我们的蝙蝠训练很严而且吃得不错。你不会找到比他们还快的了。"] = "Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You'll not find faster.",
    ["你好。我是一个亡灵法师训练师，而你是一个法师。"] = "Greetings.  I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage.",
    ["你好。我是一个侏儒法师训练师，而你是一个法师。"] = "Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.",
    ["你好。我是克洛诺斯——记忆力天下第一的克洛诺斯。我是不会忘记任何微小的细节的。$B$B相信我。"] = "Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.$B$BTrust me.",
    ["你好。我是古博·布拉普。"] = "Hi there.  I'm Gubber Blump.",
    ["你好。我是法师训练师，而你是一个法师。"] = "Greetings.  I'm a mage trainer, and you're a mage.",
    ["你好啊，朋友！"] = "Well met, friend!",
    ["你好啊，法师。我能在魔法知识的学习上为你提供什么帮助吗？"] = "Greetings mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?",
    ["你好尊贵的客人。图拉克·符文图腾和其余的德鲁伊正在长者高地上的长者大厅等你。"] = "Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.",
    ["你好！你正是我要找的人。坐下来听我说，我有个可以让咱们两个都发家致富的计划！"] = "Hello!  You're just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!",
    ["你好！你看起来挺强壮的。我们这里的卫兵数量不太够，你愿意帮忙吗……"] = "Hey, citizen!  You look like a stout one.  We guards are spread a little thin out here, and I could use your help...",
    ["你好！如果你想要接受一些挑战的话，我这里有个建议给你！$B$B我正在利用我发明的超级测蛋器帮助暗夜精灵的德鲁伊们拯救鹰角兽。由于菲拉斯废墟中的戈杜尼食人魔，这种生物的数量正在迅速减少。$B$B我收集各种不同类型的蛋。"] = "Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!$B$BAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.$B$BI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?",
    ["你好！如果你是来购买侏儒工程学图纸的，那请你准备好侏儒工程学会员卡以备验证。"] = "Greetings!  If you are here to access gnome engineering schemata, please have your gnome engineer membership card ready for verification.",
    ["你好！如果你是来购买地精工程学图纸的，那请你准备好地精工程学会员卡以备验证。"] = "Greetings!  If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please have your goblin engineer membership card ready for verification.",
    ["你好！我刚刚探索凯斯利尔废墟回来，就在西南方。现在我决定调查在这个山脉之上的枭兽，在枭翼树丛内。$B$B你与鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀谈过话了吗？他要求我来这里，或许他还有任务给你。"] = "Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well.",
    ["你好！我在这里是为了推广荆棘谷的超级无敌钓鱼锦标赛的。不过你首先得有足够的生存能力在这里活下去，然后还需要足够在这里钓鱼的精湛技巧。$B$B当你更符合以上条件的时候再回到这里来吧！"] = "Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!",
    ["你好！我的名字是洁娜！你呢？"] = "Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you? ",
    ["你好！是什么吸引你来到冬泉谷？这片寒冷广袤的土地或许显得有些凄凉，但是它蕴含着无数的秘密……"] = "Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets...",
    ["你好！欢迎你！恐怕我的售货亭还不能开张……我得修理很多东西……$B$B但是我仍然受制于血的诅咒，求你啦，笑笑吧。如果你的脸上没有笑容的话，我就得砍下我的手，并且在手掌再生之前不得食用任何肉类……"] = "Hello!  And welcome!  I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...$B$BBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates...",
    ["你好！这间工场不是我的，不是！但是终有一天当我完成训练后，我将成为一名发明家，就像我崇拜的英雄玛尔冯·瑞文斯克那样。$B$B你从来没有听说过他吗？哦，碰巧他已经离开好长一段日子啦，他去研究远古巨魔废墟啦，他是乘坐地精飞艇走的……我也不是很清楚他究竟去了哪儿……$B$B塔纳拉辛？坦克利斯？塔纳里萨尼？$B$B<莉芙摇着头。>$B$B不，名字不是这样……"] = "Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.$B$BYou've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...$B$BTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?$B$B<Liv shakes her head.>$B$BNo, that's not it...",
    ["你好！陌生人，你在找什么？"] = "Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?",
    ["你好，$C——我是奥格瑞玛的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在奥格瑞玛的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Orgrimmar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Orgrimmar for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是幽暗城的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在幽暗城的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Undercity.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Undercity for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是暗矛部族的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在暗矛部族的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Darkspear tribe.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Darkspear tribe for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是暴风城的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在暴风城的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Stormwind.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Stormwind for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是诺莫瑞根流亡者的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在诺莫瑞根流亡者中的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是达纳苏斯的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在达纳苏斯的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是铁炉堡的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在铁炉堡的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C——我是雷霆崖的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在雷霆崖的声望也会因此提高。"] = "Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service.",
    ["你好，$C。你是来学习神秘的手艺的吗？"] = "Greetings, $c.  Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?",
    ["你好，$C。我是塞纳里奥要塞的兽栏管理员莱欧伦。"] = "Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold.",
    ["你好，$C。我是大元帅斯诺·落雪。$G小伙子:姑娘;，我们面前的道路充满艰辛，如果你想要帮忙的话，请尽量帮助我们。有什么问题尽管问吧。"] = "Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We've a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions.",
    ["你好，$C。看来你最近在进行一项秘密的收集工作？你还是老样子，但是这是个繁忙的城市。$B$B如果你参加了那场会议，你就该得到一段代码。把代码告诉我，我就会给你一份特殊的奖励作为回报。"] = "Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.$B$BIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return.",
    ["你好，$G先生:小姐;。我是克希雷姆大人的学徒尼瑞尔。如果你们有任何问题，请随意向主人询问。$B$B当你准备下山的时候，就过来找我吧。"] = "Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.$B$BI will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain.",
    ["你好，$N。我是克罗诺姆，但是你可以叫我克罗米。我觉得叫这个名字舒服些。$B$B现在——你问我是怎么知道你的名字的？我是青铜龙的一员，永远与时间的消长相合。你可以认为我们以前遇到过，到最后，我们还会再次相遇。$B$B我希望我所选择的外观没有给你带来困惑；虽然我被派来这个充满悲伤的土地作为哨兵，但我可不想陷入悲伤中。"] = "Hello there, $N.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.",
    ["你好，$N。欢迎来到避难谷地。"] = "Hello, $n. Welcome to Refuge Pointe.",
    ["你好，$N，欢迎来到纳拉其营地。关于你来到的消息很快就在部落传开了。"] = "Greetings, $N, and welcome to Camp Narache. News of your arrival spread quickly among the tribe.",
    ["你好，$R$C。我是此地的联盟大使汉默·石锤。$G小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要了解联盟战争物资的收集情况，问我好了。"] = "Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask.",
    ["你好，$R。我是部落大使佐格将军。我是来向你通报部落关于安其拉一战的准备工作的进度的。你想知道什么？"] = "Lok'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?",
    ["你好，$c。"] = "Greetings, $r.",
    ["你好，$c。$B$B那边的哨兵允许我住在他们的营地，只要我答应不会再有麻烦了——我敢肯定你能意识到对外交的需要，是吗？$B$B我来调查这片土地的紊乱状况，既然这也有助于他们的事业，他们同意我在这里 只能协助艾泽拉斯各族之间脆弱的联盟关系。如果你想帮我，那么我会很感激，但无论如何，请不要引起任何麻烦。"] = "Greetings, $c.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble.",
    ["你好，$c。你想要一些建议？好吧，找个法师当朋友就对了！我们的袖口里藏着一些小把戏……"] = "Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do...",
    ["你好，$c。你愿意帮助战歌峡谷的银翼哨兵作战吗？"] = "Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?",
    ["你好，$c。你找法拉德谈过了吗？"] = "Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?",
    ["你好，$c。如果你在寻找皮革制品和制皮物资的话，来问我这个半退休的圣骑士就算是找对人了。"] = "Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin.",
    ["你好，$c。对不起，我正在与雷布拉特谈话。他认为即使土地变成了这样也不是完全无可救药的。"] = "Hello, $c. Please excuse me as I am having a conversation with Rimblat. He believes that even this land is not beyond saving.",
    ["你好，$c。对于某些人来说，猎人是一种生活方式，一种所选的职业。对于其他人来说，这是用来消遣的东西，一个勇气的徽章，或是依照你的部族的某种通过仪式。$B$B对于我来说，种族和职业什么都不是--我所尊敬的是对你的灵魂和心智的测试。因为对自然力的抵抗和他们的技能的测试是真正荣誉的标志。$B$B如果你希望检测自己并赢得我的尊敬，那就跟我多谈谈。"] = "Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.",
    ["你好，$c。我在亡灵壁垒设立营帐，准备进入瘟疫之地。不久之前，谣传有一位伟大的人类巫师居住在壁炉谷。血色十字军强迫他为他们的战士和猎人制造新的弓箭和枪支。据说在十字军杀死他之前，他铸造了一件非比寻常的武器。$B$B我猜想他们对奥术越来越不信任了。"] = "Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.$B$BI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown.",
    ["你好，$c。我怜悯你，因为魔法的真正秘密是你永远也无法企及的……"] = "Greetings, $c.  I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you...",
    ["你好，$c。我是军需官米兰达·布利洛克——银色军团为数不多的授权装备和军品军需官之一。$B$B既然你在我们的委任下与邪恶战斗——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵那里得到勇气勋章。勋章有两个作用：用他们赢得在军队中更高的地位，或者作为交换得到特殊物品。$B$B随着你在军团中地位的升高，你会发现你会有更多的物品。"] = "Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",
    ["你好，$c。我是拉斯塔哈的仆从伊克萨尔。"] = "Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan.",
    ["你好，$c。我是杰希尔·月弓。我从达纳苏斯来寻找两个朋友，他们是来寻找费伍德森林暗影议会的踪迹的。$B$B看起来那些宣称对兽人种族的苦难负大部分责任的卑鄙的生物正试图重获一些能量。$B$B我的两个朋友进入加德纳尔搜寻证据来证明有事情发生。$B$B我希望我来时他们在这里，但是他们已经晚了数天了。"] = "Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late.",
    ["你好，$c。我是部落的勇士雷克萨，是萨尔的仆人，是野兽与野性之王。"] = "Greetings, $c. I am Rexxar, champion of the Horde, servant of Thrall, master to the beasts of the wilds.",
    ["你好，$c。我给你的建议是：当你在世界各地旅行的时候，要当心魔法，它会将不熟悉它的人烧成灰。"] = "Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.",
    ["你好，$c。我这个羽月要塞的仆人可以为你做些什么呢？"] = "Greetings, $c.  What may this humble servant of the Feathermoon Stronghold do for you today?",
    ["你好，$c。有什么我能帮忙的吗？"] = "Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?",
    ["你好，$c。欢迎你来到永夜港，还有整个月光林地。塞纳里奥议会欢迎所有尊敬大自然的权威和支配力的生灵。$B$B当你在这里的时候，请一定要保持所有事物的平衡。这里不喜欢受到打扰，而我们的看守所受的训练就是无条件地停止所有的敌对行为。"] = "Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.$B$BWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question.",
    ["你好，$c。欢迎来到塞纳里奥要塞。我们在这个异种生物最强盛的地方对抗他们。我希望你可以助我们一臂之力。"] = "Greetings, $c.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold.  From here we will strike against the silithid where they're at their strongest.  I hope you've come to lend a hand.",
    ["你好，$c。没有多少时间谈话——我在动身去壁炉谷之前只是把冰风营地作为暂留地休息一下。我曾听到传言在他们疯掉之前，血色十字军强迫一个法师为他们工作，为他们的士兵制造强大的弓箭和枪支。我不敢肯定他成功与否……十字军在他们的成品制成之前杀死了他。或许他们杀死他为了保密……也可能他们不太信任奥术。"] = "Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much.",
    ["你好，$c。眼下正是收获节——感恩与追思的季节。我们举办盛宴感激所有我们应该感激的人，追忆我们的祖先和英雄，感谢他们给我们留下的宝贵遗产。$B$B请尽情享受这盛宴吧。我还会燃放焰火助兴。"] = "Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.$B$BPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year.",
    ["你好，$c。虽然长期饮用烈酒已经让我的感觉变得迟钝了，但我的心灵之眼依然十分强大。"] = "Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong.",
    ["你好，$c！你准备参加战歌峡谷的战斗了吗？为了部落！"] = "Throm'ka $c!  Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?",
    ["你好，$c！欢迎来闪光平原观看赛车！"] = "Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!",
    ["你好，$c，很高兴认识你。"] = "Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.",
    ["你好，$c，我是萨纳瑞恩·绿树。"] = "Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender.",
    ["你好，$g先生:女士;。我想握你的手，但是如你所见，我正忙着做事。我可以帮忙吗？"] = "Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?",
    ["你好，$g先生:小姐;。你看起来就像是个对美酒有着独特品味和见解的$c。我想让你帮个忙，并提出一个你无法拒绝的建议……忘了它！"] = "Hey, $gmister:miss;.  You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine.  I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!",
    ["你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;……我是奥格索普，你拥有的某件侏儒设备很可能就是我发明的！如果它爆炸了，那它就不是我发明的；如果它给你带来了财富，那我们可以讨论一下版权金的问题！$B$B哦，对了，如果你来自诺莫瑞根，那你可以走了。我没有什么跟你好说的。"] = "Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!$B$BOh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you.",
    ["你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我可以帮你什么忙吗？"] = "Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?",
    ["你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要在铁炉堡之外找到最好的交易地点，那么你就算找对地方了。"] = "Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place.",
    ["你好，$n 。你是来学习铁炉堡的历史的？"] = "Greetings, $n. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?",
    ["你好，$n。"] = "Hello, $n.",
    ["你好，$n。你看上去是个强壮的$c——你应该能够在这个地区有所作为。你可以去接触一下你不了解的东西，否则对你的长辈表现出失礼的行为将招致惩罚。$B$B你可以不尊重我或者我的同伴，但是如果你真的那么愚蠢的话，你就必然会学会尊重我们的力量。$B$B现在，闲聊够了，有什么事情我可以帮忙的？"] = "Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.$B$BYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.$B$BNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?",
    ["你好，$n。如果你想学习烹饪技巧的话，可以随时来找我。"] = "Hello, $n. If you'd like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time.",
    ["你好，$n。我们从月光林地来这里，要将新年的喜悦传播到世界的各个角落。$B$B你难道不想与我们一起庆祝新年吗？"] = "Greetings, $n.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.$B$BWon't you join us in our celebration?",
    ["你好，$n。我在这里训练和照料年轻的角鹰兽，你可以随意看看。"] = "Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around.",
    ["你好，$n。我是古斯塔夫·范沃森医生，联盟的首席外科医生。"] = "Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma.",
    ["你好，$n。我是格里高利·维克托医生，部落的首席外科医生。"] = "Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma.",
    ["你好，$n。我是米洛尔·怒斩，大熔炉的看守者。"] = "Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge.",
    ["你好，$n。欢迎来到塞尔萨玛，别忘了去本地的酿酒厂看看！"] = "Hello, $n.  Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you're here don't forget to visit our local brewery!",
    ["你好，$n。让我帮你前往战歌峡谷，好吗？"] = "Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?",
    ["你好，$n！如果你需要的东西在我店里找不到，那么我可以专门去帮你找一下！"] = "Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!",
    ["你好，$n！我是一名熟练的技师，我叫斯库提。"] = "Hello, $n! I am master engineer, Scooty.",
    ["你好，$r。我是弗兰克罗恩·铸铁。你是来了解黑石塔和黑铁矮人的吗？"] = "Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?",
    ["你好，$r！我是哈格丁中尉，是负责招募雷矛卫兵的官员。$B$B你在雷矛军队中获得一定的威望后再来找我吧，我会升级你的徽章的。如果你丢失了徽章，我也能再给你一枚。"] = "Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement.",
    ["你好，勇敢的$c！我有世界上最训练有素的狼供你挑选。你到哪里都不会发现能与狼拥有同样的耐力和生存本能的动物！你亲自来看看它们吧。"] = "Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You'll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself.",
    ["你好，年轻的$c。"] = "Greetings, young $c.",
    ["你好，年轻的$g主人:女主人;。我是艾瓦·萨克霍夫，这是我的丈夫卢森。很高兴认识你。"] = "Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.",
    ["你好，年轻的潜行者。你在找什么？"] = "Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?",
    ["你好，我的朋友！我是哈古斯，战歌前锋部队的军需官。随着你在战歌氏族中的声望不断提升，我可以为你提供一些可在战歌峡谷中使用的商品。如果你需要修理装备的话，我也可以提供这样的服务。"] = "Zug zug, my friend!  I am Kelm Hargunth, the main supplier for the Warsong Outriders.  As you improve your standing with the Outriders, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.",
    ["你好，我的朋友，欢迎来到艾择拉斯最伟大的展览会！$B$B请尽情浏览我们展出的东西吧。来看看这些暗月马戏团在广袤而又神秘的艾泽拉斯世界中找到的各种千奇百怪的东西！我们不收取任何费用，我们为你带来无限惊喜，为孩子们带来让他们兴奋的东西！"] = "Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!",
    ["你好，旅行者。只要你待在塞纳里奥要塞的城墙里，就可以免受一切伤害。$B$B当你离开要塞的保护之后要特别小心，异种生物在这片土地上横行。"] = "Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.$B$BBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late.",
    ["你好，旅行者。大约1000年前，其拉虫人开始了对卡里姆多大陆的战争。$B$B在那场战争中损失了数以千记的生命，大多数都是在战争爆发初期丧身在这片该死的沙漠中的。$B$B我是少数幸存下来的人，我连接了过去和现在。我不知道我为什么还留在这里，但是我知道我必须这样做。"] = "Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.$B$BThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.$B$BI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must.",
    ["你好，旅行者！介意探索一下神秘世界的秘密吗？嗯？"] = "Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?",
    ["你好，朋友。愿黎明在这个乱世之中保佑你平安无恙。"] = "Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times.",
    ["你好，朋友。我是普尔哈特，隶属于银色黎明这个世界性的组织。我们的目标非常简单——与艾泽拉斯的一切邪恶力量进行顽强而持久的战斗。我们不是一个政治团体，也不想成为那样的团体。为了银色黎明的伟大目标，我们将联盟和部落的成员都当作并肩作战的朋友来看待！$B$B为了黎明而战，我的$G兄弟:姐妹;！"] = "Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is simple - fight swifty and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!",
    ["你好，朋友！你对灵质装载器感兴趣吗？或者是看看全向鬼灵同化器？"] = "Greetings, friend!  Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors?  Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator? ",
    ["你好，欢迎。我不太擅长微笑，但是相信我；我很高兴能为您服务。"] = "Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you.",
    ["你好，部落的$C。我是督军格尔库克，部落物资收集行动的指挥官。艰难的岁月就要来临，但我们还是会获胜的，胜利永远属于我们。$B$B如果你有什么问题，就去问问他们吧。"] = "Throm'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde's war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.$B$BIf you have questions, you should ask them.",
    ["你如此大胆地跑来找我，想要接受训练，我对此可不高兴。穿过拱道，沿着坡道向东南方走，跟亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他能教你一些基础知识。"] = "I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics.",
    ["你学习的能力已经超过我了。你需要找那边的本娜·冰蹄谈谈以获得更多指示。但请不要占用她太多时间。她需要休息。"] = "Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest.",
    ["你学得很快，$g小伙子:姑娘;，快得我已经远远跟不上你了。如果你想继续学习的话，我建议你去见见我的导师。他的名字叫洛特加斯，嗯，洛特加斯·石须。你可以在铁炉堡的大锻炉那里找到他。"] = "Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name's Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye'll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge.",
    ["你学得很快，这是件好事。但要注意按照工作的要求适当地完成工作。现在，我恐怕必须要把你送到斯纳尔那里多学些东西。你要学会所有他能教的，但不要听他的气话。当萨鲁的女儿笑话他时他就变成那样了。"] = "You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him.",
    ["你宁愿把你的货物交给一个地精吗?"] = "Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?",
    ["你完成了昨天的作业吗？要是完成了，就过来跟我坐一块吧！"] = "Did you finish yesterday's assignment?  If so, then sit by me!",
    ["你对哪个战场感兴趣？"] = "Which battleground are you interested in?",
    ["你对皮革的理解比我要深刻。可能你应该拜访一下贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的牛头人克鲁姆·满月。对你这么聪明的学生他有很多知识要教给你。"] = "Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.",
    ["你对自己的宠物伙伴表现出的关爱之情是值得赞扬的。矮山上的布尔鲁格能帮助你照看宠物。他居住在银行和旅馆之间的地方，去找他吧。"] = "The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn.",
    ["你对药剂的知识已经远胜于我，但你还有很多要学的。上楼去到东南面见见马尔什医生。他会交给你真正的苦痛——啊咳。他是一个被遗忘者，他能进一步训练你。"] = "Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further.",
    ["你寻找一个喜欢动物的人？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅馆的外面寻找瑟里亚迪。她就是你找的那个人。"] = "You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek.",
    ["你寻求更高级的知识。坦帕拥有这种知识。她应该就站在附近……"] = "You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby...",
    ["你尝过我们的面包吗？面包师玛斯特森是最具天才的烹饪师！"] = "Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!",
    ["你差不多已经达到训练的顶峰了。为了成为你能做到的最伟大的附魔师，你还需见一位导师。她的名字叫做安诺拉，而你或许能在奥达曼找到她。"] = "You have nearly reached the pinnacle of your training. To become the greatest enchanter you can possibly be, you have one more instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman.",
    ["你已经为我做了很多事情，$n。谢谢你。$B$B现在我至少可以告诉你，我是怎么来到这里的。我和我的好朋友特雷·莱弗治潜入加德纳尔调查暗影议会，然后就在毫无准备的情况下被他们抓住了。他们把特雷带到暗影堡的深处，并把我关在这里，他们把我们所有的装备都拿走了……我仍然可以听到他的惨叫，$n。他们……简直丧心病狂。我不知道他们都对他做了些什么，但他们会为此付出代价的。"] = "You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it. ",
    ["你已经回来了！现在，我能为你做什么呢？"] = "You're back already!  What can I do for you now?",
    ["你已经学会了我现在能教你的所有知识，$n医生。当你获得更多经验的时候再来找我吧，我会传授给你更多高级的医学知识的。"] = "You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts.",
    ["你已经学会了我能教给你的所有东西，$n。如果你还想继续学习的话，去找暴风城法师区的暗夜精灵莉琳希亚·夜风谈话。我听说她是个好老师。"] = "You've already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher.",
    ["你已经完成了泰洛尼斯的任务，感谢你所做的一切，$n。"] = "You have completed Teronis' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $n.",
    ["你已经完成我要求你做的事情，$n。我这里没有什么需要你做的了。如果你想继续为瑟银兄弟会服务的话，和黑石深渊的黑铁酒吧的罗克图斯·暗契谈谈。$B$B再见！"] = "You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.$B$BFarewell!",
    ["你已经成为一个出色的猎手了，$n！你不但证明了你的技能，你还胜过了达瑞尔，这是你在我的名册中得到了额外的分数！$B$B欢迎你随时来到这里。"] = "You've become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!$B$BYou're welcome here any time.",
    ["你已经掌握了它的用法。我没有什么要教你的了，但是找亚瑟·摩尔谈谈，他是在幽暗城潜行者区工作的一位被遗忘者。告诉他是我派你去的。"] = "You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you.",
    ["你已经是一个比我好得多的铁匠，那是肯定的。尽管如果你告诉其他人这点我会否认我曾说过。你该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈。如果有人能教你，那就是他。"] = "A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him.",
    ["你已经比许多人都走得更远了，$n。敬畏大自然的力量，你就会取得比大多数人都要伟大的成就。"] = "You've come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most.",
    ["你已经表明了你的愿望，也支付了珍贵的石头。我会教你的……"] = "You have shown me your desire, and have payed with precious stone.  I will teach you...",
    ["你已经超越我有限的能力了。到达纳苏斯的工匠区寻找暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她可以教给你更多知识。我很希望我可以跟你一起去。"] = "You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you.",
    ["你已经通过测试了，干得好！对你的培训可以继续了。"] = "You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue.",
    ["你希望利用这些尸体以表示对它们的尊敬，这很好。去暗巷区中心的 科多兽皮工店找苏尔德吧。"] = "It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag.",
    ["你希望把大地母亲的骨头设计成可以帮助部落的工具。好的，好的。沿着北边的路走出血蹄村直到一部可以上到雷霆崖顶部的电梯那里。那里的守卫可以给你更多帮助。"] = "You desire to shape the bones of the Earth Mother into tools that will aid the Horde.  Good, good.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the elevator leading to the top of Thunder Bluff.  A Bluffwatcher there can give you further assistance.",
    ["你带来了课本吗？我能和你一起看吗？"] = "Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?",
    ["你帮助了我，我会告诉我所知的这片土地和生物的情况。我所了解的并不多，但是我可以告诉你一些你可能感兴趣的事儿。"] = "Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself.",
    ["你干的很好，旅行者。我能收你当徒弟令感到很骄傲！"] = "You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!",
    ["你并不为我的人民所知。科多兽是强大的坐骑，它是我的人民爱心和关怀的产物；所以它不能给陌生人。在雷霆崖的长老认为你的品德高尚之前，我不能卖给你科多兽。"] = "You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo.",
    ["你并未得到拉文霍德公爵的认可，$c。"] = "Ravenholdt Manor does not recognize you, $c.",
    ["你应该去听听根妮亚·符文图腾的忠告。她在村子东面的大营帐中。"] = "It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village.",
    ["你应该去战士区找布洛冈·石盾，$c。"] = "I know just the one that you speak of $c. You must seek out Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace.",
    ["你应该去找斯瓦特。到剃刀岭东边的兵营里找找看。"] = "You need to find Swart.  Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.",
    ["你应该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈，他是我见过的最好的矮人铁匠。你可以在矮人区的中心地带找到他。"] = "Therum Deepforge is the dwarf you want to talk to. One of the finest blacksmiths around if you ask me. You can find him in the heart of the Dwarven District.",
    ["你应该去钢架补给站找布隆克。当他不忙着修补一些奇怪装置的时候，他通常就在跟飞行员们聊些关于他们的蒸汽坦克的事。"] = "Ye should check over at Steelgrill's Depot for Bronk.  When he's not tinkering with some odd device, he's usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks.",
    ["你应该和奥斯伯谈谈。暴风城没有比他更擅长潜行艺术了，那家伙就在旧城区里。"] = "You want to talk to Osborne then. No finer teacher of the stealth arts than him in Stormwind. Look for him over in Old Town.",
    ["你应该找柯布神父谈谈，到灵魂高地下的预见之池去找他吧。"] = "Father Cobb will be the one you want to talk to. He can be found under the Spirit Rise in the Pools of Vision cave.",
    ["你应该是在寻找泰金。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到她。"] = "You're looking for Tai'jin.  Find her in the barracks on the east side of town.",
    ["你当心些，$c。尊重我们的方式，否则你和你的人们就会受到诅咒。"] = "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours.",
    ["你当然不会失望!现在既然我们已经把那个清除掉,你可以下达指令了!"] = "You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we've gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!",
    ["你很幸运来到达纳苏斯，因为你遇到了像祖卡斯特这样多才多艺的猎人作为你的培训师。我建议你到塞纳里奥区拜访她并寻求她的指导。"] = "You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.",
    ["你很热心，这很好。然而，你还不够资格接受像我这样的人的培训。"] = "You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. ",
    ["你得去奥格瑞玛。出了剃刀岭沿着北面的道路走，就能到那儿了。跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会给你指明方向的。"] = "Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions.",
    ["你得及时准备好接受我的教学，$n。到那时，找达丽亚娜谈谈，他会帮助你训练的。"] = "In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training.",
    ["你必须去西部荒野的海洋搜寻，向正西方——金海岸矿洞与海岸交接处往西北方向。海岸边有一只锚，看来附近一定有艘沉船。水下的压力很大；如果游得太远的话，即使是最优秀的潜水者也可能死于疲劳。$B$B去找一处适宜的自然环境吧，$n——这附近有起泡的海底裂缝，能在深海潜水时提供氧气。"] = "The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  $B$BLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath.",
    ["你必须找一个更有经验的老师，因为你已经超越了我的能力了。我建议你找这里的莉琳希亚·夜风谈谈：她有更多知识可以传授给你。"] = "You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer.",
    ["你必须明白，像我这样活了一万年的人，对生命有独特的看法。眼下你经受的考验和磨难都是毫无意义的。"] = "What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless.",
    ["你必须给我一点时间，$c，纳迦正在攻击我们。搞定他们之后再来找我！"] = "You'll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I'll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!",
    ["你必须耐心一些，$n。我的间谍机器人正在进行非常精密的操作，马上就帮你搞定。$B$B哦，帮我个忙，尽量不要让莱斯科瓦看到你……我们要伏击他。"] = "You'll have to be patient with me, $n. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.$B$BOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him.",
    ["你忘记自己的学生服了吗？你认为时尚比亡灵天灾的统治更重要吗？"] = "Did you forget your student's attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge's domination?",
    ["你总有一天能跟我学习……但现在还不是时候！为什么不先跟站在我右边的斯普莱特聊聊呢。入门之后再来找我！"] = "You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don't you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you've gotten your feet wet!",
    ["你想学习如何使用武器，是吗？嗨，$g小伙子:姑娘;，别在站在那儿发呆啦，大声说吧！"] = "Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye?  Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!",
    ["你想学习工匠的手艺吗？那你就得去工匠区找宾斯匹德。  从铁炉堡大门一直往正东方向走，或者朝着传来爆炸声的方向走。"] = "The tinkerer's craft for you is it?  No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town.  Just head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions.",
    ["你想学习怎样使用一种新武器是吗？那么，你就应该与那边的密林武器店武器商店的比克斯和布里维夫谈谈，$g小伙子:姑娘;。他们对从斧头到……嗯……双手武器都非常了解。"] = "Yer looking to learn how to use a new weapon are ye?  Well, ye should be talking to Bixi or Buliwyf over at the Timberline Arms weapon shop then $glad : lass;.  They know their weapons from axes to... uh... zweihanders.",
    ["你想学习成为一个裁缝？嗯……我相信在东谷伐木场有一个裁缝可以教你。"] = "You want to learn to be a tailor?  Hmmm... I believe there's a tailor over in the Eastvale Logging Camp that may be able to get you started.  ",
    ["你想学习？跟着我？太棒了！唯一比装配子弹和炸药装置有趣的事情就是与别人分享那种知识！我们开始吧！"] = "You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!",
    ["你想学点东西吗？我会很乐意教你的！"] = "So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!",
    ["你想干什么，小松鼠？赶快从我眼前消失，不然你就有机会搞明白为什么他们叫我愤怒者了。"] = "What is it that you want, lemming? Get out of my sight before you find out why I am known as the Wrathcaster.",
    ["你想成为一个标本剥制师？我不喜欢那些从我身上获得材料然后运走的人，因为他们认为我死了。难道不讨厌吗？好了！到城镇东南边的一个营地找寻兰德·洛巴尔特。要找到他需要走布瑞尔东南方的路，然后在十字路口左拐。"] = "You aiming to be a taxidermist?  I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead.  No?  Good!  Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town.  To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection.",
    ["你想找的是卡德里斯。她和其余的萨满正在智慧谷萨尔的要塞的入口房间那里。"] = "You seek Kardris Dreamseeker.  She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom.",
    ["你想知道如何用铁砧和锤子制作东西吗？卡恩·石蹄可以教你这些。他是个铁匠，就在中部高地的水池旁。"] = "Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond.",
    ["你想知道收集工作的进度吗？很好。我得到的最新消息称，部落已经收集到$2095w个瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。"] = "You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We've also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed.",
    ["你想要什么？"] = "What do you want?",
    ["你想要什么？$B$B梅维克只跟德鲁伊和萨满祭司往来。"] = "What you be expectin', mon?$B$BMaywiki only be dealin' with the druids and shaman.",
    ["你想要什么？*嗝儿*"] = "What you be wanting? *hic*",
    ["你想要加入哪个战场？"] = "And to which battleground do you wish to journey?",
    ["你想要学习制皮？西蒙·坦纳尔可以教你。你可以在旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里找到他。"] = "Want to learn leatherworking, eh? Simon Tanner would be able to teach you. He can be found in Old Town at the Protective Hide.",
    ["你想要学习这项古老的手艺？你希望冶炼黑铁？$B$B给我一样祭品我就会考虑的！"] = "You wish to learn the old craft?  You wish to smelt dark iron?$B$BAppease me, $r.  Show me a sacrifice and I will consider it!",
    ["你想要帮助阿拉希盆地的污染者打败阿拉索联军吗？很好，去预见之池找马丁·林塞寻求帮助吧。"] = "You wish to aid The Defilers in their fight against The League of Arathor in Arathi Basin?  Very well, you should ask Martin Lindsey for his assistance then.  Look for him in the Pools of Vision.",
    ["你想要帮助阿拉希盆地的被遗忘者打败人类吗？那就去勇者大厅找迪兹·斯诺班谈谈。"] = "You wish to help the Forsaken with their fight against the humans in Arathi Basin?  Then go to the Hall of the Brave and speak with Deze Snowbane.",
    ["你想要成立一个公会，对吗？祝你好运！  和暴风城接待中心的奥德文·拉弗林谈谈吧。你从英雄谷进入贸易区之后就可以看到暴风城接待中心了。"] = "Gonna make a guild, are ya? Good luck to ya then!Talk to Aldwin Laughlin in the Stormwind Vistor's Center. It's in the Trade District right as you come in from the Valley of Heroes.",
    ["你想要找什么？"] = "What are you looking for?",
    ["你想要炼金训练者吗？嗯，我刚从那儿过来呢，真的。你可以在侏儒的聚集地侏儒区找浆泡小姐。"] = "An Alchemy trainer is what you need?  Well, I just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.",
    ["你想要穿皮革对吗？听起来你该与旧城区的西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈。他在那儿开了一家叫做护体皮甲的商店。"] = "You're into leather, eh?  Sounds like you should talk to Simon Tanner over in Old Town.  He runs a shop there called the Protective Hide.",
    ["你想要飞往什么地方？"] = "Where would you like to fly to?",
    ["你想飞回塞纳里奥议会的鲁瑟兰村吗？"] = "Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?",
    ["你或许不知道，除了是一个娴熟的裁缝之外，约莫德还是一个巨人杀手！为什么说当他大喊他一拳打死了七个的时候可以断定他一定偷听到我们在一起讲的东西！  你应该到大熔炉北面他的店铺去拜访他一下，并看看他是否会在跟你讲他的传奇故事！"] = "Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow!  Ye should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!",
    ["你所要做的就是铸造萨弗隆战锤和找到萨弗拉斯之眼。将萨弗拉斯之眼和萨弗隆战锤结合在一起就能成为萨弗拉斯！我不会告诉你任何关于萨弗拉斯之眼的信息。我想你自己能找到的。在这张合约上签字，让我们达成交易。"] = "You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I'm not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I'm sure you'll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done.",
    ["你打扰我就是为了这个？你穿得真是跟垃圾一样，你还不如背着个死兔子到巨魔的洞里去跑一圈哪！"] = "Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage.",
    ["你找塞纳里奥议会有什么事，$n？"] = "What brings you to the Cenarion Circle, $n?",
    ["你找错兽人了。我不训练新手。去问问那边的小伍特……谦虚一点。"] = "You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words.",
    ["你把尸体翻过来然后看到她武器上的标志——她的护甲已经都损毁了，她的头发披散在她的脸上。$B$B根据曼科里克对于她的描述，你可以确定这就是她的妻子。$B$B他一定会为这个消息而感到悲伤，但是你相信他还是希望知道真相的。"] = "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.",
    ["你把我的鱼吓走了！你到底要怎么样？"] = "You scared the fish away!  What do you want?",
    ["你操纵得比我要好！你需要一个经验比我还要多的人。那就是赫伯特·哈尔希医生，一个在幽暗城炼金房工作的亡灵。"] = "You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",
    ["你敢踏入拉文霍德庄园，可怜虫？"] = "You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?",
    ["你是一个非常棒的附魔师。我恐怕已经超出我的才能了。到阿祖拉之塔找到基塔·费温德。现在只有她才配作你的导师。"] = "You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now.",
    ["你是不是想要我在强大的$N所率领的军团之前畏缩？$B$B你对我来说不算什么。什么都不是。如果我想要你的头颅，那它就会被插在长矛上呈送给我。$B$B你犯了所有凡人都会犯的错误。$B$B<维克多·奈法里奥斯叹了口气。>$B$B如果你像花钱一样花费你的时间，那就会发生一些奇怪的事情。"] = "Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?$B$BYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.$B$BYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.$B$B<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>$B$BTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency.",
    ["你是个有天分的学生，而且还是个有潜质的铁匠。我可以在本周任何时候宣布你可以从我这里毕业了。但是我觉得你还有东西要学。去找本古斯·深炉谈谈，他是个严厉的人，但他也是最出色的。"] = "A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he's a hard taskmaster but he's also one of the best.",
    ["你是个猎人？你会发现索塔尔为了躲避太阳就藏在城镇西南角上的洞穴里。"] = "You're a hunter?  Well anyway, you'll find Thotar hiding from the sun inside the burrow at the southwest corner of town.",
    ["你是个皮革商吧？我对兽皮的味道再熟悉不过了。$B$B我的父亲过去常常跟我谈起数世纪前一位居住在南风村的著名工匠。很遗憾，那儿已是一片废墟了。"] = "You're a leatherworker by trade, aren't you?  It's that faint smell of cured hides, I'd recognize it anywhere.$B$BMy father used to talk about a famous artisan who lived in Southwind Village centuries ago.  It's a shame the place is in ruins now.",
    ["你是喜欢枪支还是弓箭？"] = "Do you prefer guns or bows?",
    ["你是在开玩笑吧？你一定是在开玩笑！你认为我是个取悦于你的小丑，是吗？我是小丑？嗯，是的！你认为我是小丑，是吧！"] = "Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I'm a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I'm a clown? Huh, is it! You think I'm a clown don't you!",
    ["你是在猎杀死亡弯钩吧，$n？我记得很清楚。这周我手下的两个家伙就是被她杀死的。希望你的运气比他们好。"] = "You're hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let's hope your luck is better than theirs.",
    ["你是来学习如何作战吗？"] = "Have you come seeking training in the ways of armed combat?",
    ["你是来学习战役案例的吧？听好了，我会为你讲解那些显赫的胜仗和耻辱的败仗的。"] = "You have come to learn of battles won and lost on this field? There are no winners here...",
    ["你是来学习的吗？"] = "Come to learn from the master eh?",
    ["你是来学习的？嗯，我或许会给你一些事儿做的。"] = "Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub.",
    ["你是来学习赫加斯部落的知识的吗？"] = "Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?",
    ["你是来学习配制药水的？我能传授给你很多知识。虽然我已年老力衰，但脑子还是管用的。"] = "Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet.",
    ["你是来帮助我们在战歌峡谷作战的吗？为了部落，$c！"] = "Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch?  Lok'tar Ogar $c!",
    ["你是来接受药水配制这一技能的训练的吗？要是你认为能从我这儿不费吹灰之力地学到东西的话，你就大错特错了。走吧，在你没有掌握更高技能之前别来找我。"] = "Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill.",
    ["你是来接受训练的吗？我也是刚刚开始学习这方面的知识，但是我很乐意把我所知道的教给你。"] = "Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can.",
    ["你是来接受训练，还是来浪费一个战士的时间的？"] = "Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time.",
    ["你是来这儿报到的吗，$C？部落和联盟所需的所有战争物资都已经收集完毕，如约运往希利苏斯了。货物在$2113w天内就会抵达。希望有人能找到流沙节杖的碎片，将它们组合到一起。"] = "Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together.",
    ["你是说为了满足一个妄想狂的地方官和一群没准正在遭受中暑之苦的乌合之众的愿望，我们就得把世界各地的部队都调回来，然后给他派过去吗？"] = "You seek to lower our global defenses in order to appease a paranoid magistrate and an encampment of riff-raff that are most probably suffering from heat stroke.",
    ["你是说绷带吗？哦，如果我没有记错的话，联盟已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，而总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。"] = "Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages.",
    ["你是说裁缝？嗯。是的，当然。你得去正北方的雷霆崖。沿着村外的道路走。到达雷霆崖底后，乘坐电梯去雷霆崖顶部，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"] = "Tailoring you say?  Hmmm.  Ah yes, of course.  You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north.  Take the path out of the village to get there.  When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers.",
    ["你是说，你完全不知道？你背上的那把剑，名叫灰烬使者，这个名字是从它原来的主人那里继承而来的。"] = "You mean, you don't know? The sword that you carry on your back - it is known as Ashbringer; named after its original owner.",
    ["你是谁？为什么骚扰我？哦，是啦——你是学生吧。是的。我能为你做什么吗？"] = "Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?",
    ["你是谁？你想从我这儿得到什么？"] = "Who are you? What do you want from me?",
    ["你是谁？我在哪儿？我感到……非常虚弱……"] = "Who are you?  Where am I?  I feel... so weak...",
    ["你是问我铁匠在哪儿？你没听说过大熔炉吗？所有最好的铁匠都聚集在那儿铸造武器和护甲！  在铁炉堡中心都是敲打铁器的声音，你能在那儿找到最出色的铁匠本古斯·深炉。"] = "Are ye really askin' me where the Blacksmith is?  Have ye not heard of The Great Forge!?  All our best blacksmiths gather there to craft their weapons and armor!  It's dead smack in the middle of Ironforge, and that's where you'll find one of our most brilliant blacksmiths, Bengus Deepforge.  ",
    ["你是魔法的研习者？嗯，好吧……你可以在灵魂高地下的预见之池中找到他们。"] = "A follower of the arcane are you?  Hmph!  Very well then... you can find them around the Pools of Vision underneath the Spirit Rise.",
    ["你最好别找麻烦，$n！"] = "You'd better not be causing trouble, $n!",
    ["你最好坐下，这是个很长的故事。$B$B当我们第一次来到希利苏斯时，玛尔利斯女士是塞纳里奥要塞中第一位加入远征队的暗夜精灵。我们的行程没有什么特别的：组队进入虫巢探险，寻找失落的神器。"] = "You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.$B$BWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts. ",
    ["你有了一个好的开始，但是你要学的还有很多，$n。"] = "You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n.",
    ["你有什么事？你是来接受训练的吗？你是来寻找钢铁的秘密的吗？还是要学习锻造的技巧？快说！"] = "What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!",
    ["你有兴趣探索这些地下城中的一个吗？"] = "Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?",
    ["你有蜘蛛或是甲虫吗，$C？它们速度快，但是如果你的速度更快的话，你会发现拥有它们是件乐事！"] = "Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!",
    ["你有金钱，我们有食物。那么你还在等什么？！"] = "You've got money and we've got food.  What are you waiting for?!",
    ["你有需要保管的财宝吗？去找铁炉堡银行的石衣兄弟吧。  从铁炉堡的入口往东北方向走，银行就在那边。"] = "Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge.",
    ["你杀了鬼嚎。你这个傻瓜！"] = "You killed Ghost Howl.  You're a stud!",
    ["你来找我求学是浪费了你我的时间，$n。我没时间教授基础技能。我们在这里战斗，而这里是一处前线。在你准备充分之前不要再来找我。"] = "You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared.",
    ["你来接受训练为的是把它传递到你的宠物身上？"] = "You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?",
    ["你来这里是为了进一步的训练？抖去你身上的尘土吧，让我们马上开始工作。"] = "Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work.",
    ["你来错地方了。去找那边的专家古丹谈谈。你可以从他那儿学到更多东西。"] = "You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him.",
    ["你正行进在一条光荣的道路上，$n。我的祖先尊敬你的意愿，但你在完成我所交付的任务之前我不会对你有任何认可的。$B$B如果你希望证明在精神层面是一个猎手的话你该知道你必须做什么。"] = "You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit.",
    ["你没有浪费那些你必须杀死的动物，因此你赐予了这些动物的灵魂以荣誉。阿丝卡·迷雾行者将会给你演示怎么处理。她在高地上有个厨房。"] = "You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise.",
    ["你没看到我们正在准备迎接乌瑟的访问吗？现在别妨碍我，我有许多工作要做！"] = "Can't you see we're trying to prepare for Uther's visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!",
    ["你没看到我在这里钓鱼吗？"] = "Can't you see I'm fishing here!",
    ["你没看到我很忙吗?沿着路向北走到奥格瑞玛并询问那里的步兵。你不会错过的。"] = "Can't you see I'm busy here?  Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.  You can't miss it.",
    ["你没看到我这儿正忙着呢！"] = "Can't you see I've got work to do here?",
    ["你没经过适当的训练就来找我，说明你勇气有余而智慧不足。去找个接近你的技术水平的人谈话，像兽人卡玛瑞，他住在奥格瑞玛的暗巷区。"] = "You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",
    ["你现在没有资格受我的培训，陌生人。先到我的助手夏格那里学习一段时间。"] = "You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there. ",
    ["你疯了吗？你难道不知道那里都是些凶残无比的野兽？我们可能得使用铲子才能挖出你的尸体。我们已经在那里损失了太多生命了。$B$B我的答案是，不行。如果你想要去灼热峡谷，那么我只能说抱歉了，此路不通。"] = "Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.$B$BSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way.",
    ["你的使命一定意义非凡，$c，它需要你深入沼泽……"] = "Your errand must mean much, $c, to draw you so deep into the marsh...",
    ["你的嗓子喊哑了是吗？在力量谷就可以找到奥格瑞玛拍卖行。"] = "Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.",
    ["你的培训进展很好。你该为你的成就感到自豪。"] = "Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments.",
    ["你的意志不足以操纵我们控制的军队，$c。"] = "Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c.",
    ["你的意志很坚强，而且你的意图很明显。$B$B可能你的确有资格……"] = "Your will is strong, and your intent is clear.$B$BPerhaps you are worthy...",
    ["你的才能出众！你真是有灵性。你要想继续追求知识的话，找暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。他深受众人尊敬，而且他能深化对你的指导。"] = "Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction.",
    ["你的打扰在占用我的宝贵时间，你最好带来的是好消息。"] = "Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good.",
    ["你的技术在进步,很快你就会拥有一家你自己的皮革商店。我很高兴能帮你，$n。我的速度就只能这么快了，你知道吗？有那么多工作要做！"] = "Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you'll be running a leather shop of your own. I'll be glad for the help, $n. My hands are only so fast, you know? There's so much work to do!",
    ["你的技术太差了，还不能跟我学习。去跟那边的马丁医生谈谈，或者爬上斜坡到东南方去看看马尔什医生。他们是被遗忘者，可以给你所需的训练。"] = "You don't yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need.",
    ["你的技能已经非我能及。现在你该接受新的挑战了。塔兰丹会帮你准备。他就站在那里的桌子旁边。"] = "Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there.",
    ["你的技能显示你一直喜爱我们的艺术，但是我想看到你所做承诺的进一步证据。我会分配给你一项任务。完成它就会令我满意。"] = "Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content.",
    ["你的技能正变得非同寻常。现在，继续你的训练……"] = "Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training...",
    ["你的技艺不足以学会我所教授的。去找那边的玛克谈谈。他可以帮你直到你准备好学习更高级的课程。"] = "Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons.",
    ["你的技艺胜过我的水平了，陌生人。与石爪山脉烈日石居的赫加斯谈谈。他会传授你比我还要多的知识。"] = "Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can. ",
    ["你的搜寻基本结束了。到智慧谷的萨尔的要塞入口房间里找寻真知吧。"] = "Your search is almost completed.  Seek your truth in the entrance room of Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom.",
    ["你的教育正在继续，而你的知识已超越了我。如果你还想继续学习你就必须找迈里恩谈谈。她会指引你的。"] = "My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you.",
    ["你的智慧胜于我，朋友。与这里的塔恩谈话；他对皮革的知识比我要丰富得多。我肯定他会欢迎新学生的。"] = "Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student.",
    ["你的未来乌云密布。集中精力，再问一次。"] = "Your future is clouded.  Concentrate, and ask again.",
    ["你的炼金技能还不足以理解我所传授的知识。也许你应该晚些时候再来找我谈谈……"] = "Your skills in alchemy aren't yet high enough to benefit from my teachings.  Perhaps if you speak with me later...",
    ["你的烹饪水平实在是太低了。再去训练一段时间，也许我就可以教你一些我所知道的东西。"] = "Your talents in cooking are a little too low.  Maybe with some practice I can teach you what I know.",
    ["你的目标位于荣誉谷西北角。你会在那儿发现猎人大厅的。"] = "Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor.  There you will find the Hunter's Hall.",
    ["你的知识很渊博，旅行者。你必须向一个比我更聪明的人学习。关于乔瑟夫·格里高利的智慧的故事广为流传。你可以在幽暗城找到他。"] = "Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity.",
    ["你的精神不够集中。你对我隐瞒着什么吗?"] = "Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?",
    ["你的臭气会把数英里内的所有龙都招来的。告诉我你想要什么，快些。"] = "Your stench will attract every dragon for miles.  Tell me what you want, and quickly.",
    ["你的训练已经非常深入了。只有一个导师可以进一步地训练你。找到加基森的巴兹克·布拉斯温！"] = "You have certainly come a long way in your training. There is only one instructor who can train you further. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!",
    ["你的进步已经超越了我能教授的技艺了。现在到辛特兰的鹰巢山去找矮人德拉克·石拳谈话。他的作品太棒了，比我的好多了。"] = "You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own.",
    ["你的问题我都回答不了，$n。你需要与奥格瑞玛暗巷区的兽人耶尔玛克谈谈。他会帮你的。"] = "You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, $n. You be needin' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He'll help you out.",
    ["你目前的智能超出了我的指导能力。你该找我在铁炉堡的侏儒同伴特里克希询问一下！"] = "Your current aptitude exceeds my instructional capabilities. You should enquire further with my fellow Gnome Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge!",
    ["你看上去就是一个天生的铁匠。你的指甲缝中都是煤灰，双手充满了钢铁般的力量。啊，我甚至可以感觉到铁匠的血液在你的血管中奔流。你应该是来这里学东西的，好吧，$g小伙子:小姑娘;，拿起锤子，让我看看我能教你些什么吧。"] = "Ye have the look of a Blacksmith to ye. Soot under the nails, steel in yer bones. Aye, very much the blood of a Blacksmith in yer veins. Which means ye've come to me looking to learn a thing or two, well $g lad : lass; grab a hammer. Let's see what I can teach ye.",
    ["你看上去很疲惫。在我们的屋里休息一会儿吧，让艾露恩引领你进入甜美的梦乡。"] = "Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams.",
    ["你看到他们了吗？当然没有……我认为你是看不到的。以你的资质，即使有眼睛也和瞎了没有什么区别。"] = "Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse.",
    ["你看到我们湖中污浊的水元素了吗，$n？这个场景令人感到伤感，但是我不知道它们是从哪里来的。$B$B在我过去的谈话中似乎有人提起过你的名字，或许你可以帮我。$B$B我们必须了解的第一件事就是谁控制着这些元素。"] = "Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $n? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.$B$BYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.$B$BThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals.",
    ["你看我像个会施魔法的人吗？嗯，我确实听说 凯恩·火歌居住在城镇东南部的恐惧之末旅店的楼上。他那样站在格雷彻的房间之外可真奇怪。"] = "Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that.",
    ["你看我像个傻子吗，$r？我可以签署她的死亡证明书！我为什么要信任你呢？"] = "Do I look stupid to you, $r? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?",
    ["你看我像是个$c吗？在我决定用你的血洗我的刀之前，赶紧逃吧。"] = "Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood.",
    ["你看起来不像是个学生……"] = "You don't look like a student...",
    ["你看起来不怎么像我，但谁知道呢，可能有一个附魔师藏在那里的什么地方！"] = "You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!",
    ["你看起来像是个喜欢冒险的人。而我，自从我们巨魔来到这里我就受够冒险了。现在我每天都是既来之则安之，而且我为自己训练其他家伙处理冒险的经历。"] = "You got the look of someone wantin' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an' I train other folks to handle adventures for me.",
    ["你真是一个意志坚定的学生。我很高兴给你提供指导！"] = "You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!",
    ["你真的变得狡猾多了，$n。"] = "You have truly grown more cunning, $n.",
    ["你真的那么笨吗？你锻造出来的是什么东西？那最多算得上是一把水果刀罢了。我可不会花时间来训练一个菜鸟。"] = "What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs.",
    ["你知道上层精灵吗？你知道辛德拉古吗？"] = "Do you know of the Highborne? The Shen'dralar?",
    ["你知道的已经够危险了，但是对我来说你看起来还需要训练，$n。"] = "You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n.",
    ["你知道的比我还多，这一点很肯定。我告诉你接下来该怎么办，去和我的爸爸谈谈。他是个好的老师，但是他会要求你证明自己的实力。他的名字叫洛特加斯，你可以在本古斯的铁砧旁边找到他。"] = "Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus.",
    ["你知道谁是真正聪明的人吗？诺格！甚至比我还要聪明。你去告诉诺格是桑德派你来的！你可以在那边的控制台那里找到他。"] = "You know who's really smart? Nogg! Smarter than me, even. You go tell Nogg Thund sent you! You can find him by the control panel over there.",
    ["你知道，我可以刺穿一个兽人或是把一个巨魔切成碎片。我甚至可以把我名字的大写字母刻在食人魔的肚子上，但我就是不能忍受给动物剥皮。想一下都让我觉得恶心。  好的，如果你有这种兴趣，那就到老城的护体皮甲找马瑞斯·格兰治。"] = "You know, I could run an orc through or slice up a troll.  I could even carve my initials in an ogre's flank, but I just can't stand to skin an animal.  Go figure, eh.  Well, if you have the stomach for it, then go see Maris Granger at the Protective Hide in Old Town.",
    ["你确定不想做铁匠吗？嗯，如果你真心想学制皮，最好去大熔炉西北角找费布·钢轴谈谈。"] = "Sure ye don't want to be a Blacksmith?  Well, if yer heart is set on Leatherworking, then you best talk to Fimble Finespindle over at his shop on the northwest side of The Great Forge.",
    ["你确实是个不错的附魔师！现在你该继续了。我想让你与楼上的吉布·草须谈谈。他人有些古怪，但是他会继续指引你！"] = "Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!",
    ["你确实有点本事。我打赌你的技术足够让你学些东西了，我们来看看我有什么能教给你的，好吗？"] = "Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?",
    ["你离家还远着呢，$r。"] = "You are certainly a long way from home, $r.",
    ["你算来对地方了，$g小伙子:姑娘;！人们从世界各地来此学习成为一名铁匠。你会看到本古斯·深炉在我们漂亮的城市中央的大熔炉的铁砧上埋头工作。"] = "Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;!  People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith.  Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself.",
    ["你肯定会想从扎姆沙那里学些什么的。当你从力量谷进来的时候走左边的楼梯到暗巷区上层的博斯坦的火坑去。"] = "You'll want to learn from Zamja.  Head to Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength.",
    ["你肯定你不想当一名战士？那好吧，如果你真想学习动动手指的把戏，你最好去找雷酒酿制厂的玛济斯·石衣谈谈。"] = "Ye sure ye don't want to learn to be a warrior?  Well, it's yer hide on the battlefield.  If ye really want to learn to waggle yer finger, ye best talk to Magis Sparkmantle in the Thunderbrew Distillery.",
    ["你肯定可以在雷酒酿制厂看到马克萨恩·安沃尔大口喝酒。为什么你不去喝一点，顺便看看他能教你点什么新鲜东西呢？"] = "Ye'll surely find Maxan Anvol tossin' back a few in the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Why don't ye go have yerself a pint and see if he'll teach ye something new.",
    ["你胆敢让我培训你，你这可怜虫？你期望什么，你这个呆头呆脑的乡巴佬，一场关于如何正确使用银叶的讲演？滚出去！你浪费我的时间没把你打个半死算你走运。"] = "How dare you ask me for training, maggot? What were you hoping for, you slack-jawed yokel, a lecture on the proper uses of silverleaf? Out! You're lucky I don't thrash you senseless for wasting my time.",
    ["你能以部落的名义冲锋陷阵，我可真羡慕你。我的职责是指挥部落的军队，而不是亲自上阵。$B$B当然，我年轻时也曾梦想着能安度晚年。现在，我痴迷于胜利的荣耀和失败的苦楚——这些都取决于我所指挥的士兵们。"] = "Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.$B$BCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command.",
    ["你能在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行外面找到一个邮筒。"] = "You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.",
    ["你能在剃刀岭东面的兵营后找到杜格鲁·血怒。"] = "On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust.",
    ["你能在旅店里干什么？$B$B当你待在旅店里的时候，你就可以好好地休息。因此,你可以比留在野外更快地恢复到精力充沛的状态，这样就可以获得更多的经验值。$B$B另外你还可以通过和旅店老板交谈来获得一块炉石，以后就可以使用这块炉石快速回到你绑定的旅店里了。"] = "What can you do at an inn?$B$BWell when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become 'well rested' much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.$B$BYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn.",
    ["你能相信作为精英战士的我居然失败了吗？$B$B我们的部队被无法抗拒的力量彻底摧毁，我所记得的一切就是不顾一切地逃跑，我所听到的一切只有我的战友撕心裂肺的惨叫和我自己的心跳。$B$B过了不久，我又回到了诅咒之地，希望能拯救我的伙伴。但是我被抓住了，最后被活活打死。$B$B这段日子中，我所能感受到的只有恐惧。"] = "Would you believe that in my darkest hour, at the apex of my being, I failed.$B$BAs I fled from the wanton destruction of the forces that overwhelmed us, the only sounds I could hear were the screams of my soldiers and the rapid beat of my own heart.$B$BA short while later, I returned to the Blasted Lands in hopes of rescuing my men and restoring my honor. Instead I was captured and beaten until dead.$B$BWhat I found out during my inquisition and subsequent torture was horrifying.",
    ["你能看见我？你知道我一个人在这里游来荡去被忽视有多久了吗？就是没有没有人能看见我。能有人陪我说话真好！$B$B啊，你一定是我以前待过的那个雇佣兵团里的生还者派来的，我说的对不对？显然就对呀！$B$B好了好了，不多寒暄了，要想把灵魂还给瓦塔拉克公爵，并让一切纳入正轨，还有许多事情要做呢！"] = "You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!$B$BSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!$B$BBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!",
    ["你能给我的斧头附魔吗？我需要永久性的。或许晚些。到智慧谷附近的暗巷区西端找到古丹的符文工艺店。"] = "Can you enchant my axe?  I'll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan's Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom.",
    ["你要仔细听好了，别轻易相信或怀疑你所听到的一切。因为即使是朋友也可能将自己送上死路，$c。$B$B我们伟大的酋长深知这一点，为了证明部落中有一些术士并不想从内部毁掉部落，或是为了获得权力，我自愿尽我所能帮助年轻的首领。"] = "Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.$B$BOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can.",
    ["你要做什么，$c？我要迟到了，而我的雇主不喜欢拖沓。"] = "What do you want, $c? I'm running late, and my employer doesn't look kindly on tardiness.",
    ["你要做的事情需要很大的勇气，$n。要进入战歌峡谷，你就得跟银翼哨兵的军官艾萨拉斯谈谈。她会为你指引方向的。愿女神的祝福与你同在！"] = "It is no light endeavor upon which you embark $n.  To get to Warsong Gulch you will want to speak to Aethalas, the Battlemaster of the Silverwing Sentinels.  She will guide your way.  Blessings of the Goddess be with you!",
    ["你要去传说大厅？它就在西边的力量谷之上。如果你不是官员的话，你是不能进入传说大厅的，但是你可以跟大厅外的巴沙谈谈。"] = "You want the Hall of Legends. It's high above the Valley of Strength on the west side. If you're not an officer you can't get in, but you can still talk to Sergeant Ba'sha outside.",
    ["你要寻找哪种职业的训练师？"] = "Which class trainer are you looking for?",
    ["你要找什么技能的训练师？"] = "Which trainer do you seek?",
    ["你要找什么？"] = "What are you looking for?",
    ["你要找哪个战场？"] = "Which battleground do you seek your glory in?",
    ["你要找的是维斯派塔斯。他负责看管在泰达希尔底部往返的角鹰兽。你可在穿过达纳苏斯西部的传送门，然后在鲁瑟兰村那儿找到他。"] = "It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.  You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village.",
    ["你要找的是鲁伯特·鲍什。他和他的随从居住在布瑞尔东南角恐惧之末旅店的楼上。"] = "That's Rupert Boch you're looking for.  He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill.",
    ["你要找科多兽皮工店是吧。去暗巷区中心吧。"] = "Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag.",
    ["你要把你的针法做得更小些，$n。这样你的箭袋和弹药袋就不会有东西掉出来。还有，没有人喜欢穿着鼓鼓囊囊的外衣的。"] = "You need to make your stitches smaller, $n. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic.",
    ["你见过守夜人巴库斯吗？很勇敢……$B$B我想他是所有守夜人中最凶猛的一个。我怀疑他是否看到我就在周围……"] = "Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around....",
    ["你见过安戈洛环形山的所有奇景了吗，$n？真是令人惊讶。虽然它们没有我制造出的东西那样精密，但这里所有的东西都是天然而成的……这就真是太奇特了。$B$B我的叔叔雷塔维就喜欢这样的地方。我正沿着他的脚步前进——我还想从灭绝的文明中找到新的知识！"] = "Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.$B$BMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!",
    ["你认为你很聪明吗？你认为你得到了吗？让我们查明真相！"] = "You think you're smart enough? You think you got what it takes? Let's find out!",
    ["你认为你能摧毁阿拉索联军吗，$c？希望如此。你究竟是想要干些什么呢，还是根本就是来浪费我的时间的？"] = "You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, $c?  I hope so.  What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?",
    ["你认为双足飞龙管理员会在哪儿？到力量谷的飞行塔的顶部去！"] = "Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!",
    ["你认为我能教给你什么？罗克希克比我更适合做你的老师。你可以在奥格瑞玛找到他。出发吧。"] = "What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!",
    ["你认为自己够资格向我学习吗？你不过是我脚下的一名卑微的小人物罢了。但是，收纳一名下属或许能增加我对苏米和图米的吸引力。让我看看你拥有什么技能。"] = "So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let's see what meager skills you possess.",
    ["你该与温斯顿谈谈。我听说他在寻找一个与你有相同技能的潜行者。"] = "You should talk to Winstone. I hear he's looking for thieves with your skill.",
    ["你说你不能在这儿闻到矮人煅炉的烟味？哦，如果你想学习锻造的话就该找瑟鲁姆·深炉。他就在大教堂广场北边的矮人区。"] = "You mean you can't smell the smoke of the Dwarven forges from here?  Well, you will be looking for Therum Deepforge if you want to learn blacksmithing.  He's over in the Dwarven District which is just north of the Cathedral Square.",
    ["你说屠夫？哦，急救训练师！一个样。当你看到护士妮拉站在城镇东南面的恐惧之末旅店里面时你就会明白为什么。"] = "Butcher you say?  Oh, First Aid Trainer!  Same thing.  When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why.",
    ["你说有多少金属锭？我得到的最新消息是联盟已经收集到$2018w块铜锭、$2005w块锡锭和$2008w块秘银锭了，而总的需求量分别是$1998w、$2006w和$2009w。"] = "How many metal bars you say? As of my last update on the situation, here is what I know. The Horde has collected $2018w copper bars out of $1998w needed, $2005w tin bars out of $2006w and of $2009w mithril bars sought, $2008w have been gathered.",
    ["你赢得了到一个更高级的导师那里学习的权利。去见见我那边的朋友罗克希克。"] = "You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there.",
    ["你跟塔里的侍僧说过话了吗，$n？除非你能完成他们之中某个人的任务，否则我们就无法为你制作宝珠。如果你准备好了的话，就去跟他们谈谈吧。"] = "Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, $n? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready.",
    ["你还不坏，但让我耍耍几个小把戏，你可能会觉得很方便实用的。"] = "You're not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. ",
    ["你还不够强大，$C。继续努力吧。"] = "You are not yet powerful enough, $c.  Move along.",
    ["你还喜欢这里的节日气氛吗，$c？$b$b相对于一个负责照看火炬的火炬看守者, 我更像是一个历史学家，记录着每一次的庆典，当然，今年的庆典我也会记录下来。现在情况进展的不错，你说是不是？$b$b要知道，节庆火炬上燃烧着的圣火中，都蕴涵着强大的力量。我们现在这样监守着我们的火炬，但我相信，敌人的城市里，也有这样熊熊燃烧着的圣火……"] = "Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flamekeeper tends to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities...",
    ["你还没有准备好。找贝蒂·奎恩谈谈，他就站在那边的楼梯旁边。当你提高以后再来找我。"] = "You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she's standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment.",
    ["你还没有学会基础知识，流浪者。你找我的助手拉琳娜·夏月谈话了吗？可能你需要跟她谈谈。"] = "You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should.",
    ["你还没有资格接受我的培训。先去见见桑德，就在那张桌子旁边。当他说你可以了再来找我！"] = "You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!",
    ["你通常可以在铁匠铺的后面发现威尔海姆修士和里瑞亚互相讲故事。他总是很乐意向圣骑士们传授新的技艺。"] = "You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria.  He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills.",
    ["你那时给我看了某些结果！现在该我给你看看结果了！"] = "About time you showed me some results! Now I'll show you results!",
    ["你难道感觉不到大地母亲为了她所丢失的孩子，也就是亡灵们，而出现的苦恼吗？快些说，$n。每一秒对我都很珍贵。我们必须帮他们找到回归她身边的路！"] = "Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, $n. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!",
    ["你需要一个真正大师的指导！到塔伦米尔的达瑞尔·斯塔克那儿去试试你的运气！"] = "You require the instruction of a true master! Go to Daryl Stack in Tarren Mill and embrace your destiny!",
    ["你需要一种特殊的臭泥鱼诱饵来捕捉加兹兰卡。这些鱼饵是我亲自制作的！$B$B但是除了鱼饵之外，你还需要臭泥鱼……你得把臭泥鱼放入诱饵，让它充满臭味！$B$B将做好的诱饵放到祖尔格拉布中的帕格渔点……然后就坐下来喝酒等待……你无需等太久，因为加兹兰卡肯定会迫不及待地上钩！"] = "To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make 'em myself!$B$BBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!$B$BWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!",
    ["你需要去尘泥沼泽找纳特·帕格接受训练，提高自己的能力。"] = "You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.",
    ["你需要变得更强大才能帮助我们在奥特兰克山谷作战，$C。"] = "You need to be stronger, $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley.",
    ["你需要布尔鲁格的帮助。他在旅馆和雷霆崖银行间较低的山上。"] = "It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank.",
    ["你需要帮助吗？"] = "What do you need directions to?",
    ["你需要幻象吗？$B$B要是在执行任务的过程中幻象失效，回到我这儿来，我将重新对你进行伪装。$B$B如果你尽力而为还是失败了，别放弃！回到我这儿来。我将助你完成目标。"] = "Do you require an illusion?$B$BShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.$B$BShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives.",
    ["你需要开始学习一些我的专门技术之外的东西！跟那边帐篷前面的利廉姆·火轴谈谈。他会让你步入正轨的！"] = "You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!",
    ["你需要我的帮助？可以。你需要什么？"] = "You want my help? You got it. What do you need?",
    ["你需要找一个比我懂得多的人。去找幽暗城的乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。那么，你还在这里干吗？"] = "You need to learn from someone who knows more than I do. Go talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity. Well, what are you still doing here?",
    ["你需要接受些训练？好吧，阿扎尔·战锤总是愿意教给年轻的圣骑士一点东西。你为什么不去雷酒酿制厂找他呢？"] = "Ye need some training?  Well, Azar Stronghammer is always up for showing the younger paladins a thing or two.  Why don't ye go see him in the Thunderbrew Distillery.",
    ["你需要租用一只狮鹫进行飞行，是吗？杜加尔就在贸易区的城墙上，他那里有很多狮鹫，记着飞行的时候要抓紧哦！"] = "Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight! ",
    ["你需要银行做什么？好吧，你得穿越布瑞尔南部的洛丹伦废墟，乘坐电梯到达幽暗城。当你到达那儿后，询问自称为幽暗城守卫的行动缓慢的憎恶，请求它给予更详细的指示。"] = "What could you possibly need a bank for?  Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity.  When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions.",
    ["你需要飞往雷霆崖吗?"] = "Would you like a flight to Thunder Bluff, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?",
    ["你！你看起来身体强健……南海镇需要你的帮助！$B$B万圣节到了，那些受诅咒的被遗忘者蠢蠢欲动。他们把所谓的庆典开到我们家门口来了。如果你有时间的话，我们真的需要你的帮助！"] = "You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!$B$BThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it's Hallow's End.  Their 'celebration' will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you've got the time, we really could use your help!",
    ["侏儒武器大师比克斯在这商店附近游荡。她可以教你使用弩、匕首和投掷武器。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器大师吴平可以教你使用弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。  居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳套、法杖和投掷武器。"] = "Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master, is wandering about in this shop.  She can teach crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons.",
    ["信仰吗……有些人已经失去了它，有些人则刚刚找到它。它无法被湮灭，也无法被创造。$B$B或者你是在说信仰护甲？我们的牧师与最虔诚的战士们在上一次战争中抵抗天灾军团士兵时所穿的护甲？$B$B唉，大部分都遗失了……被纳克萨玛斯的地穴恶魔们夺走了。"] = "Faith... Some have lost it, others have found it. It cannot be destroyed and it cannot be created.$B$BOr perhaps you speak of the vestments of Faith? Armor worn by our priests and most devout warriors into battle against the Scourge during the last war.$B$BAye, much of it is lost... Stolen by the fiends of Naxxramas.",
    ["倍受尊敬的古斯塔夫·范沃森医生能进一步训练你。他在塞拉摩的兵营里治疗伤兵。"] = "The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.",
    ["假如你问我的话，我想格瑞夫在动物身上花费的时间过多了。到目前为止，没人比他更精通于猎人之道。去卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外面找他吧。"] = "If ye ask me, I think Grif spends a little too much time with the animals.  Still, nobody else knows the hunter's path quite like he does.  Look for him outside the smithy in Kharanos.",
    ["储存下来的物资都给你和你的家属！"] = "Season's savings to you and yours!",
    ["傲角长者正在莫高雷的雷霆崖欣赏那里的风光。"] = "Elder Proudhorn is enjoying the vistas above Mulgore at Thunder Bluff.",
    ["像只猫一样在雨里爬行，你抓着刨着，一遍又一遍……稍后继续……$B$B哦，我没看见你进来，$n！我能为你做什么吗？"] = "Like a cat dragged in from the rain, you scratch and claw, then do it all over again... I'll be back for more...$B$BOh, I didn't see you enter, $n! What can I do for you?",
    ["元素在跟我们讲话，$c。他们分享着我们必须掌握的知识以及不能泄漏的秘密。"] = "The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept.",
    ["充分利用每块碎片会让我们更加节约并会拉近我们和大地母亲的距离。莫兰塔会教给你方法。到中部高地上的雷霆崖兵器库外面可以找到她。"] = "Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.",
    ["先不说外面的那些卫兵，我和我的兄弟们可都参加过海加尔山之战。谁想要在银行里面行窃，那就先过我们这一关。"] = "Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first.",
    ["光明大教堂是暴风城所有治疗相关技能的训练中心。你可以找珊娜·弗勒学习急救技能。"] = "The Cathedral of Light is the center of all the healing practices of Stormwind. There you can find Shaina Fuller to help you learn this craft.",
    ["克斯塔姆是个大嗓门、爱吹嘘的人……他也是你所能见到的技艺最为纯熟的战士之一！  我告诉你，如果你想成为一名战士的话，就去找他谈谈吧。他肯定在铁炉堡大门以东的军事区中。"] = "Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet!  I tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to.  I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge.",
    ["克朗·石蹄在村子东南角的训练圈里。"] = "Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village.",
    ["克苏卡会把你多余的宠物圈养起来的。到荣誉山谷的竞技场和猎人大厅之间的畜栏里找到他，现在走吧！"] = "Xon'cha will stable your extra pets.  Find him in the Valley of Honor at the stables between the arena and the Hunter's Hall.  Now begone!",
    ["克莱德·凯林，当地的钓鲈鱼高手，有他自己最喜欢的钓鱼地点，就在布瑞尔东部的澈水湖。"] = "Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake.",
    ["兑换奖券啦！换取礼物啦！快来啊！"] = "Ticket redemption here!  Get your tickets turned into prizes!  Step right up!",
    ["兰德·洛巴尔特对制皮这样的技能相当精通。你可以在往布瑞尔东南角沿途的某个营帐中找到他。沿着城镇东南方的道路走，然后在十字路口向东转。"] = "Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like.  You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill.  Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection.",
    ["兰达尔打扮得有些像花花公子，但是他是个可靠的人，他比我向许多学生所说的那样更加值得信赖。尽管如此，我还是不能责备他们想要冒险的想法。"] = "Randal's a bit of a dandy, but he's dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can't blame them for wanting a bit of adventure.",
    ["关于草药学，嗯……我认为你现在和我的水平已经差不多了，也许我只能在个别细节上给你一些点拨。"] = "Another Herbalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.",
    ["再有一些坐骑我们的马厩就满啦。士兵，让我来保管它们吧。我会从这儿牵走一些。"] = "Just a few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts. Release it into my custody, soldier. I'll take it from here.",
    ["再次感谢你找回了我的幸运卷尺，$n。这东西能帮我捕到更大的鱼呢！"] = "Thanks again for returning my lucky measuring tape, $n.  I swear it helps me catch bigger fish!",
    ["再次给我带来这种劣质货我就把你装在用山羊尿回过火的小铁盒里送回家。现在去见见那个傻瓜乌格索克，他更加适合你的需要。"] = "Come to me again with such pathetic work and I will send you home in a small iron box that I tempered in goat urine. Now go see that idiot Ug'thok, he is better suited to your needs.",
    ["冒险者，你好。我是赞达拉的商人林沃斯。我来自南海，从我的家乡带来了许多新奇的货物。$B$B如果你能证明自己的价值，我会乐意与你交换物品的。如果你有我们部族的荣誉勋章，我这里还有些更好的东西……"] = "Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.$B$BPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more.",
    ["冰蹄长者？我听说他在藏宝海湾。"] = "Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay.",
    ["冲击者5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置，它能以龙的速度将人发射出去。发明该设施的地精家族是家喻户晓的航空领域先驱，这种超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！$B$B如果你想象鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去雷霆崖的猎人高地南部找玛克希玛吧。听说它可以把人发射到石牛湖以南呢！"] = "The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's Hunter Rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!",
    ["准备好接受下一次训练了吗？好吧。首先，你得放松。随意搅动药水就可以了。"] = "Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right.",
    ["准备好接受训练了？保持速度，$n。我们要走的路还长着呢。"] = "Ready for training? Then try to keep up, $n. We've got a lot of ground to cover.",
    ["几天前，我无意中听雷格努斯·雷石在武器大厅中吹嘘他兽穴中的一件新饰品。要是你想成为一名技艺纯熟的猎人，就去找他吧。"] = "I overheard Regnus Thundergranite in the Hall of Arms bragging about a new trophy for his den the other day.  If yer looking for training from a skilled hunter, Regnus is the one to see.",
    ["凡人，这儿充斥着一种难以言说的恐怖。克苏恩和他的追随者们不仅公然藐视自然的力量，他们的存在更预示着艾泽拉斯的毁灭。$B$B一千年前，麦琳瑟拉、凯雷斯特拉兹和亚雷戈斯都牺牲了自己以保全这个世界。我们来这里不仅仅是要报仇，还因为我们必须阻止克苏恩！"] = "An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.$B$BMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!",
    ["凯恩把我们带到了一片充满希望的大地。我们很幸运，因此我们再把好运带给别人。这就是我为什么开始教学的原因，$n。"] = "Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n.",
    ["凯恩自己住这儿，他们说。一旦我完成了制作一件合适的礼物，我就会把他找出来。或许他会有智慧的话要对我说。"] = "Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me.",
    ["凯拉·风刃的战斗技能炉火纯青。她可以对你进行训练。到多兰纳尔的旅店中去找她吧。"] = "Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["出售可口的饮料啦！暗月马戏团最好的酒，生津止渴！"] = "Tasty drinks for sale!  Quench your thirst on some of the Darkmoon Faire's finest brews!",
    ["刃歌长者就在希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。"] = "If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing.",
    ["分久必合，合久必分。那两把剑被隐藏在祖尔法拉克城中。$B$B苏萨斯会在两把剑都被发现时重生。"] = "Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak.$B$BSul'thraze reborn when the twins are found.",
    ["刚从烤架上取下的暗月热狗非常鲜美。趁着它们还没变冷的时候，赶快去买吧！"] = "Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill.  Come and get em while they're hot!",
    ["利用敌人的兽皮来保护自己这一想法运用了拟态学的知识。要进一步提高制皮技能，你得去雷霆崖防具店找库纳。"] = "There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.",
    ["别与圣光作对，$c，或许有一天它能拯救你。"] = "Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.",
    ["别再靠近我了，$n。我已经可以感觉到印章中流淌着的邪恶力量了。$B$B给我一点时间，让我来检查检查——你要紧紧地握住它。"] = "Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.$B$BGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly.",
    ["别害羞，请这儿的每个人喝上一杯吧！"] = "Don't be shy, buy a round for everyone!",
    ["别忘了观看下一场焰火表演！每天下午6点开始，每小时整点都会有一次！"] = "Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!",
    ["别忘记买点饮料和纪念品！"] = "Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!",
    ["别担心斯奎尔图，$n。他不想这么粗鲁的，他只是非常繁忙。我们不如趁着等他完成侦察任务的时候做些更有用的事情？"] = "Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?",
    ["别浪费我时间。"] = "Don't waste my time.",
    ["别浪费我时间。我从事研究的时间比你的年纪还要大。去跟幽暗城炼金房的亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他或许能传授给你一些基础知识。"] = "Don't waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He's a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics.",
    ["别浪费我的时间，$c。"] = "Do not waste my time, $c.",
    ["别管我。我伤得很重，可能会丢掉性命。谢谢你，$n。我将死在这儿，但是因为你……我能在平静中死去。"] = "Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace.",
    ["别紧张……这些狮鹫虽然伤势未愈，但是它们仍然能把你安全地送往目的地。告诉我……你想要去哪座哨塔？"] = "Don't be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely whole, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?",
    ["别聆听来自世界的心声——答案就在你心中，你知道真相的。"] = "Don't listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within.  You know the truth.",
    ["别花钱购买那些铃当！为了你的冬幕盛宴，把烟林牧场买下吧！"] = "Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!",
    ["别被沃萨亮晶晶的眼睛和浓密的胡须愚弄了。他是个很有才能的学徒，也是个很好的朋友，即使我在跟他谈话时颈部有些痉挛。"] = "Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him.",
    ["别被那些天真的大眼睛欺骗了。塔雷是个专家，我每天都在学习新知识。你认为我为什么会在侏儒区？你看我像个工程师吗？啊，我可不这么想。"] = "Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so.",
    ["别让我发现你盗窃了任何东西！去暗影裂口地下寻找申苏尔以及他的 迅影兄弟会。在智慧谷以南能找到通向那儿的通道。"] = "Don't let me catch you stealing anything!  Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow.  Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom.",
    ["别试图将你的意愿强加到皮革上。而是让其天然的特性显示出自身的形状和功能。这不是一场战役。与皮革协同工作，而不是与其作对。"] = "Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it.",
    ["别说话！让我猜猜！你是为灰烬使者而来的吗？！对……呃……不对！不好意思。$B$B我能帮你什么忙吗，$R？"] = "Don't tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.$B$BWhat can I help you with, $r?",
    ["别那样看我。我也许跟你不同，我不是个冒险家，但是这并不意味着我的力量比你小。忙碌的生活会让你的手臂变得强壮的。"] = "Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong.",
    ["到中部高地的“本娜的炼金店”去找本娜，她可以指导你学习配制药剂的方法。"] = "Then head over to Bena's Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing.",
    ["到中部高地的附魔店去看看吧。泰戈会很乐意帮助你的。"] = "Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can.",
    ["到剃刀岭东面的兵营里找到塔绍尔·锯痕。给部落的年轻人带去骄傲和荣誉！"] = "Find Tarshaw Jaggedscar inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Bring pride and honor to the Horde youngling!",
    ["到力量谷去，在飞行塔的南面就是奥格瑞玛银行。"] = "Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower.",
    ["到力量谷的飞行塔顶部可以找到双足飞龙管理员。多拉斯会确保你到达你想要战斗的地方。"] = "Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength. Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek.",
    ["到我们这儿来的客人可不多。你对我感兴趣？"] = "We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?",
    ["到暗巷区的科多兽皮工店那里去。问问卡玛瑞。"] = "Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Kamari.",
    ["到村庄西南方的洞穴顶部找到卡普拉克。"] = "Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town.",
    ["到荣耀谷去找到勇者大厅并与格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。告诉他们我在这里的轮岗结束后就会去向他们汇报。"] = "Find the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak to Grezz Ragefist.  Let them know that I'll be reporting back in after my shift here.",
    ["到荣誉山谷去并在马厩附近找到克苏卡。"] = "Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon'cha near the stables.",
    ["到荣誉谷的湖泊的东北方找红石谷矿业工会。与那里的马卡鲁谈谈。"] = "Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there.",
    ["到荣誉谷的猎人大厅去，它就位于就在大剧场的西边。与那里的奥玛克谈谈。"] = "Go to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor, west of the Coliseum.  Talk to Ormak Grimshot there.",
    ["到这儿是学习如何使用新武器，还是来浪费我时间的？"] = "Here to learn how to wield a new weapon, or just to waste my time?",
    ["到这儿来学习的吗？很好。我想要是我教你的话，你不会对我们的联盟造成太多的伤害。只要你一心对付我们的敌人。"] = "Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can't cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies.",
    ["到闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店去吧。那儿有啤酒和柔软的床铺供你尽情享用，没有比那里更好的休息场所了。"] = "Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest.",
    ["剃刀沼泽位于贫瘠之地最南端的大路西边。"] = "Razorfen Kraul can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the west side of the road.",
    ["剃刀高地位于贫瘠之地最南端的大路东边。"] = "Razorfen Downs can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the east side of the road.",
    ["剥皮匠通常会把所有的兽皮豆带到铁炉堡去风干。你为什么不去那儿看看是否能找人训练你呢？"] = "The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don't you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?",
    ["剥皮？能不能学成只有看你自己了！哈哈！你为什么不去找巴尔萨斯·裂石呢，他能教你如何剥皮。他在大熔炉北面的皮甲用品店。"] = "Skinning?  The only thing ye look like ye could skin is yer own knee!  Ha!  Now why don't you go see Balthus Stoneflayer so he can teach you how to properly skin some animals.  You'll find him in Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["加基森的迪尔格·奎克里弗对厨艺非常精通。要想提高自己的能力，你就去找他吧。"] = "Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.",
    ["加布加布回来啦，我太高兴了！我希望我的黑铁啤酒不会很快被喝光，否则这家伙又会偷跑出去啦！"] = "I'm so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don't run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!",
    ["加德纳尔的行事准则是隐晦奸诈。别在这儿探头探脑，$C，否则你的灵魂就会被永远禁锢在此……"] = "The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals...",
    ["动物的朋友就是我的朋友。你要找的猎人大厅就在猎人高地的顶部。"] = "Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter's Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise.",
    ["努力保持所有事情的平衡性，$c。真正的和谐便在于此。"] = "Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies.",
    ["劳尔娜·晨光为居住在多兰纳尔附近的居民们提供医疗服务。或许她能教你如何成为一名牧师。"] = "Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest.",
    ["劳瑞娜是暴风城的高阶牧师，你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找到她。"] = "Laurena is the High Priestess of Stormwind. You can find her in the Catheral of Light in Cathedral Square.",
    ["勇敢的$c，欢迎来到莫沙彻营地。我能帮你什么忙吗？"] = "Welcome to Camp Mojache, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?",
    ["北方的水晶塔接受黄红绿三种颜色的水晶构成。$B$B而关键是使用黄水晶所产生的能量作为主要的力量来源。有两种可能的效果：一种会制造破坏，一种会消除破坏。$B$B爆炸水晶需要红水晶和黄水晶。这将产生剧烈爆炸，足以震慑你的敌人。$B$B恢复水晶需要黄水晶和绿水晶。这将给你提供治疗光环。"] = "The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.$B$BThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. $B$BCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.$B$BCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura.",
    ["卑微的家伙，在我面前鞠躬吧！你能感受到我那强大的力量。"] = "Bow in my presence, insect! Surely you can feel the power I hold over you.",
    ["博学者是个古老的学者。他为我们伟大的女王服务！"] = "The Lorekeeper is an ancient. He has served under our glorious Queen!",
    ["博恩奈特是我的名字，我把铁匠作为我的兴趣……另外，呃……我还卖一些食物和水。来点肉类怎么样？"] = "Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?",
    ["卡恩说我们需要聆听熔炉和钢铁的灵魂之声，它们会指引我们的。我只听见一阵铃声。拿起铁锤，让我们一起试着听它们在说什么。"] = "Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together.",
    ["即使你能设法不打败克苏恩而解救我们，我们也会不惜一切代价将他驱逐回地狱。不惜一切代价。"] = "Even if you somehow managed to free us without defeating C'Thun, we would focus all of our powers to see the beast banished back to the hell from whence it came - AT ANY COST.",
    ["即使在冰冷的石头墙内，就像庇护这座城镇的墙一样，人们仍旧可以找到宁静与和平。事实上，你可以在你所在的任何地方找到他们……只需在你体内寻找这种平衡。"] = "Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.",
    ["即使在和平时期仍然会有战争，而许多氏族仍在酋长的领导下奋勇作战。你是来为奥格瑞玛而战的吗？"] = "Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?",
    ["即使我也有我的局限性！如果你想继续学习的话去找幽暗城的拉文尼亚·克洛文谈谈。"] = "Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training.",
    ["即使轻微地改变药剂的成份也能使它发生根本的变化。耐心和精确，年轻人：他们会让你在所有行业都受益匪浅。"] = "Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life.",
    ["厄运之棰位于菲拉斯的中部。"] = "The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas.",
    ["去中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中可以找到旅店老板帕拉。"] = "Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.",
    ["去中部高地的石蹄地质学会找布瑞克·石蹄，他会教你如何采集矿石和宝石。"] = "Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems.",
    ["去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店逛逛吧。如果你去旅店的话，别忘了尝尝那里的好酒，那些酒绝对能让矮人的酒相形见拙。"] = "Check around Old Town at the Barracks or the Pig and Whistle Tavern. If you go to the tavern, be sure to sample some of the fine brews. Puts the dwarven ales to shame, I tell ya.",
    ["去力量谷寻找旅店老板格雷什卡。她的旅馆主城门以北东侧的地方。"] = "Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates.",
    ["去力量谷西边的山顶找找看。他们只会让官员进去的！如果你不是官员，可以跟外面的巴沙中士谈谈。"] = "Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength. They'll only let you in if you're an officer! Talk to Sergeant Ba'sha outside otherwise.",
    ["去勇者大厅找污染者迪兹·斯诺班，他会帮助你进入阿拉希盆地的。"] = "Go to the Hall of the Brave.  You will find The Defiler, Deze Snowbane there to assist you in getting to Arathi Basin.",
    ["去北面的雷霆崖吧，从那儿开始你的旅程，朋友。一旦你到达雷霆崖，那儿的守卫会直接告诉你你要找的东西在哪儿。"] = "Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek.",
    ["去南方的森金村找米奥赞。"] = "Seek out Miao'zan in Sen'jin Village to the south.",
    ["去南方的森金村，找安苏瓦谈谈。"] = "Speak with Un'Thuwa to the south in Sen'jin Village.",
    ["去城外东南方找飞艇降落塔。"] = "Look for the Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast.",
    ["去城镇东面的兵营找塔绍尔·锯痕。"] = "Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town.",
    ["去大树以西的暗巷区中心寻找耶尔玛克药剂店。"] = "Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree.",
    ["去恐惧之末旅店的主餐厅找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。酒馆就在布瑞尔城的东南角。"] = "Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon.  The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill.",
    ["去找克拉姆吧。你可以在中心高地上的雷霆崖咨询处里找到他。"] = "Krumn is the bull you are looking for. He can be found on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Civic Information.",
    ["去找我们的领袖杜姆雷尔发出挑战吧。"] = "Our leader, Doom'rel, has ears for the challenge.",
    ["去找法鲁萨。我最后一次见到她时，她正站在马厩和西北方向的房间之间。"] = "Look for Faruza.  Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town.",
    ["去灵魂高地下面的预见之池找马丁·林塞。他会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。"] = "You may seek out Martin Lindsey inside the Pools of Vision, underneath the Spirit Rise.  He will assist you on your way to Arathi Basin.",
    ["去红石谷矿业工会东北部的荣誉谷找诺格机械店。"] = "Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.",
    ["去结交朋友吧。我能帮你吗？"] = "Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?",
    ["去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什。注意你的言行，否则塞尤克也许会将你作为喂狗的美食。"] = "Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog.",
    ["去荣誉谷的勇者大厅找格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。并代我向他问好！"] = "Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor.  Put in a good word for me!",
    ["去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅，你会在那儿受到魔法训练的。朱莉·雷线总是在那儿埋头苦读。"] = "Well ye'd be sure to find some training in the magical arts over in the Hall of Mysteries, north of the gates of Ironforge.  Juli Stormkettle can always be found there with her nose in a book.",
    ["去银风避难所找珊蒂瑞亚吧。她可以卖给你“中级烹饪教材”。"] = "Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the 'Expert Cookbook'.",
    ["去镇子东南角的恐惧之末旅店，你可以在旅店楼上的阅览室中找到黑暗牧师贝里尔的。"] = "At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern.  Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room.",
    ["去长者高地的长者大厅找图拉克·符文图腾吧。"] = "Seek out Turak Runetotem in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.",
    ["去雷霆崖中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找犹纳吧。"] = "Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then.  It can be found on the middle rise.",
    ["又一个想要靠倒买倒卖发家的？拍卖所就在贸易区，离银行不远的地方。"] = "Another entrepreneur, eh? Well, the Auction House can be found in the Trade District.  Not far from the bank.",
    ["又来打扰我了。像这样我还能做什么工作么？不用回答，我看起来像是很在乎你的回答么？为什么不去烦别人呢？"] = "Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? Why don't you go bother Mr. High-And-Mighty instead?",
    ["双子皇帝被杀之后，神庙中能够阻止传送法阵的魔法护罩已经远远被削弱了。如果你愿意，我可以将你直接传送到双子皇帝住所那里去。"] = "With the Emperors slain, the magical protection blocking teleportation within the temple has been greatly weakened. If you desire, I am able to translocate you to the Emperors' lair.",
    ["双足飞龙巢穴就在城镇中心的图腾柱顶部。"] = "The Wind Rider Roost is atop the totem stairway in the center of town.",
    ["发明创造，我亲爱的$c，就是百分之二的灵感，百分之四的日光浴，百分之六的雷阵雨之后的清新，以及百分之九十三的鬼点子。$B$B等等，这加起来好像不是百分之一百？我的笔记本去哪里了……"] = "Invention, my dear $c, is two percent bottled inspiration, four percent solar exposure, six percent chance of thunderstorms clearing by mid-afternoon, and ninety-three percent Rumplesnicker.$B$BWait, did that add to one hundred? I've got my notes around here somewhere.",
    ["古丹的符文工艺店就是你要去的地方。到暗巷区的西端可以找到，就在智慧谷的旁边。"] = "Godan's Runeworks is where you'll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom.",
    ["另一名学生。棒极了。这就是林度恩跻身皇家学会从事研究工作的原因，也是我坚持成为一名导师的原因。只要我再获得一枚教学奖章，我的美名便不会被人所遗忘了。"] = "Another student. Wonderful. This is why Lydon belongs to the Royal Society of Snobs and gets to do research, and I'm stuck being an instructor. If I win another teaching award, I'll never live it down!",
    ["另一名学生，是吗？好吧。我看看有什么能帮助你的。"] = "Another student, eh? All right. I'll see what I can do to help you out.",
    ["另外还有一些事情值得注意。我强烈推荐你去塞格那里预测一下你的财富在哪里。我知道，我知道……他是一个豺狼人。但是他是一个拥有特别力量的豺狼人，他可以预知你的财富在哪里！  另外我们在不断扩展我们的马戏团。最近我们增加了一门大炮，你可以试图用它把自己发射到水晶湖！你可以和马戏团东面的玛克希玛谈谈，了解更多细节！"] = "I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!",
    ["只是想想那美味，我就已经垂涎三尺了。派尔·沉默行者是血蹄村最好的厨师。你可以在村子西北角的大营帐里找到他。"] = "My mouth waters just to think on it.  Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.",
    ["只有在天空自由翱翔时，灵魂才能得到真正的解脱。在我们伟大的部落中心雷霆崖就有这样一块地方。血蹄村外以北的道路就通往那儿。一旦你乘坐电梯到达高处，就找雷霆崖守卫谈谈，他会做出进一步的指引。"] = "Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky.  There is such a place in our great tribal center Thunder Bluff.  The road north out of Bloodhoof Village will guide you there.  Once you ride the elevator to the top speak with one of the Bluffwatchers who can give you further directions.",
    ["只有在雷霆崖上的神秘之地才能找到这样的智者。沿着血蹄村北面的道路一直走，直到你来到雷霆崖底的电梯。乘坐电梯到达顶端，询问雷霆崖守卫，您能获取到更多的帮助。"] = "Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs.  Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance.",
    ["只要有耐心和决心，很多秘密都是有可能解开的。现在，让我们开始吧……"] = "There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin...",
    ["只要那些矮人一直待在那里，我们就不会有麻烦。你现在要去哪里，$n？"] = "As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading $n?",
    ["只需做些小调整……搞定！"] = "Just a minor adjustment here... ah there we go!",
    ["可悲的是，正是因为萨尔的智慧才导致了恶魔之王和其它势力联合起来，特雷博的军队促成了恶魔之王、阴影议会和巨槌食人魔之间的联合。对于力量的无尽渴求使得他们签下了血契，对恶魔效忠。"] = "Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood.",
    ["吆……我需要一根烟和找个好看的侏儒女人摸几下--倒不必非要按那个顺序！$B$B我被困在那个东西的肚子里已经有几个月了。今天几号了？啊，不要紧。重要的是我终于出来了。$B$B呜呼！"] = "Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!$B$BI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.$B$BWOOO HOOO!",
    ["后悔。这就是现在我所能感受到的一切。一个错误的决定导致了如此灾难性的后果。我多么希望当时能多等几天，直到命令传来。也许那样我们就能事先知道这片被诅咒的土地上到底有多少恐怖的东西等着我们！也许这一条命令就能指引我们去另外一个方向！无论怎么样，这都是我的错。所有的一切都是我造成的。"] = "Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault.",
    ["向你致敬，英雄！我有来自大陆和岛屿的最新消息，供你参考。"] = "Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.",
    ["向您致敬，$g兄弟:姐妹;。你有外面的消息吗？我希望得到泰达希尔的消息。"] = "Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.",
    ["听一听长者的故事吧，$n。我有许多话要说……"] = "Listen to the stories of an elder. $n. I have many to speak of...",
    ["听仔细了，$n，我要传授给你的知识很多。"] = "Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart.",
    ["听你的长辈的话，$n。要是你拥有强大的意志和热情，就没有不能控制的力量。"] = "Listen to your elders, $n. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control.",
    ["听说克尔苏加德正在研究传说中的埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。$B$B是的，就是那件曾属于麦迪文的神奇法杖。"] = "It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.$B$BYes, the very staff once held by Medivh.",
    ["听说在焰火表演之后，桌子上就会摆满高脚杯，然后我们就可以喝酒庆祝了！"] = "I heard that, after the fireworks show, goblets will be brought to the tables.  Fine toasts we shall raise!",
    ["听说那个隐士玛洛瑞有时会为当地居民配制药剂，他居住在暴风城和北郡之间的小山上。"] = "That hermit Mallory is known to concoct some potions for the local townsfolk on occasion.  He has a cottage in the hills between Stormwind and Northshire.",
    ["听起来你得去跟玛吉诺·仲马谈谈！你可以在法师区的巫师圣殿找到他。当然，那些法师总是来去无踪……"] = "Sounds like you want to talk to Maginor Dumas! You can usually find him in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Course, you never know when or where those magi will portal off to.",
    ["吴平大师几乎懂得人类所知的所有武器的用法。在徒手搏斗中，他的觉醒之拳技能具有致命的攻击力。要是你需要训练的话，就去找他吧，他一般都在维勒武器店等待新武器的运送。"] = "Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller's Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training.",
    ["吴平的精力真令人惊奇。我看着他连续练习了数小时技巧。他用双手击打练习用的假人，直到他的拳头沾满鲜血。我想不到还有谁比他更适合训练你的战斗技能。"] = "Woo Ping's stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can't think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat.",
    ["呃……很抱歉，我真的不太了解你。我是说，作为公认的机械陆行鸟经销商，我只能跟高贵的侏儒做生意。要是你是诺莫瑞根的侏儒贵族，我会很高兴地为你提供服务的。"] = "Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer.",
    ["呃……虽然我不愿承认，但是你要想继续训练的话就必须跟我的姐妹谈谈。目前来说……我知道的没她多！她乘坐火箭车四处巡查。"] = "Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car.",
    ["呃，你进展到这个程度了吗？去那边的书架找拉文尼亚·克洛文。要是你没把事情搞糟，或许你能学到更多知识。"] = "Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more.",
    ["呃？你可以在奥格瑞玛找到银行。沿着道路往北走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"] = "Huh?  You'll find the bank in Orgrimmar.  Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts.",
    ["告诉我你要什么，别磨磨蹭蹭的。"] = "Tell me what you want, and make it quick.",
    ["呵呵呵呵……你是个相当好奇的家伙，不是吗，$n？嗯，我来告诉你该怎么做。$B$B在此地以北的古老废墟中居住着一个名叫米布隆·乱齿的令人厌恶的豺狼人。他日夜守护着灵根草，好像从不睡觉似的！$B$B你必须把他引开才行。我可以卖给你一些他喜欢吃的东西——把食物放在他附近，引他过来，然后你就可以趁机拿走灵根草啦。祝你好运！"] = "Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do.$B$BNorth of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps!$B$BWhat you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!",
    ["呸！邮箱……最近我收到的全都是垃圾邮件！  增加这个的尺寸……减少那个的尺寸……现在是免费的屠龙剑。我得每隔一个月就要更改邮箱号码才行！  嗯，你可别说我没警告过你。邮箱就在石火旅店外面。"] = "Bah!  Mailboxes...  all I get is junk mail lately!  Increase the size of this... decrease the size of that... act now for your free Sword of Dragonslaying.  I have to change my mailbox number every other month!  Well, ye can't say I didn't warn ye.  If you're looking for the mailbox it's just outside the Stonefire Tavern.",
    ["呸，那是地精的东西！在剃刀岭有一个兽人可以教你如何制作这些物品。去熔炉附近找穆德拉克吧。"] = "Bah, that's goblin work!  Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things.  Look for Mukdrak over near the forge.",
    ["和其他所有事物一样，金属应该被平衡的使用。卡恩·石蹄在中部高地的底层的池塘边设立了一处铁匠铺。去寻求他的指引吧。"] = "Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom.",
    ["和平也与你同在, $n。你是来寻求知识的吗？"] = "Ishnu-dal-dieb, $n. Have you come here in search of knowledge?",
    ["和我们战斗的那些生物的灵魂，或者说“灵魂精华”中存在着不可思议的力量。$B$B这个地区的许多生物都是暗夜精灵的盟友，暗夜精灵可以随时利用它们的力量。部落也应该享受到同样的权利，我相信一定有办法可以掌握这些力量，使其为我们所用。$B$B我说的都是事实，$N。帮助我，你会发现自己获得了不可思议的力量。"] = "Incredible power can be found in the spirits or 'muisek' of the creatures that we battle against.$B$BLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined.",
    ["哀嚎洞穴的入口位于贫瘠之地十字路口西南边的甜水绿洲。"] = "The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens.   ",
    ["哇！这酒真够劲！我快要撑不住了！"] = "Wow!  These kegs are filled with powerful stuff!  They lift me right out of my boots!",
    ["哈哈！开始庆祝吧！"] = "All right!  Party time!",
    ["哈！提尔斯这段时间以来都在找他，但是他不想被找到。他是一只小鸡。"] = "Hah!  Tirth's been looking for him for days, but he doesn't want to be found.  He's chicken!",
    ["哈，你要找的是暴风城访客中心。从英雄谷走到贸易区后左手边的第一座建筑就是了。"] = "Ahhh, Stormwind Visitor's Center is what you are looking for then. It's the first building on the left as you walk through the front gates from the Valley of Heroes.",
    ["哎呀，你看起来就像是一个普通的街头顽童！"] = "Why, you look like a common street urchin!",
    ["哎，潜行者只会影响我们在暴风城的工作。我真希望能把奥斯伯和马迪亚斯直接送到暴风城监狱去。"] = "Bah, rogues have done nothing but make our job here in Stormwind harder. I wish I could drag both Osborne and Mathias both out of Old Town and right to the Stockade.",
    ["哦……一个圣骑士？嗯，$g小伙子:姑娘;，你真走运！阿扎尔·战锤刚结束训练，他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。"] = "Och... a paladin?  Well $glad : lass;, ye're in luck!  Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.",
    ["哦……好吧，玛克西米利安是这附近唯一一个了解黑暗魔法的人。你也许可以在狮王之傲旅店那阴暗的地下室里找到他。"] = "Oh... one of those types.  Well, Maximillian is the only one around here that knows about the dark arts.  You can probably find him in the dark of the Lion's Pride Inn basement.",
    ["哦你好！我的名字是萨拉。我能为你做什么吗？"] = "Oh hi! My name's Sarah. What can I do for you?",
    ["哦！$g小伙子:姑娘;，当你选择附魔时，你得非常小心。我让自己的杯子附魔，使杯中的水不洒出一滴，但是我也不能喝到里面的水了！这真是个悲剧。  当你看到格瑞姆比时，必须记得我的叮嘱。他在大熔炉狮鹫管理人右边的商店中。"] = "Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn't spill a drop, but now I can't drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  You be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He'll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.",
    ["哦！你想接受战士的训练，是吗？克斯塔姆·碎石会帮你实现梦想的！去铁炉堡东门的武器大厅吧。"] = "Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye?  Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces!  Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge. ",
    ["哦！达瑞尔·瑞克努索是个技艺高超的厨师！他的红辣椒如此辛辣，几乎可以锻造钢铁了！我想他不会将菜谱传给你的，但是他肯定能帮助你成为一名好厨师。你可以在大熔炉东北角的铜壶铁罐那找到他。"] = "Och!  That Daryl Riknussun is a brilliant cook!  He makes a chilli so hot ye could temper steel with it!  I don't think he'll teach ye the recipe, but he'll certainly help ye to become a good cook.  Ye'll find him at the Bronze Kettle o'er on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["哦！这可是你说的！我敢打赌格兰尼斯·快斧会向你展示如何挥动武器的。他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。"] = "Och!  Now ye're talkin'!  I bet Granis Swiftaxe could show ye a thing or two about swinging steel.  He's over in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos at the moment.",
    ["哦！这是一项极有价值的技能。托格努斯以你从未见过的方式敲击铁砧。为什么你不去跟他谈谈，看看他能教你什么？"] = "Och!  Now that's a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don't see often.  Why don't ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?",
    ["哦，一个医师。我愿意传授给你一些能够在你旅途中对你有所帮助的东西。"] = "Oh, a fellow Physician. I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys.",
    ["哦，你一定是说暴风城会计室。走进城门之后，它就在贸易区的西南部。"] = "Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House.  It's not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind.",
    ["哦，你好！我是霍莱伊，马绍尔探险队的首席科学家和生物学家。我的兄弟和我，还有我们的同伴，一起到艾泽拉斯去探索荒野和未被驯化的雄伟景象。真是太激动人心了……但是，嗯……我想这次我们陷入了太多激动中了！"] = "Oh, hello there!  I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!",
    ["哦，你想学习采摘雏菊是吧？哈哈！我只是开个玩笑，$g小伙子:姑娘;。  这是个很好的职业，雷纳·石枝会教你的。她在大熔炉南边的 铁炉堡医师协会工作。"] = "Oh, ye want to learn to pick some daisies do ye?  Ha!  I'm just teasing ye $gladdie : lass;.  A fine profession it is, and Reyna Stonebranch can show ye how it's done.  She works at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["哦，你是在找宾斯匹德吧。为什么那个小侏儒和他的装备……让我告诉你吧，如果你想去他在侏儒区的商店，管好你的手，别去抚摸他的机械绵羊！  爆炸绵羊……为什么你要做这样的事情！？"] = "Oh, you're looking for Springspindle Fizzlegear then.  Why that little gnome and his gadgets...  Let me tell you, if you're going to his shop in Tinker Town, keep your hands to yourself and don't pet any of his mechanical sheep!  Exploding sheep... now why would you even make such a thing!?",
    ["哦，你正在学习魔法？那没有什么地方会比法师区的巫师圣殿更好了。"] = "Oh, looking for some arcane enlightenment are you? No place better then then Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter.",
    ["哦，你说的是约翰森？我听说他躲起来了。"] = "Oh, you mean Johnson?  I heard he's in hiding.",
    ["哦，你还有很多东西要学。我会教给你我所学的全部知识，但是我自己也在学习！你为什么不找铁炉堡的特里克希谈谈，她会帮你进修的！"] = "Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!",
    ["哦，地铁，地铁……每个人都想乘坐地铁。那些乘坐狮鹫的好时光，那种在高空中飞翔时紧握缰绳的情景，它们到哪儿去了？  啊！你还是坐地铁去吧……地铁就在侏儒区，那儿还有侏儒的其他精妙设计呢。"] = "Oh, the tram, the tram...  everyone wants to ride the tram.  What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above?  Bah!  You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions.",
    ["哦，就是这样了……先找个椅子，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。$B$B我肯定鲁特加尔已经告诉你一些事情了，因此我将省略一些细节，让你直奔主题。"] = "Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat $g sonny:missy;.$B$BI'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty.",
    ["哦，年轻的主人制造的这一系列事件和慌乱。可以想象，世界的命运就掌控在他手中。只有人类才会对世界产生这种扭曲的看法。$B$B唉，他将奥术的秘密都告诉了我……圣契之类的无用之物。这种东西对我来说是一无是处，但是或许你对它们感兴趣。"] = "Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.$B$BAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments.",
    ["哦，我不能教给你什么，$n。跟塔雷·浆泡谈谈。她几乎够不着桌子，但是当她在配制药水时，你得看仔细了！"] = "Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!",
    ["哦，旅店是吗？嗯，雷酒酿制厂是最棒的。你可以在那里稍事休息，但是你一定得尝尝那儿的啤酒。"] = "Oooh, an Inn is it?  Well, ye just can't beat the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Rest if ye must, but be sure to have an ale or two while ye're there.",
    ["哦，是牧师吗？要是你想接受训练的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找马克萨恩吧，他一定在那儿喝酒呢。"] = "Oh, a priest is it?  Well good ol' Maxan is sure to be found having a drink in the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need a bit of training.",
    ["哦，沉迷于物质财富，这很常见呢。呃，去贸易区的拍卖行吧，财富在对你微笑。"] = "Oh, the ever-present obsession with material wealth.  Well, fortune smiles on you, as you can find the auction house in the Tradesman's Terrace.",
    ["哦，真恐怖！这是个悲剧！我们就要突破啦，但也有可能遭遇全军覆灭的惨剧。"] = "Oh the horror! The tragedy! We are on the verge of a breakthrough, yet all could be lost.",
    ["哦，谢谢你！我已经深陷恶梦多时了……"] = "Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...",
    ["哦，这不是$n嘛！很高兴再见到你，我无法表达我对你的感激之情，你帮我及时完成了发明。$B$B我能为你做什么事吗？"] = "Well, if it isn't $n!  It's good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you've given me and my invention work to date.$B$BWhat can I do for you today?",
    ["哪一项专业？"] = "Which profession?",
    ["哪个车队的赛车最快？天知道！"] = "Who has the fastest car?  Who knows?!?",
    ["唉$c，你不是达纳苏斯的贵族，也不是泰达希尔的上层精灵。除非你以实际行动——不仅仅是口头上的话语——证明自己的友好态度，那样的话，我会提供马匹让你挑选的。"] = "Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.",
    ["唉，对不起。我没什么新东西可以教你了。你去暴风城的老城区找西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈怎么样？他是一个肌肉发达有一头漂亮红发的人类。"] = "Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair.",
    ["唉，我现在的补给品储量已经非常少了！是什么耽搁了那个该死的地精那么长时间？"] = "Oh dear, I am running dangerously low on supplies! What is taking that blasted goblin so long?",
    ["啊,一个来访者！肯定是一个冒险家，没有多少游客会走这条路的。坐下来喝一杯饮料吧，随便些。嗨，你看起来好像还有些肉。你想参加比赛吗？"] = "Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don't get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?",
    ["啊,是的，剥皮。没有人比姚恩·深刺还善于运用剥皮刀了。你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷找到他。"] = "Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.",
    ["啊……一名顾客！看看我最伟大的发明，贸易机器人1000型！它拥有你所需的一切商品……其中的一些稀有物品更是在卡利姆多的其它任何市场上都找不到……更不用说它的设计不支持任何讨价还价的废话了，因此你看到的价格就是你要支付的价格。"] = "Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay.",
    ["啊……起雾了，$n。我什么都看不见！等等……等会儿。我看见……我看见维维尔的藏身之处。啊……没错！我相信书的一章就在他手中！$B$B让我调整一下望远镜，这样可以看得更清楚些。$B$B<纳瑞安都快变成对眼了。>$B$B奥卡兹岛！那家伙就在奥卡兹岛上！"] = "It... It's foggy, $N. I can't see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil's hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!$B$BLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.$B$B<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>$B$BAlcaz Island! That devious bastard is on Alcaz Island!",
    ["啊……这些家伙让我整天都不得安宁！你看见他们了吗？$B$B我真希望自己能藏到地下，避开他们……"] = "Ugh... these pests keep me busy night and day! Haven't you seen them?$B$BI wish I could just jump down a pipe to get away from them...",
    ["啊是的，你必须找到希克瓦。我记得我最后一次见她时她在旅馆前面站着。"] = "Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn.",
    ["啊是的，另一个要烧炉火并锻造战斗武器的人。我当然会教你怎么操作。"] = "Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how.",
    ["啊是的，我就是加德林的助手。在这里的志愿工作就是我通过巫医学校课程的方式。既然你帮了他，我就免费帮你。需要修理什么吗？"] = "Ya mon, I be Gadrin's assistant.  Dis here volunteer work be my way of gettin through Witch Doctor School.  Since you help him, I help ya for free.  Whatcha need fixin?",
    ["啊朋友，我只帮助猎人和他们的宠物。"] = "Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.",
    ["啊！如果你见到一个达隆郡的幸存者，请告诉他们我自由了！"] = "Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!",
    ["啊！没有比看人们在竞技场中互相厮杀更好看的东西了。如果你来得是时候的话，那你也将是他们中的一员！"] = "Arr!   There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena.   If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!",
    ["啊，$r……我了解很多关于这个世界的知识，以及如何制造巨大能量的符咒的方法。"] = "Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power. ",
    ["啊，一个术士同伴已经在某种程度上证明了$g他的:她的;价值。$B$B很高兴认识你。我的名字是梅纳拉·沃伦德……那是有原因的。$B$B你看上去强大并博学，其他的工具……你是更强大的工具……会很受欢迎而不是愚蠢地泄密。如果事实确实如此，那再与我更深入地谈谈。如果不是，那么你知道你该怎么回到码头然后回到海洋的另一边。"] = "Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.$B$BI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.$B$BYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean.",
    ["啊，一个经历丰富的冒险者。基尔拉姆又让你来这里了。我知道你具有相当的能力，你只需要询问我，我就会教你斧系铁匠的知识。"] = "Ah, a seasoned veteran you once were. Kilram can make you this again. I know you are capable, you merely need to ask and I shall teach you the way of the axesmith.",
    ["啊，你在找杜加尔·朗德瑞克。他那里有卡兹莫丹飞得最快的狮鹫！你可以在贸易区的外墙上找到他。"] = "Ahhh, you are looking for Dungar Longdrink. He has some of the fastest gryphons this side of Khaz Modan! You can find him up on the ramparts in the Trade District.",
    ["啊，你必须去雷霆崖最高处拜访他们中的一人。沿着血蹄村北面的道路走。雷霆崖底有电梯可达顶部。当你到达那儿时，可以询问雷霆崖守卫。"] = "Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers.",
    ["啊，你是个好奇的人，是吗？太好了！听仔细了，这也许能在恶劣的环境下保护好你的皮肤！"] = "Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!",
    ["啊，你是个结实的家伙。也许你能给我一些帮助。你可以为新学徒提供协助，因为他们有别的事情要考虑。"] = "Ah, well aren't you a sturdy-looking one? Perhaps you can assist me with a thing or two. Not much help around here except for green apprentices, and they've other things to worry about.",
    ["啊，你是在找安塞瓦。去雷霆崖武器店中部高地的底层找他吧。"] = "Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons.",
    ["啊，你是在找鲁坎·考迪尔。他在魔法区外开了一家商店，你前往监狱时会经过那儿的。"] = "Ah, you're looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade.  ",
    ["啊，你是在找黑暗牧师贝里尔。他在恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅读室。他一直在阅读、祷告，没人知道他在干嘛，也谁敢去问他啊？"] = "Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern.  Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?",
    ["啊，你！如果你想要赢得暗矛部族的尊重，那你可以向我们捐赠那些急需的资源！你要知道，布料和绷带不会从树上长出来。$B$B我们需要你在冒险中得到的那些布料，把它们捐给我们吧！这样你就可以得到暗矛部族的青睐！"] = "Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!",
    ["啊，你！如果你想要赢得铁炉堡矮人的尊重，那么你可以为我们捐赠有价值的资源！铁炉堡现在的布料和绷带的存储量很低！$B$B你可以捐赠各种你在冒险中得到的布料！这样一来，你就可以赢得铁炉堡矮人对你的尊重！"] = "Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!",
    ["啊，又回到年轻的时候了，还有第一次发现药剂的时候。谢谢你恢复我的记忆，$n。去跟那边的米拉·法拉科纳分享那份年轻的热情吧。"] = "Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there.",
    ["啊，友善的瑟里亚迪。在她的庇护下，所有动物都很安全。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅馆外找到她。"] = "Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["啊，和天空中的巨鸟一同翱翔。去双足飞龙巢穴顶端找塔尔吧。他会指引你完成你的梦想的。"] = "Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you're going.",
    ["啊，多么美好的一天啊！真该炸点什么东西。"] = "Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!",
    ["啊，奥特兰克山谷，我的美好回忆啊。<叹息>嗯，我不能与你同行，但我同样感到骄傲！你得跟铁炉堡武器大厅的格罗杜姆·钢须谈谈。"] = "Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you'll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge.",
    ["啊，如我头衔所述，我是一名血色十字军的刺客。我每天白天研究着最优先目标的资料，晚上就去加基森的舞厅里放纵一下。好吧，其实跳舞才是我的正业，偶尔出去做点杀手活计赚点钱，付帐单。"] = "Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills.",
    ["啊，就是你找到那封信的吧。感谢你带来这个……关于我的家人的消息。如果我这里的食物和饮料有什么你喜欢的，请别客气。"] = "Ah, you're the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You're welcome to what food and drink I can offer.",
    ["啊，布兰度尔·铁锤。毫无疑问，他能为你提供指导，$g小伙子:姑娘;。在铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅中能找到他。"] = "Ah, good ol' Brandur Ironhammer.  There's no doubt he'll provide ye with the guidance ye seek, $glad : lass;.  Ye'll find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge.",
    ["啊，布莱纳·火崖。她能使用魔法。她主管牧师事务。  你要穿过铁炉堡大门，向北走，前往神秘大厅。她就在那里。"] = "Ah, Braenna Flintcrag.  She has magic hands, that one.  Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters.  Ye'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries.  That's where ye'll find her.",
    ["啊，幽影谷的美景永远使我感到快乐！"] = "Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!",
    ["啊，很好。你是个优秀的学生，我对你非常满意。现在，我可以开始训练你了……"] = "Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin...",
    ["啊，我心爱的白兰地，我太思念她了！"] = "Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!",
    ["啊，我最喜爱的顾客之一。你似乎是个有能力的术士，$n。很高兴认识你。要是我能帮上什么忙，请尽管开口。$B$B我和我的兄弟都认为你这样的人才能领导我们进入新纪元。一个拥有力量……和控制力的人……让军团臣服于你只是时间问题。$B$B我有些羡慕你了。"] = "Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.$B$BMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.$B$BI am but a little envious.",
    ["啊，是我们的人。很高兴看到我们的队伍增长如此迅速，以至于我都记不清每个人的容貌了。$B$B萨尔那个傻子认为我正努力改善术士的形象并为他服务呢。白痴！燃烧军团在耗尽这世界的资源后会将它化为灰烬的。"] = "Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.$B$BThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely.",
    ["啊，毫无疑问，他一定是想要成为一名战士！我想你是来参加儿童周的，是吗？你的行为堪称楷模，其他人必定会以你为榜样的，这令那些疲惫不堪的灵魂倍感欣慰。$B$B我很乐意帮助你和这位年轻的男子。嗯……我要给他提些什么建议呢？听听灵魂怎么说吧，是的……或许是关于吃掉所有蔬菜……"] = "Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children's Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.$B$BI'd be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too...",
    ["啊，没有什么比狮鹫更好的坐骑了。暗夜精灵偏爱可笑的角鹰兽，而我只需一头狮鹫就可以穿梭在云端！  好吧，我不跟你唠叨了，到大锻炉东边的格莱斯·瑟登那儿去吧，他会向你出租狮鹫的。"] = "Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there?  The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair!  Well now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way.",
    ["啊，没有谁比牧师更擅长治疗病痛了。当然喝得酩酊大醉也能解除痛苦，但是我想布莱纳·火崖并不懂得酿酒。我认为你该在神秘大厅进行一些牧师的培训。"] = "Ah, nothing better than a priest to cure what ails ye.  Of course a nice tall pint cures a lot of what ails ye too, but I don't think Braenna Flintcrag teaches brewing.  I guess ye'll have to settle for some priest training over in the Hall of Mysteries instead.",
    ["啊，真是太可怕了，$g先生:小姐;。巴罗夫家族从前充满生机……充满活力。这个庄园是巴罗夫家族主要的住所。$B$B卢森和我注意到随着时间的流逝，巴罗夫家族变得低沉而沮丧。偏执妄想和暴怒笼罩着主人和小姐。在夜里，我们可以听到巴罗夫夫妇在卧房里争吵。根据我们了解，他们的贪婪毁了他们，可以这么说。"] = "Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire.$B$BLucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak. ",
    ["啊，石眉这些日子不怎么离开铁炉堡的，如果你想要学做一名裁缝的话，就去铁炉堡找他吧。"] = "Ah, Stonebrow doesn't leave Ironforge much these days so if ye're looking to learn the tailor's profession ye'll have to go to see him up in Ironforge.",
    ["啊，要是你想成为一名附魔师的话，我想你需要找吉布·草须。他在 大熔炉狮鹫管理人右边的商店草须魔法用品店里。"] = "Ah, I believe Gimble Thistlefuzz is who ye'll be needing if yer looking to learn the Enchanter's profession.  Ye'll find Gimble in his shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.",
    ["啊，这个问题问得好。$B$B如果你喜欢在户外狩猎，那么在瘟疫之地，艾萨拉，燃烧平原，费伍德，希利苏斯，冬泉谷，甚至是安戈洛环形山都有元素生物的存在。$B$B如果你更喜欢直接挑战危险，那么就去厄运之槌吧。我听说大量变异元素都躲在厄运之槌的高墙之后。当然，你也可以在黑石深渊那里找到大量被黑铁矮人所雇佣的元素生物。"] = "Ah, a good question.$B$BIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.$B$BIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths.",
    ["啊，这件达纳苏斯织品质量最好！"] = "Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!",
    ["啊，那你就要去猎人高地上的猎手大厅了。你可以在那里找到像浩特·雷角那样伟大的猎人。"] = "Ahh, you will need to make your way over to the Hunter's Hall then. Several great hunters like Holt Thunderhorn can be found there on the Hunter Rise.",
    ["啊，镶金玫瑰？那柔软的床铺和温水沐浴……想想这一切吧。::打哈欠::如果你要前往那儿的话，你可真幸运。旅馆就在贸易区的西边……柔软的枕头、温暖的毛毯。::打哈欠::"] = "Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you're heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::",
    ["喝点东西吧，$c。这可能是你最后一次喝东西啦！"] = "Have a drink, $c.  It might be your last!",
    ["嗨$n！你是来购物的，还是来出售物品的？$B$B如果有比这儿更便宜的物品，我就不叫被感动的奥古斯图斯！"] = "Hi $n!  Are you here to buy something?  Or maybe sell something?$B$BYou won't find better prices anywhere, or my name isn't Augustus the Touched!",
    ["嗨。不，玛尔冯一定不在这儿，他还要好些时间才能回来呢。实际上，我有些担心他……$B$B我希望他能很快回来。有人寄了一只大箱子给他，我可没力气把这东西拖进去！我只能把它放在门口……"] = "Hi there. No, Marvon sure isn't here, and he won't be back for quite some time. Actually, I am getting a little worried about him...$B$BI hope he gets back soon. A large chest arrived for him and it's too heavy for me to lug it inside here! I had to leave it out by the door...",
    ["嗨。你到这儿来学习如何使用新武器算是来对地方啦。"] = "Heya mon.  You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon.",
    ["嗨。去那边跟我们的加德林大师谈谈。小心扎拉赞恩的发狂，我也会好好照管你的。"] = "Heya mon.  Go talk to mah Master Gadrin right over there.  Take care of that Zalazane crazy for him and I fix ya right up!",
    ["嗨你，你是不是想要去詹迪亚的加迪植物园。我刚刚没有说清楚吗？哦，我肯定累了！只要沿着智慧谷里的阿索兰的市场后面的木制台阶到达暗巷区，你可以看到加迪就在那里的上层。"] = "Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level.",
    ["嗨！你从来没有过深海潜水的经历吗？我告诉你一个小秘诀，嗯。在海洋深处有许多冒气泡的裂缝，当你在水下时可利用这些气泡进行呼吸。这个秘密只限于你我之间。对我来说，贝壳到处都是……如果你懂我的意思的话！"] = "Hey mon! You've ever been diving deep in the ocean? I'll let you in on a little secret, eh. Deep in the ocean you can find bubbly fissures; they'll allow you to breathe air while underwater.  Let's keep this secret between you and me though, eh. I don't need no competition for me shellfish traps elsewhere... if you get my drift!",
    ["嗨！你是来这儿学习新武器的吗？"] = "Well hi there!  Are you here to learn the proper technique of a new weapon?",
    ["嗨！嗨！嗨！如果你想要试试自己的钓鱼技能，那么你来对地方啦！本周日荆棘谷将举办一场钓鱼大赛！"] = "Heya Heya Heya!   If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!   This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!",
    ["嗨！很高兴你回来啦，$n。告诉我，你完成我给你的第一项任务了吗？如果完成了，我会给你第二项任务的……"] = "Hi there! I'm glad you came back, $n. Tell me, have you completed the first quest I gave you? If you have, I might have a second quest for you...",
    ["嗨！我名叫格雷甘。我能为你做什么呢？"] = "Hi there! The name's Gregan. What can I do for ya?",
    ["嗨！谢谢你手下留情，没有惩罚我！我想我得躺一会儿恢复体力。"] = "Hey!  Thanks for saving my hide!  I think I'll be lying down for a while until I recover my strength.",
    ["嗨，$C。我想你是为安其拉一战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B部落和联盟必须携手对抗安其拉异种虫类大军和它们的主使者。在奥格瑞玛的精神谷，我们正在收集原料制造战争物资，收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"] = "Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?",
    ["嗨，$C。我想你是为安其拉之战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B部落和联盟必须携手对抗安其拉异种虫类大军和它们的主使者。在奥格瑞玛的精神谷，我们正在收集原料制造战争物资，收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"] = "Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?",
    ["嗨，$C。眼下奥特兰克山谷急需援助，这是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你愿意加入我们，共同对抗雷矛卫队吗？"] = "Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?",
    ["嗨，$C。铁炉堡军团驻扎在此地，密切注视着佐拉虫巢的动静。塞纳里奥要塞的德鲁伊们一直监视着异种虫类的一举一动，他们预计这儿将发生大事。"] = "Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area.",
    ["嗨，$c！"] = "Hail, $c!",
    ["嗨，$c！欢迎你！"] = "Hail, $c!  Welcome to the celebration!",
    ["嗨，你需要继续前进，去找$c训练师。"] = "Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer.",
    ["嗨，又见面了，$n。我感觉时间流仍处在强大力量的威胁之下。青铜龙始终欢迎你不断地提供帮助。$B$B虽然过去的事情已无法改变，但是将来却变化莫测。你此刻做出的决定将改变未来。"] = "Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change.",
    ["嗨，我是派提亚。在我右边是科多兽达丹加。我们曾跟马歇尔探险队在一起——那已经是数年前的事儿了，那时达丹加还是只幼兽呢。$B$B要是你带有火炬或是任何火种，请尽可能地把它们藏起来。达丹加不喜欢烟。"] = "Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke.",
    ["嗨，我能为你做什么呢？"] = "Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?",
    ["嗨，提醒我啦，我需要修理一下火箭靴。聪明人一点就通啦，不要把火箭靴和狮鹫混淆的。  哦，让我为你指明方向……穿过矮人区，你就会找到利廉姆·火轴啦。"] = "Hey, that reminds me, I need to have my rocket boots repaired.  Word to the wise my friend, rocket boots and gryphons don't mix.  Oh, but you need directions...  just head on over to the Dwarven District, you'll find Lilliam Sparkspindle towards the back.",
    ["嗯……你看起来很有能耐。如果你真想学习的话，那么没有什么能阻挡你！我会指引你通过漫长而硕果丰盛的道路上的第一步。"] = "Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path.",
    ["嗯……你需要学的东西有点超出我的能耐了。去找那边的塞拉多斯谈谈。我会的东西全是他教的！"] = "Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson's Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!",
    ["嗯……好吧，我现在还帮不到你！你必须先学习基础知识。你为什么不去见见暴风城的斯普莱特呢！"] = "Hmm... well, I can't help you quite yet! You have to learn the basics first. Why don't you go see Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind!",
    ["嗯……对，我这里确实有一些挺有用的菜谱。让我来教你吧！"] = "Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful.  Let me teach you!",
    ["嗯……我认为你体型过大，不能乘坐机械陆行鸟，$g先生:女士;。你很可能会压碎这些精美的机器！"] = "Um... I think you're a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma'am;.  You'd likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!",
    ["嗯……看来还有点希望，我会把那个给你的。那好吧，我们在哪里？"] = "Hmm... you show a little promise, I'll give you that. Okay then, where were we?",
    ["嗯……这附近唯一有附魔训练师的地方就是暴风城了。你为什么不问一下暴风城的守卫呢？"] = "Hmmm... only enchanters I know of around here work out of Stormwind.  Why don't you ask one of the guards up in Stormwind?",
    ["嗯……食物。旅途并不遥远，你需要朝北走，去奥格瑞玛，问问那儿的守卫。"] = "Mmmmm food.  It's not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.",
    ["嗯！说到学习采矿的话，你来对地方啦，$g小伙子:姑娘;！吉尔弗拉姆·石趾居住在深山矿工协会。没有比他更好的老师了。"] = "Well well!  You've come to the right place to learn Mining, $gboyo : girlie;!  Geofram Bouldertoe himself resides at the Deepmountain Mining Guild.  Ye couldn't ask for a better instructor than him.",
    ["嗯，似乎你在寻找裁缝时并不顺利。但是，有很多高明的裁缝都居住在铁炉堡。你为什么不去问问那里的守卫呢？"] = "Well, ye won't have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don't ye go ask a guard there.",
    ["嗯，你在找哪个战场？"] = "Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?",
    ["嗯，你好！如果你是来征收费用或者投递传票的，那你一定是将我认作别人了。非常抱歉！"] = "Um, hello!  If you are here about fee collection and/or a summons, then you must have me mistaken for someone else.  Terribly sorry!",
    ["嗯，你学得速度蛮快的！我没法教给你所有知识，但是宾斯匹德是可以的！你可以在铁炉堡中找到他。祝你好运！"] = "Well, you're just zooming right along! I can't teach you anything you don't already know, but Springspindle Fizzlegear sure can! You can find Springspindle in Ironforge. Good luck!",
    ["嗯，你这个聪明的家伙！我可以明确地告诉你，你知道的比我多！你可别为此自负，如果你想继续学习的话，就去暴风城找乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈吧。听说他是个很好的裁缝！"] = "Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!",
    ["嗯，依我看来，$n，要离开这个洞穴有两种选择。$B$B我们可以秘密潜逃——我利用你给我的披风，你用你自己的办法；或者，我们一起杀出去，但是我受伤了，这个方法或许比较困难。$B$B你更了解自己的实力，因此我让你来做选择。"] = "Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.$B$BWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.$B$BI'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I.",
    ["嗯，嗯，我们都生活在这个世界中，是吗？在Old Town的东南角落，你可以找到勇士大厅。如果你是官员的话，就可以直接进入大厅。如果不是的话，你也可以跟站在大厅外的Officer Areyn谈谈。祝你好运！"] = "Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You're looking for the Champions' Hall, and you'll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. If you're an officer you can enter the hall, otherwise you can still speak to Officer Areyn standing outside. Good luck!",
    ["嗯，嗯，还不坏。或许我能让你看点什么……"] = "Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things...",
    ["嗯，好吧，我看到你还懂一点做药剂的方法。然而，你是否配做我的学生仍有待察看。我有一项任务交给你。争取给我一个好印象。"] = "Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me.",
    ["嗯，如果我能用树枝做掩护的话，那些守卫是看不见我的。"] = "Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then.",
    ["嗯，很简单的！这东西的使用方法和你以前用过的那些东西没什么两样。别担心，我会负责点火，当你升空之后，你会发现自己正“飘浮”在空中，但是这种情况不会持续很久。你将被发射到湖边的一个目标那里去，只要记得在适当的时候下落，就可以安全地掉入湖中了！不然的话，嗯，我不负责出售人身保险。"] = "Oh that's simple! You use it like anything else you might activate. Don't worry, I'll take care of lighting the fuse. Once you're up in the air you'll notice that you'll seem to 'float,' but that won't last forever. What you're aiming for is a target on the lake way over yonder. Make sure that you begin your descent by detaching your 'wings' at the right time to land in the water, or, well, I don't sell life insurance.",
    ["嗯，我声明！他是个新学生！只要你再多掌握一点技能，我会很乐意将我所知道的一切都教给你的。去跟格雷塔谈谈，好吗？她会教你如何速成技能的。"] = "Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time.",
    ["嗯，我想我可以再收一个学生。好吧，不要傻站在那里。告诉我你想学什么。"] = "Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn.",
    ["嗯，我能教的你已经都学会了。或许你该找其他人谈谈了。试一下达纳苏斯工匠区的暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她确实很有智慧！"] = "Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!",
    ["嗯，我觉得你需要到雷霆崖去弄清楚。出了血蹄村沿着公路一直往北走。你会到达雷霆崖的底部。乘电梯到顶部你就可以向雷霆崖的任何一个守卫寻求进一步的帮助。"] = "Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance.",
    ["嗯，既然你提及了这一点，不错，昨天下午我确实看见了奇怪的事情！$B$B当我从东南方的巨魔废墟处跑过时……好吧，我其实不是跑过去的，应该说是跳过去的……沙地真是太烫了！$B$B总之，当我从废墟旁跳过的时候，我注意到那儿有一座营帐。我不得不说，在那儿设立营帐是件可笑的事儿……我本来要到那里去看看的，但是一只疯狂的大秃鹫把我赶走了。"] = "Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!$B$BI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot!$B$BAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off.",
    ["嗯，见到你真好！我叫威利德·马绍尔。我、我的姐妹以及同伴组成了马绍尔探险队——来自艾泽拉斯荒野的科学家和探险家们。$B$B我们在安戈洛环形山遇到了一点小麻烦，如果你有时间的话，就帮帮我们吧！"] = "Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown.$B$BWe've hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we're looking for some help if you have the time!",
    ["嗯，这个问题很有趣……我收到的最新消息是，到目前为止，联盟已经收集了$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮了，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。"] = "Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins.",
    ["嗯？我没时间聊天，我父亲要我完成这个使命。"] = "Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him.",
    ["嘘……你闻到什么了吗？"] = "Shhh... do you smell something?",
    ["嘿嘿嘿！我在这里是为了推广荆棘谷的超级无敌钓鱼锦标赛的。不过你首先得有足够的生存能力在这里活下去，然后还需要足够在这里钓鱼的精湛技巧。$B$B当你更符合以上条件的时候再回到这里来吧！"] = "Hey Hey Hey!  I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!",
    ["嘿，$g兄弟:姐妹;……我希望可以打扰你一下，如果可以的话。$B$B我们在通过试炼和进行家园重建中经历了很多。我们现在极度缺乏布料。如果你有一些多余的话，我希望你可以捐献给我们。你一定会为此赢得所有牛头人的尊重的！"] = "Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may.$B$BWe tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland.  We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!",
    ["嘿，$n！这场景不甚美观，是吧？地平线轻帆号沉在海底，我的手下狼狈不堪，我们的货物和乘客如同碎片一般到处都是，你也许会认为暴风城曾在这儿举办过节日庆典。$B$B麻烦事儿还不止这么点……"] = "Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?$B$BThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival.$B$BAnd that's not where the trouble ends...",
    ["嘿，朋友——请等一下，如果可以的话……$B$B我们在重建泰达希尔的过程中经历了很多的痛苦。现在，我们不仅要忍受这些痛苦，而且我们还发现我们的布料存储已经很少了。如果你有多余的布料，那我希望你可以捐赠出它们。你一定因为帮助暗夜精灵赢得我们的尊重！"] = "Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...$B$BWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!",
    ["四季轮回变幻，但是你年纪尚轻。当你经历更多之后再来找我们吧，$C。"] = "The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more.",
    ["因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！$B$B向炼金师迪瑟斯询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！"] = "With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!",
    ["因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！$B$B向炼金师阿尔比顿询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！"] = "With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!",
    ["因为我们经常战斗，我们当然有一个急救训练师在剃刀岭。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到拉乌克。"] = "With all of the fighting we do of course we have a First Aid Trainer in Razor Hill.  Find Rawrk inside the barracks on the east side of town.",
    ["在上一次大战中，牛头人也曾参战，很多地方都有萨满祭司抵抗天灾入侵的记录。这些祭司们也献出了宝贵的生命，更悲惨的是，他们的尸体竟然还被收集起来，切割成碎片，输送到那座被诅咒的城堡中的用作某些邪恶实验的材料。我只能在此真心为他们的逝去感到默哀，他们也是我们一族的骄傲。"] = "In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage.",
    ["在严格的训练中，我必须除去那些学生先前所学的所有知识，以便传授新知识。我所提供的服务越来越难以完成。为此，每次训练的费用也越来越昂贵。你愿意除去你先前学习的技能吗？"] = "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
    ["在亡灵天灾来临之前，我是一名大商贩。我出售所有商品。所有！$B$B价钱都极其便宜！$B$B你随便问问那些没死的人，看看我说的是不是真的。"] = "Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!$B$BAnd my prices were INSANE!$B$BJust ask anyone.  Anyone who's not dead.",
    ["在他不幸运遇难之后，全洛丹伦的骑士与战士都开始穿着相同式样的铠甲，以纪念这位倒下的英雄。尽管莫格莱尼的死可以算是克尔苏加德的一场大胜，但英雄之死的影响，却改变了整个战争最终的走势。$B$B一个人倒下了，但更多的人站了出来，为反抗天灾军团的入侵而战……"] = "It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.$B$BWhere one did fall, many would rise...",
    ["在你从驭风者背上往下俯瞰这个世界之前，不能说你真正活过。"] = "You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider.",
    ["在你匆忙追寻荣耀的过程中，你有没有想过你的行动对于这场竞赛的节奏有什么影响？你有没有想过你们的行为对我来说是多么可笑而荒谬？我对你来说是个难以理解的存在，这让你头颅里那花生大小的脑子感到十分迷茫。"] = "In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull.",
    ["在你开始任何工作之前都要洗净双手。皮革被血或尘土玷污了会带走它的自然美。"] = "Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty.",
    ["在你开始切割皮革之前一定要仔细检查尺寸。我们可不能浪费材料。"] = "Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials.",
    ["在假期里不要忘记储备包装纸！没什么能比包装精美的护甲和武器一样让你的朋友和家人感受到冬幕节的温馨快乐！"] = "Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says 'Wondrous Winter Veil' like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.",
    ["在光明与黑暗之间，还有阴影……而那些阴影有些你未曾见过的力量。"] = "Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see.",
    ["在凯尔达隆，你不能四处游荡、行乞、诅咒、斗殴，也不能随心所欲 。"] = "There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow.",
    ["在剃刀岭居住着一名工程学训练师。他名叫穆德拉克，你在熔炉附近就能找到他。"] = "There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge.",
    ["在北方的雷霆崖，你能学到草药学。沿着村外的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部。那儿的守卫能为你指明方向。"] = "There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further.",
    ["在北方的雷霆崖，有一名双足飞龙管理员。乘坐电梯到达雷霆崖顶部，问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"] = "There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north.  Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions.",
    ["在城市的大门外有一处路标，指向地精塔。去跟塔顶的地精飞艇管理人弗雷萨交谈。"] = "Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the zeppelin tower.  Speak to Zeppelin Master Frezza at the top of the tower.",
    ["在大地之母心目中，学习如何与自然融合一体是件荣耀的事儿。如果你想成为一名猎人，你必须去血蹄村北部找雅文·刺鬃。"] = "To learn to be one with Nature in the eyes of the Earth Mother, this is a matter of pride.  If your will is to learn the ways of the Hunter you must seek out Yaw Sharpmane at the north end of Bloodhoof Village.",
    ["在奥格瑞玛有一名剥皮训练者。出了剃刀岭往北走，当你到达奥格瑞玛时问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"] = "There's a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive.",
    ["在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。朝着北方走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。"] = "There's one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts.",
    ["在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。那儿的守卫会为你指明方向的。朝着北方的道路走，应该不会错过的。"] = "There's one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can't miss it.",
    ["在希利苏斯，我们的敌人不止一个，$n。$B$B虽然每个人的注意力都集中到异种虫类身上，但是我和我的兄弟密切注视着暮光之锤的一举一动。"] = "We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $N.$B$BWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies.",
    ["在幽暗城中居住着一位蝙蝠管理员。出了布瑞尔城朝南走，然后在丁字路口向西走。洛丹伦废墟就在你的右边，穿过废墟，然后进入幽暗城。你可以问问那儿的守卫，请求他们的帮助。"] = "There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance.",
    ["在我们的家园面临重重危机的情况下……暴风城的官员们竟然将大批军队派往别处，我真不敢相信！$B$B来自西部荒野的潜行者和谁知道哪里来的豺狼人蜂拥而至，暴风城没有受到围攻可真是个奇迹。"] = "I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!$B$BWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged.",
    ["在我参加聚会时别骚扰我……"] = "Don't bother me while I'm partying...",
    ["在我帮你之前你必须学会一些基础的东西。与我的徒弟范恩谈谈。他很耐心而且愿意教你所需的知识。"] = "There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被奥格瑞玛的兽人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the orcs of Orgrimmar before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被幽暗城的被遗忘者所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the Forsaken of the Undercity before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被暗矛部族的巨魔所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the trolls of the Darkspear tribe before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被暴风城的人类所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the humans of Stormwind before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被诺莫瑞根逃亡侏儒所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被达纳苏斯的暗夜精灵所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the night elves of Darnassus before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被铁炉堡的矮人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被雷霆崖的牛头人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。"] = "You need to be exalted with the tauren of Thunder Bluff before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.",
    ["在我的家乡雷霆崖，有一位铁匠训练者。如果你想成为一名铁匠的话，就朝北走，去雷霆崖，然后问问那儿的守卫吧。"] = "There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions.",
    ["在我看来，钓鱼的美妙之处在于其缓慢的节奏。人们可以在钓鱼的过程中思考、回想过去和计划未来。$B$B哦，当然这也是大醉的托辞。"] = "If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.$B$BOh, and it's also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily.",
    ["在我眼中，部落的所有成员都是平等的，$n。我们的血液被恶魔玛诺洛斯污染了，人民承受着重负，如果不是为了学识和荣耀的话，我们几乎就快沦为亡灵天灾了。$B$B协助部落，让我们获得新生，这是你的职责。但是你也得明白什么时候应该对朋友同情，对敌人怜悯。$B$B好好理解。这是新生的部落，而不是缺乏自由意愿的恶魔军队。"] = "All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $n. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.$B$BIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.$B$BUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill.",
    ["在我身后是赞扎祭坛，赞达拉部族的神圣之地。我们在此祷告，希望能充分做好对抗血神哈卡的准备工作。$B$B利用祭坛摧毁你在祖尔格拉布找到的任何哈卡莱宝石，以此证明你对部族的价值。我会用赞达拉荣誉硬币跟你交换祖尔格拉布的硬币。找到我需要的硬币，你将获得丰厚的奖励！"] = "Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.$B$BProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!",
    ["在我首次开始配制药水时，我一定打碎过成百个瓶子。我笨手笨脚，瓶子在我手中极易破碎。希望你比我更为小心。"] = "I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.",
    ["在抵抗燃烧军团时期，污染者拉瑟莱克是卡扎克麾下最强大的将领之一。当燃烧军团被击退，卡扎克的势力被压制之后，拉瑟莱克接受了诅咒之地的事务。$B$B当联盟和部落在诅咒之地以外的地方打得天昏地暗的时候，拉瑟莱克则在召集阴影议会的教徒，以及野蛮的巨槌食人魔。"] = "In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.$B$BWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land.",
    ["在旅行者营地，我们最推崇狩猎技能。想获得我的赏识吗？你得靠行动来证明。$B$B面对挑战吧，$G小伙子:姑娘;！"] = "Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it.$B$BYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!",
    ["在暴风城银行和贸易区的镶金玫瑰旅店之间设有邮箱，非常便利。"] = "There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District.",
    ["在暴风城，有很多地方可供饮水休息，但是只有一处可以过夜。去贸易区的镶金玫瑰吧。我听说客房的费用相当合理，被单也很整洁。"] = "There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean. ",
    ["在最后一次大战之前，我父亲经营着北山伐木场。那是他的命根子，他把所有的精力都投到了伐木场。战争爆发时，我们忍痛逃到了暴风城。$B$B那些日子里，我们失去了无数朋友，而我们的伐木场也被血色十字军占领了，我对此感到非常心痛。$B$B这就是我回来的原因。"] = "Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.$B$BWe lost a number of friends and family in the those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.$B$BThat's why I've returned.",
    ["在武器使用方面，没有人能胜过安塞瓦了。据说他接受过我们尊敬的祖先，最伟大的战士的灵魂的指导。去中部高地的底层寻找他，他会教你的。"] = "None are as skilled in the use of weapons as Ansekhwa.  It is said that he is guided by the spirits of the finest warriors of our honored ancestors.  Seek him out on the lower rise and he will teach you what you want to know.",
    ["在水晶湖畔居住着一名技艺高超的剥皮师。她可以教你这项专业的入门技能。"] = "There's an excellent skinner that lives up in the house by Crystal Lake.  She's bound to be able to show you how to get started in the skinner's profession.",
    ["在沙漠里要多加小心，$c。"] = "Be careful out in the desert, $c.",
    ["在灰色年代，德鲁伊对周遭的人都很友好。你随便问塞纳里奥区的任何一个德鲁伊，他们会给出相同的说法的。"] = "In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.",
    ["在瘟疫来之前，我对皮革一无所知。现在我的知识可以传授别人了。死亡让我有了很多时间供自己支配。"] = "Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands.",
    ["在艾尔文森林只有少数职业的训练师。你在找谁？"] = "There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?",
    ["在血蹄村的东边，有一座巨大的营帐。纳姆·逐星在那儿等着你呢。"] = "There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there.",
    ["在贫瘠之地的东北部，有一处受到严重污染的水池。当地人称它为淤泥沼泽；风险投资公司将水晶般幽蓝的水域变成工业副产品和废弃品的泥潭。在沼泽的中心有你要找的东西，$n。$B$B要小心，风险投资公司绝不容许有人入侵，他们将不为其工作的人都当作入侵者。你作为自然的保护者，更是他们极力对抗的目标。"] = "In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose.",
    ["在达拉然陷落和奎尔萨拉斯被摧毁之后，这样的东西就很难在世面上看到了。但是鲁坎·考迪尔和我的其他一些商业伙伴很好的完成了我的订单。"] = "Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise.",
    ["在达纳苏斯的东北部，也就是工匠区，你会在旅馆外面找到邮箱的。"] = "There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you'll find in the center of Darnassus.",
    ["在过去的岁月里，我们以狩猎为生。我们为了荣誉而狩猎……$B$B现在有什么不同吗？"] = "In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?",
    ["在这个艰难的时期，捐赠布料对于那些不幸的人是非常重要的帮助手段。布料还可以制作装备和绷带——这对于战争十分重要！$B$B如果你想要为奥格瑞玛的兽人捐赠布料的话，我会欣然接受它们，你一定会受到我们的青睐。$B$B为了部落！"] = "In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!$B$BIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.$B$BFor the Horde!",
    ["在这么偏远的地方遇到人可真好啊。来吧，跟我一起。让我们用身体互相取暖。"] = "How wonderful to see another person in this remote region of the world. Come, walk with me. Let our bodies keep each other warm.",
    ["在这座营地的东北面有一个名叫克罗苏斯的强大的地狱火。这就是尼比待在这儿的原因。克罗苏斯极其强大，前所未闻。你瞧，菜鸟，地狱火以极高的速度坠落在地面上，但是它的生命却很短暂。一旦火焰熄灭，地狱火便崩溃了。"] = "There is a powerful infernal named Kroshius northeast of this camp. It is why Niby is here. Kroshius is a greater infernal - an infernal that has lasted longer than expected. You see, nub, an infernal crashes down into the earth with great intensity to serve its master but this intensity fades fast. Once the blazing flames have died down, the infernal crumbles.",
    ["在这里说话你要小心点，一不小心就可能招来杀身之祸。现在，你有什么需要我帮助的事情吗？"] = "Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?",
    ["在银松森林北流海岸边缘，海滩上搁着一艘废弃的船。船只以西有你要找的东西；游得太远的话，你会因疲劳无法游回海岸的。海床上有一只上了锁的箱子，等着你去取呢。$B$B要是没有人帮忙的话，潜到这样的深度会受到极大的压强，要小心；海床上有一道裂缝，能释放出气泡，有助于你寻找那半块坠饰。好好利用吧。"] = "In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely.",
    ["在阿拉希盆地跟被遗忘者作战的人类需要你的帮助。去武器大厅找他们的代表杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。"] = "The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood.",
    ["在雷霆崖，你肯定找不到比阿丝卡·迷雾行者更好的厨师。嗯……我在这里都可以闻到他正在烹制的美味佳肴。你可以在中部高地的厨房里找到她。  呃……我又饿了。"] = "There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.Drat... now I am hungry.",
    ["在驾驭过一头受过良好训练的山羊之前，就别夸口说你已经拥有了真正的坐骑，我的朋友。请随意看看这些杰出的坐骑吧。它们会让你满意的，相信我。"] = "You've not had a steed until you've taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They'll serve you well, believe me.",
    ["在黑海岸的北面流淌着壁泉河，发源于现今的费伍德森林。随着河流流到并汇入薄雾海，一直蜿蜒到海洋北部最深处。在那儿有你要的石头，由于这种石头的形状酷似爪状，因此被称为石爪。$B$B要当心——蛇颈龙聚集在石爪那里，他们会攻击那些贸然入侵的人。"] = "In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory.",
    ["地狱火是术士在$G他:她;在战斗中所能使用最强大的恶魔。这个怪物很强大，护甲很厚，并能给任何敌人造成极大的伤害。如果你想把地狱火的灵魂加到你的武器上，你就会得到那些好处——更多的生命值和更快的生命恢复速度。$B$B如果你想了解更多关于地狱犬的事，那你就该与我对面的温图拉谈谈。"] = "The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.$B$BIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me.",
    ["地狱犬……确实是一个邪恶的生物。它不像地狱火那样强壮，但是聪明的术士知道蛮力不总是解决的办法——如果是，你就会选择战士了，不是吗？$B$B地狱犬利用敌人的法力，用它和它的迅速来战胜敌人。它的力量来自奥术并利用那种奥术能量为自己谋利。$B$B如果你想得知更多关于地狱火的事，那么你该找我对面的玛迦兹谈谈。"] = "The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?$B$BThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.$B$BIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me.",
    ["地穴恶魔在狩猎与杀戮天敌的过程中所表现出来的那些超自然能力，一直是我们这类人所赞赏与模仿的对象。是的，我，一个在远征中手刃过成百上千天灾军团所圈养的野兽的人。$B$B尽管我也对地穴恶魔那残忍无情的天性十分厌恶，但也必须正视它的能力。它总是能够完美地完成自己的工作。"] = "The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.$B$BWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well.",
    ["地精的赛车马力强劲，但侏儒的赛车也有不少独到之处……"] = "The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car...",
    ["坐下来听听我的故事吧，$r。"] = "Sit and listen to my story, $r.",
    ["坦帕以她制作的衣物而闻名，你可以在中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找到她。"] = "Tepa is renown for her clothwork.  She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.",
    ["基尔达斯总是过分夸大。比如，“迦罗娜：潜行与诡计研究”已经被偷过400多次啦。$B$B雅典娜神庙的标志保护着这本卷轴，防止任何人偷看。"] = "Kildrath tends to overdramatize the situation. For example, 'Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery,' has been stolen over 400 times.$B$BThe mark of the Athenaeum protects the tomes, preventing any unauthorized viewings.",
    ["塞尤克是兽人武器管理人。他居住在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。他可训练弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。  居住在奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的巨魔武器管理人哈纳什可训练弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有投掷武器。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可训练十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。"] = "Sayoc is the orc weapon master and is located in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.  He instructs in the use of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons.Hanashi, the troll weapon master in the Valley of Honor of Orgrimmar, can teach the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and thrown weapons.Archibald, the undead weapon master in the War Quarter of the Undercity, can train the use of crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms.",
    ["塞尤克是兽人武器管理人。他居住在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。他可训练弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。  居住在奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的巨魔武器管理人哈纳什可训练弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有投掷武器。  居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可训练单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。"] = "Sayoc is the orc weapon master.  He is located in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.  He can train the use of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons.Hanashi, the troll weapon master in the Valley of Honor of Orgrimmar, can instruct in the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and all thrown weapons.Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master, is on Thunder Bluff's lower rise.  He teaches the use of one and two-handed maces, staves and guns.",
    ["塞恩德拉在炼金术方面的知识有些局限，但是我相信那也足够领你入门了。她就在多兰纳尔旅店的东面。"] = "Cyndra's knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I'm sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["塞恩德拉的态度非常和蔼，她的药剂也很不错。你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的东边找到她。"] = "While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["塞拉摩的卫兵都是原本驻扎在卡利姆多的联盟精英力量。即使远离了家园，但我们还是会努力维护联盟的律法。"] = "The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes.",
    ["塞纳留斯保佑你，$c。我们的首领大德鲁伊鹿盔会带领我们和整个泰达希尔开始全新的生活！"] = "The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c.  Our leader, Arch Druid Staghelm, guides us and all of Teldrassil to a renewed life!",
    ["塞纳里奥议会是睿智的，他们发现了很多有关大地的秘密。愿意聆听这些德鲁伊的教诲的工匠总是会得到许多宝贵的知识。"] = "The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth's secrets.  Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids.",
    ["士兵，你好。你是来帮我的吗？"] = "Greetings, soldier. Are you here to help the cause?",
    ["士兵，做得好。我们的马厩将塞满骑兵们的战斗坐骑！"] = "Well done, soldier. A few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts for the cavalry to ride into combat!",
    ["多好的天气！它让我有了创造新设计的灵感。"] = "What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design.",
    ["多年的精心饲养和细致的品种培育使我能够有机会向你展示这些良种马。请慢慢挑选，马是你长期的伙伴，朋友。不要把自己低估了——今天就在这里找到你想要的马！"] = "Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!",
    ["夜光长者就在艾萨拉地区的拉文凯斯雕像附近。"] = "Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara.",
    ["夜风长者最近在费伍德森林的加德纳尔神殿里。"] = "Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood.",
    ["大地中蕴藏着许多秘密，$c。保护这些秘密是我们永远的职责。"] = "The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such.",
    ["大地之母发出召唤，你得做出应答。你可以在灵魂高地找到灵魂大厅。"] = "The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.",
    ["大地之母有许多秘密，布瑞克·石蹄能帮助你发现一些秘密。你会在 石蹄地质学会的中部高地的底层那找到他的。"] = "The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.",
    ["大工匠奥玛里恩某个晚上消失了。就像是风中的柳絮一样……呼地一声就没了！好吧，现在我就是唯一能够为前线的那帮家伙打造装备的人了。"] = "Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines. ",
    ["天真的傻子。火刃就是暗影议会！议会拥有许多信徒和组织，但是他们都服从于议会的意愿。我或许能领导火刃，但是我无非是议会手下的一名爪牙，就像你是我的爪牙一样！$B$B看看燃刃吧——他们中的大多数人认为自己会成为下一批极具潜力的术士，并成功替代暗影议会。"] = "Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!$B$BLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council.",
    ["太可怕了，这些骡子到底怎么了……要是这样下去，梅兹会把我剥了皮的。"] = "Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure.",
    ["太好了！我能断定我的努力不会白费！"] = "Good! I can tell that my efforts will not be wasted!",
    ["太棒了！难道你不是一个勤奋的人吗？好的，让我们开始吧，行吗？"] = "Fantastic! Aren't you the industrious one? Well, let's get started, shall we?",
    ["太阳已经升起来了吗？夜晚的时间总是太短！嗯，塞琳尼会好好照顾你的。她在达纳苏斯东北面的工匠区招待客人。"] = "Has the sun risen already?  There are just never enough hours in the night!  Well, Saelienne will take good care of you.  You can find her tending to her guests over in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.",
    ["奈辛瓦里要出去狩猎。我发现帮助他做丛林狩猎的准备工作比做战争准备的工作轻松多了。尽管我错过了战场上的光辉岁月。"] = "Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him.  I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat.  Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield.",
    ["奥兰纳·鸦眼将她的天赋部分归结为与神谕林地的灵魂进行了交流。你应该能在那儿找到她的。"] = "Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now.",
    ["奥拉密斯湖近来遭受袭击，所有的渔夫都已经搬迁到达纳苏斯了。你应该去那儿看看。"] = "All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there.",
    ["奥格瑞玛地形迂回曲折，能有效地阻止入侵者。你能想象这些矮小的侏儒在多么短的时间内就迷失方向吗？哈哈！如果够幸运的话，我会追踪到他们，将他们变成我的宠物。"] = "The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet.",
    ["奥格瑞玛拍卖所位于力量谷。去火枪进口公司东面找它吧。"] = "The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.",
    ["奥格瑞玛银行在力量谷那里。去主城门以北的地方找找吧。"] = "The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city.",
    ["奥特兰克本地出产的山羊对我们的骑兵至关重要！"] = "The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!",
    ["奥罗死后，通向最后那个密室的道路已经彻底畅通了。如果你愿意的话，我可以把你传送到那边去。"] = "With Ouro slain the way is clear to the final chamber. I am able to transport you there, if you desire.",
    ["奥达曼位于荒芜之地最北端。"] = "Uldaman can be found at the very northern end of the Badlands.",
    ["女神已经赐予我智慧，陌生人。如果那是她的意愿，我将会把它传给你。"] = "The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you.",
    ["奶奶总是说世界上没有比一块自制的、鲜美的樱桃馅饼更好的东西了。"] = "Nana always said there was no greater thing in the whole world than a warm, toasty slice of fresh, homemeade cherry pie.",
    ["她名叫泰金，你可以在剃刀岭东面的兵营中找到她。她会教你如何尊敬神灵的。作为回报，你必须向她表示尊重。"] = "Tai'jin is her name and you'll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  She'll teach you to respect the gods.  Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!",
    ["好像这是我所见过的最好的垃圾。当然它还过得去，但我每天都看到这类‘还行’的东西。告诉你吧，你若能想办法让我叫好，我就会教给你能让矮人们在睡梦里都会笑的东西。"] = "You act like this is the best junk I've ever seen. Sure it's ok, but I see stuff this 'OK' every day. Tell you what, you find a way to wow me, and I'll teach you things that make dwarves smile in their sleep.",
    ["好吧*嗝儿*……嗯，你看起来很眼熟*嗝儿*。我有跟你说过我和温德索尔一起跟，呃，一，一百万个兽人战斗的事儿吗？$B$B哦，坐下来吧，朋友，这个故事非常棒的！"] = "Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?$B$BOh settle down friend, this is a good one!",
    ["好吧！她从虫巢回来过，但是布莱恩一点都没有察觉到！混战之前，她开始跟什么人交谈起来。奇怪的是，她用了一种我们从未听过的语言谈话。"] = "Right then! So the Mistress had come back for a second go at the hives but Brann was having none of that nonsense! Before the melee began, she started talking to something or someone. Crazier still, she started chanting in a language none of us had ever heard.",
    ["好吧！我在熔岩大桥的熔岩坑测试熔岩服。一切进展顺利。我甚至能在熔岩中毫发无损地游泳！$B$B我在那儿做自己的事，有时仰泳一会，突然之间它把我一口吞没！若不是有了熔岩服和便携式食物机，我一定会就此交待了！"] = "Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!$B$BSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!",
    ["好吧，$N，让我们来看看怎么对付这些瘟疫之锅！如果你要收集所需的成分，就带上一个玻璃聚焦装置吧。在鉴别从亡灵天灾的爪牙身上获取的资源时，你会用得着它的。$B$B你还需要找一份奥术催化剂。这东西可不便宜，而且也非常不稳定。一旦你得到药剂，就必须在15分钟内使用它，否则药剂就失效了。所以你可得留神别乱买。"] = "Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.",
    ["好吧，嗯……别骄傲！既然你已经证明了自己的能力，我们可以开始了！"] = "Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated  your competence though, we may now begin!",
    ["好吧，我明白些了。但是，你有潜力，这点我不会否定。多加留心你或许就能学到什么东西！"] = "Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!",
    ["好好利用自然界的草药，它会成为你有力的助手的。去本娜的炼金店找她吧，接受更多训练。"] = "The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training.",
    ["好心的旅店老板艾玛，她现在已经照顾当地的动物好些年了。我敢肯定她会很高兴照顾你给的任何动物。你可以在狮王之傲旅店的外面找到她。"] = "Good ol' Erma, she's been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I'm sure she'd be happy to take care of any you'd like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion's Pride Inn.",
    ["好心的萨姆诺前些天在我与一个肮脏的穴居人战斗后替我包扎了伤口。我现在已经完全痊愈了！我敢肯定萨姆诺会很高兴教你制作绷带的。"] = "Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I'm good as new I tell ye!  I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage.",
    ["好极了，你很有勇气！我很满意。那么，我们就出发吧！"] = "Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!",
    ["如果不住在有大理石天花板的房间里，我就浑身不舒服。天上的星星让我觉得很烦燥……"] = "I just can't seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers.",
    ["如果你一心想学附魔的话，你该到铁炉堡看看。我记得上次我到那里的时候曾看到狮鹫旁边有一家商店。"] = "Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there.",
    ["如果你到这儿来猎龙，那你就是我的客人了。我应该去哪里表示我的哀悼？"] = "If you are here to hunt dragons, be my guest.  Where should I send my condolences?",
    ["如果你喜欢在户外狩猎的话，那么无论是费伍德的树人还是环形山的鞭笞者都是不错的目标，可以提供大量的叶子。$B$B如果你更喜欢冒险，那么厄运之槌东西两翼内都有大量的植物，可以供应足够的叶子。"] = "If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.$B$BIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds.",
    ["如果你在寻找一种真正回报丰厚的事业，那么附魔行业正在等待着你！"] = "If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!",
    ["如果你对皮革缝纫感兴趣，那你算来对地方了。法多恩和泰龙尼斯都是真正的艺术家，而我希望能从他们那里多学些知识。"] = "If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them.",
    ["如果你希望成为一名铸剑师，那就问问我吧。"] = "If you wish to become a swordsmith, just ask.",
    ["如果你带着那东西，我会很高兴地为你指路的。"] = "If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way.",
    ["如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找暴风城的狮鹫管理员吧。当你进入英雄谷时，应该就能看见右边的狮鹫降落台。"] = "Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes.",
    ["如果你想变成强大的圣骑士，那么格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵是你最好的导师。你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂中找到他。"] = "If you are looking to become a mighty paladin, there is no better teacher then Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. He can be found in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square.",
    ["如果你想在塞纳里奥议会中找寻某些档案的话，我就是那个你要交谈的人。你首先要知道要寻找的确切信息，那样我才能帮你。$B$B看看那个，真是光彩夺目呀！"] = "If you're looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I'm the one to talk to.  Then again, you need to know what information you're looking for first before I can really help you.$B$BSee how that works?  Brilliant!",
    ["如果你想学习挖矿的话，最好前往暴风城的矮人区。那里的某个矮人肯定会教给你这门技能。"] = "You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession.",
    ["如果你想猎杀纳迦，你需要所能获得的所有帮助。水底有裂缝，能产生足够的气泡供你在水下呼吸。向水面游动，就能利用这些气泡了。"] = "If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles.",
    ["如果你想知道碎木哨岗的商旅来往情况，我恰好就是你要找的兽人。不幸的是，我不喜欢人类。$B$B要是你想要什么的话，就快些。"] = "If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people.$B$BIf you want something, make it quick.",
    ["如果你想要去奥特兰克山谷，去和卡尔特拉·血喉谈谈。你可以在荣耀谷的勇者大厅去找她。"] = "If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.",
    ["如果你想要学习草药学的话，就应该去找克米恩·冰蹄谈谈。他在中部高地那里。"] = "Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise.",
    ["如果你想要成为一名好厨师，那就去旧城区的猪和哨声旅店，找斯蒂芬·雷百克谈谈。那家伙知道怎样才能做出与众不同的肋排大餐来。  啊……说到他那著名的肋骨大餐，我都感到有些饿了。你可不要指望他会把那道菜的做法传授给你！"] = "If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other.Man... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!",
    ["如果你想飞回鲁瑟兰村，就该找暗夜精灵希尔瓦·菲纳雯斯谈谈。"] = "If you're looking for a flight back to Rut'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil'naveth.",
    ["如果你把A标签插到B槽中，那么当然会爆炸！来，看看我有些什么，然后你可以问利廉姆怎样组合才不会爆炸。"] = "If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up.",
    ["如果你是个裁缝，维兹格里克肯定有你想要的东西！随便看看，$n，想要买什么东西就和我说！"] = "If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $n, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!",
    ["如果你是为获得快速而安全的产品而来，那么这儿就是你的目的地了！今年的机械陆行鸟模型已经到了，我将为你展示其性能！"] = "If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year's model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!",
    ["如果你是来拯救世界的，那么你来对地方了。无面者——血神哈卡——已经被带回到我们的世界来了！"] = "If you have come to save the world then you have come to the right place. The faceless one - the Blood God, Hakkar - has been brought back into our world!",
    ["如果你是来接受狩猎技巧训练的，那你就来对地方了！"] = "If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!",
    ["如果你是来浪费我的时间，那你就是在浪费整个塞纳里奥议会的时间。为你自己着想，希望你不至于那么蠢。"] = "If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that.",
    ["如果你有办法改进这个装置，那就告诉我！"] = "If you figure out any way to improve the device let me know!",
    ["如果你有希望学成一位裁缝的话你当然应该去找迈里恩。她住在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区。"] = "You would certainly be looking for Me'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.",
    ["如果你有能力学习的话，我是很荣幸教你如何使用武器的。"] = "I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you.",
    ["如果你来这儿是为了得到进一步的训练，那你是高估我的能力了。跟泰龙尼斯谈谈；他应该能帮助你。"] = "If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you.",
    ["如果你洒上一些香水，就可以找到对你有好感的人。他们会接受你的爱情信物……并给你一件礼物作为回报。$B$B但是，你要记住：要让别人接受你的爱情信物，你必须闻起来很迷人！男人喜欢香水的味道，而女人会为古龙水陶醉！"] = "If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne.",
    ["如果你真的想做这个职业，就去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区找一个技艺纯熟的炼金士：安尼希尔。"] = "If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus.",
    ["如果你要去学剥皮术，可以到旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里看看。"] = "You are gonna want to head over to Old Town and drop by the Protective Hide if you are lookin' to learn skinning.",
    ["如果你要学习炼金术，暴风城只有一个地方值得你去……那就是炼金材料店。你可以沿着法师区的外围找到这家店铺。"] = "If you need training in alchemy, there is only one place in Stormwind you need to go... Alchemy Needs. You can find it in the Mage Quarter along the outer rim of shops.",
    ["如果你要寻找德鲁伊训练师，那就去花园区。塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩一般都在那里的月亮井旁边。"] = "The Park is where you want to go if you are looking for druid trainers. Theridan and Maldryn can usually be found by the moonwell in the center of the district.",
    ["如果你要找潜行者的话，就应该去旧城区。它坐落在暴风城的东北角。"] = "Old Town is where you should go if you want to find rogues. It's in the northeast corner of Stormwind.",
    ["如果你认为自己有能力为部落打造武器，就去剃刀岭西北部，炙热的熔炉旁找杜克。"] = "If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.",
    ["如果你问我，那我要说，地精的科技更加先进。我们有工具，我们还有天赋！"] = "If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!",
    ["如果你集齐一套元素卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：漩涡。这张卡片可能会对你的敌人造成严重的伤害。"] = "If you manage to complete a deck of elementals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the maelstrom.   This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage.",
    ["如果你集齐一套入口卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：虚空。这张卡片将有可能在你死亡之后让你复活。"] = "If you manage to complete a deck of portals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the twisting nether.   This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you.",
    ["如果你集齐一套督军卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：英雄。这张卡片将有可能在你进行近身作战的时候对你进行治疗。"] = "If you manage to complete a deck of warlords cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of heroism.   This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat.",
    ["如果你集齐一套野兽卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：蓝龙。这张卡片对恢复魔法能量非常有用。"] = "If you manage to complete a deck of beasts cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the blue dragon.   This is very useful in restoring of magical energies.",
    ["如果你需要将宠物关在屋内，以便训练另一只宠物的话，就去矮人区找耶诺瓦·石盾谈谈。"] = "If you need to house your pet while you're training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.",
    ["如果你需要通过休息恢复体力的话，多兰纳尔的旅店是你最佳的选择。旅店老板凯达米尔将帮你打点一切。"] = "If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of.",
    ["如果克苏恩还活着的话，我们的自由将变得没有意义。你真是个预言中的勇士。"] = "Our freedom would have meant nothing if C'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy.",
    ["如果它坏了，那么斯拉提可以修理它！"] = "If it's broke, Slagtree can fix it!",
    ["如果我不是天天都陷在这里，我已经得到训练你们这些人的技能了！不幸的是事实不是这样。去找石爪山脉太阳石居所的赫加斯谈谈。"] = "If I wasn't stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that's not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains.",
    ["如果我们要成为这块新地区的主人，那么我们就必须要找个地方好好休息。把你的斧子放在火边，让大家分享你英勇战斗的故事吧。"] = "If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles.",
    ["如果我是你，我就赌地精赢。压其他车队都是在浪费时间。"] = "If I were you, I'd buy a goblin race voucher.  Rooting for the other team is a waste of time.",
    ["如果我是旅店老板瑞尼的话，我可能在哪儿？嗯？哦，也许在恐惧之末旅店中。是的，是那儿，我敢肯定。试着去布瑞尔的东南角……你认为自己能找到他吗？"] = "Now if I were Innkeeper Renee where might I be?  Hmmm?  Oh, perhaps inside the Gallows' End Tavern.  Yes, that's it, I'm sure of it.  Try the southeast end of Brill... think you can find that?",
    ["如果耶尔玛克认为你有能耐的话，他会教你配制药水的。去暗巷区中心的商店找他吧。"] = "Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag.",
    ["如果要孵化出我们的龙的话，我们必须集中精力！"] = "We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!",
    ["如果这就是你来此的目的，我们会尽一切可能训练你，帮助你成为真正的牧师。"] = "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.",
    ["如果雷瑟和树荫旅店被烧毁的事有某种联系的话，你就得找到他，问个清楚。$b$b我派了奥格隆去追他，应该是朝东南方向去了。去跟奥格隆会合，然后一起去找雷瑟吧。"] = "If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him.$b$bI sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe.",
    ["如此近距离地接近异种虫类而不被察觉需要相当的技巧。如果可能的话，我不建议你做这样的尝试。"] = "It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed.  I don't recommend trying it if you can avoid it.  ",
    ["威尔海姆修士经常在闪金镇的锻冶场后面培训里瑞亚·杜拉克。你可能会从他那里学到一些圣骑士的知识。"] = "Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire.  You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him.",
    ["孩子，我看不出你具备战士的精神。我不会训练你这样的$c的。"] = "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.",
    ["它怎么样了？我喜欢皮革的味道；你不喜欢吗？"] = "How's it going? I love the smell of leather; don't you?",
    ["它是一项耗时，但是会很有收获的技能。与贸易区的阿斯坦娅谈谈或许你能学到一些有用的东西。"] = "A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman's Terrace and maybe you'll learn something useful.",
    ["安戈洛环形山在卡利姆多南部，位于塔纳利斯沙漠的西面。去寻找巨大的浮空石……它们是环形山入口的标志。但是要小心，那里可是很危险的，迅猛龙就在入口附近徘徊。"] = "Un'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance.",
    ["安戈洛这里的暴掠龙看起来与贫瘠之地的猛禽有关--非常聪明，十分灵活，还有一种行为的感觉或是守则。其中我所遇到的最伟大的是拉克维。他是我所见过的最危险的动物之一。在牛头人语，拉克维的意思是“锋利的爪子，”但那对他并不公平。$B$B如果你计划猎杀拉克维的话，千万不要低估他，但如果你决定要这样做，无论如何我都会帮你的。"] = "The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means 'sharp claw,' but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do.",
    ["安诺拉是唯一一个在技能上胜过我的人。你得去……奥达曼找她，学习更多知识。"] = "There is only one whose skills exceed my own. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman.",
    ["安静！你没听见主人在讲话吗？"] = "Be quiet!  Can't you see the master is speaking?",
    ["完成得很熟练！现在，让我们继续你的教育……"] = "Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education...",
    ["官方事宜只能送交达纳苏斯处理。你必须前往那儿去创建自己的公会。"] = "Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation.",
    ["宝贝，让我来教你一个简单的加法守则：“地精”+“工程学”=“万事通”。告诉你其它算法的家伙肯定数学不及格。"] = "Let me break down a little math for you: 'goblin' plus 'engineering' equals KNOW HOW, baby.  Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn't know how to add.",
    ["实际上我更倾向于传统医学……水蛭，蛆，锯骨……那类东西。你可以看到我们本地的草药医学训练师，法鲁萨，就站在布瑞尔的马厩的附近。"] = "Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill.",
    ["密林武器店的矮人武器管理人布里维夫可以教你如何使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器管理人吴平可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。  达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器管理人伊琳尼雅·月火  可以教你如何使用弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、法杖和投掷  武器。"] = "Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master right here at the Timberline Arms, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons.",
    ["对一个业余者来说……这还行！你的知识量已经跟我持平了。要是你想学习更多知识，就去幽暗城找乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。"] = "Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity.",
    ["对一个初学者来说还不坏！我猜给你看些东西也不会对我有什么损失……"] = "Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things...",
    ["对不起，但是我只训练潜行者。"] = "Sorry, but I only train rogues.",
    ["对任何人而言……包括我，这都是一个秘密！$B$B很高兴你找到了我——我没躲藏在树丛中或是岩石下，挺幸运的，是吧？"] = "It's a secret to everybody... including me!$B$BI'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?",
    ["对你来说，我的教学在这个阶段略显深奥了。要是你想学习有关药水的更多知识，就跟泰兰希尔谈谈。"] = "My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead.",
    ["对我们这些在月光林地塞纳里奥议会的人来说，雷姆洛斯神殿是个神圣的地方……所以请你的表现符合访客的身份。$B$B我想你不愿让我用弯刀杀死你，那就是了。"] = "The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is.",
    ["对我这样的工匠来说，制造的流程本身是很简单的。$B$B困难之处在于获得原料。如果你能为我取回一块完美的比斯巨兽的皮，我就能用它制作出一些强大的装备。"] = "It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.$B$BThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh.",
    ["对，我可以教你钓鱼。"] = "Yap, I can teach ye to fish.",
    ["将一枚硬币塞到首领手中，看看你会得到什么。我喜欢自己的工作。但是，如果我能设法让斯纳尔克重新分配给这个飞行点的话……那样就好了。但是我敢打赌，你到这儿来不是要帮我进行职业训练的，而是寻找地精飞艇前往幽暗城，对吧？那很好，因为它会停泊在我后面。如果你看见斯纳尔克，代我向他问好，行吗？"] = "Slip a little coin into the boss's hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port....well, I can't imagine it any better. But I'm betting that you aren't here about my business practices. You're looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that's great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?",
    ["尊重你的长辈同样也是尊重你的文化与人民，$c。而先祖硬币则是对遵循这样一条古老礼仪之道的人的赞许。$B$B在春节期间，你可以拜访许多长者，对他们表达你的尊敬。如果你这样做了，你将会得到先祖硬币。将这些硬币带回来，我会因你的勤奋而允许你从一些特殊的物品中选择一个作为奖励。"] = "To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the Coins of Ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.$B$BDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the Coins of Ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items.",
    ["小心一点，$c，我有一个为你准备的变形术……"] = "Watch where you're stepping, $c, because I have a polymorph spell with your name on it...",
    ["小心点，$g男孩:女孩;。主人能洞察一切……"] = "Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all...",
    ["小心点，陌生人。别在我们的镇子里惹事。"] = "Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town.",
    ["小心，$r。在这种要与那些能毁灭世界的东西来一场决战的时候，我们圣光兄弟会可远没有其他同胞那样和善。$B$B任何的慈悲与怜悯都会激怒科尔法克斯。$B$B现在，如果你没有事情找我或者其他圣光兄弟会成员的话，就赶紧离开这里吧，我们还有会议要继续。"] = "Watch your step, $r. We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong.$B$BWoe unto those that would anger Korfax.$B$BNow if you have no business with me or the other members of the Brotherhood, please leave so that we may continue our meeting. ",
    ["少说废话，认真听讲。"] = "Spend less time rattling and more time listening.",
    ["尘泥沼泽蕨墙村的格鲁克卡恩在卖指南书，你需要好好研究它来提高自己的技能！"] = "Balai Lok'Wein of Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh sells a manual that you will need to study in order to improve your skills!",
    ["尝尝樱桃馅饼吧，它会令你开怀大笑的。"] = "Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide.",
    ["就像其他人一样，我在开战初期就来帮助我的德鲁伊同胞。$B$B现在安其拉的大门已经打开，但我意识到许多工作还没有完成。因此我决定留在希利苏斯，尽我所能地帮助他们。"] = "I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.$B$BNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done.  I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n.  ",
    ["就在……另一批暗月储备物资中。取回属于你自己的那份，它们很快会被抢光的！"] = "Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve.  Come get yours before they're all gone!",
    ["尽情享受冬幕节吧！品尝来自烟林牧场的盛宴！"] = "Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil!  Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!",
    ["尽管我可以将覆盖着整个泰达希尔的草坪当作很好的床铺，但是工匠区中塞琳尼经营的旅馆对那些享受一下奢华生活的人来说再合适不过了。"] = "Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman's Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.",
    ["尽管黑海岸比泰达希尔更危险，但是很多渔夫都在此谋生。"] = "Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here.",
    ["居住于塞纳里奥区的德鲁伊一直在大德鲁伊鹿盔的领导下警惕地保卫着自然界。你可以在达那苏斯北部找到他和别的德鲁伊训练师。"] = "Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus.",
    ["居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一位炼金师或许能帮上忙。你为什么不去找他呢？"] = "There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help.  Why don't you go pay him a visit?",
    ["居住在铁炉堡密林武器店的矮人大师布里维夫可以教你使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  居住在铁炉堡密林武器店的侏儒武器大师比克斯可以教你使用弩、匕首和投掷武器。  居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳套、法杖和投掷武器。"] = "Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons.",
    ["居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可以教你使用单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可以教你使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。  居住在这儿的相貌丑陋的兽人塞尤克可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。"] = "Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master, is on da Thunder Bluff lower rise.  He teach one and two-handed maces, staves and guns.Archibald, da undead weapon master in da War Quarter of da Undercity, train good with crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms.Sayoc, da ugly orc right here, can teach da ways of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons mon.",
    ["居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可以教你使用单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。  站在我旁边的哈纳什可以教你使用弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有的投掷武器。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可以教你使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。"] = "Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master, is on Thunder Bluff's lower rise.  He can train one and two-handed maces, staves and guns.Hanashi, standing next to me here, can instruct in the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and all manner of thrown weapons.Archibald, the undead weapon master in the War Quarter of the Undercity, can teach the use of crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms.",
    ["山顶渔具店的卡尔·迷雾行者将为你指明如何实现内心平静的同时还能通过钓鱼为自己准备好下一餐。"] = "Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.",
    ["工程学能赋予你瓦解敌人的技能和知识！让我教你该如何做……"] = "Engineering will provide you with the skills and knowledge to dismantle your opponents! Let me show you how...",
    ["巨甲虫的能量所隐藏的秘密将引发科学界的一场大变革！"] = "The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!",
    ["巨石长者在燃烧平原的巨槌石顶部的一座山洞里。"] = "Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes.",
    ["巫妖王正试图要将他的存在传达给整个世界，让这个世界陷入恐慌与噩梦之中。绝对不能让这一切发生。"] = "The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur.",
    ["巴尔萨斯·裂石是一名剥皮师，他会教你如何剥皮的。去大熔炉北边的皮甲用品店找他吧。"] = "Balthus Stoneflayer is the one to see about Skinning.  If it can be skinned, he can teach ye how.  Just walk yerself over to Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["巴罗夫家族让我忙个不停。总有一些垃圾从那儿出来。"] = "The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there.",
    ["布兰度尔·铁锤就是你想找的人。你可以去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅找他。"] = "Brandur Ironhammer would be the one ye'd want to see.  Ye can find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge.",
    ["布料也可以。就我个人来说我更喜欢使用人皮。"] = "Cloth is okay. Personally I prefer to work with human skin.",
    ["布瑞尔镇没有银行，你得去幽暗城找找。在南方的洛丹伦废墟后面的电梯能带你去幽暗城。你可以问问幽暗城守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。"] = "We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that.  At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity.  Once there ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions.",
    ["布衣！？那不会帮你抵挡住好钢做成的武器的！哈，如果你确定你想当个裁缝的话到暗巷区的玛加尔布品店那儿去吧。"] = "Clothing!?  That won't help you against good steel!  Bah, if you're sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar's Cloth Goods in The Drag.",
    ["布隆克总是在敲敲打打，他擅长修理最为精密的机械。你应该到钢架补给站拜访他一趟。"] = "With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he's let a few of his own go if ye get me.  All the same he's still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices.  Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill's Depot.",
    ["希克瓦能在你需要的时候帮你照看宠物。去旅馆前面找她吧。"] = "Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn.",
    ["希利苏斯的灵魂召唤我们，$n。土地在哭泣，它有个悲惨的故事要告诉我们……"] = "The spirits of Silithus call out to us, $n.  The land weeps, for it has a woeful story to tell...",
    ["希尔瓦娜斯女王已经下令对艾泽拉斯的某些自然现象进行调查。她觉得能从艾泽拉斯神秘的历史中学到更多的知识。$B$B我不知道要如何才能学到这些知识，但是我完全相信她，因此我会尽力而为的。所有的生物看起来很相似，但是周围的环境对它们的影响是不容忽略的。$B$B我需要你帮我收集生物样本。"] = "Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.$B$BI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.$B$BI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.$B$BI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures..",
    ["希望你是来奥特兰克山谷作战的，$n。我们会竭尽所能，利用一切援助。"] = "I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $n.  We can use all o' the help that we can get.",
    ["希望你是来帮助我们从污染者手中夺回阿拉希盆地的，$n？"] = "I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers.  What do you say $n?",
    ["希达奈尔训练出许多卫戍，他们守卫着我们心爱的城市。我相信她会使你成为一名战士的。去城门附近的战士区找她吧。"] = "Sildinair has trained many of the Sentinels who guard our beloved city.  I am certain she can make a warrior out of the likes of you.  Seek her out at the Warrior's Terrace near the entrance to our city.",
    ["带着大地母亲的祝福，我们要开始了。"] = "With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin.",
    ["干得好！你对药剂的理解进展不错。"] = "Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely.",
    ["干得好！在你眼中闪动的光芒……我很熟悉，我年少时也跟你一样！让我看看能不能教你点什么。"] = "Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it's the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let's see if I can't teach you something.",
    ["年兽沉睡在月神湖底的深处，但你可以在湖东南岸，也就是靠近怒风兽穴的地方召唤它。你可以在那里找到特殊的烟花束发射器……$B$B在发射器那里使用你的烟花，年兽的爪牙就会出现。发射更多的烟花，大约三十组，或者朝它的爪牙投掷艾露恩的蜡烛，年兽就会醒来。"] = "Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...$B$BUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken.",
    ["年轻人，欢迎你来到雷霆崖。在这儿你能卸下负担，享受庇佑。我们欢迎所有的部落居民来到雷霆崖。$B$B我的朋友，灵魂都会来这个神圣的地方复活。尊敬他们吧，这也是尊敬你自己。"] = "Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.$B$BThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself.",
    ["年轻的$c，欢迎来到暗月马戏团！我们从世界各地收集到不少神奇的物品。啊，如果你能设法收集一套暗月卡片，就赶紧告诉我，因为主人……我是说我对这东西很感兴趣。"] = "Welcome to the Faire young one!   We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal.   Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master...I mean I would be keenly interested in them.",
    ["年轻的$c，靠近一点。我年轻的时候耳朵可好使了，但现在你必须大声说话我才能听到。"] = "Come closer, young one.  In my time I could hear the flutter of a prey's beating heart, but now you must speak up if you want your words heard.",
    ["年轻的流浪者，有比铁锤和熔炉更能使钢铁坚固的方法。想学学吗？"] = "There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer. Care to learn more?",
    ["并不是所有的被遗忘者都屈从于希尔瓦娜斯的意志，$N。我们中的某些人士被真正的力量驱动的--我们为自己赢得的力量。"] = "Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, $n. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves.",
    ["幽林长者在西瘟疫之地的哭泣之洞外面。"] = "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.",
    ["庞大的戈杜尼食人魔部落控制了菲拉斯森林的很大一块区域。他们的黑暗魔法已经渗透了周围的环境，从而直接对那里的其它生物造成了毁灭性的打击。$B$B如果你去菲拉斯的话，可得小心那些食人魔——他们非常肮脏，而且很多都会使用强大的黑暗魔法。"] = "The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.$B$BIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic. ",
    ["开阔你的视野，流浪者，我们马上开始。"] = "Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin.",
    ["异种虫看起来已经够可怕的了，可是和它们的其拉主人比起来，它们可以算是温顺的了。"] = "As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords.",
    ["强壮的身体和精神。没有比这更强大的组合了！去猎人大厅跟萨尔克·狂暴图腾找寻自己的命运吧。"] = "Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter's Hall.",
    ["当一个铁匠达到了你这样的专业水平的时候，我会提供给他们一个选择。$B$B虽然我并没有要求你必须做出选择，但我建议你最好还是做出抉择——毕竟，你想永远当一名新手吗？是大师级的铸甲师和武器铸造师给我们的军队提供补给，让我们赢得战争的胜利并获得荣耀！$B$B注意，$n，一旦你做出了决定并完成了指定的任务，就没有回头路了。一个人只能沿一条路走到底。"] = "When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.$B$BWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!$B$BBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path.",
    ["当人们进入城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店时，妮拉会向这些未来的顾客致敬。"] = "Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.",
    ["当你准备听我讲述故事的时候就告诉我。"] = "Notify me when you are ready to listen to the story.",
    ["当你在卡拉诺斯的时候，你可能会听到托格努斯在铁砧上敲打。然而，如果你还没有把耳朵里的蜡清理掉，那你为什么不到铁匠铺去看看呢？"] = "Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven't cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don't ye just have a look in the smithy.",
    ["当你把爱情信物交给城镇里的居民时，你可以收到各种礼物作为回报。一些礼物最好留起来用，另一些则最好放在一起做成一个大礼品包！$B$B去找匹德菲特为你喜欢的英雄投票吧。$B$B你可以在伯瓦尔、麦格尼或者泰兰德身边找到匹德菲特。"] = "When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande.",
    ["当你把爱情信物交给城镇里的居民时，你可以收到各种礼物作为回报。一些礼物最好留起来用，另一些则最好放在一起做成一个大礼品包！$B$B去找匹德菲特为你喜欢的英雄投票吧。$B$B你可以在凯恩、希尔瓦娜斯或者萨尔身边找到匹德菲特。"] = "When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall.",
    ["当你接受更多训练以后再回来找我。在那边的兰达尔·沃斯可以帮你。"] = "Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that.",
    ["当你没有医师来料理你的伤口时，急救知识可以救你的性命。我会请教工匠区的丹纳罗尔关于这门技艺的问题。"] = "When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen's Terrace for instruction on this skill.",
    ["当双足飞龙将你送达目的地之后，请好好款待它。愿你的祖先与你同在，$n。"] = "Treat the wind rider well as it takes you to your destination.  May your ancestors watch over you $n.",
    ["当坐在一个驭风者背上时，你就会发现它的力量和速度的确不是徒有虚名。"] = "When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned.",
    ["当心点，凡人。那些强大的生物就是在此地葬生的。"] = "Step carefully mortal.  You tread where mightier beings have met their fate.",
    ["当我从墓穴中爬出来后，我本以为我的家人会热烈地欢迎我。相反，他们把我从村里赶了出去，用一种我听不懂的语言高声尖叫着。"] = "When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand.",
    ["当我以叛国罪被放逐离开联盟过着流放的生活时，我的儿子泰兰还是个小孩。我呆在这儿就是为了看着他长大，让他成为一个可敬的人。$B$B正如我期望的那样，他接替我的位置，成为玛登霍尔德之王，但是命运是如此残酷，他加入了血色十字军的队伍。现在他成了十字军的高级统领，$r。"] = "My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.$B$BAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r.",
    ["当我们使用动物的皮革时我们必须热爱食物或带给我们的保护，我们给大地母亲以荣誉并尊敬动物。查尔·硬皮会教给你这些事情。你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷找到他。"] = "When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village.",
    ["当我们的盟友，也就是亡灵们，在遭受可怕苦难时候，我如果还在这里训练新手，这会让我感到良心不安。请找那边的克瑞谈谈；他目前能够帮你。"] = "I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now.",
    ["当我因为绑着这个大铁球而不能保护自己的时候，你会嘲笑我吗？"] = "Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?",
    ["当时机合适时，我会传授知识给你的……不是现在。你还得学习更多的知识！"] = "I will instruct you when the time is right... that time is not now. You have much more to learn first!",
    ["当暗月马戏团开始展览的时候，他们会出现在艾尔文森林。我们的帐篷将驻扎在闪金镇的南边！"] = "When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!",
    ["当洛洛尔不想撒掉他宝贵的酒或者弄脏他衣服的时候，我就被召唤而来。是的。汉瑟尔就是别人口中正义和痛苦的结合体。"] = "When Lolo doesn't wanna spill any o' his precious ale or get his lil' dress dirty, I'm called in. Yep. Ol' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil' bit o' justice an' a whole lotta pain.",
    ["当然的事情，$n。还有一个给你。"] = "Sure thing, $n. Here's another for you.",
    ["当然，$g先生:小姐;。我们曾是巴罗夫家里的仆人：现在那里被称作通灵学院。$B$B我那时是女仆的领班而卢森是主人巴罗夫的男管家。$B$B我们为巴罗夫家族工作了数十年，直到……$B$B<艾瓦哭了。>"] = "Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.$B$BI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.$B$BWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...$B$B<Eva weeps.>",
    ["当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有友善级别声望的冒险者需要上缴60个徽记以获得优秀的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴220个徽记。$B$B对于那些银色黎明尚不眷顾的冒险者来说，这个价格是非常之高的。"] = "Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn.",
    ["当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有尊敬级别声望的冒险者需要上缴40个徽记以获得优秀品质的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴150个徽记。$B$B我承认，这个价格即便是对尊敬级别的冒险者来说，也确实有些高了。"] = "Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn.",
    ["当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有崇拜级别声望的冒险者需要上缴12个徽记以获得优秀的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴54个徽记。$B$B只有在银色黎明眼中被崇拜的人，才能获得最大的折扣。"] = "Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias.$B$BThose exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts.",
    ["当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有崇敬级别声望的冒险者需要上缴14个徽记以获得优秀品质的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴90个徽记。$B$B这个价格对崇敬级别的冒险者来说，可是说是完全合理的！但最强大的物品仍然是高价的。"] = "Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.$B$BThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high.",
    ["当然，$n。你只需要先告诉我你想知道关于哪个声望等级的信息。"] = "Certainly, $n. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about.",
    ["当然，$n。看起来你是个值得信任的$r！我在一里开外就发现了……$B$B总之，说正经事。我需要一株灵根草才能制作视灵药剂。药剂所需的其它成分都是小菜一碟，但是灵根草就不是那么容易得到了。"] = "Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...$B$BAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get.",
    ["当然，当然。城镇中有一名采矿训练师。在旅馆旁西北角可以找到克鲁恩。"] = "Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn.",
    ["影牙城堡位于南部银松森林，就在焚木村的北面。"] = "Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village.",
    ["往上走去力量谷以西，去精神谷的黑石南小屋找皮菲瑞多谈谈。"] = "Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["很不幸，你还很年轻，无法在战歌峡谷中存活，$C。"] = "Unfortunately you are not yet strong enough to survive in Warsong Gulch, $c.",
    ["很久之前，在我的旅途之中，我遇到了一个人，他告诉我：“掌握它的使用方法，你就可以拥有它。”$B$B你觉得那是什么意思？那时我还不知道，而且现在我还是不知道，真的……"] = "A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, 'Master using it and you can have this.'$B$BWhat do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really...",
    ["很久以前——我们的种族经历了无数战乱和冲突，几乎到了灭绝的边缘。我们承受了太多灾难，$c。$B$B燃烧军团的进攻，恶魔之魂，巨龙军团的分裂，死亡之翼的崛起，我们的女王阿莱克丝塔萨受到龙喉氏族的奴役。$B$B经过种种磨难，我们拥有了不可动摇的意志——那是努力生存的大无畏力量。"] = "In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.$B$BThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.$B$BThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world.",
    ["很久以前，在篡位者称为创世之年代的时候，我的主人和他的同胞们统治着整个世界。是他们，是远古的神灵创造了一切。$B$B他们最终被那些称他们为缔造者的家伙推翻了。"] = "In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all.$B$BAnd it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers.",
    ["很多事情要做，很多事情要做！协会已经给了我们最后的期限，我们决不能超过这个期限！"] = "Lots to do, lots to do! The Union's given us deadlines and they're not the sort you want to miss!",
    ["很多人都试图追随着潜行者的脚步，但是只有暗夜精灵能真正被黑夜接受。如果你想在阴暗的道路上前行的话，就去塞纳里奥区找塞尤娜吧。"] = "There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave.",
    ["很好。从这些标本上再切下一块肉来。让我们看看你学到了什么，我们可以由此开始。"] = "Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there.",
    ["很好的尝试，但是在训练之前，你还需要进行更多的锻炼！回到战壕！"] = "Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! ",
    ["很好！你达到了要求的参数和规格。我可以为你做些什么吗？"] = "Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?",
    ["很好！我一直希望收个新学生。那么就让我们立刻开始吧！"] = "Excellent! I've been hopin' for a new student. Well, let's get started right away then!",
    ["很好！无论其他人怎么说，我想我对你的看法是正确的。哈哈！我是开玩笑的！好吧，开始上课……"] = "Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons...",
    ["很好，你已经证明了你自己！现在进入下一阶段的授课……"] = "Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction...",
    ["很好，开始学习裁缝吧。"] = "Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin.",
    ["很少有人能找到我……我能为你做什么吗？"] = "Very few seek me out... What may I do for you?",
    ["很快人们就会知道这座被诅咒的神殿背后的秘密，英雄。它将被载入史册，跟那些从扭曲虚空到艾泽拉斯的传说一起，被永远传诵。"] = "All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!",
    ["很愿意……只是让我再多回味一下这一刻。"] = "With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer.",
    ["很抱歉$g兄弟:姐妹;，但是在确定买主是暗矛部落的贵族之前，我不会将迅猛龙卖给他的。当你证明自己是部落贵族之后，我才会把迅猛龙卖给你。"] = "I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya.",
    ["很抱歉$g小伙子:姑娘;，但是你基础不足，我不能教你。但是别烦恼，跟我的学生洛特加斯谈谈，他会帮助你的。"] = "I'm sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don't have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don't fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he'll help ye out.",
    ["很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去奥特兰克山谷送死。"] = "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.",
    ["很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去战歌峡谷送死。"] = "I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.",
    ["很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去阿拉希盆地送死。"] = "I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.",
    ["很抱歉，$g小伙子:姑娘;，你还不够资格在我这儿求学。去找我的儿子 格鲁姆，他会收你做学生的。"] = "Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren't quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice.",
    ["很抱歉，$n，但是我可不在新手身上浪费时间。你得找一个跟自己技能相近的人。去达纳苏斯的工匠区找一个名叫米拉·法拉科纳的暗夜精灵。"] = "I'm sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
    ["很抱歉，如果你不是暴风城中的贵族，我是不会将马匹卖给你的。这些战马是最好的，我们当然不会当它们落入敌人之手。$B$B想要证明自己不是敌人，当然……你只需赢得暴风城的信任，我就可以跟你做买卖了。"] = "Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.",
    ["很抱歉，我已经没有什么可以教给你的了。如果你还想学的话，就去达纳苏斯的工匠区找泰龙尼斯吧。我听说他相当有才能。"] = "Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear.",
    ["很抱歉，我现在有些忙，我要为湖畔镇的弗纳·奥斯古打造马蹄。"] = "I'm sorry, I'm a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire. ",
    ["很抱歉，朋友，在布瑞尔没有你想要的东西。你得前往幽暗城。幽暗城位于布瑞尔以南的洛丹伦废墟下。在废墟后面搭乘电梯即可到达，去问问幽暗城守卫，他会为你指明方向的。"] = "Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill.  You'll have to head to the Undercity for that.  The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further.",
    ["很明显！居住在虫巢中的异种虫并不欢迎我们的到来。$B$B一切进展顺利，直到我们在雷戈虫巢中发现了一块雕文水晶。她象飞蛾扑火一般急切地抓起水晶，把脸凑上去，精神也变得恍惚起来。队友们都很担心她。我们以最快的速度将她带出了虫巢！"] = "It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.$B$BEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!",
    ["很荣幸再次看到你，$n。"] = "An honor to see you again, $n.",
    ["很难想象如此多的死亡和恐惧会汇集在那么小的一块地区中。在这些门后是一块充斥着混乱和毁灭的大陆。$B$B冒险者，你要非常小心谨慎才行。诅咒之地中到处都是可以让你丧命的强大生物。"] = "It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.$B$BWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you.",
    ["很高兴再次见到你，$n。"] = "It is good to see you again, $n.",
    ["很高兴再次见到你，$n医生。我看着你逐步成长，我敢说现在是你学习更高的绷带技能的时候啦。$B$B一旦你的技能得到提高，就回来找我，我会把我所知的一切都教给你的。"] = "It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.$B$BReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know.",
    ["很高兴再见到你，$n！我不知道我还可以坚持多久来创建这样一个店。现在，由于你对我的帮助，我会给你看一些你会感兴趣的东西！"] = "Well hello again, $n!  I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!",
    ["很高兴您问到这个问题。暗月马戏团奖券是我们鼓励大家帮助马戏团所推出的，您可以使用这些奖券来兑换特别的奖品！  首先您可以找克洛诺斯、克莉·希克斯和亚布·尼比盖尔谈谈来看看您有什么可以帮他们的。他们总是需要帮助。  当您有足够的奖券时，和吉瓦斯·格里加特谈谈，他有很多奖品可供选择。"] = "Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are our way of letting you help with the faire, and in return you can turn in your tickets for special prizes!To get started you'll want to talk to Chronos, Kerri Hicks, Ringling and Yebb Nebblegear to see who you can best help. They always have something that needs doing to improve and expand our attractions.Then when you have enough tickets, speak with Gelvas Grimegate and he will give you a list of prizes to choose from.",
    ["很高兴我能代表皇家药剂师学会为你提供最好的战马。这些战马与我们一样经历过考验和磨难，现在它们已经远胜于那些血肉之躯所铸成的战马了，它们更为强壮，更易恢复精力！好好看看它们吧。"] = "On behalf of the Royal Apothecary Society, I am pleased to offer you the finest steeds available for the Forsaken.  These beasts have endured trials and tribulations as we all have, and now they too have emerged stronger and more resilient than mere mortal flesh would have had them destined to be!  Please, inspect them for yourself and see.",
    ["很高兴有技师能勇敢地制作这个装置。我们地精工程师对于危险只会抱以大笑！"] = "It's good to see an engineer brave enough to make the device.   We goblin engineers laugh at danger!",
    ["很高兴看到又有人在斯坦索姆城中和亡灵天灾抗战，在这里他们的力量是最强大的。$B$B，你好。我是奥里克斯。我曾经是银手骑士团的一名骑兵，但是跟其他信念发生动摇的骑兵一样……我堕落了。亡灵天灾诱惑了我，差点使我成为一名死亡骑士！$B$B最终，我感觉到自己的危险处境，我逃到了这个教堂。这是个神圣的地方，第一个圣骑士光明使者乌瑟尔就是在这里成为银手骑士团的首领的。"] = "It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.$B$BGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!$B$BFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand.",
    ["很高兴能将你收入麾下。让我们开始吧。"] = "I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin.",
    ["很高兴见到你，$C。我想你是为安其拉一战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B部落和联盟必须携手对抗安其拉异种虫类大军和它们的主使者。在铁炉堡的军事区，我们正在收集原料制造战争物资，收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"] = "Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?",
    ["很高兴见到你，$C。我想你是为安其拉之战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B联盟和部落需要同仇敌忾，共同对抗安其拉异种虫类和它们的首脑。我们在铁炉堡的军事区收集原料以制造各种战争物资，这些收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？"] = "Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?",
    ["很高兴见到你，$c。除非你和我的女主人玛加萨之间有直接交易关系，否则别找我说话。$B$B我帮她处理大部分的事务，让她能集中精力处理更重要的事情。或许在你拜见她之前我们可以谈谈。"] = "Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.$B$BI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?",
    ["很高兴见到你，朋友。我是军官加鲁什，是银色黎明这一世界性组织的成员。我们的任务是毫不留情地消灭艾泽拉斯大陆上所有邪恶的势力。银色黎明不是一个政治机构，我们也不愿意成为政府机构。我们的目标很简单，我们将部落和联盟都看作自己的朋友——以铲除邪恶为目标的朋友！$B$B我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，为了黎明而战！"] = "Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!",
    ["很高兴遇到你，渔夫！如果你想要在钓鱼比赛中一展自己的钓鱼技能，那么就听好了！在本周日，荆棘谷将举办一场钓鱼大赛，选出一名真正的钓鱼大师！"] = "Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!",
    ["很高兴遇见你，$n。要做的事情还很多，我们必须抓紧时间。"] = "Well met, $n. We must be brief because there is much to do.",
    ["德鲁伊们说大自然把部落从卡利姆多赶出去只是个时间问题。然而堕落继续在我们的大地上蔓延，甚至在泰达希尔这里也是。"] = "The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil.",
    ["德鲁伊对世界上所有生物的生存状况都非常敏感。当我们知道这些鸟处于危险之中时，便设立了一套营救系统，防止它们遭受菲拉斯的堕落气息的影响。$B$B一个名叫克格尔·曲藤的侏儒负责这项工作，她收集鸟蛋并将其交给我照顾。$B$B我们总是在寻求更多的帮助，$n。或许你该前往加基森找克格尔谈一谈。"] = "Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.$B$BA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.$B$BWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle.",
    ["德鲁伊的生活方式跟萨满相差无几。根妮亚·符文图腾正在对此进行研究。去血蹄村东面的大营帐中找她吧。"] = "The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman.  Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge.  Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.",
    ["德鲁伊训练师卡尔通常待在多兰纳尔的月亮井。我想他可以对你进行训练。"] = "The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require.",
    ["德鲁伊？我没看到过任何德鲁伊。不过在暴风城中有一块属于暗夜精灵的区域。"] = "Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own.",
    ["必须使用源质对重生之瓶进行加固。我只知道这种矿物的一种原料：位于这个世界核心中的元素领域。$B$B塑地者对这种东西的了解比我多得多。你必须找到塑地者！"] = "The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.$B$BThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!",
    ["必须杀死雷矛卫兵！准备在奥特兰克山谷开战，准备好了吗，$c?"] = "The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed!  Ready for Alterac Valley $c?",
    ["必须首先学习一些基础知识。蒂安娜就站在旁边，找她谈谈然后回来找我。"] = "There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later.",
    ["快动手吧，肮脏的$r。$B$B<卡兰低下头，露出他粗壮的的脖子。>"] = "Get it over with you filthy $r.$B$B<Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>",
    ["快来吧！到这儿来买热辣烤鸡翅！"] = "Step right up!  Get your red hot wings right here!",
    ["快来吧，听说艾泽拉斯最盛大的集会——暗月马戏团开张啦！哈哈！"] = "Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire!  Huzzah!",
    ["快点离开，市民。没有什么好看的。"] = "Move along, citizen. There is nothing to see here.",
    ["怎么了，$g小伙子:姑娘;？我能帮你什么忙吗？"] = "Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?",
    ["怎么玩？！$B$B世界各地的旅店老板都会将糖果分发给孩子们，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，南海镇的哈特曼中士需要帮助，他想要攻击那些被遗忘者，破坏他们的稻草人庆典。$B$B对了，我听说暴风城孤儿院里有个生病的小男孩，他想找人陪他玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏……或许你能帮帮他？"] = "What ISN'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, Sergeant Hartman in Southshore needs help against the Forsaken and their Wickerman Festival.$B$BOne more thing - I've heard that a sick little boy at the orphanage in Stormwind is looking for someone to help him gather treats for the holiday.",
    ["怎么玩？！$B$B世界各地的旅店老板都会将糖果分发给孩子们，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，幽暗城外还会在夜间举办稻草人庆典。$B$B对了，我听说奥格瑞玛孤儿院里有个生病的小女孩，她想找人陪她玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏……或许你能帮帮她？"] = "What ISN'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, there is the Wickerman Festival just outside the Undercity during the evenings.$B$BOne more thing - I've heard that a sick little girl at the orphanage here in Orgrimmar is looking for someone to help her gather treats for the holiday... maybe you could help her out?",
    ["怎么进去的？？嗯，这故事真长。"] = "How?? Well, it's a long story.",
    ["怒焰裂谷位于奥格瑞玛中心的暗影裂口。"] = "Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar.",
    ["急救是一种有价值的技能。我们的常住的培训师，尼莎·火石，会教你该怎么做。到大熔炉南边的铁炉堡医师协会可以找到她。"] = "A valuable skill First Aid is.  Our resident trainer, Nissa Firestone, can show ye how it's done.  Look for her on the southern side of The Great Forge at the Ironforge Physician.",
    ["急救是一项很有用的技能。在战斗中，它常常能救人一命。如果你想要学习这项技能的话，就去灵魂高地的“精神治疗”小店里面找找潘德·缚石，他可是这方面最好的训练师。"] = "First Aid is always a nice skill to have.  Many a time during battle has it saved my hide.  Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise.  Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well.",
    ["急救虽然不能代替牧师的治疗，但是它在紧要关头却很方便。我建议你去跟雷酒酿制厂的萨姆诺谈谈，并力所能及地学习一些东西。"] = "First Aid may not make up for a priest's healing, but it's handy in a pinch.  I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can.",
    ["急救？但你看起来不象受伤的样子。如果你真的对学习急救有兴趣，那么就去找尼莎·火石。到铁炉堡医师协会去，就在大熔炉旁边。"] = "First Aid?  Well ye don't look hurt to me.  If yer really interested in learning First Aid, then Nissa Firestone is the one to learn from.  Go see her over by The Great Forge in her shop, The Ironforge Physician.",
    ["恐怕你在奥特兰克山谷中活不了多久，$C。等你更加强大一些再回来吧。"] = "I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt.",
    ["恐怕你得离开我了，朋友！你该去找奥格瑞玛的诺格，他将带你进入下一阶段!"] = "I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!",
    ["恐怕你给我的份额太低了，我可不愿跟你废话了。请走吧。"] = "I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please.",
    ["恐怕我已不再是个文雅谦逊的人了。年龄和无数战争让我的皮肤和灵魂变得坚硬无比。或许这就是凯恩派我来烈日石居的原因……和煦的暖风和温暖的阳光无法减轻我的痛苦。"] = "I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain.",
    ["恐怖图腾长者在菲拉斯的拉瑞斯小厅那里。"] = "You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas.",
    ["您好，$c，欢迎来到暗月马戏团。在马戏团可以做的事儿数不甚数，第一次来的客人可能会觉得有些不知所措。这就是我在这里帮忙的原因。您有什么问题吗？"] = "Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?",
    ["您好，尊贵的$c。我这个塞纳里奥议会的谦卑的仆从愿祝福与您同在。"] = "Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours.",
    ["想买蟑螂吗？"] = "Wanna buy a cockroach?",
    ["想到这些可怜的亡灵灵魂的遭遇，我感到非常悲伤。你可以去灵魂高地之下的预见之池附近找大法师山姆。"] = "Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.",
    ["想学习如何使用新武器？去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什吧。"] = "Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor.",
    ["想找迅影兄弟会的申苏尔，是吗？去暗巷区，过了杜佛斯回收店之后就可以找到通往暗影裂口的通道。"] = "Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh?  In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow.",
    ["想看看我出售的货物吗？"] = "Can I show you what I have for sale?",
    ["想要乘坐狮鹫，是吗？你得去找格莱斯·瑟登。  你可以在铁炉堡中心的大锻炉东边找到他。"] = "Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye?  Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that.  Ye can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge.",
    ["想要加入我们的行列？萨尔克·狂暴图腾可以指引你，他就在猎手大厅里。"] = "Aspiring to join our ranks one day?  Sark Ragetotem can help you on your way.  He's in the Hunter's Hall.",
    ["想要当厨师？到城镇南部的幽暗城去接受培训。你可以到洛丹伦废墟后面找到下行的电梯。当你到达后向那些笨拙的幽暗城守卫寻求更多帮助。"] = "Fancy yourself a chef?  Head to the Undercity south of town for your training.  You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive.",
    ["想要成为一名铁匠？想要锻造出最好的武器？我可以帮你，希望你能对这门手艺投入最大的热情。"] = "Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it.",
    ["想要找到鲁瑟兰村的渡船，你得先去达纳苏斯，通过传送门进入鲁瑟兰村。"] = "To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.",
    ["想要接受训练？我可以把你训练成暴风城最好的战士，但是守卫是不能这么做的。我想你得去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店，找些合适的人来对你进行训练。"] = "Looking for some training, eh? I could train you better then anyone in Stormwind but the guard prohibits it. I guess you will have to settle for one of those has beens hanging out around the Barracks or at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.",
    ["想让你的恶魔变得更强大吗？这需要花钱的，但是你来对地方啦。"] = "Want to make your demons more powerful?  It'll cost you, but you've come to the right place.",
    ["想飞往某处？你得去幽暗城才行！沿着城镇南面的道路走，然后往西南方前进，到达洛丹伦废墟。你可以乘坐废墟后面的电梯到幽暗城，问问幽暗城守卫，获取更详细的指示。"] = "Somewhere to fly to?  You'll need to go to the Undercity for that!  Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron.  You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.",
    ["感谢你的帮助，$C。不幸的是，你的经验不够丰富，无法承受阿拉希盆地的险恶环境。"] = "Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin.",
    ["愿你们的长者祝福你，$n，祝你明年万事顺意，心想事成。"] = "May your elders bless you, $n, and bring you luck in the coming year.",
    ["愿光明保佑你。"] = "May the Light protect you this day.",
    ["愿圣光与你同在，$c。我能帮上忙吗？"] = "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?",
    ["愿圣光与你同在，$n。我能为你做什么吗？"] = "I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?",
    ["愿圣光保佑你，$c。"] = "The Light protect you, $c.",
    ["愿夜之祝福永远与你同在，我的朋友！我是艾蒂尔·月火，我是灰谷银翼哨兵部队的军需官。随着你在银翼哨兵中的声望不断提升，我可以为你提供一些可在战歌峡谷中使用的商品。如果你需要修理装备的话，我也可以提供这样的服务。"] = "May the blessings of the night be yours, friend!  I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale.  As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.",
    ["愿月神与你同在，$c。月亮神殿已经来帮助奥伯丁饱受煎熬的公民了。"] = "May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine.",
    ["愿灵魂与你同在。"] = "May the spirits be with you.",
    ["愿灵魂保佑你。"] = "May da spirits protect you mon.",
    ["我……我真的不知道自己是怎么到那儿的……$B$B我依稀记得用的是……木筏……$B$B"] = "I... I'm not really sure how I got here...$B$BI seem to remember traveling... a raft...$B$B",
    ["我一个小时以后还要去值班，但在那之前……干杯！"] = "I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!",
    ["我一直在盼着你呢，$n。我们在阿拉希盆地的战斗需要你的帮助，你准备好了吗？"] = "I've been expecting you $n.  Are you ready to assist us in Arathi Basin?",
    ["我一直在研究在大城市间通过地下通道运送石油的方法，但是每个人都认为我是在做白日梦。"] = "I've been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it's a pipe dream.",
    ["我不会伤害你的。我在监视野猪人并记录他们的活动。我的人民注意到了某些奇怪的事情——黑暗的弥漫——从这个地区来的。我是来调查的，而我的发现很令人不安。$B$B似乎有一个很善于奥术的亡灵外交官。我不相信他也是被遗忘者……我认为事态更坏了。"] = "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c.",
    ["我不会伤害你的。我在监视野猪人并记录他们的活动。我的人民注意到了某些奇怪的事情——黑暗的弥漫——从这个地区来的。我是来调查的，而我的发现很令人不安。$B$B似乎有一个很善于奥术的亡灵外交官。我不相信他也是被遗忘者……我认为更坏。"] = "I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.$B$BThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse.",
    ["我不会因为你想学钓鱼而责怪你的。莫高雷有卡利姆多大陆上最好的钓鱼胜地，而在山顶渔具店中，你可以找到钓鱼所需的一切装备。  告诉卡尔·迷雾行者是我让你去的！"] = "Don't blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you'll need to take advantage of it.Tell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!",
    ["我不会给一个学徒训练。去贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴找牛头人瓦多尔吧，他会帮助你的。"] = "I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need.",
    ["我不会训练一点水平都没有的铁匠，等你觉得自己达到我的要求之后再回来找我。"] = "I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me.",
    ["我不具备你想学的知识。"] = "I do not have the knowledge you seek.",
    ["我不是为了荣耀而来这里的，$n。我来这里是为了兽人的骄傲。$B$B如果我没有拒绝贝尔戈洛姆的提议，那我肯定现在还在奥格瑞玛料理真正的生意。$B$B他对女人的渴望在杜隆塔尔的女性战士中尽人皆知，但是那仍然没有影响他成为大众情人。$B$B很幸运他并没有骚扰我太长时间——否则他会被砍成肉酱的。"] = "I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc's pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands.",
    ["我不是来教那些刚离开摇篮的宝宝的。你离我对学生的要求还差远了。你不过是个年幼的$g小伙子:姑娘;，你最好别在这儿烦我了。"] = "I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me.",
    ["我不知道他们是怎么做到的……这些邮箱一定是传送门之类的东西。为什么人们整天都聚集在银行旁边的邮箱那儿，从小小的邮箱中不断地取出剑、盾牌和各种护甲！"] = "I don't know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!",
    ["我不知道他们给那些酒桶里放了什么，但闻起来很香甜！"] = "I don't know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!",
    ["我不知道你为什么想要离开这阳光灿烂的沙滩和蓝色晶莹的水域。这里就象是天堂。但是不要告诉我的哥哥萨匹塔这些，他整天被困在提瑞斯法已经够难过的了。这里的地精飞艇目的地是奥格瑞玛，所以你不用担心得听他发牢骚。但是如果你到了提瑞斯法，要留意我的警告并且不要让他开始抱怨。"] = "Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It's like paradise down here. But don't tell my brother Zapetta that, he's bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn't have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don't get him started.",
    ["我不能为你提供更多的训练啦：你的制革技能已经超过我啦。你应该去那儿找犹纳谈谈。如果需要的话我会为你担保的。"] = "I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be.",
    ["我不能再教你什么啦。但是，我父亲的知识远胜于我。进去跟他谈谈。祝你好运！"] = "I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!",
    ["我不能再教你啦：你所掌握的技能已经超过我了。去雷霆崖中央平原西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳吧。她会为你提供更多训练的。"] = "I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She offers more advanced training.",
    ["我不能对你进行什么指导啦，你能用铁锤和铁砧做出如此令人称奇的东西。我建议你去找一个名叫布里克·基克拉夫的地精，你可别告诉别人,我最后一次听说他在藏宝海湾经营一家商店。"] = "I can't say enough about yer work, truly amazing things that ye can do with a hammer and an anvil. Now, don't be tellin anyone that I suggested ye go find a goblin to teach ye but that's exactly what I'm gonna do. Brikk Keencraft is his name, and last I heard he was operating a shop down in Booty Bay.",
    ["我不能帮助你！你会遇到比我更精于此道的人！你是联盟的人，你得跟暴风城的利廉姆·火轴谈谈。"] = "I can't help ya'! You're ready to see someone who's been at it longer than I have! Let's see... you're an Alliance type, so you need to talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in Stormwind.",
    ["我不能教牛头人骑乘迅猛龙。"] = "I cannot be teachin' a Tauren to ride a Raptor.",
    ["我不能训练你。"] = "I can not train you.",
    ["我不能训练你。你必须去找你的职业训练师。"] = "I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer.",
    ["我不能训练你这样的$c。"] = "I cannot train a $c such as yourself.",
    ["我不能训练你，$c。"] = "I can not train you, $c.",
    ["我不能训练你，年轻人。"] = "I can not train you, young one.",
    ["我不认为你具有掌握传送门魔法所必需的潜质。"] = "I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic.",
    ["我不训练你这样的$c。在你惹恼我之前找你自己的训练师吧。"] = "I don't train your kind $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me.",
    ["我从不拒绝那些已经准备好跟我一同训练的人。不幸的是，你不是！你还像个小孩！"] = "I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!",
    ["我从南边到十字路口来寻求帮助，$c，但是那些胆怯的家伙都不愿意伸出援手——就连强大的索克也污辱我。他是一名很好的领导者，但是他拒绝了我的请求，这让我感到非常恼怒。$B$B他声称我的愤怒令我变得鲁莽——妨碍我的正常判断——但是我一定要复仇！"] = "I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.$B$BHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!",
    ["我从铁炉堡来到这里协助进行重建工作。我希望能向你传授尽可能多的本领，然后我就能回家去，把这堆事情丢给你来做。"] = "I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home.",
    ["我以你所能接受的形态站在你面前。显然，你无法接受一条名叫瓦拉塔兹的龙。$B$B<维埃兰笑了起来。>$B$B我可以继续吗？"] = "Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.$B$B<Vaelan laughs.>$B$BShall I continue?",
    ["我以前曾有幸看到在凯拉·风刃作战，因此我相信她可以好好训练你。到多兰纳尔旅店去找她吧。"] = "I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["我以前曾经追寻过墓光之锤的道路。为了找到复活上古之神的方法，我只身深入这座巢穴，想要找到从那个该死的恶魔阿库麦尔身上抽取能量的方法。$B$B在看到无数无辜人白白地牺牲之后，我慢慢恢复了理智。$B$B我被困住了一段时间，但是现在我自由了！不幸的是，这里离我的家乡卡兹莫丹太远了！$B$B勇敢的冒险者，我现在可以将你传送到一个特别的地方，然后回来干掉阿库麦尔。如果你愿意的话，我现在就送你到达纳苏斯去。"] = "I once followed the ways of the Twilight's Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku'mai!$b$bAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.$b$bI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!$b$bBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus.",
    ["我们一直欢迎你的到来，就像我们欢迎平原上吹过的风。"] = "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.",
    ["我们不是刚从燃烧军团魔掌中逃脱吗，现在你却又跟恶魔纠缠不清了？去地下洞穴暗影裂口寻找暗火营地。在暗巷区中有一条地道通往那儿。"] = "Didn't we just break free of the Burning Legion, and here you are messing with demons again?  Seek out the Darkfire Enclave in the underground cavern known as the Cleft of Shadow.  You'll find a tunnel down into it from The Drag.",
    ["我们不知道。$B$B活下来的黑铁矮人们躲入深山，并开始重建他们的城市。$B$B索瑞森的废墟上又出现了黑石塔和新的黑铁王国。他们在灼热峡谷内建立了新的防御工事，就在众所周知的大熔炉地区。$B$B一个关于远古邪恶力量控制黑铁王国的故事开始流传。"] = "We do not know.$B$BThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.$B$BFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.$B$BStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate. ",
    ["我们不能剥下人类及其联盟的皮，这真糟糕。这些皮都白白浪费掉了。尽管如此，谁想穿着你由此制造出的质地极差的皮革？"] = "Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?",
    ["我们代表的是黑暗，永恒而无形。"] = "We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible.",
    ["我们使用动物皮毛制作物品。"] = "We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. ",
    ["我们可不能惹恼了他。他发起火来就没有节制啦。"] = "We mustn't anger the Master. His is a wrath that is cruel beyond measure.",
    ["我们可以从死去的动物身上获得原料。别无视它们的牺牲，$n。带着尊敬来处理这些皮革。"] = "Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves.",
    ["我们可能遇到了旱季，但是供给并不缺乏！想看看我的货物吗？"] = "We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?",
    ["我们和联盟并肩作战，共同进退，$r。一个古老的邪恶力量正在准备将我们全部吞噬，首先是卡利姆多，然后是整个艾泽拉斯。这股邪恶是如此地古老，我们都已经忘记了它的存在。驱动它的力量的源泉，乃是对于造物之神泰坦以及一切由泰坦创造的事物的仇恨。$B$B我们是唯一能阻挡克苏恩的力量。我们要先发制人，击溃安其拉的虫人。让艾泽拉斯在部落和联盟的力量面前震撼吧。$B$B战备工作需要你的帮助！"] = "We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.$B$BThe war effort needs you!",
    ["我们团结一致，为共同的目标而努力，$R。来自上古的邪灵威胁着卡利姆多，他妄图让整个世界陷入无尽的堕落……他仇视生命的缔造者——永恒的泰坦所创造的一切生物。$B$B我们是惟一能与克苏恩的大军抗衡的军队。如果我们不振作起来同仇敌忾的话，敌人一定会摧毁一切。$B$B为我们的作战物资储备尽自己的力吧！"] = "We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.$B$BThe war effort needs you!",
    ["我们在世界各地散发暗月卡片，看看有没有谁能集齐四套暗月卡片中的任何一套。若你设法集齐八张一套的卡片，我们就会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片，可作为饰品或是暗月马戏团的纪念。"] = "We have seeded Darkmoon Cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the four suits.    If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the Greater Darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire.",
    ["我们在奥特兰克山谷的军队需要运用谋略获胜，$c。你看起来是个不错的领导者。"] = "Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them.",
    ["我们在此繁衍生息，生生死死，数年来大地却亘古不动。因此，这片土地并不属于我们，$n。我们是属于大地的。因此，我们守护着它，没有它我们就无法生存。"] = "We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive.",
    ["我们在艾萨拉度过的这段日子并不是辉煌而又灿烂的，但是我们仍然年轻而且热血沸腾——我们最终会获得胜利，这只是一个时间问题。"] = "The days we've spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time.",
    ["我们对于树荫旅店被焚烧以及詹姆斯·海厄尔的妻子和孩子没能及时逃脱这些事情了解得并不多。$B$B我们想要找到詹姆斯的尸体，但是他却根本不在那堆废墟中。$B$B我们有一些线索，但是证据仍然很缺乏。我们希望能通过卫兵和塞拉摩人民的帮助让这件惨案得以大白天下。$B$B如果你也想帮忙的话，可以到贫瘠之地的边境那里调查一下旅店的废墟。"] = "We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.$b$bWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.$b$bWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.$b$bIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens.",
    ["我们已经收集到$2018w块铜锭、$2005w块锡锭和$2008w块秘银锭，而总的需求量是$1998w、$2006w和$2009w。"] = "Of the $1998w copper bars that we'll need, we have $2018w. The number for tin bar collections sits at $2005w out of $2006w needed. And, there have been $2008w of $2009w mithril bars smelted for the cause.",
    ["我们已经收集到了$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。"] = "On the cooked goods front it would appear that we've managed to collect and store away $2092w rainbow fin albacore, out of $2093w requested. Additionally, right now we have in $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail in cold storage.",
    ["我们已经用亡灵天灾的瘟疫反攻他们了，但是我们撑不了多久了！去摧毁他们的锅炉吧！"] = "We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!",
    ["我们当然欢迎多兰纳尔的厨师再多几个，但我并不是说扎瑞恩厨艺欠佳。你为什么不去找这个厨师看看他能教你什么？"] = "We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don't you go see what he can teach you?",
    ["我们彼此都在浪费时间！如果你想接受训练的话，就去找格拉哈姆·范·塔伦吧！他就站在右边。"] = "This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there.",
    ["我们得看看其拉虫人到底给这些怪物吃的是什么！看看它们的个头！"] = "We've gotta find out what the Qiraji are feeding those monsters! Look at the size of 'em!",
    ["我们必须不惜一切代价保护这个营地的安全，$c！我们不能允许敌人再前进一步了！"] = "We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it.",
    ["我们成功了，$G小伙子:姑娘;！联盟和部落已经集齐了安其拉一战所需的所有物资。现在这些物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预计将在$2113w天内达到。然后，会有一位勇敢的英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时，战争也就开始了！"] = "We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and all of it will arrive within $2113w days. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!",
    ["我们所处的这个时期就像风云般变化无常，$c。要谨记这世上什么才是真实而长久的，并好好保存它。其余的事物都毫无用处。"] = "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
    ["我们新近发现，马戏团中随处可见的蒸汽车控制台能操纵这些被称为蒸汽车的迷你坦克，我可是很慷慨地跟你分享这一信息。$B$B你只需激活控制台就行了。每辆坦克都配备了常用的弹药和某种秘密武器，向你的敌人开火吧！$B$B和朋友一起参加史诗般的战斗、巡逻、或者仅仅是进行野蛮的破坏……一切都由你自己选择！"] = "Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.$B$BAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!$B$BHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!",
    ["我们是整个暴风城中唯一提供鲜花的地方。你可以在我们店里购买到各种美丽的花儿。"] = "We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion.",
    ["我们有自己的职责，$c。对部落应尽的职责。"] = "We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde.",
    ["我们正控制着亡灵天灾——瘟疫至少还会侵扰它们一整天时间！但是我们得对此有足够的把握，因此你要尽可能地破坏锅炉。"] = "We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.",
    ["我们没有浪费狩猎而得的动物的任何一部分。"] = "No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. ",
    ["我们的主人玛法里奥还在沉睡中，$c。他是我们的指路明灯，我们必须竭尽全力保护他。"] = "Our master Malfurion remains lost in the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.",
    ["我们的大篷车队会往前线运送物资，每天两次。要是不能帮助负责运送的迪迪尔和他的骡子清理掉路上骚扰的天灾士兵的话，我就得挨罚了。那可是我所见过的最疯狂的事。看来我们得像英雄那样冒险保护货物了。"] = "Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments...",
    ["我们的工作就是保持平衡，如同塞纳留斯所教给我们的一样，$c。他就是指引我们前进的明灯，而我们必须竭尽所能保护它的光芒。"] = "We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.",
    ["我们的惩罚也是我们的祝福。"] = "Our punishment is also our blessing.",
    ["我们的炼金师名叫卡罗莱·安尼斯。她居住在布瑞尔镇西北角的房屋中。"] = "Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise.  You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill.",
    ["我们的祖先教诲说，集体的力量胜过个人的力量。你想要加入公会为了雷霆崖的荣誉而战吗？"] = "Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers.  Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?",
    ["我们种植蔬菜。野兔吃我们的蔬菜。狼群以野兔为食。我们捕杀狼群，从它们身上获得肉和兽皮。这就是神奇的生物链，或许你用别的什么词语来描述它。  去塞纳里奥区找泰龙尼斯吧，我得继续执行自己的职责了。"] = "We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse.  It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  Now go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties.",
    ["我们终于来了！暗月马戏团现在开始展出！一定要来看看艾泽拉斯大陆各种千奇百怪的东西！"] = "It's here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!",
    ["我们绝不能让联盟在阿拉希扩张势力！既便是小小的避难谷地，在将来也可能对我们形成威胁。"] = "We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi!  Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us.",
    ["我们美丽的岛屿迎来了新的一天。"] = "Another lovely day on our beautiful island.",
    ["我们肉体的死亡标志着我们灵魂和神圣使命的重生。"] = "The death of our flesh marked the birth of our spirit and our sacred task.",
    ["我们脚下的洞穴中有许多奇异的兽皮，如果你想深入其中探险的话，一定要非常小心，$n。要记住你自己的性命比那些兽皮有价值得多。"] = "The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable.",
    ["我们赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉来自此地，因为我们不能对威胁整个世界的危机视而不见。$B$B我们的远征队首领莫托尔带领我们来到荆棘谷海岸以北的尤亚姆巴岛，招募勇敢的英雄深入古老的巨魔城市……祖尔格拉布。"] = "We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.$B$BThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub.",
    ["我们选择了离开黑石深渊的保护出来探险……呃，我是说……嗯，我们这么做是对的，我们要探索整个世界。"] = "We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that's right, EXPLORE the world.",
    ["我们都亲眼目睹了无数可怕的灾难，但是我们不能由此绝望。$B$B记住这些往事，总有一天，我们会进行报复的。"] = "We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.$B$BInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning.",
    ["我们都因为不同的原因来到了这里，$c。$B$B<莱因笑了笑。>$B$B我来到这里是为了帮助陶土议会的雷布拉特。他有个很趣的理论，据说能净化这片土地。"] = "We are all drawn here for different reasons, $c.$B$B<Rayne smiles.>$B$BI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands.",
    ["我们都是大自然的孩子，所以你到花园区的月亮井那边去吧。"] = "A child of nature are we? Then you need look no further then the moonwell in the Park.",
    ["我们针对天灾军团的第一步战役进行得非常良好。我们已经获得了一些胜利，希望我的协助能让你取得更多的胜利。"] = "The first steps of our fight against the Scourge go well. We have had some successes, and hopefully my assistance can aid you in bringing future success to the battle.",
    ["我们陷入生存危机。我们陷入困境，寻找答案，希望在黑暗中闪闪发光。$B$B那时，$n，就是我们迈向自由的第一步。"] = "There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.$B$BOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom.",
    ["我会喂养它们的，孩子。达瑞尔·瑞克努索，愿为你服务。"] = "I keep 'em fed, kid. Yep, Daryl Riknussun, at yer service.",
    ["我会将我所知道的传授给你的。"] = "I will teach you what I can.",
    ["我会尽我所能教你。每一节课都是女神亲自给你的礼物。正确使用她的礼物，你就会无往不胜。"] = "I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter.",
    ["我会尽量保证哨兵岭物资供给的，要维持这项行动可不容易。"] = "I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that's not easy with all the action we see.",
    ["我会教你锤系专精之道。你只需要恭恭敬敬地问我就可以了。"] = "I will teach you the way of the hammersmith. Just ask nicely.",
    ["我会用我的鲜血来保证这座银行的安全，你觉得很放心吧？"] = "I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?",
    ["我估计获得这样一件东西的概率是百万分之一！一件让你终身受用的兽皮！即使是技艺最高超的工匠也不一定能剥出一张完美的皮来！"] = "I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered.",
    ["我做梦了，$n……对，我做梦了。在梦中，我以上千种不同的方式死去。有人会认为这是噩梦，但我不这样想！在梦中，我在战场上死去。每次死亡之前我都会让一万名部落的敌人倒在我的脚下。这是无上的荣耀！"] = "I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!",
    ["我兄弟说我们能在这条商贸路线上赚到更多的钱的，但是他没告诉我要独自应对。要是你乘坐地精飞艇沿着这条路返回的话，你能帮我带点吃的吗？在奥格瑞玛，有人出售最好的肉类，当然我还能以那些苟延残喘的动物为食的。"] = "My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving.",
    ["我准备出发了，$n。我需要一些帮助——你愿意跟我来吗？"] = "I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?",
    ["我出售各种神秘的货物，陌生人。"] = "Mystical goods and commodities is my business, stranger.",
    ["我出售山谷这一边最好的布料和皮革服饰！"] = "I sell the finest cloth and leather garb this side of the valley!",
    ["我出售的每项物品都是我自己的劳动所得。我向你保证。"] = "Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity.",
    ["我刚刚完成了一个新的空间爆破器，它可以让我变成最最富有的技师，我做梦都不曾想过的富有！我所需要的就是找到一个熟练的地精技师，让$g他:她;来制作一个空间撕裂器，然后将两者连接起来！"] = "I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams!   All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it! ",
    ["我刚刚得到最新的消息。似乎我们已经收集到$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。"] = "I received an update on that just a moment ago. It looks like out of $2061w light leather needed, we have $2060w. As for the others, the report indicated that we've gathered $2063w of $2064w medium leather, and $2069w out of our $2071w thick leather quota.",
    ["我刚得到消息说，我们已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。"] = "I just received word on that. We currently have $2021w out of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom, and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotus herbs requested.",
    ["我制造药剂的技能在你之下。你应该与那边的安尼希尔谈谈。她会明白你需要进一步的培训。"] = "My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction.",
    ["我单挑50个兽人？我可不是傻子，$n。我爸爸常说“卑鄙是卑鄙者的通行证”这类的话，我突然之间就明白了那是什么意思。"] = "Me versus fifty orcs? I'm no fool, $n. My pappy always told me, 'Discreditin is the better part of a cracker,' or something, and I knew what that meant.",
    ["我历尽艰辛才将这些无价之宝带来此地销售，你知道吗？来看看吧。"] = "Have you any idea what I go through to bring these incomparable valuables to sell?  Come see them all for yourself!",
    ["我原本不想告诉你的：如果你能够穿过荒芜之地的话，那么你也许可以找到通往灼热峡谷的另外一条路。$B$B没错，我说的是荒芜之地。在卡加斯营地那里，兽人铺了一条通向灼热峡谷的小路。你说说他们有多蠢吧！那帮家伙居然造了一条通向地狱的道路？他们到底在想什么啊？"] = "I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.$B$BYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?",
    ["我发现了地穴恶魔身上的甲壳以及其它部位的多种用途。我想我能利用这些碎片，配合纳克萨玛斯内的一些被污染的魔法护甲碎片，制成某种极轻而且实用的护甲套装来。"] = "I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.",
    ["我发誓……如果奎恩提斯胆敢再乱栽食虫花，我就马上把他的树给砍了。"] = "I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I'm going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword.",
    ["我只教那些掌握基本指示的学生。你必须在达纳苏斯工匠区找到暗夜精灵达丽亚娜。她的技能与你的是完美的互补。"] = "I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours.",
    ["我只是个学生。雷安诺才是专家。她站在那边的箱子旁。你可以从她那儿学到很多东西。"] = "I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her.",
    ["我只知道有一个人能在裁缝技能上胜过我。我最后一次听说他在塞拉摩岛。你该去找他。"] = "There's only one person I know of who is more learned in the art of tailoring than myself. Last I heard he could be found in Theramore Isle. He is the person you should seek.",
    ["我只跟那些被奥格瑞玛的兽人当朋友的人做生意。证明自己吧，然后再来和我谈那些强大的座狼。"] = "I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.",
    ["我可以为你做什么?"] = "Wot kin I do fer ye?",
    ["我可以为你做什么吗，$c？"] = "What can I do for you $c?",
    ["我可以为你效劳吗?"] = "What kin I do for ya, mon?",
    ["我可以为你效劳吗，$n？"] = "What kin I do for ye, $n?",
    ["我可以利用在这儿找到的材料制作有趣的东西。这些山林中有许多奇怪的生物！去杀死它们，$n。"] = "I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales.",
    ["我可以告诉你你想知道的一切，但是你必须要有耐心。去练习打铁吧，摸索用锤的力度。当你熟练后，自然也就掌握啦。"] = "I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand.",
    ["我可以喝点东西，稍事休息。到剃刀岭西北角，替我向旅店管理人罗斯克问声好。"] = "I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You'll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me.",
    ["我可以教你一些钓鱼技能。"] = "I can teach you fishing skills.",
    ["我可以教你如何烹饪！"] = "I can teach you how to cook!",
    ["我可以教你急救技能。"] = "I can train you in First Aid techniques.",
    ["我可以教你操纵机械陆行鸟的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Mechanostrider Piloting, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑山羊的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Ram Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑狼的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Wolf Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑科多兽的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Kodo Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑豹的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Tiger Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑迅猛龙的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Raptor Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可以教你骑骸骨战马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！"] = "I can teach you the finer points of Skeletal Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!",
    ["我可没时间停下来。"] = "I have no time for interruptions.",
    ["我可没时间跟小孩子耗！去跟我的助手阿斯拉谈谈！"] = "I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar! ",
    ["我可没时间闲谈，我是个专业人士！"] = "I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!",
    ["我可没法教你战斗时如何保持优雅姿态，我只能教你如何使用武器。"] = "The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons.",
    ["我名叫蒙提，老鼠是我的玩物。"] = "Monty be me name an' rats be me game.",
    ["我向要塞提供各种施法所需的碎片和其它炼金材料。"] = "I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents.",
    ["我听到他来了！朝西看！"] = "I think I hear him coming!  Look to the west!",
    ["我听格瑞诺尔说他曾经钓起过一柄剑。或者那是一条旗鱼？这该死的格瑞诺尔，他对我讲了太多的关于鱼的故事，我都分不清了。嗯，你干嘛不去荒弃的洞穴找他，让他告诉你那究竟是什么呢……"] = "I once heard ol' Grimnur say he fished up a sword.  Or was it a swordfish?  Damn that Grimnur, he's told so many fish tales I can't remember which is which.  Well, why don't you go see him over in The Forlorn Cavern and have him tell you what it was.",
    ["我听说下一场比赛的时候他们要把地精的车炸掉！不管是真是假，我会待在安全的地方。"] = "I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome's car in the next race!  True or not, I'd stand clear of their pit area.",
    ["我听说北方的雷霆崖有个矿工训练师。沿着村外的道路前进，然后乘坐电梯到达山顶。任何一名雷霆崖守卫都能帮助你。"] = "I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there.",
    ["我听说居住在激流堡的德尼布·沃克有一本书，这本书一定能帮助你提高急救技能。"] = "I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.",
    ["我听说幽暗城中有个矿工训练师。离开城镇往南走，穿过洛丹伦废墟，你就能到那儿了。然后乘坐电梯下到幽暗城，去询问幽暗城守卫，你应该能获取更多指示信息。"] = "I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity.  All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions.",
    ["我听说新型的极速6000型很快就要开下生产线了。我几乎不能抑制激动的心情！"] = "I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!",
    ["我听说暴风城中有个矮人因狩猎技巧高超而闻名。或许你可以找他问问看。"] = "I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you.",
    ["我听说杜隆塔尔的采矿业极为发达。我们在剃刀岭有一个采矿训练师，你可以去城镇西北角的大熔炉附近寻找克鲁恩。"] = "Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear.  So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill.  You'll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town.",
    ["我听说森金村的巨魔中有个名叫米奥赞的药剂师。去那儿找他吧。"] = "I hear that the trolls in Sen'jin Village have a potion maker named Miao'zan.  Look there.",
    ["我听说水元素中的贵族海达克希斯发动了对火元素的战争。真希望他战败！"] = "I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let's hope he loses!",
    ["我听说铁炉堡中有家由精通炼金术的侏儒所经营的商店。你该去看看。"] = "I hear there's a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look.",
    ["我听过对水禽的评价，据说它们可以通过一个管子一样的东西吃东西。"] = "I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube.",
    ["我告诉你，掌握那种魔法可不是什么好事。我不知道为什么他们会允许吉姆瑞兹在雷酒酿制厂外面安营扎寨！离他远点！"] = "That kind of magic is just bad news, I tell ye.  I don't know why that Grimrizz has been allowed to set up outside the Thunderbrew Distillery of all places!  You stay away from him, you here!",
    ["我和我的同伴正在收集我们所知的致命物质，并在敌人身上测试它们的效果。一旦我收集齐备，我将制造出这世界前所未有的瘟疫。"] = "My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen.",
    ["我和碎手都向你致敬，$c。$B$B别这么惊讶，$n。连奥格瑞玛最高的地方也会有阴影——一定有什么东西隐藏在那儿。碎手欣然接受了那项任务。萨尔也承认要确保兽人和巨魔的安全，他是不可缺少的。$B$B但是你到这儿来不是谈论我的事儿吧，你一定另有目的。"] = "I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else.",
    ["我喜欢机会；你不喜欢吗？啊，当然你也喜欢。这就是你要按我说的去做的原因。"] = "I love a good challenge; don't you? Aye, of course ye do. An' that's why you're about to do exactly what I say.",
    ["我喜欢馅饼。"] = "I love pie.",
    ["我在听，我在听，但是听不见卡恩所说的那些灵魂的声音。"] = "I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. ",
    ["我在找人，$c。请不要打扰我……这对我很重要。"] = "I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them.",
    ["我在火山口游荡了许久，后来我想起曾有人告诉我……“继续往前，到山上去。”这个声音在我的脑海中出现。$B$B听了这话之后我就来到了这里，$n！"] = "When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... 'Go up, up the mountain ahead,' said the voice in my head.$B$BListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!",
    ["我在这片平原上生活了很多很多年，我捕猎过许多凶猛的野兽，从来没有失败过……直到我遇见了鬼嚎。$B$B很久以前，这只巨狼曾经是牛头人的盟友，还和燃烧军团英勇作战。不过后来它被一个恶魔所伤，身上的伤口一直没有治愈。最后……这道伤口把它逼疯了。$B$B现在它总是痛苦地在平原上游荡，寻找终止它的痛苦的方法。我很惭愧，因为我无力把他杀掉……"] = "I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.$B$BLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.$B$BNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him...",
    ["我多想和你一起加入伟大的战斗，但是我不得不待在这里值勤。去奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的勇者大厅找卡尔特拉·血喉，她将会帮助你进入奥特兰克山谷。为部落带来荣耀，$n！"] = "How I yearn to join you in glorious battle, but instead I am stuck here on duty. Go to the Hall of the Brave in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor and speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. She will help you get to Alterac Valley. Make us proud $n!",
    ["我太忙了，根本没有时间来陪你玩什么游戏， $r。有事就说，没事就从我眼前消失！"] = "I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!",
    ["我对暗夜精灵的了解有限，但是据说很早以前——当暗夜精灵还掌握着神秘法术时——艾萨拉便是其中的佼佼者，她年轻美貌，是暗夜精灵的女王。不幸地是，正是她对魔法的痴迷才导致历史上最具破坏性事件的发生。"] = "My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world's history.",
    ["我对裁缝业知之甚少，但你需要更多的帮助。我听说有个暗夜精灵精通裁缝技术。他居住在暴风城的魔法区。"] = "I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. ",
    ["我对这片森林非常熟悉，它们就像我身体的一部分……但是它们还蕴藏着很多值得学习的知识，当然也有很多危险。"] = "I know these forests as if they were a part of me... but know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden.",
    ["我对魔法知之甚少，但是在狮王之傲有一个名叫扎尔迪玛的法师，他也许能帮助你。"] = "I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you.",
    ["我就是你所说的财主，$R。"] = "I'm what you call a capitalist, $r.",
    ["我就站在你旁边，笨蛋。我知道你在找什么。"] = "I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek.",
    ["我已经了解到很多关于时尚的东西。现在那不过就是掌握制革技巧罢了。西蒙能帮助学习制革的。"] = "I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them.",
    ["我已经把钱压在地精身上了！如果你够聪明的话也应该赌地精获胜！"] = "My money's on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!",
    ["我已经没什么可教你了。带着大地之母的祝福离开吧。在雷霆崖的中央高原西北方的商店找到牛头人塔恩。愿你得到他智慧的指引。"] = "You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom.",
    ["我已经用多年学会了很多药剂知识，$n，而那些知识都由你支配。你只需提要求就可以。"] = "I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask.",
    ["我已经观测到有四种植物受到了腐蚀术的影响：轻歌花、迎风花、鞭根草和夜龙植物。轻歌花和迎风花是费伍德森林中常见的植物，而鞭根草和夜龙植物就不那么常见了。所有这些都是费伍德森林生态系统的重要组成部分。"] = "I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem.",
    ["我希望你千里迢迢来到大煅炉不只是为了取暖。$g小伙子:小姑娘;，我能帮你什么忙吗？"] = "I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up $g lad : lass;, tell me what it is I can do for ye?",
    ["我希望你是因为好事才打断我的，我正在做一些重要的工作。"] = "I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work.",
    ["我希望有一天能用敌人的骨头制作武器。"] = "I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies.",
    ["我希望组建队伍。当然，我更希望扩大队伍！"] = "I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!",
    ["我希望能……$B$B<雷布拉特干咳了几声。>$B$B抱歉，老毛病了。我是陶土议会的雷布拉特。"] = "I've been expec...$B$B<Rimblat coughs.>$B$BExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. ",
    ["我希望雪融化掉。它总是把我的长袍弄湿，把一切都搞得乱糟糟的！"] = "I wish the snow would just all melt away. It's always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!",
    ["我应该寻求某些帮助；我不喜欢整天坐在这儿卖鱼。我更愿意去钓鱼，然后再卖掉。"] = "I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies.",
    ["我建议你去教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找一找。"] = "I would suggest looking in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square.",
    ["我建议你最好不要坐得靠近阴影。"] = "Take my advice, don't sit close to the shadows.",
    ["我当然也不这么认为。但雷布拉特似乎已经证实了新的生命可以在这种破碎的土地上成长。现在我们的工作就是保持这种成长的可持续性，以及，最重要的，供应维持这种生长的养分。$B$B当然，既然我已经在这里了，我也会提供一些服务，帮助冒险者们进入纳克萨玛斯。"] = "I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.$B$BWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas.",
    ["我当然是来传达酋长的命令的。我是部落的。"] = "I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde.",
    ["我很少有访客。你在寻找某种特殊的东西，是吗？"] = "I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?",
    ["我很忙，$n。告诉伍特去处理一切。那个年轻人整天都焦虑不安的。他大部分时间都处于这种状态，像是要做些什么。"] = "I'm busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something.",
    ["我很惊讶一个如此粗心的人竟然能走到这里……$B$B是的，你可能还有一个符咒，但是玛艾里对你的行为很生气！$B$B现在赶紧离开。"] = "Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. ",
    ["我很抱歉，$n，但是我不给新手提供培训。你应该找达纳苏斯工匠区的米拉·法拉科纳谈谈。她可以帮你弥补损失的时间。"] = "My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time.",
    ["我很珍惜我们之间的友谊，但是让我们面对现实吧：你对药水的了解比我多。要是你想得到训练的话，就找亡灵马尔什医生谈谈。他居住在幽暗城的炼金房。"] = "I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",
    ["我很荣幸能够传授给你知识，$n。看得出来你用得不错。"] = "I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well.",
    ["我很高兴再见到你，$n。你的帮助为我们保证了补给线的安全。我希望你可以理解在如此一场大战中，物资补给的重要性。"] = "It's a pleasure to see you again, $n.  Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines.  I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this.",
    ["我很高兴能在你事业开始的时候帮上忙，！让我们抓紧纺纱机，开始吧……"] = "I would be delighted to aid you in the commencement of your pursuit! Let me grab my spinner and we'll get started...",
    ["我得到的最后的消息称，部落已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。"] = "Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses.",
    ["我必须承认，藏宝海湾有南海最好的杂烩蚌肉。哦，对烹饪不感兴趣？那么欢迎你投宿少女之爱号——在东部王国和卡里姆多之间航行的最好的客船。很快她将驰往棘齿城，在她到达之前好好享受吧。"] = "I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.",
    ["我忙吗？这话什么意思？你觉得我只是成天站在这儿玩弄手指吗？如果你想买些什么的话，跟罕杜尔谈谈。"] = "Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor.",
    ["我忙死了，不会跟陌生人讲话的！几乎从来不……"] = "I'm never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway...",
    ["我怎么能把我的秘密告诉一个初学者呢？先试着跟博文谈谈。"] = "How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first.",
    ["我恐怕在我可以教授你知识之前你要需要更多的训练。"] = "You'll need more training before I can share my knowledge with you, I'm afraid. ",
    ["我想之前西蒙尼找过你，$n。你跟她谈过了吗？"] = "I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?",
    ["我想问你，$c：$B在泰坦创造的守护巨龙中，是谁后来变成了被称作死亡之翼的邪恶生物？"] = "My question to you is this, $c:$BWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?",
    ["我感觉一场动乱潜伏在你周围……"] = "I sense a disturbance, lurking around you...",
    ["我感觉到处都是阴谋。还有那些对我所做的事情缺乏理解的家伙，他们想要把我关起来！$B$B你最好不要牵扯进来。"] = "Conspiracies abound, I say.  There are those who lack vision in understanding what I do, and would seek to keep me shackled to obscurity!$B$BDon't step in the dirt.",
    ["我感觉好多了，别担心我。我要在这间房间里进行净化仪式，在那之后我自然会设法离开的。这儿被邪恶的魔法力量污染了，$n。"] = "I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me.  I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room.  Foul magic taints this place, $n.",
    ["我愿意教你！要让我的姐姐看看她不是唯一了解工程学的人……"] = "I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering...",
    ["我愿意用萨弗隆战锤的设计图换取一块萨弗隆铁锭。$B$B现在，你大概正在暗自盘算吧，“我要那种战锤来做什么，我现有的装备比这东西高级多了！”$B$B嗯，让我告诉你吧，$g先生:女士;，没有什么武器比萨弗隆战锤更高级了！"] = "In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.$B$BNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, 'What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?'$B$BWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain't nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!",
    ["我憋了一肚子的火，别让我朝你发火。"] = "I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe.",
    ["我所有的作品都必须由买主亲自来订购。奥尔文常常要我改变这个习惯，但是我就是不改。看看你周围吧，无数战士还指望我给他们打造装甲呢。"] = "All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor.",
    ["我所犯下的错误……多么可怕的错误……$B$B，<塔希斯的声音呜咽了起来。>"] = "The things I have done... such horrible things...$B$B<Tarsis begins to sob.>",
    ["我打赌科瑞恩·塞尔留斯知道你在寻找什么东西。她通常在狮王之傲旅店里。"] = "I'd wager Keryn Sylvius knows the type you're looking for. The company Keryn keeps is less than honorable. She usually hangs out in the Lion's Pride Inn.",
    ["我找不到我的宠物青蛙加布加布啦。她爱喝黑铁啤酒，她总是喝这种酒，但是这种酒很不容易得到的！现在我没有黑铁啤酒了……加布加布一定是自己跑出去找酒喝啦！$B$B真希望她回到我身边……"] = "I can't find my pet frog, Jubjub.  She loves Dark Iron Ale, it's all she ever drinks, but can be so hard to get!  Now I'm out... and Jubjub must have run away to find more!$B$BI wish she would come back...",
    ["我担心对有你这样经验的人没什么可教的。但是你还有其他方法。去找那边柜台后面的鲁坎·考迪尔谈谈。他会指引你通过旅行的下一个阶段。"] = "I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey.",
    ["我按照传统一代代地训练、指导年轻猎人。"] = "I train and guide young hunters in the traditions passed down many generations.",
    ["我教不了你，$n。去找塔雷·浆泡；她是一个侏儒，住在铁炉堡的侏儒区。哦，既然你反正要去，请把我的爱带给卡利。"] = "Ye're beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love.",
    ["我敢打赌洁塞塔会很乐意教你学习新法术的。她就在狮王之傲旅店的房间内。"] = "I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn.",
    ["我敢肯定在达纳苏斯有一个裁缝可以对你进行训练。当你到了那里之后，就向达纳苏斯的某个哨兵询问一下裁缝住在哪里吧。"] = "I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor.",
    ["我无法训练你。你该去找$c训练者。"] = "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.",
    ["我是一个从事药学的兽人，$r。如果你是来学习的，我会尽我最大的努力教你。"] = "I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach.",
    ["我是一名上层精灵，$r。虽然这个词语现在已经不能代表什么了，但很久以前，这个世界曾被上层精灵所统治。一万年过去了……"] = "I am Highborne, $r. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past...",
    ["我是克拉索克，这些工匠的监工。"] = "I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen.",
    ["我是全知者阿塔比姆，拉斯塔哈的特使。$B$B我通常只和牧师、法师和术士打交道。"] = "I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.$B$BMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks.",
    ["我是基尔拉姆，斧系大师。"] = "I am Kilram, master of the axe.",
    ["我是大工匠欧沃斯巴克，现代侏儒工程学领域的顶级设计师。我的工作就是用我们的闪亮崭新的扳手确保新的发明能够付诸实施！$B$B要是你碰巧懂得制造消除辐射污染的装置，那你算是来对地方啦……"] = "I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!$B$BAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now...",
    ["我是最后的大赢家……他们会看到的！啊，你好啊，$c，我刚才没看到你。"] = "I'll get the last laugh... they'll see! Oh, hi $c, I didn't see you there.",
    ["我是联军的指挥官。我是惩戒之拳。我的职责就是扫清其拉虫人的势力。你敢挑衅酋长的权威吗？你敢直面我无情的审判吗？"] = "I am he that watches they. I am the fist of retribution. That which does quell the recalcitrant. Dare you defy the Warchief? Dare you face my merciless judgement?",
    ["我是赞达拉的赞扎。我以灵体形态从赞达拉赶来帮助我的人民。哈卡不能控制我的灵魂。$B$B我是来帮助那些曾经有恩于赞达拉的朋友的。"] = "I am Zanza, a Loa of Zandalar. I have come in this ethereal form from Zandalar to help my people. Hakkar has no dominion over my soul.$B$BI help those that have helped the Zandalarian people.",
    ["我是这座城市的官员，从事幽暗城的人口普查工作。自从我们从亡灵天灾中解脱出来以后，我们就尽力对我们的城市人口做出精确的记录。通过一些奥术方式和聪明的方法，我才得以弄到这些记录。如果你需要有事找我的话，请继续。你应该知道你是否有事需要我的帮助。"] = "I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate.",
    ["我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的污染者物资供应商卢瑟弗·图恩。随着你在污染者中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。"] = "I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.",
    ["我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的阿拉索联军物资供应商萨缪尔·霍克。随着你在阿拉索联军中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。"] = "I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.",
    ["我曾见到一个名叫劳迪克的巨魔在暗矛海滩南部钓鱼，就在森金村的外围。"] = "I've seen a troll named Lau'Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That's just on the outskirts of Sen'jin Village.",
    ["我最不愿放弃的就是在这样的日子里到开阔的大草原上……但是，我的职责所在不容许我那样做。"] = "What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but, my duty binds me.",
    ["我最近在这里附近遭遇过一些迪菲亚潜行者，但米歇尔·贝利帮我进行了治疗。到狮王之傲与她商量一下，看看她能否教你。"] = "I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well.  Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you.",
    ["我有很多要做的……在瘟疫来之前有很多……"] = "I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes...",
    ["我有许多处方可供选择，我还可以为你打折！"] = "I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!",
    ["我有许多知识可以让你大开眼界，$c。你必须学会带着荣耀去狩猎。"] = "I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor.",
    ["我永远都不能再触摸石头了。我永远都无法再体会钢铁的荣誉了……"] = "I am forever denied the touch of stone.  I will never again know the glory of shaped iron...",
    ["我没什么可以教你的了。我听说藏宝海湾有个名叫海明威的老头，他在出售《鲈鱼与你》这本书，它对你提高钓鱼技能大有帮助。"] = "Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'.  That is sure to help you increase your skill.",
    ["我没有东西可传授给你了。要是你想进一步学习制皮技能，就找卡洛雷克交谈。"] = "I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills.",
    ["我没有什么东西可以教你了，现在你可以走了。不要想接近萨鲁，因为像你一样卑微的家伙，他只会用你们的血来炼钢。"] = "There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don't even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel.",
    ["我没有什么可以教你的啦！如果有人比我知道得多……等等，有啦！去加基森找巴兹克·布拉斯温吧。"] = "I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!",
    ["我没有什么可教你的了。但是，我听说有位名叫安尼希尔的暗夜精灵也许能教你。她居住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。"] = "There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
    ["我没有可传授给你的知识了。穿过拱门走下斜坡到东南方，找赫伯特·哈尔希医生谈谈。他是个被遗忘者，他能教给你更加高级的技术。"] = "I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques.",
    ["我没有时间浪费在像你这样的人身上$c。"] = "I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.",
    ["我没有选择，至少我是这么认为的。我会忍受索瑞森的毁灭并与我的国王和同胞站在一起。$B$B在拉格纳罗斯的统治下，达格兰·索瑞森国王开凿了山脉的中央，并建立了黑石塔。我们不知疲倦地工作着，发誓要建立一座比以前的任何城市或堡垒都要坚固的矮人城堡……甚至将来也不会有能与之媲美的建筑。"] = "I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.$B$BUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after.",
    ["我活着就是为了为国王服务。"] = "I live only to serve our King.",
    ["我活着的目的就是为主人服务。"] = "I live only to serve the master.",
    ["我父亲告诉我：有一天，会有一个陌生人跟我交谈，我必须控制住自己，不能杀了$g他:她;。"] = "My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.",
    ["我父亲被大熔炉中的恶棍杀害了。我恳求暴风城给予援助，但是他们根本没有理睬。不仅如此，他们甚至不愿意承认这个地区的存在，更不要说派遣军队来匡扶正义了。$B$B我要报仇，$c。这世界上还有比这更强烈的理由吗？"] = "My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.$B$BI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?",
    ["我独自走在路上，为了捍卫荣誉和清除这片大陆上的敌人而战。$B$B我能为你做什么，$n？"] = "I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.$B$BWhat can I do for you, $n?",
    ["我猜想你到这儿来是训练如何使用新武器的？快点，我很忙的！"] = "I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon?  Make it fast, I'm very busy!",
    ["我猜想你最初的训练就是挖掘到幽暗城。嗨，明白吗？挖掘……没关系。要到幽暗城，你先要到布瑞尔南面的洛丹伦废墟后方，然后乘电梯下去。向那里的一位幽暗城守卫寻求更多的帮助。"] = "I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity.  Heh, get it?  Mine... nevermind.  To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down.  Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance.",
    ["我猜想那些小鬼在偷学知识。"] = "I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge.",
    ["我猜有人在战斗结束后需要帮我们这些战士包扎伤口。到精神谷的灵魂小屋旁边的适者生存小屋找阿诺克。往上走去力量谷的西边找到一个湖。那就是他呆的地方。"] = "I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake.  That's where he's at.",
    ["我猜那些灵魂更加喜欢你，我还没有听到他们的召唤但是你看起来已经上过他们好多课程了。去找卡恩谈谈，他会很高兴看到一个像他一样听到它们声音的人。"] = "I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does.",
    ["我生前是一名图书管理员，与战争和灾难无缘。我从未想过要变成现在这样。另一方面，现在我能主宰自己，我是不会不战而降的。"] = "Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight.",
    ["我用祖先传下来的方法训练猎人。"] = "I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors.",
    ["我的$g兄弟:姐妹;帮帮我吧……$B$B我很快就将离开这个世界了，虽然我饱受苦楚，但是我知道死了之后所有痛苦都将解除。但是，那些野生生物，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;……也历经折磨，永无止境。在我生命的最后一刻，我请求你的帮助。"] = "Please, help me $g brother : sister;...$B$BI will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass.  The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release.  I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.",
    ["我的二十英尺高的火鸡烤肉架的计划快要完成了！现在我需要的就是一只二十英尺高的火鸡了……"] = "The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey...",
    ["我的双足飞龙可以在贫瘠之地高速飞翔。"] = "My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air.",
    ["我的大部分武器都来自战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火。要是你想学习如何使用新武器，就去找她吧。"] = "I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon.  ",
    ["我的头衔可能有会让人误解我。与我相处久了，你就会知道我其实是一个很好相处的人。"] = "The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me.",
    ["我的头衔是废物管理专家。"] = "My job title is Waste Management Specialist.",
    ["我的孩子，你学得很好。去幽暗城找一个名叫詹姆斯·范·布朗特的铁匠。他能传授给你更多的知识。我想他应该在战士训练大厅附近铸造武器。"] = "You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor.",
    ["我的孩子，我能为你做什么？"] = "What can I do for you my child?",
    ["我的家人过去在北山伐木场工作，那里现在被称作西瘟疫之地。他们曾忠于杜马家族，而现在血色十字军把一切连同壁炉谷全都占领了！$B$B在把那些狂热分子从艾泽拉斯驱逐出去之前，我是不会停止行动的。"] = "My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth.",
    ["我的家族数代都从事附魔工作。我在很小的时候就学会了这项技能，就像我儿子现在在做的一样。"] = "Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now.",
    ["我的才能有限，你也已经达到了。恭喜你，$n。你的下一站应该是菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地。牛头人哈拉纳·铁皮住在那里；她的技术很有声望。"] = "Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill.",
    ["我的数据分析师认为这次我们会比上次的纪录提高二十秒！"] = "My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!",
    ["我的斧头经历过多场战事，我喜欢将它带在身边。敌人曾数次入侵我们的首都，但是别怕：我们总能击退他们。"] = "My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back.",
    ["我的旋转诱饵在哪儿？我刚刚还把它放在这附近的……"] = "Where's my spinner? I just had it here somewhere...",
    ["我的时间不多了……我们的时间都不多了……"] = "Time is running out for me... for us all...",
    ["我的时间不多了，但是圣光依然照耀着这个世界，它可以帮助我完成我的宿命。当你面对瑞文戴尔男爵时，我便与你同在。"] = "I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you.",
    ["我的智慧就是你的智慧，我的知识也一样。我能为你做什么，$n？"] = "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?",
    ["我的灵魂终于自由了。"] = "At last, my soul is free!",
    ["我的知识有限，尽管我还在继续学习。现在该你继续了，旅行者。在幽暗城找到乔瑟夫·格里高利并告诉他你准备好了。"] = "My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready.",
    ["我的自责、羞愧、懊悔和悲伤全都刻在这块纯金石板上。不幸的是，暮光之锤找到了石板，并认定我是诅咒者。我被立即处死，而那时我对艾露恩的祷告还没有做完。现在我已经成为了一个游荡的幽灵，无法降入扭曲虚空；我被关在笼子里，用来警告那些试图背叛暮光之锤的人。"] = "Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer.",
    ["我目前对你的进步感到很满意。很显然大地母亲已经赋予你的双手以灵感了。"] = "I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands.",
    ["我相信圣光会与你同在，$n。我能帮忙吗？"] = "I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?",
    ["我相信奥德文·拉弗林仍是暴风城的常驻公会注册员。当你进入暴风城的贸易区后，你的左手边就是他的居所。"] = "I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind.",
    ["我看上去像是有时间和你闲谈的样子吗？"] = "Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?",
    ["我看上去像是那种闲得可以招待每个旅行者的人吗？快点告诉我你需要什么，我可没有时间和你慢慢磨蹭。"] = "Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick.",
    ["我看见一些有趣的人在港口进进出出。小心，$n。你永远不清楚谁值得信任以及跟这儿发生的所有事情的缘由……"] = "I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here...",
    ["我看起来像什么，附魔师普巴尔？你的技能还需要附魔大师的指导！去阿祖拉之塔找基塔·费温德。"] = "What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora.",
    ["我真不敢相信自己的眼睛，这简直是个奇迹！一千年来，除了那些肮脏的其拉虫人和异种虫类，我都不曾见过有活人进入这些房间。"] = "I bear witness to a miracle that stands before me! In one thousand years of captivity, I have not seen a single LIVING specimen - other than those foul Qiraji and silithid - enter these chambers.",
    ["我真希望有更多像你一样的学生。很少有人会冒险深入敌境。我佩服你的勇气。"] = "I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage.",
    ["我真羡慕你，$n。你做得太出色了。"] = "I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work.",
    ["我眼睁睁地看着拉格纳罗斯的堕落渗透了整个黑铁矮人社会，使这个曾经荣耀的民族变得疯狂……变得邪恶。$B$B当黑石塔建造完毕时，我与同胞们共同生存下去的意愿也消失殆尽了。我作为新的黑铁矮人的英雄而死去。这座坟墓就在我亲手建造的城门处，作为对我的成就的敬意。"] = "I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.$B$BWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts.",
    ["我眼睛瞎了，但是我还拥有洞察力。$B$B我主要跟猎人和潜行者打交道，$r。"] = "Sightless I may be, but vision I have.$B$BMy primary dealings are with hunters and rogues, $r.",
    ["我知识渊博，但我还不是专家。你知道你该去找谁谈话吗？雷安诺！她就在不远的地方。到幽暗城打听她的下落。"] = "I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity",
    ["我知道一些，但我不是专家。祝你好远，玛加尔也是。他就站在商店后面。看看他是否能帮助你，但是小心别惹恼他。他脾气有些暴躁。"] = "I know a few things, but I'm no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He's standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable.",
    ["我知道在雷霆崖有人可以帮助你进入奥特兰克山谷。去猎人高地找泰姆·狂暴图腾。希望你找到你希望找的人，$N。"] = "There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n.",
    ["我知道很多事，陌生人，但是你的知识与我的不相上下。想更深入研究的附魔师要去阿祖拉之塔，那里住着一个叫做基塔·费温德的工匠。"] = "I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides.",
    ["我知道很多，好好听着吧，$r。"] = "I know much, listen and be educated, $r.",
    ["我知道有些人在这附近练习某些专业。你想要打听哪项专业技能的训练师？"] = "I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two.  What profession do you have in mind?",
    ["我知道，我知道，我知道我根本不知道自己在哪里！$B$B我的家在棘齿城，不过既然我的飞艇在这儿坠落了，那我不如现在就开始进行我的研究项目了！"] = "I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere!$B$BMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!",
    ["我确实很喜欢坐在这里，听着大海的声音。哦，什么？是的，有一艘船会把你带到米奈希尔港。它有时会停在这里。"] = "I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time.",
    ["我确实有能力对那些有价值的人进行教学。你是这样的人吗？"] = "It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?",
    ["我给你带来一些东西，$n。它们看起来挺重要的。"] = "I got something for you, $n. Looks important.",
    ["我给国王提供过装备。如果有正确的训练，你也可以。"] = "I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too.",
    ["我给我们的车里安装了新的矩阵式调节器，它可以使赛车的引擎转速提高至少百分之十五！"] = "I installed a new device in our car's matrix regulometer.  That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!",
    ["我统治这个王国已经有一万年啦。在那时，我从那些神圣的辛德拉家族成员那儿听到很多令人着迷的故事。$B$B由于我必须呆在这儿，所以我常常和访问者沟通交谈。你可以为我讲个故事吗，或许你想听听我的故事？"] = "For 10,000 years I have ruled this kingdom. In that time, I have heard many fascinating tales from those that would walk the hallowed grounds of the House of Shen'dralar.$B$BAs I am bound to this place, I often exchange stories with visitors. Do you have a story for me or perhaps you would like to hear a story?",
    ["我能为你做些什么吗，$n？快说，我时间可不多。"] = "What can I do for you, $n?  Make it quick, I don't have all day!",
    ["我能为你做些什么吗？不，等等！你能为我做些什么？"] = "What can I do for you?  No, wait!  What can you do for me?",
    ["我能为你做什么？"] = "What can I do for ya?",
    ["我能制造你在商店里看见的若干东西。你认为如何？小心回答，这也许能决定你的命运。"] = "I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it.",
    ["我能帮忙吗？"] = "Can I help you?",
    ["我自己不久前也是一个新手，所以我觉得我不太适合教你。试着跟那边的塔恩或是玛克谈谈。他们之中应该有人能回答你的问题。"] = "It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions.",
    ["我被你吸引住了，$r。"] = "I've got my eye on you, $r.",
    ["我被抓之后遭受了非人的虐待，$N。他们轮番拷打我和基利斯中尉，而且在虐待一方的同时让另外一个在旁边看着。我们不断被折磨，直到有一天基利斯告诉把战友们的遭遇告诉了我，还有他的拯救计划。$B$B他们所遭受的痛苦比我和基利斯所遭受的还要多，他们真的是生不如死。"] = "My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.$B$BThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured.",
    ["我被杀死过无数次。我总是发现我会在这里醒来。有些人说我遭受了诅咒，还有些人……"] = "I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others...",
    ["我要一直待在这里直到钓到68磅重的石斑鱼！你却要离开到什么地方去，是不是？"] = "I'm going to stay here until I catch a 68 Pound Grouper!  You on the other hand want to fly off somewhere, am I right?",
    ["我要复仇。"] = "Vengeance shall be mine.",
    ["我要如何效劳？"] = "How may I be of service?",
    ["我要教你的东西会让你头脑混乱的！当你学到足够的知识后再来找我吧！"] = "The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!",
    ["我要来一杯黑铁啤酒。哦，你不是侍者？"] = "I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?",
    ["我觉得你的服饰急需维修。"] = "I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care.",
    ["我认为你在暴风城会交到好运的。去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你指明方向。"] = "I think you'll have better luck looking in Stormwind.  Ask a guard up there and they'll point you in the right direction.",
    ["我认为普拉格把桶装得太满了。你瞧，简直都要炸开了！"] = "I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it's about to blow!",
    ["我记得不久之前我有新邮件寄出。你可以在中部高地的底层雷霆崖银行外找到邮箱。"] = "I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You'll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.",
    ["我负责霜狼氏族的军队招募工作。作为一名霜狼士兵，如果你的等级足够高的话，就来向我报到吧。$B$B在冰冷的战场上，你会获得荣誉和尊重的。"] = "I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.$B$BHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field.",
    ["我这个无足轻重的仆人能为你做什么，$n？需要训练吗？"] = "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?",
    ["我这里卖的可都是由暴风城最好的工匠和法师制作东西，世上最好的魔法装备！"] = "I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind.",
    ["我这里只卖最好的东西，而且绝无二价。你想要讨价还价的话，就去找个地精商人。"] = "I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin.",
    ["我这里有他的重生之瓶。如果你决心接受这项任务，就必须保护好这只小瓶，并击败拉格纳罗斯！"] = "I hold the vessel of his rebirth. Should you be prepared to take on this task, you will be required to fortify the vessel and ultimately, break the hold of Ragnaros himself!",
    ["我这里有你所需要的所有烹饪材料，伙计！"] = "I've got all the cooking supplies you'll ever need, mon!",
    ["我这里的狮鹫是鹰巢山以南飞得最快的。想要乘坐吗？"] = "Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?",
    ["我通常将那种事情留给侏儒去做。要是你想学习这项专业的话，我想你可以在暴风城找到一些侏儒来训练你。"] = "I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes.  If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you.",
    ["我那两岁的儿子设计的赛车都比那些可笑的地精造出来的破烂跑得更快！"] = "My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!",
    ["我那时还是一个年轻的牛头人，没有成年，但我却知道，那些为了我们的自由而战的勇士们，都拥有一套与我同名的护甲。"] = "I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments.",
    ["我，就像我的兄弟们一样，以那些尊重祖先的人为荣。对我来说，与欢度春节的人们一起分享我的秘密手艺是极大的快乐。"] = "I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!",
    ["或许我应该告诉你为什么我会在这儿。$B$B你知道死亡之翼或者他的后裔，奈法利安和奥妮克希亚吗？"] = "Perhaps I should tell you why I am here.$B$BDo you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?",
    ["或许有一天萨鲁·钢怒会教你学会制作一把质地精良的斧头。沿着红石谷矿业工会右边的道路，到荣誉谷的“燃烧的铁砧”店里去找他吧。"] = "Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day.  Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining.",
    ["或许有一天，你对联盟的贡献会跟你今日所见的英雄一样伟大。尊重英雄吧，$n。"] = "Perhaps one day, your contributions to the Alliance will be as great as the heroes you have seen this day. Honor them, $n.",
    ["或许这会令你震惊，但是近来的事情不是那么顺利……"] = "This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late...",
    ["战争之王萨尔亲自邀请我到这儿来。我感到非常荣幸，这并不困难。我不要求自己的职务高于斯通纳德。我只想找些生长在这儿的草药。"] = "Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here.",
    ["战争即将来临，$n。每个部落成员都要响应号召，并肩击溃懦弱的联盟。"] = "War is upon us, $n.  It's time for every member of the Horde to answer the call and join the fight against the cowardly Alliance.",
    ["战争是有代价的，$c……这种代价常常被我们忽略。艾泽拉斯大地冲突迭起，到处都是失去双亲的孤儿。那些无家可归的孤儿没有别的地方可去，他们通常在这儿成长，到了自力更生的年龄才离开。$B$B联盟将春季的某一周设为儿童周，为这些无辜的孩子赠送物品。"] = "There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week.",
    ["战争是有代价的，$c……这种代价常常被我们忽略。艾泽拉斯大地冲突迭起，到处都是失去双亲的孤儿。那些无家可归的孤儿没有别的地方可去，他们通常在这儿成长，到了自力更生的年龄才离开。$B$B部落将春季的某一周设为儿童周，为这些无辜的孩子赠送物品。"] = "There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week.",
    ["战争犹如箭在弦上，$C！部落和联盟都做好了充分的准备。所有的战争物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。当军队准备就绪时，那位完成修复流沙节杖的艰巨任务的英雄将敲响甲虫之台上的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。一场旷世之战也将随即拉开序幕！$B$B部落万岁！"] = "The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!$B$BLok'tar Ogar!",
    ["战争犹如箭在弦上，蓄势待发；部落和联盟都有着无数强大的勇士。$B$B但愿他们不会互相争斗……"] = "Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.$B$BIf only we could keep them off of each other's throats...",
    ["战争结束了，达隆郡的人民得救了。$B$B他们得救了，$n，这都归功于你。你是达隆郡的英雄。"] = "The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.$B$BThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire.",
    ["战争胜利了。目前天灾军团的威胁已经被暂时消除了。我们还有一些剩余资源，如果你需要的话，我可以帮助你，以感激你做出的贡献，并为将来做准备。"] = "The battle is won. For the time being, the Scourge threat has been pushed back. Our resources can be channeled into aiding you, in thanks and preparation for the future.",
    ["战场军官"] = "Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep.",
    ["战士们一般都在猪和哨声旅店或者在旧城区的兵营里出没。但我建议你还是到旅店去找找比较好。"] = "Warriors can usually be found either at the Pig and Whistle Tavern or the Barracks in Old Town. Tell ya though, the tavern is probably a better place look.",
    ["战士的任务之一就是保护。正如我们在战场上保护自己的同伴一样，我们要时刻保护被遗忘者的利益。"] = "The warrior's role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.",
    ["战役进行良好。天灾军团的实力已经被大大削弱了。我相信我们完全能够把他们都赶进海里，这只是时间问题了。我会尽可能地帮助你进行战斗。"] = "The battle goes well. The Scourge forces seem weakened. I believe it will only be a matter of time before we drive them from our shores. I will turn my magics to you, to aid in this struggle.",
    ["战歌峡谷一役至关重要，我们必须获胜。我们为了荣誉和土地而战，兽人或是他们那些误入歧途的盟友是无法打败我们的！"] = "The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose.  We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!",
    ["战歌峡谷？好吧，你应该去跟武器大厅的莱兰迪斯谈一谈。"] = "Warsong Gulch you say? Well then, you'll be wanting to speak with fair Lylandris over in the Hall of Arms.",
    ["战死沙场是件光荣的事儿！但是，若是你能利用我教你的东西，或许你不会死得那么快，嗯？"] = "To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?  ",
    ["所有的官员都居住在铁炉堡。你得去铁炉堡访客中心领取公会登记表。"] = "All those official types reside in Ironforge.  Ye'll be wanting to check out the Ironforge Visitor's Center for guild creation papers.",
    ["所有的潜行者都居住在铁炉堡以北的荒弃的洞穴。我敢打赌芬斯维克也在那儿，正在数着偷来的钱包中的硬币呢。我总有一天会抓住他的！  同时，我也会好好看着你的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。"] = "All the roguish types hang out in The Forlorn Cavern, north of the gates of Ironforge.  I'd wager ye'll find Fenthwick there, no doubt counting the coin of another cut purse.  I'll catch him one of these days!  In the meantime I'll have my eye on you as well, $glad : lass;.",
    ["扎姆沙在暗巷区上层的博斯坦的火坑。当你从力量谷进入暗巷区时走左边的楼梯。"] = "You want Zamja at Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength.",
    ["扎姆沙能帮你吗，$r？"] = "Can Zamja help you, $r?",
    ["扎尔迪玛可能会教你一些新的法术。他最近喜欢待在狮王之傲旅店，你可以去那里的房间看看他在不在。"] = "Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells.  He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion's Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he's in.",
    ["扎瑞恩看起来很了解烹饪行业。为什么你不去看看他是否会给你一些食谱呢？他通常在多兰纳尔的旅店旁边烹饪。"] = "Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don't you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["托马斯也许不是最好的厨师，但是他确实能做一些精美的菜肴。如果你想学习厨艺的话，就去狮王之傲旅店找他吧。"] = "Tomas may not be the best cook around, but he has a few dishes that hit the spot.  He's currently working in the Lion's Pride Inn if you'd like to learn the profession.",
    ["找我学习剥皮的学徒并不多，如果你准备好了，我马上就可以教你一些东西。"] = "I don't get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready.",
    ["找我有事吗，$c？"] = "Yes, $c?",
    ["承蒙月神的关照，我很高兴给你在整个泰达希尔找到的最好的坐骑，甚至是这世上最好的--黑豹。数年来，哨兵部队一直倚赖这些同伴的价值。$B$B抓紧时间，朋友，挑选一匹你满意的。我敢肯定你不会失望的。"] = "By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed.",
    ["拉乌克就在剃刀岭东边的兵营中。"] = "There's one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk.",
    ["拉文霍德庄园欢迎你的光临，冒险者。"] = "Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer.",
    ["拉文霍德的信使今天早上将这封信交给了我。这是写给你的，$n。"] = "Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.",
    ["拉格纳罗斯将拥有至高无上的统治权！"] = "Ragnaros will reign supreme!",
    ["拍卖行在哪儿？当你进入我们美丽的城市时它就在铁炉堡大门旁边。你会在银行的正对面找到它。"] = "Where is the Auction House?  Why it's right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye'll find it just across from The Vault.",
    ["拜恩希在急救方面的技巧已经很知名了。如果你想向她学习的话，你可以到多兰纳尔旅店的北面去找她。"] = "Byancie's skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her.",
    ["拜恩希经常为在野外巡逻的哨兵服务。如果你想学习急救的话就该找她谈谈。"] = "Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid.",
    ["拥有万年历史的知识卷轴将那些邪恶的家伙吸引到图书馆。大量的书籍被盗，被找回之后再次被盗。"] = "10,000 years of recorded knowledge tends to draw the wrong element to the Athenaeum. Books are stolen, recovered and stolen again on a daily basis.",
    ["拿到钥匙，打开这些锁链！钥匙在守护者希坦亚手里……就在洞的后面……"] = "Get the key and unlock these chains! Hitah'ya the Keeper holds it... back of cave... ",
    ["指挥官最近一直心不在焉。他的妻子在最近的一次南部沙漠考古挖掘中失踪了——一下子消失地踪影全无！真的非常奇怪。$B$B我想你是不是想要找份工作？我是不是可以给你一些提示？"] = "The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.$B$BI suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?",
    ["挑战火焰之王的下场就是我们现在的样子。"] = "Our fate is the doom of all who face the Great Fire.",
    ["据我所知，丹莫罗是没有附魔师的。如果你想成为一名附魔师的话，就去铁炉堡吧。"] = "There aren't any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye're going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter's profession.",
    ["据我所知，附近没有这些训练师。你最好去北方的奥格瑞玛看看，去问问那儿的守卫。"] = "I don't know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts.",
    ["授人以鱼不如授人以渔。尤萨恩·静水会教你如何钓鱼。到石牛湖岸边的血蹄村寻找他的智慧所在。"] = "Give a bull a fish and feed him for a day.  Teach a bull to fish and feed him for life.  Uthan Stillwater can teach you how to fish.  Seek his wisdom west of Bloodhoof Village along the banks of Stonebull Lake.",
    ["接近尸体时的感觉是独一无二的。你可以沿着城镇外东南方面的道路前进，到达十字路口后向东走，找到舍伦尼·洛巴尔特。她居住在离道路不远处的小营帐中。"] = "Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you.  You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection.  She's at a small camp there not too far along the road.",
    ["收拾你的行装，$n！我从灼热峡谷那边的尼莉丝·洛克拉夫收到消息说，有个被称作“黑市组织”的团体正在大熔炉一带运作。到灼热峡谷去找到尼莉丝·洛克拉夫，然后把那个黑市组织连窝端掉。"] = "Grab your things, $n! I've just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!",
    ["收集绷带的工作正有条不紊地按计划进行着。我们已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。"] = "Collection of bandages is proceeding according to schedule. As far as linen bandages are concerned, we've gathered $2076w of $2077w. Silk bandages have been tallied at $2082w out of $2083w, and we have $2088w out of $2090w runecloth bandages needed.",
    ["收集食物是眼下我惟一的工作！我们已经收集到$2095w块瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼了，总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。"] = "Food, now there's a subject that I can sink my fangs into! I am told that we have $2095w of $2096w lean wolf steaks, $2102w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail, and $2105w of $2106w baked salmon on ice and stored away.",
    ["放松一下自己疲倦的身心。"] = "Rest your weary bones for a spell.",
    ["放轻松点。我只训练战士。"] = "Take it easy, mon. I only train da warriors.",
    ["救命！！！！"] = "HELP!!!!",
    ["救赎护甲原本属于我们当中最虔诚的那一批圣骑士，甚至是光明使者本人也曾穿过这套护甲！$B$B可在上一次战争中，这些圣骑士们英勇抗击天灾军团，战死沙场之后，他们身上的铠甲却被敌人掠夺走，带去了恐怖之城纳克萨玛斯。$B$B据说纳克萨玛斯的死亡骑士利用污浊的力量亵渎了这批救赎护甲，并为他们的罪恶目的所用。$B$B这真是个悲剧……"] = "The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!$B$BThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.$B$BIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.$B$BSuch tragedy... ",
    ["教堂广场的光明大教堂是暴风城神职人员的住所，你可以在那里找到高阶牧师劳瑞娜。"] = "The Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square is home to the priests of Stormwind. There you will find High Priestess Laurena.",
    ["教学不只是一项单边活动，$n。当我教你时，我自己也在学习，而我的理解也在加深。"] = "Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows.",
    ["数百年以来阿拉辛一直很关心我们猎人视作朋友的动物。他对动物的关心被周围的猎人所追随。如果你也来向他请教，那么就到塞纳里奥区找他。"] = "For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.",
    ["数百年前，伟大的索瑞森城骄傲地矗立在富饶的大地之上，那里现在已经变成了荒芜的燃烧平原。$B$B索瑞森城是黑铁矮人的家乡，它那时正处于一场矮人的内战中。$B$B你知道，那片土地曾是赤脊山的一部分——直到有一天，索瑞森被一场大爆炸吞噬。城市变成一片废墟，周围的地区也被夷为平地。"] = "Hundreds of years ago, the great city of Thaurissan stood proudly in a lush expanse of land that is now the dilapidated Burning Steppes.$B$BThaurissan was home to the nation of Dark Iron dwarves and at the time, in the midst of a civil war among the dwarven nation at large.$B$BYou see, that area of the world was at one point in time part of the Redridge Mountains - until the day that Thaurissan was consumed by a gigantic explosion. The city lay in ruin, the surrounding areas reduced to an ashy wasteland.",
    ["整个世界都感激你和你的同伴们所做的一切，$n。"] = "The world is indebted to you and your allies, $n.",
    ["整晚都会有烟花表演，从下午6点直到黎明，月神湖的上空将会绽放无数美丽的花朵！"] = "They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune'ara!",
    ["斯坦索姆位于东部瘟疫之地瘟疫林的北部。"] = "The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood.",
    ["斯纳尔因为我动作慢了所以叫我。我只是想做好工作罢了，这得花时间的。"] = "Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time.",
    ["新的一年来临了，月光洒满大地。$B$B这是属于我们的日子……远古的生命苏醒了。"] = "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake.",
    ["新鲜的樱桃馅饼！香味扑鼻，让你的眼睛发直！"] = "Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye.",
    ["旅店老板帕拉能帮助你得到身心的休息。他就在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中。"] = "Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.",
    ["旅店老板考乌斯可以满足你的需求。你可以在村子西边的屋子中找到他。"] = "Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses.",
    ["旅店老板艾玛照料着这周围的所有动物。要是你需要跟她交谈的话，就去狮王之傲旅店外面找她。"] = "Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She's right outside the Lion's Pride Inn if you need to speak with her.",
    ["旅行者，你好。很少有人以这种方式找到我。$B$B我叫雷沃，我在冬泉谷驯化这些霜刃豹，使它们成为坐骑。$B$B这些猫科动物非常凶猛，极难驯服。只有那些最值得信赖和最受人尊敬的人才可能骑上它们。$B$B我是不会随意出售这样的坐骑的，你必须用行为来证明，让我和霜刃豹都接受你。"] = "Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.$B$BMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.$B$BThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.$B$BI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves.",
    ["旅行者，你有充分的理由让自己充满信心。现在你真正的培训开始了！"] = "Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!",
    ["旅馆位于主城入口以北，力量谷右边的第二幢建筑物。和旅店老板格雷什卡谈谈。"] = "That's the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka.",
    ["旅馆？啊，你是来寻找铁炉堡出产的美酒的？你该去石火旅店。$B$B如果你在铁炉堡之外，它就在铁炉堡大门的左边；反之，则在大门右边。"] = "The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go.  $B$BYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.",
    ["无论萨尔是否存在，碎手氏族的秩序都将延续下去。"] = "The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall. ",
    ["既然所有东西对你来说吃起来都象是灰烬，为什么还要做饭呢？如果你还有一样东西不是这样的，那很好，到布瑞尔南边的幽暗城去问一位幽暗城的守卫，以进一步了解如何找到他们的烹饪培训师。要到那里你可以从洛丹伦废墟的后方乘电梯下去。"] = "Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth?  If you have one still that is.  Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer.  To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron.",
    ["日复一日地坚持训练吧。当你熟练掌握所有技能的时候，再来找我。"] = "Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me.",
    ["时机成熟了，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;们，武装起来，从亡灵天灾手中夺回属于我们的夜晚！"] = "The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!",
    ["明显莫特并没有派你到我这儿来。他知道得很清楚。你还无法理解我能传授给你的知识。去外面找我的儿子莫特，他会对你进行训练的。"] = "Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. ",
    ["星光指引着新的道路，未来燃起希望和力量的灯塔。"] = "The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.",
    ["星林长者在荆棘谷的祖尔格拉布大门外面。"] = "You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale.",
    ["星歌长者应该是在悲伤沼泽的沉没的神庙中。"] = "Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows.",
    ["星灵长者在千针石林的乱风岗。"] = "Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer.",
    ["星纹长者在黑海岸的奥伯丁。"] = "Elder Starweave can be found at the coastal village of Auberdine in Darkshore.",
    ["是什么使你来到塔楼的？"] = "What brings you to the Tower?",
    ["是什么把你带到这个地方的，$c？"] = "What brings you to this part of the world, $n?",
    ["是吗？这么说你已经知道高等精灵所掌握的巨魔魔法有多么浅显了？$B$B高等精灵怎么都想不明白，作为一个与魔法密切相关的种族，他们为何无法驾驭巨魔巫毒的力量。对这些白皮肤的生灵而言，这简直难以置信。他们只好使用一种不纯的巨魔法术来增强他们的魔法力量。我想他们称其为“秘药”。"] = "Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?$B$BThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them 'Arcanum.'",
    ["是吗？这是他们一贯的操作手法。对克尔苏加德和快速增长的亡灵天灾军队来说，什么东西拥有更大的价值？一个能成功潜入某个组织，然后释放瘟疫使数千人丧命的狂热追随者，还是一个普通到掉渣的亡灵士兵？很明显你不是那么愚蠢。$B$B没错，$r，他们就在你周围，生活着，工作着，密谋着。"] = "Is it? This has always been their method of operation. What is of greater value to Kel'Thuzad and the ever growing Scourge army? A zealous, living, follower that can work their way into a society and then unleash a plague, destroying thousands; or a single undead trooper? Certainly you cannot be that dense$B$BYes, $r, they live, work, and plot among you.",
    ["是我亲爱的恋人卡利派你来找我的？她可是我的宝贝。"] = "Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is.",
    ["是的。眼睛绝不会弄错的。$B$B毕竟，你是一名牧师。如果眼睛向你展示了这段恐怖的记忆，那么你肯定是一名强大的牧师。$B$B你是来救赎的，但是你甚至还没有意识到这一点……对吗？"] = "You were. The Eye is never wrong.$B$BYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.$B$BYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?",
    ["是的是的，我知道达丹加不喜欢烟。但从它身上的气味来看，达丹加好像还不喜欢洗澡。"] = "Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing.",
    ["是的，你应该去找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。他总住在城镇东南端的客栈里。它叫做恐惧之末旅店，你不会错过的。"] = "Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town.  It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it.",
    ["是的，你总是能看到克莱德·凯林在布瑞尔东边的澈水湖岸钓鱼。但当你到那里后要当心那些带着面具的变态者。我们去年就被迫关掉了孩子们的夏令营。"] = "Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill.  Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there.  We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year.",
    ["是的，你看起来是个领导者。你是来这里组织公会与联盟作战吗？"] = "Aye, you look the type to be a leader.  Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?",
    ["是的，你知道一些事情！如果你想学会更多的话就必须与暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。"] = "Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind.",
    ["是的，嗯，$G小伙子:姑娘;，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在$2113w天内全部抵达。我们只需等待某位英雄修复流沙节杖，敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。"] = "That's right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within $2113w days. After that, we'll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj.",
    ["是的，年轻人，你不需要让我相信这些事情，酋长和我有很多过去的故事要说。然而你所做的贡献是众所周知的。$B$B就象我说的那样，雷德已经为他的人民找到了新的家园，我也是那些不知疲倦跟随他的人中的一员。$B$B那一次冲突激起了其它……其它无数的冲突。就是在黑石氏族和黑铁矮人为了黑石塔的战斗中我的两个儿子被杀害了。就在那时我意识到了我在黑石氏族的日子结束了。"] = "Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.$B$BAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.$B$BFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end.",
    ["是的，当然，去告诉冬天爷爷你都想从这个冬幕中得到什么。$B$B赶紧些。"] = "Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Greatfather Winter what you'd like for this Winter's Veil.$B$BHo ho hurry up.",
    ["是的，很高兴能教你如何锻造。系上围裙，拿起铁锤，看看我们能锻造出什么来？"] = "Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let's see what we can accomplish shall we?",
    ["是的，我是阿斯托·哈德恩。你是？"] = "Yes, I am. What's it to you?",
    ["是的，我曾盼望你能回来。早些时候，我派科兰出去，她发现了达图尔的魔棒被遗弃在森林里。$B$B我们竭力想要找回它，$n。请你小心以后不要掉了它。"] = "Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol's Rod, abandoned in the forest.$B$BWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future.",
    ["是的，我有些东西要给你看看。我们来看一下你做得怎么样，或许你会令我吃惊的！"] = "Yeah, I'll show you a few things. We'll see how you do, maybe you'll surprise me!",
    ["是的，我现在已经经营这家店一段时间了。最近生意非常好。许多新的探险者来了……"] = "Yes, I've been running this shop for some time now. Business has been pretty good lately. A lot of new adventurers coming through...",
    ["是的，我看到你要寻找的萨满祭司了。上次我见到她的时候是在这里的西边，她隐居在钢鬃部族旁的小山上。如果你够聪明的话，就可以找到一条通往小屋的山路，就在北边不远的地方，那条路可以让你避开野猪人，直接找到她。"] = "Yes, I have seen the shaman you seek. Last I saw her, she was to the west of here. She hides in the hills above the Razormane tribe. If you're clever, you'll be able to find a path to her hut in the hills. It is not too far north of here. That path should allow you to find her without fighting through the quilboar.",
    ["是的，我自己也需要放置一些东西。要找到它你需要向北沿着去奥格瑞玛的路一直走，然后找那里的步兵询问一下。"] = "Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there.",
    ["是的，我认为你有潜力。或许我可以给你看看一两样东西？"] = "Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two.",
    ["是的，我讲的语言你听得懂$r。我们不是动物，然而你们中大多数却仍然把我们像动物一样对待！可是我们的分歧比起降临到这片土地上的悲剧来显得微不足道。恳请你们把与我们存在的分歧搁置一边，倾听一下我临死前的请求。$B$B我来到这片土地尽我所能改善状况，而现在除非你能帮我，否则那即将要化为泡影。我用我生命的最后一息请你帮这个忙。"] = "Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.$B$BI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life.",
    ["是的，每个人都想坐矿道地铁，那真是酷毙了。嗯，你可以去铁炉堡大门以东的技工区找矿道地铁。"] = "Aye, everyone wants to ride the tram, it's a real hoot and a half.  Well, if ye want to find the tram, it's located over in Tinker Town just east of the gates of Ironforge.",
    ["是的，莫格莱尼，大领主莫格莱尼：血色十字军最初的建立者之一，一位一生忠诚于其信仰，致力于净化世间一切罪恶的骑士。他被自己的亲生儿子背叛，并被克尔苏加德的军队杀死在了斯坦索姆城内。这也是我现在横在这里的原因……"] = "Aye, the Highlord Mograine: A founder of the original order of the Scarlet Crusade. A knight of unwavering faith and purity; Mograine would be betrayed by his own son and slain by Kel'Thuzad's forces inside Stratholme. It is how I ended up here...",
    ["是的，那是真的，我好像一只蝙蝠一样瞎了！而且还醉得……呃，醉得好像喝了很多酒。$B$B我会告诉这个感受的，$r。是酒让我感觉灵敏。人人都知道如果你丧失了一种感觉，那么另外一个感觉会变得更加灵敏。我的饮酒感觉这两天非常灵敏。"] = "Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.$B$BI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days.",
    ["是谁派你来的？"] = "Did Crest send you?",
    ["晚上会有焰火表演，从下午6点直到第二天早上，藏宝海湾的天空将会绽开无数绚丽的花朵！"] = "They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Booty Bay!",
    ["晨行长者在燃烧平原的烈焰峰。"] = "Elder Dawnstrider can be found at Flame Crest on the Burning Steppes.",
    ["晨露长者在千针石林的沙漠赛道观看比赛。"] = "Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.",
    ["暗月卡片？看到你面前的这位专家了吧？如果你想要了解这方面的东西，就来找我吧。"] = "Darkmoon Faire Cards?  See the Professor here for those.  Come see me if you are a dealer in hard to come by antiquities and artifacts.",
    ["暗月马戏团不久就会开张啦。别忘了待会回来，看看我们是否已准备停当。"] = "Won't be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we're done.",
    ["暗月马戏团到艾尔文森林来了，就在闪金镇的南边。走过路过不要错过！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire.  Don't miss it!",
    ["暗月马戏团到莫高雷的金色平原来了，就在雷霆崖的西南边。走过路过不要错过！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff.  Don't miss it!",
    ["暗月马戏团只会停留一小段时间，别错过今天的大好机会！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!",
    ["暗月马戏团只会逗留有限的时间。一定要在今天来看看啊！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!",
    ["暗月马戏团将会在莫高雷开张，我们就在雷霆崖的西南方安营扎寨！"] = "When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore.  We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!",
    ["暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！不要错过有史以来最华丽的表演！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see!",
    ["暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！走过路过不要错过！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don't miss it!",
    ["暗月马戏团是全艾泽拉斯最华丽的！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!",
    ["暗月马戏团来了！所有的孩子都可以在这里找到好玩的东西！来吧，都来吧！"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!",
    ["暗灵长者在幽暗城。"] = "Elder Darkcore can be found in the Undercity.",
    ["暗角长者在遍布红色巨岩的奥格瑞玛城中。"] = "Elder Darkhorn can be found among the red rocks of Orgrimmar.",
    ["暴怒图腾长者在塔纳利斯沙漠的守卫之谷打发时间。"] = "Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert.",
    ["暴风城中的某位侏儒肯定能教你，而且我相信暴风城的守卫能为你指明方向。"] = "There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession.  I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction.",
    ["暴风城是人类的支柱，它是建立在钢铁的意志和锋利的刀刃上的。"] = "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.",
    ["暴风城最好的货物啊，朋友，你绝对不应该错过。看看有什么你需要的东西吗？"] = "Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?",
    ["暴风城有一个天才侏儒名叫利廉姆·火轴，他是这里最好的工程学训练师。你可以在矮人区的后面找到他。"] = "Stormwind's resident engineer trainer is an ingenious gnome by the name of Lilliam Sparkspindle. He can be found in the back of the Dwarven District.",
    ["暴风城的暴风城会计室位于城中贸易区的前门处。当你厌烦细数你的金钱时，一定要在镶金玫瑰喝一杯。"] = "Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the Trade District of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink.",
    ["暴风城监狱位于暴风城靠近法师区附近。"] = "The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind.",
    ["暴风城银行坐落在贸易区，就在城门的西北面。来，让我在地图上指给你看。"] = "The Bank of Stormwind is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map.",
    ["最好的矿工紧握$g他:她;的铁锄，拥有一颗坚定的心，头发上还散落着一层厚厚的黑灰。"] = "The best miner has a firm grip on $ghis:her; pick, a stout heart in $ghis:her; chest, and thick, black dust in $ghis:her; hair.",
    ["最近书本丢失甚多。博学者和他的助手非常恼怒。他们怀疑在埃雷萨拉斯有人妄图不轨。"] = "Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas.",
    ["最近的狮鹫管理员居住在铁炉堡的大锻炉附近。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就前往铁炉堡吧。"] = "The closest gryphon master is located up in Ironforge near The Great Forge itself.  Ye'll need to head to Ironforge if ye want to travel by gryphon.",
    ["最近的银行就是铁炉堡银行，$g小伙子:姑娘;。"] = "The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, $glad : lass;. ",
    ["月光长者在贫瘠之地的十字路口。"] = "Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens.",
    ["月击长者在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院里。"] = "Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.",
    ["月神--我崇拜你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。你在这里很受欢迎。说吧，我会尽力帮助你的。"] = "Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you.",
    ["月神已经赐予暗夜精灵很多礼物。作为回报，我们有职责保卫这些森林免受部落带来的恶魔的污染。"] = "Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it.",
    ["月神殿是艾露恩的祭司们的家园。你会在那儿找到贾德莉亚和拉瑞亚，她们会对你的牧师生涯做出进一步的指导。"] = "The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.",
    ["月神的力量支配着你！月神的力量支配着你！  出发吧！去达纳苏斯东部的月神殿中央大厅找贾德莉亚！"] = "The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  Go now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!",
    ["月神的秘密很多，但是它们不能让任何人知道。"] = "Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone. ",
    ["有一名优秀的厨师在旧城区的猪与哨声旅店工作。我曾在他身旁看他在烹饪时使用刀具，但是我可不认为他只是一名厨师。别误会我的意思……如果你想学厨艺的话，他会是你最好的老师。"] = "There's a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I've watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don't think he's always been a cook.  Don't get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he's the best we have.",
    ["有一名草药师跟炼金师一同居住在暴风城东面的山上。完美的搭配，不是吗？"] = "There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?",
    ["有个人类手中有能打开这个装置的钥匙。我想他的名字叫埃斯顿。"] = "One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was.",
    ["有些冒险家认为附魔术不起作用。我发现当我向他们挑战，要与他们作战时，他们的看法就改变了！"] = "Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!",
    ["有些弱小的植物竟然能在丹莫罗的寒风中开花，这真令人惊奇……但是这儿没有草药师。你得去铁炉堡接受草药师的训练。"] = "Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won't find any herbalists out here.  Ye'll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession.",
    ["有人找我谈话总是件高兴的事儿。事情进展如何，$c？"] = "It's always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?",
    ["有人没有受到记忆的折磨。"] = "Some were spared the anguish that memories provide.",
    ["有什么事吗，$c？"] = "Yes, $c?",
    ["有奥格诺恩提供所需的供应，我可以不用寻找一株草药就能完成在这里的任务。如果我永远都不用再次看到自然的奇迹，这就不会很快发生。"] = "With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon.",
    ["有时，连我自己都感到惊讶！"] = "Sometimes I surprise even myself!",
    ["有消息说范斯·安德格鲁姆已经在城镇东南端的恐惧之末旅店楼上永久定下了一间房间。我想他刚刚离开了阅览室。"] = "Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  I think he's just off the reading room.",
    ["有许多战场可供选择，你要去哪一个呢？"] = "There are several battlegrounds from which to choose.  To which battlemaster shall I send you?",
    ["有趣，真有趣……我知道有个德鲁伊居住在哀嚎洞穴上方的山顶，$n。她也许能告诉你有关这块碎片的更多信息。$B$B现在，我必须工作了！"] = "Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.$B$BNow, I must get back to work!",
    ["朋友——暴风城需要你的协助和慷慨解囊！$B$B我们曾经储藏丰富的布料已经所剩不多了。暴风城现在需要大量的布料和绷带！你的捐赠将能够帮助暴风城度过难关，你还能赢得我们对你的尊重！"] = "Friend - Stormwind needs your assistance and your generosity!$B$BOur once large stockpile of textiles has run critically low.  Stormwind is now engaged in a multi-pronged effort to rebuild those stocks for the manufacture of textiles and bandages!  Your donation of cloth would help Stormwind immensely, as well as earn the respect of the citizenry!",
    ["朋友，招待生总是乐意收到小费的。"] = "Tips are always graciously accepted, friend.",
    ["本娜就像着魔一样工作。她日以继夜地调制这些药剂，不吃不睡。我知道我们的亡灵盟友需要帮助，但是我担心她这样会伤身体的。"] = "Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.",
    ["本年度新品：X-5000型欢乐制造器。请上前来尝试一下！不要害羞！$B$B在尝试之前请填写这些表格，我们还在修正这台机器的某些问题……"] = "New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.  Step on up and don't be shy!$B$BAnd sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing...",
    ["术士……我可不在乎他们。就像那个在雷酒酿制厂外开设商店的吉姆瑞兹。都是他，那儿的啤酒可能都跑了气！术士……呸！"] = "Warlocks... I don't care for their lot.  Like that Grimrizz who's set up shop outside the Thunderbrew Distillery. The ale will probably go flat there because of him!  Warlocks... bah!",
    ["术士，嗯。我先前并未对你提及，但是我听说他们聚集在法师区中一间名为已宰的羔羊的酒吧中。"] = "Warlocks, eh.  Well, you didn't hear it from me, but I've heard rumors that those types gather at a bar called the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter.  ",
    ["权力珍宝是古代古拉巴什帝国的遗物。赞达拉部族正在寻找它们——它们不仅有着极大的收藏价值，而且我们相信它们还蕴藏着远古帝国的魔法。$B$B你可以在祖尔格拉布找到三种权力珍宝：硬币、珠宝和原始神灵的物品。收集到一定数量之后，把这些东西交给我们，我们就会送你一些赞达拉最好的工艺制品。"] = "The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.$B$BYou'll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.",
    ["李·布朗在水晶湖中抓到过很多奇怪的东西。他说他数月前钓起过一个神秘的面具。但是照实说，我想他那晚一定在狮王之傲喝多了。"] = "Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake.  He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago.  If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night.",
    ["李·布朗整天都在水晶湖钓鱼。或许他能给你讲些故事，还能教你一些技巧。"] = "Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake.  He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you.",
    ["村子里可没这样的地方，在高高的雷霆崖上应该有。出了血蹄村沿着北面的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部，找那儿的守卫谈谈。愿你的祖先保佑你。"] = "We have no such place in the village.  The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though.  Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs.  There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher.  May your ancestors watch over you.",
    ["村子里居住着一位名叫纳姆·逐星的智者。他能继续训练你，使你成为一名真正的萨满。"] = "There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser.  He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman.",
    ["杜格鲁·血怒在城镇东边的兵营后面。不要让我发觉你跟燃烧军团是一伙的！"] = "Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town.  Don't let me find out that you're in league with the Burning Legion!",
    ["来复枪、炸药、炸弹、爆炸绵羊……这些可爱的东西。要学习如何制造这些物品以及其他工具的话，就去布瑞尔以南，洛丹伦废墟下的幽暗城吧。乘坐废墟后面的电梯，当你到达幽暗城后，向一个幽暗城守卫询问训练者的确切位置。"] = "Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love?  To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins.  Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly.",
    ["来学习猎人之道吧。骄傲，荣誉，还有传统。"] = "Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition.",
    ["来自贝恩霍勒的消息？是什么消息？他需要伟大的导师和仆人乌拉泰克吗？他需要我吗？"] = "... A message from Banehollow?  What message is that?  Does he have need of his great advisor and servant, Ulathek?  Does he require my presence?",
    ["松脆青蛙只在暗月马戏团有售，机会难得，限量供应哦！"] = "For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire.",
    ["林精使渔民在多兰纳尔很难有所收获。你最好去达纳苏斯找找他们。"] = "The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus.",
    ["枪炮与硝烟弥漫，直到某一方被摧毁。"] = "It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.",
    ["查尔·硬皮居住在村子西北角的大帐篷中。他能教你一些制皮的必要知识。"] = "Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides.  He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now.",
    ["根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、五份细胞增强剂和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的僵尸或食尸鬼身上获取细胞增强剂！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。"] = "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.",
    ["根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、六份骨质分离素和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的骸骨亡灵身上获取骨质分离素！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。"] = "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.",
    ["根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、四份外膜震荡体和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的鬼魂或怨灵身上获取外膜震荡体！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。"] = "Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.",
    ["格兰尼斯·快斧能把一条鱼给喝趴下，而且还能把斧头抡得虎虎生风。如果你想接受训练的话，就去找他吧。"] = "That Granis Swiftaxe could drink a fish under the table and yet his axe still swings true.  However, if yer looking for training, ye best catch him while ye can understand him.",
    ["格瑞诺尔·石印会告诉他曾经碰到许多脱钩的超级大鱼，但他仍是附近最好的渔夫之一。他在荒弃的洞穴开有一家叫做旅行渔具店的商店。"] = "Grimnur Stonebrand will tell ye some whoppers about the one that got away, but he's still one o' the best fishermen around.  He's got a shop set up in The Forlorn Cavern called the Traveling Fisherman.",
    ["格里克斯和我达成一项共识：他给我供货，而我给他钱。这是很认真的！那个海盗为了一小袋皱皱巴巴的皇血草收我多少钱……足够把一个成年的地精弄哭了。"] = "Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry.",
    ["格雷姆罗克烹饪的手艺不一定是最好的，但他确实有些美味的食谱值得学习。到雷酒酿制厂找他聊聊，看看他能教给你什么。"] = "Gremlock doesn't always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning.  Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he'll teach ye.",
    ["桌上的所有瓶子中都盛有今天配制好的药水。心急吃不到热豆腐。哈哈！"] = "All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!",
    ["梦言长者在塔纳利斯沙漠的加基森。"] = "Elder Dreamseer resides in Gadgetzan in Tanaris Desert.",
    ["森林告知我你的存在，但是没有说你为什么在这里。那么，告诉我真相吧。"] = "The forest told me of your presence, but not why you were here. So, speak and enlighten me.",
    ["棱石长者在希利苏斯的水晶谷生活了许多年。"] = "Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus.",
    ["樱桃馅饼是我在整个艾泽拉斯最喜欢的食物。"] = "Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth.",
    ["欢迎你来到塞拉摩，$n。$B$B我没时间跟你寒暄，我为自己的唐突向你道歉，但是我必须以城市为首。我们的生活和联盟的尊严受到了严重的威胁。要想使我的人民平安幸福，我就必须对不在我们控制之外的力量保持警惕。$B$B或许稍后我们能找时间谈谈。"] = "I welcome you to Theramore, $n.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later.",
    ["欢迎你，$N。翡翠议会也欢迎你。$B$B我们很有可能一起恢复并保护这片曾经繁茂的森林。许多势力试图从外部和内部毁灭它。$B$B不要被这里的力量征服——那只会腐蚀你，就像整个这片土地一样。"] = "I welcome you, $N. And the Emerald Circle welcomes you.$B$BHopefully together we can help rejuventate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.$B$BDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land.",
    ["欢迎你，$c。如果你有什么问题，尽管来问我。"] = "Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c.  If you have any questions, please let me know.",
    ["欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B只要玛法里奥还在沉睡中，我们便永远是平衡的守卫者。别忘了这一点。"] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.",
    ["欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B据传塞纳里奥议会战事不断，但是你不该轻信这些谣言。我们的德鲁伊首领范达尔·鹿盔将领导我们和整个泰达希尔取得胜利！"] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere are rumors of strife within the Cenarion Circle, but you should pay such loose talk no heed.  Our Arch Druid, Fandral Staghelm, leads us and all of Teldrassil to glory!",
    ["欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B来自翡翠梦境的召唤将很快占据你的心灵。你将冬眠数年，在最纯净的环境中生活。你将在那儿接受最终的训练。"] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.",
    ["欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B重申自己在这伟大的平衡中的地位总是无伤大雅的。作为这种平衡的守护者，我们必须努力保持清醒的头脑和坚定的信念。训练能使我们做到这一点。"] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.$B$BIt never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard.",
    ["欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你是来接受训练的，那我很高兴能训练你。$B$B如塞纳留斯教导我们的一样，我们一直都是平衡的保护者。永远不要忘记这点。"] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this.",
    ["欢迎参加藏宝海湾钓鱼比赛，每周我们都会选出一位最好的渔夫，授予他钓鱼大师的称号！  在下午2点到4点之间，大群的可口鱼会出现在荆棘谷海岸。如果你的鱼杆浮子落在可口鱼鱼群中，你肯定能钓上一些的，这比在荆棘谷的其它海域垂钓要有效得多。"] = "Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we choose the finest fisherman to be the Master Angler!Between 2pm and 4pm schools of tastyfish will appear up and down the coast of Stranglethorn.  While fishing if your fishing bobber lands in a tastyfish school then you will catch something from the school rather than the normal stranglethorn fishing fare.",
    ["欢迎来到军情七处总部，$n。"] = "Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n.",
    ["欢迎来到前线，$c。暴风城及其盟国派我到这儿来对抗亡灵天灾。在冰风营地，我们日复一日在抗战中求生。$B$B如果你想证明自己是个英雄的话，机会是很多的……特别是在我们向安多哈尔和控制亡灵天灾的邪恶势力进军时，你可以好好把握。"] = "Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Point, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.",
    ["欢迎来到前线，$c。虽然他们的政客在暗地里密谋，但是他们会发现自己的计划在这里是行不通的。这儿是亡灵壁垒，我们会日以继日地为生存而抗争的。$B$B如果你想证明自己是个英雄的话，你会在这儿找到数不清的机遇的……特别是在我们向安多哈尔和控制着那儿的亡灵天灾的邪恶力量推进的过程中。"] = "Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.",
    ["欢迎来到十字路口，$c。我叫索克——以酋长的名义，我负责在这儿进行防御。$B$B请你在这里随意一些。在你处理生意的时候，没人会对你占用空间有所异议的。$B$B我们的安全存在许多威胁。如果你想熟悉周围的情况的话，就跟其他人谈谈吧——或许他们会派给你一些任务的。"] = "Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do.",
    ["欢迎来到圣光之愿礼拜堂，陌生人。"] = "Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger.",
    ["欢迎来到塔纳利斯，$n。我能为你提供什么服务？你看起来可不像铁匠，但是我知道，人不可貌相。"] = "Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving.",
    ["欢迎来到塞尔萨玛，这儿是你在洛克莫丹的家！$B$B塞尔萨玛是个好地方，但是对那些相应召唤来到这儿的勇士来说，这里可不是个吃喝玩乐的地方！如果你想以联盟的名义挑战危险的话，就去读读贴在探险者协会塞尔萨玛分部外面的海报吧。"] = "Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!$B$BThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League.",
    ["欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。"] = "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.",
    ["欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。我要怎么帮你呢？"] = "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?",
    ["欢迎来到幽暗城公会登记处。你需要什么帮助么？"] = "Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?",
    ["欢迎来到恶齿村，陌生的$c。我是断齿族长，这里的领袖。"] = "Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls.",
    ["欢迎来到我的商店。我能为你做什么？"] = "Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?",
    ["欢迎来到我的帐篷。我可以帮你吗？"] = "Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?",
    ["欢迎来到我的旅店，疲惫的旅行者。我能为您做点什么吗？"] = "Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?",
    ["欢迎来到探险者联盟。如果你需要书面信息的话，我也许能帮你。"] = "Welcome to the Explorer's League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out.",
    ["欢迎来到暴风城公会注册办公室。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"] = "Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?",
    ["欢迎来到暴风城银行。我们竭诚为您提供最优质的服务，包括金融账户和绝对安全的储物箱。$g先生:女士;，您是否已经拥有了本银行的账户呢？"] = "Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?",
    ["欢迎来到暴风城！我是城市的一名长官，帮助城市的人口调查局登记居民。如果你想找人的话，我也许能帮上你。我能运用奥术和智慧拿到这些记录。$B$B如果你找我有事的话，那就开口吧！"] = "Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.$B$BIf you have business with me, then please proceed!",
    ["欢迎来到猪和哨声旅店！和朋友在这里举杯畅饮，不亦乐乎！"] = "Welcome to the Pig and Whistle! Grab a drink my friend and pull up a seat, the more the merrier!",
    ["欢迎来到稻草人庆典，$c！$B$B按照万圣节的习俗，被遗忘者要焚烧一个稻草人来纪念这个最崇高的时刻。就是在这一天，女妖之王将我们从巫妖王和天灾军团的魔掌中解救了出来，从那以后，我们就成了自由之身，直到今天。那些想要毁灭我们的敌人终将化为灰烬！$B$B焚烧稻草人的庆典将在晚上八点整开始！"] = "Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!$B$BOn the observance of Hallow's End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repayed in full... with vengeance!$B$BThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!",
    ["欢迎来到蓝色隐士，这里是魔法汇集的地方。$g先生:女士;，我能帮你什么忙吗？"] = "Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?",
    ["欢迎来到达纳苏斯银行。我们提供金融帐户和存储贵重物品的保险箱。你要开户吗$g先生:女士;？"] = "Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?",
    ["欢迎来到避难所，$n。有些人来这里是有目的的，其余的是凑巧路过……但是每个到这里的人好像都有一个奇特的故事要讲。"] = "Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell.",
    ["欢迎来到钢架补给站！"] = "Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!",
    ["欢迎来暴风城。我们可是花了很长时间才将它重建起来的，但是这些工作都很值得。那么，你是来参观的还是有任务在身？"] = "Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?",
    ["欢迎来观看赛车！希望你喜欢这里，但请记得不要把钱都压在一支车队上。"] = "Welcome to the races!  Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!",
    ["欢迎！上前来，不要害羞。这是我最自豪的发明……冲击者5000型超级大炮！她难道不漂亮吗？她实在就是很漂亮啊！看起来对于炮管的中段来说，你的体型稍微大了一点，但是我想这不是什么大问题。飞行充满了乐趣，你想要学学吗？"] = "Welcome! Step right up, don't be shy. This here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain't she pretty? You look a little big around the mid section, but I think you'll fit. Flying is so much fun, want to learn how?",
    ["欢迎！欢迎来到亚布·尼比盖尔的暗月珍奇馆——这儿有来自世界各地的奇珍异宝！朋友，尽情参观吧！$B$B但是不要动手触摸！神圣的神器和可怕的野兽守护着这些展品！随意触碰的话，它们可能会烧伤你的手……"] = "Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!$B$BBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker...",
    ["欢迎，旅行者！是什么风把你吹来的？"] = "Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?",
    ["正如你所见的一样，我只不过是单枪匹马。黑铁矮人和拉格纳罗斯的爪牙可以轻松把我摆平，但是我对于像你这样勇敢的冒险者充满了信心，你一定可以把大熔炉里的那些东西全部搞定的。如果你愿意帮助我，我会给予你丰富的奖励，那些奖励将是你做梦也想不到的。"] = "As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams.",
    ["死亡矿井位于西部荒野南端月溪镇的地下。"] = "The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall.",
    ["死亡矿井位于西部荒野月溪镇的地下。"] = "The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall.",
    ["死者在这片荒地长眠，$c。我们必须小心，别惊动他们。"] = "The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it.",
    ["每个人都是怎么了？我感到……很冷……"] = "What is happening to everyone?  I feel... cold...",
    ["每天下午6点钟，雷霆崖都会有华丽的焰火表演！"] = "Starting at 6PM, they will show fireworks from the highest bluff!",
    ["每年的这个时候我都会来希利苏斯。这里的气候对治疗我的拇趾囊肿很有帮助。$B$B你应该跟我四处逛逛，朋友。欣赏一下风景什么的。"] = "I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.$B$BYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not.",
    ["比克斯和布里维夫的武器沾满了兽人的鲜血。如果你想学习的话，就去密林武器店找他们吧。"] = "Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain't many weapons they haven't had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training.",
    ["毫无疑问，你是黑暗女王派来接受训练的又一个无能的白痴。$B$B<纳萨诺斯叹息着。>$B$B我每次都得把你们的尸体运回去给她，我想这次也不会有什么例外。$B$B但是，我并不会问什么，我只按照黑暗女王的吩咐办事。"] = "No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion.$B$B<Nathanos sighs.>$B$BI've sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don't see why it will be any different this time.$B$BMine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids.",
    ["氦弹点火和爆炸的过程是没有危险的。跟船只相比，这宝贝能更为快速安全地将你送达幽暗城，途中的景色真是惊心动魄。说到这，在地精飞艇上是不允许吸烟的，旅途中也不允许使用火的法术。"] = "Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip.",
    ["水元素正在跟火元素交战，也就是说他们也在跟我们作战。他们的领袖之一的海达克希斯正在召集士兵……"] = "The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...",
    ["水晶湖边居住着一位名叫艾德勒·费欧德的女士。她利用从当地剥皮师海伦尼那儿得来的皮革为当地的守卫制作补丁。如果你想要学习这项专业技能，她也许就是你要找的人。"] = "Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession.",
    ["水歌长者目前住在灰谷的阿斯特兰纳。"] = "The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home.",
    ["沉没的神庙位于悲伤沼泽东部的一个大湖的中心。"] = "The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows.",
    ["没想到你会来这儿找我的可爱的卡利谈话。很好。这是药水。有没有人说过你是个头脑简单的家伙？"] = "I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?",
    ["没想到你竟如此精通协调管理。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，联盟和部落都已经做好了充分的准备工作。所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，预计将在$2113w天抵达。那是，会有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时战争就真正打响了！"] = "Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within $2113w days. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!",
    ["没有人知道谁制作了暗月卡片，或者他们真正的意图是什么，但是我可以告诉你，在艾泽拉斯各地都可以找到它们，那些试图揭开它秘密的邪恶怪物手中都可能有卡片。  一共有四种类型的暗月卡片；野兽，元素，入口和督军，每种有8张卡片。如果你收集了所有8张一套的卡片，那么你可以把它们交给我们的萨杜斯·帕雷教授，兑换一件强大的饰品。"] = "No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries.There are four types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Elementals, Portals and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket.",
    ["没有人能够从这里偷走东西。从来没有人……从来！"] = "No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!",
    ["没有什么地方比铁炉堡最黑暗的荒弃的洞穴那粒更适合寻找那些阴暗的家伙了。你在那里肯定会找到瑟斯哈特，就象是召唤一个行径卑劣的动物去照他的吩咐办事。"] = "Where better to look for a dark and brooding lot, than the dark section of Ironforge, aptly named The Forlorn Cavern.  Thistleheart is sure to be found there, likely summoning some manner of vile creature to do his bidding.",
    ["没有什么能比在水晶湖钓一天的鱼更惬意的事情了。阿诺德·利兰教我学会了钓鱼。你可以在运河区的码头找到他。  哦，不要相信他告诉你的任何关于运河里有怪物之类的故事。"] = "Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. Oh, and don't believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either.",
    ["没有具备天赋的附魔师，刀刃不可能如此锋利，护甲也不可能如此坚固。塔兰丹就是这样的附魔师，他可以教你如何给武器和护甲附魔。去工匠区找他吧。"] = "Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace.",
    ["没有啊，不过许多其他人都在寻找爱情。你应该从我这里买些爱情信物，洒上一些香水，然后勇敢地出击！"] = "No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!",
    ["没有比编织更好的宁神方法了。"] = "There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave.",
    ["没法帮你，$n。我只训练潜行者。"] = "Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues.",
    ["没错！暗月马戏团很快就要来了！只要我把这些东西从车上卸下来，搭好帐篷弄好场地，就马上开工！别忘了届时过来看看哦！"] = "That's right friend!  The Darkmoon Faire is going to be right here.  Just as soon as I unload those huge wagons, put up all the tents, erect the zoo and pour the drinks.  Make sure you come back!",
    ["没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它更有用！你可以培育出特别的草药来。虽然常青袋是个连新手都能轻松使用的工具，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的报酬。"] = "Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You'll be nurturing and cultivating special seeds.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even a novice to grow something, those who show some aptitude in herbalism will have more bountiful results.",
    ["没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它非常有用！你要做的是用特别的种子来细心培育药草——而不是一遇到风吹草动就挥斧乱砍。虽然你即将得到的常青袋能让最没有经验的新手轻松进行种植工作，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的成果。"] = "Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results.",
    ["治疗技能是给那些无法忍受痛苦的人学习的。如果你一定想学习的话，就去力量山谷上面以西的精神谷找灵魂归宿吧。"] = "Healing is for those who cannot endure pain.  However if you must, seek out the Spirit Lodge on the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up and above the Valley of Strength to the west.",
    ["沿着北边的道路去奥格瑞玛。你可以问问那儿的守卫烹饪训练师在哪儿。"] = "Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer.",
    ["法师们都聚集在法师区的巫师圣殿里，那里有一座高塔。和它相比，我们的兵营就好像是一座农舍。"] = "The magi congregate in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Quite a tower they have there. Makes our barracks look like peasant hovels.",
    ["泰兰德送来了她的问候。月神与我们同在。"] = "Tyrande sends her prayers. The Mother Moon blesses us all.",
    ["泰达希尔有许多你需要去看看的地方。告诉我你在找什么。"] = "There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek.",
    ["泰达希尔海岸边的鱼儿又大又精神。有传言说那是因为我们新的世界之树的快速增长而引起的。"] = "The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause.",
    ["泰龙尼斯制作武器的技能无与伦比。他不会收学生的钱，你该为此感到庆幸。去吧，去达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区找他吧。"] = "The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus.",
    ["洁塞塔经常帮助镇子里的守卫，她是圣光赐予我们的礼物。如果你想学习牧师技能的话，可以去狮王之傲旅店找她。"] = "Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards.  If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion's Pride Inn.",
    ["活到老，学到老。"] = "No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know.",
    ["海伦尼·派特斯金纳有着数年的剥皮经验，他一直为艾德勒·费欧德提供兽皮以制造皮革制品。你可以在水晶湖旁的房间里找到她。"] = "Helene Peltskinner has had years of experience skinning animals for Adele Fielder to make leather items.  You can find Helene in her house by Crystal Lake.",
    ["海格纳·重枪，愿为你效劳！"] = "Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!",
    ["海达克西斯公爵躲到了艾萨拉风暴海湾的某个岛屿上。那些家伙能有什么威胁？"] = "The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?",
    ["温德索尔那天特别爱跟人争吵——相信我，对温德索尔来说，那是一个有纪念意义的伟大成就。他一直在跟我说“感觉有些怪异”。他不是在开玩笑！$B$B当那些肮脏的野兽出击时，我们还在黑石山脉的中央。当然，我指的是兽人。你别分神，好吗？一时之间，叫喊声和铁器的敲击声四起。"] = "Windsor was particularly ornery that day - and believe me, for Windsor, that's a monumental accomplishment. He kept telling me that 'something feels off.' Well he wasn't kidding!$B$BWe were in the middle of Blackrock Mountain when the filthy animals attacked. I'm talking about the orcs, of course. Pay attention, will ya? All you could hear were grunts and the clanging of steel as they rushed us. ",
    ["滚！我只和恐惧魔王打交道，你没资格来跟我说话！"] = "Be gone!  I hold counsel with Dreadlords, and the matters we discuss are not your concern!",
    ["满上一杯啤酒，拉一张凳子过来坐坐。我们要畅饮一番，同时还要分享我们的故事。"] = "Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty.",
    ["潜行者训练者名叫马里恩·考尔。她在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店的阅览室中。"] = "The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call.  You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge.",
    ["灰石长者在提瑞斯法林地的布瑞尔附近打发时间。"] = "Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",
    ["灵魂与你永在，孩子。我能为你做些什么？"] = "Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?",
    ["灵魂告诉我说你会来的，你会出于某种原因来此寻找我，但是你也许自己都不清楚这个原因。那么，你知道你为什么会在这儿吗？"] = "The spirits told me you would come, that you would seek me for some reason, but that even you may not know that reason. So, do you know why you are here?",
    ["灵魂大厅是萨满祭司的家园，它坐落在灵魂高地上。愿你的先祖保佑你。"] = "The Hall of Spirits is where our shamans call home.  You can find it on the Spirit Rise.  May your ancestors watch over you.",
    ["灵魂将你带到我这儿来，感谢他们。"] = "The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them. ",
    ["灵魂引导你来到我这儿。我要怎么帮你？"] = "The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?",
    ["炼金师？这没什么$c。安尼希尔通过不懈地努力，成为了工匠区技艺最纯熟的炼金术士。如果我是你的话，我会马上赶去那儿的。马上！出发吧！"] = "An alchemist?  No trouble at all $c.  Ainethil, in all her labor and toil, has become the most accomplished alchemist in the Craftsmen's Terrace.  I would head over there on the double if I were you. On the double!  Now off with you!",
    ["烹饪是我一生的追求，我觉得我们俩有共同的爱好！"] = "Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!",
    ["焰火表演之后不要走开！拿起高脚杯和你的好朋友一起庆祝吧！"] = "Stick around after the firework show is over.  Find a goblet and raise it to toast your hardy friends!",
    ["焰火表演之后，他们会拿出高脚杯，我们就可以喝酒庆祝啦！"] = "After the firework show, they'll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!",
    ["燃烧平原是个危险的地方，但是我这样的学者将不惜一切代价来获取新知识。"] = "The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge.",
    ["爱情信物是用来向你中意的某个城中的居民表达爱意的小东西。如果对方也对你感兴趣的话，你就可以收到一份爱情的礼物。$B$B如果你已经和别人相爱了，那么至少对方会给你一份代表友谊的礼物。"] = "Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship.",
    ["牛头人热衷于狩猎，这是流淌在我们血液中的灵魂。"] = "Tauren have a passion for hunting; it is something that runs deep with our kind.",
    ["狂欢开始啦！"] = "Faire's a coming!",
    ["狮鹫管理员监管着飞进飞出暴风城的所有狮鹫。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找他吧。"] = "The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed.",
    ["狮鹫？你是要使用空中旅行服务吧，到贸易区的城墙上去找到杜加尔·朗德瑞克就可以了。"] = "Gryphons, eh? Never really cared for the beasts but to each their own.You can find Dungar Longdrink on the rampart in the Trade District.",
    ["猎人大厅的克古尔·血斧将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。"] = "Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise stands ready to help you get to Warsong Gulch.",
    ["猎人训练者名叫索塔尔。去剃刀岭西南部的洞穴中找他吧。"] = "The Hunter Trainer's name is Thotar.  Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill.",
    ["王子不再讲述灰烬使者的故事了吗？在他的诸多故事中，我们最喜欢这个。他的爱好则是寻找灰烬使者的下落。当然，没人能从他口中得知那个故事。"] = "Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.",
    ["王子对奈法利安的巢穴非常感兴趣。如果有谁能杀死巨龙及其属下，并将战斗经过告诉王子，我敢打赌王子会非常满意的。找到灰烬使者之日可待啦！"] = "The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!",
    ["玛加尔的玛加尔布品店在暗巷区里。去科多兽皮工店旁边的大树南边就可以找到他。"] = "Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks.",
    ["玛拉顿位于凄凉之地西部中间的长矛谷中。"] = "Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears.",
    ["玛艾里的容器有很多秘密……用来制作它的碎片是可以反光的，你可以使用它的反光面从其它事物身上吸取能量然后反射到自己身上。$B$B将护符放在你的背包里可以让你聚集魂精，也就是与你战斗的野兽的灵魂力量。一旦你找到魂精，你把它带给玛艾里。"] = "Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari.",
    ["玛艾里知道你为什么找她……$B$B带给我你找到的魂精，我就会为你转换它。"] = "Mau'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you.",
    ["玩得开心吗？"] = "Having a good time?",
    ["现在你该找一位更加渊博的老师了。在菲拉斯的羽月要塞居住着暗夜精灵凯兰娜·风语。她有聪明的头脑；毫无疑问她能继续教你。"] = "It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further.",
    ["现在是你去达纳苏斯跟迈里恩谈谈的时候了。她将对你进行指导。"] = "It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on.",
    ["现在是危险时分，$r。远古的邪魔复活了，他可不管你是部落还是联盟。"] = "These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance.",
    ["现在是危险时期，冒险者。多加小心。"] = "These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly.",
    ["现在是廉价货上市的时候！啦啦啦啦！"] = "'Tis the season for great bargains!  Fah la la la la!",
    ["现在还不行，$g小伙子:姑娘;……我是不会把强大的战羊随意卖给其他人的，你必须首先证明自己是铁炉堡矮人的忠实盟友才行。一旦我确认你在铁炉堡有着显赫的地位，那我会很乐意让你看看我出售的多种战羊的。"] = "Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.",
    ["现在，只有著名的格里高利·维克托医生能提高你的技能啦。你可以在阿拉希高地的落锤镇找到他。"] = "Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall.",
    ["琳沙娜能为你提供所需要的文档，她居住在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。愿你的伙伴为暗夜精灵带来无比的荣耀吧！"] = "Lysheana can offer you the proper documents, she resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeasten Darnassus.  May your fellowship bring glory to the Night Elves!",
    ["瑟银兄弟会懂得如何制造火焰之王的神圣武器，但是我们缺乏人力，无法获得制造武器所需的材料。$B$B我，罗克图斯·暗契，兄弟会赋予我强大的力量，用珍贵的药方来交换从熔火之心收集的材料。$B$B给个价吧，$r。"] = "The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.$B$BI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.$B$BPresent your offer, $r.",
    ["瑟银兄弟会是不会在蚂蚁身上浪费时间的。快滚开！"] = "The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!",
    ["生活就像一幅小心编织的锦缎。"] = "Life is like a carefully woven tapestry.",
    ["生活是一场竞争，“大难不死必有后福”这句俗语并不是始终正确的。有时伤口愈合得很慢，这就是我们需要绑带的原因。灵魂高地的潘德·缚石能教你急救的技能。"] = "Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.",
    ["用大地之母的果实配制药水来帮助我们进行持久抗争是一件光荣的行为。如果你想学习配制药水，就得去北方的雷霆崖。当你到达雷霆崖顶部时，去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你详细的指引的。"] = "Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor.  To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff.  When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions.",
    ["由于我的身份问题，我并未对你说实话，我必须为此向你道歉。我必须确定你是值得信赖的——很少有人能无私地为一个年老的隐士提供帮助。$B$B你已经证明了自己是个正直崇高的人。"] = "I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.$B$BYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor.",
    ["由于职业的不同，因此我对你缺乏技能的现状无能为力。"] = "Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability.",
    ["男孩们女孩们——所有的孩子们——暗月马戏团已经到啦！哈哈！"] = "Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived!  Huzzah!",
    ["瘟疫之地是对付亡灵天灾绝佳的地方！"] = "The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!",
    ["皇家药剂师学会对愚蠢的家伙可没有耐心，我也一样。或许下次我们谈到战马的时候，你会被当作是幽暗城的贵族。到那时……"] = "The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then...",
    ["皮革？哦，我刚收到消息。似乎部落已经收集到$2066w块重皮、$2070w块厚皮和$2073w块硬甲皮，而总的需求量分别是$2067w、$2071w和$2074w。"] = "Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered.",
    ["目前我们对其拉战争的节节胜利可以说是全卡利姆多大陆各个种族共同努力的结果。$B$B但除了士兵之外，我们还需要更多的东西来支撑这场战争，$n。许多商贩和工匠其实都是这场战争中的无名英雄，正是他们一直源源不断地将物资送到前线。"] = "Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.$B$BYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need.",
    ["盯着敌人，$r。看吧，强大的部落足以对付巨龙！所有跟我们做对的人都是这种下场！"] = "Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!",
    ["看啊，竟然有个年轻的$c来看像我这样的老农夫？"] = "What's a young $c like you out visiting an old farmer like me?",
    ["看来你需要通过无尽之海的通道。那你算来对地方了，这儿就是少女之爱号的停泊处，她是这片水域上最好的客船。当船到达后，你就登上甲板，然后用不了多久你就可以躺在荆棘谷的沙滩上晒太阳了。"] = "You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.",
    ["看看你身后，$R。虫巢中的异动使我们周围的土地震动起来。$B$B现在是我们实现一千年前许下的诺言的时候了。沙土飞扬，似乎其拉虫人是在计划开战了。"] = "Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.$B$BThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war.",
    ["看看四周，$c。你身边的朋友并不多，我想你需要证明自己的价值。嗯，或许我应该同意你帮助我们在阿拉希盆地作战。你愿意吗？"] = "Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?",
    ["看看我卖的东西吧，有什么你想要的吗？"] = "Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?",
    ["看看我的肉，朋友。你不会想双手空空就进入贫瘠之地吧。"] = "Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions.",
    ["看看谁来了……有什么要我帮你的吗，$c？"] = "Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, $c?",
    ["看看这些样本！这意味着什么？这意味着什么？我需要时间来解读这些信息。我还需要更多我无法获得的信息……该死！好好想想，拉里斯，好好想想！$B$B你要做什么？什么？！$B$B必须得有解决的方法！"] = "Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I'm going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I'll need more information. Information I can't get... damn! Think, Laris, think!$B$BWhat are you going to do? What?!$B$BThere has to be a solution!",
    ["看看这些科多兽，我的朋友！它们幼年时便开始接受训练，在莫高雷的金色平原长大，这些家伙就是我们出色的坐骑！看看它们吧，看看我们牛头人为什么会依赖于这些强大的生物！"] = "Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!",
    ["看看这条被干掉的龙的脸，$r。部落的强大是毋庸置疑的！"] = "Look to this fallen dragon, $r. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!",
    ["看看这片被蹂躏的土地，你就知道元素的力量了，$r。"] = "Look to this ravaged field and know the power that the elements hold, $r.",
    ["看看野兽的智慧和学识吧，你会认清自己的。你要学会像猫头鹰那样敏锐，像猎豹那样聪明，像狼那样强大。"] = "Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.",
    ["看看，风险投资公司的新伐木机比我的要好多啦，从可拆换的机械臂到控制把手，都是那么棒！我的老板给我下了死命令，但我们却拿不出任何东西。$b$b现在我们自己的设计研制工作已经完全停止了，所以我决定向他们“借”一个。我派维兹克兰克去淤泥沼泽偷一个回来，但他到现在还没音讯！"] = "See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips! My boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything.$b$bNothing was working, so we decided to 'borrow' one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!",
    ["看这边！暗月马戏团开市啦！记得来看看艾泽拉斯最激动人心的集会！"] = "It's here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!",
    ["真冷……我很饿。$B$B我可怜的朋友，希望你已经安息了。我不忍心去想他们会对你做什么。$B$B你！嘿，就是你！请你一定要帮我逃跑。他们之中的某个人身上肯定有钥匙，你能找到它吗？我知道他们有钥匙。如果你弄到钥匙，就可以帮我离开这里了。特雷可能已经死了，但是我还心存希望！求你了，帮帮我吧！"] = "So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?",
    ["真希望与你同行，$n。去暴风要塞吧，跟国王觐见室的塞尔曼·岩拳谈谈，他会帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷的。"] = "And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You'll find Thelman Slatefist in the King's audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley.",
    ["真是无谓的攻击，但是如果银翼要塞的家伙不想要和我们和平相处的话，那么他们还能留给我们什么？去猎人大厅找克古尔·血斧，他将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。"] = "Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch.",
    ["真是细致的工作！你完全有资格获得我将授予你的知识！"] = "Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!",
    ["眼下，我们在这片大陆上只有一处立足之地，但是人类是永远不可能打败我们的。他们很快就会受到报复。我们会割下他们说谎的舌头，惩戒他们的背叛行为。"] = "We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery.",
    ["矮人区的耶诺瓦·石盾是你要找的人。在猎人接受她父亲的训练时，她帮着照看猎人的宠物。"] = "Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you're looking for.  She tends to hunters' pets while they seek training from her father.",
    ["石塔长者眼下应该是在冬泉谷的永望镇。"] = "Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring.",
    ["石墙长者到黑石塔去了。"] = "Elder Stonefort has taken to the dungeons of Blackrock Spire.",
    ["石爪山脉在这片区域拥有许多危险的洞穴。若干冒险家愿意冒着生命的危险到这些洞穴中探险。$B$B$C，也许只要你全心全意地寻找，会找到财宝的。"] = "Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.$B$B$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish.",
    ["矿工？你不需要问有没有，$g小伙子:姑娘;，只需问在哪里！亚尔就是你要找的家伙，我想他应该在钢架补给站那里。"] = "A miner?  Ye don't need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill's Depot.",
    ["研究并了解这些巨甲虫，可以让我们更有把握打败其拉虫人！"] = "Studying and understanding the Colossus will give us a needed advantage over the Qiraji.",
    ["碎手已经在黑石的大本营中安插了数名间谍。尽管信息收集的过程已经慢了下来，但是我们发现了一些不容忽略的现象。"] = "The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored.",
    ["碎手氏族将会见证部落的崛起和荣耀，酋长的懦弱不会阻止我们！"] = "The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief.",
    ["碎手氏族的影响遍布这一地区。我们已经统治了整个卡利姆多——法律，政治，军事，一切的一切。我们无所不知，我们目及一切。$B$B你现在已经成长到能够为我们效力的时候了，$n。是时候让你投入战斗了。$B$B你做好接受下一个任务的准备了吗？"] = "The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?",
    ["碎手氏族的赞杜沙。赞杜沙怎么会帮你？他不能！也绝对不会！"] = "Zando'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando'zan help you? He can't! He won't!",
    ["碎石长者到凄凉之地的玛拉顿去了。"] = "I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Mauradon in the Desolace.",
    ["祖卡斯特是她那个时代最伟大的猎人。最近，她在塞纳里奥区教那些猎人初学者。"] = "Jocaste was the greatest of Hunters of her time.  These days you can find her over in the Cenarion Enclave where she teaches those who are just starting down the Hunter's path.",
    ["祖尔法拉克遗迹位于塔纳利斯沙漠最西北角。"] = "The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert.",
    ["祖尔金总有一天会回来的，$r。记住我的话。在那一天到来之前，我们会尽我们的所能保证森林巨魔族群的昌盛。$B$B作为恶齿村的猎人头领，我的责任就是保证我们的安全。$B$B我必须对这一带的野兽进行监控。$B$B你是不是来找些活干的？"] = "Zul'jin shall return one day, $r. Mark my words. Until then, we all hold our positions and do what we can to keep the forest troll population intact.$B$BWith that said, as master huntsman of Revantusk Village, it is my responsibility to insure that the world around us is safe for habitation.$B$BThe beasts of this area must be kept in check.$B$BAre you looking for work?",
    ["祝你好运，勇敢的$c。我知道你在寻找一匹好战马。告诉你吧$g兄弟:姐妹;，在你所在的区域没有什么比迅猛龙更好的坐骑了！看看我的这些迅猛龙吧——他们的祖先曾经是极其凶猛的野兽。"] = "And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed.  There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.",
    ["离苏米和图米远点。他们会……极力推销他们的东西的。"] = "Stay away from Sumi and Tumi. They are....spoken for.",
    ["种族并不代表荣誉，$r。只要你呆在我的农场，就请你记住并尊重这个信条。$B$B我知道有些兽人，他们像最高贵的骑士那样可敬；我还知道有些人类，他们像最残忍的亡灵天灾那样邪恶。$B$B但是我不会拿我少年时的故事来烦你的！要做的事情还很多——如果那是你所期望的。"] = "Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. ",
    ["秘法大厅的法师彬克也许能帮忙解决你的一些魔法需求。  秘法大厅就在铁炉堡的北部。"] = "That wee wizardly lass, Bink, over in the Hall of Mysteries would probably be able to help ye out with any magical needs you have.  The Hall of Mysteries is just north of the gates of Ironforge.",
    ["穿着迈里恩缝制的衣服，人们可能会以为她的绣花针是被月神赐福过的。除非你的针也受过同样的祝福，否则你最好去拜访她一次并聆听她的教导。你可以在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区找到她。"] = "With the garments that Me'Lynn tailors, one might think that her needle was blessed by Elune herself.  Unless your needle is so blessed, you best pay her a visit and listen to her teachings.  You can find her in The Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.",
    ["突然之间，你成为了“联盟的保卫者”，是吗？！嗯，我猜你一定是想去勇士大厅。大厅就在旧城区，但是你不是官员，守卫是不会让你进去的，你只能跟埃雷恩谈谈。去吧。"] = "All of a sudden you're a 'Defender of the Alliance' are you?! Well, I suppose you'll be wanting to head to the Champions' Hall now. It's over in Old Town, but they won't let you in unless you're an officer, so you might just have to settle for talking to Officer Areyn outside. Move along now.",
    ["符文图腾长者应该是往杜隆塔尔的剃刀岭去了。"] = "Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar.",
    ["第一次看见亡灵时，我哭了，我无法想象他们的恐惧和孤寂。大地之母在我耳边吟唱，她告诉我：“拯救他们吧。”"] = "When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, 'Save them.'",
    ["等一下，我只是一个助手。如果你想学那些花哨的东西，找那边的老约莫德·石眉谈谈。"] = "Hold on there, I'm just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there.",
    ["米歇尔·贝利对病患的态度令人钦佩！她也许无法教你如何对待病人，但是她可以教你一些急救技巧。她现在居住在狮王之傲旅店。"] = "Michelle Belle's bedside manner is remarkable!  While she might not be able to teach you that, she surely could teach you some proper First Aid.  She currently resides in the Lion's Pride Inn.",
    ["索尔芬·石盾从铁炉堡而来，让我们见识到了什么叫真正的狩猎艺术。如果你不介意被烟熏得泪流满面，就到矮人区去找他吧。他的屋子就在那个区域的东北部。"] = "Thorfin Stoneshield came to us all the way from Ironforge to bring us his expertise in hunting.  If you don't mind breathing the smoke filled air of the Dwarven District then you'll find him at his house in the northeast area of the district.",
    ["约翰,亲爱的,你在哪里?"] = "John, honey, where are you?",
    ["约翰森不想让提尔斯知道他还在闪光平原，所以他把自己变成了一只小鸡！$B$B如果你找到约翰森，就冲他招招手。没准他会跑过来的。"] = "Plucky doesn't want Tirth to know he's still in the Shimmering Flats, so he turned himself into a chicken!$B$BIf you find Plucky, beckon him to you.  Maybe he'll come out of hiding.",
    ["约翰森？我认为他在附近的某个地方……"] = "Johnson?  I think he's around here somewhere...",
    ["约莫德·石眉对缝纫有独到之处，真的。如果你想接受训练的话，就去大熔炉北边的石眉布衣店找他吧。"] = "That Jormund Stonebrow has a knack for the needle, he does.  Should you be needing some training, then you'll find him at Stonebrow's Clothier on the northern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["纳拉雷克斯又陷入了沉睡！$b$b很久以前，纳拉雷克斯曾满怀着进入翡翠梦境、让贫瘠之地重新变成茂密森林的伟大理想而来到了这处洞穴中。但他的执着却逐渐消退了，而他的思想也被脑海蜿蜒的影象所侵染。$b$b现在，那些奇怪的爬虫正从他的梦境中爬到这片土地上来，我们必须把他从梦魇中唤醒过来，否则他就将永远失落于其中，并继续给这片大地带来邪恶的力量！$b$b不过，只有杀死他那些堕落的仆人——毒牙之王，我才能开始进行唤醒仪式。"] = "Naralex sleeps again!$b$bLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.$b$bNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.$b$bOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual.",
    ["纳瑞安为您效劳！退隐的工程学专家和占卜大师！我敢打包票！"] = "Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!",
    ["纳迪娅·织发离开自己的家园前往达纳苏斯进修去了。她精通制革，而且是一名优秀的老师。你该去向她求教。"] = "The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you.",
    ["纳迪娅在数年的实践中掌握了制皮技术。沿着通往达纳苏斯的道路向西走，去拜访她，或许她能传授给你一些知识呢。"] = "Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you.",
    ["终于！终于从这破牢房里逃出来了！$b$b肯瑞托将我从达拉然派到这个银松森林里来，要我调查阿鲁高和他的亡灵仆从们的活动，可我们却一点也不知道那个巫师已经完全失去了理智。$b$b我必须立刻把这个消息汇报上去！可在我离开之前，让我先把庭院门上的魔法锁给打开。$b$b既然你能击败雷希戈尔，或许也能从前面的层层埋伏中杀出一条血路……"] = "At last! I am finally free from this cell!$b$bThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.$b$bI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.$b$bYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond....",
    ["终于！终于有人把我从这破牢房里给救出来了！$b$b高级执行官哈德瑞克大人派我们来这儿收集这座要塞里的信息，以便制定一个能永久消灭铲除阿鲁高的计划。$b$b但那个老不死的巫师还真有点能耐，我们很快就被他的魔法结界给发现了。我被抓来关在这里，不过文森特可就没这么走运了。$b$b我得马上回去向哈德瑞克大人汇报。首先我会把庭院里的锁给你打开，或许你这么强悍的$c能从前面的一大堆伏兵里杀出一条血路……"] = "At last! Someone to free me from this cell!$b$bHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.$b$bBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.$b$bI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond.",
    ["终于，诅咒解除了。谢谢你，英雄。"] = "At last, the curse is lifted. Thank you, hero.",
    ["经历了多年的战乱和奴役生活，再次拥有一个家园的感觉真好。"] = "So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again. ",
    ["经瓦里玛萨斯大人批准，亡灵哨兵的数量增加了。我们将进一步加强打击敌人的力度。"] = "With the sanction of Lord Varimathras, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it.",
    ["给你看看你得到了什么！我承诺，你不会有遗憾的！"] = "Show me what you got! You won't be sorry, I promise!",
    ["给我点时间，要记录的数据很多。看来我们已经收集到$2066w块重皮、$2070w块厚皮和$2073w块硬甲皮了，总的需求量分别是$2067w、$2071w和$2074w。"] = "Give me a moment; there are a lot of numbers to remember here. It looks like we have $2066w of $2067w heavy leather skins collected. As well, we have $2070w out of $2071w thick leather, and $2073w of $2074w rugged leather stockpiled.",
    ["给部落做衣服与其余的工作同样重要。你该到雷霆崖防具店里面寻找坦帕。她对针线活有自己的天赋。"] = "Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle.",
    ["继续培训你已经超越我的能力了。与达纳苏斯工匠区的泰龙尼斯谈谈。他总是很愿意帮助有才能的学生。"] = "Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students.",
    ["维尔拉·幼蹄在村子西边的房子中进行训练。"] = "Vira Younghoof keeps her practice inside the long house on the west side of the village.",
    ["维斯派塔斯的角鹰兽会送你到达目的地的。穿过达纳苏斯西部入口，去鲁瑟兰村找他吧。"] = "Vesprystus' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.",
    ["绷带、抗毒药品这些东西在草原生活中是不可缺少的必需品。维尔拉·幼蹄能教你如何制作它们。你可以在血蹄村西边的房子中找到她。"] = "Bandages, anti-venoms and such things, these are the inevitable necessities of life on the plains.  Vira Younghoof can teach you this knowledge.  You can find her in the long house on the west side of Bloodhoof Village.",
    ["绷带？为什么，你需要绷带救命吗？哈哈！很好，$R，我会告诉你的。我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带了，总的需求量是$2080w根。另外，到目前为止，我们拥有$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，总的需求量分别是$2086w和$2090w。"] = "Bandages? Why, do you intend to survive long enough to need them? Har! Very well, $r, I will tell you. Of the $2080w wool bandaged needed, we have collected $2079w. Also to date, we have taken in $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages, and $2089w of $2090w runecloth bandages asked for.",
    ["缝纫需要娴熟的手法，以及……也是最重要的，耐性。"] = "Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience.",
    ["美酒良辰！尽情地喝吧，我的朋友，尽情地狂欢吧！"] = "The kegs are filled with strong brew!  Drink, friend, and celebrate!",
    ["翡翠议会试图治愈费伍德森林受伤的大地。尽管这片大地是以腐蚀它的东西命名，我们还是希望有一天我们能从这片土地中将腐败清除。"] = "The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land.",
    ["考虑清楚，$g小子:姑娘;——我可没心情听你废话。我在这里的工作是确认大德鲁伊的研究工作正在按计划进行，而不是跟那些不愿为塞纳里奥议会效劳的家伙聊天。"] = "Be advised, $g Jackson : Princess; - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny.  I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle.",
    ["肃静！我不能漏掉这次讲座任何一句话！"] = "Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!",
    ["肉、兽皮、骨头……好的猎人是不会浪费任何东西的。每块兽皮都有利用价值，也许能用来增强盟友的武器装备。单独来看，我们每个人都很强大，但是团结在一起我们就无敌了。"] = "Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally's armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible.",
    ["肤质很好。它将你包裹其中。你也许已经注意到我的皮肤不是那么好。我过去常常担心自己的毛孔。这些日子我几乎不担心皮肤了。在某种程度上，它得到了解放。"] = "Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing.",
    ["胆大的约翰森？我听说塔顶的赛场主管科鲁克莱德知道他在哪儿。"] = "Plucky?  I heard race master Kronkrider up on the the tower knows where he is.",
    ["能看到一张友善的脸真不错。我没有跟药剂师乔汉聊过很多，除非他想要什么东西。他离开坟墓太久了。有一天我也会像他一样，我听说。真可怕。或许到那时我就不在乎了。"] = "Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care.",
    ["能问些不这么愚蠢的问题吗？你真不知道吗？$B$B要是你胆子小，怕死的话，就去燃烧平原和灼热峡谷的生物身上去找黑铁碎片。$B$B要是你够狠够胆大，干脆杀进黑石塔和黑石深渊算了，那里的黑铁碎片更多。"] = "Is this a serious question? You really don't know?$B$BIf you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.$B$BIf you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps.",
    ["自从我的丈夫上了前线后，海伦尼便一直保护着我。她用善良的心肠和锋利的宝剑帮助我度过了无数艰难岁月。没有她，我真不知道会发生什么事。"] = "Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her.",
    ["自从阴影占据了暮色森林我就一直无法入睡。我总是被风中传来的可怕尖叫声惊醒。那听起来好像羔羊的叫声，而且声音从不会停止。"] = "Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop.",
    ["自然会提供我们所需的一切。跟中部高地中层克米恩·冰蹄谈谈草药学吧。"] = "Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.",
    ["艰难时期，嗯，$n？谁都需要帮助，我和我妻子也不例外。"] = "Rough times, huh, $n? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception.",
    ["艾尔丁是艾尔文森林中唯一称得上裁缝的人。要是你对这个专业感兴趣，就去东谷伐木场找他吧。"] = "Eldrin is the only one in Elwynn Forest that I would call a tailor.  You can find him at the Eastvale Lumber Camp if you're interested in learning the profession.",
    ["艾德勒·费欧德的皮革手艺在艾尔文森林已经妇孺皆知了。她的家就在水晶湖旁边。"] = "Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake.",
    ["艾格文的唯一子嗣，最后一任提瑞斯法的守护者……麦迪文。"] = "Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh.",
    ["艾泽拉斯中没有哪一个种族经历过我们的人民所受的磨难，$c。面对死亡仍安之若素已经成为我们的第二天性了。"] = "No other race on Azeroth has suffered as much as our people, $c. To laugh in the face of death has become second nature for all of us.",
    ["花和种子以及类似的东西？那是雷纳·石枝的专业领域。你能在大熔炉南面的铁炉堡医师协会处看到她料理她的植物。"] = "Flowers and seeds and such?  That would be Reyna Stonebranch's area of expertise.  Ye can find her tending to her plants over at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge.",
    ["花？在这片荒芜的土地上？如果有人能教你如何找到它们，那就是南方的森金村的米什基。"] = "Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south.",
    ["苏亚米在旅馆前面。去吧，我正忙着呢。"] = "Shoja'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I'm busy.",
    ["苏尔德将教你如何练习技能。去暗巷区的科多兽皮工店找他吧。"] = "Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag.",
    ["苏萨斯……第一次听到这个词的时候，我还和你一样大。那个时候这个词对我来说没有什么意义，就好像现在它对你没有什么意义一样。但是当一群巨魔从祖尔法拉克来到这里肆意妄为之后，这个词就变成了恐惧的代名词。$B$B这里的人都会告诉你那把剑并不存在，那只是一个神话，一个用来吓唬小孩子的故事。但是，$c，请相信我，它确实存在。$B$B<说到这里，特伦顿不禁开始用手抚摸自己脸上累累的伤疤。>"] = "Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.$B$BMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children 'straight.' But believe me, $r, it exists.$B$B<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>",
    ["草地柔软青葱。空气清新，阳光明媚，歌声飘飘。泰达希尔的梦想终成现实。但是为什么我感到有种不详的预兆？"] = "The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?",
    ["草药……你需要前往暗巷区，去加迪的植物园找她谈谈。在智慧谷阿索兰的市场后面有木制的阶梯。沿着阶梯可以到达暗巷区的上层。"] = "Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her.",
    ["草药师博米洛伊为居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一名炼金师收集草药。去他的住所找草药师博米洛伊，看她是否能对你有所指引。"] = "Ms. Pomeroy gathers herbs for an Alchemist who lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind.  Check for her at his cottage and see if she'll show you the profession.",
    ["草药的收集和与之相关的知识是菲罗迪恩·唤月的专长。去达纳苏斯西南部的神殿花园找他吧。"] = "The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.",
    ["草药，草药，嗯，让我看看。啊，是的。到目前为止我们已经收集到$2047w份荆棘藻、$2053w份紫莲花和$2057w份阿尔萨斯之泪，而总的需求量分别是$2048w、$2055w和$2058w。"] = "Herbs, herbs, hmmm, let me see here. Ah yes, here it is. To date we have accumulated $2047w out of $2048w stranglekelp, $2053w out of $2055w purple lotuses, and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed.",
    ["莫兰塔可以教你如何剥皮。你可以在中部高地的卡恩铁匠铺旁找到她。"] = "Mooranta can help you learn skinning.  She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.",
    ["菲拉斯的土地经历了岁月的洗礼，$r。大地、树木和生物，它们改变着菲拉斯的现状和未来。$B$B跟这儿所发生的一切相比，双塔山可以算是亘古不变的了……"] = "The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.$B$BThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here...",
    ["萨尔在他的领地里给了我一片安身立命之所，展示出了无比的宽容与善良。我也不想在这里停留得过久。否则，如果我给我们的领袖带来了麻烦，那实在是太耻辱了。"] = "Thrall has shown great kindness in granting me sanctuary within his domain.  I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate.  It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our leader.",
    ["萨尤斯与他的牧师在精神谷那的灵魂小屋里。去力量谷上方西侧的湖泊那里可以找到他。"] = "Zayus and his priests are in the Spirit Lodge, which is in the Valley of Spirits.  Look for it on the lake up above and to west of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["萨弗隆铁锭？！？？！不可能！我必须得到它！必须！必须！$B$B$R，我会花大价钱购买铁锭的。或许你会对炎魔拉格纳罗斯之手之谜感兴趣？就是萨弗拉斯，白痴！传说中火元素之王使用的铁锤。"] = "A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!$B$B$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord.",
    ["葬影村的乌兰可以卖给你“中级烹饪教材”。如果你想要提高烹饪技能的话，就需要这本书。"] = "Wulan in Shadowprey Village can sell you the 'Expert Cookbook'.  You will need that if you are to better yourself.",
    ["蓝龙玛里苟斯不在那儿，但是他的信徒在。我不清楚这是怎么回事，但是我可以告诉你：蓝龙所在的地方都有希望找到神秘的魔法。如果说龙人在这儿保护某种东西的话，我是不会感到惊讶的……或许是上层精灵遗漏的物品。"] = "The blue dragons themselves aren't here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn't be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind.",
    ["虽然亡灵受到重创，但是他们还是赶来帮助我们。我只希望我们也能对他们有所帮助。去灵魂高地下面的预见之池附近寻找柯布神父。"] = "Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.",
    ["虽然十字路口似乎是贫瘠之地的中心地带，但是我更喜欢陶拉祖营地的安静。你想去哪儿？"] = "Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?",
    ["虽然在布瑞尔没有工程学训练师，在幽暗城却有一位。要到那儿，朝村子的南边走，一直到洛丹伦废墟，然后坐电梯下去。一旦你到了那里，向一位幽暗城守卫询问详细的方位。"] = "While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity.  To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down.  Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions.",
    ["虽然塞拉摩以它特有的武士培训闻名，我恐怕还是不能帮你。"] = "While Theramore is reknown for it's exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you.",
    ["虽然我们在血蹄村没有炼金术训练师，在北面的雷霆崖却有一位。沿着这条路去那儿，当你到达顶部时再向一位雷霆崖守卫询问具体方位。"] = "While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top.",
    ["虽然我们把这块土地称作贫瘠之地，但对于睿智者来说，这里到处都是生命。"] = "Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life.",
    ["虽然我很高兴听到你对我的能力充满信心，但我真的没法再教你了。你必须到达纳苏斯的工匠区去找暗夜精灵安尼希尔谈谈。她可以帮助你。"] = "Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you.",
    ["虽然我被关在这间小屋里，但是我梦想着加入城墙外激烈的战斗。然而，职责迫使我为替我战斗的那些人传授知识……"] = "Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now.",
    ["虽然每次我都使用了相同的成分，但配制出的药水似乎都达不到预期的治疗效果。这只能得出一个结论：植物发生了变化。我还不清楚具体原因。"] = "This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what.",
    ["虽然现在是和平时期，但是我们可不能荒废了我们的战斗技能！"] = "The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!",
    ["蛮锤城堡的矮人也许有奔跑迅速的战马，但是这些鹰巢山的狮鹫能承受大熔炉的热量吗？我觉得不能！"] = "The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge?  I think not!",
    ["蛮鬃长者的家在塔纳里斯沙漠的祖尔法拉克。"] = "Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home.",
    ["血色修道院位于提瑞斯法林地东北部的山坡上。"] = "Scarlet Monastery lies in the hills northeast of Tirisfal Glades.",
    ["血蹄长者在莫高雷的血蹄村里。"] = "Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",
    ["被偷啦，$r！我们最珍贵的三卷卷轴。如果你能找回来的话，一定会得到丰厚的报酬的。"] = "They've been stolen, $r! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours.",
    ["裁缝可以派得上大用场。我从前就不得不把我的胳膊缝上。"] = "Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on.",
    ["裁缝所需的多数物品都是从达纳苏斯获得的。他们都在那儿工作，这并不是件奇怪的事情。要是你想成为一名裁缝的话，你最好前往达纳苏斯。"] = "Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus.",
    ["西方的水晶塔接受红色，绿色和蓝色的水晶。$B$B塔门关键是要用红色水晶作为力量源泉而产生的能量。可能有两种结果：一种能提高你的防御力，而另一种则是削弱敌人的防御。$B$B防御水晶需要红色和绿色的水晶。这将会使你的装甲更完备。$B$B破甲水晶需要蓝色和红色的水晶。这将会削弱即定目标的装甲防御。"] = "The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.$B$BThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy's defenses.$B$BCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.$B$BCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target.",
    ["要不是侏儒的狗屎运，他们就永远不会赢！"] = "If it weren't for that cursed, gnomish luck, they'd never win a race!",
    ["要不是因为这酒吧，我的空闲时间就只能用来剥龙鳞啦。"] = "If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.",
    ["要不是地精的狗屎运，他们每次都会把车撞进山里去！"] = "If it weren't for the goblins' inconceivable, dumb luck, they'd crash their car during every race!",
    ["要保护部落在灰谷的木材收集工作并不容易，但是我们从不畏惧战斗！暗夜精灵和他们的盟友必将失败！"] = "It is no easy task to protect the Horde's lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle!  The night elves and their allies will fall!",
    ["要做的事情很多！自从我的兄弟不小心蒸发了诺莫瑞根所有的衣料和皮革之后，事情便多起来了。我只能保持暂时通风！啊，$n，那些日子……"] = "Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, $n, those were the days....",
    ["要学习如何处理皮革，你得去北面的奥格瑞玛。那儿的守卫会告诉你如何找到制皮训练师的。"] = "To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer.",
    ["要学习草药学，你得向玛洛尼好好讨教。去多兰纳尔旅馆东边找他吧。"] = "Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["要学急救的话，没有比光明大教堂的珊娜·弗勒更好的老师了。  去找她吧，去有黄色屋顶的房子就是教堂样式的房子，在那儿顶上你能俯瞰整个城市。"] = "No better place to learn First Aid than under the watchful eye of Shaina Fuller at the Cathedral of Light.  To get there, just look for the yellow rooftops, or the towering spire of the Cathedral itself which you can see from almost anywhere in the city.",
    ["要将这些桶运送到挖掘点非常困难，但是要获得火药，还得靠我们自己。$B$B我们必须竭尽所能地对抗黑铁！"] = "Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!",
    ["要建立公会的话是需要相应文件的，乔多·钢眉能帮助你处理这些程序。如果你都准备好了的话，就去铁炉堡访客中心找他吧。"] = "Well now, ye'll need papers to form a guild, and Jondor Steelbrow can help you get started with the process.  He can be found over at the Ironforge Visitor's Center when yer ready to get started.",
    ["要我训练你？别开玩笑了——我们都知道这是不可能的。我可无法胜任。你要是想接受训练的话，就去幽暗城的炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生吧。"] = "Me, train you? Come on--we both know I can't. It's this teaching, you see. My own skills suffer. You want training, go to Doctor Herbert Halsey, a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",
    ["要教你学会驾驶机械陆行鸟，那简直就是在浪费我的金钱和时间，$c。你的体形太庞大了！"] = "I'd be wasting both your gold and my time if I were to teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.  You're just too large!",
    ["要是你想做潜行者的话，就该去找塞尤娜。她居住在西部森林盘旋山道下的塞纳里奥区。"] = "It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue's path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree.",
    ["要是你想学习制皮的话，就去铁炉堡吧。我听说大锻炉附近有间商店，你可以那儿学到制皮的知识。"] = "If ye're looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye're gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there's a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession.",
    ["要是你想学习草药学，就必须去雷霆崖。出了血蹄村，沿着北边的路走，然后乘坐电梯到达山顶。你可以问问雷霆崖的守卫获取帮助。"] = "If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance.",
    ["要是你想成为一名战士，就得去找克朗·石蹄。你能在村子的东南角找到他，他通常就在那儿训练学生。"] = "If it is the way of the Warrior that you crave then you must seek out Krang Stonehoof.  You will find him in the southeast corner of the village at his training circle, often instructing his other students.",
    ["要是你想找猎人的话，就去拜访达扎拉吧。他通常在多兰纳尔旅店的外面。"] = "If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.",
    ["要是你想找银行的话，就去达纳苏斯的中央地带。你可以在那儿存储自己的财宝。"] = "If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures.",
    ["要是你想接受训练的话，就去找科瑞恩。她通常在铁匠铺外面等着铁匠打造武器。"] = "Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training.  She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished.",
    ["要是你想组建公会的话，那你首先需要通过铁炉堡访客中心的乔多·钢眉的认同。穿过铁炉堡大门往东南方向走，你就能找到他。"] = "If yer thinking about forming a guild, then ye'll need to put it past Jondor Steelbrow o'er in the Ironforge Visitor's Center.  Just head southeast from the gates of Ironforge to see him.",
    ["要是你想要组建公会的话，你必须去见公会管理人琳沙娜。她在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。"] = "If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.",
    ["要是你想要飞回雷霆崖，就该跟我的牛头人搭档布瑟恩·草风谈谈。"] = "If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind.",
    ["要是你愿意的话，除了训练之外，我还可以用自己的力量将天赋从你的头脑中抹去。我要警告你的是，你每经历一次这样的过程，执行这过程的难度就会增加一分，而且所需的费用也会随之上升。"] = "If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes.",
    ["要是你是来找世界上最富经验的工匠，你就找对地方啦！$B$B格瑞曼德·艾尔默，愿为你效劳！"] = "If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place!$B$BGrimand Elmore, at your service!",
    ["要是你要找旅馆的话，石火旅店是个不错的选择。若是你前往铁炉堡的话，会在城门的左边找到这个旅馆；要是在铁炉堡里面的话，它就在城门的右边。$B$B哦，要是你现在就去那里的话，告诉他们为我准备好啤酒吧。"] = "If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  $B$BOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me.",
    ["要是你问我的话，没有比矿工更好的职业了，也没有比矮人更好的矿工了！"] = "If you ask me, there's no greater profession than a miner.  And if you ask me, there's no greater miner than a dwarf!",
    ["要是你需要一些公会登记表的话，就前往铁炉堡，去拜访铁炉堡访客中心吧。"] = "If ye need to get yer hands on some guild creation papers ye'll have to head up to Ironforge and visit the Ironforge Visitor's Center.",
    ["要是我向萨鲁证明了自己的实力，他将别无选择，只能让我为他的一个女儿而战。让我们看看谁是失败的那个吧。"] = "If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering.",
    ["要是我有栗子的话，你最好相信我会将它们烤熟吃掉的。嗯！"] = "If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire.  Mmmm!",
    ["要是我能的话，我会教你的，但我力所不及。去跟雷霆崖中央高地西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳谈谈。她拥有真正的才能。"] = "I'd train you if I could, but you're too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's got some real talent.",
    ["要是我计算正确的话，这车轮很快就会作废的！"] = "If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!",
    ["要是有人给我个吻就好了，你知道我在哪里可以找到一个吻吗？"] = "I sure could use a kiss about now.  Know where I can find one?",
    ["要是海达克西斯招募了新兵，就可能使双方的力量对比发生变化……"] = "If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...",
    ["要是离天黑还有些时间的话……"] = "If there were just a few more hours in a day...",
    ["要照料宠物吗？你得确保它的清洁！去旅馆前面找苏亚米吧。"] = "Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja'my in front of the inn.",
    ["要赢得这场战争，我们不能坐在这里，静待战争之潮将我们淹没。我们必须果断出击，否则阿拉希永远也不会成为我们的囊中之物。"] = "To win this war, we can't sit idle and let the tides sweep us over.  We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours.",
    ["见到你是我的荣幸，$n，但是你在配制药水方面比我厉害。去幽暗城 炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他能帮助你。"] = "I'm honored to meet you, $n, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on.",
    ["角鹰兽是一种高贵而迅捷的动物。这些训练有素的飞兽可以让它们的骑手以很快的速度旅行。"] = "The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance.",
    ["让圣光保佑你一路平安。如果你需要需要任何帮助，就来找我吧。"] = "May the light guide your path and aid you in your journies. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here.",
    ["让开，你这败狗！就算是里维加兹饶恕了我，不送我上绞刑架，我也感觉我的报应就快要来了。"] = "Gangway, ye scurvy dog!  Revilgaz has spared me from the gallows but my punishment might be nearly as bad.",
    ["让我们看看你的能力，好吗？要是你按要求完成任务，我会乐意教你的！"] = "Let's see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I'll spend the time to teach you!",
    ["让我看看……14加7，得1进2……是吗？"] = "Let's see... fourteen plus seven, carry the two... oh, yes?",
    ["让我看看，让我看看。我有做过记录的。啊，找到了！到目前为止，联盟已经收集到$2047w份荆棘藻、$2053w份紫莲花和$2057w份阿尔萨斯之泪，而总的需求量分别是$2048w、$2055w和$2058w。"] = "Let me see, let me see. I had those numbers here somewhere. Ah yes, here they are! To date, the Alliance has collected $2047w stranglekelp, out of $2048w needed. It also says here that we have $2053w of $2055w purple lotus and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed.",
    ["让矮人从铁炉堡指派一名采矿专家来教教我们吧。使用锄头打碎岩石有多困难？嗯，只要他在这儿，你就只管问他好了。他名叫吉尔曼，居住在矮人区。"] = "Leave it to the dwarves to send a mining specialist from Ironforge to tell us how to mine.  How hard is it to take a pick and chip away at some rock?  Well, since he's here, he's probably the one you should see anyhow.  His name is Gelman and he resides over in the Dwarven District.",
    ["记住，所有的事物都是有关联的。如果陆地上的野兽灭绝，我们的种族将在孤独中死去，因为牛头人和野兽的命运是相通的，而艾泽拉斯的命运和所有艾泽拉斯上的生灵的命运也休戚相关。"] = "Remember, all things are connected. If the beasts were gone from the land, our kind would die from a great loneliness of spirit, for whatever happens to the beasts also happens to the Tauren. Whatever befalls Azeroth befalls all those that inhabit it. ",
    ["记得我的话！你在东部王国是找不到比塞尔萨玛狮鹫更快的狮鹫的！"] = "Mark my words!  You won't find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!",
    ["许多人来到这个避难所，少数人却离开了。"] = "Many have come to this sanctuary, few have left. ",
    ["诅咒神教正在迅速壮大。从小型村落到首都，从部落到联盟，几乎每座城镇的居民中都有诅咒神教的信徒。$B$B别惊讶，他们只在仪式和庆典上面才身穿统一的服饰。你很可能已经跟他们的信徒碰过面了，只是你不知道而已。"] = "The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.$B$BDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known.",
    ["试炼谷能将最软弱的新兵锻炼成一名合格的部落战士。无法通过试炼者将被抛弃，独自忍受骄阳的煎烤。"] = "The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun.",
    ["说也奇怪，兽栏管理员莫加努斯就在马厩外面。"] = "Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough.",
    ["请不要打扰古老的灵魂。"] = "Please, leave an old spirit in peace.",
    ["请告诉冬天爷爷是什么秘密让你想要得到冬幕！"] = "Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!",
    ["请尽量不要引起太多注目，我正在等待国王的召见。我并不介意多等一会儿，这儿到处是身材魁梧的守卫，我感到非常安全。"] = "Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the King to grant me audience.  Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards.",
    ["请进，请进！不要坐得离火炉太近。它今天还没爆炸，但是为了安全起见，我想你还是坐在别的地方比较好。"] = "Come in, come in. Just don't sit too close to the stove. It hasn't exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere.",
    ["诸如公会登记表等文档可从达纳苏斯的公会注册员那儿获得。"] = "Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.  ",
    ["诺莫瑞根在丹莫洛的西边。"] = "Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh.",
    ["诺莫瑞根的流亡者需要大量的布料资源！也许你可以帮帮我们，是不是？$B$B把你多余的布料资源带给我们。通过捐献它们，你可以获得所有侏儒的尊重。这是金钱无法换的的！好吧，布料可以帮助我们，但是它们意义绝不限于这些……"] = "The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves!  Perhaps you can help us, eh?!$B$BBring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks.  By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere.  That's something that money can't buy!  Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point...",
    ["谁派你来的？你还没有准备好接受我的指令！当你们准备好以后会得到通知的。"] = "Who sent you here? You're not ready for my instruction yet! You'll be told when you're ready.",
    ["谁说兽人不聪明？当工程师很费脑筋的！"] = "Who says orcs aren't smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!",
    ["谢尔比·石火帮当地猎人看管宠物。如果你想让她帮你照看宠物的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找她吧。"] = "Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet.",
    ["谢谢你救了我！$B$B我是一名来自暴风城的厨师兼炼金师。我到这儿来是要帮我叔叔安古斯寻找草药和食物的，但是这些野猪人将我抓了起来。要不是你赶过来的话，我想我已经被它们煮着吃了。"] = "Thank you for saving me!$B$BI'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!",
    ["谢谢你！你让我自由了！"] = "Thank you!  You freed me!",
    ["谢谢你！我注定会在达隆郡之战中身亡，但是你让我获得了自由！"] = "Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!",
    ["谢谢你，$n。你安抚了我死去的妻子的灵魂，我将永远无法报答你的恩情。$B$B我想我会永远仇视野猪人，但是现在我已经得到了满足。$B$B我必须开始重建生活。"] = "I thank you, $n. Your dedication to my plea gives rest to my lost wife's spirit, and for that I could never repay you enough.$B$BI cannot say that my hatred will ever cease for the quilboar, but it is satiated for now.$B$BNow I must begin to rebuild my life.",
    ["谢谢你，现在我们能解开水晶和神秘的水晶塔的秘密了，$n。要是你需要更多信息，请随时回来找我！"] = "Thanks to you, we can now unlock the secrets of the crystals and the mysterious pylons, $n. If you need more information at any time, please come back and visit me again!",
    ["贫瘠之地阳光灼热，那儿的居住者充满敌意，是考验你的力量和决心的最佳地点。"] = "The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude.",
    ["贸易区刚刚开放了一座拍卖行。如果你沿着银行东南方的路走，很容易就能找到贸易区。"] = "One has opened up on the Tradesman's Terrace.  If you take the path leading Southeast from the bank, it should be easy to find.",
    ["费伍德的某些植物或许能因为塞纳里奥植物药膏的效用而避免堕落。我知道如何从几种不同的东西中获取这种药膏，凭借你的能力，你会发现有多种方法可以协助我制造药膏。$B$B首先，你需要一盏塞纳里奥信标，它是一种能让你看到肉眼所看不到的堕落和腐烂力量的装置。"] = "There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.",
    ["费布·钢轴在大熔炉西北面开了一家商店。我打赌他能教你学会制作精良的装甲。"] = "Fimble Finespindle has a shop set up on the northwest side of The Great Forge.  I wager he could show ye how to make some fine armor.",
    ["赞扎能制造古老的附魔物品。这种魔法可以帮助你打败哈卡和他的爪牙。$B$B我只要你帮我找3种东西。我承认有一样东西不是必需的，但是我想净化那些高等精灵的魔法。"] = "Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. This magic will help you in defeating Hakkar and his minions.$B$BI only ask that you bring me two items.",
    ["赞美圣光，终于有人对召唤做出了回应。"] = "Praise the Light, one has finally answered the calling.",
    ["赞美月神！你在寻找我们的战歌峡谷军官？她的名字叫做伊萨拉斯，她就在战士训练师的旁边等着你。"] = "Elune be praised!  You seek out our Warsong Gulch Battlemaster?  Her name is Aethalas, and she stands ready to greet you near the warrior trainers.",
    ["赞美艾露恩！好些年都没有人来拜访我了。"] = "Praise Elune! It has been many years since I have had visitors.",
    ["赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉，历经艰险才来到此地，但是这一切却招致我们的厄运……"] = "The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom...",
    ["赫加斯掌握的知识远胜于我。你得去石爪山脉的太阳石居所找他，继续训练。"] = "There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training.",
    ["趁现在还有机会，过来看看我的货物吧。我们要在这儿呆上一周，然后就要动身去远方啦。"] = "Come and take a look at my wares while you still can.  We're here all week, and then we're off to some far off land.",
    ["跟燃烧的铁砧的萨鲁·钢怒谈谈。沿着红石谷矿业工会右边的道路走到尽头，去那得荣誉谷找他吧。"] = "Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It's at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining.",
    ["身上又多了一种材料$g小伙子:姑娘;，是吧？嗯，如果你携带的物品过多的话，可以将它们存储在城中心的达纳苏斯银行中。"] = "Another material $gboy : girl; are we?  Well, if you are obsessed with your precious items then you will probably want to store them at the Darnassus Bank in the center of our city.",
    ["辛德拉古是艾萨拉女王最器重的奥术学家。女王最重要的物品都在这些高大的城墙内秘密制造完成。$B$B永恒之井被破坏后，上层精灵陷入浑浑噩噩的境地，一支较小的暗夜精灵氏族，埃雷萨拉斯的王子托塞德林开始建造水晶塔，你可以在西侧的城墙那儿看到那些分散在各处的水晶塔。"] = "The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret.$B$BAfter the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing.",
    ["辛迪加工会的成员都是些平庸的家伙——缺乏组织性、技能拙劣、懒惰……"] = "The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy... ",
    ["达丽亚娜答应了，但是她的精力如此充沛，很难让她安静下来仔细的聆听。她气力十足又机灵敏捷，我恐怕她不久就会被叫去参加战斗。我们必须快点教她。"] = "Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly.",
    ["达扎拉以他的狩猎技能在多兰纳尔小有名气。为什么不找他谈谈，看看他能教你点什么呢？"] = "Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill.  Why don't you talk to him and see what he can teach you?",
    ["达纳苏斯有无数令人惊异的地方，你想去哪儿？"] = "Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?",
    ["达纳苏斯有许多熟练的训练师，他们拥有数年的训练经验。我会介绍一名导师给你，沿着你选择的道路前进吧。"] = "Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.",
    ["达纳苏斯的工匠们可传授给你很多工艺知识。告诉我，你对哪种工艺最好奇？"] = "Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millenium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?",
    ["迅刀长者在达纳苏斯的街道上闲庭信步。"] = "Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil.",
    ["过去数年来，我目睹了熊怪所经历的种种可怕的事情——它们成为战场上的无辜受害者。但是我不清楚这个部落现在怎么样了。它们被席卷费伍德森林的瘟疫腐化了吗？或许它们对自己曾经和平的民族所遭遇的一切表示愤怒，正试图自我保护？无论如何，它们中的大多数对进入这片领域的人都会表现出敌意。"] = "I've seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it's unclear to me what's become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that's touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what's happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area.",
    ["过奖了，但我真的不感兴趣……什么？你想知道在哪儿能学习附魔知识吗？哦，真令人为难！呃，你应该……我想你应该……去找那个，嗯……塔兰丹！对，去工匠区找塔兰丹！"] = "I'm flattered, but really I'm not interested... What?  You want to know where to learn enchanting?  Oh, how embarrassing!  Well, you should...  I'm sure you could... go see, um...  Taladan!  Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen's Terrace!",
    ["还没准备好收拾这张皮。我希望做皮革不要花太多时间。肯定有办法削减等待的时间。这对我身体不太好，你知道吗？"] = "This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?",
    ["还行……训练你是不成问题的。很好！我们开始吧……"] = "Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin...",
    ["这个信徒陷入了恍惚的状态……"] = "This cultist is in a deep trance...",
    ["这个地区有许多生物都是暗夜精灵的同盟。精灵们可以借助这些生物的能量来为自己效劳。部落也应该拥有这种能力。我想到一个方法，可以捕捉到这种能量并为我们所用。$B$B不要怀疑我告诉你的事情，$n。帮助我，你就会知道我所说的都是实话。"] = "Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit.$B$BDo not doubt what I tell you, $n. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth.",
    ["这个机器所依据的理论就是通过一次大爆破将你完全摧毁，然后把你的粒子通过空间裂隙传送到某个地点，再通过反爆破模块将你在目的地重组。这是即时的传送！它并不是百分之百有效的，但是你是个杰出的地精技师！如果你把性命看得比发明创造更重要，那么你永远都无法成为一个真正的地精技师！ 这是制作空间撕裂器所需的图纸，你一定要试试看！"] = "The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!Here is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!",
    ["这个码头？你可以乘船前往暗夜精灵的领地。地名？嗯，我想是奥伯丁。我不太确定，我只是一名搬运工。"] = "This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What's it's name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff.",
    ["这个问题问得好，$r。年轻的时候，我是个自由自在玩世不恭的人，从来没有关心过这个世界的命运。那时候，我在暴风城那边唱歌，参加了一个叫“劈头四”的四重唱组合。我也是在那里学会制作骨镰护甲的。"] = "Good question, $r. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs.",
    ["这么说……你想当一名裁缝？很好，让我们看看你是否具有这样的潜质。"] = "So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes.",
    ["这么说，你以为在这个城镇里没有常驻矿工，是吗？错！在卡拉诺斯外的钢架补给站附近去找亚尔吧。"] = "Surely ye didn't think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill's Depot just outside of Kharanos.",
    ["这么说，你是来找尼比学习如何从虚空中召唤地域火仆从的。$B$B安静！尼比什么都知道！$B$B他可不会这么轻易地将知识传授给你。首先，你必须帮助尼比完成一项至关重要的任务。"] = "So you have come to Niby to learn the secrets of calling down an infernal servant from the Nether.$B$BSilence! Niby knows all!$B$BNiby is not so quick to part with such knowledge. First, you must assist Niby with a very important task.",
    ["这些图案难道不漂亮吗？每一个都有自己的风格。"] = "Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice.",
    ["这些天提尔斯和他的助手都变得怪怪的。"] = "Tirth's not himself these days, and neither is his assistant.",
    ["这些巨兽比你更会寻找道路，它们能让你更快地到达目的地，而且还可轻松欣赏沿途的美景。"] = "These great beasts know paths that ye can't find on foot, they'll get ye there fast and maybe show ye something new at the same time.",
    ["这些日子以来，所有的官方事务都是在暴风城处理的。如果你想要组织公会的话，就去暴风城接待中心吧。"] = "All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild.",
    ["这些栖息在这片荒地上的科多兽的兽皮最为坚韧。"] = "The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland.",
    ["这些污秽的野兽爬满了四处。$B$B如果你喜欢户外狩猎的话，你可以轻松地在病木林和恐惧谷找到它们的，恶蛛隧道里也有大量生存。当然，任何东瘟疫之地的天灾营地里也都会有它们的身影。$B$B此外，如果你真是一个特别优秀的地下城冒险专家的话，你还能在斯坦索姆找到一些，而通灵学院里也有一些通灵魔。"] = "Those filthy beasts are all over the place.$B$BIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance.",
    ["这些道路都是大地之母走过的道路。无论你决定前往何方，愿大地之母与你同在。"] = "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you.",
    ["这些都是大地之母走过的道路。愿你的祖先保佑你$c。"] = "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c.",
    ["这份工作明显不值16500的年薪。"] = "This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year.",
    ["这倒提醒我了，我得去找点吃的。据说联盟已经收集到$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。一旦收集完毕，这些食物就将被运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。"] = "That reminds me, I'm going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I'm told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",
    ["这儿就是那场声势浩大的战争的遗址。那些伟大的战争啊。"] = "This was the site of a great battle.  Many great battles.",
    ["这儿有采矿训练者吗？你认为你在哪儿！？  你将在大熔炉北边深山采矿公会找到丹莫罗地区最好的矿工。吉尔弗拉姆·石趾将为你展示真正的采矿艺术。"] = "Do we have Mining trainers here?  Where do ye think ye are!?  Why you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at the Deepmountain Mining Guild on the northern side of The Great Forge.  There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining.",
    ["这具尸体属于一个女性兽人战士。$B$B很明显她是在战斗中死去的，或许是在对付这片地区的野猪人时死亡的。"] = "The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.",
    ["这只熊漫步在一条靠近石爪小径的路上，在密斯特拉湖和联盟的银风避难所正西方。虽然他是你在灰谷遇到的三个动物之中最好对付的一个，对他也不能掉以轻心。他的出现对于逗留在灰谷和石爪山脉之间的旅客来说是一个巨大的威胁。"] = "This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains.",
    ["这只黑豹传言在暗夜精灵和他们的同盟面前很驯服，这使她成为一个更有价值的对手。萨杜布拉的猎杀路线把她从瑞恩伍德居所赶到了我们的西方，最终在那里的正西方登陆。她的皮毛是沥青一般的颜色，而她的速度也不能低估。"] = "This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated.",
    ["这周围可不是钓鱼的好地方，但是你应该去找帕克斯顿问问看。他在涌冰湖钓鱼。"] = "Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton's ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake.",
    ["这地方通风良好……但是我还在乎什么？我已经死了。"] = "The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead.",
    ["这场战争还没有结束，它才刚刚开始！勇敢的士兵日日夜夜在安其拉与敌人血战，很快，这座其拉虫人的城市就要陷落了。"] = "This war's not over, it's only just begun!  We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, $n.  It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls.",
    ["这块美味的樱桃馅饼能让小侏儒喜极而泣。"] = "This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry.",
    ["这套装备真的让我眼前一亮，你觉得呢？显然，我有多种技能可以使用，我可以将贸易的一些诀窍与你分享。听好了。"] = "This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?",
    ["这是个危险的地方，$n。要小心。"] = "This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here.",
    ["这是刚从农场带来的新鲜货--这是烟林牧场的健康食品！"] = "Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",
    ["这是用钱能够建造出的最好最先进的交通工具。什么？矿道地铁？侏儒？听着，朋友，如果你相信那种废物的话，我就把荆棘谷中的那尊雕像卖给你。那么，你到底是要走着去格罗姆高营地，还是乘坐这架精美的飞行机器？你选吧。"] = "This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I've got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice.",
    ["这是真的。请允许我总结一下……"] = "It's simple really. Allow me to summarize...",
    ["这是真的，我曾经是人类。缺点是可能转换为我们的优势的，$n，因为我对人类的劣势了如指掌。"] = "Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately.",
    ["这片森林容易使人迷路！要小心。"] = "This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there.",
    ["这片美丽的森林受到了可怕的诅咒！腐化的力量将这儿变成了一片恐惧之地。如果你跟他们不是一伙的，或许你能帮助我夺回费伍德森林。"] = "These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!",
    ["这确实是一件上好的护甲，它给我留下了深刻的印象。我只知道谁可以打造出同样品质的护甲，他叫格鲁努斯·削钢，就在铁炉堡的大煅炉那里。我相信那位锻造大师一定可以教你不少东西。"] = "Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye.",
    ["这种工作胆小鬼做不了的。我有个叔叔丢了一只手！可怜的老胖子……无论如何，如果你还感兴趣我或许能给你看些东西？"] = "This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things.",
    ["这种车赛是展现我们高新科技的大好机会！"] = "These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!",
    ["这轮结束后冬天爷爷会做什么呢，我有一个很好的主意。我在包里有一瓶冬幕啤酒，而且我想喝光它。"] = "I have a pretty good idea what ol' Greatfather Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it.",
    ["这里的天气真不错，你说呢？"] = "Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?",
    ["这里西边有一处叫做菲拉斯的地方，那一带的鹰角兽正处于危险的境地中。$B$B我需要你从菲拉斯南部的伊斯迪尔废墟中给我带回鹰角兽的蛋，超级测蛋器会分析你带回来的蛋，并判断它是否可以孵化。然后我可以把蛋送到达纳苏斯去孵化，避免它们受到戈杜尼食人魔的黑暗魔法的影响！$B$B$n，你要知道，有些蛋即使完整无缺也是不可能孵化出来的。"] = "In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.$B$BI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.$B$BPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch.",
    ["这附近只有一名猎人，那就是格瑞夫。他就站在卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外。"] = "There's only one hunter around here I would have ye talk to, and that would be Grif Wildheart.  Ye'll find him standing just outside the smithy in Kharanos.",
    ["这附近只有几处地方可以钓鱼。帕克斯顿对此了如指掌，但是他不一定都会告诉你。为什么不去涌冰湖找他谈谈呢？"] = "Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won't tell ya about.  Why don't ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya.",
    ["这附近很少有人像科瑞恩·塞尔留斯一样精通于刀刃的使用技巧。到铁匠铺后面找她看一下她有没有心情教你些新东西。"] = "Few around here are as skilled with a blade as Lyria Du Lac.  Check for her out behind the smithy and see if she's in the mood to teach you something new.",
    ["这附近有很多乱扔垃圾的家伙。"] = "Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here.",
    ["这馅饼真好吃，你要尝尝吗？"] = "This pie is so good, would you like some?",
    ["远风长者在斯坦索姆的街道上徘徊。"] = "Elder Farwhisper can be found wandering the streets of Stratholme.",
    ["迷雾长者在菲拉斯的厄运之槌竞技场观看角斗。"] = "Elder Mistwalker enjoys watching the struggles at the Maul in Feralas.",
    ["退后，否则我会把你一下子砍成两半的。"] = "Back off or I'll cut you in half.",
    ["逐星长者每天都在哨兵岭上俯瞰西部荒野。"] = "Elder Skychaser looks out over Westfall from atop Sentinel Hill.",
    ["通灵学院这个学习亡灵术的学校位于西瘟疫之地的凯尔达隆那个废弃的小岛上。"] = "The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands.",
    ["通过千百次的锤炼，伊琳尼雅·月火已经掌握了若干种武器的使用方法，现在她为别人提供训练。如果你想接受训练的话，就去战士区找她吧。"] = "Through the milennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior's Terrace if you desire training.",
    ["通过在诺莫瑞根中进行的探险行动，我找到了制作一种伟大发明的方法：物质传送器！我所需要的就是一个熟练的侏儒技师，让$g他:她;制造一个信标连接在这个传送器上。"] = "With some of the technology that was recovered by bold gnomes venturing into Gnomeregan, I have managed to construct my greatest invention:  The Matter Transporter!    All I need now is a skilled Gnomish Engineer to build a powerful beacon attuned to the transporter.",
    ["通过研究，我发现在哈卡的化身被击败之后，他的力量也会随之减弱。但是哈卡的大部分力量仍保留在扭曲虚空的深处。$B$B你曾经击败过哈卡的化身，$n。或许再次击败他的话就可以进一步削弱他的力量，也许有一天我们就将面对他的真身。$B$B我为你准备了一张卷轴，你可以用它在堕神圣地中再次召唤哈卡的化身。你敢再次迎接哈卡的挑战吗？"] = "Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar's avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.$B$BYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.$B$BI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?",
    ["邓肯雇佣了暴风城最好的裁缝，乔吉奥·波利罗。他的店就坐落在法师区里。"] = "Duncan's Textiles employs one of the finest tailors in Stormwind, Georgio Bolero. Look for the shop over in the Mage Quarter.",
    ["那个游手好闲的利兰……他整天就在贸易区外的码头边钓鱼。他在钓鱼上花费这许多时间，我想他的钓鱼技术一定很高。如果你想学的话，为什么不去跟他谈谈呢？"] = "That bum Leland... all he does is sit out on the dock outside the Trade District and fish all day.  I sure hope he's good at it for all the time he spends fishing.  If you want to learn, why don't you go talk to him?",
    ["那么$g小伙子:小姑娘;，你认为你具有在奥特兰克山谷帮助联盟抵御部落的能力？非常好，那么你一定希望和铁炉堡的格罗杜姆·钢须谈谈。你可以在武器大厅的战略沙图之前找到他。"] = "So $g lad : lass;, you think you have what it takes to defend the Alliance against the Horde in Alterac Valley?  Very well then, you will want to speak with our very own Glordrum Steelbeard here in Ironforge.  You'll find him strategizing over the war table in the Hall of Arms.",
    ["那么你是在找博文·布里斯博埃斯了。他居住在炉灰庄园大桥另一边，布瑞尔城镇西南部。"] = "It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then.  You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor.",
    ["那么听好了，$c。$B$B几个月前，湖畔镇的镇长派遣特使来到铁炉堡，恳求国王一同抵抗入侵赤脊山的黑石兽人。$B$B铁炉堡公主茉艾拉自愿前去援助，于是国王就指派了20个精英守卫，确保公主由洛克湖前往湖畔镇的途中一路平安，我也在卫队中。"] = "Then listen well, $r.$B$BSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.$B$BPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire.",
    ["那么说来你想要成为一名铁匠？$g小伙子:小姑娘;，扎好围裙，拿上铁锤，让我们开始吧。"] = "So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got.",
    ["那么，似乎我们都是来找霍格拉尔·巴坎的。他是个矮人，他迟早会去 雷酒酿制厂喝酒的，没准他现在已经在那儿了。"] = "Well then, it seems we're both looking for Hogral Bakkan.  He's a dwarf to be sure, so sooner or later he'll be heading for the Thunderbrew Distillery for an ale -- he might even be there now.",
    ["那又怎样，白痴。这些蕴涵着黑暗力量的物品或许能把我们全都毁灭掉。这是我们在获取力量时所必须付出的代价。如果我必须要死，那也要死在这样伟大的仪式与实验中。$B$B至于你……如果你在为我完成这一切的过程中死了……那我就会以豺狼人的方式嘲笑你的孱弱。把我要的东西带回来，这样我们两个都能获利益，要么就去死吧，我已经解释过结果了……"] = "I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.$B$BAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this...",
    ["那就是力量的化身，你这白痴。$B$B<玛塔乌斯的眼神变得黑暗了。>$B$B这帮白痴把你这样更白的白痴送进纳克萨玛斯里去回收那些被亵渎的护甲碎片，然后净化，重新附魔，来恢复以前的荣光。$B$B<玛塔乌斯不屑地吐了一下口水。>$B$B光是想到这群超级白痴就能让我感到不舒服。$B$B我也在寻找这些护甲碎片，不过我会把它进一步加工成为最邪恶的形态。"] = "It is power, imbecile.$B$B<Mataus's eyes darken.>$B$BThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.$B$B<Mataus spits.>$B$BJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.$B$BI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form.",
    ["那很好，$n。无论那是什么，去拿给那边的沃萨看看。他会回答你的任何问题。"] = "That's nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have.",
    ["那是剃刀岭的一幢大建筑，而不是兵营。去跟旅店老板格罗斯克谈谈。明白了？"] = "It's the big building in Razor Hill that's not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?",
    ["那是巨魔的事儿。去南方的森金村找安苏瓦。"] = "That's troll business.  Look for Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin Village down south.",
    ["那是杜克。去城镇西北角炙热的熔炉附近找他。"] = "That would be Dwukk.  Find him next to the heated forge at the northwest corner of town.",
    ["那绝不是东部王国的任何一个地方。$B$B一定是在卡利姆多大陆的某处，但是距离部落和其他种族仍有相当遥远的距离。还没有受到分裂影响的某个地方——远离暗夜精灵文明的地方。$B$B我猜有人守护在那儿……就像守护山谷或是环形山一样；我不确定。我只是猜测。很抱歉我不能提供更多的帮助了。"] = "It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.$B$BIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.$B$BI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more.",
    ["部落大使馆位于西边的力量谷。"] = "The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side.",
    ["部落正在收集绷带。到目前为止，我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带、$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，而总的需求量分别是$2080w、$2086w和$2090w。"] = "The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered.",
    ["酋长指示我学习各种武器和护甲知识。他把我派遣到这兽人和牛头人文明的集合之地，接触尽可能多的旅行者，学习整个贫瘠之地的文明。$B$B他认为即使是最未开化的文明也有值得学习的地方——比如野猪人和半人马。"] = "The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.$B$BHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur.",
    ["酋长进行的变革将帮助部落取得胜利！去城镇东边的兵营找斯瓦特吧。"] = "The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town.",
    ["金井长者在丹莫罗的卡拉诺斯歇脚。"] = "Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",
    ["金矛长者在冬泉谷的凯斯利尔废墟到处游荡。"] = "Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring.",
    ["针太细，线太粗，针脚倒还不错。我们与萨尔和其他人的合约将继续有效。部落不会被驱逐出这片土地的。"] = "The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands.",
    ["钓鱼只是为了娱乐，伙计。你知道吗？我是在向我的导师学习，世界上最伟大的钓鱼者——纳特·帕格。你听说他没有，伙计？$B$B如果你想要寻求启迪，那么纳特·帕格会指引你前进的道路。"] = "Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon?$B$BIf you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way. ",
    ["钓鱼大师巴斯贝特已经在这片水域中放入了美味的可口鱼，钓鱼比赛可以开始啦。  一旦决出了冠军，我就会按五条可口鱼换一银币的价格收购其余的可口鱼！"] = "Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.Once he gets his winner, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!",
    ["钓鱼大赛的赢家已经胜出，但是贾恩愿意收购你们钓到的可口鱼！  每周日都会有一场钓鱼大赛，你尽可再来展示自己的钓鱼技能！"] = "We already have a winner for our contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!There is always next Sunday for you to show your Angling skill!",
    ["钓鱼是那些没有在战斗中死去的老人的运动！到荣誉谷的湖边可以找到鲁玛克。"] = "Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor.",
    ["铁匠的生活可不轻松，但是它能让你体格健壮，充满热情。我的父亲是一名铁匠，我的祖父曾经在格瑞姆巴托的炼铁炉工作。现在，我的儿子也跟随着我们的脚步，他让我倍感自豪。"] = "The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud.",
    ["铁匠阿古斯居住在闪金镇。我想他能教你如何做一名铁匠。"] = "Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire.  I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession.",
    ["铁匠？不，我们最后一名铁匠都转变成毫无头脑的亡灵天灾士卒啦。但是镇子南边的幽暗城中还居住着一名铁匠。幽暗城在洛丹伦废墟下面，好听的名字，是吗？乘坐废墟后面的电梯抵达幽暗城，去跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会为你指明方向的。"] = "Blacksmith?  Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge.  There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though.  Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh?  Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians.  They should be able to point you in the right direction.",
    ["铁匠？真少见啊。我能为你做什么吗？"] = "Don't see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?",
    ["铁炉堡密林武器店的矮人武器管理人布里维夫可以教你如何使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  铁炉堡密林武器店的侏儒武器管理人比克斯  可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首和投掷武器。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器管理人吴平可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。"] = "Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff.",
    ["铁炉堡是学习制皮的最佳场所。要是我没记错的话，你可以去大锻炉旁的商店。"] = "Ironforge is going to be your best bet for leatherworkers.  If memory servers, there's a shop by The Great Forge that should meet yer needs.",
    ["铁炉堡银行是这一带最近的银行。"] = "The Vault in Ironforge is the closest bank ye'll find in these parts.",
    ["铁环长者生活在灼热峡谷的黑炭谷中。"] = "Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge.",
    ["铜须再次失踪了！那家伙跟他的兄弟不一样，一点判断力都没有。"] = "Bronzebeard's gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn't get any of his brother's good senses.",
    ["铜须长者在他们家族的老家铁炉堡里。"] = "Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge.",
    ["银翼哨兵算不上是个可敬的对手，但是如果你对屠杀他们感兴趣，那么就去勇者大厅找布拉古尔吧。"] = "The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave.",
    ["银翼哨兵运用一切援助对抗战歌前锋。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就去暴风要塞找艾弗拉兰谈谈。"] = "The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them.",
    ["银翼要塞需要你的援助。跟暴风要塞觐见室的艾弗拉兰谈谈。"] = "Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep.",
    ["银脉长者就在洛克莫丹的塞尔萨玛附近。"] = "Elder Silvervein can be found near Thelsamar in Loch Modan.",
    ["银色黎明只不过是一群懦弱无力的理想主义者，若不是他们的领袖能意识到自己的不足，他们真可以说是无可救药了。我是血色十字军派驻到这里来的一名大使。是的，算是一名外交人员……我们的未来仍然是一片迷雾，我不知道我们是否能成为一支联军，或各自为战；我也不知道我们是否能够在克尔苏加德的侵略之下保卫家园，或让这个世界沦陷，但我们应该竭尽全力，奇迹总在风雨之后到来。$B$B至于我？马革裹尸，战死沙场……$B$B<玛尔兰耸了耸肩。>"] = "The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.$B$BAs for me? I'll die in battle...$B$B<Marjhan shrugs.>",
    ["银色黎明向你致敬，$c。我是哈萨娜——银色黎明为数不多经过授权的装备和军品军需官之一。$B$B既然你在我们委任下作战——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从加鲁什军官那里得到英勇勋章。它们有两个作用：在我们的队伍中赢得地位，或者作为交换得到某些特殊物品。$B$B随着你在银色黎明地位的升高，你会发现你能够得到更多物品。"] = "The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",
    ["银色黎明向你致敬，$c！我叫莱斯巴克，是银色黎明委派的装备和物资军需官。$B$B如果你愿意接受任命，同邪恶力量作战——以此赢得我们的尊重和信任——你就能在军官普尔哈特那儿获得勇气勋章。勋章有两个用途：提高声望或是获取特殊物品。$B$B随着你在银色黎明阵营地位的提高，你会发现自己能获得更多的物品。"] = "The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",
    ["银行位于平静的达纳苏斯城。如果你想存储自己的财物的话，就得去那儿。"] = "The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions.",
    ["银行？哦，你是说银行！说到存储贵重物品的话，没有什么比银行更安全的地方了。它就在铁炉堡大门的东北方。"] = "The bank?  Oh, ye mean The Vault!  No safer place to store yer valuables than The Vault. Ye'll find it just northeast of the entrance to Ironforge. ",
    ["银行？哦，这附近最近的银行就是暴风城会计室。沿着暴风城大门不远的那条路向前走就是。"] = "A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates.",
    ["锋叶长者的家在泰达希尔顶部的小村庄多兰纳尔。"] = "The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf.",
    ["闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店是这个地区中最好的旅店了。在那儿歇一歇吧，旅店老板法雷会让你感受到家的温暖。"] = "The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home.",
    ["问得好，$C。我得到的最新消息称我们已经收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了，总的需求量分别是$1998w、$2003w和$2012w。"] = "Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested.",
    ["问得好，$C。联盟共需要$1998w块铜锭、$2003w块铁锭和$2012w块瑟银锭。到目前为止，他们已经设法收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了。"] = "A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort.",
    ["阿兰娜大部分时间都在神谕林地练习技能。如果你想学做一名附魔师的话，就去那儿找她吧。"] = "Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her.",
    ["阿拉希盆地急需增援，你能帮助我们吗，$C？这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你的帮助定能扭转局势，帮助我们打败污染者。我们能将希望寄托到你身上吗？"] = "Will you help us in our time of great need at Arathi Basin, $c?  The chance for increased honor and standing is greater than ever, and your assistance is sure to help to turn the tide against The Defilers.  Can we count on you?",
    ["阿拉希盆地曾经是我们的家园，有了你的帮助，我们会收复失地的！你愿意帮助我们吗，$c？"] = "Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?",
    ["阿拉希盆地的人类急需我们的帮助。你得找战士区的克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈，他会帮助你的。"] = "The humans definitely need all of our help in Arathi Basin.  The one that you wish to speak to is named Keras Wolfheart.  He stands ready to assist you on the Warrior's Terrace.",
    ["阿拉希盆地的战斗是一场谋略战。木材、矿石、食物……所有这些物资对战斗来说都是必需品。$B$B销毁敌方的物资跟在战场上杀死他们一样重要。"] = "The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.$B$BDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield.",
    ["阿拉索联军发誓为激流堡和联盟夺回阿拉希。这将是一场恶战，但是是一场值得打的战争。"] = "The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance.  It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting.",
    ["阿拉索联军在阿拉希盆地所做的一切令人敬佩。可惜亡灵憎恶和他们的部落盟友挡住了去路。去暴风要塞国王的觐见室找赫塔希姆吧，她会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。"] = "It's admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King's audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin.",
    ["阿拉索联军试图从被遗忘者手中夺回自己的失地。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就跟武器大厅的杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。"] = "The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.",
    ["阿拉辛是个值得信赖的人，让他来悉心照料你的任何宠物。他就住在猎人们聚集的塞纳里奥区。"] = "You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.",
    ["阿斯坦娅在她经常垂钓的地方钓起了一些古怪的财宝。去贸易区找她吧，让她给你看看。"] = "Astaia has fished up some curious treasures over the ages she has spent fishing.  Why don't you go see her over in the Tradesman's terrace and have her show you some of them.",
    ["阿诺克能制作很好的绷带。他住在精神山谷灵魂归宿旁边的湖畔，就在适者生存小屋。沿着力量山谷向西走便可抵达。"] = "Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.",
    ["阿雷贡做的食物很受欢迎。他总是在工匠区忙于制作新的美食。要是有 塞纳里奥绿色烹饪的话，你一定要尝尝。  如果你不介意的话，我必须先去调查一下接二连三的鹿群失踪事件。"] = "The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  Now, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer. ",
    ["阿雷贡是一名技艺精湛的厨师，数个世纪以来，他都在完善着自己的厨艺。要是他愿意教你的话，你就得谢天谢地了。要是你相信自己的实力的话，就去工匠区找他吧。"] = "Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace.",
    ["附魔体现了毁灭和新生的循环，这正是自然界的基本准则。晨行者附魔师将为你展示这一切。"] = "The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.",
    ["陌生人，小心身后。"] = "Watch your back, stranger.",
    ["陌生人，我们并不是粗鲁的家伙，只是大家都忙于在乌瑟到来之前确保一切顺利。光明使者能来到我们的城镇，这可真难得。"] = "We're not really rude people, stranger, it's just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther's arrival. It's not often that the Lightbringer comes to town.",
    ["陌生人，我没有时间浪费啦。说说你的事儿吧，要么就离开！"] = "I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!",
    ["陌生人，把你的声音放小一点。你不是想打扰主人的沉思吧。"] = "Keep your voice down, stranger. You do not want to disrupt the Master's meditations.",
    ["陌生人，欢迎来到凯尔达隆。"] = "Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger.",
    ["陌生人，离开这儿吧，免得送命，它会吃掉它接触到的一切东西的。"] = "Leave this place, stranger, lest it consume you as it has all that it has touched.",
    ["陌生人，赶快离开！我跟你没有关系。"] = "Leave at once, stranger!  I have no business with you.",
    ["除了对色彩和细节的鉴别能力外，我没有什么可以教你的。跟西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈；他知道很多制皮的高级技能。"] = "There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather.",
    ["难以置信。你配制药水的技能已经能跟我匹敌了。我不能再训练你了，去悲伤沼泽找斯通纳德的兽人罗格瓦尔谈谈。他以他的宝刀而闻名。"] = "Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments.",
    ["雅文·刺鬃在村庄北面等你。他能教你猎人之道。"] = "Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter.",
    ["雪冠长者在东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂。"] = "Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",
    ["雪峰长者在辛特兰中部的一座山丘顶部。"] = "Elder Highpeak watches over the Hinterlands from a hill near its center.",
    ["雷德沃克斯主管让我负责新型伐木机的研制计划。只剩几个月了，我处在水深火热之中！我需要你的帮助，$n！"] = "Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $n!",
    ["雷德，是黑手的儿子，他是黑石氏族的酋长。他是一个十足的恶棍。$B$B当第二次大战结束时，雷德和他的兄弟麦姆逃往黑石塔要塞避难。雷德正是在那儿宣称自己为黑石氏族的酋长的。"] = "Rend, son of Blackhand: Impotent chieftain of the Blackrock clan. A more stubborn bastard does not exist.$B$BAt the end of the second War, Rend and his brother, Maim, fled to find sanctuary within the mountainous stronghold of Blackrock Spire. It was there that Rend declared himself Warchief of the weakened Blackrock clan.",
    ["雷眉长者眼下应该正在艾尔文森林的闪金镇停留。"] = "Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",
    ["雷矛卫队需要你的帮助，赶快去参加对抗霜狼氏族的战斗吧，$n！和战士区的布洛冈·石盾谈一谈，他会帮你抵达奥特兰克山谷。赞美艾露恩！"] = "The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!",
    ["雷角长者到安戈洛环形山的巨痕谷去了，天知道他要干什么。"] = "For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater.",
    ["雷酒家族在卡拉诺斯开了一家旅店，久负盛名。在那里喝杯酒休息一下吧。"] = "The Thunderbrews run a fine Inn in Kharanos which bears their name.  Stop in for a pint and a bit of rest.",
    ["雷锤长者在暴风城里。"] = "Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind.",
    ["需要一些炼金术的材料吗？或者你有别的什么事情？"] = "In need of some alchemy supplies, are we?  Or do you have other business with me?",
    ["需要物资供给吗？"] = "Need some supplies?",
    ["靠近点，但是不要抽雪茄！我恐怕你必须得先跟我的妹妹洁娜谈谈。当她领你复习完基础知识再回来找我，我那时就会让你见识真正有趣的东西！"] = "Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!",
    ["风之图腾长者在贫瘠之地的棘齿城和地精为伴。"] = "Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens.",
    ["风怒长者在诅咒之地的一座高山上眺望着黑暗之门。"] = "Elder Bellowrage watches over the Dark Portal from a ridge in the Blasted Lands.",
    ["风路长者在东瘟疫之地的皇冠哨塔里。"] = "Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands.",
    ["马卡鲁整天都在荣誉谷的红石谷矿业工会，就在湖边。"] = "Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake.",
    ["马里恩·考尔和黑暗牧师贝里尔一起在布瑞尔镇东南角恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅览室中。我只是想看看谁是这场对抗的胜利者。"] = "Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest.",
    ["高山长者住在贫瘠之地的陶拉祖营地。"] = "Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",
    ["高阶女祭司现在不能离开达纳苏斯。范达尔的情绪非常奇怪。"] = "The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood.",
    ["魂精是每个生物都有的能量。我为你做的护符使你能以物理形态来抓到它。$B$B我知道一个可以转换你发现的魂精的咒语，并把它转换成魂能。$B$B你然后可以得到玛艾里的容器，并使用它把魂能的能量转换到自己身上。$B$B来吧，试一下。把玛艾里的魂精带来我们开心一下。"] = "E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun.",
    ["魔法只会使弱者堕落。继续你的训练吧，不然你的命运就跟那些家伙相差无几了。"] = "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.",
    ["魔法只会使那些软弱的人堕落。继续你的训练吧，不然你的命运就跟那些人相差无几了。"] = "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.",
    ["魔法只会腐蚀那些意志薄弱的人。即便你不是术士，最好也牢记这一点。"] = "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that.",
    ["鱼肉真鲜美。你来学钓鱼的？还是来吃鱼的？呣……"] = "Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm...",
    ["鲁坎·考迪尔在监狱附近的运河边上有一家小店。我相信他可以教你附魔的技巧。"] = "Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting.",
    ["鲁玛克……总是在荣誉谷的湖边钓鱼。你找到他后，顺便帮我向山吉斯问好。"] = "That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you're there say hi to Shankys for me.",
    ["鲁莽的家伙。拉文霍德公爵可不喜欢这样的人。"] = "Brash. Master Ravenholdt does not like brash.",
    ["黎明长者在黑石深渊的秩序之环打发时间。"] = "Elder Morndeep spends time at the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths.",
    ["黑暗女王说过，在这场战争中，知识是我们最强大的武器。"] = "The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war.",
    ["黑暗没有拥抱你这样的$c。别说废话，从我视线中消失吧！滚！"] = "The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!",
    ["黑暗深渊位于灰谷海岸佐拉姆海岸的最北部。"] = "Blackfathom Deeps can be found at the north end of Zoram Strand along the coast of Ashenvale.",
    ["黑曜石长者在银松森林的瑟伯切尔附近游荡。"] = "Elder Obsidian wanders near the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",
    ["黑石山脉位于灼热峡谷和燃烧平原的中间。"] = "Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south.",
    ["黑石领主从灰烬中升起！"] = "The Lord of Blackrock hangs from the arches!",
    ["黑色、灰色和深紫色是规定的颜色。朋友，看仔细了，可别迷失方向。博文·布里斯博埃斯可以帮助你。你可以穿过镇子西南的桥梁，去炉灰庄园找他。"] = "Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors.  See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend.  Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't.  You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town.",
    ["龙类指派的英雄？必须除掉克苏恩！我们可以帮助你，凡人！"] = "Heroes of the Brood? C'Thun must be banished! We can assist you, mortal!",
    ["（吸气声，吸气声）你闻到了吗？你难道不是只喜欢油脂的气味吗？"] = "(Sniff, sniff) You smell that? Don't you just LOVE the smell of grease?",
}

M.enUStozhCN = {
    ["$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch.  But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills.  As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf.  Will you join the battle?"] = "$C，战歌峡谷迫切需要增援。如果你愿意助我们一臂之力的话，你将获得前所未有的荣誉。银翼哨兵对你的所做所为也会表示敬意。你愿意加入战斗吗？",
    ["$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?"] = "$C，战歌峡谷急需增援，帮助我们对抗银翼哨兵吧。在那里你可以赢得战歌前锋部队的尊敬！你有勇气加入战斗吗？",
    ["$C, we need your assistance at Warsong Gulch.  Will you aid us in our fight against the Warsong Outriders?"] = "$C，战歌峡谷需要援助。你能帮助我们攻打战歌前锋吗？",
    ["$N, I've come to find out how rampant the effects of Fel Moss are throughout Darkshore. The corruption of Teldrassil and our surrounding lands really concerns the druids of the Cenarian Circle, and all Night elves.$B$BIt is my goal to find out why this has happened and to put an end to it."] = "$N，我已经查明魔苔在整个黑海岸的影响有多么的猖獗。泰达希尔和我们周围大地的堕落的确引起了塞纳里奥议会德鲁伊以及所有的暗夜精灵的关注。$B$B我的目标就是查出为什么会发生这样的事并将其制止。",
    ["$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That's right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;"] = "$g嗨，帅哥，你想去格罗姆高吗？我听说那里的丛林整日雾气腾腾的，也许我们可以一起度个短假，我让你看看真正的丛林虎怎么样？:来吧，参观一下奇妙绚丽的荆棘谷丛林。你可以在水晶般的蓝色海岸线上惬意地洗日光浴，而我却站在这难以忍受的高温下整天傻看着我的兄弟弗雷萨！尽情享受你的旅程吧！;",
    ["$n! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!$B$BYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!$B$BThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger."] = "$n！你回来陪我说话解闷儿啦？你心肠真好，而且你这身衣服看起来相当不错呢！$B$B你不知道我见到你有多高兴。我呆在这儿真是太寂寞了，这些粗俗的灵魂又没法看见我。感谢你为我们所做的一切，我是永远不会忘记的！$B$B谢谢你过来看我，别拘谨。",
    ["$n, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley?  Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?"] = "$n，你对我们在奥特兰克山谷的处境有什么想法？你准备好跟霜狼氏族作战了吗？",
    ["$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?"] = "$n，我如何才能在大地母亲的心目中继续你的深造呢？",
    ["$n, it's good to see veterans like you in the field!  I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available."] = "$n，在战场上看到你这样经验丰富的家伙真好！很抱歉，我们军队的物资过低，无法发动对部落的大规模地面攻击。$B$B跟我们的军需官谈谈，他会给你供给任务的。",
    ["$n, it's good to see you again!  Are you having fun at the Faire?$B$BWant to arm wrestle?  No, of course not... you want to keep your arm!"] = "$n，很高兴再次见到你！你玩得开心吗？$B$B想要来掰手腕吗？不，当然不……你想要保护好自己的手臂！",
    ["$n, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?"] = "$n，必须消灭银翼哨兵！你做好进入战歌峡谷的准备了吗？",
    ["$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"] = "$n，眼下，奥特兰克山谷的雷矛卫队需要你助战，共同打败霜狼氏族。这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会！你想要参加战斗吗？",
    ["$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself."] = "$n，这真是你做的吗？真是一件精美的作品。我会继续训练你的，相信总有一天你可以达到皇家铸甲匠的水准。",
    ["'...'$B$BThe body of the tauren druid lies still and unmoving.  It would seem as though he has finally passed from this world to his promised great beyond."] = "“……”$B$B牛头人德鲁伊的尸体静静地躺着，看起来他好像终于离开了这个世界。",
    ["'Darnassae?'$B$BThe night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the north.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?"] = "“达纳苏斯语？”$B$B暗夜精灵德鲁伊满怀期望地看着你，但是你显然无法跟她沟通。她微笑着指向自己，然后指着你。最后她向北面的道路指了几下。$B$B或许她是在说那边有能跟你进行交谈的德鲁伊？",
    ["'Great job collecting resources for the war,' they said, 'Have a promotion,' they said.  What they really meant is 'You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!'$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!"] = "“在为战争采集资源这方面，你做得太棒了！”他们说，“你一定会得到晋升的！”然而他们真正的意思是，“你会和一群小不点的矮人一起被部署在希利苏斯的某个虫巢外面，卡恩斯！”$B$B多谢提携，中尉！",
    ["'Taurahe?'$B$BThe tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the south.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road?"] = "“牛头人语？”$B$B牛头人德鲁伊满怀期望地看着你，但是你显然无法跟她沟通。她微笑着指向自己，然后指着你。最后她向南面的道路指了几下。$B$B或许她是在说那里有能跟你进行交谈的德鲁伊？",
    ["'Tis the season for great bargains!  Fah la la la la!"] = "现在是廉价货上市的时候！啦啦啦啦！",
    ["(Sniff, sniff) You smell that? Don't you just LOVE the smell of grease?"] = "（吸气声，吸气声）你闻到了吗？你难道不是只喜欢油脂的气味吗？",
    ["... A message from Banehollow?  What message is that?  Does he have need of his great advisor and servant, Ulathek?  Does he require my presence?"] = "来自贝恩霍勒的消息？是什么消息？他需要伟大的导师和仆人乌拉泰克吗？他需要我吗？",
    ["10,000 years of recorded knowledge tends to draw the wrong element to the Athenaeum. Books are stolen, recovered and stolen again on a daily basis."] = "拥有万年历史的知识卷轴将那些邪恶的家伙吸引到图书馆。大量的书籍被盗，被找回之后再次被盗。",
    ["<Andorov looks at you grimly.>$B$BIf it bleeds, we can kill it."] = "<安多洛夫严肃地看着你。>$B$B如果它会流血，我们就能杀了它。",
    ["<Demitrian falls to his knees.>$B$BYou have recovered my Master's eternal prison!$B$BOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.$B$BHe must be released!"] = "<德米提恩跪倒在地。>$B$B你已经找回了主人的牢笼！$B$B我期待这一天已经很久很久了，我的愿望终于实现了。$B$B必须解放我的主人！",
    ["<Demitrian laughs.>$B$BYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!"] = "<德米提恩笑了。>$B$B愚蠢的家伙，你的奖励就是痛苦地死去！",
    ["<Eris nods.>$B$BThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.$B$BIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see."] = "<艾瑞斯点着头。>$B$B这只眼睛见证了许多恐怖和惊奇的事情。$B$B它会显现出观察者理应看到的场景。",
    ["<Goretooth spits.>$B$BI am a warrior of the Horde, $n. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.$B$BHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.$B$BAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill."] = "<高图斯啐了一口唾沫。>$B$B我是部落的勇士，$n。让我愤怒的是得知我们的敌人正坐在离卡加斯不到一天路程的堡垒中，密谋着要对我们发起攻击。$B$B我渴望摆脱责任的束缚，以酋长的名义将他们消灭。$B$B但是，我们都有各自必须承担的职责。",
    ["<Kharan clears his throat.>$B$BWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.$B$BWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup."] = "<卡兰清了清喉咙。>$B$B我们艰难地穿过灼热峡谷的隧道，进入了这片饱经蹂躏的荒地。现在回想起来，这事情十分蹊跷。我们所遇到的危险只不过是在这个地区生存的一些野生动物，我们很容易就赶走了它们。$B$B我们轻松地抵达了黑石山，并毫不费力地穿过了这座由巨石砌成的堡垒。",
    ["<Kharan sighs.>$B$BI suppose... I suppose you are right.$B$BGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?"] = "<卡兰叹了口气。>$B$B我想……我想你是对的。$B$B哥沙克告诉我你的酋长有个大计划，一个可能会改变联盟和部落关系的计划。关于这点你知道些什么？",
    ["<Lady Prestor glares at you.>"] = "<普瑞斯托女士怒视着你。>",
    ["<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>$B$BWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!$B$BAm I right?"] = "<纳瑞安将一封未打开的信贴到他的前额。>$B$B这是什么……嗯……天鹅绒！$B$B是吗？",
    ["<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>$B$BName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!"] = "<雷矛中士向你敬礼。>$B$B姓名，军阶和编号，士兵！这是你唯一需要提供给那些肮脏的霜狼走狗的信息！",
    ["<Tarsis groans.>$B$BThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.$B$BThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...$B$B<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>$B$BWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, $r? To die here, in this manner now..."] = "<塔希斯呻吟着>$B$B或许还有时间……听仔细了，凡人。$B$B我穿越了虚空，我探索了未知的世界……我与一个强大的邪恶存在定下了微妙的协议……$B$B<塔希斯咳出了鲜血。>$B$B你……你是否能相信，即使是艾露恩也不再怜悯我，$r？现在我要死在这里了，要以这种方式……",
    ["<Volcor doesn't look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>$B$BOh, sorry, $c. Now's not a good time. I hope you understand."] = "<你靠近沃科尔时，他一点都不理睬你。他好象集中精力关注他的绷带以防脱落。过了一会儿，他抬头看你，有一点惊诧。>$B$B噢，对不起，$c。现在不太合适。我希望你能理解。",
    ["A Cooking trainer is it?  Well then, get yerself over to the Bronze Kettle on the northeastern side of The Great Forge.  Daryl Riknussun will teach ye to make a mighty fine dish that's sure to put the life back in ye!"] = "一个烹饪培训师？那好吧，你到大熔炉东北方的铜壶铁罐店去。达瑞尔·瑞克努索会教你制作极好的菜肴，那肯定会让你获得新生的！",
    ["A Hunter is it?  Well, then you will want to speak with Thorfin Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.  Oh, and you be sure to tell him that if I step in his pet's business one more time, he's going to be training other hunters from behind bars in the Stockade!"] = "一个猎人？好的，那么你会想跟矮人区的索尔芬·石盾谈谈。  哦，你一定要告诉他如果我再次介入他的宠物生意，他就可以去培训那些监牢里的猎人了！",
    ["A Rut'theran Ferry leaves for Auberdine from Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.  The portal in Darnassus will allow you to reach Rut'theran safely."] = "一艘鲁瑟兰的渡船会从泰达希尔底部的鲁瑟兰村出发前往奥伯丁。达纳苏斯的传送门会让你安全抵达鲁瑟兰村。",
    ["A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!$B$B$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord."] = "萨弗隆铁锭？！？？！不可能！我必须得到它！必须！必须！$B$B$R，我会花大价钱购买铁锭的。或许你会对炎魔拉格纳罗斯之手之谜感兴趣？就是萨弗拉斯，白痴！传说中火元素之王使用的铁锤。",
    ["A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock's cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook."] = "一瓶雷霆啤酒外加格雷姆罗克做的菜就足以让你饱餐一顿。如果你想成为一名厨师的话，就该去参加他的培训。",
    ["A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates."] = "银行？哦，这附近最近的银行就是暴风城会计室。沿着暴风城大门不远的那条路向前走就是。",
    ["A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you."] = "一个新手采药师？那你该找神殿花园的菲罗迪恩·唤月聊聊。他或许有些专业诀窍要传授给你。",
    ["A child of nature are we? Then you need look no further then the moonwell in the Park."] = "我们都是大自然的孩子，所以你到花园区的月亮井那边去吧。",
    ["A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him."] = "你已经是一个比我好得多的铁匠，那是肯定的。尽管如果你告诉其他人这点我会否认我曾说过。你该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈。如果有人能教你，那就是他。",
    ["A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he's a hard taskmaster but he's also one of the best."] = "你是个有天分的学生，而且还是个有潜质的铁匠。我可以在本周任何时候宣布你可以从我这里毕业了。但是我觉得你还有东西要学。去找本古斯·深炉谈谈，他是个严厉的人，但他也是最出色的。",
    ["A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts."] = "一个志趣相投的团体可以成为一支非常强大的力量。克拉姆会帮助你们达到这个目的。你可以在雷霆崖电梯旁边中部高地的底层的公民信息中心找到他。",
    ["A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don't get caught up in it."] = "一场猛烈的风就要来了——我可以通过我裸露膝盖的疼痛判断出来。我就是希望我们不要被狂风困住。",
    ["A follower of the arcane are you?  Hmph!  Very well then... you can find them around the Pools of Vision underneath the Spirit Rise."] = "你是魔法的研习者？嗯，好吧……你可以在灵魂高地下的预见之池中找到他们。",
    ["A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?$B$BBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor."] = "一股强大的邪恶力量正在蠢蠢欲动，$R。你感觉到了没？$B$B啊！当然你无法感觉到。把你的护甲和武器给我吧，我会让它们恢复活力。",
    ["A long time ago, during my travels, I met a man that told me, 'Master using it and you can have this.'$B$BWhat do you suppose that means? I didn't know then, and I still don't now, really..."] = "很久之前，在我的旅途之中，我遇到了一个人，他告诉我：“掌握它的使用方法，你就可以拥有它。”$B$B你觉得那是什么意思？那时我还不知道，而且现在我还是不知道，真的……",
    ["A mailbox?  You have a letter to send, or perhaps have received one?  I hope it's something good!  There's a mailbox right outside of the Bank in the center of Darnassus."] = "一个邮筒？你要发信，或者也许你要收一封信？我希望是个好消息！在达那苏斯中心银行外面就有一个邮箱。",
    ["A miner?  Ye don't need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill's Depot."] = "矿工？你不需要问有没有，$g小伙子:姑娘;，只需问在哪里！亚尔就是你要找的家伙，我想他应该在钢架补给站那里。",
    ["A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him."] = "一个强大的人类魔法师传闻就在北部生活；他为了某种不为人知的原因一直在看守着那片大地。我自己没有亲自去过，但是据说访问者在那里很受欢迎，如果他们愿意为他办些差事的话甚至可以赢得他的好感。",
    ["A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn."] = "一位名叫劳尔娜·晨光的女祭司住在多兰纳尔，我认为你可以在旅店北面找到她。",
    ["A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.$B$BThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched."] = "一个纯净的样品就是在非故意情况下未被腐蚀的样品。我们需要尽可能在最基本，最正常的环境中找到这样的生物。$B$B这意味着某个全无文明痕迹或是未受艾泽拉斯某个种族所影响的地方。某块……处女地。",
    ["A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.  "] = "你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的老板凯达米尔提供的床上安稳地睡一觉。",
    ["A rogue?  Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types.  You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn."] = "一个潜行者？嗯……我曾听说过那个科瑞恩·塞尔留斯在那些阴暗的地方游荡。找她谈谈，看看你能学到点什么。",
    ["A rogue?  I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "一个潜行者？我不习惯跟那些家伙打交道，但我相信詹诺克就是你要找的训练师。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅店找到他。",
    ["A tailor is it?  Well, if you hang out here long enough you'll eventually hear word of mouth about Georgio Bolero.  He's been setting the trends for some months now.  If you wish to learn from him, you can find him over in the Mage Quarter in the outer rim."] = "一个裁缝是吗？哦，如果你在这儿呆的时间够长你就会最终听到关于乔吉奥·波利罗的谈论。他现在已经领导潮流几个月了。如果你希望跟他学习，你能在法师区的外圈找到他。",
    ["A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.$B$BEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.$B$BAnd fall it did... and so we came."] = "一千年前，阿纳克洛斯和鹿盔封印安其拉大门时，三位族人牺牲了自己的性命，将其拉虫人禁锢在这些大墙内，流沙之战宣告结束。$B$B他们曾立下誓言，一旦甲虫之墙开启，他们就将召唤麦琳瑟拉、亚雷戈斯和凯雷斯特拉兹。$B$B因此……我们来了。",
    ["A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman's Terrace and maybe you'll learn something useful."] = "它是一项耗时，但是会很有收获的技能。与贸易区的阿斯坦娅谈谈或许你能学到一些有用的东西。",
    ["A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason."] = "一个真正的专家知道他的局限，而我并不羞于承认你的技能超越了我。我想让你到阿祖拉之塔拜访基塔·费温德。她很有声誉。",
    ["A valuable skill First Aid is.  Our resident trainer, Nissa Firestone, can show ye how it's done.  Look for her on the southern side of The Great Forge at the Ironforge Physician."] = "急救是一种有价值的技能。我们的常住的培训师，尼莎·火石，会教你该怎么做。到大熔炉南边的铁炉堡医师协会可以找到她。",
    ["A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort."] = "问得好，$C。联盟共需要$1998w块铜锭、$2003w块铁锭和$2012w块瑟银锭。到目前为止，他们已经设法收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了。",
    ["A warlock, eh...  Well, if you've got a mind to be doing that sort of thing around here then ye best keep yer demons on a leash $gboyo : girlie;.  I don't like demons, but I love putting mah axe to them.  Ye get me?  Now you just leave me be and go get lost in The Forlorn Cavern.  That's where you'll find that warlock, Thistleheart."] = "一个术士，嗯……好吧，如果你想在附近继续做那种事情，你最好管好你的恶魔，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我不喜欢恶魔，但是我喜欢杀死他们。你明白我的话了吗？  现在你不要再烦我了，马上消失去荒弃的洞穴。你会在那里找到那个术士，瑟斯哈特。",
    ["A warlock?  Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement.  That's where you should look first."] = "一个术士？好吧，如果我是一个术士，我可能会待在这附近最黑暗的地方……那就是狮王之傲旅店的地下室。你应该先到那里去看看。",
    ["A wondrous Winter's Veil to you... uh... little $G boy : girl;.  Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor.  Yum."] = "一个神奇的冬幕节……啊……小$G男孩:女孩;。好孩子在烟林牧场当地的任何小卖部都有特别的，嗯，折扣。真棒。",
    ["About time you showed me some results! Now I'll show you results!"] = "你那时给我看了某些结果！现在该我给你看看结果了！",
    ["Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill."] = "实际上我更倾向于传统医学……水蛭，蛆，锯骨……那类东西。你可以看到我们本地的草药医学训练师，法鲁萨，就站在布瑞尔的马厩的附近。",
    ["Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake."] = "艾德勒·费欧德的皮革手艺在艾尔文森林已经妇孺皆知了。她的家就在水晶湖旁边。",
    ["After the firework show, they'll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!"] = "焰火表演之后，他们会拿出高脚杯，我们就可以喝酒庆祝啦！",
    ["Ah a visitor! Must be an adventurer, we don't get many tourists down this way. Grab a chair and a drink, make yourself comfortable. Say, you look like you have some meat on your bones. You thinkin about competing in the cage matches?"] = "啊,一个来访者！肯定是一个冒险家，没有多少游客会走这条路的。坐下来喝一杯饮料吧，随便些。嗨，你看起来好像还有些肉。你想参加比赛吗？",
    ["Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. "] = "我很惊讶一个如此粗心的人竟然能走到这里……$B$B是的，你可能还有一个符咒，但是玛艾里对你的行为很生气！$B$B现在赶紧离开。",
    ["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."] = "啊朋友，我只帮助猎人和他们的宠物。",
    ["Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."] = "啊,是的，剥皮。没有人比姚恩·深刺还善于运用剥皮刀了。你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷找到他。",
    ["Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how."] = "啊是的，另一个要烧炉火并锻造战斗武器的人。我当然会教你怎么操作。",
    ["Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn."] = "啊是的，你必须找到希克瓦。我记得我最后一次见她时她在旅馆前面站着。",
    ["Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!"] = "啊！如果你见到一个达隆郡的幸存者，请告诉他们我自由了！",
    ["Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power. "] = "啊，$r……我了解很多关于这个世界的知识，以及如何制造巨大能量的符咒的方法。",
    ["Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you'll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge."] = "啊，奥特兰克山谷，我的美好回忆啊。<叹息>嗯，我不能与你同行，但我同样感到骄傲！你得跟铁炉堡武器大厅的格罗杜姆·钢须谈谈。",
    ["Ah, Braenna Flintcrag.  She has magic hands, that one.  Braenna is the one to see about Priestly matters.  Ye'll want to travel north from the gates of Ironforge to the Hall of Mysteries.  That's where ye'll find her."] = "啊，布莱纳·火崖。她能使用魔法。她主管牧师事务。  你要穿过铁炉堡大门，向北走，前往神秘大厅。她就在那里。",
    ["Ah, I believe Gimble Thistlefuzz is who ye'll be needing if yer looking to learn the Enchanter's profession.  Ye'll find Gimble in his shop, Thistlefuzz Arcanery, right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."] = "啊，要是你想成为一名附魔师的话，我想你需要找吉布·草须。他在 大熔炉狮鹫管理人右边的商店草须魔法用品店里。",
    ["Ah, Stonebrow doesn't leave Ironforge much these days so if ye're looking to learn the tailor's profession ye'll have to go to see him up in Ironforge."] = "啊，石眉这些日子不怎么离开铁炉堡的，如果你想要学做一名裁缝的话，就去铁炉堡找他吧。",
    ["Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you're heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::"] = "啊，镶金玫瑰？那柔软的床铺和温水沐浴……想想这一切吧。::打哈欠::如果你要前往那儿的话，你可真幸运。旅馆就在贸易区的西边……柔软的枕头、温暖的毛毯。::打哈欠::",
    ["Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.$B$BI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.$B$BYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean."] = "啊，一个术士同伴已经在某种程度上证明了$g他的:她的;价值。$B$B很高兴认识你。我的名字是梅纳拉·沃伦德……那是有原因的。$B$B你看上去强大并博学，其他的工具……你是更强大的工具……会很受欢迎而不是愚蠢地泄密。如果事实确实如此，那再与我更深入地谈谈。如果不是，那么你知道你该怎么回到码头然后回到海洋的另一边。",
    ["Ah, a good question.$B$BIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.$B$BIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths."] = "啊，这个问题问得好。$B$B如果你喜欢在户外狩猎，那么在瘟疫之地，艾萨拉，燃烧平原，费伍德，希利苏斯，冬泉谷，甚至是安戈洛环形山都有元素生物的存在。$B$B如果你更喜欢直接挑战危险，那么就去厄运之槌吧。我听说大量变异元素都躲在厄运之槌的高墙之后。当然，你也可以在黑石深渊那里找到大量被黑铁矮人所雇佣的元素生物。",
    ["Ah, a seasoned veteran you once were. Kilram can make you this again. I know you are capable, you merely need to ask and I shall teach you the way of the axesmith."] = "啊，一个经历丰富的冒险者。基尔拉姆又让你来这里了。我知道你具有相当的能力，你只需要询问我，我就会教你斧系铁匠的知识。",
    ["Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children's Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.$B$BI'd be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too..."] = "啊，毫无疑问，他一定是想要成为一名战士！我想你是来参加儿童周的，是吗？你的行为堪称楷模，其他人必定会以你为榜样的，这令那些疲惫不堪的灵魂倍感欣慰。$B$B我很乐意帮助你和这位年轻的男子。嗯……我要给他提些什么建议呢？听听灵魂怎么说吧，是的……或许是关于吃掉所有蔬菜……",
    ["Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills."] = "啊，如我头衔所述，我是一名血色十字军的刺客。我每天白天研究着最优先目标的资料，晚上就去加基森的舞厅里放纵一下。好吧，其实跳舞才是我的正业，偶尔出去做点杀手活计赚点钱，付帐单。",
    ["Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "啊，友善的瑟里亚迪。在她的庇护下，所有动物都很安全。你可以在多兰纳尔的旅馆外找到她。",
    ["Ah, good ol' Brandur Ironhammer.  There's no doubt he'll provide ye with the guidance ye seek, $glad : lass;.  Ye'll find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge."] = "啊，布兰度尔·铁锤。毫无疑问，他能为你提供指导，$g小伙子:姑娘;。在铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅中能找到他。",
    ["Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!"] = "啊，我心爱的白兰地，我太思念她了！",
    ["Ah, nothing better than a priest to cure what ails ye.  Of course a nice tall pint cures a lot of what ails ye too, but I don't think Braenna Flintcrag teaches brewing.  I guess ye'll have to settle for some priest training over in the Hall of Mysteries instead."] = "啊，没有谁比牧师更擅长治疗病痛了。当然喝得酩酊大醉也能解除痛苦，但是我想布莱纳·火崖并不懂得酿酒。我认为你该在神秘大厅进行一些牧师的培训。",
    ["Ah, nothing quite like a ride on a gryphon, is there?  The night elves can keep those hippo's of theirs, just give me a gryphon and the wind in me hair!  Well now, I won't keep ye any longer, just head over to Gryth Thurden on the east side of The Great Forge and he'll get ye on yer way."] = "啊，没有什么比狮鹫更好的坐骑了。暗夜精灵偏爱可笑的角鹰兽，而我只需一头狮鹫就可以穿梭在云端！  好吧，我不跟你唠叨了，到大锻炉东边的格莱斯·瑟登那儿去吧，他会向你出租狮鹫的。",
    ["Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.$B$BMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it's only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.$B$BI am but a little envious."] = "啊，我最喜爱的顾客之一。你似乎是个有能力的术士，$n。很高兴认识你。要是我能帮上什么忙，请尽管开口。$B$B我和我的兄弟都认为你这样的人才能领导我们进入新纪元。一个拥有力量……和控制力的人……让军团臣服于你只是时间问题。$B$B我有些羡慕你了。",
    ["Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.$B$BThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely."] = "啊，是我们的人。很高兴看到我们的队伍增长如此迅速，以至于我都记不清每个人的容貌了。$B$B萨尔那个傻子认为我正努力改善术士的形象并为他服务呢。白痴！燃烧军团在耗尽这世界的资源后会将它化为灰烬的。",
    ["Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!"] = "啊，幽影谷的美景永远使我感到快乐！",
    ["Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!"] = "啊，这件达纳苏斯织品质量最好！",
    ["Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there."] = "啊，又回到年轻的时候了，还有第一次发现药剂的时候。谢谢你恢复我的记忆，$n。去跟那边的米拉·法拉科纳分享那份年轻的热情吧。",
    ["Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you're going."] = "啊，和天空中的巨鸟一同翱翔。去双足飞龙巢穴顶端找塔尔吧。他会指引你完成你的梦想的。",
    ["Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin..."] = "啊，很好。你是个优秀的学生，我对你非常满意。现在，我可以开始训练你了……",
    ["Ah, well aren't you a sturdy-looking one? Perhaps you can assist me with a thing or two. Not much help around here except for green apprentices, and they've other things to worry about."] = "啊，你是个结实的家伙。也许你能给我一些帮助。你可以为新学徒提供协助，因为他们有别的事情要考虑。",
    ["Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!"] = "啊，多么美好的一天啊！真该炸点什么东西。",
    ["Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!"] = "啊，你是个好奇的人，是吗？太好了！听仔细了，这也许能在恶劣的环境下保护好你的皮肤！",
    ["Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers."] = "啊，你必须去雷霆崖最高处拜访他们中的一人。沿着血蹄村北面的道路走。雷霆崖底有电梯可达顶部。当你到达那儿时，可以询问雷霆崖守卫。",
    ["Ah, you seek Dark Cleric Beryl.  He's upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern.  Reading, praying, who knows what he's up to, and who would dare to ask?"] = "啊，你是在找黑暗牧师贝里尔。他在恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅读室。他一直在阅读、祷告，没人知道他在干嘛，也谁敢去问他啊？",
    ["Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons."] = "啊，你是在找安塞瓦。去雷霆崖武器店中部高地的底层找他吧。",
    ["Ah, you're looking for Lucan Cordell.  He runs a shop on the outside of the Magic Quarter on your way to the Stockade.  "] = "啊，你是在找鲁坎·考迪尔。他在魔法区外开了一家商店，你前往监狱时会经过那儿的。",
    ["Ah, you're the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You're welcome to what food and drink I can offer."] = "啊，就是你找到那封信的吧。感谢你带来这个……关于我的家人的消息。如果我这里的食物和饮料有什么你喜欢的，请别客气。",
    ["Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay."] = "啊……一名顾客！看看我最伟大的发明，贸易机器人1000型！它拥有你所需的一切商品……其中的一些稀有物品更是在卡利姆多的其它任何市场上都找不到……更不用说它的设计不支持任何讨价还价的废话了，因此你看到的价格就是你要支付的价格。",
    ["Ahh, you will need to make your way over to the Hunter's Hall then. Several great hunters like Holt Thunderhorn can be found there on the Hunter Rise."] = "啊，那你就要去猎人高地上的猎手大厅了。你可以在那里找到像浩特·雷角那样伟大的猎人。",
    ["Ahhh, Stormwind Visitor's Center is what you are looking for then. It's the first building on the left as you walk through the front gates from the Valley of Heroes."] = "哈，你要找的是暴风城访客中心。从英雄谷走到贸易区后左手边的第一座建筑就是了。",
    ["Ahhh, you are looking for Dungar Longdrink. He has some of the fastest gryphons this side of Khaz Modan! You can find him up on the ramparts in the Trade District."] = "啊，你在找杜加尔·朗德瑞克。他那里有卡兹莫丹飞得最快的狮鹫！你可以在贸易区的外墙上找到他。",
    ["Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?$B$BThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you'd think this was one of Stormwind's canals after a festival.$B$BAnd that's not where the trouble ends..."] = "嘿，$n！这场景不甚美观，是吧？地平线轻帆号沉在海底，我的手下狼狈不堪，我们的货物和乘客如同碎片一般到处都是，你也许会认为暴风城曾在这儿举办过节日庆典。$B$B麻烦事儿还不止这么点……",
    ["Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now."] = "奥兰纳·鸦眼将她的天赋部分归结为与神谕林地的灵魂进行了交流。你应该能在那儿找到她的。",
    ["Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her."] = "阿兰娜大部分时间都在神谕林地练习技能。如果你想学做一名附魔师的话，就去那儿找她吧。",
    ["Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal."] = "唉$c，你不是达纳苏斯的贵族，也不是泰达希尔的上层精灵。除非你以实际行动——不仅仅是口头上的话语——证明自己的友好态度，那样的话，我会提供马匹让你挑选的。",
    ["Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen's Terrace."] = "阿雷贡是一名技艺精湛的厨师，数个世纪以来，他都在完善着自己的厨艺。要是他愿意教你的话，你就得谢天谢地了。要是你相信自己的实力的话，就去工匠区找他吧。",
    ["All is lost..."] = "一切都完了……",
    ["All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $n. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.$B$BIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.$B$BUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill."] = "在我眼中，部落的所有成员都是平等的，$n。我们的血液被恶魔玛诺洛斯污染了，人民承受着重负，如果不是为了学识和荣耀的话，我们几乎就快沦为亡灵天灾了。$B$B协助部落，让我们获得新生，这是你的职责。但是你也得明白什么时候应该对朋友同情，对敌人怜悯。$B$B好好理解。这是新生的部落，而不是缺乏自由意愿的恶魔军队。",
    ["All of a sudden you're a 'Defender of the Alliance' are you?! Well, I suppose you'll be wanting to head to the Champions' Hall now. It's over in Old Town, but they won't let you in unless you're an officer, so you might just have to settle for talking to Officer Areyn outside. Move along now."] = "突然之间，你成为了“联盟的保卫者”，是吗？！嗯，我猜你一定是想去勇士大厅。大厅就在旧城区，但是你不是官员，守卫是不会让你进去的，你只能跟埃雷恩谈谈。去吧。",
    ["All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor."] = "我所有的作品都必须由买主亲自来订购。奥尔文常常要我改变这个习惯，但是我就是不改。看看你周围吧，无数战士还指望我给他们打造装甲呢。",
    ["All right!  Party time!"] = "哈哈！开始庆祝吧！",
    ["All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild."] = "这些日子以来，所有的官方事务都是在暴风城处理的。如果你想要组织公会的话，就去暴风城接待中心吧。",
    ["All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!"] = "桌上的所有瓶子中都盛有今天配制好的药水。心急吃不到热豆腐。哈哈！",
    ["All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there."] = "奥拉密斯湖近来遭受袭击，所有的渔夫都已经搬迁到达纳苏斯了。你应该去那儿看看。",
    ["All the roguish types hang out in The Forlorn Cavern, north of the gates of Ironforge.  I'd wager ye'll find Fenthwick there, no doubt counting the coin of another cut purse.  I'll catch him one of these days!  In the meantime I'll have my eye on you as well, $glad : lass;."] = "所有的潜行者都居住在铁炉堡以北的荒弃的洞穴。我敢打赌芬斯维克也在那儿，正在数着偷来的钱包中的硬币呢。我总有一天会抓住他的！  同时，我也会好好看着你的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。",
    ["All those official types reside in Ironforge.  Ye'll be wanting to check out the Ironforge Visitor's Center for guild creation papers."] = "所有的官员都居住在铁炉堡。你得去铁炉堡访客中心领取公会登记表。",
    ["All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!"] = "很快人们就会知道这座被诅咒的神殿背后的秘密，英雄。它将被载入史册，跟那些从扭曲虚空到艾泽拉斯的传说一起，被永远传诵。",
    ["Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!$B$BSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!"] = "好吧！我在熔岩大桥的熔岩坑测试熔岩服。一切进展顺利。我甚至能在熔岩中毫发无损地游泳！$B$B我在那儿做自己的事，有时仰泳一会，突然之间它把我一口吞没！若不是有了熔岩服和便携式食物机，我一定会就此交待了！",
    ["Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you."] = "虽然我很高兴听到你对我的能力充满信心，但我真的没法再教你了。你必须到达纳苏斯的工匠区去找暗夜精灵安尼希尔谈谈。她可以帮助你。",
    ["Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here."] = "尽管黑海岸比泰达希尔更危险，但是很多渔夫都在此谋生。",
    ["Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life."] = "虽然我们把这块土地称作贫瘠之地，但对于睿智者来说，这里到处都是生命。",
    ["Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials."] = "在你开始切割皮革之前一定要仔细检查尺寸。我们可不能浪费材料。",
    ["Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor."] = "我忙吗？这话什么意思？你觉得我只是成天站在这儿玩弄手指吗？如果你想买些什么的话，跟罕杜尔谈谈。",
    ["Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won't find any herbalists out here.  Ye'll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession."] = "有些弱小的植物竟然能在丹莫罗的寒风中开花，这真令人惊奇……但是这儿没有草药师。你得去铁炉堡接受草药师的训练。",
    ["Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.$B$BI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...$B$BDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?"] = "不可思议，不是吗？所有这些神器和残骸。$B$B我不清楚是什么给我留下了更为深刻的印象，它们的规模，还是它们背后的故事。要学习的东西还很多。我们能找到其中的关联……$B$B你知道那个传闻吗，听说许多种族与暗夜精灵有着相同的遗产。",
    ["An Alchemy trainer is what you need?  Well, I just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather."] = "你想要炼金训练者吗？嗯，我刚从那儿过来呢，真的。你可以在侏儒的聚集地侏儒区找浆泡小姐。",
    ["An alchemist?  No trouble at all $c.  Ainethil, in all her labor and toil, has become the most accomplished alchemist in the Craftsmen's Terrace.  I would head over there on the double if I were you. On the double!  Now off with you!"] = "炼金师？这没什么$c。安尼希尔通过不懈地努力，成为了工匠区技艺最纯熟的炼金术士。如果我是你的话，我会马上赶去那儿的。马上！出发吧！",
    ["An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food and drink, then head over to Stamp and Sylannia's booth. My favorite is the Darkmoon Special Reserve.If you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.And then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets."] = "一个很好的问题！我们马戏团这里有很多东西出售。如果您对食物和饮料感兴趣的话，那么您可以去斯塔姆和塞兰妮亚的小店看看。我最喜欢的就是暗月特别套餐。  如果您想要购买一些特别的东西，那么兰拉出售的货物将会很适合您。她擅长于从世界各地收集稀有的东西。  另外从到处跑来跑去的弗里克那里购买可以用于投掷的球和宠物青蛙。",
    ["An honor to see you again, $n."] = "很荣幸再次看到你，$n。",
    ["An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.$B$BMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We're here because of our oath to return for them, but we're also here because C'Thun must be stopped!"] = "凡人，这儿充斥着一种难以言说的恐怖。克苏恩和他的追随者们不仅公然藐视自然的力量，他们的存在更预示着艾泽拉斯的毁灭。$B$B一千年前，麦琳瑟拉、凯雷斯特拉兹和亚雷戈斯都牺牲了自己以保全这个世界。我们来这里不仅仅是要报仇，还因为我们必须阻止克苏恩！",
    ["And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You'll find Thelman Slatefist in the King's audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley."] = "真希望与你同行，$n。去暴风要塞吧，跟国王觐见室的塞尔曼·岩拳谈谈，他会帮助你前往奥特兰克山谷的。",
    ["And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin' for a fine steed.  There's no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere."] = "祝你好运，勇敢的$c。我知道你在寻找一匹好战马。告诉你吧$g兄弟:姐妹;，在你所在的区域没有什么比迅猛龙更好的坐骑了！看看我的这些迅猛龙吧——他们的祖先曾经是极其凶猛的野兽。",
    ["And to which battleground do you wish to journey?"] = "你想要加入哪个战场？",
    ["Another Herbalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques."] = "关于草药学，嗯……我认为你现在和我的水平已经差不多了，也许我只能在个别细节上给你一些点拨。",
    ["Another entrepreneur, eh? Well, the Auction House can be found in the Trade District.  Not far from the bank."] = "又一个想要靠倒买倒卖发家的？拍卖所就在贸易区，离银行不远的地方。",
    ["Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? Why don't you go bother Mr. High-And-Mighty instead?"] = "又来打扰我了。像这样我还能做什么工作么？不用回答，我看起来像是很在乎你的回答么？为什么不去烦别人呢？",
    ["Another lovely day on our beautiful island."] = "我们美丽的岛屿迎来了新的一天。",
    ["Another material $gboy : girl; are we?  Well, if you are obsessed with your precious items then you will probably want to store them at the Darnassus Bank in the center of our city."] = "身上又多了一种材料$g小伙子:姑娘;，是吧？嗯，如果你携带的物品过多的话，可以将它们存储在城中心的达纳苏斯银行中。",
    ["Another student, eh? All right. I'll see what I can do to help you out."] = "另一名学生，是吗？好吧。我看看有什么能帮助你的。",
    ["Another student. Wonderful. This is why Lydon belongs to the Royal Society of Snobs and gets to do research, and I'm stuck being an instructor. If I win another teaching award, I'll never live it down!"] = "另一名学生。棒极了。这就是林度恩跻身皇家学会从事研究工作的原因，也是我坚持成为一名导师的原因。只要我再获得一枚教学奖章，我的美名便不会被人所遗忘了。",
    ["Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master, is on da Thunder Bluff lower rise.  He teach one and two-handed maces, staves and guns.Archibald, da undead weapon master in da War Quarter of da Undercity, train good with crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms.Sayoc, da ugly orc right here, can teach da ways of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons mon."] = "居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可以教你使用单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可以教你使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。  居住在这儿的相貌丑陋的兽人塞尤克可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。",
    ["Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master, is on Thunder Bluff's lower rise.  He can train one and two-handed maces, staves and guns.Hanashi, standing next to me here, can instruct in the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and all manner of thrown weapons.Archibald, the undead weapon master in the War Quarter of the Undercity, can teach the use of crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms."] = "居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可以教你使用单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。  站在我旁边的哈纳什可以教你使用弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有的投掷武器。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可以教你使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。",
    ["Any chance to fight against the Horde, especially orcs, is a good time if you ask me. You'll find plenty of battle in Warsong Gulch, that you will. Head on over to the Hall of Arms and speak with Lylandris. She'll set you on your way."] = "任何与部落——特别是兽人——交战的机会都是不容错过的。你可以在战歌峡谷中得到充分的历练，到武器大厅去找莱兰迪斯谈一谈吧，她会送你去战歌峡谷的。",
    ["Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter's Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise."] = "动物的朋友就是我的朋友。你要找的猎人大厅就在猎人高地的顶部。",
    ["Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?"] = "阿拉希盆地曾经是我们的家园，有了你的帮助，我们会收复失地的！你愿意帮助我们吗，$c？",
    ["Are ye really askin' me where the Blacksmith is?  Have ye not heard of The Great Forge!?  All our best blacksmiths gather there to craft their weapons and armor!  It's dead smack in the middle of Ironforge, and that's where you'll find one of our most brilliant blacksmiths, Bengus Deepforge.  "] = "你是问我铁匠在哪儿？你没听说过大熔炉吗？所有最好的铁匠都聚集在那儿铸造武器和护甲！  在铁炉堡中心都是敲打铁器的声音，你能在那儿找到最出色的铁匠本古斯·深炉。",
    ["Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?$B$B<Rohan sighs.>$B$BIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.$B$BIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments."] = "你傻了吗？你一路上竟然没有看到任何该死的骨头丁零的玩意？$B$B<洛汉叹了一口气。>$B$B如果在户外的话，你很容易就能在东西瘟疫之地发现各类骷髅生物。相信我，你一定不会错过它们的，当然，它们要是看见了你，也不会错过你……$B$B如果你喜欢地下城，那就去斯坦索姆或者通灵学院，那里也能拿到白骨碎片。",
    ["Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time."] = "你是来接受训练，还是来浪费一个战士的时间的？",
    ["Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch?  Lok'tar Ogar $c!"] = "你是来帮助我们在战歌峡谷作战的吗？为了部落，$c！",
    ["Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?"] = "你有兴趣探索这些地下城中的一个吗？",
    ["Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I'm a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I'm a clown? Huh, is it! You think I'm a clown don't you!"] = "你是在开玩笑吧？你一定是在开玩笑！你认为我是个取悦于你的小丑，是吗？我是小丑？嗯，是的！你认为我是小丑，是吧！",
    ["Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.$B$BSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way."] = "你疯了吗？你难道不知道那里都是些凶残无比的野兽？我们可能得使用铲子才能挖出你的尸体。我们已经在那里损失了太多生命了。$B$B我的答案是，不行。如果你想要去灼热峡谷，那么我只能说抱歉了，此路不通。",
    ["Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together."] = "你是来这儿报到的吗，$C？部落和联盟所需的所有战争物资都已经收集完毕，如约运往希利苏斯了。货物在$2113w天内就会抵达。希望有人能找到流沙节杖的碎片，将它们组合到一起。",
    ["Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice."] = "这些图案难道不漂亮吗？每一个都有自己的风格。",
    ["Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire.  I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession."] = "铁匠阿古斯居住在闪金镇。我想他能教你如何做一名铁匠。",
    ["Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?$B$BOh settle down friend, this is a good one!"] = "好吧*嗝儿*……嗯，你看起来很眼熟*嗝儿*。我有跟你说过我和温德索尔一起跟，呃，一，一百万个兽人战斗的事儿吗？$B$B哦，坐下来吧，朋友，这个故事非常棒的！",
    ["Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "阿诺克能制作很好的绷带。他住在精神山谷灵魂归宿旁边的湖畔，就在适者生存小屋。沿着力量山谷向西走便可抵达。",
    ["Arr!   There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena.   If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!"] = "啊！没有比看人们在竞技场中互相厮杀更好看的东西了。如果你来得是时候的话，那你也将是他们中的一员！",
    ["As a culture we believe in letting nothing go to waste.  When we are forced to slay a creature we take what we can to make sure its sacrifice was not in vain.  If you wish to learn the proper way to take the skin of a slain beast, then seek out Eladriel in the Craftsmen's Terrace."] = "不随意浪费东西是我们的传统文化。当我们不得不杀死某种生物时，我们会加以利用，不让它白白丧命。  要是你想学习剥皮的话，就去工匠区找艾拉迪尔吧。",
    ["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."] = "作为一名法师，你是少数可以召唤传送门返回这个地方的$r。如果你已经准备就绪，我就可以教你这种法术。",
    ["As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight's Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight's Hammer.$B$BIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.$B$BIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune. "] = "作为黑海岸的一名年轻的暗夜精灵，我遇到了一队暮光之锤的成员。他们待我如同亲人，因此我背叛了对艾露恩的信仰，听信了他们的蛊惑之言。$B$B直到艾露恩的幻影从我眼前闪过，我才幡然省悟。$B$B我满怀悔恨，开始向艾露恩祈祷。",
    ["As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.$B$BIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately."] = "作为驻扎在这里的工头，我的职责就是确保在这里所进行的所有事情，从工作到休息和放松都包含着一定的令人厌烦的成分。$B$B如果你发现某件你被要求去做的事情过于简单或者没有什么好抱怨的话，请立即向我报告。",
    ["As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords."] = "异种虫看起来已经够可怕的了，可是和它们的其拉主人比起来，它们可以算是温顺的了。",
    ["As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading $n?"] = "只要那些矮人一直待在那里，我们就不会有麻烦。你现在要去哪里，$n？",
    ["As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here."] = "我们一直欢迎你的到来，就像我们欢迎平原上吹过的风。",
    ["As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams."] = "正如你所见的一样，我只不过是单枪匹马。黑铁矮人和拉格纳罗斯的爪牙可以轻松把我摆平，但是我对于像你这样勇敢的冒险者充满了信心，你一定可以把大熔炉里的那些东西全部搞定的。如果你愿意帮助我，我会给予你丰富的奖励，那些奖励将是你做梦也想不到的。",
    ["Aspiring to join our ranks one day?  Sark Ragetotem can help you on your way.  He's in the Hunter's Hall."] = "想要加入我们的行列？萨尔克·狂暴图腾可以指引你，他就在猎手大厅里。",
    ["Astaia has fished up some curious treasures over the ages she has spent fishing.  Why don't you go see her over in the Tradesman's terrace and have her show you some of them."] = "阿斯坦娅在她经常垂钓的地方钓起了一些古怪的财宝。去贸易区找她吧，让她给你看看。",
    ["At last! I am finally free from this cell!$b$bThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal's progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.$b$bI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.$b$bYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond...."] = "终于！终于从这破牢房里逃出来了！$b$b肯瑞托将我从达拉然派到这个银松森林里来，要我调查阿鲁高和他的亡灵仆从们的活动，可我们却一点也不知道那个巫师已经完全失去了理智。$b$b我必须立刻把这个消息汇报上去！可在我离开之前，让我先把庭院门上的魔法锁给打开。$b$b既然你能击败雷希戈尔，或许也能从前面的层层埋伏中杀出一条血路……",
    ["At last! Someone to free me from this cell!$b$bHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.$b$bBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.$b$bI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond."] = "终于！终于有人把我从这破牢房里给救出来了！$b$b高级执行官哈德瑞克大人派我们来这儿收集这座要塞里的信息，以便制定一个能永久消灭铲除阿鲁高的计划。$b$b但那个老不死的巫师还真有点能耐，我们很快就被他的魔法结界给发现了。我被抓来关在这里，不过文森特可就没这么走运了。$b$b我得马上回去向哈德瑞克大人汇报。首先我会把庭院里的锁给你打开，或许你这么强悍的$c能从前面的一大堆伏兵里杀出一条血路……",
    ["At last, my soul is free!"] = "我的灵魂终于自由了。",
    ["At last, the curse is lifted. Thank you, hero."] = "终于，诅咒解除了。谢谢你，英雄。",
    ["At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern.  Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room."] = "去镇子东南角的恐惧之末旅店，你可以在旅店楼上的阅览室中找到黑暗牧师贝里尔的。",
    ["Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek."] = "去北面的雷霆崖吧，从那儿开始你的旅程，朋友。一旦你到达雷霆崖，那儿的守卫会直接告诉你你要找的东西在哪儿。",
    ["Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?"] = "$g小伙子:姑娘;，你准备好动身前往奥特兰克山谷了吗？让部落尝尝失败的滋味！",
    ["Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let's see what we can accomplish shall we?"] = "是的，很高兴能教你如何锻造。系上围裙，拿起铁锤，看看我们能锻造出什么来？",
    ["Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?"] = "嗯，你在找哪个战场？",
    ["Aye, everyone wants to ride the tram, it's a real hoot and a half.  Well, if ye want to find the tram, it's located over in Tinker Town just east of the gates of Ironforge."] = "是的，每个人都想坐矿道地铁，那真是酷毙了。嗯，你可以去铁炉堡大门以东的技工区找矿道地铁。",
    ["Aye, the Highlord Mograine: A founder of the original order of the Scarlet Crusade. A knight of unwavering faith and purity; Mograine would be betrayed by his own son and slain by Kel'Thuzad's forces inside Stratholme. It is how I ended up here..."] = "是的，莫格莱尼，大领主莫格莱尼：血色十字军最初的建立者之一，一位一生忠诚于其信仰，致力于净化世间一切罪恶的骑士。他被自己的亲生儿子背叛，并被克尔苏加德的军队杀死在了斯坦索姆城内。这也是我现在横在这里的原因……",
    ["Aye, you look the type to be a leader.  Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?"] = "是的，你看起来是个领导者。你是来这里组织公会与联盟作战吗？",
    ["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!"] = "啊，你！如果你想要赢得暗矛部族的尊重，那你可以向我们捐赠那些急需的资源！你要知道，布料和绷带不会从树上长出来。$B$B我们需要你在冒险中得到的那些布料，把它们捐给我们吧！这样你就可以得到暗矛部族的青睐！",
    ["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!"] = "啊，你！如果你想要赢得铁炉堡矮人的尊重，那么你可以为我们捐赠有价值的资源！铁炉堡现在的布料和绷带的存储量很低！$B$B你可以捐赠各种你在冒险中得到的布料！这样一来，你就可以赢得铁炉堡矮人对你的尊重！",
    ["Back off or I'll cut you in half."] = "退后，否则我会把你一下子砍成两半的。",
    ["Bah!  Mailboxes...  all I get is junk mail lately!  Increase the size of this... decrease the size of that... act now for your free Sword of Dragonslaying.  I have to change my mailbox number every other month!  Well, ye can't say I didn't warn ye.  If you're looking for the mailbox it's just outside the Stonefire Tavern."] = "呸！邮箱……最近我收到的全都是垃圾邮件！  增加这个的尺寸……减少那个的尺寸……现在是免费的屠龙剑。我得每隔一个月就要更改邮箱号码才行！  嗯，你可别说我没警告过你。邮箱就在石火旅店外面。",
    ["Bah, rogues have done nothing but make our job here in Stormwind harder. I wish I could drag both Osborne and Mathias both out of Old Town and right to the Stockade."] = "哎，潜行者只会影响我们在暴风城的工作。我真希望能把奥斯伯和马迪亚斯直接送到暴风城监狱去。",
    ["Bah, that's goblin work!  Still, we have an orc here in Razor Hill that will teach you of such things.  Look for Mukdrak over near the forge."] = "呸，那是地精的东西！在剃刀岭有一个兽人可以教你如何制作这些物品。去熔炉附近找穆德拉克吧。",
    ["Balai Lok'Wein of Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh sells a manual that you will need to study in order to improve your skills!"] = "尘泥沼泽蕨墙村的格鲁克卡恩在卖指南书，你需要好好研究它来提高自己的技能！",
    ["Balthus Stoneflayer is the one to see about Skinning.  If it can be skinned, he can teach ye how.  Just walk yerself over to Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge."] = "巴尔萨斯·裂石是一名剥皮师，他会教你如何剥皮的。去大熔炉北边的皮甲用品店找他吧。",
    ["Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages."] = "你是说绷带吗？哦，如果我没有记错的话，联盟已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，而总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。",
    ["Bandages, anti-venoms and such things, these are the inevitable necessities of life on the plains.  Vira Younghoof can teach you this knowledge.  You can find her in the long house on the west side of Bloodhoof Village."] = "绷带、抗毒药品这些东西在草原生活中是不可缺少的必需品。维尔拉·幼蹄能教你如何制作它们。你可以在血蹄村西边的房子中找到她。",
    ["Bandages? Why, do you intend to survive long enough to need them? Har! Very well, $r, I will tell you. Of the $2080w wool bandaged needed, we have collected $2079w. Also to date, we have taken in $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages, and $2089w of $2090w runecloth bandages asked for."] = "绷带？为什么，你需要绷带救命吗？哈哈！很好，$R，我会告诉你的。我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带了，总的需求量是$2080w根。另外，到目前为止，我们拥有$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，总的需求量分别是$2086w和$2090w。",
    ["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."] = "根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、五份细胞增强剂和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的僵尸或食尸鬼身上获取细胞增强剂！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。",
    ["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."] = "根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、四份外膜震荡体和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的鬼魂或怨灵身上获取外膜震荡体！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。",
    ["Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron."] = "根据你提供的毒素样本，我们认为你需要下面这些东西：一份奥术催化剂、六份骨质分离素和四块符文布。你可以使用玻璃放大镜从瘟疫之地的骸骨亡灵身上获取骨质分离素！$B$B一旦你获得了这些物品，就可以把它们放进瘟疫之锅里了。",
    ["Be advised, $g Jackson : Princess; - I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny.  I am here to make sure that the Arch Druid's research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle."] = "考虑清楚，$g小子:姑娘;——我可没心情听你废话。我在这里的工作是确认大德鲁伊的研究工作正在按计划进行，而不是跟那些不愿为塞纳里奥议会效劳的家伙聊天。",
    ["Be careful out in the desert, $c."] = "在沙漠里要多加小心，$c。",
    ["Be gone!  I hold counsel with Dreadlords, and the matters we discuss are not your concern!"] = "滚！我只和恐惧魔王打交道，你没资格来跟我说话！",
    ["Be quiet!  Can't you see the master is speaking?"] = "安静！你没听见主人在讲话吗？",
    ["Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!"] = "肃静！我不能漏掉这次讲座任何一句话！",
    ["Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!"] = "一定要来看看暗月马戏团为你带来的各种千奇百怪的东西！",
    ["Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"] = "别忘了观看下一场焰火表演！每天下午6点开始，每小时整点都会有一次！",
    ["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"] = "请告诉冬天爷爷是什么秘密让你想要得到冬幕！",
    ["Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace."] = "没有具备天赋的附魔师，刀刃不可能如此锋利，护甲也不可能如此坚固。塔兰丹就是这样的附魔师，他可以教你如何给武器和护甲附魔。去工匠区找他吧。",
    ["Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself."] = "你帮助了我，我会告诉我所知的这片土地和生物的情况。我所了解的并不多，但是我可以告诉你一些你可能感兴趣的事儿。",
    ["Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight."] = "我生前是一名图书管理员，与战争和灾难无缘。我从未想过要变成现在这样。另一方面，现在我能主宰自己，我是不会不战而降的。",
    ["Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!$B$BAnd my prices were INSANE!$B$BJust ask anyone.  Anyone who's not dead."] = "在亡灵天灾来临之前，我是一名大商贩。我出售所有商品。所有！$B$B价钱都极其便宜！$B$B你随便问问那些没死的人，看看我说的是不是真的。",
    ["Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands."] = "在瘟疫来之前，我对皮革一无所知。现在我的知识可以传授别人了。死亡让我有了很多时间供自己支配。",
    ["Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.$B$BProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!"] = "在我身后是赞扎祭坛，赞达拉部族的神圣之地。我们在此祷告，希望能充分做好对抗血神哈卡的准备工作。$B$B利用祭坛摧毁你在祖尔格拉布找到的任何哈卡莱宝石，以此证明你对部族的价值。我会用赞达拉荣誉硬币跟你交换祖尔格拉布的硬币。找到我需要的硬币，你将获得丰厚的奖励！",
    ["Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded."] = "作为探险者协会的一员，我曾在这片区域搜寻古代器物。据说冬泉谷有许多不可思议的物品……很多物品都受到严密的保护。",
    ["Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury."] = "本娜就像着魔一样工作。她日以继夜地调制这些药剂，不吃不睡。我知道我们的亡灵盟友需要帮助，但是我担心她这样会伤身体的。",
    ["Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first."] = "先不说外面的那些卫兵，我和我的兄弟们可都参加过海加尔山之战。谁想要在银行里面行窃，那就先过我们这一关。",
    ["Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?"] = "暴风城最好的货物啊，朋友，你绝对不应该错过。看看有什么你需要的东西吗？",
    ["Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain't many weapons they haven't had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training."] = "比克斯和布里维夫的武器沾满了兽人的鲜血。如果你想学习的话，就去密林武器店找他们吧。",
    ["Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see."] = "在光明与黑暗之间，还有阴影……而那些阴影有些你未曾见过的力量。",
    ["Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master, is wandering about in this shop.  She can teach crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons."] = "侏儒武器大师比克斯在这商店附近游荡。她可以教你使用弩、匕首和投掷武器。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器大师吴平可以教你使用弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。  居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳套、法杖和投掷武器。",
    ["Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors.  See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend.  Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't.  You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town."] = "黑色、灰色和深紫色是规定的颜色。朋友，看仔细了，可别迷失方向。博文·布里斯博埃斯可以帮助你。你可以穿过镇子西南的桥梁，去炉灰庄园找他。",
    ["Blackfathom Deeps can be found at the north end of Zoram Strand along the coast of Ashenvale."] = "黑暗深渊位于灰谷海岸佐拉姆海岸的最北部。",
    ["Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south."] = "黑石山脉位于灼热峡谷和燃烧平原的中间。",
    ["Blacksmith?  Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge.  There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though.  Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh?  Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians.  They should be able to point you in the right direction."] = "铁匠？不，我们最后一名铁匠都转变成毫无头脑的亡灵天灾士卒啦。但是镇子南边的幽暗城中还居住着一名铁匠。幽暗城在洛丹伦废墟下面，好听的名字，是吗？乘坐废墟后面的电梯抵达幽暗城，去跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会为你指明方向的。",
    ["Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas."] = "最近书本丢失甚多。博学者和他的助手非常恼怒。他们怀疑在埃雷萨拉斯有人妄图不轨。",
    ["Bow in my presence, insect! Surely you can feel the power I hold over you."] = "卑微的家伙，在我面前鞠躬吧！你能感受到我那强大的力量。",
    ["Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived!  Huzzah!"] = "男孩们女孩们——所有的孩子们——暗月马戏团已经到啦！哈哈！",
    ["Brandur Ironhammer would be the one ye'd want to see.  Ye can find him in the Hall of Mysteries north of the gates of Ironforge."] = "布兰度尔·铁锤就是你想找的人。你可以去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅找他。",
    ["Brash. Master Ravenholdt does not like brash."] = "鲁莽的家伙。拉文霍德公爵可不喜欢这样的人。",
    ["Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems."] = "去中部高地的石蹄地质学会找布瑞克·石蹄，他会教你如何采集矿石和宝石。",
    ["Bronzebeard's gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn't get any of his brother's good senses."] = "铜须再次失踪了！那家伙跟他的兄弟不一样，一点判断力都没有。",
    ["Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire.  You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him."] = "威尔海姆修士经常在闪金镇的锻冶场后面培训里瑞亚·杜拉克。你可能会从他那里学到一些圣骑士的知识。",
    ["Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons."] = "居住在铁炉堡密林武器店的矮人大师布里维夫可以教你使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  居住在铁炉堡密林武器店的侏儒武器大师比克斯可以教你使用弩、匕首和投掷武器。  居住在达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器大师伊琳尼雅·月火可以教你使用弓箭、匕首、拳套、法杖和投掷武器。",
    ["Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master at the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, teaches crossbow, daggers and throwing weapons.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff."] = "铁炉堡密林武器店的矮人武器管理人布里维夫可以教你如何使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  铁炉堡密林武器店的侏儒武器管理人比克斯  可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首和投掷武器。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器管理人吴平可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。",
    ["Buliwyf, the dwarven weapon master right here at the Timberline Arms, teaches fist weapons, guns, one and two-handed axes and one and two-handed maces.Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller's Arsenal in Stormwind, teaches crossbow, daggers, one and two-handed swords, polearms, and staff.Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master, resides at the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus where she teaches bow, daggers, fist weapons, staff and throwing weapons."] = "密林武器店的矮人武器管理人布里维夫可以教你如何使用拳头武器、枪、单手斧、双手斧、单手锤和双手锤。  暴风城维勒武器店的人类武器管理人吴平可以教你如何使用十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑、长柄武器和法杖。  达纳苏斯战士区的暗夜精灵武器管理人伊琳尼雅·月火  可以教你如何使用弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、法杖和投掷  武器。",
    ["Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?"] = "博恩奈特是我的名字，我把铁匠作为我的兴趣……另外，呃……我还卖一些食物和水。来点肉类怎么样？",
    ["Butcher you say?  Oh, First Aid Trainer!  Same thing.  When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why."] = "你说屠夫？哦，急救训练师！一个样。当你看到护士妮拉站在城镇东南面的恐惧之末旅店里面时你就会明白为什么。",
    ["By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed."] = "承蒙月神的关照，我很高兴给你在整个泰达希尔找到的最好的坐骑，甚至是这世上最好的--黑豹。数年来，哨兵部队一直倚赖这些同伴的价值。$B$B抓紧时间，朋友，挑选一匹你满意的。我敢肯定你不会失望的。",
    ["Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid."] = "拜恩希经常为在野外巡逻的哨兵服务。如果你想学习急救的话就该找她谈谈。",
    ["Byancie's skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her."] = "拜恩希在急救方面的技巧已经很知名了。如果你想向她学习的话，你可以到多兰纳尔旅店的北面去找她。",
    ["Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n."] = "凯恩把我们带到了一片充满希望的大地。我们很幸运，因此我们再把好运带给别人。这就是我为什么开始教学的原因，$n。",
    ["Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."] = "凯恩自己住这儿，他们说。一旦我完成了制作一件合适的礼物，我就会把他找出来。或许他会有智慧的话要对我说。",
    ["Can I help you?"] = "我能帮忙吗？",
    ["Can I show you what I have for sale?"] = "想看看我出售的货物吗？",
    ["Can Zamja help you, $r?"] = "扎姆沙能帮你吗，$r？",
    ["Can ye hear it, stranger? The humming is gettin' louder with each passing day. These crystals must be what's driving these bugs crazy."] = "你可以听到吗，陌生人？嗡嗡的声音一天比一天响。这些水晶一定是把那些虫子逼疯的元凶。",
    ["Can you enchant my axe?  I'll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan's Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom."] = "你能给我的斧头附魔吗？我需要永久性的。或许晚些。到智慧谷附近的暗巷区西端找到古丹的符文工艺店。",
    ["Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, $n. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!"] = "你难道感觉不到大地母亲为了她所丢失的孩子，也就是亡灵们，而出现的苦恼吗？快些说，$n。每一秒对我都很珍贵。我们必须帮他们找到回归她身边的路！",
    ["Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse."] = "你看到他们了吗？当然没有……我认为你是看不到的。以你的资质，即使有眼睛也和瞎了没有什么区别。",
    ["Can't help ya, $n. I only train rogues."] = "没法帮你，$n。我只训练潜行者。",
    ["Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions."] = "不能帮你。你比我更懂药剂。还有，我还要看着罐子。去找那边的Yelmak谈谈。他懂得很多药剂的知识。",
    ["Can't you see I'm busy here?  Go north up the road to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there.  You can't miss it."] = "你没看到我很忙吗?沿着路向北走到奥格瑞玛并询问那里的步兵。你不会错过的。",
    ["Can't you see I'm fishing here!"] = "你没看到我在这里钓鱼吗？",
    ["Can't you see I've got work to do here?"] = "你没看到我这儿正忙着呢！",
    ["Can't you see we're trying to prepare for Uther's visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!"] = "你没看到我们正在准备迎接乌瑟的访问吗？现在别妨碍我，我有许多工作要做！",
    ["Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.$B$BI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.$B$BWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...$B$B<Eva weeps.>"] = "当然，$g先生:小姐;。我们曾是巴罗夫家里的仆人：现在那里被称作通灵学院。$B$B我那时是女仆的领班而卢森是主人巴罗夫的男管家。$B$B我们为巴罗夫家族工作了数十年，直到……$B$B<艾瓦哭了。>",
    ["Certainly, $n. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about."] = "当然，$n。你只需要先告诉我你想知道关于哪个声望等级的信息。",
    ["Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as exalted must submit a combined total of 12 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 54 insignias.$B$BThose exalted in the eyes of the Dawn receive the greatest discounts."] = "当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有崇拜级别声望的冒险者需要上缴12个徽记以获得优秀的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴54个徽记。$B$B只有在银色黎明眼中被崇拜的人，才能获得最大的折扣。",
    ["Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn."] = "当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有友善级别声望的冒险者需要上缴60个徽记以获得优秀的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴220个徽记。$B$B对于那些银色黎明尚不眷顾的冒险者来说，这个价格是非常之高的。",
    ["Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn."] = "当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有尊敬级别声望的冒险者需要上缴40个徽记以获得优秀品质的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴150个徽记。$B$B我承认，这个价格即便是对尊敬级别的冒险者来说，也确实有些高了。",
    ["Certainly, $n.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.$B$BThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high."] = "当然，$n。$B$B在银色黎明组织中拥有崇敬级别声望的冒险者需要上缴14个徽记以获得优秀品质的物品。若想获得更加强大的物品，他们需要上缴90个徽记。$B$B这个价格对崇敬级别的冒险者来说，可是说是完全合理的！但最强大的物品仍然是高价的。",
    ["Check around Old Town at the Barracks or the Pig and Whistle Tavern. If you go to the tavern, be sure to sample some of the fine brews. Puts the dwarven ales to shame, I tell ya."] = "去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店逛逛吧。如果你去旅店的话，别忘了尝尝那里的好酒，那些酒绝对能让矮人的酒相形见拙。",
    ["Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can."] = "到中部高地的附魔店去看看吧。泰戈会很乐意帮助你的。",
    ["Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth."] = "樱桃馅饼是我在整个艾泽拉斯最喜欢的食物。",
    ["Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty."] = "在你开始任何工作之前都要洗净双手。皮革被血或尘土玷污了会带走它的自然美。",
    ["Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!"] = "靠近点，但是不要抽雪茄！我恐怕你必须得先跟我的妹妹洁娜谈谈。当她领你复习完基础知识再回来找我，我那时就会让你见识真正有趣的东西！",
    ["Cloth is okay. Personally I prefer to work with human skin."] = "布料也可以。就我个人来说我更喜欢使用人皮。",
    ["Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle."] = "给部落做衣服与其余的工作同样重要。你该到雷霆崖防具店里面寻找坦帕。她对针线活有自己的天赋。",
    ["Clothing!?  That won't help you against good steel!  Bah, if you're sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar's Cloth Goods in The Drag."] = "布衣！？那不会帮你抵挡住好钢做成的武器的！哈，如果你确定你想当个裁缝的话到暗巷区的玛加尔布品店那儿去吧。",
    ["Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake."] = "克莱德·凯林，当地的钓鲈鱼高手，有他自己最喜欢的钓鱼地点，就在布瑞尔东部的澈水湖。",
    ["Collection of bandages is proceeding according to schedule. As far as linen bandages are concerned, we've gathered $2076w of $2077w. Silk bandages have been tallied at $2082w out of $2083w, and we have $2088w out of $2090w runecloth bandages needed."] = "收集绷带的工作正有条不紊地按计划进行着。我们已经收集到$2076w根亚麻绷带、$2082w根丝质绷带和$2088w根符文布绷带了，总的需求量分别是$2077w、$2083w和$2090w。",
    ["Come and take a look at my wares while you still can.  We're here all week, and then we're off to some far off land."] = "趁现在还有机会，过来看看我的货物吧。我们要在这儿呆上一周，然后就要动身去远方啦。",
    ["Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that."] = "当你接受更多训练以后再回来找我。在那边的兰达尔·沃斯可以帮你。",
    ["Come closer, young one.  In my time I could hear the flutter of a prey's beating heart, but now you must speak up if you want your words heard."] = "年轻的$c，靠近一点。我年轻的时候耳朵可好使了，但现在你必须大声说话我才能听到。",
    ["Come in, come in. Just don't sit too close to the stove. It hasn't exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere."] = "请进，请进！不要坐得离火炉太近。它今天还没爆炸，但是为了安全起见，我想你还是坐在别的地方比较好。",
    ["Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition."] = "来学习猎人之道吧。骄傲，荣誉，还有传统。",
    ["Come to learn from the master eh?"] = "你是来学习的吗？",
    ["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."] = "你是来学习的？嗯，我或许会给你一些事儿做的。",
    ["Come to me again with such pathetic work and I will send you home in a small iron box that I tempered in goat urine. Now go see that idiot Ug'thok, he is better suited to your needs."] = "再次给我带来这种劣质货我就把你装在用山羊尿回过火的小铁盒里送回家。现在去见见那个傻瓜乌格索克，他更加适合你的需要。",
    ["Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?"] = "你与塞拉摩卫兵一起训练过吗？",
    ["Conspiracies abound, I say.  There are those who lack vision in understanding what I do, and would seek to keep me shackled to obscurity!$B$BDon't step in the dirt."] = "我感觉到处都是阴谋。还有那些对我所做的事情缺乏理解的家伙，他们想要把我关起来！$B$B你最好不要牵扯进来。",
    ["Cooking is a life long pursuit and I see we share the same passion!"] = "烹饪是我一生的追求，我觉得我们俩有共同的爱好！",
    ["Cyndra's knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I'm sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "塞恩德拉在炼金术方面的知识有些局限，但是我相信那也足够领你入门了。她就在多兰纳尔旅店的东面。",
    ["Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari."] = "玛艾里的容器有很多秘密……用来制作它的碎片是可以反光的，你可以使用它的反光面从其它事物身上吸取能量然后反射到自己身上。$B$B将护符放在你的背包里可以让你聚集魂精，也就是与你战斗的野兽的灵魂力量。一旦你找到魂精，你把它带给玛艾里。",
    ["Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?"] = "灵魂与你永在，孩子。我能为你做些什么？",
    ["Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly."] = "达丽亚娜答应了，但是她的精力如此充沛，很难让她安静下来仔细的聆听。她气力十足又机灵敏捷，我恐怕她不久就会被叫去参加战斗。我们必须快点教她。",
    ["Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill.  Come and get em while they're hot!"] = "刚从烤架上取下的暗月热狗非常鲜美。趁着它们还没变冷的时候，赶快去买吧！",
    ["Darkmoon Faire Cards?  See the Professor here for those.  Come see me if you are a dealer in hard to come by antiquities and artifacts."] = "暗月卡片？看到你面前的这位专家了吧？如果你想要了解这方面的东西，就来找我吧。",
    ["Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill.  Why don't you talk to him and see what he can teach you?"] = "达扎拉以他的狩猎技能在多兰纳尔小有名气。为什么不找他谈谈，看看他能教你点什么呢？",
    ["Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!"] = "要将这些桶运送到挖掘点非常困难，但是要获得火药，还得靠我们自己。$B$B我们必须竭尽所能地对抗黑铁！",
    ["Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."] = "虽然亡灵受到重创，但是他们还是赶来帮助我们。我只希望我们也能对他们有所帮助。去灵魂高地下面的预见之池附近寻找柯布神父。",
    ["Dhugru Gorelust is hiding behind the barracks on the east side of town.  Don't let me find out that you're in league with the Burning Legion!"] = "杜格鲁·血怒在城镇东边的兵营后面。不要让我发觉你跟燃烧军团是一伙的！",
    ["Did Crest send you?"] = "是谁派你来的？",
    ["Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is."] = "是我亲爱的恋人卡利派你来找我的？她可是我的宝贝。",
    ["Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?"] = "你带来了课本吗？我能和你一起看吗？",
    ["Did you finish yesterday's assignment?  If so, then sit by me!"] = "你完成了昨天的作业吗？要是完成了，就过来跟我坐一块吧！",
    ["Did you forget your student's attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge's domination?"] = "你忘记自己的学生服了吗？你认为时尚比亡灵天灾的统治更重要吗？",
    ["Didn't we just break free of the Burning Legion, and here you are messing with demons again?  Seek out the Darkfire Enclave in the underground cavern known as the Cleft of Shadow.  You'll find a tunnel down into it from The Drag."] = "我们不是刚从燃烧军团魔掌中逃脱吗，现在你却又跟恶魔纠缠不清了？去地下洞穴暗影裂口寻找暗火营地。在暗巷区中有一条地道通往那儿。",
    ["Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $n!"] = "雷德沃克斯主管让我负责新型伐木机的研制计划。只剩几个月了，我处在水深火热之中！我需要你的帮助，$n！",
    ["Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out."] = "加基森的迪尔格·奎克里弗对厨艺非常精通。要想提高自己的能力，你就去找他吧。",
    ["Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick."] = "我看上去像是那种闲得可以招待每个旅行者的人吗？快点告诉我你需要什么，我可没有时间和你慢慢磨蹭。",
    ["Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?"] = "我看上去像是有时间和你闲谈的样子吗？",
    ["Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood."] = "你看我像是个$c吗？在我决定用你的血洗我的刀之前，赶紧逃吧。",
    ["Do I look stupid to you, $r? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?"] = "你看我像个傻子吗，$r？我可以签署她的死亡证明书！我为什么要信任你呢？",
    ["Do I look to you like I cast spells?  Well, I did hear that Cain Firesong was hanging out on the upstairs landing of the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  Odd how he just stands there outside of Gretchen's room like that."] = "你看我像个会施魔法的人吗？嗯，我确实听说 凯恩·火歌居住在城镇东南部的恐惧之末旅店的楼上。他那样站在格雷彻的房间之外可真奇怪。",
    ["Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.$B$BGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly."] = "别再靠近我了，$n。我已经可以感觉到印章中流淌着的邪恶力量了。$B$B给我一点时间，让我来检查检查——你要紧紧地握住它。",
    ["Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it."] = "别试图将你的意愿强加到皮革上。而是让其天然的特性显示出自身的形状和功能。这不是一场战役。与皮革协同工作，而不是与其作对。",
    ["Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day."] = "别与圣光作对，$c，或许有一天它能拯救你。",
    ["Do not waste my time, $c."] = "别浪费我的时间，$c。",
    ["Do we have Mining trainers here?  Where do ye think ye are!?  Why you'll find one o' the best miners in all Dun Morogh at the Deepmountain Mining Guild on the northern side of The Great Forge.  There, Geofram Bouldertoe will show ye the true art of mining."] = "这儿有采矿训练者吗？你认为你在哪儿！？  你将在大熔炉北边深山采矿公会找到丹莫罗地区最好的矿工。吉尔弗拉姆·石趾将为你展示真正的采矿艺术。",
    ["Do ye have some new treasures that ye want to keep safe n' sound?  Then ye'll be wanting to store them at The Vault with the Stonemantles.  Ye'll find The Vault just a hammer's throw northeast from the entrance to Ironforge."] = "你有需要保管的财宝吗？去找铁炉堡银行的石衣兄弟吧。  从铁炉堡的入口往东北方向走，银行就在那边。",
    ["Do ye have the potential to be a skilled hunter?  Well $gladdie : lassie;, only time will tell.  Just don't ye go shooting at apples atop peoples' heads till ye've spoken with Regnus o'er in the Hall of Arms."] = "你具有成为一名熟练猎人的潜质吗？嗯，$g年青人:姑娘;，时间会告诉我们一切的。在与军事区的雷格努斯交谈之前，别对着别人的眼睛射击。",
    ["Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?$B$BYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.$B$BYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.$B$B<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>$B$BTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency."] = "你是不是想要我在强大的$N所率领的军团之前畏缩？$B$B你对我来说不算什么。什么都不是。如果我想要你的头颅，那它就会被插在长矛上呈送给我。$B$B你犯了所有凡人都会犯的错误。$B$B<维克多·奈法里奥斯叹了口气。>$B$B如果你像花钱一样花费你的时间，那就会发生一些奇怪的事情。",
    ["Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!"] = "你有蜘蛛或是甲虫吗，$C？它们速度快，但是如果你的速度更快的话，你会发现拥有它们是件乐事！",
    ["Do you hear the call of the hunt, $c?  You must listen closely, but the call comes from deep within you.  It comes from deep within all of us."] = "你听到狩猎的召唤了吗，$c？你必须仔细聆听，但是召唤从你的内心传来。他从我们所有人内心传来。",
    ["Do you know of the Highborne? The Shen'dralar?"] = "你知道上层精灵吗？你知道辛德拉古吗？",
    ["Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?"] = "当我因为绑着这个大铁球而不能保护自己的时候，你会嘲笑我吗？",
    ["Do you prefer guns or bows?"] = "你是喜欢枪支还是弓箭？",
    ["Do you require an illusion?$B$BShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.$B$BShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives."] = "你需要幻象吗？$B$B要是在执行任务的过程中幻象失效，回到我这儿来，我将重新对你进行伪装。$B$B如果你尽力而为还是失败了，别放弃！回到我这儿来。我将助你完成目标。",
    ["Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.  "] = "诸如公会登记表等文档可从达纳苏斯的公会注册员那儿获得。",
    ["Does my name sound familiar to you? Maybe we knew each other a long time ago...$B$BI think I'm named after someone important..."] = "你听说过我的名字吗？或许我们俩很早就相识了……$B$B我认为我得名于某个重要人物……",
    ["Don't be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely whole, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?"] = "别紧张……这些狮鹫虽然伤势未愈，但是它们仍然能把你安全地送往目的地。告诉我……你想要去哪座哨塔？",
    ["Don't be shy, buy a round for everyone!"] = "别害羞，请这儿的每个人喝上一杯吧！",
    ["Don't blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you'll need to take advantage of it.Tell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!"] = "我不会因为你想学钓鱼而责怪你的。莫高雷有卡利姆多大陆上最好的钓鱼胜地，而在山顶渔具店中，你可以找到钓鱼所需的一切装备。  告诉卡尔·迷雾行者是我让你去的！",
    ["Don't bother me while I'm partying..."] = "在我参加聚会时别骚扰我……",
    ["Don't come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning. "] = "不要那样从阴暗中走出来。下次你要先给女生一点警示。",
    ["Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!"] = "别忘记买点饮料和纪念品！",
    ["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says 'Wondrous Winter Veil' like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."] = "在假期里不要忘记储备包装纸！没什么能比包装精美的护甲和武器一样让你的朋友和家人感受到冬幕节的温馨快乐！",
    ["Don't get too close, $n. I'm liable to fumble and bash your brains open with the face of my hammer."] = "不要靠得太近，$N。我手中的铁锤可能会敲到你的脑袋。",
    ["Don't let me catch you stealing anything!  Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow.  Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom."] = "别让我发现你盗窃了任何东西！去暗影裂口地下寻找申苏尔以及他的 迅影兄弟会。在智慧谷以南能找到通向那儿的通道。",
    ["Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him."] = "别被沃萨亮晶晶的眼睛和浓密的胡须愚弄了。他是个很有才能的学徒，也是个很好的朋友，即使我在跟他谈话时颈部有些痉挛。",
    ["Don't let the humans in the Bazaar fool ye $g lad : lass;, with the subway those gnomes built it's easier than ye might think to transport goods from Ironforge. If they try to tack on import fees just tell them yer gonna buy yer gear from me."] = "不要让市场上的人类愚弄了你，$g小伙子:姑娘;。有了侏儒建造的那条地铁运输线，你可以很轻松地把货物从铁炉堡运送过来。如果那些家伙要收你运费的话，那么就告诉他们你要到我这里来买东西。",
    ["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"] = "别花钱购买那些铃当！为了你的冬幕盛宴，把烟林牧场买下吧！",
    ["Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so."] = "别被那些天真的大眼睛欺骗了。塔雷是个专家，我每天都在学习新知识。你认为我为什么会在侏儒区？你看我像个工程师吗？啊，我可不这么想。",
    ["Don't listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within.  You know the truth."] = "别聆听来自世界的心声——答案就在你心中，你知道真相的。",
    ["Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?"] = "别担心斯奎尔图，$n。他不想这么粗鲁的，他只是非常繁忙。我们不如趁着等他完成侦察任务的时候做些更有用的事情？",
    ["Don't see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?"] = "铁匠？真少见啊。我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear."] = "不要告诉任何人我说过，就当我什么都不知道！如果你还想学习，你应该与店主宾斯匹德谈谈。",
    ["Don't tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.$B$BWhat can I help you with, $r?"] = "别说话！让我猜猜！你是为灰烬使者而来的吗？！对……呃……不对！不好意思。$B$B我能帮你什么忙吗，$R？",
    ["Don't waste my time."] = "别浪费我时间。",
    ["Don't waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He's a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics."] = "别浪费我时间。我从事研究的时间比你的年纪还要大。去跟幽暗城炼金房的亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他或许能传授给你一些基础知识。",
    ["Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.$B$BA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.$B$BWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle."] = "德鲁伊对世界上所有生物的生存状况都非常敏感。当我们知道这些鸟处于危险之中时，便设立了一套营救系统，防止它们遭受菲拉斯的堕落气息的影响。$B$B一个名叫克格尔·曲藤的侏儒负责这项工作，她收集鸟蛋并将其交给我照顾。$B$B我们总是在寻求更多的帮助，$n。或许你该前往加基森找克格尔谈一谈。",
    ["Druids?  I haven't seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own."] = "德鲁伊？我没看到过任何德鲁伊。不过在暴风城中有一块属于暗夜精灵的区域。",
    ["Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability."] = "由于职业的不同，因此我对你缺乏技能的现状无能为力。",
    ["Duncan's Textiles employs one of the finest tailors in Stormwind, Georgio Bolero. Look for the shop over in the Mage Quarter."] = "邓肯雇佣了暴风城最好的裁缝，乔吉奥·波利罗。他的店就坐落在法师区里。",
    ["E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun."] = "魂精是每个生物都有的能量。我为你做的护符使你能以物理形态来抓到它。$B$B我知道一个可以转换你发现的魂精的咒语，并把它转换成魂能。$B$B你然后可以得到玛艾里的容器，并使用它把魂能的能量转换到自己身上。$B$B来吧，试一下。把玛艾里的魂精带来我们开心一下。",
    ["Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more."] = "呃，你进展到这个程度了吗？去那边的书架找拉文尼亚·克洛文。要是你没把事情搞糟，或许你能学到更多知识。",
    ["Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him."] = "嗯？我没时间聊天，我父亲要我完成这个使命。",
    ["Elder Bellowrage watches over the Dark Portal from a ridge in the Blasted Lands."] = "风怒长者在诅咒之地的一座高山上眺望着黑暗之门。",
    ["Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil."] = "迅刀长者在达纳苏斯的街道上闲庭信步。",
    ["Elder Bloodhoof can be found at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore."] = "血蹄长者在莫高雷的血蹄村里。",
    ["Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring."] = "金矛长者在冬泉谷的凯斯利尔废墟到处游荡。",
    ["Elder Bronzebeard can be found in the ancestral home of the Bronzebeards, Ironforge."] = "铜须长者在他们家族的老家铁炉堡里。",
    ["Elder Darkcore can be found in the Undercity."] = "暗灵长者在幽暗城。",
    ["Elder Darkhorn can be found among the red rocks of Orgrimmar."] = "暗角长者在遍布红色巨岩的奥格瑞玛城中。",
    ["Elder Dawnstrider can be found at Flame Crest on the Burning Steppes."] = "晨行长者在燃烧平原的烈焰峰。",
    ["Elder Dreamseer resides in Gadgetzan in Tanaris Desert."] = "梦言长者在塔纳利斯沙漠的加基森。",
    ["Elder Farwhisper can be found wandering the streets of Stratholme."] = "远风长者在斯坦索姆的街道上徘徊。",
    ["Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh."] = "金井长者在丹莫罗的卡拉诺斯歇脚。",
    ["Elder Graveborn spends time near Brill in Tirisfal Glades."] = "灰石长者在提瑞斯法林地的布瑞尔附近打发时间。",
    ["Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind."] = "雷锤长者在暴风城里。",
    ["Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens."] = "高山长者住在贫瘠之地的陶拉祖营地。",
    ["Elder Highpeak watches over the Hinterlands from a hill near its center."] = "雪峰长者在辛特兰中部的一座山丘顶部。",
    ["Elder Ironband lives in Blackchar Cave in Searing Gorge."] = "铁环长者生活在灼热峡谷的黑炭谷中。",
    ["Elder Mistwalker enjoys watching the struggles at the Maul in Feralas."] = "迷雾长者在菲拉斯的厄运之槌竞技场观看角斗。",
    ["Elder Moonstrike can be found in the Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands."] = "月击长者在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院里。",
    ["Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens."] = "月光长者在贫瘠之地的十字路口。",
    ["Elder Morndeep spends time at the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths."] = "黎明长者在黑石深渊的秩序之环打发时间。",
    ["Elder Morningdew has taken to watching the commotion at the Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles."] = "晨露长者在千针石林的沙漠赛道观看比赛。",
    ["Elder Nightwind passes the days at the shrine in Jaedenar in Felwood."] = "夜风长者最近在费伍德森林的加德纳尔神殿里。",
    ["Elder Obsidian wanders near the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest."] = "黑曜石长者在银松森林的瑟伯切尔附近游荡。",
    ["Elder Primestone has spent many years in the Crystal Vale in Silithus."] = "棱石长者在希利苏斯的水晶谷生活了许多年。",
    ["Elder Proudhorn is enjoying the vistas above Mulgore at Thunder Bluff."] = "傲角长者正在莫高雷的雷霆崖欣赏那里的风光。",
    ["Elder Ragetotem spends her days at the Valley of the Watchers in Tanaris Desert."] = "暴怒图腾长者在塔纳利斯沙漠的守卫之谷打发时间。",
    ["Elder Rumblerock passes the years in a cave atop Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes."] = "巨石长者在燃烧平原的巨槌石顶部的一座山洞里。",
    ["Elder Silvervein can be found near Thelsamar in Loch Modan."] = "银脉长者就在洛克莫丹的塞尔萨玛附近。",
    ["Elder Skychaser looks out over Westfall from atop Sentinel Hill."] = "逐星长者每天都在哨兵岭上俯瞰西部荒野。",
    ["Elder Skygleam can be found near the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara."] = "夜光长者就在艾萨拉地区的拉文凯斯雕像附近。",
    ["Elder Snowcrown can be found in Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "雪冠长者在东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂。",
    ["Elder Starweave can be found at the coastal village of Auberdine in Darkshore."] = "星纹长者在黑海岸的奥伯丁。",
    ["Elder Stonefort has taken to the dungeons of Blackrock Spire."] = "石墙长者到黑石塔去了。",
    ["Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest."] = "雷眉长者眼下应该正在艾尔文森林的闪金镇停留。",
    ["Elder Windrun resides in the Crown Guard Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "风路长者在东瘟疫之地的皇冠哨塔里。",
    ["Elder Windtotem is keeping company with the goblins of Ratchet on the coast of the Barrens."] = "风之图腾长者在贫瘠之地的棘齿城和地精为伴。",
    ["Eldrin is the only one in Elwynn Forest that I would call a tailor.  You can find him at the Eastvale Lumber Camp if you're interested in learning the profession."] = "艾尔丁是艾尔文森林中唯一称得上裁缝的人。要是你对这个专业感兴趣，就去东谷伐木场找他吧。",
    ["Elune be praised!  You seek out our Warsong Gulch Battlemaster?  Her name is Aethalas, and she stands ready to greet you near the warrior trainers."] = "赞美月神！你在寻找我们的战歌峡谷军官？她的名字叫做伊萨拉斯，她就在战士训练师的旁边等着你。",
    ["Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it."] = "月神已经赐予暗夜精灵很多礼物。作为回报，我们有职责保卫这些森林免受部落带来的恶魔的污染。",
    ["Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone. "] = "月神的秘密很多，但是它们不能让任何人知道。",
    ["Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you."] = "月神--我崇拜你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。你在这里很受欢迎。说吧，我会尽力帮助你的。",
    ["Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now."] = "我的家族数代都从事附魔工作。我在很小的时候就学会了这项技能，就像我儿子现在在做的一样。",
    ["Engineering will provide you with the skills and knowledge to dismantle your opponents! Let me show you how..."] = "工程学能赋予你瓦解敌人的技能和知识！让我教你该如何做……",
    ["Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flamekeeper tends to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."] = "你还喜欢这里的节日气氛吗，$c？$b$b相对于一个负责照看火炬的火炬看守者, 我更像是一个历史学家，记录着每一次的庆典，当然，今年的庆典我也会记录下来。现在情况进展的不错，你说是不是？$b$b要知道，节庆火炬上燃烧着的圣火中，都蕴涵着强大的力量。我们现在这样监守着我们的火炬，但我相信，敌人的城市里，也有这样熊熊燃烧着的圣火……",
    ["Erm... I really don't know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I'd be happy to show you what I have to offer."] = "呃……很抱歉，我真的不太了解你。我是说，作为公认的机械陆行鸟经销商，我只能跟高贵的侏儒做生意。要是你是诺莫瑞根的侏儒贵族，我会很高兴地为你提供服务的。",
    ["Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She's right outside the Lion's Pride Inn if you need to speak with her."] = "旅店老板艾玛照料着这周围的所有动物。要是你需要跟她交谈的话，就去狮王之傲旅店外面找她。",
    ["Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight's Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight's Hammer."] = "我的自责、羞愧、懊悔和悲伤全都刻在这块纯金石板上。不幸的是，暮光之锤找到了石板，并认定我是诅咒者。我被立即处死，而那时我对艾露恩的祷告还没有做完。现在我已经成为了一个游荡的幽灵，无法降入扭曲虚空；我被关在笼子里，用来警告那些试图背叛暮光之锤的人。",
    ["Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training."] = "即使我也有我的局限性！如果你想继续学习的话去找幽暗城的拉文尼亚·克洛文谈谈。",
    ["Even if you somehow managed to free us without defeating C'Thun, we would focus all of our powers to see the beast banished back to the hell from whence it came - AT ANY COST."] = "即使你能设法不打败克苏恩而解救我们，我们也会不惜一切代价将他驱逐回地狱。不惜一切代价。",
    ["Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?"] = "即使在和平时期仍然会有战争，而许多氏族仍在酋长的领导下奋勇作战。你是来为奥格瑞玛而战的吗？",
    ["Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill."] = "我的才能有限，你也已经达到了。恭喜你，$n。你的下一站应该是菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地。牛头人哈拉纳·铁皮住在那里；她的技术很有声望。",
    ["Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life."] = "即使轻微地改变药剂的成份也能使它发生根本的变化。耐心和精确，年轻人：他们会让你在所有行业都受益匪浅。",
    ["Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance."] = "即使在冰冷的石头墙内，就像庇护这座城镇的墙一样，人们仍旧可以找到宁静与和平。事实上，你可以在你所在的任何地方找到他们……只需在你体内寻找这种平衡。",
    ["Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop."] = "自从阴影占据了暮色森林我就一直无法入睡。我总是被风中传来的可怕尖叫声惊醒。那听起来好像羔羊的叫声，而且声音从不会停止。",
    ["Ever vigilant in their protection of the natural world, the druids are guided by Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm who resides in the Cenarion Enclave.  You will find him and the other Druid trainers in the northern section of Darnassus."] = "居住于塞纳里奥区的德鲁伊一直在大德鲁伊鹿盔的领导下警惕地保卫着自然界。你可以在达那苏斯北部找到他和别的德鲁伊训练师。",
    ["Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity."] = "我出售的每项物品都是我自己的劳动所得。我向你保证。",
    ["Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."] = "充分利用每块碎片会让我们更加节约并会拉近我们和大地母亲的距离。莫兰塔会教给你方法。到中部高地上的雷霆崖兵器库外面可以找到她。",
    ["Excellent! I've been hopin' for a new student. Well, let's get started right away then!"] = "很好！我一直希望收个新学生。那么就让我们立刻开始吧！",
    ["Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?"] = "很好！你达到了要求的参数和规格。我可以为你做些什么吗？",
    ["Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction..."] = "很好，你已经证明了你自己！现在进入下一阶段的授课……",
    ["Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit.$B$BDo not doubt what I tell you, $n. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth."] = "这个地区有许多生物都是暗夜精灵的同盟。精灵们可以借助这些生物的能量来为自己效劳。部落也应该拥有这种能力。我想到一个方法，可以捕捉到这种能量并为我们所用。$B$B不要怀疑我告诉你的事情，$n。帮助我，你就会知道我所说的都是实话。",
    ["Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education..."] = "完成得很熟练！现在，让我们继续你的教育……",
    ["Faire's a coming!"] = "狂欢开始啦！",
    ["Faith... Some have lost it, others have found it. It cannot be destroyed and it cannot be created.$B$BOr perhaps you speak of the vestments of Faith? Armor worn by our priests and most devout warriors into battle against the Scourge during the last war.$B$BAye, much of it is lost... Stolen by the fiends of Naxxramas."] = "信仰吗……有些人已经失去了它，有些人则刚刚找到它。它无法被湮灭，也无法被创造。$B$B或者你是在说信仰护甲？我们的牧师与最虔诚的战士们在上一次战争中抵抗天灾军团士兵时所穿的护甲？$B$B唉，大部分都遗失了……被纳克萨玛斯的地穴恶魔们夺走了。",
    ["Fancy yourself a chef?  Head to the Undercity south of town for your training.  You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive."] = "想要当厨师？到城镇南部的幽暗城去接受培训。你可以到洛丹伦废墟后面找到下行的电梯。当你到达后向那些笨拙的幽暗城守卫寻求更多帮助。",
    ["Fantastic! Aren't you the industrious one? Well, let's get started, shall we?"] = "太棒了！难道你不是一个勤奋的人吗？好的，让我们开始吧，行吗？",
    ["Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?"] = "我这里的狮鹫是鹰巢山以南飞得最快的。想要乘坐吗？",
    ["Father Cobb will be the one you want to talk to. He can be found under the Spirit Rise in the Pools of Vision cave."] = "你应该找柯布神父谈谈，到灵魂高地下的预见之池去找他吧。",
    ["Few around here are as skilled with a blade as Lyria Du Lac.  Check for her out behind the smithy and see if she's in the mood to teach you something new."] = "这附近很少有人像科瑞恩·塞尔留斯一样精通于刀刃的使用技巧。到铁匠铺后面找她看一下她有没有心情教你些新东西。",
    ["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."] = "满上一杯啤酒，拉一张凳子过来坐坐。我们要畅饮一番，同时还要分享我们的故事。",
    ["Fimble Finespindle has a shop set up on the northwest side of The Great Forge.  I wager he could show ye how to make some fine armor."] = "费布·钢轴在大熔炉西北面开了一家商店。我打赌他能教你学会制作精良的装甲。",
    ["Find Kaplak on top of the burrow in the southwest section of town."] = "到村庄西南方的洞穴顶部找到卡普拉克。",
    ["Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there."] = "到荣誉谷的湖泊的东北方找红石谷矿业工会。与那里的马卡鲁谈谈。",
    ["Find Tarshaw Jaggedscar inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Bring pride and honor to the Horde youngling!"] = "到剃刀岭东面的兵营里找到塔绍尔·锯痕。给部落的年轻人带去骄傲和荣誉！",
    ["Find the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak to Grezz Ragefist.  Let them know that I'll be reporting back in after my shift here."] = "到荣耀谷去找到勇者大厅并与格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。告诉他们我在这里的轮岗结束后就会去向他们汇报。",
    ["Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength. Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek."] = "到力量谷的飞行塔顶部可以找到双足飞龙管理员。多拉斯会确保你到达你想要战斗的地方。",
    ["Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!"] = "真是细致的工作！你完全有资格获得我将授予你的知识！",
    ["First Aid is always a nice skill to have.  Many a time during battle has it saved my hide.  Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise.  Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well."] = "急救是一项很有用的技能。在战斗中，它常常能救人一命。如果你想要学习这项技能的话，就去灵魂高地的“精神治疗”小店里面找找潘德·缚石，他可是这方面最好的训练师。",
    ["First Aid may not make up for a priest's healing, but it's handy in a pinch.  I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can."] = "急救虽然不能代替牧师的治疗，但是它在紧要关头却很方便。我建议你去跟雷酒酿制厂的萨姆诺谈谈，并力所能及地学习一些东西。",
    ["First Aid?  Well ye don't look hurt to me.  If yer really interested in learning First Aid, then Nissa Firestone is the one to learn from.  Go see her over by The Great Forge in her shop, The Ironforge Physician."] = "急救？但你看起来不象受伤的样子。如果你真的对学习急救有兴趣，那么就去找尼莎·火石。到铁炉堡医师协会去，就在大熔炉旁边。",
    ["Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm..."] = "鱼肉真鲜美。你来学钓鱼的？还是来吃鱼的？呣……",
    ["Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor."] = "钓鱼是那些没有在战斗中死去的老人的运动！到荣誉谷的湖边可以找到鲁玛克。",
    ["Fishing is just so pleasant, mon. You know? I owe my state of bliss to my mentor, the greatest angler in the whole world - Nat Pagle. Have you heard of him, mon?$B$BIf you be looking for enlightenment, Nat Pagle be the one who gonna show you the way. "] = "钓鱼只是为了娱乐，伙计。你知道吗？我是在向我的导师学习，世界上最伟大的钓鱼者——纳特·帕格。你听说他没有，伙计？$B$B如果你想要寻求启迪，那么纳特·帕格会指引你前进的道路。",
    ["Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.Once he gets his winner, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!"] = "钓鱼大师巴斯贝特已经在这片水域中放入了美味的可口鱼，钓鱼比赛可以开始啦。  一旦决出了冠军，我就会按五条可口鱼换一银币的价格收购其余的可口鱼！",
    ["Flowers and seeds and such?  That would be Reyna Stonebranch's area of expertise.  Ye can find her tending to her plants over at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."] = "花和种子以及类似的东西？那是雷纳·石枝的专业领域。你能在大熔炉南面的铁炉堡医师协会处看到她料理她的植物。",
    ["Flowers?  In this wasteland?  If anyone can teach you how to find them it will be Mishiki down in Sen'jin Village to the south."] = "花？在这片荒芜的土地上？如果有人能教你如何找到它们，那就是南方的森金村的米什基。",
    ["Food, now there's a subject that I can sink my fangs into! I am told that we have $2095w of $2096w lean wolf steaks, $2102w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail, and $2105w of $2106w baked salmon on ice and stored away."] = "收集食物是眼下我惟一的工作！我们已经收集到$2095w块瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼了，总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。",
    ["For 10,000 years I have ruled this kingdom. In that time, I have heard many fascinating tales from those that would walk the hallowed grounds of the House of Shen'dralar.$B$BAs I am bound to this place, I often exchange stories with visitors. Do you have a story for me or perhaps you would like to hear a story?"] = "我统治这个王国已经有一万年啦。在那时，我从那些神圣的辛德拉家族成员那儿听到很多令人着迷的故事。$B$B由于我必须呆在这儿，所以我常常和访问者沟通交谈。你可以为我讲个故事吗，或许你想听听我的故事？",
    ["For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire."] = "松脆青蛙只在暗月马戏团有售，机会难得，限量供应哦！",
    ["For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "数百年以来阿拉辛一直很关心我们猎人视作朋友的动物。他对动物的关心被周围的猎人所追随。如果你也来向他请教，那么就到塞纳里奥区找他。",
    ["For reasons I cannot understand, Elder Thunderhorn has gone to the Slithering Scar in Un'Goro Crater."] = "雷角长者到安戈洛环形山的巨痕谷去了，天知道他要干什么。",
    ["For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land.  Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place."] = "为了所有神圣高贵的爱，请告诉我你是来把我们从这片被遗忘之地带走的。虽然我是与马绍尔探险队一起的，我愿给你我口中的金牙，只要你让我爬进你的背包并离开这个地方。",
    ["Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye."] = "新鲜的樱桃馅饼！香味扑鼻，让你的眼睛发直！",
    ["Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"] = "这是刚从农场带来的新鲜货--这是烟林牧场的健康食品！",
    ["Friend - Stormwind needs your assistance and your generosity!$B$BOur once large stockpile of textiles has run critically low.  Stormwind is now engaged in a multi-pronged effort to rebuild those stocks for the manufacture of textiles and bandages!  Your donation of cloth would help Stormwind immensely, as well as earn the respect of the citizenry!"] = "朋友——暴风城需要你的协助和慷慨解囊！$B$B我们曾经储藏丰富的布料已经所剩不多了。暴风城现在需要大量的布料和绷带！你的捐赠将能够帮助暴风城度过难关，你还能赢得我们对你的尊重！",
    ["Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins."] = "嗯，这个问题很有趣……我收到的最新消息是，到目前为止，联盟已经收集了$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮了，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。",
    ["Gangway, ye scurvy dog!  Revilgaz has spared me from the gallows but my punishment might be nearly as bad."] = "让开，你这败狗！就算是里维加兹饶恕了我，不送我上绞刑架，我也感觉我的报应就快要来了。",
    ["Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!"] = "盯着敌人，$r。看吧，强大的部落足以对付巨龙！所有跟我们做对的人都是这种下场！",
    ["Gelman Stonehand would be the one to talk to. I think he has a house over in the Dwarven District but I can't remember exactly. I would check over there."] = "你可以去找吉尔曼·石手谈谈。我知道他在矮人区有一栋房子，但我不知道确切的地方。如果我是你的话，我就会去那边看看。",
    ["Get away from here, $c, or they'll put you in chains as well."] = "从这里离开，$c，不然他们也会把你锁住的。",
    ["Get it over with you filthy $r.$B$B<Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>"] = "快动手吧，肮脏的$r。$B$B<卡兰低下头，露出他粗壮的的脖子。>",
    ["Get the key and unlock these chains! Hitah'ya the Keeper holds it... back of cave... "] = "拿到钥匙，打开这些锁链！钥匙在守护者希坦亚手里……就在洞的后面……",
    ["Give a bull a fish and feed him for a day.  Teach a bull to fish and feed him for life.  Uthan Stillwater can teach you how to fish.  Seek his wisdom west of Bloodhoof Village along the banks of Stonebull Lake."] = "授人以鱼不如授人以渔。尤萨恩·静水会教你如何钓鱼。到石牛湖岸边的血蹄村寻找他的智慧所在。",
    ["Give me a moment; there are a lot of numbers to remember here. It looks like we have $2066w of $2067w heavy leather skins collected. As well, we have $2070w out of $2071w thick leather, and $2073w of $2074w rugged leather stockpiled."] = "给我点时间，要记录的数据很多。看来我们已经收集到$2066w块重皮、$2070w块厚皮和$2073w块硬甲皮了，总的需求量分别是$2067w、$2071w和$2074w。",
    ["Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are our way of letting you help with the faire, and in return you can turn in your tickets for special prizes!To get started you'll want to talk to Chronos, Kerri Hicks, Ringling and Yebb Nebblegear to see who you can best help. They always have something that needs doing to improve and expand our attractions.Then when you have enough tickets, speak with Gelvas Grimegate and he will give you a list of prizes to choose from."] = "很高兴您问到这个问题。暗月马戏团奖券是我们鼓励大家帮助马戏团所推出的，您可以使用这些奖券来兑换特别的奖品！  首先您可以找克洛诺斯、克莉·希克斯和亚布·尼比盖尔谈谈来看看您有什么可以帮他们的。他们总是需要帮助。  当您有足够的奖券时，和吉瓦斯·格里加特谈谈，他有很多奖品可供选择。",
    ["Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry."] = "格里克斯和我达成一项共识：他给我供货，而我给他钱。这是很认真的！那个海盗为了一小袋皱皱巴巴的皇血草收我多少钱……足够把一个成年的地精弄哭了。",
    ["Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh."] = "诺莫瑞根在丹莫洛的西边。",
    ["Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then.  It can be found on the middle rise."] = "去雷霆崖中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找犹纳吧。",
    ["Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Kamari."] = "到暗巷区的科多兽皮工店那里去。问问卡玛瑞。",
    ["Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer."] = "星灵长者在千针石林的乱风岗。",
    ["Go to the Hall of the Brave.  You will find The Defiler, Deze Snowbane there to assist you in getting to Arathi Basin."] = "去勇者大厅找污染者迪兹·斯诺班，他会帮助你进入阿拉希盆地的。",
    ["Go to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor, west of the Coliseum.  Talk to Ormak Grimshot there."] = "到荣誉谷的猎人大厅去，它就位于就在大剧场的西边。与那里的奥玛克谈谈。",
    ["Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon'cha near the stables."] = "到荣誉山谷去并在马厩附近找到克苏卡。",
    ["Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower."] = "到力量谷去，在飞行塔的南面就是奥格瑞玛银行。",
    ["Godan's Runeworks is where you'll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom."] = "古丹的符文工艺店就是你要去的地方。到暗巷区的西端可以找到，就在智慧谷的旁边。",
    ["Gonna make a guild, are ya? Good luck to ya then!Talk to Aldwin Laughlin in the Stormwind Vistor's Center. It's in the Trade District right as you come in from the Valley of Heroes."] = "你想要成立一个公会，对吗？祝你好运！  和暴风城接待中心的奥德文·拉弗林谈谈吧。你从英雄谷进入贸易区之后就可以看到暴风城接待中心了。",
    ["Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?"] = "你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;。我可以帮你什么忙吗？",
    ["Good day to you."] = "你好。",
    ["Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"] = "你好，$g先生:女士;。我想握你的手，但是如你所见，我正忙着做事。我可以帮忙吗？",
    ["Good ol' Erma, she's been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I'm sure she'd be happy to take care of any you'd like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "好心的旅店老板艾玛，她现在已经照顾当地的动物好些年了。我敢肯定她会很高兴照顾你给的任何动物。你可以在狮王之傲旅店的外面找到她。",
    ["Good ol' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I'm good as new I tell ye!  I'm sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage."] = "好心的萨姆诺前些天在我与一个肮脏的穴居人战斗后替我包扎了伤口。我现在已经完全痊愈了！我敢肯定萨姆诺会很高兴教你制作绷带的。",
    ["Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested."] = "问得好，$C。我得到的最新消息称我们已经收集到$1997w块铜锭、$2002w块铁锭和$2011w块瑟银锭了，总的需求量分别是$1998w、$2003w和$2012w。",
    ["Good question, $r. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs."] = "这个问题问得好，$r。年轻的时候，我是个自由自在玩世不恭的人，从来没有关心过这个世界的命运。那时候，我在暴风城那边唱歌，参加了一个叫“劈头四”的四重唱组合。我也是在那里学会制作骨镰护甲的。",
    ["Good! I can tell that my efforts will not be wasted!"] = "太好了！我能断定我的努力不会白费！",
    ["Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!"] = "好极了，你很有勇气！我很满意。那么，我们就出发吧！",
    ["Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair."] = "唉，对不起。我没什么新东西可以教你了。你去暴风城的老城区找西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈怎么样？他是一个肌肉发达有一头漂亮红发的人类。",
    ["Grab your things, $n! I've just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!"] = "收拾你的行装，$n！我从灼热峡谷那边的尼莉丝·洛克拉夫收到消息说，有个被称作“黑市组织”的团体正在大熔炉一带运作。到灼热峡谷去找到尼莉丝·洛克拉夫，然后把那个黑市组织连窝端掉。",
    ["Greeting $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you've come to the right place.  I'm always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!"] = "你好$c--欢迎来到我们征服灰谷的前线！如果你在找事做的话，那么你算来对地方了。我总是在寻找体格健壮的人来给部落带来荣誉！",
    ["Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender."] = "你好，$c，我是萨纳瑞恩·绿树。",
    ["Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin."] = "你好，$c。如果你在寻找皮革制品和制皮物资的话，来问我这个半退休的圣骑士就算是找对人了。",
    ["Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?"] = "你好，$c。你愿意帮助战歌峡谷的银翼哨兵作战吗？",
    ["Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you're looking for the best deals you'll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you've come to the right place."] = "你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要在铁炉堡之外找到最好的交易地点，那么你就算找对地方了。",
    ["Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer."] = "拉文霍德庄园欢迎你的光临，冒险者。",
    ["Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."] = "向你致敬，英雄！我有来自大陆和岛屿的最新消息，供你参考。",
    ["Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise."] = "你好尊贵的客人。图拉克·符文图腾和其余的德鲁伊正在长者高地上的长者大厅等你。",
    ["Greetings mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"] = "你好啊，法师。我能在魔法知识的学习上为你提供什么帮助吗？",
    ["Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"] = "你好，我的朋友，欢迎来到艾择拉斯最伟大的展览会！$B$B请尽情浏览我们展出的东西吧。来看看这些暗月马戏团在广袤而又神秘的艾泽拉斯世界中找到的各种千奇百怪的东西！我们不收取任何费用，我们为你带来无限惊喜，为孩子们带来让他们兴奋的东西！",
    ["Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.$B$BThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself."] = "年轻人，欢迎你来到雷霆崖。在这儿你能卸下负担，享受庇佑。我们欢迎所有的部落居民来到雷霆崖。$B$B我的朋友，灵魂都会来这个神圣的地方复活。尊敬他们吧，这也是尊敬你自己。",
    ["Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?"] = "你好，年轻的潜行者。你在找什么？",
    ["Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!"] = "你好！我在这里是为了推广荆棘谷的超级无敌钓鱼锦标赛的。不过你首先得有足够的生存能力在这里活下去，然后还需要足够在这里钓鱼的精湛技巧。$B$B当你更符合以上条件的时候再回到这里来吧！",
    ["Greetings!  If you are here to access gnome engineering schemata, please have your gnome engineer membership card ready for verification."] = "你好！如果你是来购买侏儒工程学图纸的，那请你准备好侏儒工程学会员卡以备验证。",
    ["Greetings!  If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please have your goblin engineer membership card ready for verification."] = "你好！如果你是来购买地精工程学图纸的，那请你准备好地精工程学会员卡以备验证。",
    ["Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem's apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.$B$BI will be here to serve you when you're ready to return down to the base of the mountain."] = "你好，$G先生:小姐;。我是克希雷姆大人的学徒尼瑞尔。如果你们有任何问题，请随意向主人询问。$B$B当你准备下山的时候，就过来找我吧。",
    ["Greetings, $N, and welcome to Camp Narache. News of your arrival spread quickly among the tribe."] = "你好，$N，欢迎来到纳拉其营地。关于你来到的消息很快就在部落传开了。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是达纳苏斯的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在达纳苏斯的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Ironforge.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Ironforge for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是铁炉堡的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在铁炉堡的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Orgrimmar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Orgrimmar for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是奥格瑞玛的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在奥格瑞玛的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Stormwind.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Stormwind for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是暴风城的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在暴风城的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是雷霆崖的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在雷霆崖的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Darkspear tribe.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Darkspear tribe for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是暗矛部族的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在暗矛部族的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Gnomeregan Exiles for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是诺莫瑞根流亡者的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在诺莫瑞根流亡者中的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Undercity.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Undercity for your duty and service."] = "你好，$C——我是幽暗城的嘉奖官。我的职责就是帮助那些获得联盟荣誉徽章的冒险者们。$B$B我一次可收取不同数量的徽章，但是对你来说，一次缴纳10枚徽章可获得最高收益。我会保留你缴纳徽章的记录，你在幽暗城的声望也会因此提高。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  Are you here to learn of the hidden arts?"] = "你好，$C。你是来学习神秘的手艺的吗？",
    ["Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal, Servitor of Rastakhan."] = "你好，$c。我是拉斯塔哈的仆从伊克萨尔。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "你好，$c。我是军需官米兰达·布利洛克——银色军团为数不多的授权装备和军品军需官之一。$B$B既然你在我们的委任下与邪恶战斗——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵那里得到勇气勋章。勋章有两个作用：用他们赢得在军队中更高的地位，或者作为交换得到特殊物品。$B$B随着你在军团中地位的升高，你会发现你会有更多的物品。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  I pity your kind, for the secrets of true magic are beyond you..."] = "你好，$c。我怜悯你，因为魔法的真正秘密是你永远也无法企及的……",
    ["Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.$B$BPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year."] = "你好，$c。眼下正是收获节——感恩与追思的季节。我们举办盛宴感激所有我们应该感激的人，追忆我们的祖先和英雄，感谢他们给我们留下的宝贵遗产。$B$B请尽情享受这盛宴吧。我还会燃放焰火助兴。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong."] = "你好，$c。虽然长期饮用烈酒已经让我的感觉变得迟钝了，但我的心灵之眼依然十分强大。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold.  From here we will strike against the silithid where they're at their strongest.  I hope you've come to lend a hand."] = "你好，$c。欢迎来到塞纳里奥要塞。我们在这个异种生物最强盛的地方对抗他们。我希望你可以助我们一臂之力。",
    ["Greetings, $c.  What may this humble servant of the Feathermoon Stronghold do for you today?"] = "你好，$c。我这个羽月要塞的仆人可以为你做些什么呢？",
    ["Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.$B$BWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question."] = "你好，$c。欢迎你来到永夜港，还有整个月光林地。塞纳里奥议会欢迎所有尊敬大自然的权威和支配力的生灵。$B$B当你在这里的时候，请一定要保持所有事物的平衡。这里不喜欢受到打扰，而我们的看守所受的训练就是无条件地停止所有的敌对行为。",
    ["Greetings, $c. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much."] = "你好，$c。没有多少时间谈话——我在动身去壁炉谷之前只是把冰风营地作为暂留地休息一下。我曾听到传言在他们疯掉之前，血色十字军强迫一个法师为他们工作，为他们的士兵制造强大的弓箭和枪支。我不敢肯定他成功与否……十字军在他们的成品制成之前杀死了他。或许他们杀死他为了保密……也可能他们不太信任奥术。",
    ["Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more."] = "你好，$c。对于某些人来说，猎人是一种生活方式，一种所选的职业。对于其他人来说，这是用来消遣的东西，一个勇气的徽章，或是依照你的部族的某种通过仪式。$B$B对于我来说，种族和职业什么都不是--我所尊敬的是对你的灵魂和心智的测试。因为对自然力的抵抗和他们的技能的测试是真正荣誉的标志。$B$B如果你希望检测自己并赢得我的尊敬，那就跟我多谈谈。",
    ["Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?"] = "你好，$c。你找法拉德谈过了吗？",
    ["Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We've a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions."] = "你好，$C。我是大元帅斯诺·落雪。$G小伙子:姑娘;，我们面前的道路充满艰辛，如果你想要帮忙的话，请尽量帮助我们。有什么问题尽管问吧。",
    ["Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold."] = "你好，$C。我是塞纳里奥要塞的兽栏管理员莱欧伦。",
    ["Greetings, $c. I am Rexxar, champion of the Horde, servant of Thrall, master to the beasts of the wilds."] = "你好，$c。我是部落的勇士雷克萨，是萨尔的仆人，是野兽与野性之王。",
    ["Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?"] = "你好，$c。有什么我能帮忙的吗？",
    ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble."] = "你好，$c。$B$B那边的哨兵允许我住在他们的营地，只要我答应不会再有麻烦了——我敢肯定你能意识到对外交的需要，是吗？$B$B我来调查这片土地的紊乱状况，既然这也有助于他们的事业，他们同意我在这里 只能协助艾泽拉斯各族之间脆弱的联盟关系。如果你想帮我，那么我会很感激，但无论如何，请不要引起任何麻烦。",
    ["Greetings, $n.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.$B$BWon't you join us in our celebration?"] = "你好，$n。我们从月光林地来这里，要将新年的喜悦传播到世界的各个角落。$B$B你难道不想与我们一起庆祝新年吗？",
    ["Greetings, $n. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?"] = "你好，$n 。你是来学习铁炉堡的历史的？",
    ["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma."] = "你好，$n。我是格里高利·维克托医生，部落的首席外科医生。",
    ["Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma."] = "你好，$n。我是古斯塔夫·范沃森医生，联盟的首席外科医生。",
    ["Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge."] = "你好，$n。我是米洛尔·怒斩，大熔炉的看守者。",
    ["Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask."] = "你好，$R$C。我是此地的联盟大使汉默·石锤。$G小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要了解联盟战争物资的收集情况，问我好了。",
    ["Greetings, $r."] = "你好，$c。",
    ["Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?"] = "你好，$r。我是弗兰克罗恩·铸铁。你是来了解黑石塔和黑铁矮人的吗？",
    ["Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you."] = "你好，欢迎。我不太擅长微笑，但是相信我；我很高兴能为您服务。",
    ["Greetings, friend!  Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors?  Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator? "] = "你好，朋友！你对灵质装载器感兴趣吗？或者是看看全向鬼灵同化器？",
    ["Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times."] = "你好，朋友。愿黎明在这个乱世之中保佑你平安无恙。",
    ["Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours."] = "您好，尊贵的$c。我这个塞纳里奥议会的谦卑的仆从愿祝福与您同在。",
    ["Greetings, soldier. Are you here to help the cause?"] = "士兵，你好。你是来帮我的吗？",
    ["Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?"] = "你好，旅行者！介意探索一下神秘世界的秘密吗？嗯？",
    ["Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.$B$BBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late."] = "你好，旅行者。只要你待在塞纳里奥要塞的城墙里，就可以免受一切伤害。$B$B当你离开要塞的保护之后要特别小心，异种生物在这片土地上横行。",
    ["Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.$B$BThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.$B$BI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must."] = "你好，旅行者。大约1000年前，其拉虫人开始了对卡里姆多大陆的战争。$B$B在那场战争中损失了数以千记的生命，大多数都是在战争爆发初期丧身在这片该死的沙漠中的。$B$B我是少数幸存下来的人，我连接了过去和现在。我不知道我为什么还留在这里，但是我知道我必须这样做。",
    ["Greetings, young $c."] = "你好，年轻的$c。",
    ["Greetings.  Do you seek instruction in art of war?"] = "你好。你想要学一些战斗技巧吗？",
    ["Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.$B$BTrust me."] = "你好。我是克洛诺斯——记忆力天下第一的克洛诺斯。我是不会忘记任何微小的细节的。$B$B相信我。",
    ["Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage."] = "你好。我是一个侏儒法师训练师，而你是一个法师。",
    ["Greetings.  I'm a mage trainer, and you're a mage."] = "你好。我是法师训练师，而你是一个法师。",
    ["Greetings.  I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage."] = "你好。我是一个亡灵法师训练师，而你是一个法师。",
    ["Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted."] = "你好。如果你是来找皮件的，那么你会看到我的货品做工精细。",
    ["Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You'll not find faster."] = "你好。我们的蝙蝠训练很严而且吃得不错。你不会找到比他们还快的了。",
    ["Greetings.  You seek instruction in the art of war?"] = "你好。你想要学一些战斗技巧吗？",
    ["Gremlock doesn't always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning.  Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he'll teach ye."] = "格雷姆罗克烹饪的手艺不一定是最好的，但他确实有些美味的食谱值得学习。到雷酒酿制厂找他聊聊，看看他能教给你什么。",
    ["Grimnur Stonebrand will tell ye some whoppers about the one that got away, but he's still one o' the best fishermen around.  He's got a shop set up in The Forlorn Cavern called the Traveling Fisherman."] = "格瑞诺尔·石印会告诉他曾经碰到许多脱钩的超级大鱼，但他仍是附近最好的渔夫之一。他在荒弃的洞穴开有一家叫做旅行渔具店的商店。",
    ["Gryphons, eh? Never really cared for the beasts but to each their own.You can find Dungar Longdrink on the rampart in the Trade District."] = "狮鹫？你是要使用空中旅行服务吧，到贸易区的城墙上去找到杜加尔·朗德瑞克就可以了。",
    ["HELP!!!!"] = "救命！！！！",
    ["Hah!  Tirth's been looking for him for days, but he doesn't want to be found.  He's chicken!"] = "哈！提尔斯这段时间以来都在找他，但是他不想被找到。他是一只小鸡。",
    ["Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.$B$BIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."] = "你好，$C。看来你最近在进行一项秘密的收集工作？你还是老样子，但是这是个繁忙的城市。$B$B如果你参加了那场会议，你就该得到一段代码。把代码告诉我，我就会给你一份特殊的奖励作为回报。",
    ["Hail $g brother : sister;... I'd like a moment of your time, if I may.$B$BWe tauren have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing our homeland.  We now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of tauren everywhere in helping us out!"] = "嘿，$g兄弟:姐妹;……我希望可以打扰你一下，如果可以的话。$B$B我们在通过试炼和进行家园重建中经历了很多。我们现在极度缺乏布料。如果你有一些多余的话，我希望你可以捐献给我们。你一定会为此赢得所有牛头人的尊重的！",
    ["Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...$B$BWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!"] = "嘿，朋友——请等一下，如果可以的话……$B$B我们在重建泰达希尔的过程中经历了很多的痛苦。现在，我们不仅要忍受这些痛苦，而且我们还发现我们的布料存储已经很少了。如果你有多余的布料，那我希望你可以捐赠出它们。你一定因为帮助暗夜精灵赢得我们的尊重！",
    ["Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?"] = "你好，$n。让我帮你前往战歌峡谷，好吗？",
    ["Hail, $c!"] = "嗨，$c！",
    ["Hail, $c!  Welcome to the celebration!"] = "嗨，$c！欢迎你！",
    ["Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they're anticipating something major in this area."] = "嗨，$C。铁炉堡军团驻扎在此地，密切注视着佐拉虫巢的动静。塞纳里奥要塞的德鲁伊们一直监视着异种虫类的一举一动，他们预计这儿将发生大事。",
    ["Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"] = "嗨，$C。眼下奥特兰克山谷急需援助，这是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你愿意加入我们，共同对抗雷矛卫队吗？",
    ["Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?"] = "嗨，$C。我想你是为安其拉一战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B部落和联盟必须携手对抗安其拉异种虫类大军和它们的主使者。在奥格瑞玛的精神谷，我们正在收集原料制造战争物资，收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？",
    ["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."] = "你好，$r！我是哈格丁中尉，是负责招募雷矛卫兵的官员。$B$B你在雷矛军队中获得一定的威望后再来找我吧，我会升级你的徽章的。如果你丢失了徽章，我也能再给你一枚。",
    ["Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.$B$BPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more."] = "冒险者，你好。我是赞达拉的商人林沃斯。我来自南海，从我的家乡带来了许多新奇的货物。$B$B如果你能证明自己的价值，我会乐意与你交换物品的。如果你有我们部族的荣誉勋章，我这里还有些更好的东西……",
    ["Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?"] = "欢迎，旅行者！是什么风把你吹来的？",
    ["Happy Hallow's End!  Do you like my mask?  Very scary!"] = "万圣节快乐！你喜欢我的面具吗？非常吓人呢！",
    ["Happy Hallow's End!  How do you like my mask?  Very scary!"] = "万圣节快乐！你喜欢我的面具吗？非常吓人呢！",
    ["Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him."] = "王子不再讲述灰烬使者的故事了吗？在他的诸多故事中，我们最喜欢这个。他的爱好则是寻找灰烬使者的下落。当然，没人能从他口中得知那个故事。",
    ["Has the sun risen already?  There are just never enough hours in the night!  Well, Saelienne will take good care of you.  You can find her tending to her guests over in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."] = "太阳已经升起来了吗？夜晚的时间总是太短！嗯，塞琳尼会好好照顾你的。她在达纳苏斯东北面的工匠区招待客人。",
    ["Have a drink, $c.  It might be your last!"] = "喝点东西吧，$c。这可能是你最后一次喝东西啦！",
    ["Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions."] = "看看我的肉，朋友。你不会想双手空空就进入贫瘠之地吧。",
    ["Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil!  Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!"] = "尽情享受冬幕节吧！品尝来自烟林牧场的盛宴！",
    ["Have you any idea what I go through to bring these incomparable valuables to sell?  Come see them all for yourself!"] = "我历尽艰辛才将这些无价之宝带来此地销售，你知道吗？来看看吧。",
    ["Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work."] = "你来这里是为了进一步的训练？抖去你身上的尘土吧，让我们马上开始工作。",
    ["Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill."] = "你是来接受药水配制这一技能的训练的吗？要是你认为能从我这儿不费吹灰之力地学到东西的话，你就大错特错了。走吧，在你没有掌握更高技能之前别来找我。",
    ["Have you come seeking training in the ways of armed combat?"] = "你是来学习如何作战吗？",
    ["Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?"] = "你是来学习赫加斯部落的知识的吗？",
    ["Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around...."] = "你见过守夜人巴库斯吗？很勇敢……$B$B我想他是所有守夜人中最凶猛的一个。我怀疑他是否看到我就在周围……",
    ["Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.$B$BMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!"] = "你见过安戈洛环形山的所有奇景了吗，$n？真是令人惊讶。虽然它们没有我制造出的东西那样精密，但这里所有的东西都是天然而成的……这就真是太奇特了。$B$B我的叔叔雷塔维就喜欢这样的地方。我正沿着他的脚步前进——我还想从灭绝的文明中找到新的知识！",
    ["Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $n? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.$B$BYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.$B$BThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals."] = "你看到我们湖中污浊的水元素了吗，$n？这个场景令人感到伤感，但是我不知道它们是从哪里来的。$B$B在我过去的谈话中似乎有人提起过你的名字，或许你可以帮我。$B$B我们必须了解的第一件事就是谁控制着这些元素。",
    ["Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, $n? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready."] = "你跟塔里的侍僧说过话了吗，$n？除非你能完成他们之中某个人的任务，否则我们就无法为你制作宝珠。如果你准备好了的话，就去跟他们谈谈吧。",
    ["Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!"] = "你尝过我们的面包吗？面包师玛斯特森是最具天才的烹饪师！",
    ["Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It's good stuff!"] = "你喝过雷霆啤酒吗？那可是好东西！",
    ["Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?$B$BThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them 'Arcanum.'"] = "是吗？这么说你已经知道高等精灵所掌握的巨魔魔法有多么浅显了？$B$B高等精灵怎么都想不明白，作为一个与魔法密切相关的种族，他们为何无法驾驭巨魔巫毒的力量。对这些白皮肤的生灵而言，这简直难以置信。他们只好使用一种不纯的巨魔法术来增强他们的魔法力量。我想他们称其为“秘药”。",
    ["Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie."] = "今天不太开心？尝尝这些樱桃馅饼吧。",
    ["Having a good time?"] = "玩得开心吗？",
    ["He grows fatter and more corrupt with each passing day. Ye can smell the stink comin' off o' his body. He be dirty, an' I dun just mean he be needin' a wash.$B$BEnough babblin' from Hulfdan. Where did ye come from and how can me help ye, $c?"] = "他变得越来越胖而且越来越堕落，你可以闻到他身上发出臭味，他很脏所以我觉得他要去洗洗。$B$B好吧，不说这些奇怪的东西了。你从哪里来，我能帮你什么忙吗，$c？",
    ["He'll bring you mead$bHe'll bring you beer$bA grinning face from ear to ear$bHe's served us all from year to year$bWe call him Smiling Jim."] = "他给你蜂蜜酒$b$b他给你啤酒$b$b他总是过着快乐的生活$b$b这么多年他为我们每个人都服务过$b我们叫他微笑的吉姆。",
    ["He... hello, $n. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.$B$BThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.$B$BYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you."] = "你……你好，$n。对不起，我正从伤势中恢复过来。$B$B那些血色十字军比我料想的要凶猛的多。他们几乎在里面干掉了我。$B$B你也应该多加小心。我不愿看到他们先发制人。",
    ["Head north up the road to Orgrimmar.  You can ask one of the grunts there for directions to the Cooking Trainer."] = "沿着北边的道路去奥格瑞玛。你可以问问那儿的守卫烹饪训练师在哪儿。",
    ["Healing is for those who cannot endure pain.  However if you must, seek out the Spirit Lodge on the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up and above the Valley of Strength to the west."] = "治疗技能是给那些无法忍受痛苦的人学习的。如果你一定想学习的话，就去力量山谷上面以西的精神谷找灵魂归宿吧。",
    ["Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!"] = "海格纳·重枪，愿为你效劳！",
    ["Heh, heh... Quite the inquisitive one, aren't ya, $n? Well, here's what you need to do.$B$BNorth of here, in the old ruins, lives a very disagreeable gnoll by the name of Miblon Snarltooth. He guards the only Evoroot I know of, but he watches it night and day! Seems like he never even sleeps!$B$BWhat you can do, is bribe him. I can sell you some bait that he'll find tasty -- just put it down near him and that will distract him long enough for you to grab the Evoroot. Good luck!"] = "呵呵呵呵……你是个相当好奇的家伙，不是吗，$n？嗯，我来告诉你该怎么做。$B$B在此地以北的古老废墟中居住着一个名叫米布隆·乱齿的令人厌恶的豺狼人。他日夜守护着灵根草，好像从不睡觉似的！$B$B你必须把他引开才行。我可以卖给你一些他喜欢吃的东西——把食物放在他附近，引他过来，然后你就可以趁机拿走灵根草啦。祝你好运！",
    ["Helene Peltskinner has had years of experience skinning animals for Adele Fielder to make leather items.  You can find Helene in her house by Crystal Lake."] = "海伦尼·派特斯金纳有着数年的剥皮经验，他一直为艾德勒·费欧德提供兽皮以制造皮革制品。你可以在水晶湖旁的房间里找到她。",
    ["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?"] = "您好，$c，欢迎来到暗月马戏团。在马戏团可以做的事儿数不甚数，第一次来的客人可能会觉得有些不知所措。这就是我在这里帮忙的原因。您有什么问题吗？",
    ["Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."] = "你好，$c，很高兴认识你。",
    ["Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change."] = "嗨，又见面了，$n。我感觉时间流仍处在强大力量的威胁之下。青铜龙始终欢迎你不断地提供帮助。$B$B虽然过去的事情已无法改变，但是将来却变化莫测。你此刻做出的决定将改变未来。",
    ["Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown.$B$BWe've hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we're looking for some help if you have the time!"] = "嗯，见到你真好！我叫威利德·马绍尔。我、我的姐妹以及同伴组成了马绍尔探险队——来自艾泽拉斯荒野的科学家和探险家们。$B$B我们在安戈洛环形山遇到了一点小麻烦，如果你有时间的话，就帮帮我们吧！",
    ["Hello there $glad:lass;... the name's Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn't me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!$B$BOh, and if you're from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you."] = "你好，$g小伙子:姑娘;……我是奥格索普，你拥有的某件侏儒设备很可能就是我发明的！如果它爆炸了，那它就不是我发明的；如果它给你带来了财富，那我们可以讨论一下版权金的问题！$B$B哦，对了，如果你来自诺莫瑞根，那你可以走了。我没有什么跟你好说的。",
    ["Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you? "] = "你好！我的名字是洁娜！你呢？",
    ["Hello there, $N.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale."] = "你好，$N。我是克罗诺姆，但是你可以叫我克罗米。我觉得叫这个名字舒服些。$B$B现在——你问我是怎么知道你的名字的？我是青铜龙的一员，永远与时间的消长相合。你可以认为我们以前遇到过，到最后，我们还会再次相遇。$B$B我希望我所选择的外观没有给你带来困惑；虽然我被派来这个充满悲伤的土地作为哨兵，但我可不想陷入悲伤中。",
    ["Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke."] = "嗨，我是派提亚。在我右边是科多兽达丹加。我们曾跟马歇尔探险队在一起——那已经是数年前的事儿了，那时达丹加还是只幼兽呢。$B$B要是你带有火炬或是任何火种，请尽可能地把它们藏起来。达丹加不喜欢烟。",
    ["Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."] = "你好，年轻的$g主人:女主人;。我是艾瓦·萨克霍夫，这是我的丈夫卢森。很高兴认识你。",
    ["Hello!  And welcome!  I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...$B$BBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..."] = "你好！欢迎你！恐怕我的售货亭还不能开张……我得修理很多东西……$B$B但是我仍然受制于血的诅咒，求你啦，笑笑吧。如果你的脸上没有笑容的话，我就得砍下我的手，并且在手掌再生之前不得食用任何肉类……",
    ["Hello!  You're just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!"] = "你好！你正是我要找的人。坐下来听我说，我有个可以让咱们两个都发家致富的计划！",
    ["Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets..."] = "你好！是什么吸引你来到冬泉谷？这片寒冷广袤的土地或许显得有些凄凉，但是它蕴含着无数的秘密……",
    ["Hello, $c!  Welcome to the races at the Shimmering Flats!"] = "你好，$c！欢迎来闪光平原观看赛车！",
    ["Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late."] = "你好，$c。我是杰希尔·月弓。我从达纳苏斯来寻找两个朋友，他们是来寻找费伍德森林暗影议会的踪迹的。$B$B看起来那些宣称对兽人种族的苦难负大部分责任的卑鄙的生物正试图重获一些能量。$B$B我的两个朋友进入加德纳尔搜寻证据来证明有事情发生。$B$B我希望我来时他们在这里，但是他们已经晚了数天了。",
    ["Hello, $c. I've set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I've heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It's said that he completed a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.$B$BI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown."] = "你好，$c。我在亡灵壁垒设立营帐，准备进入瘟疫之地。不久之前，谣传有一位伟大的人类巫师居住在壁炉谷。血色十字军强迫他为他们的战士和猎人制造新的弓箭和枪支。据说在十字军杀死他之前，他铸造了一件非比寻常的武器。$B$B我猜想他们对奥术越来越不信任了。",
    ["Hello, $c. Please excuse me as I am having a conversation with Rimblat. He believes that even this land is not beyond saving."] = "你好，$c。对不起，我正在与雷布拉特谈话。他认为即使土地变成了这样也不是完全无可救药的。",
    ["Hello, $n! I am master engineer, Scooty."] = "你好，$n！我是一名熟练的技师，我叫斯库提。",
    ["Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!"] = "你好，$n！如果你需要的东西在我店里找不到，那么我可以专门去帮你找一下！",
    ["Hello, $n."] = "你好，$n。",
    ["Hello, $n.  Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you're here don't forget to visit our local brewery!"] = "你好，$n。欢迎来到塞尔萨玛，别忘了去本地的酿酒厂看看！",
    ["Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around."] = "你好，$n。我在这里训练和照料年轻的角鹰兽，你可以随意看看。",
    ["Hello, $n. If you'd like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time."] = "你好，$n。如果你想学习烹饪技巧的话，可以随时来找我。",
    ["Hello, $n. Welcome to Refuge Pointe."] = "你好，$N。欢迎来到避难谷地。",
    ["Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.$B$BMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.$B$BThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.$B$BI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves."] = "旅行者，你好。很少有人以这种方式找到我。$B$B我叫雷沃，我在冬泉谷驯化这些霜刃豹，使它们成为坐骑。$B$B这些猫科动物非常凶猛，极难驯服。只有那些最值得信赖和最受人尊敬的人才可能骑上它们。$B$B我是不会随意出售这样的坐骑的，你必须用行为来证明，让我和霜刃豹都接受你。",
    ["Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance."] = "亨德尔已经被我们逮捕了，$n。谢谢你。$B$B尽管审讯的进展会比较缓慢，但我向你保证，他会告诉我们他所知道的一切。$B$B眼下还请你耐心等待。如果我需要你的帮助，就会马上联系你。$B$B在那之前，请享受塞拉摩之旅，我邀请你作为联盟的朋友来到我们城市，要待多久随便你。",
    ["Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "要学习草药学，你得向玛洛尼好好讨教。去多兰纳尔旅馆东边找他吧。",
    ["Herbs, herbs, hmmm, let me see here. Ah yes, here it is. To date we have accumulated $2047w out of $2048w stranglekelp, $2053w out of $2055w purple lotuses, and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed."] = "草药，草药，嗯，让我看看。啊，是的。到目前为止我们已经收集到$2047w份荆棘藻、$2053w份紫莲花和$2057w份阿尔萨斯之泪，而总的需求量分别是$2048w、$2055w和$2058w。",
    ["Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her."] = "草药……你需要前往暗巷区，去加迪的植物园找她谈谈。在智慧谷阿索兰的市场后面有木制的阶梯。沿着阶梯可以到达暗巷区的上层。",
    ["Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millenium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?"] = "达纳苏斯的工匠们可传授给你很多工艺知识。告诉我，你对哪种工艺最好奇？",
    ["Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it.$B$BYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!"] = "在旅行者营地，我们最推崇狩猎技能。想获得我的赏识吗？你得靠行动来证明。$B$B面对挑战吧，$G小伙子:姑娘;！",
    ["Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can."] = "你是来接受训练的吗？我也是刚刚开始学习这方面的知识，但是我很乐意把我所知道的教给你。",
    ["Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path."] = "达纳苏斯有许多熟练的训练师，他们拥有数年的训练经验。我会介绍一名导师给你，沿着你选择的道路前进吧。",
    ["Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet."] = "你是来学习配制药水的？我能传授给你很多知识。虽然我已年老力衰，但脑子还是管用的。",
    ["Here to learn how to wield a new weapon, or just to waste my time?"] = "到这儿是学习如何使用新武器，还是来浪费我时间的？",
    ["Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can't cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies."] = "到这儿来学习的吗？很好。我想要是我教你的话，你不会对我们的联盟造成太多的伤害。只要你一心对付我们的敌人。",
    ["Heroes of the Brood? C'Thun must be banished! We can assist you, mortal!"] = "龙类指派的英雄？必须除掉克苏恩！我们可以帮助你，凡人！",
    ["Hey Hey Hey!  I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!"] = "嘿嘿嘿！我在这里是为了推广荆棘谷的超级无敌钓鱼锦标赛的。不过你首先得有足够的生存能力在这里活下去，然后还需要足够在这里钓鱼的精湛技巧。$B$B当你更符合以上条件的时候再回到这里来吧！",
    ["Hey mon! You've ever been diving deep in the ocean? I'll let you in on a little secret, eh. Deep in the ocean you can find bubbly fissures; they'll allow you to breathe air while underwater.  Let's keep this secret between you and me though, eh. I don't need no competition for me shellfish traps elsewhere... if you get my drift!"] = "嗨！你从来没有过深海潜水的经历吗？我告诉你一个小秘诀，嗯。在海洋深处有许多冒气泡的裂缝，当你在水下时可利用这些气泡进行呼吸。这个秘密只限于你我之间。对我来说，贝壳到处都是……如果你懂我的意思的话！",
    ["Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?"] = "嗨，我能为你做什么呢？",
    ["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer."] = "嗨，你需要继续前进，去找$c训练师。",
    ["Hey!  Thanks for saving my hide!  I think I'll be lying down for a while until I recover my strength."] = "嗨！谢谢你手下留情，没有惩罚我！我想我得躺一会儿恢复体力。",
    ["Hey, $gmister:miss;.  You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine.  I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!"] = "你好，$g先生:小姐;。你看起来就像是个对美酒有着独特品味和见解的$c。我想让你帮个忙，并提出一个你无法拒绝的建议……忘了它！",
    ["Hey, citizen!  You look like a stout one.  We guards are spread a little thin out here, and I could use your help..."] = "你好！你看起来挺强壮的。我们这里的卫兵数量不太够，你愿意帮忙吗……",
    ["Hey, that reminds me, I need to have my rocket boots repaired.  Word to the wise my friend, rocket boots and gryphons don't mix.  Oh, but you need directions...  just head on over to the Dwarven District, you'll find Lilliam Sparkspindle towards the back."] = "嗨，提醒我啦，我需要修理一下火箭靴。聪明人一点就通啦，不要把火箭靴和狮鹫混淆的。  哦，让我为你指明方向……穿过矮人区，你就会找到利廉姆·火轴啦。",
    ["Heya Heya Heya!   If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!   This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!"] = "嗨！嗨！嗨！如果你想要试试自己的钓鱼技能，那么你来对地方啦！本周日荆棘谷将举办一场钓鱼大赛！",
    ["Heya mon.  Go talk to mah Master Gadrin right over there.  Take care of that Zalazane crazy for him and I fix ya right up!"] = "嗨。去那边跟我们的加德林大师谈谈。小心扎拉赞恩的发狂，我也会好好照管你的。",
    ["Heya mon.  You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon."] = "嗨。你到这儿来学习如何使用新武器算是来对地方啦。",
    ["Hi $n!  Are you here to buy something?  Or maybe sell something?$B$BYou won't find better prices anywhere, or my name isn't Augustus the Touched!"] = "嗨$n！你是来购物的，还是来出售物品的？$B$B如果有比这儿更便宜的物品，我就不叫被感动的奥古斯图斯！",
    ["Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!$B$BAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.$B$BI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?"] = "你好！如果你想要接受一些挑战的话，我这里有个建议给你！$B$B我正在利用我发明的超级测蛋器帮助暗夜精灵的德鲁伊们拯救鹰角兽。由于菲拉斯废墟中的戈杜尼食人魔，这种生物的数量正在迅速减少。$B$B我收集各种不同类型的蛋。",
    ["Hi there! I'm glad you came back, $n. Tell me, have you completed the first quest I gave you? If you have, I might have a second quest for you..."] = "嗨！很高兴你回来啦，$n。告诉我，你完成我给你的第一项任务了吗？如果完成了，我会给你第二项任务的……",
    ["Hi there! The name's Gregan. What can I do for ya?"] = "嗨！我名叫格雷甘。我能为你做什么呢？",
    ["Hi there.  I'm Gubber Blump."] = "你好。我是古博·布拉普。",
    ["Hi there. No, Marvon sure isn't here, and he won't be back for quite some time. Actually, I am getting a little worried about him...$B$BI hope he gets back soon. A large chest arrived for him and it's too heavy for me to lug it inside here! I had to leave it out by the door..."] = "嗨。不，玛尔冯一定不在这儿，他还要好些时间才能回来呢。实际上，我有些担心他……$B$B我希望他能很快回来。有人寄了一只大箱子给他，我可没力气把这东西拖进去！我只能把它放在门口……",
    ["Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well."] = "你好！我刚刚探索凯斯利尔废墟回来，就在西南方。现在我决定调查在这个山脉之上的枭兽，在枭翼树丛内。$B$B你与鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀谈过话了吗？他要求我来这里，或许他还有任务给你。",
    ["Hiya! This workshop isn't mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.$B$BYou've never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...$B$BTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?$B$B<Liv shakes her head.>$B$BNo, that's not it..."] = "你好！这间工场不是我的，不是！但是终有一天当我完成训练后，我将成为一名发明家，就像我崇拜的英雄玛尔冯·瑞文斯克那样。$B$B你从来没有听说过他吗？哦，碰巧他已经离开好长一段日子啦，他去研究远古巨魔废墟啦，他是乘坐地精飞艇走的……我也不是很清楚他究竟去了哪儿……$B$B塔纳拉辛？坦克利斯？塔纳里萨尼？$B$B<莉芙摇着头。>$B$B不，名字不是这样……",
    ["Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful.  Let me teach you!"] = "嗯……对，我这里确实有一些挺有用的菜谱。让我来教你吧！",
    ["Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn."] = "嗯，我想我可以再收一个学生。好吧，不要傻站在那里。告诉我你想学什么。",
    ["Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me."] = "嗯，好吧，我看到你还懂一点做药剂的方法。然而，你是否配做我的学生仍有待察看。我有一项任务交给你。争取给我一个好印象。",
    ["Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson's Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!"] = "嗯……你需要学的东西有点超出我的能耐了。去找那边的塞拉多斯谈谈。我会的东西全是他教的！",
    ["Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path."] = "嗯……你看起来很有能耐。如果你真想学习的话，那么没有什么能阻挡你！我会指引你通过漫长而硕果丰盛的道路上的第一步。",
    ["Hmm... well, I can't help you quite yet! You have to learn the basics first. Why don't you go see Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind!"] = "嗯……好吧，我现在还帮不到你！你必须先学习基础知识。你为什么不去见见暴风城的斯普莱特呢！",
    ["Hmm... you show a little promise, I'll give you that. Okay then, where were we?"] = "嗯……看来还有点希望，我会把那个给你的。那好吧，我们在哪里？",
    ["Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance."] = "嗯，我觉得你需要到雷霆崖去弄清楚。出了血蹄村沿着公路一直往北走。你会到达雷霆崖的底部。乘电梯到顶部你就可以向雷霆崖的任何一个守卫寻求进一步的帮助。",
    ["Hmmm... only enchanters I know of around here work out of Stormwind.  Why don't you ask one of the guards up in Stormwind?"] = "嗯……这附近唯一有附魔训练师的地方就是暴风城了。你为什么不问一下暴风城的守卫呢？",
    ["Hold on there, I'm just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there."] = "等一下，我只是一个助手。如果你想学那些花哨的东西，找那边的老约莫德·石眉谈谈。",
    ["How I yearn to join you in glorious battle, but instead I am stuck here on duty. Go to the Hall of the Brave in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor and speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. She will help you get to Alterac Valley. Make us proud $n!"] = "我多想和你一起加入伟大的战斗，但是我不得不待在这里值勤。去奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的勇者大厅找卡尔特拉·血喉，她将会帮助你进入奥特兰克山谷。为部落带来荣耀，$n！",
    ["How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first."] = "我怎么能把我的秘密告诉一个初学者呢？先试着跟博文谈谈。",
    ["How dare you ask me for training, maggot? What were you hoping for, you slack-jawed yokel, a lecture on the proper uses of silverleaf? Out! You're lucky I don't thrash you senseless for wasting my time."] = "你胆敢让我培训你，你这可怜虫？你期望什么，你这个呆头呆脑的乡巴佬，一场关于如何正确使用银叶的讲演？滚出去！你浪费我的时间没把你打个半死算你走运。",
    ["How many metal bars you say? As of my last update on the situation, here is what I know. The Horde has collected $2018w copper bars out of $1998w needed, $2005w tin bars out of $2006w and of $2009w mithril bars sought, $2008w have been gathered."] = "你说有多少金属锭？我得到的最新消息是联盟已经收集到$2018w块铜锭、$2005w块锡锭和$2008w块秘银锭了，而总的需求量分别是$1998w、$2006w和$2009w。",
    ["How may I be of service?"] = "我要如何效劳？",
    ["How wonderful to see another person in this remote region of the world. Come, walk with me. Let our bodies keep each other warm."] = "在这么偏远的地方遇到人可真好啊。来吧，跟我一起。让我们用身体互相取暖。",
    ["How you doin' mon!"] = "你做得怎么样啦！",
    ["How's it going? I love the smell of leather; don't you?"] = "它怎么样了？我喜欢皮革的味道；你不喜欢吗？",
    ["How?? Well, it's a long story."] = "怎么进去的？？嗯，这故事真长。",
    ["Huh?  You'll find the bank in Orgrimmar.  Head north up the road to get there and then talk to one of their grunts."] = "呃？你可以在奥格瑞玛找到银行。沿着道路往北走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。",
    ["Hundreds of years ago, the great city of Thaurissan stood proudly in a lush expanse of land that is now the dilapidated Burning Steppes.$B$BThaurissan was home to the nation of Dark Iron dwarves and at the time, in the midst of a civil war among the dwarven nation at large.$B$BYou see, that area of the world was at one point in time part of the Redridge Mountains - until the day that Thaurissan was consumed by a gigantic explosion. The city lay in ruin, the surrounding areas reduced to an ashy wasteland."] = "数百年前，伟大的索瑞森城骄傲地矗立在富饶的大地之上，那里现在已经变成了荒芜的燃烧平原。$B$B索瑞森城是黑铁矮人的家乡，它那时正处于一场矮人的内战中。$B$B你知道，那片土地曾是赤脊山的一部分——直到有一天，索瑞森被一场大爆炸吞噬。城市变成一片废墟，周围的地区也被夷为平地。",
    ["I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them."] = "我已经了解到很多关于时尚的东西。现在那不过就是掌握制革技巧罢了。西蒙能帮助学习制革的。",
    ["I am Al'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.$B$BMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks."] = "我是全知者阿塔比姆，拉斯塔哈的特使。$B$B我通常只和牧师、法师和术士打交道。",
    ["I am Highborne, $r. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past..."] = "我是一名上层精灵，$r。虽然这个词语现在已经不能代表什么了，但很久以前，这个世界曾被上层精灵所统治。一万年过去了……",
    ["I am Kilram, master of the axe."] = "我是基尔拉姆，斧系大师。",
    ["I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen."] = "我是克拉索克，这些工匠的监工。",
    ["I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."] = "我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的污染者物资供应商卢瑟弗·图恩。随着你在污染者中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。",
    ["I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."] = "我是驻扎在阿拉希盆地的阿拉索联军物资供应商萨缪尔·霍克。随着你在阿拉索联军中的声望不断提升，我可以出售给你一些非常有用的物品。如果你需要修理装备，我也乐意为你服务。",
    ["I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!$B$BAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now..."] = "我是大工匠欧沃斯巴克，现代侏儒工程学领域的顶级设计师。我的工作就是用我们的闪亮崭新的扳手确保新的发明能够付诸实施！$B$B要是你碰巧懂得制造消除辐射污染的装置，那你算是来对地方啦……",
    ["I am Zanza, a Loa of Zandalar. I have come in this ethereal form from Zandalar to help my people. Hakkar has no dominion over my soul.$B$BI help those that have helped the Zandalarian people."] = "我是赞达拉的赞扎。我以灵体形态从赞达拉赶来帮助我的人民。哈卡不能控制我的灵魂。$B$B我是来帮助那些曾经有恩于赞达拉的朋友的。",
    ["I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain."] = "恐怕我已不再是个文雅谦逊的人了。年龄和无数战争让我的皮肤和灵魂变得坚硬无比。或许这就是凯恩派我来烈日石居的原因……和煦的暖风和温暖的阳光无法减轻我的痛苦。",
    ["I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate."] = "我是这座城市的官员，从事幽暗城的人口普查工作。自从我们从亡灵天灾中解脱出来以后，我们就尽力对我们的城市人口做出精确的记录。通过一些奥术方式和聪明的方法，我才得以弄到这些记录。如果你需要有事找我的话，请继续。你应该知道你是否有事需要我的帮助。",
    ["I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach."] = "我是一个从事药学的兽人，$r。如果你是来学习的，我会尽我最大的努力教你。",
    ["I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor."] = "我敢肯定在达纳苏斯有一个裁缝可以对你进行训练。当你到了那里之后，就向达纳苏斯的某个哨兵询问一下裁缝住在哪里吧。",
    ["I am forever denied the touch of stone.  I will never again know the glory of shaped iron..."] = "我永远都不能再触摸石头了。我永远都无法再体会钢铁的荣誉了……",
    ["I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde."] = "我当然是来传达酋长的命令的。我是部落的。",
    ["I am he that watches they. I am the fist of retribution. That which does quell the recalcitrant. Dare you defy the Warchief? Dare you face my merciless judgement?"] = "我是联军的指挥官。我是惩戒之拳。我的职责就是扫清其拉虫人的势力。你敢挑衅酋长的权威吗？你敢直面我无情的审判吗？",
    ["I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well."] = "我很荣幸能够传授给你知识，$n。看得出来你用得不错。",
    ["I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.$B$BHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field."] = "我负责霜狼氏族的军队招募工作。作为一名霜狼士兵，如果你的等级足够高的话，就来向我报到吧。$B$B在冰冷的战场上，你会获得荣誉和尊重的。",
    ["I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity"] = "我知识渊博，但我还不是专家。你知道你该去找谁谈话吗？雷安诺！她就在不远的地方。到幽暗城打听她的下落。",
    ["I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc's pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands."] = "我不是为了荣耀而来这里的，$n。我来这里是为了兽人的骄傲。$B$B如果我没有拒绝贝尔戈洛姆的提议，那我肯定现在还在奥格瑞玛料理真正的生意。$B$B他对女人的渴望在杜隆塔尔的女性战士中尽人皆知，但是那仍然没有影响他成为大众情人。$B$B很幸运他并没有骚扰我太长时间——否则他会被砍成肉酱的。",
    ["I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands."] = "我目前对你的进步感到很满意。很显然大地母亲已经赋予你的双手以灵感了。",
    ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."] = "很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去战歌峡谷送死。",
    ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley."] = "很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去奥特兰克山谷送死。",
    ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin."] = "很抱歉，$c，在你变得更加强大之前，我不能让你去阿拉希盆地送死。",
    ["I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "我很珍惜我们之间的友谊，但是让我们面对现实吧：你对药水的了解比我多。要是你想得到训练的话，就找亡灵马尔什医生谈谈。他居住在幽暗城的炼金房。",
    ["I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them."] = "我在找人，$c。请不要打扰我……这对我很重要。",
    ["I bear witness to a miracle that stands before me! In one thousand years of captivity, I have not seen a single LIVING specimen - other than those foul Qiraji and silithid - enter these chambers."] = "我真不敢相信自己的眼睛，这简直是个奇迹！一千年来，除了那些肮脏的其拉虫人和异种虫类，我都不曾见过有活人进入这些房间。",
    ["I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind."] = "我相信奥德文·拉弗林仍是暴风城的常驻公会注册员。当你进入暴风城的贸易区后，你的左手边就是他的居所。",
    ["I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You'll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."] = "我记得不久之前我有新邮件寄出。你可以在中部高地的底层雷霆崖银行外找到邮箱。",
    ["I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?"] = "我想之前西蒙尼找过你，$n。你跟她谈过了吗？",
    ["I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "我敢打赌洁塞塔会很乐意教你学习新法术的。她就在狮王之傲旅店的房间内。",
    ["I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home."] = "我从铁炉堡来到这里协助进行重建工作。我希望能向你传授尽可能多的本领，然后我就能回家去，把这堆事情丢给你来做。",
    ["I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.$B$BHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!"] = "我从南边到十字路口来寻求帮助，$c，但是那些胆怯的家伙都不愿意伸出援手——就连强大的索克也污辱我。他是一名很好的领导者，但是他拒绝了我的请求，这让我感到非常恼怒。$B$B他声称我的愤怒令我变得鲁莽——妨碍我的正常判断——但是我一定要复仇！",
    ["I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales."] = "我可以利用在这儿找到的材料制作有趣的东西。这些山林中有许多奇怪的生物！去杀死它们，$n。",
    ["I can not train you, $c."] = "我不能训练你，$c。",
    ["I can not train you, young one."] = "我不能训练你，年轻人。",
    ["I can not train you."] = "我不能训练你。",
    ["I can not train you. You need to talk to your class trainer."] = "我不能训练你。你必须去找你的职业训练师。",
    ["I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand."] = "我可以告诉你你想知道的一切，但是你必须要有耐心。去练习打铁吧，摸索用锤的力度。当你熟练后，自然也就掌握啦。",
    ["I can teach you fishing skills."] = "我可以教你一些钓鱼技能。",
    ["I can teach you how to cook!"] = "我可以教你如何烹饪！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Kodo Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑科多兽的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Mechanostrider Piloting, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你操纵机械陆行鸟的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Ram Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑山羊的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Raptor Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑迅猛龙的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Skeletal Horse Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑骸骨战马的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Tiger Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑豹的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can teach you the finer points of Wolf Riding, provided you have enough gold to cover the lesson!"] = "我可以教你骑狼的技巧，只要你有足够的金币支付学费！",
    ["I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior.  $B$BWhy don't you go do something safe, like read a book."] = "从你的站姿我可以看出你不是战士。$B$B你为什么不做点安全的事，比如读书什么的。",
    ["I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care."] = "我觉得你的服饰急需维修。",
    ["I can train you in First Aid techniques."] = "我可以教你急救技能。",
    ["I can't believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!$B$BWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from from the east and west, it's a wonder Stormwind itself isn't besieged."] = "在我们的家园面临重重危机的情况下……暴风城的官员们竟然将大批军队派往别处，我真不敢相信！$B$B来自西部荒野的潜行者和谁知道哪里来的豺狼人蜂拥而至，暴风城没有受到围攻可真是个奇迹。",
    ["I can't find my pet frog, Jubjub.  She loves Dark Iron Ale, it's all she ever drinks, but can be so hard to get!  Now I'm out... and Jubjub must have run away to find more!$B$BI wish she would come back..."] = "我找不到我的宠物青蛙加布加布啦。她爱喝黑铁啤酒，她总是喝这种酒，但是这种酒很不容易得到的！现在我没有黑铁啤酒了……加布加布一定是自己跑出去找酒喝啦！$B$B真希望她回到我身边……",
    ["I can't help ya'! You're ready to see someone who's been at it longer than I have! Let's see... you're an Alliance type, so you need to talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in Stormwind."] = "我不能帮助你！你会遇到比我更精于此道的人！你是联盟的人，你得跟暴风城的利廉姆·火轴谈谈。",
    ["I can't say enough about yer work, truly amazing things that ye can do with a hammer and an anvil. Now, don't be tellin anyone that I suggested ye go find a goblin to teach ye but that's exactly what I'm gonna do. Brikk Keencraft is his name, and last I heard he was operating a shop down in Booty Bay."] = "我不能对你进行什么指导啦，你能用铁锤和铁砧做出如此令人称奇的东西。我建议你去找一个名叫布里克·基克拉夫的地精，你可别告诉别人,我最后一次听说他在藏宝海湾经营一家商店。",
    ["I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"] = "我没有什么可以教你的啦！如果有人比我知道得多……等等，有啦！去加基森找巴兹克·布拉斯温吧。",
    ["I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She offers more advanced training."] = "我不能再教你啦：你所掌握的技能已经超过我了。去雷霆崖中央平原西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳吧。她会为你提供更多训练的。",
    ["I cannot be teachin' a Tauren to ride a Raptor."] = "我不能教牛头人骑乘迅猛龙。",
    ["I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be."] = "我不能为你提供更多的训练啦：你的制革技能已经超过我啦。你应该去那儿找犹纳谈谈。如果需要的话我会为你担保的。",
    ["I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now."] = "当我们的盟友，也就是亡灵们，在遭受可怕苦难时候，我如果还在这里训练新手，这会让我感到良心不安。请找那边的克瑞谈谈；他目前能够帮你。",
    ["I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!"] = "我不能再教你什么啦。但是，我父亲的知识远胜于我。进去跟他谈谈。祝你好运！",
    ["I cannot train a $c such as yourself."] = "我不能训练你这样的$c。",
    ["I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.$B$BYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not."] = "每年的这个时候我都会来希利苏斯。这里的气候对治疗我的拇趾囊肿很有帮助。$B$B你应该跟我四处逛逛，朋友。欣赏一下风景什么的。",
    ["I could use a drink and some rest myself.  You'll find it right in the northwest corner of Razor Hill.  Say hi to Innkeeper Grosk for me."] = "我可以喝点东西，稍事休息。到剃刀岭西北角，替我向旅店管理人罗斯克问声好。",
    ["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."] = "我不认为你具有掌握传送门魔法所必需的潜质。",
    ["I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you."] = "我的时间不多了，但是圣光依然照耀着这个世界，它可以帮助我完成我的宿命。当你面对瑞文戴尔男爵时，我便与你同在。",
    ["I do not have the knowledge you seek."] = "我不具备你想学的知识。",
    ["I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!"] = "陌生人，我没有时间浪费啦。说说你的事儿吧，要么就离开！",
    ["I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need."] = "我不会给一个学徒训练。去贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴找牛头人瓦多尔吧，他会帮助你的。",
    ["I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."] = "孩子，我看不出你具备战士的精神。我不会训练你这样的$c的。",
    ["I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time."] = "我确实很喜欢坐在这里，听着大海的声音。哦，什么？是的，有一艘船会把你带到米奈希尔港。它有时会停在这里。",
    ["I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for."] = "如果这就是你来此的目的，我们会尽一切可能训练你，帮助你成为真正的牧师。",
    ["I don't care to hear it, $n. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!$B$BIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened. "] = "$n，我不介意听到这个。不，你绝不能进入灼热峡谷，决不可能。我告诉你多少次了——我绝对不会让你进去的！你难道听不懂吗？你难道是兽人假扮成的？看我口型，不！$B$B如果我让你进去，那么每个人都会想要进去。不久之后，你最好的朋友，你的远房亲戚，然后你远房亲戚的朋友，然后所有的人就会来我这里想要进去。以前发生过这样的事情……好吧，我们不谈以前的事情。",
    ["I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?"] = "我很少有访客。你在寻找某种特殊的东西，是吗？",
    ["I don't get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you're ready."] = "找我学习剥皮的学徒并不多，如果你准备好了，我马上就可以教你一些东西。",
    ["I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!"] = "我可没时间闲谈，我是个专业人士！",
    ["I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar! "] = "我可没时间跟小孩子耗！去跟我的助手阿斯拉谈谈！",
    ["I don't know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!"] = "我不知道他们是怎么做到的……这些邮箱一定是传送门之类的东西。为什么人们整天都聚集在银行旁边的邮箱那儿，从小小的邮箱中不断地取出剑、盾牌和各种护甲！",
    ["I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you."] = "我对魔法知之甚少，但是在狮王之傲有一个名叫扎尔迪玛的法师，他也许能帮助你。",
    ["I don't know of one of those around here.  Your best bet is to go to Orgrimmar to the north and speak to one of their grunts."] = "据我所知，附近没有这些训练师。你最好去北方的奥格瑞玛看看，去问问那儿的守卫。",
    ["I don't know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!"] = "我不知道他们给那些酒桶里放了什么，但闻起来很香甜！",
    ["I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?"] = "没想到你会来这儿找我的可爱的卡利谈话。很好。这是药水。有没有人说过你是个头脑简单的家伙？",
    ["I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me."] = "我不会训练一点水平都没有的铁匠，等你觉得自己达到我的要求之后再回来找我。",
    ["I don't train your kind $c."] = "我不能训练你。",
    ["I don't train your kind $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me."] = "我不训练你这样的$c。在你惹恼我之前找你自己的训练师吧。",
    ["I dream, $n... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!"] = "我做梦了，$n……对，我做梦了。在梦中，我以上千种不同的方式死去。有人会认为这是噩梦，但我不这样想！在梦中，我在战场上死去。每次死亡之前我都会让一万名部落的敌人倒在我的脚下。这是无上的荣耀！",
    ["I give you warm greetin's, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else."] = "我和碎手都向你致敬，$c。$B$B别这么惊讶，$n。连奥格瑞玛最高的地方也会有阴影——一定有什么东西隐藏在那儿。碎手欣然接受了那项任务。萨尔也承认要确保兽人和巨魔的安全，他是不可缺少的。$B$B但是你到这儿来不是谈论我的事儿吧，你一定另有目的。",
    ["I got something for you, $n. Looks important."] = "我给你带来一些东西，$n。它们看起来挺重要的。",
    ["I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?"] = "我会用我的鲜血来保证这座银行的安全，你觉得很放心吧？",
    ["I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake.  That's where he's at."] = "我猜有人在战斗结束后需要帮我们这些战士包扎伤口。到精神谷的灵魂小屋旁边的适者生存小屋找阿诺克。往上走去力量谷的西边找到一个湖。那就是他呆的地方。",
    ["I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does."] = "我猜那些灵魂更加喜欢你，我还没有听到他们的召唤但是你看起来已经上过他们好多课程了。去找卡恩谈谈，他会很高兴看到一个像他一样听到它们声音的人。",
    ["I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity.  Heh, get it?  Mine... nevermind.  To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down.  Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance."] = "我猜想你最初的训练就是挖掘到幽暗城。嗨，明白吗？挖掘……没关系。要到幽暗城，你先要到布瑞尔南面的洛丹伦废墟后方，然后乘电梯下去。向那里的一位幽暗城守卫寻求更多的帮助。",
    ["I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well.  Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you."] = "我最近在这里附近遭遇过一些迪菲亚潜行者，但米歇尔·贝利帮我进行了治疗。到狮王之傲与她商量一下，看看她能否教你。",
    ["I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.$B$BUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after."] = "我没有选择，至少我是这么认为的。我会忍受索瑞森的毁灭并与我的国王和同胞站在一起。$B$B在拉格纳罗斯的统治下，达格兰·索瑞森国王开凿了山脉的中央，并建立了黑石塔。我们不知疲倦地工作着，发誓要建立一座比以前的任何城市或堡垒都要坚固的矮人城堡……甚至将来也不会有能与之媲美的建筑。",
    ["I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "我以前曾有幸看到在凯拉·风刃作战，因此我相信她可以好好训练你。到多兰纳尔旅店去找她吧。",
    ["I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe."] = "我憋了一肚子的火，别让我朝你发火。",
    ["I have a pretty good idea what ol' Greatfather Winter's gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it."] = "这轮结束后冬天爷爷会做什么呢，我有一个很好的主意。我在包里有一瓶冬幕啤酒，而且我想喝光它。",
    ["I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others..."] = "我被杀死过无数次。我总是发现我会在这里醒来。有些人说我遭受了诅咒，还有些人……",
    ["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."] = "我发现了地穴恶魔身上的甲壳以及其它部位的多种用途。我想我能利用这些碎片，配合纳克萨玛斯内的一些被污染的魔法护甲碎片，制成某种极轻而且实用的护甲套装来。",
    ["I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!"] = "我一个小时以后还要去值班，但在那之前……干杯！",
    ["I have just completed a new dimensional imploder that will make me rich beyond my wildest goblin dreams!   All I need to do is get a skilled Goblin Engineer to build a dimensional ripper that connects to it and try it! "] = "我刚刚完成了一个新的空间爆破器，它可以让我变成最最富有的技师，我做梦都不曾想过的富有！我所需要的就是找到一个熟练的地精技师，让$g他:她;来制作一个空间撕裂器，然后将两者连接起来！",
    ["I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask."] = "我已经用多年学会了很多药剂知识，$n，而那些知识都由你支配。你只需提要求就可以。",
    ["I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor."] = "我有许多知识可以让你大开眼界，$c。你必须学会带着荣耀去狩猎。",
    ["I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques."] = "我没有可传授给你的知识了。穿过拱门走下斜坡到东南方，找赫伯特·哈尔希医生谈谈。他是个被遗忘者，他能教给你更加高级的技术。",
    ["I have no time for interruptions."] = "我可没时间停下来。",
    ["I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c."] = "我没有时间浪费在像你这样的人身上$c。",
    ["I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills."] = "我没有东西可传授给你了。要是你想进一步学习制皮技能，就找卡洛雷克交谈。",
    ["I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem."] = "我已经观测到有四种植物受到了腐蚀术的影响：轻歌花、迎风花、鞭根草和夜龙植物。轻歌花和迎风花是费伍德森林中常见的植物，而鞭根草和夜龙植物就不那么常见了。所有这些都是费伍德森林生态系统的重要组成部分。",
    ["I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too."] = "我给国王提供过装备。如果有正确的训练，你也可以。",
    ["I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.$B$BLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.$B$BNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him..."] = "我在这片平原上生活了很多很多年，我捕猎过许多凶猛的野兽，从来没有失败过……直到我遇见了鬼嚎。$B$B很久以前，这只巨狼曾经是牛头人的盟友，还和燃烧军团英勇作战。不过后来它被一个恶魔所伤，身上的伤口一直没有治愈。最后……这道伤口把它逼疯了。$B$B现在它总是痛苦地在平原上游荡，寻找终止它的痛苦的方法。我很惭愧，因为我无力把他杀掉……",
    ["I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes..."] = "我有很多要做的……在瘟疫来之前有很多……",
    ["I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube."] = "我听过对水禽的评价，据说它们可以通过一个管子一样的东西吃东西。",
    ["I hear that the trolls in Sen'jin Village have a potion maker named Miao'zan.  Look there."] = "我听说森金村的巨魔中有个名叫米奥赞的药剂师。去那儿找他吧。",
    ["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there."] = "我听说北方的雷霆崖有个矿工训练师。沿着村外的道路前进，然后乘坐电梯到达山顶。任何一名雷霆崖守卫都能帮助你。",
    ["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity.  All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions."] = "我听说幽暗城中有个矿工训练师。离开城镇往南走，穿过洛丹伦废墟，你就能到那儿了。然后乘坐电梯下到幽暗城，去询问幽暗城守卫，你应该能获取更多指示信息。",
    ["I hear there's a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look."] = "我听说铁炉堡中有家由精通炼金术的侏儒所经营的商店。你该去看看。",
    ["I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let's hope he loses!"] = "我听说水元素中的贵族海达克希斯发动了对火元素的战争。真希望他战败！",
    ["I heard that, after the fireworks show, goblets will be brought to the tables.  Fine toasts we shall raise!"] = "听说在焰火表演之后，桌子上就会摆满高脚杯，然后我们就可以喝酒庆祝了！",
    ["I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!"] = "我听说新型的极速6000型很快就要开下生产线了。我几乎不能抑制激动的心情！",
    ["I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome's car in the next race!  True or not, I'd stand clear of their pit area."] = "我听说下一场比赛的时候他们要把地精的车炸掉！不管是真是假，我会待在安全的地方。",
    ["I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!"] = "另外还有一些事情值得注意。我强烈推荐你去塞格那里预测一下你的财富在哪里。我知道，我知道……他是一个豺狼人。但是他是一个拥有特别力量的豺狼人，他可以预知你的财富在哪里！  另外我们在不断扩展我们的马戏团。最近我们增加了一门大炮，你可以试图用它把自己发射到水晶湖！你可以和马戏团东面的玛克希玛谈谈，了解更多细节！",
    ["I hold the vessel of his rebirth. Should you be prepared to take on this task, you will be required to fortify the vessel and ultimately, break the hold of Ragnaros himself!"] = "我这里有他的重生之瓶。如果你决心接受这项任务，就必须保护好这只小瓶，并击败拉格纳罗斯！",
    ["I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $n.  We can use all o' the help that we can get."] = "希望你是来奥特兰克山谷作战的，$n。我们会竭尽所能，利用一切援助。",
    ["I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers.  What do you say $n?"] = "希望你是来帮助我们从污染者手中夺回阿拉希盆地的，$n？",
    ["I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work."] = "我希望你是因为好事才打断我的，我正在做一些重要的工作。",
    ["I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?"] = "愿圣光与你同在，$n。我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies."] = "我希望有一天能用敌人的骨头制作武器。",
    ["I hope ye didn't come all the way to the Great Forge just to stay warm. Speak up $g lad : lass;, tell me what it is I can do for ye?"] = "我希望你千里迢迢来到大煅炉不只是为了取暖。$g小伙子:小姑娘;，我能帮你什么忙吗？",
    ["I installed a new device in our car's matrix regulometer.  That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!"] = "我给我们的车里安装了新的矩阵式调节器，它可以使赛车的引擎转速提高至少百分之十五！",
    ["I just can't seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers."] = "如果不住在有大理石天花板的房间里，我就浑身不舒服。天上的星星让我觉得很烦燥……",
    ["I just received word on that. We currently have $2021w out of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom, and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotus herbs requested."] = "我刚得到消息说，我们已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。",
    ["I keep 'em fed, kid. Yep, Daryl Riknussun, at yer service."] = "我会喂养它们的，孩子。达瑞尔·瑞克努索，愿为你服务。",
    ["I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer."] = "我无法训练你。你该去找$c训练者。",
    ["I know a few things, but I'm no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He's standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable."] = "我知道一些，但我不是专家。祝你好远，玛加尔也是。他就站在商店后面。看看他是否能帮助你，但是小心别惹恼他。他脾气有些暴躁。",
    ["I know just the one that you speak of $c. You must seek out Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace."] = "你应该去战士区找布洛冈·石盾，$c。",
    ["I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides."] = "我知道很多事，陌生人，但是你的知识与我的不相上下。想更深入研究的附魔师要去阿祖拉之塔，那里住着一个叫做基塔·费温德的工匠。",
    ["I know much, listen and be educated, $r."] = "我知道很多，好好听着吧，$r。",
    ["I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two.  What profession do you have in mind?"] = "我知道有些人在这附近练习某些专业。你想要打听哪项专业技能的训练师？",
    ["I know these forests as if they were a part of me... but know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden."] = "我对这片森林非常熟悉，它们就像我身体的一部分……但是它们还蕴藏着很多值得学习的知识，当然也有很多危险。",
    ["I know, I know, I'm out here in the middle of nowhere!$B$BMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!"] = "我知道，我知道，我知道我根本不知道自己在哪里！$B$B我的家在棘齿城，不过既然我的飞艇在这儿坠落了，那我不如现在就开始进行我的研究项目了！",
    ["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."] = "幽林长者在西瘟疫之地的哭泣之洞外面。",
    ["I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!"] = "我希望组建队伍。当然，我更希望扩大队伍！",
    ["I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. "] = "我在听，我在听，但是听不见卡恩所说的那些灵魂的声音。",
    ["I live only to serve our King."] = "我活着就是为了为国王服务。",
    ["I live only to serve the master."] = "我活着的目的就是为主人服务。",
    ["I love a good challenge; don't you? Aye, of course ye do. An' that's why you're about to do exactly what I say."] = "我喜欢机会；你不喜欢吗？啊，当然你也喜欢。这就是你要按我说的去做的原因。",
    ["I love pie."] = "我喜欢馅饼。",
    ["I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it."] = "我能制造你在商店里看见的若干东西。你认为如何？小心回答，这也许能决定你的命运。",
    ["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.$B$BAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this..."] = "那又怎样，白痴。这些蕴涵着黑暗力量的物品或许能把我们全都毁灭掉。这是我们在获取力量时所必须付出的代价。如果我必须要死，那也要死在这样伟大的仪式与实验中。$B$B至于你……如果你在为我完成这一切的过程中死了……那我就会以豺狼人的方式嘲笑你的孱弱。把我要的东西带回来，这样我们两个都能获利益，要么就去死吧，我已经解释过结果了……",
    ["I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.$B$BThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse."] = "我不会伤害你的。我在监视野猪人并记录他们的活动。我的人民注意到了某些奇怪的事情——黑暗的弥漫——从这个地区来的。我是来调查的，而我的发现很令人不安。$B$B似乎有一个很善于奥术的亡灵外交官。我不相信他也是被遗忘者……我认为更坏。",
    ["I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.$B$BYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor."] = "由于我的身份问题，我并未对你说实话，我必须为此向你道歉。我必须确定你是值得信赖的——很少有人能无私地为一个年老的隐士提供帮助。$B$B你已经证明了自己是个正直崇高的人。",
    ["I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was."] = "在我首次开始配制药水时，我一定打碎过成百个瓶子。我笨手笨脚，瓶子在我手中极易破碎。希望你比我更为小心。",
    ["I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives."] = "我必须承认，藏宝海湾有南海最好的杂烩蚌肉。哦，对烹饪不感兴趣？那么欢迎你投宿少女之爱号——在东部王国和卡里姆多之间航行的最好的客船。很快她将驰往棘齿城，在她到达之前好好享受吧。",
    ["I once followed the ways of the Twilight's Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku'mai!$b$bAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.$b$bI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!$b$bBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus."] = "我以前曾经追寻过墓光之锤的道路。为了找到复活上古之神的方法，我只身深入这座巢穴，想要找到从那个该死的恶魔阿库麦尔身上抽取能量的方法。$B$B在看到无数无辜人白白地牺牲之后，我慢慢恢复了理智。$B$B我被困住了一段时间，但是现在我自由了！不幸的是，这里离我的家乡卡兹莫丹太远了！$B$B勇敢的冒险者，我现在可以将你传送到一个特别的地方，然后回来干掉阿库麦尔。如果你愿意的话，我现在就送你到达纳苏斯去。",
    ["I once heard ol' Grimnur say he fished up a sword.  Or was it a swordfish?  Damn that Grimnur, he's told so many fish tales I can't remember which is which.  Well, why don't you go see him over in The Forlorn Cavern and have him tell you what it was."] = "我听格瑞诺尔说他曾经钓起过一柄剑。或者那是一条旗鱼？这该死的格瑞诺尔，他对我讲了太多的关于鱼的故事，我都分不清了。嗯，你干嘛不去荒弃的洞穴找他，让他告诉你那究竟是什么呢……",
    ["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."] = "我只跟那些被奥格瑞玛的兽人当朋友的人做生意。证明自己吧，然后再来和我谈那些强大的座狼。",
    ["I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours."] = "我只教那些掌握基本指示的学生。你必须在达纳苏斯工匠区找到暗夜精灵达丽亚娜。她的技能与你的是完美的互补。",
    ["I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage."] = "我真希望有更多像你一样的学生。很少有人会冒险深入敌境。我佩服你的勇气。",
    ["I overheard Regnus Thundergranite in the Hall of Arms bragging about a new trophy for his den the other day.  If yer looking for training from a skilled hunter, Regnus is the one to see."] = "几天前，我无意中听雷格努斯·雷石在武器大厅中吹嘘他兽穴中的一件新饰品。要是你想成为一名技艺纯熟的猎人，就去找他吧。",
    ["I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work."] = "我真羡慕你，$n。你做得太出色了。",
    ["I received an update on that just a moment ago. It looks like out of $2061w light leather needed, we have $2060w. As for the others, the report indicated that we've gathered $2063w of $2064w medium leather, and $2069w out of our $2071w thick leather quota."] = "我刚刚得到最新的消息。似乎我们已经收集到$2060w张轻皮、$2063w张中皮和$2069w张厚皮，而总的需求量分别是$2061w、$2064w和$2071w。",
    ["I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior's Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon.  "] = "我的大部分武器都来自战士区的伊琳尼雅·月火。要是你想学习如何使用新武器，就去找她吧。",
    ["I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered."] = "我估计获得这样一件东西的概率是百万分之一！一件让你终身受用的兽皮！即使是技艺最高超的工匠也不一定能剥出一张完美的皮来！",
    ["I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require."] = "$g尊敬的先生:女士;，在你掌握制皮的更多知识之前，我还不能帮助你，对此我感到很遗憾。跟法多恩或达丽亚娜谈谈。他们能教你所需的技能。",
    ["I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice."] = "$n，我已经看到了你的潜力。现在拿上锤子准备开工吧，你需要大量的练习才能提高自己的水平。",
    ["I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It's never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here..."] = "我看见一些有趣的人在港口进进出出。小心，$n。你永远不清楚谁值得信任以及跟这儿发生的所有事情的缘由……",
    ["I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin."] = "我这里只卖最好的东西，而且绝无二价。你想要讨价还价的话，就去找个地精商人。",
    ["I sell only the finest arcane gear, made by the crafters and mages here in the city of Stormwind."] = "我这里卖的可都是由暴风城最好的工匠和法师制作东西，世上最好的魔法装备！",
    ["I sell the finest cloth and leather garb this side of the valley!"] = "我出售山谷这一边最好的布料和皮革服饰！",
    ["I sense a disturbance, lurking around you..."] = "我感觉一场动乱潜伏在你周围……",
    ["I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies."] = "我应该寻求某些帮助；我不喜欢整天坐在这儿卖鱼。我更愿意去钓鱼，然后再卖掉。",
    ["I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.$B$BYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?"] = "我原本不想告诉你的：如果你能够穿过荒芜之地的话，那么你也许可以找到通往灼热峡谷的另外一条路。$B$B没错，我说的是荒芜之地。在卡加斯营地那里，兽人铺了一条通向灼热峡谷的小路。你说说他们有多蠢吧！那帮家伙居然造了一条通向地狱的道路？他们到底在想什么啊？",
    ["I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.$B$BWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts."] = "我眼睁睁地看着拉格纳罗斯的堕落渗透了整个黑铁矮人社会，使这个曾经荣耀的民族变得疯狂……变得邪恶。$B$B当黑石塔建造完毕时，我与同胞们共同生存下去的意愿也消失殆尽了。我作为新的黑铁矮人的英雄而死去。这座坟墓就在我亲手建造的城门处，作为对我的成就的敬意。",
    ["I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents."] = "我向要塞提供各种施法所需的碎片和其它炼金材料。",
    ["I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon?  Make it fast, I'm very busy!"] = "我猜想你到这儿来是训练如何使用新武器的？快点，我很忙的！",
    ["I sure could use a kiss about now.  Know where I can find one?"] = "要是有人给我个吻就好了，你知道我在哪里可以找到一个吻吗？",
    ["I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge."] = "我猜想那些小鬼在偷学知识。",
    ["I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I'm going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword."] = "我发誓……如果奎恩提斯胆敢再乱栽食虫花，我就马上把他的树给砍了。",
    ["I thank you, $n. Your dedication to my plea gives rest to my lost wife's spirit, and for that I could never repay you enough.$B$BI cannot say that my hatred will ever cease for the quilboar, but it is satiated for now.$B$BNow I must begin to rebuild my life."] = "谢谢你，$n。你安抚了我死去的妻子的灵魂，我将永远无法报答你的恩情。$B$B我想我会永远仇视野猪人，但是现在我已经得到了满足。$B$B我必须开始重建生活。",
    ["I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Mauradon in the Desolace."] = "碎石长者到凄凉之地的玛拉顿去了。",
    ["I think I hear him coming!  Look to the west!"] = "我听到他来了！朝西看！",
    ["I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it's about to blow!"] = "我认为普拉格把桶装得太满了。你瞧，简直都要炸开了！",
    ["I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.$B$BWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas."] = "我当然也不这么认为。但雷布拉特似乎已经证实了新的生命可以在这种破碎的土地上成长。现在我们的工作就是保持这种成长的可持续性，以及，最重要的，供应维持这种生长的养分。$B$B当然，既然我已经在这里了，我也会提供一些服务，帮助冒险者们进入纳克萨玛斯。",
    ["I think you'll have better luck looking in Stormwind.  Ask a guard up there and they'll point you in the right direction."] = "我认为你在暴风城会交到好运的。去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你指明方向。",
    ["I train and guide young hunters in the traditions passed down many generations."] = "我按照传统一代代地训练、指导年轻猎人。",
    ["I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors."] = "我用祖先传下来的方法训练猎人。",
    ["I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?"] = "我相信圣光会与你同在，$n。我能帮忙吗？",
    ["I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that's not easy with all the action we see."] = "我会尽量保证哨兵岭物资供给的，要维持这项行动可不容易。",
    ["I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes.  If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you."] = "我通常将那种事情留给侏儒去做。要是你想学习这项专业的话，我想你可以在暴风城找到一些侏儒来训练你。",
    ["I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.$B$BWhat can I do for you, $n?"] = "我独自走在路上，为了捍卫荣誉和清除这片大陆上的敌人而战。$B$B我能为你做什么，$n？",
    ["I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments."] = "我那时还是一个年轻的牛头人，没有成年，但我却知道，那些为了我们的自由而战的勇士们，都拥有一套与我同名的护甲。",
    ["I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek."] = "我就站在你旁边，笨蛋。我知道你在找什么。",
    ["I welcome you to Theramore, $n.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later."] = "欢迎你来到塞拉摩，$n。$B$B我没时间跟你寒暄，我为自己的唐突向你道歉，但是我必须以城市为首。我们的生活和联盟的尊严受到了严重的威胁。要想使我的人民平安幸福，我就必须对不在我们控制之外的力量保持警惕。$B$B或许稍后我们能找时间谈谈。",
    ["I welcome you, $N. And the Emerald Circle welcomes you.$B$BHopefully together we can help rejuventate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.$B$BDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land."] = "欢迎你，$N。翡翠议会也欢迎你。$B$B我们很有可能一起恢复并保护这片曾经繁茂的森林。许多势力试图从外部和内部毁灭它。$B$B不要被这里的力量征服——那只会腐蚀你，就像整个这片土地一样。",
    ["I will instruct you when the time is right... that time is not now. You have much more to learn first!"] = "当时机合适时，我会传授知识给你的……不是现在。你还得学习更多的知识！",
    ["I will teach you the way of the hammersmith. Just ask nicely."] = "我会教你锤系专精之道。你只需要恭恭敬敬地问我就可以了。",
    ["I will teach you what I can."] = "我会将我所知道的传授给你的。",
    ["I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter."] = "我会尽我所能教你。每一节课都是女神亲自给你的礼物。正确使用她的礼物，你就会无往不胜。",
    ["I wish the snow would just all melt away. It's always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!"] = "我希望雪融化掉。它总是把我的长袍弄湿，把一切都搞得乱糟糟的！",
    ["I would be delighted to aid you in the commencement of your pursuit! Let me grab my spinner and we'll get started..."] = "我很高兴能在你事业开始的时候帮上忙，！让我们抓紧纺纱机，开始吧……",
    ["I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin."] = "很高兴能将你收入麾下。让我们开始吧。",
    ["I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you."] = "如果你有能力学习的话，我是很荣幸教你如何使用武器的。",
    ["I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!"] = "我从不拒绝那些已经准备好跟我一同训练的人。不幸的是，你不是！你还像个小孩！",
    ["I would suggest looking in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."] = "我建议你去教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找一找。",
    ["I'd be wasting both your gold and my time if I were to teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c.  You're just too large!"] = "要教你学会驾驶机械陆行鸟，那简直就是在浪费我的金钱和时间，$c。你的体形太庞大了！",
    ["I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering..."] = "我愿意教你！要让我的姐姐看看她不是唯一了解工程学的人……",
    ["I'd train you if I could, but you're too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's got some real talent."] = "要是我能的话，我会教你的，但我力所不及。去跟雷霆崖中央高地西北部的商店找牛头人犹纳谈谈。她拥有真正的才能。",
    ["I'd wager Keryn Sylvius knows the type you're looking for. The company Keryn keeps is less than honorable. She usually hangs out in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "我打赌科瑞恩·塞尔留斯知道你在寻找什么东西。她通常在狮王之傲旅店里。",
    ["I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me.  I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room.  Foul magic taints this place, $n."] = "我感觉好多了，别担心我。我要在这间房间里进行净化仪式，在那之后我自然会设法离开的。这儿被邪恶的魔法力量污染了，$n。",
    ["I'll get the last laugh... they'll see! Oh, hi $c, I didn't see you there."] = "我是最后的大赢家……他们会看到的！啊，你好啊，$c，我刚才没看到你。",
    ["I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?"] = "我要来一杯黑铁啤酒。哦，你不是侍者？",
    ["I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. "] = "我对裁缝业知之甚少，但你需要更多的帮助。我听说有个暗夜精灵精通裁缝技术。他居住在暴风城的魔法区。",
    ["I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey."] = "我担心对有你这样经验的人没什么可教的。但是你还有其他方法。去找那边柜台后面的鲁坎·考迪尔谈谈。他会指引你通过旅行的下一个阶段。",
    ["I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt."] = "恐怕你在奥特兰克山谷中活不了多久，$C。等你更加强大一些再回来吧。",
    ["I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!"] = "恐怕你得离开我了，朋友！你该去找奥格瑞玛的诺格，他将带你进入下一阶段!",
    ["I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please."] = "恐怕你给我的份额太低了，我可不愿跟你废话了。请走吧。",
    ["I'm busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something."] = "我很忙，$n。告诉伍特去处理一切。那个年轻人整天都焦虑不安的。他大部分时间都处于这种状态，像是要做些什么。",
    ["I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!"] = "我太忙了，根本没有时间来陪你玩什么游戏， $r。有事就说，没事就从我眼前消失！",
    ["I'm flattered, but really I'm not interested... What?  You want to know where to learn enchanting?  Oh, how embarrassing!  Well, you should...  I'm sure you could... go see, um...  Taladan!  Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen's Terrace!"] = "过奖了，但我真的不感兴趣……什么？你想知道在哪儿能学习附魔知识吗？哦，真令人为难！呃，你应该……我想你应该……去找那个，嗯……塔兰丹！对，去工匠区找塔兰丹！",
    ["I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?"] = "我准备出发了，$n。我需要一些帮助——你愿意跟我来吗？",
    ["I'm going to stay here until I catch a 68 Pound Grouper!  You on the other hand want to fly off somewhere, am I right?"] = "我要一直待在这里直到钓到68磅重的石斑鱼！你却要离开到什么地方去，是不是？",
    ["I'm honored to meet you, $n, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on."] = "见到你是我的荣幸，$n，但是你在配制药水方面比我厉害。去幽暗城 炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他能帮助你。",
    ["I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her."] = "我只是个学生。雷安诺才是专家。她站在那边的箱子旁。你可以从她那儿学到很多东西。",
    ["I'm never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway..."] = "我忙死了，不会跟陌生人讲话的！几乎从来不……",
    ["I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics."] = "你如此大胆地跑来找我，想要接受训练，我对此可不高兴。穿过拱道，沿着坡道向东南方走，跟亡灵马丁·费尔本谈谈。他能教你一些基础知识。",
    ["I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me."] = "我不是来教那些刚离开摇篮的宝宝的。你离我对学生的要求还差远了。你不过是个年幼的$g小伙子:姑娘;，你最好别在这儿烦我了。",
    ["I'm so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don't run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!"] = "加布加布回来啦，我太高兴了！我希望我的黑铁啤酒不会很快被喝光，否则这家伙又会偷跑出去啦！",
    ["I'm sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don't have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don't fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he'll help ye out."] = "很抱歉$g小伙子:姑娘;，但是你基础不足，我不能教你。但是别烦恼，跟我的学生洛特加斯谈谈，他会帮助你的。",
    ["I'm sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won't be sellin' my raptors to someone who hasn't proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I'll make my raptors available to ya."] = "很抱歉$g兄弟:姐妹;，但是在确定买主是暗矛部落的贵族之前，我不会将迅猛龙卖给他的。当你证明自己是部落贵族之后，我才会把迅猛龙卖给你。",
    ["I'm sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "很抱歉，$n，但是我可不在新手身上浪费时间。你得找一个跟自己技能相近的人。去达纳苏斯的工匠区找一个名叫米拉·法拉科纳的暗夜精灵。",
    ["I'm sorry, I'm a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire. "] = "很抱歉，我现在有些忙，我要为湖畔镇的弗纳·奥斯古打造马蹄。",
    ["I'm what you call a capitalist, $r."] = "我就是你所说的财主，$R。",
    ["I've been expec...$B$B<Rimblat coughs.>$B$BExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. "] = "我希望能……$B$B<雷布拉特干咳了几声。>$B$B抱歉，老毛病了。我是陶土议会的雷布拉特。",
    ["I've been expecting you $n.  Are you ready to assist us in Arathi Basin?"] = "我一直在盼着你呢，$n。我们在阿拉希盆地的战斗需要你的帮助，你准备好了吗？",
    ["I've been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it's a pipe dream."] = "我一直在研究在大城市间通过地下通道运送石油的方法，但是每个人都认为我是在做白日梦。",
    ["I've got all the cooking supplies you'll ever need, mon!"] = "我这里有你所需要的所有烹饪材料，伙计！",
    ["I've got my eye on you, $r."] = "我被你吸引住了，$r。",
    ["I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!"] = "我有许多处方可供选择，我还可以为你打折！",
    ["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way."] = "事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。",
    ["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, $r! Please, get out of my way.$B$BIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you."] = "事情太多，时间太少，$r！拜托，别挡我的道。$B$B但如果你中了蛆毒或食尸鬼疫病的话，我可以帮助你。",
    ["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques."] = "我听说居住在激流堡的德尼布·沃克有一本书，这本书一定能帮助你提高急救技能。",
    ["I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you."] = "我听说暴风城中有个矮人因狩猎技巧高超而闻名。或许你可以找他问问看。",
    ["I've seen a troll named Lau'Tiki fishing down south at the Darkspear Strand.  That's just on the outskirts of Sen'jin Village."] = "我曾见到一个名叫劳迪克的巨魔在暗矛海滩南部钓鱼，就在森金村的外围。",
    ["I've seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it's unclear to me what's become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that's touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what's happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area."] = "过去数年来，我目睹了熊怪所经历的种种可怕的事情——它们成为战场上的无辜受害者。但是我不清楚这个部落现在怎么样了。它们被席卷费伍德森林的瘟疫腐化了吗？或许它们对自己曾经和平的民族所遭遇的一切表示愤怒，正试图自我保护？无论如何，它们中的大多数对进入这片领域的人都会表现出敌意。",
    ["I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.$B$BNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done.  I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n.  "] = "就像其他人一样，我在开战初期就来帮助我的德鲁伊同胞。$B$B现在安其拉的大门已经打开，但我意识到许多工作还没有完成。因此我决定留在希利苏斯，尽我所能地帮助他们。",
    ["I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!"] = "我，就像我的兄弟们一样，以那些尊重祖先的人为荣。对我来说，与欢度春节的人们一起分享我的秘密手艺是极大的快乐。",
    ["I... I'm not really sure how I got here...$B$BI seem to remember traveling... a raft...$B$B"] = "我……我真的不知道自己是怎么到那儿的……$B$B我依稀记得用的是……木筏……$B$B",
    ["If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power..."] = "要是海达克西斯招募了新兵，就可能使双方的力量对比发生变化……",
    ["If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire.  Mmmm!"] = "要是我有栗子的话，你最好相信我会将它们烤熟吃掉的。嗯！",
    ["If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering."] = "要是我向萨鲁证明了自己的实力，他将别无选择，只能让我为他的一个女儿而战。让我们看看谁是失败的那个吧。",
    ["If I wasn't stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that's not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "如果我不是天天都陷在这里，我已经得到训练你们这些人的技能了！不幸的是事实不是这样。去找石爪山脉太阳石居所的赫加斯谈谈。",
    ["If I were you, I'd buy a goblin race voucher.  Rooting for the other team is a waste of time."] = "如果我是你，我就赌地精赢。压其他车队都是在浪费时间。",
    ["If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him.$b$bI sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe."] = "如果雷瑟和树荫旅店被烧毁的事有某种联系的话，你就得找到他，问个清楚。$b$b我派了奥格隆去追他，应该是朝东南方向去了。去跟奥格隆会合，然后一起去找雷瑟吧。",
    ["If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures."] = "要是你想找银行的话，就去达纳苏斯的中央地带。你可以在那儿存储自己的财宝。",
    ["If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "要是你想找猎人的话，就去拜访达扎拉吧。他通常在多兰纳尔旅店的外面。",
    ["If it is the way of the Warrior that you crave then you must seek out Krang Stonehoof.  You will find him in the southeast corner of the village at his training circle, often instructing his other students."] = "要是你想成为一名战士，就得去找克朗·石蹄。你能在村子的东南角找到他，他通常就在那儿训练学生。",
    ["If it weren't for that cursed, gnomish luck, they'd never win a race!"] = "要不是侏儒的狗屎运，他们就永远不会赢！",
    ["If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps."] = "要不是因为这酒吧，我的空闲时间就只能用来剥龙鳞啦。",
    ["If it weren't for the goblins' inconceivable, dumb luck, they'd crash their car during every race!"] = "要不是地精的狗屎运，他们每次都会把车撞进山里去！",
    ["If it's broke, Slagtree can fix it!"] = "如果它坏了，那么斯拉提可以修理它！",
    ["If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!"] = "要是我计算正确的话，这车轮很快就会作废的！",
    ["If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $n, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!"] = "如果你是个裁缝，维兹格里克肯定有你想要的东西！随便看看，$n，想要买什么东西就和我说！",
    ["If that is your wish $c, then you will need to speak to Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior's Terrace.  He is a representative of The League of Arathor and can help you to get to Arathi Basin."] = "$c，如果那就是你的愿望，那么去战士区找克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈。他是阿拉索联军的代表，能帮助你到达阿拉希盆地。",
    ["If there were just a few more hours in a day..."] = "要是离天黑还有些时间的话……",
    ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."] = "如果我们要成为这块新地区的主人，那么我们就必须要找个地方好好休息。把你的斧子放在火边，让大家分享你英勇战斗的故事吧。",
    ["If ye ask me, I think Grif spends a little too much time with the animals.  Still, nobody else knows the hunter's path quite like he does.  Look for him outside the smithy in Kharanos."] = "假如你问我的话，我想格瑞夫在动物身上花费的时间过多了。到目前为止，没人比他更精通于猎人之道。去卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外面找他吧。",
    ["If ye need to get yer hands on some guild creation papers ye'll have to head up to Ironforge and visit the Ironforge Visitor's Center."] = "要是你需要一些公会登记表的话，就前往铁炉堡，去拜访铁炉堡访客中心吧。",
    ["If ye're looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye're gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there's a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession."] = "要是你想学习制皮的话，就去铁炉堡吧。我听说大锻炉附近有间商店，你可以那儿学到制皮的知识。",
    ["If yer of need of an Inn, The Stonefire Inn is where ye should be.  Ye'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going.  $B$BOh, and if yer going that way, then tell them to have a tankard ready for me."] = "要是你要找旅馆的话，石火旅店是个不错的选择。若是你前往铁炉堡的话，会在城门的左边找到这个旅馆；要是在铁炉堡里面的话，它就在城门的右边。$B$B哦，要是你现在就去那里的话，告诉他们为我准备好啤酒吧。",
    ["If yer thinking about forming a guild, then ye'll need to put it past Jondor Steelbrow o'er in the Ironforge Visitor's Center.  Just head southeast from the gates of Ironforge to see him."] = "要是你想组建公会的话，那你首先需要通过铁炉堡访客中心的乔多·钢眉的认同。穿过铁炉堡大门往东南方向走，你就能找到他。",
    ["If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."] = "如果你想要去奥特兰克山谷，去和卡尔特拉·血喉谈谈。你可以在荣耀谷的勇者大厅去找她。",
    ["If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you."] = "如果你来这儿是为了得到进一步的训练，那你是高估我的能力了。跟泰龙尼斯谈谈；他应该能帮助你。",
    ["If you are here to hunt dragons, be my guest.  Where should I send my condolences?"] = "如果你到这儿来猎龙，那你就是我的客人了。我应该去哪里表示我的哀悼？",
    ["If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that."] = "如果你是来浪费我的时间，那你就是在浪费整个塞纳里奥议会的时间。为你自己着想，希望你不至于那么蠢。",
    ["If you are looking to become a great cook, venture over to the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town and talk to Stephen Ryback. That man knows how to cook up a rack of ribs like no other.Man... now you got me hungry for some of his famous ribs. Don't count on him teaching you that recipe though!"] = "如果你想要成为一名好厨师，那就去旧城区的猪和哨声旅店，找斯蒂芬·雷百克谈谈。那家伙知道怎样才能做出与众不同的肋排大餐来。  啊……说到他那著名的肋骨大餐，我都感到有些饿了。你可不要指望他会把那道菜的做法传授给你！",
    ["If you are looking to become a mighty paladin, there is no better teacher then Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker. He can be found in the Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square."] = "如果你想变成强大的圣骑士，那么格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵是你最好的导师。你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂中找到他。",
    ["If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.$B$BIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds."] = "如果你喜欢在户外狩猎的话，那么无论是费伍德的树人还是环形山的鞭笞者都是不错的目标，可以提供大量的叶子。$B$B如果你更喜欢冒险，那么厄运之槌东西两翼内都有大量的植物，可以供应足够的叶子。",
    ["If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!"] = "如果你在寻找一种真正回报丰厚的事业，那么附魔行业正在等待着你！",
    ["If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!"] = "如果你问我，那我要说，地精的科技更加先进。我们有工具，我们还有天赋！",
    ["If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.$B$BOh, and it's also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily."] = "在我看来，钓鱼的美妙之处在于其缓慢的节奏。人们可以在钓鱼的过程中思考、回想过去和计划未来。$B$B哦，当然这也是大醉的托辞。",
    ["If you ask me, there's no greater profession than a miner.  And if you ask me, there's no greater miner than a dwarf!"] = "要是你问我的话，没有比矿工更好的职业了，也没有比矮人更好的矿工了！",
    ["If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus."] = "要是你想要组建公会的话，你必须去见公会管理人琳沙娜。她在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。",
    ["If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance."] = "要是你想学习草药学，就必须去雷霆崖。出了血蹄村，沿着北边的路走，然后乘坐电梯到达山顶。你可以问问雷霆崖的守卫获取帮助。",
    ["If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes."] = "要是你愿意的话，除了训练之外，我还可以用自己的力量将天赋从你的头脑中抹去。我要警告你的是，你每经历一次这样的过程，执行这过程的难度就会增加一分，而且所需的费用也会随之上升。",
    ["If you figure out any way to improve the device let me know!"] = "如果你有办法改进这个装置，那就告诉我！",
    ["If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year's model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!"] = "如果你是为获得快速而安全的产品而来，那么这儿就是你的目的地了！今年的机械陆行鸟模型已经到了，我将为你展示其性能！",
    ["If you have come to save the world then you have come to the right place. The faceless one - the Blood God, Hakkar - has been brought back into our world!"] = "如果你是来拯救世界的，那么你来对地方了。无面者——血神哈卡——已经被带回到我们的世界来了！",
    ["If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way."] = "如果你带着那东西，我会很高兴地为你指路的。",
    ["If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up."] = "如果你把A标签插到B槽中，那么当然会爆炸！来，看看我有些什么，然后你可以问利廉姆怎样组合才不会爆炸。",
    ["If you manage to complete a deck of beasts cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the blue dragon.   This is very useful in restoring of magical energies."] = "如果你集齐一套野兽卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：蓝龙。这张卡片对恢复魔法能量非常有用。",
    ["If you manage to complete a deck of elementals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the maelstrom.   This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage."] = "如果你集齐一套元素卡片，我们会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片：漩涡。这张卡片可能会对你的敌人造成严重的伤害。",
    ["If you manage to complete a deck of portals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the twisting nether.   This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you."] = "如果你集齐一套入口卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：虚空。这张卡片将有可能在你死亡之后让你复活。",
    ["If you manage to complete a deck of warlords cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of heroism.   This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat."] = "如果你集齐一套督军卡片的话，你将获得一张暗月卡片：英雄。这张卡片将有可能在你进行近身作战的时候对你进行治疗。",
    ["If you need to house your pet while you're training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District."] = "如果你需要将宠物关在屋内，以便训练另一只宠物的话，就去矮人区找耶诺瓦·石盾谈谈。",
    ["If you need training in alchemy, there is only one place in Stormwind you need to go... Alchemy Needs. You can find it in the Mage Quarter along the outer rim of shops."] = "如果你要学习炼金术，暴风城只有一个地方值得你去……那就是炼金材料店。你可以沿着法师区的外围找到这家店铺。",
    ["If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne."] = "如果你洒上一些香水，就可以找到对你有好感的人。他们会接受你的爱情信物……并给你一件礼物作为回报。$B$B但是，你要记住：要让别人接受你的爱情信物，你必须闻起来很迷人！男人喜欢香水的味道，而女人会为古龙水陶醉！",
    ["If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of."] = "如果你需要通过休息恢复体力的话，多兰纳尔的旅店是你最佳的选择。旅店老板凯达米尔将帮你打点一切。",
    ["If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles."] = "如果你想猎杀纳迦，你需要所能获得的所有帮助。水底有裂缝，能产生足够的气泡供你在水下呼吸。向水面游动，就能利用这些气泡了。",
    ["If you think you have the strength to pound good metal into weapons and armor for the Horde look for Dwukk next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of Razor Hill."] = "如果你认为自己有能力为部落打造武器，就去剃刀岭西北部，炙热的熔炉旁找杜克。",
    ["If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing."] = "刃歌长者就在希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。",
    ["If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northern Darnassus."] = "如果你真的想做这个职业，就去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区找一个技艺纯熟的炼金士：安尼希尔。",
    ["If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don't like people.$B$BIf you want something, make it quick."] = "如果你想知道碎木哨岗的商旅来往情况，我恰好就是你要找的兽人。不幸的是，我不喜欢人类。$B$B要是你想要什么的话，就快些。",
    ["If you wish to become a swordsmith, just ask."] = "如果你希望成为一名铸剑师，那就问问我吧。",
    ["If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!"] = "如果你是来接受狩猎技巧训练的，那你就来对地方了！",
    ["If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them."] = "如果你对皮革缝纫感兴趣，那你算来对地方了。法多恩和泰龙尼斯都是真正的艺术家，而我希望能从他们那里多学些知识。",
    ["If you're looking for a flight back to Rut'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil'naveth."] = "如果你想飞回鲁瑟兰村，就该找暗夜精灵希尔瓦·菲纳雯斯谈谈。",
    ["If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind."] = "要是你想要飞回雷霆崖，就该跟我的牛头人搭档布瑟恩·草风谈谈。",
    ["If you're looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I'm the one to talk to.  Then again, you need to know what information you're looking for first before I can really help you.$B$BSee how that works?  Brilliant!"] = "如果你想在塞纳里奥议会中找寻某些档案的话，我就是那个你要交谈的人。你首先要知道要寻找的确切信息，那样我才能帮你。$B$B看看那个，真是光彩夺目呀！",
    ["If you've come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you've come to the right place!$B$BGrimand Elmore, at your service!"] = "要是你是来找世界上最富经验的工匠，你就找对地方啦！$B$B格瑞曼德·艾尔默，愿为你效劳！",
    ["In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.$B$BI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.$B$BPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch."] = "这里西边有一处叫做菲拉斯的地方，那一带的鹰角兽正处于危险的境地中。$B$B我需要你从菲拉斯南部的伊斯迪尔废墟中给我带回鹰角兽的蛋，超级测蛋器会分析你带回来的蛋，并判断它是否可以孵化。然后我可以把蛋送到达纳苏斯去孵化，避免它们受到戈杜尼食人魔的黑暗魔法的影响！$B$B$n，你要知道，有些蛋即使完整无缺也是不可能孵化出来的。",
    ["In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?"] = "在过去的岁月里，我们以狩猎为生。我们为了荣誉而狩猎……$B$B现在有什么不同吗？",
    ["In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner's profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman's Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more."] = "世间动物死时会将它们的生命和兽皮赐予我们。要是你能尊重它们的牺牲，或许剥皮者这个职业会适合你的。去达纳苏斯北部的工匠区，找艾拉迪尔谈谈，学习更多知识。",
    ["In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.$B$BThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.$B$BThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world."] = "很久以前——我们的种族经历了无数战乱和冲突，几乎到了灭绝的边缘。我们承受了太多灾难，$c。$B$B燃烧军团的进攻，恶魔之魂，巨龙军团的分裂，死亡之翼的崛起，我们的女王阿莱克丝塔萨受到龙喉氏族的奴役。$B$B经过种种磨难，我们拥有了不可动摇的意志——那是努力生存的大无畏力量。",
    ["In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.$B$BNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, 'What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?'$B$BWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain't nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!"] = "我愿意用萨弗隆战锤的设计图换取一块萨弗隆铁锭。$B$B现在，你大概正在暗自盘算吧，“我要那种战锤来做什么，我现有的装备比这东西高级多了！”$B$B嗯，让我告诉你吧，$g先生:女士;，没有什么武器比萨弗隆战锤更高级了！",
    ["In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same."] = "在灰色年代，德鲁伊对周遭的人都很友好。你随便问塞纳里奥区的任何一个德鲁伊，他们会给出相同的说法的。",
    ["In need of some alchemy supplies, are we?  Or do you have other business with me?"] = "需要一些炼金术的材料吗？或者你有别的什么事情？",
    ["In the King's audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers."] = "你可以在国王的觐见室中找到赫塔希姆。她能帮助你前往阿拉希盆地，阿拉索联军需要援助来打败污染者。",
    ["In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely."] = "在银松森林北流海岸边缘，海滩上搁着一艘废弃的船。船只以西有你要找的东西；游得太远的话，你会因疲劳无法游回海岸的。海床上有一只上了锁的箱子，等着你去取呢。$B$B要是没有人帮忙的话，潜到这样的深度会受到极大的压强，要小心；海床上有一道裂缝，能释放出气泡，有助于你寻找那半块坠饰。好好利用吧。",
    ["In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.$B$BWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land."] = "在抵抗燃烧军团时期，污染者拉瑟莱克是卡扎克麾下最强大的将领之一。当燃烧军团被击退，卡扎克的势力被压制之后，拉瑟莱克接受了诅咒之地的事务。$B$B当联盟和部落在诅咒之地以外的地方打得天昏地暗的时候，拉瑟莱克则在召集阴影议会的教徒，以及野蛮的巨槌食人魔。",
    ["In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage."] = "在上一次大战中，牛头人也曾参战，很多地方都有萨满祭司抵抗天灾入侵的记录。这些祭司们也献出了宝贵的生命，更悲惨的是，他们的尸体竟然还被收集起来，切割成碎片，输送到那座被诅咒的城堡中的用作某些邪恶实验的材料。我只能在此真心为他们的逝去感到默哀，他们也是我们一族的骄傲。",
    ["In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose."] = "在贫瘠之地的东北部，有一处受到严重污染的水池。当地人称它为淤泥沼泽；风险投资公司将水晶般幽蓝的水域变成工业副产品和废弃品的泥潭。在沼泽的中心有你要找的东西，$n。$B$B要小心，风险投资公司绝不容许有人入侵，他们将不为其工作的人都当作入侵者。你作为自然的保护者，更是他们极力对抗的目标。",
    ["In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory."] = "在黑海岸的北面流淌着壁泉河，发源于现今的费伍德森林。随着河流流到并汇入薄雾海，一直蜿蜒到海洋北部最深处。在那儿有你要的石头，由于这种石头的形状酷似爪状，因此被称为石爪。$B$B要当心——蛇颈龙聚集在石爪那里，他们会攻击那些贸然入侵的人。",
    ["In the time before time, what the usurpers would later call the First Age of Creation, my master and his siblings ruled over this world. It was they, the Old Gods, who created all.$B$BAnd it was they who would ultimately be cast down by those that would call themselves Shapers."] = "很久以前，在篡位者称为创世之年代的时候，我的主人和他的同胞们统治着整个世界。是他们，是远古的神灵创造了一切。$B$B他们最终被那些称他们为缔造者的家伙推翻了。",
    ["In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!$B$BIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.$B$BFor the Horde!"] = "在这个艰难的时期，捐赠布料对于那些不幸的人是非常重要的帮助手段。布料还可以制作装备和绷带——这对于战争十分重要！$B$B如果你想要为奥格瑞玛的兽人捐赠布料的话，我会欣然接受它们，你一定会受到我们的青睐。$B$B为了部落！",
    ["In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training."] = "你得及时准备好接受我的教学，$n。到那时，找达丽亚娜谈谈，他会帮助你训练的。",
    ["In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull."] = "在你匆忙追寻荣耀的过程中，你有没有想过你的行动对于这场竞赛的节奏有什么影响？你有没有想过你们的行为对我来说是多么可笑而荒谬？我对你来说是个难以理解的存在，这让你头颅里那花生大小的脑子感到十分迷茫。",
    ["Incredible power can be found in the spirits or 'muisek' of the creatures that we battle against.$B$BLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined."] = "和我们战斗的那些生物的灵魂，或者说“灵魂精华”中存在着不可思议的力量。$B$B这个地区的许多生物都是暗夜精灵的盟友，暗夜精灵可以随时利用它们的力量。部落也应该享受到同样的权利，我相信一定有办法可以掌握这些力量，使其为我们所用。$B$B我说的都是事实，$N。帮助我，你会发现自己获得了不可思议的力量。",
    ["Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments."] = "难以置信。你配制药水的技能已经能跟我匹敌了。我不能再训练你了，去悲伤沼泽找斯通纳德的兽人罗格瓦尔谈谈。他以他的宝刀而闻名。",
    ["Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep."] = "银翼要塞需要你的援助。跟暴风要塞觐见室的艾弗拉兰谈谈。",
    ["Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.$B$B<Vaelan laughs.>$B$BShall I continue?"] = "我以你所能接受的形态站在你面前。显然，你无法接受一条名叫瓦拉塔兹的龙。$B$B<维埃兰笑了起来。>$B$B我可以继续吗？",
    ["Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses."] = "旅店老板考乌斯可以满足你的需求。你可以在村子西边的屋子中找到他。",
    ["Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise."] = "旅店老板帕拉能帮助你得到身心的休息。他就在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中。",
    ["Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides.  He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now."] = "查尔·硬皮居住在村子西北角的大帐篷中。他能教你一些制皮的必要知识。",
    ["Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.$B$BNow, I must get back to work!"] = "有趣，真有趣……我知道有个德鲁伊居住在哀嚎洞穴上方的山顶，$n。她也许能告诉你有关这块碎片的更多信息。$B$B现在，我必须工作了！",
    ["Invention, my dear $c, is two percent bottled inspiration, four percent solar exposure, six percent chance of thunderstorms clearing by mid-afternoon, and ninety-three percent Rumplesnicker.$B$BWait, did that add to one hundred? I've got my notes around here somewhere."] = "发明创造，我亲爱的$c，就是百分之二的灵感，百分之四的日光浴，百分之六的雷阵雨之后的清新，以及百分之九十三的鬼点子。$B$B等等，这加起来好像不是百分之一百？我的笔记本去哪里了……",
    ["Ironforge is going to be your best bet for leatherworkers.  If memory servers, there's a shop by The Great Forge that should meet yer needs."] = "铁炉堡是学习制皮的最佳场所。要是我没记错的话，你可以去大锻炉旁的商店。",
    ["Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty."] = "人们从森林植物中制造的东西难道不令人震惊吗？说真的，月神对我们已经很慷慨了。",
    ["Is it? This has always been their method of operation. What is of greater value to Kel'Thuzad and the ever growing Scourge army? A zealous, living, follower that can work their way into a society and then unleash a plague, destroying thousands; or a single undead trooper? Certainly you cannot be that dense$B$BYes, $r, they live, work, and plot among you."] = "是吗？这是他们一贯的操作手法。对克尔苏加德和快速增长的亡灵天灾军队来说，什么东西拥有更大的价值？一个能成功潜入某个组织，然后释放瘟疫使数千人丧命的狂热追随者，还是一个普通到掉渣的亡灵士兵？很明显你不是那么愚蠢。$B$B没错，$r，他们就在你周围，生活着，工作着，密谋着。",
    ["Is this a serious question? You really don't know?$B$BIf you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.$B$BIf you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps."] = "能问些不这么愚蠢的问题吗？你真不知道吗？$B$B要是你胆子小，怕死的话，就去燃烧平原和灼热峡谷的生物身上去找黑铁碎片。$B$B要是你够狠够胆大，干脆杀进黑石塔和黑石深渊算了，那里的黑铁碎片更多。",
    ["Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil."] = "向您致敬，$g兄弟:姐妹;。你有外面的消息吗？我希望得到泰达希尔的消息。",
    ["Ishnu-dal-dieb, $n. Have you come here in search of knowledge?"] = "和平也与你同在, $n。你是来寻求知识的吗？",
    ["It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then.  You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor."] = "那么你是在找博文·布里斯博埃斯了。他居住在炉灰庄园大桥另一边，布瑞尔城镇西南部。",
    ["It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village."] = "你应该去听听根妮亚·符文图腾的忠告。她在村子东面的大营帐中。",
    ["It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue's path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree."] = "要是你想做潜行者的话，就该去找塞尤娜。她居住在西部森林盘旋山道下的塞纳里奥区。",
    ["It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.  You will find him through the portal in western Darnassus that will take you to Rut'theran Village."] = "你要找的是维斯派塔斯。他负责看管在泰达希尔底部往返的角鹰兽。你可在穿过达纳苏斯西部的传送门，然后在鲁瑟兰村那儿找到他。",
    ["It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there."] = "你可以在雷霆崖的最低处寻找，就在离银行不远的地方。",
    ["It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag."] = "你希望利用这些尸体以表示对它们的尊敬，这很好。去暗巷区中心的 科多兽皮工店找苏尔德吧。",
    ["It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.$B$BGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!$B$BFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand."] = "很高兴看到又有人在斯坦索姆城中和亡灵天灾抗战，在这里他们的力量是最强大的。$B$B，你好。我是奥里克斯。我曾经是银手骑士团的一名骑兵，但是跟其他信念发生动摇的骑兵一样……我堕落了。亡灵天灾诱惑了我，差点使我成为一名死亡骑士！$B$B最终，我感觉到自己的危险处境，我逃到了这个教堂。这是个神圣的地方，第一个圣骑士光明使者乌瑟尔就是在这里成为银手骑士团的首领的。",
    ["It is good to see you again, $n."] = "很高兴再次见到你，$n。",
    ["It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.$B$BReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know."] = "很高兴再次见到你，$n医生。我看着你逐步成长，我敢说现在是你学习更高的绷带技能的时候啦。$B$B一旦你的技能得到提高，就回来找我，我会把我所知的一切都教给你的。",
    ["It is located in the Trade District citizen.  It is nearly straight on from the entrance of Stormwind."] = "从暴风城入口直走，就在贸易区。",
    ["It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making."] = "为冒险家服务是我的荣幸，因为他们即将成为英雄。",
    ["It is no easy task to protect the Horde's lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle!  The night elves and their allies will fall!"] = "要保护部落在灰谷的木材收集工作并不容易，但是我们从不畏惧战斗！暗夜精灵和他们的盟友必将失败！",
    ["It is no light endeavor upon which you embark $n.  To get to Warsong Gulch you will want to speak to Aethalas, the Battlemaster of the Silverwing Sentinels.  She will guide your way.  Blessings of the Goddess be with you!"] = "你要做的事情需要很大的勇气，$n。要进入战歌峡谷，你就得跟银翼哨兵的军官艾萨拉斯谈谈。她会为你指引方向的。愿女神的祝福与你同在！",
    ["It is power, imbecile.$B$B<Mataus's eyes darken.>$B$BThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.$B$B<Mataus spits.>$B$BJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.$B$BI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form."] = "那就是力量的化身，你这白痴。$B$B<玛塔乌斯的眼神变得黑暗了。>$B$B这帮白痴把你这样更白的白痴送进纳克萨玛斯里去回收那些被亵渎的护甲碎片，然后净化，重新附魔，来恢复以前的荣光。$B$B<玛塔乌斯不屑地吐了一下口水。>$B$B光是想到这群超级白痴就能让我感到不舒服。$B$B我也在寻找这些护甲碎片，不过我会把它进一步加工成为最邪恶的形态。",
    ["It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.$B$BYes, the very staff once held by Medivh."] = "听说克尔苏加德正在研究传说中的埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。$B$B是的，就是那件曾属于麦迪文的神奇法杖。",
    ["It is the assistance of Bulrug that you need.  You will find him outside on the lower rise standing between the inn and the Thunder Bluff Bank."] = "你需要布尔鲁格的帮助。他在旅馆和雷霆崖银行间较低的山上。",
    ["It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!"] = "今天是春节的最后一天，祝你来年万事顺意！",
    ["It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on."] = "现在是你去达纳苏斯跟迈里恩谈谈的时候了。她将对你进行指导。",
    ["It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further."] = "现在你该找一位更加渊博的老师了。在菲拉斯的羽月要塞居住着暗夜精灵凯兰娜·风语。她有聪明的头脑；毫无疑问她能继续教你。",
    ["It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?"] = "我确实有能力对那些有价值的人进行教学。你是这样的人吗？",
    ["It is wise that you humble yourself before me $N in your desire for more warlock knowledge."] = "为了学习更多的术士知识，你在我面前表现谦卑是很明智的做法$N。",
    ["It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.$B$BEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!"] = "很明显！居住在虫巢中的异种虫并不欢迎我们的到来。$B$B一切进展顺利，直到我们在雷戈虫巢中发现了一块雕文水晶。她象飞蛾扑火一般急切地抓起水晶，把脸凑上去，精神也变得恍惚起来。队友们都很担心她。我们以最快的速度将她带出了虫巢！",
    ["It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed.  I don't recommend trying it if you can avoid it.  "] = "如此近距离地接近异种虫类而不被察觉需要相当的技巧。如果可能的话，我不建议你做这样的尝试。",
    ["It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.$B$BWhere one did fall, many would rise..."] = "在他不幸运遇难之后，全洛丹伦的骑士与战士都开始穿着相同式样的铠甲，以纪念这位倒下的英雄。尽管莫格莱尼的死可以算是克尔苏加德的一场大胜，但英雄之死的影响，却改变了整个战争最终的走势。$B$B一个人倒下了，但更多的人站了出来，为反抗天灾军团的入侵而战……",
    ["It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted."] = "似乎黑龙的势力范围已经超越了燃烧平原，扩展到暴风城了！人们揭下了篡位者的面具并将他流放出境。",
    ["It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.$B$BIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.$B$BI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more."] = "那绝不是东部王国的任何一个地方。$B$B一定是在卡利姆多大陆的某处，但是距离部落和其他种族仍有相当遥远的距离。还没有受到分裂影响的某个地方——远离暗夜精灵文明的地方。$B$B我猜有人守护在那儿……就像守护山谷或是环形山一样；我不确定。我只是猜测。很抱歉我不能提供更多的帮助了。",
    ["It's a pleasure to see you again, $n.  Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines.  I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this."] = "我很高兴再见到你，$n。你的帮助为我们保证了补给线的安全。我希望你可以理解在如此一场大战中，物资补给的重要性。",
    ["It's a secret to everybody... including me!$B$BI'm glad you found me -- it's a good thing I'm not hiding in a bush or underneath a rock, isn't it?"] = "对任何人而言……包括我，这都是一个秘密！$B$B很高兴你找到了我——我没躲藏在树丛中或是岩石下，挺幸运的，是吧？",
    ["It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.$B$BThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh."] = "对我这样的工匠来说，制造的流程本身是很简单的。$B$B困难之处在于获得原料。如果你能为我取回一块完美的比斯巨兽的皮，我就能用它制作出一些强大的装备。",
    ["It's admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King's audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin."] = "阿拉索联军在阿拉希盆地所做的一切令人敬佩。可惜亡灵憎恶和他们的部落盟友挡住了去路。去暴风要塞国王的觐见室找赫塔希姆吧，她会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。",
    ["It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies."] = "枪炮与硝烟弥漫，直到某一方被摧毁。",
    ["It's always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?"] = "有人找我谈话总是件高兴的事儿。事情进展如何，$c？",
    ["It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions."] = "我自己不久前也是一个新手，所以我觉得我不太适合教你。试着跟那边的塔恩或是玛克谈谈。他们之中应该有人能回答你的问题。",
    ["It's good to see an engineer brave enough to make the device.   We goblin engineers laugh at danger!"] = "很高兴有技师能勇敢地制作这个装置。我们地精工程师对于危险只会抱以大笑！",
    ["It's hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.$B$BWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you."] = "很难想象如此多的死亡和恐惧会汇集在那么小的一块地区中。在这些门后是一块充斥着混乱和毁灭的大陆。$B$B冒险者，你要非常小心谨慎才行。诅咒之地中到处都是可以让你丧命的强大生物。",
    ["It's here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!"] = "看这边！暗月马戏团开市啦！记得来看看艾泽拉斯最激动人心的集会！",
    ["It's simple really. Allow me to summarize..."] = "这是真的。请允许我总结一下……",
    ["It's the big building in Razor Hill that's not the barracks.  Just talk to Innkeeper Grosk inside.  Got that?"] = "那是剃刀岭的一幢大建筑，而不是兵营。去跟旅店老板格罗斯克谈谈。明白了？",
    ["It... It's foggy, $N. I can't see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil's hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!$B$BLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.$B$B<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>$B$BAlcaz Island! That devious bastard is on Alcaz Island!"] = "啊……起雾了，$n。我什么都看不见！等等……等会儿。我看见……我看见维维尔的藏身之处。啊……没错！我相信书的一章就在他手中！$B$B让我调整一下望远镜，这样可以看得更清楚些。$B$B<纳瑞安都快变成对眼了。>$B$B奥卡兹岛！那家伙就在奥卡兹岛上！",
    ["Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you're looking for.  She tends to hunters' pets while they seek training from her father."] = "矮人区的耶诺瓦·石盾是你要找的人。在猎人接受她父亲的训练时，她帮着照看猎人的宠物。",
    ["Jocaste was the greatest of Hunters of her time.  These days you can find her over in the Cenarion Enclave where she teaches those who are just starting down the Hunter's path."] = "祖卡斯特是她那个时代最伟大的猎人。最近，她在塞纳里奥区教那些猎人初学者。",
    ["John, honey, where are you?"] = "约翰,亲爱的,你在哪里?",
    ["Johnson?  I think he's around here somewhere..."] = "约翰森？我认为他在附近的某个地方……",
    ["Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards.  If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "洁塞塔经常帮助镇子里的守卫，她是圣光赐予我们的礼物。如果你想学习牧师技能的话，可以去狮王之傲旅店找她。",
    ["Just a few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts. Release it into my custody, soldier. I'll take it from here."] = "再有一些坐骑我们的马厩就满啦。士兵，让我来保管它们吧。我会从这儿牵走一些。",
    ["Just a minor adjustment here... ah there we go!"] = "只需做些小调整……搞定！",
    ["Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?"] = "看看我卖的东西吧，有什么你想要的吗？",
    ["Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve.  Come get yours before they're all gone!"] = "就在……另一批暗月储备物资中。取回属于你自己的那份，它们很快会被抢光的！",
    ["Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the zeppelin tower.  Speak to Zeppelin Master Frezza at the top of the tower."] = "在城市的大门外有一处路标，指向地精塔。去跟塔顶的地精飞艇管理人弗雷萨交谈。",
    ["Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal."] = "山顶渔具店的卡尔·迷雾行者将为你指明如何实现内心平静的同时还能通过钓鱼为自己准备好下一餐。",
    ["Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.$B$BYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.$B$BNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?"] = "你好，$n。你看上去是个强壮的$c——你应该能够在这个地区有所作为。你可以去接触一下你不了解的东西，否则对你的长辈表现出失礼的行为将招致惩罚。$B$B你可以不尊重我或者我的同伴，但是如果你真的那么愚蠢的话，你就必然会学会尊重我们的力量。$B$B现在，闲聊够了，有什么事情我可以帮忙的？",
    ["Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together."] = "卡恩说我们需要聆听熔炉和钢铁的灵魂之声，它们会指引我们的。我只听见一阵铃声。拿起铁锤，让我们一起试着听它们在说什么。",
    ["Keep your voice down, stranger. You do not want to disrupt the Master's meditations."] = "陌生人，把你的声音放小一点。你不是想打扰主人的沉思吧。",
    ["Kelstrum is a loudmouth and a braggart... and if that weren't enough he's also one of the most skilled warriors ye'll ever meet!  I tell ye, if ye're looking to be trained in the ways of a warrior, that's who ye should be talking to.  I'm sure he can be found over in the Hall of Arms east of the Gates of Ironforge."] = "克斯塔姆是个大嗓门、爱吹嘘的人……他也是你所能见到的技艺最为纯熟的战士之一！  我告诉你，如果你想成为一名战士的话，就去找他谈谈吧。他肯定在铁炉堡大门以东的军事区中。",
    ["Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise stands ready to help you get to Warsong Gulch."] = "猎人大厅的克古尔·血斧将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。",
    ["Kildrath tends to overdramatize the situation. For example, 'Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery,' has been stolen over 400 times.$B$BThe mark of the Athenaeum protects the tomes, preventing any unauthorized viewings."] = "基尔达斯总是过分夸大。比如，“迦罗娜：潜行与诡计研究”已经被偷过400多次啦。$B$B雅典娜神庙的标志保护着这本卷轴，防止任何人偷看。",
    ["Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!"] = "看看这些科多兽，我的朋友！它们幼年时便开始接受训练，在莫高雷的金色平原长大，这些家伙就是我们出色的坐骑！看看它们吧，看看我们牛头人为什么会依赖于这些强大的生物！",
    ["Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag."] = "你要找科多兽皮工店是吧。去暗巷区中心吧。",
    ["Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise."] = "如果你想要学习草药学的话，就应该去找克米恩·冰蹄谈谈。他在中部高地那里。",
    ["Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village."] = "克朗·石蹄在村子东南角的训练圈里。",
    ["Krumn is the bull you are looking for. He can be found on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Civic Information."] = "去找克拉姆吧。你可以在中心高地上的雷霆崖咨询处里找到他。",
    ["Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "凯拉·风刃的战斗技能炉火纯青。她可以对你进行训练。到多兰纳尔的旅店中去找她吧。",
    ["Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.$B$BI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.$B$BI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.$B$BI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures.."] = "希尔瓦娜斯女王已经下令对艾泽拉斯的某些自然现象进行调查。她觉得能从艾泽拉斯神秘的历史中学到更多的知识。$B$B我不知道要如何才能学到这些知识，但是我完全相信她，因此我会尽力而为的。所有的生物看起来很相似，但是周围的环境对它们的影响是不容忽略的。$B$B我需要你帮我收集生物样本。",
    ["Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses."] = "我得到的最后的消息称，部落已经收集到$2021w份宁神花、$2050w份火焰花和$2054w份紫莲花，而总的需求量分别是$2020w、$2051w和$2055w。",
    ["Last I heard, Elder Runetotem was traveling to Razor Hill in Durotar."] = "符文图腾长者应该是往杜隆塔尔的剃刀岭去了。",
    ["Last I knew, Elder Starsong was in the Sunken Temple of the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "星歌长者应该是在悲伤沼泽的沉没的神庙中。",
    ["Last I knew, Elder Stonespire was at Everlook in Winterspring."] = "石塔长者眼下应该是在冬泉谷的永望镇。",
    ["Laurena is the High Priestess of Stormwind. You can find her in the Catheral of Light in Cathedral Square."] = "劳瑞娜是暴风城的高阶牧师，你可以在教堂广场上的光明大教堂里找到她。",
    ["Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest."] = "劳尔娜·晨光为居住在多兰纳尔附近的居民们提供医疗服务。或许她能教你如何成为一名牧师。",
    ["Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered."] = "皮革？哦，我刚收到消息。似乎部落已经收集到$2066w块重皮、$2070w块厚皮和$2073w块硬甲皮，而总的需求量分别是$2067w、$2071w和$2074w。",
    ["Leave at once, stranger!  I have no business with you."] = "陌生人，赶快离开！我跟你没有关系。",
    ["Leave it to the dwarves to send a mining specialist from Ironforge to tell us how to mine.  How hard is it to take a pick and chip away at some rock?  Well, since he's here, he's probably the one you should see anyhow.  His name is Gelman and he resides over in the Dwarven District."] = "让矮人从铁炉堡指派一名采矿专家来教教我们吧。使用锄头打碎岩石有多困难？嗯，只要他在这儿，你就只管问他好了。他名叫吉尔曼，居住在矮人区。",
    ["Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace."] = "别管我。我伤得很重，可能会丢掉性命。谢谢你，$n。我将死在这儿，但是因为你……我能在平静中死去。",
    ["Leave this place, stranger, lest it consume you as it has all that it has touched."] = "陌生人，离开这儿吧，免得送命，它会吃掉它接触到的一切东西的。",
    ["Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake.  He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you."] = "李·布朗整天都在水晶湖钓鱼。或许他能给你讲些故事，还能教你一些技巧。",
    ["Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake.  He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago.  If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night."] = "李·布朗在水晶湖中抓到过很多奇怪的东西。他说他数月前钓起过一个神秘的面具。但是照实说，我想他那晚一定在狮王之傲喝多了。",
    ["Let me break down a little math for you: 'goblin' plus 'engineering' equals KNOW HOW, baby.  Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn't know how to add."] = "宝贝，让我来教你一个简单的加法守则：“地精”+“工程学”=“万事通”。告诉你其它算法的家伙肯定数学不及格。",
    ["Let me see, let me see. I had those numbers here somewhere. Ah yes, here they are! To date, the Alliance has collected $2047w stranglekelp, out of $2048w needed. It also says here that we have $2053w of $2055w purple lotus and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed."] = "让我看看，让我看看。我有做过记录的。啊，找到了！到目前为止，联盟已经收集到$2047w份荆棘藻、$2053w份紫莲花和$2057w份阿尔萨斯之泪，而总的需求量分别是$2048w、$2055w和$2058w。",
    ["Let's see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I'll spend the time to teach you!"] = "让我们看看你的能力，好吗？要是你按要求完成任务，我会乐意教你的！",
    ["Let's see... fourteen plus seven, carry the two... oh, yes?"] = "让我看看……14加7，得1进2……是吗？",
    ["Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid."] = "生活是一场竞争，“大难不死必有后福”这句俗语并不是始终正确的。有时伤口愈合得很慢，这就是我们需要绑带的原因。灵魂高地的潘德·缚石能教你急救的技能。",
    ["Life is like a carefully woven tapestry."] = "生活就像一幅小心编织的锦缎。",
    ["Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, $c."] = "与克尔苏加德一样，我也是一个来自肯瑞托议会的法师，更相似的是，我与他都在寻找着埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。我们的命运似乎就这样交织在一起了，$c。",
    ["Like a cat dragged in from the rain, you scratch and claw, then do it all over again... I'll be back for more...$B$BOh, I didn't see you enter, $n! What can I do for you?"] = "像只猫一样在雨里爬行，你抓着刨着，一遍又一遍……稍后继续……$B$B哦，我没看见你进来，$n！我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart."] = "听仔细了，$n，我要传授给你的知识很多。",
    ["Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.$B$BOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can."] = "你要仔细听好了，别轻易相信或怀疑你所听到的一切。因为即使是朋友也可能将自己送上死路，$c。$B$B我们伟大的酋长深知这一点，为了证明部落中有一些术士并不想从内部毁掉部落，或是为了获得权力，我自愿尽我所能帮助年轻的首领。",
    ["Listen to the stories of an elder. $n. I have many to speak of..."] = "听一听长者的故事吧，$n。我有许多话要说……",
    ["Listen to your elders, $n. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control."] = "听你的长辈的话，$n。要是你拥有强大的意志和热情，就没有不能控制的力量。",
    ["Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat."] = "$N，你好。",
    ["Lok'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?"] = "为了部落，$c！奥特兰克山谷需要你。",
    ["Lok'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?"] = "你好，$R。我是部落大使佐格将军。我是来向你通报部落关于安其拉一战的准备工作的进度的。你想知道什么？",
    ["Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.$B$BWe lost a number of friends and family in the those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.$B$BThat's why I've returned."] = "在最后一次大战之前，我父亲经营着北山伐木场。那是他的命根子，他把所有的精力都投到了伐木场。战争爆发时，我们忍痛逃到了暴风城。$B$B那些日子里，我们失去了无数朋友，而我们的伐木场也被血色十字军占领了，我对此感到非常心痛。$B$B这就是我回来的原因。",
    ["Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?"] = "看看四周，$c。你身边的朋友并不多，我想你需要证明自己的价值。嗯，或许我应该同意你帮助我们在阿拉希盆地作战。你愿意吗？",
    ["Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf."] = "看看野兽的智慧和学识吧，你会认清自己的。你要学会像猫头鹰那样敏锐，像猎豹那样聪明，像狼那样强大。",
    ["Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I'm going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I'll need more information. Information I can't get... damn! Think, Laris, think!$B$BWhat are you going to do? What?!$B$BThere has to be a solution!"] = "看看这些样本！这意味着什么？这意味着什么？我需要时间来解读这些信息。我还需要更多我无法获得的信息……该死！好好想想，拉里斯，好好想想！$B$B你要做什么？什么？！$B$B必须得有解决的方法！",
    ["Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.$B$BThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war."] = "看看你身后，$R。虫巢中的异动使我们周围的土地震动起来。$B$B现在是我们实现一千年前许下的诺言的时候了。沙土飞扬，似乎其拉虫人是在计划开战了。",
    ["Look for Faruza.  Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town."] = "去找法鲁萨。我最后一次见到她时，她正站在马厩和西北方向的房间之间。",
    ["Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates."] = "去力量谷寻找旅店老板格雷什卡。她的旅馆主城门以北东侧的地方。",
    ["Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."] = "去中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行以南的建筑物中可以找到旅店老板帕拉。",
    ["Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining."] = "去红石谷矿业工会东北部的荣誉谷找诺格机械店。",
    ["Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog."] = "去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什。注意你的言行，否则塞尤克也许会将你作为喂狗的美食。",
    ["Look for Tarshaw Jaggedscar in the barracks on the east side of town."] = "去城镇东面的兵营找塔绍尔·锯痕。",
    ["Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree."] = "去大树以西的暗巷区中心寻找耶尔玛克药剂店。",
    ["Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength. They'll only let you in if you're an officer! Talk to Sergeant Ba'sha outside otherwise."] = "去力量谷西边的山顶找找看。他们只会让官员进去的！如果你不是官员，可以跟外面的巴沙中士谈谈。",
    ["Look for the Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast."] = "去城外东南方找飞艇降落塔。",
    ["Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon.  The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill."] = "去恐惧之末旅店的主餐厅找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。酒馆就在布瑞尔城的东南角。",
    ["Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest."] = "到闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店去吧。那儿有啤酒和柔软的床铺供你尽情享用，没有比那里更好的休息场所了。",
    ["Look to this fallen dragon, $r. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!"] = "看看这条被干掉的龙的脸，$r。部落的强大是毋庸置疑的！",
    ["Look to this ravaged field and know the power that the elements hold, $r."] = "看看这片被蹂躏的土地，你就知道元素的力量了，$r。",
    ["Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!"] = "仰望天空吧，$C。这片区域已经有一千年没有见过龙族了！我就知道，那些其拉虫人在策划着什么阴谋！",
    ["Lookin' to take a gryphon ride, eh? Dungar keeps his birds up on the rampart in the Trade District. Just remember to hold on tight! "] = "你需要租用一只狮鹫进行飞行，是吗？杜加尔就在贸易区的城墙上，他那里有很多狮鹫，记着飞行的时候要抓紧哦！",
    ["Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh?  In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow."] = "想找迅影兄弟会的申苏尔，是吗？去暗巷区，过了杜佛斯回收店之后就可以找到通往暗影裂口的通道。",
    ["Looking for some training, eh? I could train you better then anyone in Stormwind but the guard prohibits it. I guess you will have to settle for one of those has beens hanging out around the Barracks or at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town."] = "想要接受训练？我可以把你训练成暴风城最好的战士，但是守卫是不能这么做的。我想你得去兵营或者猪和哨声旅店，找些合适的人来对你进行训练。",
    ["Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor."] = "想学习如何使用新武器？去荣誉谷的传说中的装备店中找塞尤克和哈纳什吧。",
    ["Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond."] = "你想知道如何用铁砧和锤子制作东西吗？卡恩·石蹄可以教你这些。他是个铁匠，就在中部高地的水池旁。",
    ["Looking to take a ride on a gryphon, now are ye?  Gryth Thurden is the one ye'll want to be seeing about that.  Ye can find him on the eastern side of The Great Forge in the middle of Ironforge."] = "想要乘坐狮鹫，是吗？你得去找格莱斯·瑟登。  你可以在铁炉堡中心的大锻炉东边找到他。",
    ["Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, $n, those were the days...."] = "要做的事情很多！自从我的兄弟不小心蒸发了诺莫瑞根所有的衣料和皮革之后，事情便多起来了。我只能保持暂时通风！啊，$n，那些日子……",
    ["Lots to do, lots to do! The Union's given us deadlines and they're not the sort you want to miss!"] = "很多事情要做，很多事情要做！协会已经给了我们最后的期限，我们决不能超过这个期限！",
    ["Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship."] = "爱情信物是用来向你中意的某个城中的居民表达爱意的小东西。如果对方也对你感兴趣的话，你就可以收到一份爱情的礼物。$B$B如果你已经和别人相爱了，那么至少对方会给你一份代表友谊的礼物。",
    ["Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting."] = "鲁坎·考迪尔在监狱附近的运河边上有一家小店。我相信他可以教你附魔的技巧。",
    ["Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training.  She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished."] = "要是你想接受训练的话，就去找科瑞恩。她通常在铁匠铺外面等着铁匠打造武器。",
    ["Lysheana can offer you the proper documents, she resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeasten Darnassus.  May your fellowship bring glory to the Night Elves!"] = "琳沙娜能为你提供所需要的文档，她居住在达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区。愿你的伙伴为暗夜精灵带来无比的荣耀吧！",
    ["Made by the finest craftsmen in all of Teldrassil, carried by hand from Kalimdor to Azeroth as a sign of the growing alliance between the people of the Great Tree and the humans of this land. If there is anything you require, you have but to ask."] = "为了增进暗夜精灵和人类的联盟关系，我千里迢迢带来了由泰达希尔最好的工匠制作的东西。我这里的东西应有尽有，请随意挑选。",
    ["Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks."] = "玛加尔的玛加尔布品店在暗巷区里。去科多兽皮工店旁边的大树南边就可以找到他。",
    ["Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake."] = "马卡鲁整天都在荣誉谷的红石谷矿业工会，就在湖边。",
    ["Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment."] = "不借助刀具或是毒药离开这儿就算完成任务。",
    ["Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "不知道玛洛尼是如何采集到那些最为娇嫩的草药的。显然你得向他多多学习。他就住在多兰纳尔的旅店东边。",
    ["Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves."] = "我们可以从死去的动物身上获得原料。别无视它们的牺牲，$n。带着尊敬来处理这些皮革。",
    ["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c."] = "这些都是大地之母走过的道路。愿你的祖先保佑你$c。",
    ["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you."] = "这些道路都是大地之母走过的道路。无论你决定前往何方，愿大地之母与你同在。",
    ["Many have come to this sanctuary, few have left. "] = "许多人来到这个避难所，少数人却离开了。",
    ["Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus."] = "裁缝所需的多数物品都是从达纳苏斯获得的。他们都在那儿工作，这并不是件奇怪的事情。要是你想成为一名裁缝的话，你最好前往达纳苏斯。",
    ["Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears."] = "玛拉顿位于凄凉之地西部中间的长矛谷中。",
    ["Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest."] = "马里恩·考尔和黑暗牧师贝里尔一起在布瑞尔镇东南角恐惧之末旅店楼上的阅览室中。我只是想看看谁是这场对抗的胜利者。",
    ["Mark my words!  You won't find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!"] = "记得我的话！你在东部王国是找不到比塞尔萨玛狮鹫更快的狮鹫的！",
    ["Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n."] = "不可思议。太不可思议了。你给了我们启迪，$n。",
    ["Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him.  I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat.  Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield."] = "奈辛瓦里要出去狩猎。我发现帮助他做丛林狩猎的准备工作比做战争准备的工作轻松多了。尽管我错过了战场上的光辉岁月。",
    ["Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller's Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training."] = "吴平大师几乎懂得人类所知的所有武器的用法。在徒手搏斗中，他的觉醒之拳技能具有致命的攻击力。要是你需要训练的话，就去找他吧，他一般都在维勒武器店等待新武器的运送。",
    ["Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines. "] = "大工匠奥玛里恩某个晚上消失了。就像是风中的柳絮一样……呼地一声就没了！好吧，现在我就是唯一能够为前线的那帮家伙打造装备的人了。",
    ["Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation."] = "官方事宜只能送交达纳苏斯处理。你必须前往那儿去创建自己的公会。",
    ["Mau'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you."] = "玛艾里知道你为什么找她……$B$B带给我你找到的魂精，我就会为你转换它。",
    ["May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine."] = "愿月神与你同在，$c。月亮神殿已经来帮助奥伯丁饱受煎熬的公民了。",
    ["May da spirits protect you mon."] = "愿灵魂保佑你。",
    ["May the Light protect you this day."] = "愿光明保佑你。",
    ["May the blessings of the night be yours, friend!  I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale.  As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."] = "愿夜之祝福永远与你同在，我的朋友！我是艾蒂尔·月火，我是灰谷银翼哨兵部队的军需官。随着你在银翼哨兵中的声望不断提升，我可以为你提供一些可在战歌峡谷中使用的商品。如果你需要修理装备的话，我也可以提供这样的服务。",
    ["May the light guide your path and aid you in your journeys. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here."] = "让圣光保佑你一路平安。如果你需要需要任何帮助，就来找我吧。",
    ["May the light guide your path and aid you in your journies. If you need any assistance browsing, I will be right over here."] = "让圣光保佑你一路平安。如果你需要需要任何帮助，就来找我吧。",
    ["May the spirits be with you."] = "愿灵魂与你同在。",
    ["May your elders bless you, $n, and bring you luck in the coming year."] = "愿你们的长者祝福你，$n，祝你明年万事顺意，心想事成。",
    ["Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day.  Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining."] = "或许有一天萨鲁·钢怒会教你学会制作一把质地精良的斧头。沿着红石谷矿业工会右边的道路，到荣誉谷的“燃烧的铁砧”店里去找他吧。",
    ["Maybe this wasn't the best place for a shop after all..."] = "也许这里不是最好的开店的地方……",
    ["Me versus fifty orcs? I'm no fool, $n. My pappy always told me, 'Discreditin is the better part of a cracker,' or something, and I knew what that meant."] = "我单挑50个兽人？我可不是傻子，$n。我爸爸常说“卑鄙是卑鄙者的通行证”这类的话，我突然之间就明白了那是什么意思。",
    ["Me, train you? Come on--we both know I can't. It's this teaching, you see. My own skills suffer. You want training, go to Doctor Herbert Halsey, a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "要我训练你？别开玩笑了——我们都知道这是不可能的。我可无法胜任。你要是想接受训练的话，就去幽暗城的炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生吧。",
    ["Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally's armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible."] = "肉、兽皮、骨头……好的猎人是不会浪费任何东西的。每块兽皮都有利用价值，也许能用来增强盟友的武器装备。单独来看，我们每个人都很强大，但是团结在一起我们就无敌了。",
    ["Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n."] = "拉文霍德的信使今天早上将这封信交给了我。这是写给你的，$n。",
    ["Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom."] = "和其他所有事物一样，金属应该被平衡的使用。卡恩·石蹄在中部高地的底层的池塘边设立了一处铁匠铺。去寻求他的指引吧。",
    ["Michelle Belle's bedside manner is remarkable!  While she might not be able to teach you that, she surely could teach you some proper First Aid.  She currently resides in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "米歇尔·贝利对病患的态度令人钦佩！她也许无法教你如何对待病人，但是她可以教你一些急救技巧。她现在居住在狮王之傲旅店。",
    ["Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?"] = "这里的天气真不错，你说呢？",
    ["Mmmmm food.  It's not too long of a run, but you need to head north to Orgrimmar and ask one of the grunts there."] = "嗯……食物。旅途并不遥远，你需要朝北走，去奥格瑞玛，问问那儿的守卫。",
    ["Monty be me name an' rats be me game."] = "我名叫蒙提，老鼠是我的玩物。",
    ["Mooranta can help you learn skinning.  She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."] = "莫兰塔可以教你如何剥皮。你可以在中部高地的卡恩铁匠铺旁找到她。",
    ["Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough."] = "说也奇怪，兽栏管理员莫加努斯就在马厩外面。",
    ["Move along, citizen. There is nothing to see here."] = "快点离开，市民。没有什么好看的。",
    ["Ms. Pomeroy gathers herbs for an Alchemist who lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind.  Check for her at his cottage and see if she'll show you the profession."] = "草药师博米洛伊为居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一名炼金师收集草药。去他的住所找草药师博米洛伊，看她是否能对你有所指引。",
    ["My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!"] = "我的数据分析师认为这次我们会比上次的纪录提高二十秒！",
    ["My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time."] = "我很抱歉，$n，但是我不给新手提供培训。你应该找达纳苏斯工匠区的米拉·法拉科纳谈谈。她可以帮你弥补损失的时间。",
    ["My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back."] = "我的斧头经历过多场战事，我喜欢将它带在身边。敌人曾数次入侵我们的首都，但是别怕：我们总能击退他们。",
    ["My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving."] = "我兄弟说我们能在这条商贸路线上赚到更多的钱的，但是他没告诉我要独自应对。要是你乘坐地精飞艇沿着这条路返回的话，你能帮我带点吃的吗？在奥格瑞玛，有人出售最好的肉类，当然我还能以那些苟延残喘的动物为食的。",
    ["My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.$B$BThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured."] = "我被抓之后遭受了非人的虐待，$N。他们轮番拷打我和基利斯中尉，而且在虐待一方的同时让另外一个在旁边看着。我们不断被折磨，直到有一天基利斯告诉把战友们的遭遇告诉了我，还有他的拯救计划。$B$B他们所遭受的痛苦比我和基利斯所遭受的还要多，他们真的是生不如死。",
    ["My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen."] = "我和我的同伴正在收集我们所知的致命物质，并在敌人身上测试它们的效果。一旦我收集齐备，我将制造出这世界前所未有的瘟疫。",
    ["My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you."] = "你的教育正在继续，而你的知识已超越了我。如果你还想继续学习你就必须找迈里恩谈谈。她会指引你的。",
    ["My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."] = "我的家人过去在北山伐木场工作，那里现在被称作西瘟疫之地。他们曾忠于杜马家族，而现在血色十字军把一切连同壁炉谷全都占领了！$B$B在把那些狂热分子从艾泽拉斯驱逐出去之前，我是不会停止行动的。",
    ["My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;."] = "我父亲告诉我：有一天，会有一个陌生人跟我交谈，我必须控制住自己，不能杀了$g他:她;。",
    ["My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.$B$BI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?"] = "我父亲被大熔炉中的恶棍杀害了。我恳求暴风城给予援助，但是他们根本没有理睬。不仅如此，他们甚至不愿意承认这个地区的存在，更不要说派遣军队来匡扶正义了。$B$B我要报仇，$c。这世界上还有比这更强烈的理由吗？",
    ["My job title is Waste Management Specialist."] = "我的头衔是废物管理专家。",
    ["My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready."] = "我的知识有限，尽管我还在继续学习。现在该你继续了，旅行者。在幽暗城找到乔瑟夫·格里高利并告诉他你准备好了。",
    ["My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world's history."] = "我对暗夜精灵的了解有限，但是据说很早以前——当暗夜精灵还掌握着神秘法术时——艾萨拉便是其中的佼佼者，她年轻美貌，是暗夜精灵的女王。不幸地是，正是她对魔法的痴迷才导致历史上最具破坏性事件的发生。",
    ["My money's on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!"] = "我已经把钱压在地精身上了！如果你够聪明的话也应该赌地精获胜！",
    ["My mouth waters just to think on it.  Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."] = "只是想想那美味，我就已经垂涎三尺了。派尔·沉默行者是血蹄村最好的厨师。你可以在村子西北角的大营帐里找到他。",
    ["My question to you is this, $c:$BWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?"] = "我想问你，$c：$B在泰坦创造的守护巨龙中，是谁后来变成了被称作死亡之翼的邪恶生物？",
    ["My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction."] = "我制造药剂的技能在你之下。你应该与那边的安尼希尔谈谈。她会明白你需要进一步的培训。",
    ["My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!"] = "我那两岁的儿子设计的赛车都比那些可笑的地精造出来的破烂跑得更快！",
    ["My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.$B$BAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r."] = "当我以叛国罪被放逐离开联盟过着流放的生活时，我的儿子泰兰还是个小孩。我呆在这儿就是为了看着他长大，让他成为一个可敬的人。$B$B正如我期望的那样，他接替我的位置，成为玛登霍尔德之王，但是命运是如此残酷，他加入了血色十字军的队伍。现在他成了十字军的高级统领，$r。",
    ["My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead."] = "对你来说，我的教学在这个阶段略显深奥了。要是你想学习有关药水的更多知识，就跟泰兰希尔谈谈。",
    ["My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air."] = "我的双足飞龙可以在贫瘠之地高速飞翔。",
    ["My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?"] = "我的智慧就是你的智慧，我的知识也一样。我能为你做什么，$n？",
    ["Mystical goods and commodities is my business, stranger."] = "我出售各种神秘的货物，陌生人。",
    ["Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you."] = "纳迪娅在数年的实践中掌握了制皮技术。沿着通往达纳苏斯的道路向西走，去拜访她，或许她能传授给你一些知识呢。",
    ["Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!$B$BLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council."] = "天真的傻子。火刃就是暗影议会！议会拥有许多信徒和组织，但是他们都服从于议会的意愿。我或许能领导火刃，但是我无非是议会手下的一名爪牙，就像你是我的爪牙一样！$B$B看看燃刃吧——他们中的大多数人认为自己会成为下一批极具潜力的术士，并成功替代暗影议会。",
    ["Nana always said there was no greater thing in the whole world than a warm, toasty slice of fresh, homemeade cherry pie."] = "奶奶总是说世界上没有比一块自制的、鲜美的樱桃馅饼更好的东西了。",
    ["Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!"] = "纳瑞安为您效劳！退隐的工程学专家和占卜大师！我敢打包票！",
    ["Naralex sleeps again!$b$bLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.$b$bNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.$b$bOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual."] = "纳拉雷克斯又陷入了沉睡！$b$b很久以前，纳拉雷克斯曾满怀着进入翡翠梦境、让贫瘠之地重新变成茂密森林的伟大理想而来到了这处洞穴中。但他的执着却逐渐消退了，而他的思想也被脑海蜿蜒的影象所侵染。$b$b现在，那些奇怪的爬虫正从他的梦境中爬到这片土地上来，我们必须把他从梦魇中唤醒过来，否则他就将永远失落于其中，并继续给这片大地带来邪恶的力量！$b$b不过，只有杀死他那些堕落的仆人——毒牙之王，我才能开始进行唤醒仪式。",
    ["Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise."] = "自然会提供我们所需的一切。跟中部高地中层克米恩·冰蹄谈谈草药学吧。",
    ["Need some supplies?"] = "需要物资供给吗？",
    ["Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience."] = "缝纫需要娴熟的手法，以及……也是最重要的，耐性。",
    ["Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.$B$BLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates."] = "你和我都无法想象当他们的灵魂被强行从躯体中剥离出来的时候有多么痛苦。他们没有死，但是他们也不是活着的。他们成为了一具具行尸，只会听从主人发号施令。$B$B干出这些惨绝人寰的事情的就是这里的恶魔首领拉瑟莱克，他把我的战友都变成了奴隶。其中的九个被他绑定在黑暗之门附近，其余的九个则被他的爪牙们瓜分。",
    ["New this year: the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.  Step on up and don't be shy!$B$BAnd sign these forms before you try it, we're still working a few bugs out of this thing..."] = "本年度新品：X-5000型欢乐制造器。请上前来尝试一下！不要害羞！$B$B在尝试之前请填写这些表格，我们还在修正这台机器的某些问题……",
    ["Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons..."] = "很好！无论其他人怎么说，我想我对你的看法是正确的。哈哈！我是开玩笑的！好吧，开始上课……",
    ["Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care."] = "能看到一张友善的脸真不错。我没有跟药剂师乔汉聊过很多，除非他想要什么东西。他离开坟墓太久了。有一天我也会像他一样，我听说。真可怕。或许到那时我就不在乎了。",
    ["Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! "] = "很好的尝试，但是在训练之前，你还需要进行更多的锻炼！回到战壕！",
    ["No better place to learn First Aid than under the watchful eye of Shaina Fuller at the Cathedral of Light.  To get there, just look for the yellow rooftops, or the towering spire of the Cathedral itself which you can see from almost anywhere in the city."] = "要学急救的话，没有比光明大教堂的珊娜·弗勒更好的老师了。  去找她吧，去有黄色屋顶的房子就是教堂样式的房子，在那儿顶上你能俯瞰整个城市。",
    ["No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion.$B$B<Nathanos sighs.>$B$BI've sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don't see why it will be any different this time.$B$BMine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids."] = "毫无疑问，你是黑暗女王派来接受训练的又一个无能的白痴。$B$B<纳萨诺斯叹息着。>$B$B我每次都得把你们的尸体运回去给她，我想这次也不会有什么例外。$B$B但是，我并不会问什么，我只按照黑暗女王的吩咐办事。",
    ["No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know."] = "活到老，学到老。",
    ["No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries.There are four types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Elementals, Portals and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket."] = "没有人知道谁制作了暗月卡片，或者他们真正的意图是什么，但是我可以告诉你，在艾泽拉斯各地都可以找到它们，那些试图揭开它秘密的邪恶怪物手中都可能有卡片。  一共有四种类型的暗月卡片；野兽，元素，入口和督军，每种有8张卡片。如果你收集了所有8张一套的卡片，那么你可以把它们交给我们的萨杜斯·帕雷教授，兑换一件强大的饰品。",
    ["No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!"] = "没有人能够从这里偷走东西。从来没有人……从来！",
    ["No other race on Azeroth has suffered as much as our people, $c. To laugh in the face of death has become second nature for all of us."] = "艾泽拉斯中没有哪一个种族经历过我们的人民所受的磨难，$c。面对死亡仍安之若素已经成为我们的第二天性了。",
    ["No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. "] = "我们没有浪费狩猎而得的动物的任何一部分。",
    ["No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!"] = "没有啊，不过许多其他人都在寻找爱情。你应该从我这里买些爱情信物，洒上一些香水，然后勇敢地出击！",
    ["No, no, you'll need FAR more training before you're ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He's the one buried in books over there."] = "不，不，在你准备好跟我学习之前你还需要很多训练！去跟那个保守的业余人士玛考布·维恩谈谈。他就是那个埋在书里的人。",
    ["No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.$B$BEvery time I've encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample."] = "不，我并不清楚。似乎那主要与地域有关。有些种类称为泥浆怪，有些称为泥浆怪。似乎这属于个人偏好。$B$B每次我遇到软泥怪、淤泥怪或泥浆怪时，它们从根本上都是一种生物。不同之处在于它们的环境，这也是我们需要一份纯净的样本的原因。",
    ["No... you can't sit on my lap."] = "不……你不能坐在我的膝盖上，$g伙计:女士;。",
    ["None are as skilled in the use of weapons as Ansekhwa.  It is said that he is guided by the spirits of the finest warriors of our honored ancestors.  Seek him out on the lower rise and he will teach you what you want to know."] = "在武器使用方面，没有人能胜过安塞瓦了。据说他接受过我们尊敬的祖先，最伟大的战士的灵魂的指导。去中部高地的底层寻找他，他会教你的。",
    ["Nope, can't help you, I'm afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's amazing!"] = "不，恐怕我不能帮你。你的技能远胜于我！如果你想学习更多的知识，跟达纳苏斯工匠区的暗夜精灵泰龙尼斯谈谈。他拥有令人惊异的技能！",
    ["Nope, don't think there are any Enchanters here in Elwynn Forest.  There's a guy named Lucan who runs a shop up in Stormwind though.  You could check with him and see if he will train you."] = "不，我不认为在艾尔文森林中有附魔师。但是，在暴风城中有个名叫鲁坎的家伙，他开了一家商店。你可以去找他，看他是否能训练你。",
    ["Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh.  Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town."] = "不，在丹莫罗是没有炼金师的。你最好去铁炉堡……去工匠区找侏儒。",
    ["Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here.  I think ye'll have better luck in Ironforge though."] = "不，这儿没人能教你草药学。你最好去铁炉堡碰碰运气。",
    ["Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, $n. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves."] = "并不是所有的被遗忘者都屈从于希尔瓦娜斯的意志，$N。我们中的某些人士被真正的力量驱动的--我们为自己赢得的力量。",
    ["Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things..."] = "对一个初学者来说还不坏！我猜给你看些东西也不会对我有什么损失……",
    ["Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin..."] = "还行……训练你是不成问题的。很好！我们开始吧……",
    ["Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity."] = "对一个业余者来说……这还行！你的知识量已经跟我持平了。要是你想学习更多知识，就去幽暗城找乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。",
    ["Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton's ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake."] = "这周围可不是钓鱼的好地方，但是你应该去找帕克斯顿问问看。他在涌冰湖钓鱼。",
    ["Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I'll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that's not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you've been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I'll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale."] = "现在还不行，$g小伙子:姑娘;……我是不会把强大的战羊随意卖给其他人的，你必须首先证明自己是铁炉堡矮人的忠实盟友才行。一旦我确认你在铁炉堡有着显赫的地位，那我会很乐意让你看看我出售的多种战羊的。",
    ["Not too clever are you?  Hmm, if I were a stable master perhaps I might be in the vicinity of say, the stable?  Look for Morganus over there."] = "你不算太聪明吧？嗯，如果我是兽栏管理员的话，我应该是在马厩附近吧？去那边找莫加努斯吧。",
    ["Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky.  There is such a place in our great tribal center Thunder Bluff.  The road north out of Bloodhoof Village will guide you there.  Once you ride the elevator to the top speak with one of the Bluffwatchers who can give you further directions."] = "只有在天空自由翱翔时，灵魂才能得到真正的解脱。在我们伟大的部落中心雷霆崖就有这样一块地方。血蹄村外以北的道路就通往那儿。一旦你乘坐电梯到达高处，就找雷霆崖守卫谈谈，他会做出进一步的指引。",
    ["Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. Oh, and don't believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either."] = "没有什么能比在水晶湖钓一天的鱼更惬意的事情了。阿诺德·利兰教我学会了钓鱼。你可以在运河区的码头找到他。  哦，不要相信他告诉你的任何关于运河里有怪物之类的故事。",
    ["Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you.  You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection.  She's at a small camp there not too far along the road."] = "接近尸体时的感觉是独一无二的。你可以沿着城镇外东南方面的道路前进，到达十字路口后向东走，找到舍伦尼·洛巴尔特。她居住在离道路不远处的小营帐中。",
    ["Notify me when you are ready to listen to the story."] = "当你准备听我讲述故事的时候就告诉我。",
    ["Now if I were Innkeeper Renee where might I be?  Hmmm?  Oh, perhaps inside the Gallows' End Tavern.  Yes, that's it, I'm sure of it.  Try the southeast end of Brill... think you can find that?"] = "如果我是旅店老板瑞尼的话，我可能在哪儿？嗯？哦，也许在恐惧之末旅店中。是的，是那儿，我敢肯定。试着去布瑞尔的东南角……你认为自己能找到他吗？",
    ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."] = "新的一年来临了，月光洒满大地。$B$B这是属于我们的日子……远古的生命苏醒了。",
    ["Now that the war is in full swing, we've had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.$B$BIf only we could keep them off of each other's throats..."] = "战争犹如箭在弦上，蓄势待发；部落和联盟都有着无数强大的勇士。$B$B但愿他们不会互相争斗……",
    ["Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye."] = "这确实是一件上好的护甲，它给我留下了深刻的印象。我只知道谁可以打造出同样品质的护甲，他叫格鲁努斯·削钢，就在铁炉堡的大煅炉那里。我相信那位锻造大师一定可以教你不少东西。",
    ["Now why would ye be needing the services of one of those types?  We get enough trouble out of that rogue, Hulfdan Blackbeard, over in The Forlorn Cavern, do I need to be turning my eye to you as well?"] = "为什么我们需要这样的服务？荒弃的洞穴的潜行者霍夫丹·黑须已经给我们惹了一大堆麻烦，我是不是还要留意你一下？",
    ["Now, answer me this, $n:$BWhich creature became the Lich King before spreading the plague across Lordaeron?"] = "不，回答我，$N：$B在洛丹伦瘟疫爆发之前，是谁变成了巫妖王？",
    ["Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town."] = "当人们进入城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店时，妮拉会向这些未来的顾客致敬。",
    ["Och!  Now that's a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don't see often.  Why don't ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?"] = "哦！这是一项极有价值的技能。托格努斯以你从未见过的方式敲击铁砧。为什么你不去跟他谈谈，看看他能教你什么？",
    ["Och!  Now ye're talkin'!  I bet Granis Swiftaxe could show ye a thing or two about swinging steel.  He's over in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos at the moment."] = "哦！这可是你说的！我敢打赌格兰尼斯·快斧会向你展示如何挥动武器的。他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。",
    ["Och!  That Daryl Riknussun is a brilliant cook!  He makes a chilli so hot ye could temper steel with it!  I don't think he'll teach ye the recipe, but he'll certainly help ye to become a good cook.  Ye'll find him at the Bronze Kettle o'er on the northeastern side of The Great Forge."] = "哦！达瑞尔·瑞克努索是个技艺高超的厨师！他的红辣椒如此辛辣，几乎可以锻造钢铁了！我想他不会将菜谱传给你的，但是他肯定能帮助你成为一名好厨师。你可以在大熔炉东北角的铜壶铁罐那找到他。",
    ["Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn't spill a drop, but now I can't drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  You be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He'll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge."] = "哦！$g小伙子:姑娘;，当你选择附魔时，你得非常小心。我让自己的杯子附魔，使杯中的水不洒出一滴，但是我也不能喝到里面的水了！这真是个悲剧。  当你看到格瑞姆比时，必须记得我的叮嘱。他在大熔炉狮鹫管理人右边的商店中。",
    ["Och! Ye seek training in the way of the warrior, do ye?  Kelstrum Stonebreaker will put ye through yer paces!  Just march yerself over to the Hall of Arms east of the gates of Ironforge. "] = "哦！你想接受战士的训练，是吗？克斯塔姆·碎石会帮你实现梦想的！去铁炉堡东门的武器大厅吧。",
    ["Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!"] = "哦，我不能教给你什么，$n。跟塔雷·浆泡谈谈。她几乎够不着桌子，但是当她在配制药水时，你得看仔细了！",
    ["Och... a paladin?  Well $glad : lass;, ye're in luck!  Azar Stronghammer is back from training and is currently staying at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos."] = "哦……一个圣骑士？嗯，$g小伙子:姑娘;，你真走运！阿扎尔·战锤刚结束训练，他现在在卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂。",
    ["Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?"] = "达纳苏斯有无数令人惊异的地方，你想去哪儿？",
    ["Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip."] = "氦弹点火和爆炸的过程是没有危险的。跟船只相比，这宝贝能更为快速安全地将你送达幽暗城，途中的景色真是惊心动魄。说到这，在地精飞艇上是不允许吸烟的，旅途中也不允许使用火的法术。",
    ["Of the $1998w copper bars that we'll need, we have $2018w. The number for tin bar collections sits at $2005w out of $2006w needed. And, there have been $2008w of $2009w mithril bars smelted for the cause."] = "我们已经收集到$2018w块铜锭、$2005w块锡锭和$2008w块秘银锭，而总的需求量是$1998w、$2006w和$2009w。",
    ["Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat $g sonny:missy;.$B$BI'm sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I'll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty."] = "哦，就是这样了……先找个椅子，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。$B$B我肯定鲁特加尔已经告诉你一些事情了，因此我将省略一些细节，让你直奔主题。",
    ["Oh dear, I am running dangerously low on supplies! What is taking that blasted goblin so long?"] = "唉，我现在的补给品储量已经非常少了！是什么耽搁了那个该死的地精那么长时间？",
    ["Oh hi! My name's Sarah. What can I do for you?"] = "哦你好！我的名字是萨拉。我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire.$B$BLucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak. "] = "啊，真是太可怕了，$g先生:小姐;。巴罗夫家族从前充满生机……充满活力。这个庄园是巴罗夫家族主要的住所。$B$B卢森和我注意到随着时间的流逝，巴罗夫家族变得低沉而沮丧。偏执妄想和暴怒笼罩着主人和小姐。在夜里，我们可以听到巴罗夫夫妇在卧房里争吵。根据我们了解，他们的贪婪毁了他们，可以这么说。",
    ["Oh that's simple! You use it like anything else you might activate. Don't worry, I'll take care of lighting the fuse. Once you're up in the air you'll notice that you'll seem to 'float,' but that won't last forever. What you're aiming for is a target on the lake way over yonder. Make sure that you begin your descent by detaching your 'wings' at the right time to land in the water, or, well, I don't sell life insurance."] = "嗯，很简单的！这东西的使用方法和你以前用过的那些东西没什么两样。别担心，我会负责点火，当你升空之后，你会发现自己正“飘浮”在空中，但是这种情况不会持续很久。你将被发射到湖边的一个目标那里去，只要记得在适当的时候下落，就可以安全地掉入湖中了！不然的话，嗯，我不负责出售人身保险。",
    ["Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.$B$BAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments."] = "哦，年轻的主人制造的这一系列事件和慌乱。可以想象，世界的命运就掌控在他手中。只有人类才会对世界产生这种扭曲的看法。$B$B唉，他将奥术的秘密都告诉了我……圣契之类的无用之物。这种东西对我来说是一无是处，但是或许你对它们感兴趣。",
    ["Oh the horror! The tragedy! We are on the verge of a breakthrough, yet all could be lost."] = "哦，真恐怖！这是个悲剧！我们就要突破啦，但也有可能遭遇全军覆灭的惨剧。",
    ["Oh, a fellow Physician. I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys."] = "哦，一个医师。我愿意传授给你一些能够在你旅途中对你有所帮助的东西。",
    ["Oh, a priest is it?  Well good ol' Maxan is sure to be found having a drink in the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need a bit of training."] = "哦，是牧师吗？要是你想接受训练的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找马克萨恩吧，他一定在那儿喝酒呢。",
    ["Oh, hello there!  I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!"] = "哦，你好！我是霍莱伊，马绍尔探险队的首席科学家和生物学家。我的兄弟和我，还有我们的同伴，一起到艾泽拉斯去探索荒野和未被驯化的雄伟景象。真是太激动人心了……但是，嗯……我想这次我们陷入了太多激动中了！",
    ["Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then."] = "嗯，如果我能用树枝做掩护的话，那些守卫是看不见我的。",
    ["Oh, looking for some arcane enlightenment are you? No place better then then Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter."] = "哦，你正在学习魔法？那没有什么地方会比法师区的巫师圣殿更好了。",
    ["Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long..."] = "哦，谢谢你！我已经深陷恶梦多时了……",
    ["Oh, the ever-present obsession with material wealth.  Well, fortune smiles on you, as you can find the auction house in the Tradesman's Terrace."] = "哦，沉迷于物质财富，这很常见呢。呃，去贸易区的拍卖行吧，财富在对你微笑。",
    ["Oh, the tram, the tram...  everyone wants to ride the tram.  What happened to the good ol' days of flying on the back of a gryphon, gripping the saddle for dear life as you flew up high in the sky above?  Bah!  You go take the tram then... it's over in Tinker Town with the rest of the gnomish contraptions."] = "哦，地铁，地铁……每个人都想乘坐地铁。那些乘坐狮鹫的好时光，那种在高空中飞翔时紧握缰绳的情景，它们到哪儿去了？  啊！你还是坐地铁去吧……地铁就在侏儒区，那儿还有侏儒的其他精妙设计呢。",
    ["Oh, ye want to learn to pick some daisies do ye?  Ha!  I'm just teasing ye $gladdie : lass;.  A fine profession it is, and Reyna Stonebranch can show ye how it's done.  She works at the Ironforge Physician on the southern side of The Great Forge."] = "哦，你想学习采摘雏菊是吧？哈哈！我只是开个玩笑，$g小伙子:姑娘;。  这是个很好的职业，雷纳·石枝会教你的。她在大熔炉南边的 铁炉堡医师协会工作。",
    ["Oh, you mean Johnson?  I heard he's in hiding."] = "哦，你说的是约翰森？我听说他躲起来了。",
    ["Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House.  It's not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind."] = "哦，你一定是说暴风城会计室。走进城门之后，它就在贸易区的西南部。",
    ["Oh, you're looking for Springspindle Fizzlegear then.  Why that little gnome and his gadgets...  Let me tell you, if you're going to his shop in Tinker Town, keep your hands to yourself and don't pet any of his mechanical sheep!  Exploding sheep... now why would you even make such a thing!?"] = "哦，你是在找宾斯匹德吧。为什么那个小侏儒和他的装备……让我告诉你吧，如果你想去他在侏儒区的商店，管好你的手，别去抚摸他的机械绵羊！  爆炸绵羊……为什么你要做这样的事情！？",
    ["Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!"] = "哦，你还有很多东西要学。我会教给你我所学的全部知识，但是我自己也在学习！你为什么不找铁炉堡的特里克希谈谈，她会帮你进修的！",
    ["Oh... one of those types.  Well, Maximillian is the only one around here that knows about the dark arts.  You can probably find him in the dark of the Lion's Pride Inn basement."] = "哦……好吧，玛克西米利安是这附近唯一一个了解黑暗魔法的人。你也许可以在狮王之傲旅店那阴暗的地下室里找到他。",
    ["Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated  your competence though, we may now begin!"] = "好吧，嗯……别骄傲！既然你已经证明了自己的能力，我们可以开始了！",
    ["Old Town is where you should go if you want to find rogues. It's in the northeast corner of Stormwind."] = "如果你要找潜行者的话，就应该去旧城区。它坐落在暴风城的东北角。",
    ["Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...$B$BUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken."] = "年兽沉睡在月神湖底的深处，但你可以在湖东南岸，也就是靠近怒风兽穴的地方召唤它。你可以在那里找到特殊的烟花束发射器……$B$B在发射器那里使用你的烟花，年兽的爪牙就会出现。发射更多的烟花，大约三十组，或者朝它的爪牙投掷艾露恩的蜡烛，年兽就会醒来。",
    ["On behalf of the Royal Apothecary Society, I am pleased to offer you the finest steeds available for the Forsaken.  These beasts have endured trials and tribulations as we all have, and now they too have emerged stronger and more resilient than mere mortal flesh would have had them destined to be!  Please, inspect them for yourself and see."] = "很高兴我能代表皇家药剂师学会为你提供最好的战马。这些战马与我们一样经历过考验和磨难，现在它们已经远胜于那些血肉之躯所铸成的战马了，它们更为强壮，更易恢复精力！好好看看它们吧。",
    ["On the cooked goods front it would appear that we've managed to collect and store away $2092w rainbow fin albacore, out of $2093w requested. Additionally, right now we have in $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail in cold storage."] = "我们已经收集到了$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。",
    ["On the east side of Razor Hill, behind the barracks is where you will find Dhugru Gorelust."] = "你能在剃刀岭东面的兵营后找到杜格鲁·血怒。",
    ["On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Menethil Harbor on Khaz Modan.  Safe journeys to you!"] = "你可以在北边的码头搭船前往鲁瑟兰村和达纳苏斯。南边的码头是穿越无尽之海通往米奈希尔港的航线。祝你一路平安！",
    ["Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world."] = "从前我欢迎过黑暗，因为它是夜晚的姐妹。现在总是漆黑一片，甚至在白天也是这样，而森林迫切需要给养。除非我们快些行动，否则这扩散的瘟疫就会遍布整个世界。",
    ["Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts."] = "上层暗夜精灵曾经统治这座城池，他们在此演练威力强大的奥术。现在他们受到诅咒，灵魂在这片土地上游荡，恶鞭军官纳迦侵占了精灵的城市。纳迦一定在废墟中搜寻那些上层精灵的神器。",
    ["Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be whisked away to lovely Gadgetzan!    Nearly everyone who has used the device has arrived on the pad here looking just the way they did when they began!There have been some reported problems with transportees being replaced by their evil selves from an alternate universe, but I'm sure we will have that worked out soon..."] = "一旦你建造了这个装置，你就将被传送到可爱的加基森！几乎使用这个装置的人都发现在其立即到达了这里！$B$B有报告说，有别人试图用一种坏的版本来替换我们的产品，但是我相信我们不久之后就可以解决这个问题……",
    ["Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately."] = "这是真的，我曾经是人类。缺点是可能转换为我们的优势的，$n，因为我对人类的劣势了如指掌。",
    ["One has opened up on the Tradesman's Terrace.  If you take the path leading Southeast from the bank, it should be easy to find."] = "贸易区刚刚开放了一座拍卖行。如果你沿着银行东南方的路走，很容易就能找到贸易区。",
    ["One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was."] = "有个人类手中有能打开这个装置的钥匙。我想他的名字叫埃斯顿。",
    ["Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won't tell ya about.  Why don't ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya."] = "这附近只有几处地方可以钓鱼。帕克斯顿对此了如指掌，但是他不一定都会告诉你。为什么不去涌冰湖找他谈谈呢？",
    ["Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall."] = "现在，只有著名的格里高利·维克托医生能提高你的技能啦。你可以在阿拉希高地的落锤镇找到他。",
    ["Oooh, an Inn is it?  Well, ye just can't beat the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Rest if ye must, but be sure to have an ale or two while ye're there."] = "哦，旅店是吗？嗯，雷酒酿制厂是最棒的。你可以在那里稍事休息，但是你一定得尝尝那儿的啤酒。",
    ["Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin."] = "开阔你的视野，流浪者，我们马上开始。",
    ["Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise.  You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill."] = "我们的炼金师名叫卡罗莱·安尼斯。她居住在布瑞尔镇西北角的房屋中。",
    ["Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers.  Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?"] = "我们的祖先教诲说，集体的力量胜过个人的力量。你想要加入公会为了雷霆崖的荣誉而战吗？",
    ["Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments..."] = "我们的大篷车队会往前线运送物资，每天两次。要是不能帮助负责运送的迪迪尔和他的骡子清理掉路上骚扰的天灾士兵的话，我就得挨罚了。那可是我所见过的最疯狂的事。看来我们得像英雄那样冒险保护货物了。",
    ["Our fate is the doom of all who face the Great Fire."] = "挑战火焰之王的下场就是我们现在的样子。",
    ["Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them."] = "我们在奥特兰克山谷的军队需要运用谋略获胜，$c。你看起来是个不错的领导者。",
    ["Our freedom would have meant nothing if C'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy."] = "如果克苏恩还活着的话，我们的自由将变得没有意义。你真是个预言中的勇士。",
    ["Our leader, Doom'rel, has ears for the challenge."] = "去找我们的领袖杜姆雷尔发出挑战吧。",
    ["Our master Malfurion remains lost in the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."] = "我们的主人玛法里奥还在沉睡中，$c。他是我们的指路明灯，我们必须竭尽全力保护他。",
    ["Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city."] = "$n，阿拉希盆地急需增援。在这危急时刻，正是获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。我恳求你去城中寻找阿拉希盆地的军官。",
    ["Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.$B$BAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!$B$BHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!"] = "我们新近发现，马戏团中随处可见的蒸汽车控制台能操纵这些被称为蒸汽车的迷你坦克，我可是很慷慨地跟你分享这一信息。$B$B你只需激活控制台就行了。每辆坦克都配备了常用的弹药和某种秘密武器，向你的敌人开火吧！$B$B和朋友一起参加史诗般的战斗、巡逻、或者仅仅是进行野蛮的破坏……一切都由你自己选择！",
    ["Our punishment is also our blessing."] = "我们的惩罚也是我们的祝福。",
    ["Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.$B$BYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need."] = "目前我们对其拉战争的节节胜利可以说是全卡利姆多大陆各个种族共同努力的结果。$B$B但除了士兵之外，我们还需要更多的东西来支撑这场战争，$n。许多商贩和工匠其实都是这场战争中的无名英雄，正是他们一直源源不断地将物资送到前线。",
    ["Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession."] = "水晶湖边居住着一位名叫艾德勒·费欧德的女士。她利用从当地剥皮师海伦尼那儿得来的皮革为当地的守卫制作补丁。如果你想要学习这项专业技能，她也许就是你要找的人。",
    ["Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand.  He'll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for."] = "你可以在武器大厅找到我们的常驻马厩管理人乌布雷克·火拳。他将替你喂养和照料宠物。",
    ["Pay me and I'll talk...$B$BOh hey, it's you, $n! Nevermind about that..."] = "付钱给我，我就说……$B$B哦，是你，$n！别介意……",
    ["Perhaps I should tell you why I am here.$B$BDo you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?"] = "或许我应该告诉你为什么我会在这儿。$B$B你知道死亡之翼或者他的后裔，奈法利安和奥妮克希亚吗？",
    ["Perhaps one day, your contributions to the Alliance will be as great as the heroes you have seen this day. Honor them, $n."] = "或许有一天，你对联盟的贡献会跟你今日所见的英雄一样伟大。尊重英雄吧，$n。",
    ["Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY."] = "也许你应该对着这些套在我愤怒的拳头上的扩音器讲话。",
    ["Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja'my in front of the inn."] = "要照料宠物吗？你得确保它的清洁！去旅馆前面找苏亚米吧。",
    ["Please, help me $g brother : sister;...$B$BI will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass.  The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release.  I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life."] = "我的$g兄弟:姐妹;帮帮我吧……$B$B我很快就将离开这个世界了，虽然我饱受苦楚，但是我知道死了之后所有痛苦都将解除。但是，那些野生生物，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;……也历经折磨，永无止境。在我生命的最后一刻，我请求你的帮助。",
    ["Please, leave an old spirit in peace."] = "请不要打扰古老的灵魂。",
    ["Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?"] = "去结交朋友吧。我能帮你吗？",
    ["Plenty of good mining to be had in Durotar, or so I hear.  So good in fact that we have a Mining Trainer right here in Razor Hill.  You'll find Krunn next to the heated forge in the northwest corner of town."] = "我听说杜隆塔尔的采矿业极为发达。我们在剃刀岭有一个采矿训练师，你可以去城镇西北角的大熔炉附近寻找克鲁恩。",
    ["Plucky doesn't want Tirth to know he's still in the Shimmering Flats, so he turned himself into a chicken!$B$BIf you find Plucky, beckon him to you.  Maybe he'll come out of hiding."] = "约翰森不想让提尔斯知道他还在闪光平原，所以他把自己变成了一只小鸡！$B$B如果你找到约翰森，就冲他招招手。没准他会跑过来的。",
    ["Plucky?  I heard race master Kronkrider up on the the tower knows where he is."] = "胆大的约翰森？我听说塔顶的赛场主管科鲁克莱德知道他在哪儿。",
    ["Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag."] = "如果耶尔玛克认为你有能耐的话，他会教你配制药水的。去暗巷区中心的商店找他吧。",
    ["Praise Elune! It has been many years since I have had visitors."] = "赞美艾露恩！好些年都没有人来拜访我了。",
    ["Praise the Light, one has finally answered the calling."] = "赞美圣光，终于有人对召唤做出了回应。",
    ["Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh."] = "艾格文的唯一子嗣，最后一任提瑞斯法的守护者……麦迪文。",
    ["Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need."] = "$g小伙子:姑娘;，努力吧。苦干和决心——那就是成功之道！书本知识是远远不够的。",
    ["Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. "] = "种族并不代表荣誉，$r。只要你呆在我的农场，就请你记住并尊重这个信条。$B$B我知道有些兽人，他们像最高贵的骑士那样可敬；我还知道有些人类，他们像最残忍的亡灵天灾那样邪恶。$B$B但是我不会拿我少年时的故事来烦你的！要做的事情还很多——如果那是你所期望的。",
    ["Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar."] = "怒焰裂谷位于奥格瑞玛中心的暗影裂口。",
    ["Ragnaros will reign supreme!"] = "拉格纳罗斯将拥有至高无上的统治权！",
    ["Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like.  You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill.  Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection."] = "兰德·洛巴尔特对制皮这样的技能相当精通。你可以在往布瑞尔东南角沿途的某个营帐中找到他。沿着城镇东南方的道路走，然后在十字路口向东转。",
    ["Randal's a bit of a dandy, but he's dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can't blame them for wanting a bit of adventure."] = "兰达尔打扮得有些像花花公子，但是他是个可靠的人，他比我向许多学生所说的那样更加值得信赖。尽管如此，我还是不能责备他们想要冒险的想法。",
    ["Ravenholdt Manor does not recognize you, $c."] = "你并未得到拉文霍德公爵的认可，$c。",
    ["Razorfen Downs can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the east side of the road."] = "剃刀高地位于贫瘠之地最南端的大路东边。",
    ["Razorfen Kraul can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the west side of the road."] = "剃刀沼泽位于贫瘠之地最南端的大路西边。",
    ["Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right."] = "准备好接受下一次训练了吗？好吧。首先，你得放松。随意搅动药水就可以了。",
    ["Ready for training? Then try to keep up, $n. We've got a lot of ground to cover."] = "准备好接受训练了？保持速度，$n。我们要走的路还长着呢。",
    ["Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault."] = "后悔。这就是现在我所能感受到的一切。一个错误的决定导致了如此灾难性的后果。我多么希望当时能多等几天，直到命令传来。也许那样我们就能事先知道这片被诅咒的土地上到底有多少恐怖的东西等着我们！也许这一条命令就能指引我们去另外一个方向！无论怎么样，这都是我的错。所有的一切都是我造成的。",
    ["Remember, all things are connected. If the beasts were gone from the land, our kind would die from a great loneliness of spirit, for whatever happens to the beasts also happens to the Tauren. Whatever befalls Azeroth befalls all those that inhabit it. "] = "记住，所有的事物都是有关联的。如果陆地上的野兽灭绝，我们的种族将在孤独中死去，因为牛头人和野兽的命运是相通的，而艾泽拉斯的命运和所有艾泽拉斯上的生灵的命运也休戚相关。",
    ["Rend, son of Blackhand: Impotent chieftain of the Blackrock clan. A more stubborn bastard does not exist.$B$BAt the end of the second War, Rend and his brother, Maim, fled to find sanctuary within the mountainous stronghold of Blackrock Spire. It was there that Rend declared himself Warchief of the weakened Blackrock clan."] = "雷德，是黑手的儿子，他是黑石氏族的酋长。他是一个十足的恶棍。$B$B当第二次大战结束时，雷德和他的兄弟麦姆逃往黑石塔要塞避难。雷德正是在那儿宣称自己为黑石氏族的酋长的。",
    ["Rest your weary bones for a spell."] = "放松一下自己疲倦的身心。",
    ["Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love?  To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins.  Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly."] = "来复枪、炸药、炸弹、爆炸绵羊……这些可爱的东西。要学习如何制造这些物品以及其他工具的话，就去布瑞尔以南，洛丹伦废墟下的幽暗城吧。乘坐废墟后面的电梯，当你到达幽暗城后，向一个幽暗城守卫询问训练者的确切位置。",
    ["Right then! So the Mistress had come back for a second go at the hives but Brann was having none of that nonsense! Before the melee began, she started talking to something or someone. Crazier still, she started chanting in a language none of us had ever heard."] = "好吧！她从虫巢回来过，但是布莱恩一点都没有察觉到！混战之前，她开始跟什么人交谈起来。奇怪的是，她用了一种我们从未听过的语言谈话。",
    ["Rough times, huh, $n? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception."] = "艰难时期，嗯，$n？谁都需要帮助，我和我妻子也不例外。",
    ["Rupert Boch is his name.  I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town."] = "他名叫鲁伯特·鲍什。我听说他在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店楼上的某间房间里。",
    ["Sayoc is the orc weapon master and is located in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.  He instructs in the use of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons.Hanashi, the troll weapon master in the Valley of Honor of Orgrimmar, can teach the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and thrown weapons.Archibald, the undead weapon master in the War Quarter of the Undercity, can train the use of crossbows, daggers, one and two-handed swords and polearms."] = "塞尤克是兽人武器管理人。他居住在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。他可训练弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。  居住在奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的巨魔武器管理人哈纳什可训练弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有投掷武器。  居住在幽暗城战争区的亡灵武器管理人阿基巴德可训练十字弩、匕首、单手剑、双手剑和长柄武器。",
    ["Sayoc is the orc weapon master.  He is located in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.  He can train the use of bows, daggers, fist weapons, one and two-handed axes and thrown weapons.Hanashi, the troll weapon master in the Valley of Honor of Orgrimmar, can instruct in the use of bows, one and two-handed axes, staves and all thrown weapons.Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master, is on Thunder Bluff's lower rise.  He teaches the use of one and two-handed maces, staves and guns."] = "塞尤克是兽人武器管理人。他居住在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。他可训练弓箭、匕首、拳头武器、单手斧、双手斧和投掷武器。  居住在奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的巨魔武器管理人哈纳什可训练弓箭、单手斧、双手斧、棍和所有投掷武器。  居住在雷霆崖低处山峰的牛头人武器管理人安塞瓦可训练单手锤、双手锤、棍和枪。",
    ["Scarlet Monastery lies in the hills northeast of Tirisfal Glades."] = "血色修道院位于提瑞斯法林地东北部的山坡上。",
    ["Season's savings to you and yours!"] = "储存下来的物资都给你和你的家属！",
    ["See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips! My boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything.$b$bNothing was working, so we decided to 'borrow' one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!"] = "看看，风险投资公司的新伐木机比我的要好多啦，从可拆换的机械臂到控制把手，都是那么棒！我的老板给我下了死命令，但我们却拿不出任何东西。$b$b现在我们自己的设计研制工作已经完全停止了，所以我决定向他们“借”一个。我派维兹克兰克去淤泥沼泽偷一个回来，但他到现在还没音讯！",
    ["Seek out Miao'zan in Sen'jin Village to the south."] = "去南方的森金村找米奥赞。",
    ["Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the 'Expert Cookbook'."] = "去银风避难所找珊蒂瑞亚吧。她可以卖给你“中级烹饪教材”。",
    ["Seek out Turak Runetotem in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise."] = "去长者高地的长者大厅找图拉克·符文图腾吧。",
    ["Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn."] = "希克瓦能在你需要的时候帮你照看宠物。去旅馆前面找她吧。",
    ["Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village."] = "影牙城堡位于南部银松森林，就在焚木村的北面。",
    ["Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet."] = "谢尔比·石火帮当地猎人看管宠物。如果你想让她帮你照看宠物的话，就去雷酒酿制厂找她吧。",
    ["Shhh... do you smell something?"] = "嘘……你闻到什么了吗？",
    ["Shoja'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I'm busy."] = "苏亚米在旅馆前面。去吧，我正忙着呢。",
    ["Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor.  There you will find the Hunter's Hall."] = "你的目标位于荣誉谷西北角。你会在那儿发现猎人大厅的。",
    ["Show me what you got! You won't be sorry, I promise!"] = "给你看看你得到了什么！我承诺，你不会有遗憾的！",
    ["Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now."] = "虽然我被关在这间小屋里，但是我梦想着加入城墙外激烈的战斗。然而，职责迫使我为替我战斗的那些人传授知识……",
    ["Sightless I may be, but vision I have.$B$BMy primary dealings are with hunters and rogues, $r."] = "我眼睛瞎了，但是我还拥有洞察力。$B$B我主要跟猎人和潜行者打交道，$r。",
    ["Sildinair has trained many of the Sentinels who guard our beloved city.  I am certain she can make a warrior out of the likes of you.  Seek her out at the Warrior's Terrace near the entrance to our city."] = "希达奈尔训练出许多卫戍，他们守卫着我们心爱的城市。我相信她会使你成为一名战士的。去城门附近的战士区找她吧。",
    ["Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her."] = "自从我的丈夫上了前线后，海伦尼便一直保护着我。她用善良的心肠和锋利的宝剑帮助我度过了无数艰难岁月。没有她，我真不知道会发生什么事。",
    ["Since the fall of Dalaran and the destruction of Quel'Thalas, wares of this sort have been hard to come by. But Lucan Cordell and some of our other Tradesman have been doing a fine job of filling our orders with quality merchandise."] = "在达拉然陷落和奎尔萨拉斯被摧毁之后，这样的东西就很难在世面上看到了。但是鲁坎·考迪尔和我的其他一些商业伙伴很好的完成了我的订单。",
    ["Since we've begun our stay in the crater, Dadanga's taken a liking to the large bloodpetal sprouts that grow all over the place here.$B$BI'm sure she'd enjoy a snack, if you feel like bringing her some..."] = "从我们呆在环形山这里开始，达丹加就喜欢上了遍布这里的巨大的血瓣花苗芽。$B$B我敢肯定她会喜欢，如果你愿意带给她一大堆花苗芽的话……",
    ["Sit and listen to my story, $r."] = "坐下来听听我的故事吧，$r。",
    ["Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing."] = "肤质很好。它将你包裹其中。你也许已经注意到我的皮肤不是那么好。我过去常常担心自己的毛孔。这些日子我几乎不担心皮肤了。在某种程度上，它得到了解放。",
    ["Skinning?  The only thing ye look like ye could skin is yer own knee!  Ha!  Now why don't you go see Balthus Stoneflayer so he can teach you how to properly skin some animals.  You'll find him in Finespindle's Leather Goods on the northern side of The Great Forge."] = "剥皮？能不能学成只有看你自己了！哈哈！你为什么不去找巴尔萨斯·裂石呢，他能教你如何剥皮。他在大熔炉北面的皮甲用品店。",
    ["Slip a little coin into the boss's hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port....well, I can't imagine it any better. But I'm betting that you aren't here about my business practices. You're looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that's great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?"] = "将一枚硬币塞到首领手中，看看你会得到什么。我喜欢自己的工作。但是，如果我能设法让斯纳尔克重新分配给这个飞行点的话……那样就好了。但是我敢打赌，你到这儿来不是要帮我进行职业训练的，而是寻找地精飞艇前往幽暗城，对吧？那很好，因为它会停泊在我后面。如果你看见斯纳尔克，代我向他问好，行吗？",
    ["Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time."] = "斯纳尔因为我动作慢了所以叫我。我只是想做好工作罢了，这得花时间的。",
    ["So $g lad : lass;, you think you have what it takes to defend the Alliance against the Horde in Alterac Valley?  Very well then, you will want to speak with our very own Glordrum Steelbeard here in Ironforge.  You'll find him strategizing over the war table in the Hall of Arms."] = "那么$g小伙子:小姑娘;，你认为你具有在奥特兰克山谷帮助联盟抵御部落的能力？非常好，那么你一定希望和铁炉堡的格罗杜姆·钢须谈谈。你可以在武器大厅的战略沙图之前找到他。",
    ["So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?"] = "真冷……我很饿。$B$B我可怜的朋友，希望你已经安息了。我不忍心去想他们会对你做什么。$B$B你！嘿，就是你！请你一定要帮我逃跑。他们之中的某个人身上肯定有钥匙，你能找到它吗？我知道他们有钥匙。如果你弄到钥匙，就可以帮我离开这里了。特雷可能已经死了，但是我还心存希望！求你了，帮帮我吧！",
    ["So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again. "] = "经历了多年的战乱和奴役生活，再次拥有一个家园的感觉真好。",
    ["So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got."] = "那么说来你想要成为一名铁匠？$g小伙子:小姑娘;，扎好围裙，拿上铁锤，让我们开始吧。",
    ["So you have come to Niby to learn the secrets of calling down an infernal servant from the Nether.$B$BSilence! Niby knows all!$B$BNiby is not so quick to part with such knowledge. First, you must assist Niby with a very important task."] = "这么说，你是来找尼比学习如何从虚空中召唤地域火仆从的。$B$B安静！尼比什么都知道！$B$B他可不会这么轻易地将知识传授给你。首先，你必须帮助尼比完成一项至关重要的任务。",
    ["So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let's see what meager skills you possess."] = "你认为自己够资格向我学习吗？你不过是我脚下的一名卑微的小人物罢了。但是，收纳一名下属或许能增加我对苏米和图米的吸引力。让我看看你拥有什么技能。",
    ["So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!"] = "你想学点东西吗？我会很乐意教你的！",
    ["So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes."] = "这么说……你想当一名裁缝？很好，让我们看看你是否具有这样的潜质。",
    ["Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!"] = "有些冒险家认为附魔术不起作用。我发现当我向他们挑战，要与他们作战时，他们的看法就改变了！",
    ["Some were spared the anguish that memories provide."] = "有人没有受到记忆的折磨。",
    ["Sometimes I surprise even myself!"] = "有时，连我自己都感到惊讶！",
    ["Somewhere to fly to?  You'll need to go to the Undercity for that!  Go south on the road out of town, then southwest to the Ruins of Lordaeron.  You can catch the elevator down to the Undercity from the back of the ruins and once there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."] = "想飞往某处？你得去幽暗城才行！沿着城镇南面的道路走，然后往西南方前进，到达洛丹伦废墟。你可以乘坐废墟后面的电梯到幽暗城，问问幽暗城守卫，获取更详细的指示。",
    ["Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren't quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice."] = "很抱歉，$g小伙子:姑娘;，你还不够资格在我这儿求学。去找我的儿子 格鲁姆，他会收你做学生的。",
    ["Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill.  You'll have to head to the Undercity for that.  The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further."] = "很抱歉，朋友，在布瑞尔没有你想要的东西。你得前往幽暗城。幽暗城位于布瑞尔以南的洛丹伦废墟下。在废墟后面搭乘电梯即可到达，去问问幽暗城守卫，他会为你指明方向的。",
    ["Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business."] = "很抱歉，如果你不是暴风城中的贵族，我是不会将马匹卖给你的。这些战马是最好的，我们当然不会当它们落入敌人之手。$B$B想要证明自己不是敌人，当然……你只需赢得暴风城的信任，我就可以跟你做买卖了。",
    ["Sorry, but I only train rogues."] = "对不起，但是我只训练潜行者。",
    ["Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear."] = "很抱歉，我已经没有什么可以教给你的了。如果你还想学的话，就去达纳苏斯的工匠区找泰龙尼斯吧。我听说他相当有才能。",
    ["Sounds like you want to talk to Maginor Dumas! You can usually find him in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Course, you never know when or where those magi will portal off to."] = "听起来你得去跟玛吉诺·仲马谈谈！你可以在法师区的巫师圣殿找到他。当然，那些法师总是来去无踪……",
    ["Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?"] = "在这里说话你要小心点，一不小心就可能招来杀身之祸。现在，你有什么需要我帮助的事情吗？",
    ["Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor.  Put in a good word for me!"] = "去荣誉谷的勇者大厅找格雷兹·怒拳谈谈。并代我向他问好！",
    ["Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "往上走去力量谷以西，去精神谷的黑石南小屋找皮菲瑞多谈谈。",
    ["Speak with Un'Thuwa to the south in Sen'jin Village."] = "去南方的森金村，找安苏瓦谈谈。",
    ["Spend less time rattling and more time listening."] = "少说废话，认真听讲。",
    ["Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak.$B$BSul'thraze reborn when the twins are found."] = "分久必合，合久必分。那两把剑被隐藏在祖尔法拉克城中。$B$B苏萨斯会在两把剑都被发现时重生。",
    ["Starting at 6PM, they will show fireworks from the highest bluff!"] = "每天下午6点钟，雷霆崖都会有华丽的焰火表演！",
    ["Stay away from Sumi and Tumi. They are....spoken for."] = "离苏米和图米远点。他们会……极力推销他们的东西的。",
    ["Step carefully mortal.  You tread where mightier beings have met their fate."] = "当心点，凡人。那些强大的生物就是在此地葬生的。",
    ["Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire!  Huzzah!"] = "快来吧，听说艾泽拉斯最盛大的集会——暗月马戏团开张啦！哈哈！",
    ["Step right up!  Get your red hot wings right here!"] = "快来吧！到这儿来买热辣烤鸡翅！",
    ["Stick around after the firework show is over.  Find a goblet and raise it to toast your hardy friends!"] = "焰火表演之后不要走开！拿起高脚杯和你的好朋友一起庆祝吧！",
    ["Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.$B$B$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish."] = "石爪山脉在这片区域拥有许多危险的洞穴。若干冒险家愿意冒着生命的危险到这些洞穴中探险。$B$B$C，也许只要你全心全意地寻找，会找到财宝的。",
    ["Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong."] = "别那样看我。我也许跟你不同，我不是个冒险家，但是这并不意味着我的力量比你小。忙碌的生活会让你的手臂变得强壮的。",
    ["Stormwind Counting House is located by the front gates in the Trade District of Stormwind. And when you get tired of counting your money, be sure to stop by the Gilded Rose for a drink."] = "暴风城的暴风城会计室位于城中贸易区的前门处。当你厌烦细数你的金钱时，一定要在镶金玫瑰喝一杯。",
    ["Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade."] = "暴风城是人类的支柱，它是建立在钢铁的意志和锋利的刀刃上的。",
    ["Stormwind's resident engineer trainer is an ingenious gnome by the name of Lilliam Sparkspindle. He can be found in the back of the Dwarven District."] = "暴风城有一个天才侏儒名叫利廉姆·火轴，他是这里最好的工程学训练师。你可以在矮人区的后面找到他。",
    ["Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies."] = "努力保持所有事情的平衡性，$c。真正的和谐便在于此。",
    ["Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter's Hall."] = "强壮的身体和精神。没有比这更强大的组合了！去猎人大厅跟萨尔克·狂暴图腾找寻自己的命运吧。",
    ["Studying and understanding the Colossus will give us a needed advantage over the Qiraji."] = "研究并了解这些巨甲虫，可以让我们更有把握打败其拉虫人！",
    ["Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch."] = "真是无谓的攻击，但是如果银翼要塞的家伙不想要和我们和平相处的话，那么他们还能留给我们什么？去猎人大厅找克古尔·血斧，他将会帮助你进入战歌峡谷。",
    ["Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs.  Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance."] = "只有在雷霆崖上的神秘之地才能找到这样的智者。沿着血蹄村北面的道路一直走，直到你来到雷霆崖底的电梯。乘坐电梯到达顶端，询问雷霆崖守卫，您能获取到更多的帮助。",
    ["Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.$B$BMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children 'straight.' But believe me, $r, it exists.$B$B<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>"] = "苏萨斯……第一次听到这个词的时候，我还和你一样大。那个时候这个词对我来说没有什么意义，就好像现在它对你没有什么意义一样。但是当一群巨魔从祖尔法拉克来到这里肆意妄为之后，这个词就变成了恐惧的代名词。$B$B这里的人都会告诉你那把剑并不存在，那只是一个神话，一个用来吓唬小孩子的故事。但是，$c，请相信我，它确实存在。$B$B<说到这里，特伦顿不禁开始用手抚摸自己脸上累累的伤疤。>",
    ["Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here."] = "这附近有很多乱扔垃圾的家伙。",
    ["Sure thing, $n. Here's another for you."] = "当然的事情，$n。还有一个给你。",
    ["Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...$B$BAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get."] = "当然，$n。看起来你是个值得信任的$r！我在一里开外就发现了……$B$B总之，说正经事。我需要一株灵根草才能制作视灵药剂。药剂所需的其它成分都是小菜一碟，但是灵根草就不是那么容易得到了。",
    ["Sure ye don't want to be a Blacksmith?  Well, if yer heart is set on Leatherworking, then you best talk to Fimble Finespindle over at his shop on the northwest side of The Great Forge."] = "你确定不想做铁匠吗？嗯，如果你真心想学制皮，最好去大熔炉西北角找费布·钢轴谈谈。",
    ["Sure, sure.  We have a Mining Trainer right here in town.  Look for Krunn over in the northwest corner alongside the inn."] = "当然，当然。城镇中有一名采矿训练师。在旅馆旁西北角可以找到克鲁恩。",
    ["Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. "] = "明显莫特并没有派你到我这儿来。他知道得很清楚。你还无法理解我能传授给你的知识。去外面找我的儿子莫特，他会对你进行训练的。",
    ["Surely ye didn't think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill's Depot just outside of Kharanos."] = "这么说，你以为在这个城镇里没有常驻矿工，是吗？错！在卡拉诺斯外的钢架补给站附近去找亚尔吧。",
    ["Tai'jin is her name and you'll find her inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  She'll teach you to respect the gods.  Make certain that you show her the proper respect in return!"] = "她名叫泰金，你可以在剃刀岭东面的兵营中找到她。她会教你如何尊敬神灵的。作为回报，你必须向她表示尊重。",
    ["Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on."] = "裁缝可以派得上大用场。我从前就不得不把我的胳膊缝上。",
    ["Tailoring you say?  Hmmm.  Ah yes, of course.  You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north.  Take the path out of the village to get there.  When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers."] = "你是说裁缝？嗯。是的，当然。你得去正北方的雷霆崖。沿着村外的道路走。到达雷霆崖底后，乘坐电梯去雷霆崖顶部，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。",
    ["Take it easy, mon. I only train da warriors."] = "放轻松点。我只训练战士。",
    ["Take my advice, don't sit close to the shadows."] = "我建议你最好不要坐得靠近阴影。",
    ["Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously.  He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two."] = "乌布雷克·火拳总是极其认真地照顾动物。如果你想让他帮你照看宠物的话，就去武器大厅找他吧，他通常跟那些猎人在一起。",
    ["Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It's at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining."] = "跟燃烧的铁砧的萨鲁·钢怒谈谈。沿着红石谷矿业工会右边的道路走到尽头，去那得荣誉谷找他吧。",
    ["Tasty drinks for sale!  Quench your thirst on some of the Darkmoon Faire's finest brews!"] = "出售可口的饮料啦！暗月马戏团最好的酒，生津止渴！",
    ["Tauren have a passion for hunting; it is something that runs deep with our kind."] = "牛头人热衷于狩猎，这是流淌在我们血液中的灵魂。",
    ["Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows."] = "教学不只是一项单边活动，$n。当我教你时，我自己也在学习，而我的理解也在加深。",
    ["Tell me what you want, and make it quick."] = "告诉我你要什么，别磨磨蹭蹭的。",
    ["Tepa is renown for her clothwork.  She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."] = "坦帕以她制作的衣物而闻名，你可以在中部高地的雷霆崖防具店找到她。",
    ["Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure."] = "太可怕了，这些骡子到底怎么了……要是这样下去，梅兹会把我剥了皮的。",
    ["Thank you for saving me!$B$BI'm a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn't come around, I'm sure I'd have ended up in their stew pot!"] = "谢谢你救了我！$B$B我是一名来自暴风城的厨师兼炼金师。我到这儿来是要帮我叔叔安古斯寻找草药和食物的，但是这些野猪人将我抓了起来。要不是你赶过来的话，我想我已经被它们煮着吃了。",
    ["Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."] = "感谢你的帮助，$C。不幸的是，你的经验不够丰富，无法承受阿拉希盆地的险恶环境。",
    ["Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!"] = "谢谢你！我注定会在达隆郡之战中身亡，但是你让我获得了自由！",
    ["Thank you!  You freed me!"] = "谢谢你！你让我自由了！",
    ["Thanks again for returning my lucky measuring tape, $n.  I swear it helps me catch bigger fish!"] = "再次感谢你找回了我的幸运卷尺，$n。这东西能帮我捕到更大的鱼呢！",
    ["Thanks to you, we can now unlock the secrets of the crystals and the mysterious pylons, $n. If you need more information at any time, please come back and visit me again!"] = "谢谢你，现在我们能解开水晶和神秘的水晶塔的秘密了，$n。要是你需要更多信息，请随时回来找我！",
    ["That Granis Swiftaxe could drink a fish under the table and yet his axe still swings true.  However, if yer looking for training, ye best catch him while ye can understand him."] = "格兰尼斯·快斧能把一条鱼给喝趴下，而且还能把斧头抡得虎虎生风。如果你想接受训练的话，就去找他吧。",
    ["That Jormund Stonebrow has a knack for the needle, he does.  Should you be needing some training, then you'll find him at Stonebrow's Clothier on the northern side of The Great Forge."] = "约莫德·石眉对缝纫有独到之处，真的。如果你想接受训练的话，就去大熔炉北边的石眉布衣店找他吧。",
    ["That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you're there say hi to Shankys for me."] = "鲁玛克……总是在荣誉谷的湖边钓鱼。你找到他后，顺便帮我向山吉斯问好。",
    ["That bum Leland... all he does is sit out on the dock outside the Trade District and fish all day.  I sure hope he's good at it for all the time he spends fishing.  If you want to learn, why don't you go talk to him?"] = "那个游手好闲的利兰……他整天就在贸易区外的码头边钓鱼。他在钓鱼上花费这许多时间，我想他的钓鱼技术一定很高。如果你想学的话，为什么不去跟他谈谈呢？",
    ["That hermit Mallory is known to concoct some potions for the local townsfolk on occasion.  He has a cottage in the hills between Stormwind and Northshire."] = "听说那个隐士玛洛瑞有时会为当地居民配制药剂，他居住在暴风城和北郡之间的小山上。",
    ["That kind of magic is just bad news, I tell ye.  I don't know why that Grimrizz has been allowed to set up outside the Thunderbrew Distillery of all places!  You stay away from him, you here!"] = "我告诉你，掌握那种魔法可不是什么好事。我不知道为什么他们会允许吉姆瑞兹在雷酒酿制厂外面安营扎寨！离他远点！",
    ["That reminds me, I'm going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I'm told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."] = "这倒提醒我了，我得去找点吃的。据说联盟已经收集到$2092w条彩鳍鱼、$2098w块烤迅猛龙肉和$2101w条斑点黄尾鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2093w、$2099w和$2103w。一旦收集完毕，这些食物就将被运往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞。",
    ["That wee wizardly lass, Bink, over in the Hall of Mysteries would probably be able to help ye out with any magical needs you have.  The Hall of Mysteries is just north of the gates of Ironforge."] = "秘法大厅的法师彬克也许能帮忙解决你的一些魔法需求。  秘法大厅就在铁炉堡的北部。",
    ["That would be Dwukk.  Find him next to the heated forge at the northwest corner of town."] = "那是杜克。去城镇西北角炙热的熔炉附近找他。",
    ["That would be Shelene Rhobart.  Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection.  She's at a camp along the side of the road."] = "你一定是要找舍伦尼·洛巴尔特。沿着布瑞尔东南方的道路走，然后在十字路口向东走。她就居住在路边的某个营帐中。",
    ["That's Rupert Boch you're looking for.  He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill."] = "你要找的是鲁伯特·鲍什。他和他的随从居住在布瑞尔东南角恐惧之末旅店的楼上。",
    ["That's nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have."] = "那很好，$n。无论那是什么，去拿给那边的沃萨看看。他会回答你的任何问题。",
    ["That's right friend!  The Darkmoon Faire is going to be right here.  Just as soon as I unload those huge wagons, put up all the tents, erect the zoo and pour the drinks.  Make sure you come back!"] = "没错！暗月马戏团很快就要来了！只要我把这些东西从车上卸下来，搭好帐篷弄好场地，就马上开工！别忘了届时过来看看哦！",
    ["That's right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within $2113w days. After that, we'll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj."] = "是的，嗯，$G小伙子:姑娘;，所有的战争物资都在运往希利苏斯的途中，预计将在$2113w天内全部抵达。我们只需等待某位英雄修复流沙节杖，敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门，拉开战争的序幕。",
    ["That's the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka."] = "旅馆位于主城入口以北，力量谷右边的第二幢建筑物。和旅店老板格雷什卡谈谈。",
    ["That's troll business.  Look for Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin Village down south."] = "那是巨魔的事儿。去南方的森金村找安苏瓦。",
    ["The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.$B$BAs for me? I'll die in battle...$B$B<Marjhan shrugs.>"] = "银色黎明只不过是一群懦弱无力的理想主义者，若不是他们的领袖能意识到自己的不足，他们真可以说是无可救药了。我是血色十字军派驻到这里来的一名大使。是的，算是一名外交人员……我们的未来仍然是一片迷雾，我不知道我们是否能成为一支联军，或各自为战；我也不知道我们是否能够在克尔苏加德的侵略之下保卫家园，或让这个世界沦陷，但我们应该竭尽全力，奇迹总在风雨之后到来。$B$B至于我？马革裹尸，战死沙场……$B$B<玛尔兰耸了耸肩。>",
    ["The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "银色黎明向你致敬，$c！我叫莱斯巴克，是银色黎明委派的装备和物资军需官。$B$B如果你愿意接受任命，同邪恶力量作战——以此赢得我们的尊重和信任——你就能在军官普尔哈特那儿获得勇气勋章。勋章有两个用途：提高声望或是获取特殊物品。$B$B随着你在银色黎明阵营地位的提高，你会发现自己能获得更多的物品。",
    ["The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "银色黎明向你致敬，$c。我是哈萨娜——银色黎明为数不多经过授权的装备和军品军需官之一。$B$B既然你在我们委任下作战——同时赢得我们的尊敬和信任——你会从加鲁什军官那里得到英勇勋章。它们有两个作用：在我们的队伍中赢得地位，或者作为交换得到某些特殊物品。$B$B随着你在银色黎明地位的升高，你会发现你能够得到更多物品。",
    ["The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city."] = "奥格瑞玛银行在力量谷那里。去主城门以北的地方找找吧。",
    ["The Bank of Stormwind is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map."] = "暴风城银行坐落在贸易区，就在城门的西北面。来，让我在地图上指给你看。",
    ["The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there."] = "巴罗夫家族让我忙个不停。总有一些垃圾从那儿出来。",
    ["The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude."] = "贫瘠之地阳光灼热，那儿的居住者充满敌意，是考验你的力量和决心的最佳地点。",
    ["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's Hunter Rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!"] = "冲击者5000型超级大炮是一种代表世界最尖端技术水平的单人发射装置，它能以龙的速度将人发射出去。发明该设施的地精家族是家喻户晓的航空领域先驱，这种超级大炮已经成为了家族的荣耀！$B$B如果你想象鸟儿一样在空中翱翔，就去雷霆崖的猎人高地南部找玛克希玛吧。听说它可以把人发射到石牛湖以南呢！",
    ["The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge."] = "燃烧平原是个危险的地方，但是我这样的学者将不惜一切代价来获取新知识。",
    ["The Cathedral of Light in Cathedral Square is home to the priests of Stormwind. There you will find High Priestess Laurena."] = "教堂广场的光明大教堂是暴风城神职人员的住所，你可以在那里找到高阶牧师劳瑞娜。",
    ["The Cathedral of Light is the center of all the healing practices of Stormwind. There you can find Shaina Fuller to help you learn this craft."] = "光明大教堂是暴风城所有治疗相关技能的训练中心。你可以找珊娜·弗勒学习急救技能。",
    ["The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth's secrets.  Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids."] = "塞纳里奥议会是睿智的，他们发现了很多有关大地的秘密。愿意聆听这些德鲁伊的教诲的工匠总是会得到许多宝贵的知识。",
    ["The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.$B$BI suppose you're looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?"] = "指挥官最近一直心不在焉。他的妻子在最近的一次南部沙漠考古挖掘中失踪了——一下子消失地踪影全无！真的非常奇怪。$B$B我想你是不是想要找份工作？我是不是可以给你一些提示？",
    ["The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.$B$BDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known."] = "诅咒神教正在迅速壮大。从小型村落到首都，从部落到联盟，几乎每座城镇的居民中都有诅咒神教的信徒。$B$B别惊讶，他们只在仪式和庆典上面才身穿统一的服饰。你很可能已经跟他们的信徒碰过面了，只是你不知道而已。",
    ["The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war."] = "黑暗女王说过，在这场战争中，知识是我们最强大的武器。",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see!"] = "暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！不要错过有史以来最华丽的表演！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you'll ever see?"] = "暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！不要错过有史以来最华丽的表演！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don't miss it!"] = "暗月马戏团已经来到本镇了！走过路过不要错过！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!"] = "暗月马戏团来了！所有的孩子都可以在这里找到好玩的东西！来吧，都来吧！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire.  Don't miss it!"] = "暗月马戏团到艾尔文森林来了，就在闪金镇的南边。走过路过不要错过！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff.  Don't miss it!"] = "暗月马戏团到莫高雷的金色平原来了，就在雷霆崖的西南边。走过路过不要错过！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!"] = "暗月马戏团是全艾泽拉斯最华丽的！",
    ["The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!"] = "暗月马戏团只会逗留有限的时间。一定要在今天来看看啊！",
    ["The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall."] = "死亡矿井位于西部荒野月溪镇的地下。",
    ["The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise."] = "大地之母发出召唤，你得做出应答。你可以在灵魂高地找到灵魂大厅。",
    ["The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology."] = "大地之母有许多秘密，布瑞克·石蹄能帮助你发现一些秘密。你会在 石蹄地质学会的中部高地的底层那找到他的。",
    ["The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.$B$BIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.$B$BCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.$B$BCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers."] = "东方的水晶塔接受蓝色，黄色，还有绿色的水晶。$B$B它专注于使用蓝色水晶作为主要力量之源而产生的能量。有两种可能的效果：一种对精神有益，而另一种产生一种破坏性的护盾。$B$B精神水晶需要蓝色和绿色的水晶。这将会增加你的勇气。$B$B尖刺水晶需要蓝色和黄色的水晶。这会产生一个对攻击者造成伤害的护盾。",
    ["The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land."] = "翡翠议会试图治愈费伍德森林受伤的大地。尽管这片大地是以腐蚀它的东西命名，我们还是希望有一天我们能从这片土地中将腐败清除。",
    ["The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you."] = "女神已经赐予我智慧，陌生人。如果那是她的意愿，我将会把它传给你。",
    ["The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.$B$BIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic. "] = "庞大的戈杜尼食人魔部落控制了菲拉斯森林的很大一块区域。他们的黑暗魔法已经渗透了周围的环境，从而直接对那里的其它生物造成了毁灭性的打击。$B$B如果你去菲拉斯的话，可得小心那些食人魔——他们非常肮脏，而且很多都会使用强大的黑暗魔法。",
    ["The Hall of Spirits is where our shamans call home.  You can find it on the Spirit Rise.  May your ancestors watch over you."] = "灵魂大厅是萨满祭司的家园，它坐落在灵魂高地上。愿你的先祖保佑你。",
    ["The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood."] = "高阶女祭司现在不能离开达纳苏斯。范达尔的情绪非常奇怪。",
    ["The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance."] = "角鹰兽是一种高贵而迅捷的动物。这些训练有素的飞兽可以让它们的骑手以很快的速度旅行。",
    ["The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side."] = "部落大使馆位于西边的力量谷。",
    ["The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered."] = "部落正在收集绷带。到目前为止，我们已经收集到$2079w根绒线绷带、$2085w根魔纹绷带和$2089w根符文布绷带，而总的需求量分别是$2080w、$2086w和$2090w。",
    ["The Hunter Trainer's name is Thotar.  Seek him out inside the burrow on the southwest corner of Razor Hill."] = "猎人训练者名叫索塔尔。去剃刀岭西南部的洞穴中找他吧。",
    ["The Inn?  Ah, ye looking to toss back some of the best ales Ironforge has to offer?  The Stonefire Tavern is where ye'll want to go.  $B$BYe'll find it just to the left of the entrance to Ironforge if ye be coming, or to the right if ye be going."] = "旅馆？啊，你是来寻找铁炉堡出产的美酒的？你该去石火旅店。$B$B如果你在铁炉堡之外，它就在铁炉堡大门的左边；反之，则在大门右边。",
    ["The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance.  It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting."] = "阿拉索联军发誓为激流堡和联盟夺回阿拉希。这将是一场恶战，但是是一场值得打的战争。",
    ["The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms."] = "阿拉索联军试图从被遗忘者手中夺回自己的失地。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就跟武器大厅的杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。",
    ["The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur."] = "巫妖王正试图要将他的存在传达给整个世界，让这个世界陷入恐慌与噩梦之中。绝对不能让这一切发生。",
    ["The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?"] = "愿圣光与你同在，$c。我能帮上忙吗？",
    ["The Light protect you, $c."] = "愿圣光保佑你，$c。",
    ["The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home."] = "闪金镇的狮王之傲旅店是这个地区中最好的旅店了。在那儿歇一歇吧，旅店老板法雷会让你感受到家的温暖。",
    ["The Lord of Blackrock hangs from the arches!"] = "黑石领主从灰烬中升起！",
    ["The Lorekeeper is an ancient. He has served under our glorious Queen!"] = "博学者是个古老的学者。他为我们伟大的女王服务！",
    ["The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you."] = "纳迪娅·织发离开自己的家园前往达纳苏斯进修去了。她精通制革，而且是一名优秀的老师。你该去向她求教。",
    ["The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!"] = "王子对奈法利安的巢穴非常感兴趣。如果有谁能杀死巨龙及其属下，并将战斗经过告诉王子，我敢打赌王子会非常满意的。找到灰烬使者之日可待啦！",
    ["The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.$B$BThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. $B$BCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.$B$BCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura."] = "北方的水晶塔接受黄红绿三种颜色的水晶构成。$B$B而关键是使用黄水晶所产生的能量作为主要的力量来源。有两种可能的效果：一种会制造破坏，一种会消除破坏。$B$B爆炸水晶需要红水晶和黄水晶。这将产生剧烈爆炸，足以震慑你的敌人。$B$B恢复水晶需要黄水晶和绿水晶。这将给你提供治疗光环。",
    ["The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall. "] = "无论萨尔是否存在，碎手氏族的秩序都将延续下去。",
    ["The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports."] = "奥格瑞玛拍卖所位于力量谷。去火枪进口公司东面找它吧。",
    ["The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.$B$BYou'll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you'll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted."] = "权力珍宝是古代古拉巴什帝国的遗物。赞达拉部族正在寻找它们——它们不仅有着极大的收藏价值，而且我们相信它们还蕴藏着远古帝国的魔法。$B$B你可以在祖尔格拉布找到三种权力珍宝：硬币、珠宝和原始神灵的物品。收集到一定数量之后，把这些东西交给我们，我们就会送你一些赞达拉最好的工艺制品。",
    ["The Park is where you want to go if you are looking for druid trainers. Theridan and Maldryn can usually be found by the moonwell in the center of the district."] = "如果你要寻找德鲁伊训练师，那就去花园区。塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩一般都在那里的月亮井旁边。",
    ["The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!"] = "瘟疫之地是对付亡灵天灾绝佳的地方！",
    ["The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call.  You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge."] = "潜行者训练者名叫马里恩·考尔。她在城镇东南角的恐惧之末旅店的阅览室中。",
    ["The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then..."] = "皇家药剂师学会对愚蠢的家伙可没有耐心，我也一样。或许下次我们谈到战马的时候，你会被当作是幽暗城的贵族。到那时……",
    ["The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands."] = "通灵学院这个学习亡灵术的学校位于西瘟疫之地的凯尔达隆那个废弃的小岛上。",
    ["The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!"] = "亡灵天灾带来的灾难就快结束；一场难以控制的颠覆行动会将我们推向顶峰！你务必要帮助我们！",
    ["The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!"] = "亡灵天灾带来的灾难还在这片区域蔓延，在扭转局面，摧毁亡灵天灾之前，我们要走的路还很长。收集必要的资源，尽力帮助我们吧！",
    ["The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored."] = "碎手已经在黑石的大本营中安插了数名间谍。尽管信息收集的过程已经慢了下来，但是我们发现了一些不容忽略的现象。",
    ["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory, unhindered by the timidness of the Warchief."] = "碎手氏族将会见证部落的崛起和荣耀，酋长的懦弱不会阻止我们！",
    ["The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?"] = "碎手氏族的影响遍布这一地区。我们已经统治了整个卡利姆多——法律，政治，军事，一切的一切。我们无所不知，我们目及一切。$B$B你现在已经成长到能够为我们效力的时候了，$n。是时候让你投入战斗了。$B$B你做好接受下一个任务的准备了吗？",
    ["The Shen'dralar were Queen Azshara's most revered arcanists. It was within these very walls that the Queen's most important demands were processed - often in secret.$B$BAfter the destruction of the Well and the subsequent lethargy that overcame the Highborne and lesser night elf sects, the Prince of Eldre'Thalas, Tortheldrin, began construction of the pylons that you see littering the halls of the west wing."] = "辛德拉古是艾萨拉女王最器重的奥术学家。女王最重要的物品都在这些高大的城墙内秘密制造完成。$B$B永恒之井被破坏后，上层精灵陷入浑浑噩噩的境地，一支较小的暗夜精灵氏族，埃雷萨拉斯的王子托塞德林开始建造水晶塔，你可以在西侧的城墙那儿看到那些分散在各处的水晶塔。",
    ["The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is."] = "对我们这些在月光林地塞纳里奥议会的人来说，雷姆洛斯神殿是个神圣的地方……所以请你的表现符合访客的身份。$B$B我想你不愿让我用弯刀杀死你，那就是了。",
    ["The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave."] = "银翼哨兵算不上是个可敬的对手，但是如果你对屠杀他们感兴趣，那么就去勇者大厅找布拉古尔吧。",
    ["The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them."] = "银翼哨兵运用一切援助对抗战歌前锋。$n，如果你想要帮助他们的话，就去暴风要塞找艾弗拉兰谈谈。",
    ["The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior's Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!"] = "雷矛卫队需要你的帮助，赶快去参加对抗霜狼氏族的战斗吧，$n！和战士区的布洛冈·石盾谈一谈，他会帮你抵达奥特兰克山谷。赞美艾露恩！",
    ["The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed!  Ready for Alterac Valley $c?"] = "必须杀死雷矛卫兵！准备在奥特兰克山谷开战，准备好了吗，$c?",
    ["The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind."] = "暴风城监狱位于暴风城靠近法师区附近。",
    ["The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows."] = "沉没的神庙位于悲伤沼泽东部的一个大湖的中心。",
    ["The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy... "] = "辛迪加工会的成员都是些平庸的家伙——缺乏组织性、技能拙劣、懒惰……",
    ["The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood."] = "月神殿是艾露恩的祭司们的家园。你会在那儿找到贾德莉亚和拉瑞亚，她们会对你的牧师生涯做出进一步的指导。",
    ["The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!"] = "瑟银兄弟会是不会在蚂蚁身上浪费时间的。快滚开！",
    ["The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.$B$BI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.$B$BPresent your offer, $r."] = "瑟银兄弟会懂得如何制造火焰之王的神圣武器，但是我们缺乏人力，无法获得制造武器所需的材料。$B$B我，罗克图斯·暗契，兄弟会赋予我强大的力量，用珍贵的药方来交换从熔火之心收集的材料。$B$B给个价吧，$r。",
    ["The Thunder Bluff Bank can be found on the lower rise."] = "你可以在中心高地上找到雷霆崖银行。",
    ["The Thunderbrews run a fine Inn in Kharanos which bears their name.  Stop in for a pint and a bit of rest."] = "雷酒家族在卡拉诺斯开了一家旅店，久负盛名。在那里喝杯酒休息一下吧。",
    ["The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus."] = "林精使渔民在多兰纳尔很难有所收获。你最好去达纳苏斯找找他们。",
    ["The Valley of Trials will temper even the weakest into a warrior worthy to join the Horde. Those who cannot rise to its tests will be left to bake in the scorching desert sun."] = "试炼谷能将最软弱的新兵锻炼成一名合格的部落战士。无法通过试炼者将被抛弃，独自忍受骄阳的煎烤。",
    ["The Vault in Ironforge is the closest bank ye'll find in these parts."] = "铁炉堡银行是这一带最近的银行。",
    ["The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens.   "] = "哀嚎洞穴的入口位于贫瘠之地十字路口西南边的甜水绿洲。",
    ["The Warchief brings change that will bring the Horde victory!  Look for Swart inside the barracks on the east side of town."] = "酋长进行的变革将帮助部落取得胜利！去城镇东边的兵营找斯瓦特吧。",
    ["The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.$B$BHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur."] = "酋长指示我学习各种武器和护甲知识。他把我派遣到这兽人和牛头人文明的集合之地，接触尽可能多的旅行者，学习整个贫瘠之地的文明。$B$B他认为即使是最未开化的文明也有值得学习的地方——比如野猪人和半人马。",
    ["The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?"] = "海达克西斯公爵躲到了艾萨拉风暴海湾的某个岛屿上。那些家伙能有什么威胁？",
    ["The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.$B$BThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy's defenses.$B$BCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.$B$BCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target."] = "西方的水晶塔接受红色，绿色和蓝色的水晶。$B$B塔门关键是要用红色水晶作为力量源泉而产生的能量。可能有两种结果：一种能提高你的防御力，而另一种则是削弱敌人的防御。$B$B防御水晶需要红色和绿色的水晶。这将会使你的装甲更完备。$B$B破甲水晶需要蓝色和红色的水晶。这将会削弱即定目标的装甲防御。",
    ["The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge?  I think not!"] = "蛮锤城堡的矮人也许有奔跑迅速的战马，但是这些鹰巢山的狮鹫能承受大熔炉的热量吗？我觉得不能！",
    ["The Wind Rider Roost is atop the totem stairway in the center of town."] = "双足飞龙巢穴就在城镇中心的图腾柱顶部。",
    ["The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom..."] = "赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉，历经艰险才来到此地，但是这一切却招致我们的厄运……",
    ["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that."] = "魔法只会腐蚀那些意志薄弱的人。即便你不是术士，最好也牢记这一点。",
    ["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."] = "魔法只会使那些软弱的人堕落。继续你的训练吧，不然你的命运就跟那些人相差无几了。",
    ["The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!$B$BThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.$B$BIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.$B$BSuch tragedy... "] = "救赎护甲原本属于我们当中最虔诚的那一批圣骑士，甚至是光明使者本人也曾穿过这套护甲！$B$B可在上一次战争中，这些圣骑士们英勇抗击天灾军团，战死沙场之后，他们身上的铠甲却被敌人掠夺走，带去了恐怖之城纳克萨玛斯。$B$B据说纳克萨玛斯的死亡骑士利用污浊的力量亵渎了这批救赎护甲，并为他们的罪恶目的所用。$B$B这真是个悲剧……",
    ["The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider's Tower. May your ancestors watch over you."] = "你可以在雷霆崖的中央高地找到拍卖行。在双足飞龙飞行点下方附近找找吧，愿你的先祖保佑你。",
    ["The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions."] = "银行位于平静的达纳苏斯城。如果你想存储自己的财物的话，就得去那儿。",
    ["The bank?  Oh, ye mean The Vault!  No safer place to store yer valuables than The Vault. Ye'll find it just northeast of the entrance to Ironforge. "] = "银行？哦，你是说银行！说到存储贵重物品的话，没有什么比银行更安全的地方了。它就在铁炉堡大门的东北方。",
    ["The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.$B$BDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield."] = "阿拉希盆地的战斗是一场谋略战。木材、矿石、食物……所有这些物资对战斗来说都是必需品。$B$B销毁敌方的物资跟在战场上杀死他们一样重要。",
    ["The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose.  We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!"] = "战歌峡谷一役至关重要，我们必须获胜。我们为了荣誉和土地而战，兽人或是他们那些误入歧途的盟友是无法打败我们的！",
    ["The battle goes well. The Scourge forces seem weakened. I believe it will only be a matter of time before we drive them from our shores. I will turn my magics to you, to aid in this struggle."] = "战役进行良好。天灾军团的实力已经被大大削弱了。我相信我们完全能够把他们都赶进海里，这只是时间问题了。我会尽可能地帮助你进行战斗。",
    ["The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.$B$BThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire."] = "战争结束了，达隆郡的人民得救了。$B$B他们得救了，$n，这都归功于你。你是达隆郡的英雄。",
    ["The battle is won. For the time being, the Scourge threat has been pushed back. Our resources can be channeled into aiding you, in thanks and preparation for the future."] = "战争胜利了。目前天灾军团的威胁已经被暂时消除了。我们还有一些剩余资源，如果你需要的话，我可以帮助你，以感激你做出的贡献，并为将来做准备。",
    ["The best miner has a firm grip on $ghis:her; pick, a stout heart in $ghis:her; chest, and thick, black dust in $ghis:her; hair."] = "最好的矿工紧握$g他:她;的铁锄，拥有一颗坚定的心，头发上还散落着一层厚厚的黑灰。",
    ["The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!"] = "虽然现在是和平时期，但是我们可不能荒废了我们的战斗技能！",
    ["The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c.  Our leader, Arch Druid Staghelm, guides us and all of Teldrassil to a renewed life!"] = "塞纳留斯保佑你，$c。我们的首领大德鲁伊鹿盔会带领我们和整个泰达希尔开始全新的生活！",
    ["The blue dragons themselves aren't here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn't be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind."] = "蓝龙玛里苟斯不在那儿，但是他的信徒在。我不清楚这是怎么回事，但是我可以告诉你：蓝龙所在的地方都有希望找到神秘的魔法。如果说龙人在这儿保护某种东西的话，我是不会感到惊讶的……或许是上层精灵遗漏的物品。",
    ["The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area."] = "这具尸体属于一个女性兽人战士。$B$B很明显她是在战斗中死去的，或许是在对付这片地区的野猪人时死亡的。",
    ["The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable."] = "我们脚下的洞穴中有许多奇异的兽皮，如果你想深入其中探险的话，一定要非常小心，$n。要记住你自己的性命比那些兽皮有价值得多。",
    ["The closest gryphon master is located up in Ironforge near The Great Forge itself.  Ye'll need to head to Ironforge if ye want to travel by gryphon."] = "最近的狮鹫管理员居住在铁炉堡的大锻炉附近。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就前往铁炉堡吧。",
    ["The concern that you show for the welfare of your animal companions is commendable.  Bulrug, on the lower rise, can help you with that.  Seek him out between the bank and the inn."] = "你对自己的宠物伙伴表现出的关爱之情是值得赞扬的。矮山上的布尔鲁格能帮助你照看宠物。他居住在银行和旅馆之间的地方，去找他吧。",
    ["The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!"] = "黑暗没有拥抱你这样的$c。别说废话，从我视线中消失吧！滚！",
    ["The days we've spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time."] = "我们在艾萨拉度过的这段日子并不是辉煌而又灿烂的，但是我们仍然年轻而且热血沸腾——我们最终会获得胜利，这只是一个时间问题。",
    ["The death of our flesh marked the birth of our spirit and our sacred task."] = "我们肉体的死亡标志着我们灵魂和神圣使命的重生。",
    ["The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He's always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman's Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  Now, if you don't mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer. "] = "阿雷贡做的食物很受欢迎。他总是在工匠区忙于制作新的美食。要是有 塞纳里奥绿色烹饪的话，你一定要尝尝。  如果你不介意的话，我必须先去调查一下接二连三的鹿群失踪事件。",
    ["The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require."] = "德鲁伊训练师卡尔通常待在多兰纳尔的月亮井。我想他可以对你进行训练。",
    ["The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil."] = "德鲁伊们说大自然把部落从卡利姆多赶出去只是个时间问题。然而堕落继续在我们的大地上蔓延，甚至在泰达希尔这里也是。",
    ["The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such."] = "大地中蕴藏着许多秘密，$c。保护这些秘密是我们永远的职责。",
    ["The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept."] = "元素在跟我们讲话，$c。他们分享着我们必须掌握的知识以及不能泄漏的秘密。",
    ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."] = "倍受尊敬的古斯塔夫·范沃森医生能进一步训练你。他在塞拉摩的兵营里治疗伤兵。",
    ["The exiles of Gnomeregan find ourselves in even more dire straits by running low on cloth reserves!  Perhaps you can help us, eh?!$B$BBring me extra cloth pieces you might have to help us replenish our stocks.  By donating them, you'll be earning the respect and trust of gnomes everywhere.  That's something that money can't buy!  Well, I guess cloth does, but that's beside the point..."] = "诺莫瑞根的流亡者需要大量的布料资源！也许你可以帮帮我们，是不是？$B$B把你多余的布料资源带给我们。通过捐献它们，你可以获得所有侏儒的尊重。这是金钱无法换的的！好吧，布料可以帮助我们，但是它们意义绝不限于这些……",
    ["The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?$B$BThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.$B$BIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me."] = "地狱犬……确实是一个邪恶的生物。它不像地狱火那样强壮，但是聪明的术士知道蛮力不总是解决的办法——如果是，你就会选择战士了，不是吗？$B$B地狱犬利用敌人的法力，用它和它的迅速来战胜敌人。它的力量来自奥术并利用那种奥术能量为自己谋利。$B$B如果你想得知更多关于地狱火的事，那么你该找我对面的玛迦兹谈谈。",
    ["The first steps of our fight against the Scourge go well. We have had some successes, and hopefully my assistance can aid you in bringing future success to the battle."] = "我们针对天灾军团的第一步战役进行得非常良好。我们已经获得了一些胜利，希望我的协助能让你取得更多的胜利。",
    ["The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.  Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.$B$BAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet."] = "世上第一套无畏护甲是专为血色十字军领袖莫格莱尼设计并锻造的。当穿上全套的无畏护甲之后，这位大领主看上去就像是一位来自扭曲虚空的恶魔。$B$B哎……我至尽还忘不了那时的情景，莫格莱尼高举着灰烬使者，在成百上千的天灾军团士兵中穿入穿出，燃烧着敌人与自己的生命，带起一阵阵烈炎与烟尘，身后留下敌人被烧成灰烬的尸骸。",
    ["The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause."] = "泰达希尔海岸边的鱼儿又大又精神。有传言说那是因为我们新的世界之树的快速增长而引起的。",
    ["The forest told me of your presence, but not why you were here. So, speak and enlighten me."] = "森林告知我你的存在，但是没有说你为什么在这里。那么，告诉我真相吧。",
    ["The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus."] = "草药的收集和与之相关的知识是菲罗迪恩·唤月的专长。去达纳苏斯西南部的神殿花园找他吧。",
    ["The goblin racer packs a lot of punch, but the gnomes hid a trick or two in their car..."] = "地精的赛车马力强劲，但侏儒的赛车也有不少独到之处……",
    ["The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons."] = "我可没法教你战斗时如何保持优雅姿态，我只能教你如何使用武器。",
    ["The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?"] = "草地柔软青葱。空气清新，阳光明媚，歌声飘飘。泰达希尔的梦想终成现实。但是为什么我感到有种不详的预兆？",
    ["The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed."] = "狮鹫管理员监管着飞进飞出暴风城的所有狮鹫。如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找他吧。",
    ["The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes."] = "塞拉摩的卫兵都是原本驻扎在卡利姆多的联盟精英力量。即使远离了家园，但我们还是会努力维护联盟的律法。",
    ["The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training."] = "好好利用自然界的草药，它会成为你有力的助手的。去本娜的炼金店找她吧，接受更多训练。",
    ["The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?"] = "人类和他们所谓的阿拉索联军想把我们赶出阿拉希盆地。我可不这么想，$c！你得动身前往那儿，证明该离开阿拉希盆地的是他们而不是污染者，准备好了吗？",
    ["The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood."] = "在阿拉希盆地跟被遗忘者作战的人类需要你的帮助。去武器大厅找他们的代表杜纳尔·奥斯古德谈谈。",
    ["The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.$b$bThe Warchief told us to leave the humans alone, so long as they didn't cross our borders, but it appears someone violated his wishes.$b$bHe has put me in charge of getting to the bottom of it. If you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me."] = "人类在贫瘠之地的边界处建了一座旅店，他们叫它树荫旅店。几个星期前，这家旅店被烧掉了。$b$b酋长让我们别去搭理那些人类——除非他们越过边境，不过看来有人违背了酋长的意愿。$b$b他让我负责查明事情的真相。如果你想帮忙的话，就去查看一下树荫旅店的废墟，把你能找到的线索都给我带回来。",
    ["The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back."] = "人类宣称尘泥沼泽是他们的领地，但是石锤部族在我们的帮助下将他们赶了回去。",
    ["The humans definitely need all of our help in Arathi Basin.  The one that you wish to speak to is named Keras Wolfheart.  He stands ready to assist you on the Warrior's Terrace."] = "阿拉希盆地的人类急需我们的帮助。你得找战士区的克拉斯·沃夫哈特谈谈，他会帮助你的。",
    ["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"] = "奥特兰克本地出产的山羊对我们的骑兵至关重要！",
    ["The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.$B$BIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me."] = "地狱火是术士在$G他:她;在战斗中所能使用最强大的恶魔。这个怪物很强大，护甲很厚，并能给任何敌人造成极大的伤害。如果你想把地狱火的灵魂加到你的武器上，你就会得到那些好处——更多的生命值和更快的生命恢复速度。$B$B如果你想了解更多关于地狱犬的事，那你就该与我对面的温图拉谈谈。",
    ["The kegs are filled with strong brew!  Drink, friend, and celebrate!"] = "美酒良辰！尽情地喝吧，我的朋友，尽情地狂欢吧！",
    ["The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.$B$BThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..."] = "菲拉斯的土地经历了岁月的洗礼，$r。大地、树木和生物，它们改变着菲拉斯的现状和未来。$B$B跟这儿所发生的一切相比，双塔山可以算是亘古不变的了……",
    ["The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud."] = "铁匠的生活可不轻松，但是它能让你体格健壮，充满热情。我的父亲是一名铁匠，我的祖父曾经在格瑞姆巴托的炼铁炉工作。现在，我的儿子也跟随着我们的脚步，他让我倍感自豪。",
    ["The magi congregate in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter. Quite a tower they have there. Makes our barracks look like peasant hovels."] = "法师们都聚集在法师区的巫师圣殿里，那里有一座高塔。和它相比，我们的兵营就好像是一座农舍。",
    ["The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.$B$BTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!"] = "作为灰谷猎场最强大的野兽，沙普塔隆可以在这片大地自封的卫兵——暗夜精灵的陪伴下自由的漫步。沙普塔隆在这里南部寻找猎物，尽情的撕裂着毫无防备的旅客。$B$B要想杀死这样一个野兽需要极大的努力，$N。我希望你在猎杀这个野兽时运气好一点！",
    ["The nearest bank ye'll find is The Vault in Ironforge, $glad : lass;. "] = "最近的银行就是铁炉堡银行，$g小伙子:姑娘;。",
    ["The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands."] = "针太细，线太粗，针脚倒还不错。我们与萨尔和其他人的合约将继续有效。部落不会被驱逐出这片土地的。",
    ["The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it."] = "死者在这片荒地长眠，$c。我们必须小心，别惊动他们。",
    ["The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?"] = "从事某种专业的学习是一个长期的过程，但是回报很丰厚。你想选择什么样的专业？",
    ["The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead."] = "这地方通风良好……但是我还在乎什么？我已经死了。",
    ["The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey..."] = "我的二十英尺高的火鸡烤肉架的计划快要完成了！现在我需要的就是一只二十英尺高的火鸡了……",
    ["The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  Go now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!"] = "月神的力量支配着你！月神的力量支配着你！  出发吧！去达纳苏斯东部的月神殿中央大厅找贾德莉亚！",
    ["The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.$B$BWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well."] = "地穴恶魔在狩猎与杀戮天敌的过程中所表现出来的那些超自然能力，一直是我们这类人所赞赏与模仿的对象。是的，我，一个在远征中手刃过成百上千天灾军团所圈养的野兽的人。$B$B尽管我也对地穴恶魔那残忍无情的天性十分厌恶，但也必须正视它的能力。它总是能够完美地完成自己的工作。",
    ["The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how."] = "附魔体现了毁灭和新生的循环，这正是自然界的基本准则。晨行者附魔师将为你展示这一切。",
    ["The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means 'sharp claw,' but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do."] = "安戈洛这里的暴掠龙看起来与贫瘠之地的猛禽有关--非常聪明，十分灵活，还有一种行为的感觉或是守则。其中我所遇到的最伟大的是拉克维。他是我所见过的最危险的动物之一。在牛头人语，拉克维的意思是“锋利的爪子，”但那对他并不公平。$B$B如果你计划猎杀拉克维的话，千万不要低估他，但如果你决定要这样做，无论如何我都会帮你的。",
    ["The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood."] = "斯坦索姆位于东部瘟疫之地瘟疫林的北部。",
    ["The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas."] = "厄运之棰位于菲拉斯的中部。",
    ["The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert."] = "祖尔法拉克遗迹位于塔纳利斯沙漠最西北角。",
    ["The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more."] = "四季轮回变幻，但是你年纪尚轻。当你经历更多之后再来找我们吧，$C。",
    ["The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!"] = "巨甲虫的能量所隐藏的秘密将引发科学界的一场大变革！",
    ["The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen's Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus."] = "泰龙尼斯制作武器的技能无与伦比。他不会收学生的钱，你该为此感到庆幸。去吧，去达纳苏斯东北部的工匠区找他吧。",
    ["The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don't you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?"] = "剥皮匠通常会把所有的兽皮豆带到铁炉堡去风干。你为什么不去那儿看看是否能找人训练你呢？",
    ["The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them. "] = "灵魂将你带到我这儿来，感谢他们。",
    ["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"] = "灵魂引导你来到我这儿。我要怎么帮你？",
    ["The spirits of Silithus call out to us, $n.  The land weeps, for it has a woeful story to tell..."] = "希利苏斯的灵魂召唤我们，$n。土地在哭泣，它有个悲惨的故事要告诉我们……",
    ["The spirits told me you would come, that you would seek me for some reason, but that even you may not know that reason. So, do you know why you are here?"] = "灵魂告诉我说你会来的，你会出于某种原因来此寻找我，但是你也许自己都不清楚这个原因。那么，你知道你为什么会在这儿吗？",
    ["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."] = "星光指引着新的道路，未来燃起希望和力量的灯塔。",
    ["The strongest hides come from those kodo that have laid themselves to rest in this wasteland."] = "这些栖息在这片荒地上的科多兽的兽皮最为坚韧。",
    ["The theory behind it is that we completely destroy you with a massive explosion wherever you are and send those particles through a dimensional rip and then re-implode you at the machine here.   Instant Transport!    It might not work ALL the time, but what kind of goblin engineer are you!   If survival was your first priority you could never be a real Goblin Engineer!Here is the recipe you will need to make the Dimensional Ripper and try it out!"] = "这个机器所依据的理论就是通过一次大爆破将你完全摧毁，然后把你的粒子通过空间裂隙传送到某个地点，再通过反爆破模块将你在目的地重组。这是即时的传送！它并不是百分之百有效的，但是你是个杰出的地精技师！如果你把性命看得比发明创造更重要，那么你永远都无法成为一个真正的地精技师！ 这是制作空间撕裂器所需的图纸，你一定要试试看！",
    ["The things I have done... such horrible things...$B$B<Tarsis begins to sob.>"] = "我所犯下的错误……多么可怕的错误……$B$B，<塔希斯的声音呜咽了起来。>",
    ["The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!"] = "我要教你的东西会让你头脑混乱的！当你学到足够的知识后再来找我吧！",
    ["The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I'd expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!$B$BLok'tar Ogar!"] = "战争犹如箭在弦上，$C！部落和联盟都做好了充分的准备。所有的战争物资都将如约运往希利苏斯。预计货物将在$2113w天内抵达。当军队准备就绪时，那位完成修复流沙节杖的艰巨任务的英雄将敲响甲虫之台上的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。一场旷世之战也将随即拉开序幕！$B$B部落万岁！",
    ["The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!"] = "时机成熟了，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;们，武装起来，从亡灵天灾手中夺回属于我们的夜晚！",
    ["The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste."] = "我们所处的这个时期就像风云般变化无常，$c。要谨记这世上什么才是真实而长久的，并好好保存它。其余的事物都毫无用处。",
    ["The tinkerer's craft for you is it?  No doubt ye'll want to go see Springspindle Fizzlegear in Tinker Town.  Just head east from the gates of Ironforge, or follow the sound of the explosions."] = "你想学习工匠的手艺吗？那你就得去工匠区找宾斯匹德。  从铁炉堡大门一直往正东方向走，或者朝着传来爆炸声的方向走。",
    ["The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me."] = "我的头衔可能有会让人误解我。与我相处久了，你就会知道我其实是一个很好相处的人。",
    ["The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet."] = "奥格瑞玛地形迂回曲折，能有效地阻止入侵者。你能想象这些矮小的侏儒在多么短的时间内就迷失方向吗？哈哈！如果够幸运的话，我会追踪到他们，将他们变成我的宠物。",
    ["The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.$B$BThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!"] = "必须使用源质对重生之瓶进行加固。我只知道这种矿物的一种原料：位于这个世界核心中的元素领域。$B$B塑地者对这种东西的了解比我多得多。你必须找到塑地者！",
    ["The village of Astranaar in Ashenvale is Elder Riversong's current home."] = "水歌长者目前住在灰谷的阿斯特兰纳。",
    ["The village of Dolanaar atop Teldrassil is home to Elder Bladeleaf."] = "锋叶长者的家在泰达希尔顶部的小村庄多兰纳尔。",
    ["The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $N.  This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it's quite necessary that all of us do our part to help."] = "与部落之间的战争已经到了白热化的阶段，$n。联盟需要大量的物资，我们应竭尽所能，提供帮助。",
    ["The warrior's role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken."] = "战士的任务之一就是保护。正如我们在战场上保护自己的同伴一样，我们要时刻保护被遗忘者的利益。",
    ["The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause..."] = "水元素正在跟火元素交战，也就是说他们也在跟我们作战。他们的领袖之一的海达克希斯正在召集士兵……",
    ["The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  $B$BLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath."] = "你必须去西部荒野的海洋搜寻，向正西方——金海岸矿洞与海岸交接处往西北方向。海岸边有一只锚，看来附近一定有艘沉船。水下的压力很大；如果游得太远的话，即使是最优秀的潜水者也可能死于疲劳。$B$B去找一处适宜的自然环境吧，$n——这附近有起泡的海底裂缝，能在深海潜水时提供氧气。",
    ["The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman.  Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge.  Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village."] = "德鲁伊的生活方式跟萨满相差无几。根妮亚·符文图腾正在对此进行研究。去血蹄村东面的大营帐中找她吧。",
    ["The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals..."] = "加德纳尔的行事准则是隐晦奸诈。别在这儿探头探脑，$C，否则你的灵魂就会被永远禁锢在此……",
    ["The world is indebted to you and your allies, $n."] = "整个世界都感激你和你的同伴们所做的一切，$n。",
    ["Then Orgrimmar is where you need to go.  The north road out of Razor Hill leads directly there.  Just talk to one of the grunts there and they can give you further directions."] = "你得去奥格瑞玛。出了剃刀岭沿着北面的道路走，就能到那儿了。跟那儿的守卫谈谈，他们会给你指明方向的。",
    ["Then head over to Bena's Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing."] = "到中部高地的“本娜的炼金店”去找本娜，她可以指导你学习配制药剂的方法。",
    ["Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep."] = "战场军官",
    ["Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise."] = "你一定是在说泰姆·狂暴图腾。去猎人高地找他。",
    ["Then listen well, $r.$B$BSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.$B$BPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."] = "那么听好了，$c。$B$B几个月前，湖畔镇的镇长派遣特使来到铁炉堡，恳求国王一同抵抗入侵赤脊山的黑石兽人。$B$B铁炉堡公主茉艾拉自愿前去援助，于是国王就指派了20个精英守卫，确保公主由洛克湖前往湖畔镇的途中一路平安，我也在卫队中。",
    ["There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later."] = "必须首先学习一些基础知识。蒂安娜就站在旁边，找她谈谈然后回来找我。",
    ["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."] = "战争是有代价的，$c……这种代价常常被我们忽略。艾泽拉斯大地冲突迭起，到处都是失去双亲的孤儿。那些无家可归的孤儿没有别的地方可去，他们通常在这儿成长，到了自力更生的年龄才离开。$B$B联盟将春季的某一周设为儿童周，为这些无辜的孩子赠送物品。",
    ["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children's Week."] = "战争是有代价的，$c……这种代价常常被我们忽略。艾泽拉斯大地冲突迭起，到处都是失去双亲的孤儿。那些无家可归的孤儿没有别的地方可去，他们通常在这儿成长，到了自力更生的年龄才离开。$B$B部落将春季的某一周设为儿童周，为这些无辜的孩子赠送物品。",
    ["There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know."] = "在我帮你之前你必须学会一些基础的东西。与我的徒弟范恩谈谈。他很耐心而且愿意教你所需的知识。",
    ["There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I've heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean. "] = "在暴风城，有很多地方可供饮水休息，但是只有一处可以过夜。去贸易区的镶金玫瑰吧。我听说客房的费用相当合理，被单也很整洁。",
    ["There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek."] = "泰达希尔有许多你需要去看看的地方。告诉我你在找什么。",
    ["There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin..."] = "只要有耐心和决心，很多秘密都是有可能解开的。现在，让我们开始吧……",
    ["There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss."] = "费伍德的某些植物或许能因为塞纳里奥植物药膏的效用而避免堕落。我知道如何从几种不同的东西中获取这种药膏，凭借你的能力，你会发现有多种方法可以协助我制造药膏。$B$B首先，你需要一盏塞纳里奥信标，它是一种能让你看到肉眼所看不到的堕落和腐烂力量的装置。",
    ["There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?"] = "在艾尔文森林只有少数职业的训练师。你在找谁？",
    ["There are several battlegrounds from which to choose.  To which battlemaster shall I send you?"] = "有许多战场可供选择，你要去哪一个呢？",
    ["There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "很多人都试图追随着潜行者的脚步，但是只有暗夜精灵能真正被黑夜接受。如果你想在阴暗的道路上前行的话，就去塞纳里奥区找塞尤娜吧。",
    ["There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further."] = "在北方的雷霆崖，你能学到草药学。沿着村外的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部。那儿的守卫能为你指明方向。",
    ["There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer. Care to learn more?"] = "年轻的流浪者，有比铁锤和熔炉更能使钢铁坚固的方法。想学学吗？",
    ["There aren't any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye're going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter's profession."] = "据我所知，丹莫罗是没有附魔师的。如果你想成为一名附魔师的话，就去铁炉堡吧。",
    ["There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.$B$BOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom."] = "我们陷入生存危机。我们陷入困境，寻找答案，希望在黑暗中闪闪发光。$B$B那时，$n，就是我们迈向自由的第一步。",
    ["There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions."] = "在我的家乡雷霆崖，有一位铁匠训练者。如果你想成为一名铁匠的话，就朝北走，去雷霆崖，然后问问那儿的守卫吧。",
    ["There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north.  Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions."] = "在北方的雷霆崖，有一名双足飞龙管理员。乘坐电梯到达雷霆崖顶部，问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。",
    ["There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there."] = "在血蹄村的东边，有一座巨大的营帐。纳姆·逐星在那儿等着你呢。",
    ["There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District."] = "在暴风城银行和贸易区的镶金玫瑰旅店之间设有邮箱，非常便利。",
    ["There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you'll find in the center of Darnassus."] = "在达纳苏斯的东北部，也就是工匠区，你会在旅馆外面找到邮箱的。",
    ["There is a powerful infernal named Kroshius northeast of this camp. It is why Niby is here. Kroshius is a greater infernal - an infernal that has lasted longer than expected. You see, nub, an infernal crashes down into the earth with great intensity to serve its master but this intensity fades fast. Once the blazing flames have died down, the infernal crumbles."] = "在这座营地的东北面有一个名叫克罗苏斯的强大的地狱火。这就是尼比待在这儿的原因。克罗苏斯极其强大，前所未闻。你瞧，菜鸟，地狱火以极高的速度坠落在地面上，但是它的生命却很短暂。一旦火焰熄灭，地狱火便崩溃了。",
    ["There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."] = "利用敌人的兽皮来保护自己这一想法运用了拟态学的知识。要进一步提高制皮技能，你得去雷霆崖防具店找库纳。",
    ["There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation.  On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest.  You will find him there."] = "人总是要休息的。在血蹄村的西边，旅店老板考乌斯经营着一家很大的旅馆，为人们提供休息之所。你去那儿找他吧。",
    ["There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser.  He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman."] = "村子里居住着一位名叫纳姆·逐星的智者。他能继续训练你，使你成为一名真正的萨满。",
    ["There is an Engineering Trainer in Razor Hill.  He is called Mukdrak and can usually be found standing over near the forge."] = "在剃刀岭居住着一名工程学训练师。他名叫穆德拉克，你在熔炉附近就能找到他。",
    ["There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help.  Why don't you go pay him a visit?"] = "居住在北郡和暴风城之间的山上的一位炼金师或许能帮上忙。你为什么不去找他呢？",
    ["There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession.  I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction."] = "暴风城中的某位侏儒肯定能教你，而且我相信暴风城的守卫能为你指明方向。",
    ["There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.Drat... now I am hungry."] = "在雷霆崖，你肯定找不到比阿丝卡·迷雾行者更好的厨师。嗯……我在这里都可以闻到他正在烹制的美味佳肴。你可以在中部高地的厨房里找到她。  呃……我又饿了。",
    ["There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave."] = "没有比编织更好的宁神方法了。",
    ["There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don't even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel."] = "我没有什么东西可以教你了，现在你可以走了。不要想接近萨鲁，因为像你一样卑微的家伙，他只会用你们的血来炼钢。",
    ["There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n."] = "我知道在雷霆崖有人可以帮助你进入奥特兰克山谷。去猎人高地找泰姆·狂暴图腾。希望你找到你希望找的人，$N。",
    ["There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training."] = "赫加斯掌握的知识远胜于我。你得去石爪山脉的太阳石居所找他，继续训练。",
    ["There is only one whose skills exceed my own. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman."] = "安诺拉是唯一一个在技能上胜过我的人。你得去……奥达曼找她，学习更多知识。",
    ["There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance."] = "在幽暗城中居住着一位蝙蝠管理员。出了布瑞尔城朝南走，然后在丁字路口向西走。洛丹伦废墟就在你的右边，穿过废墟，然后进入幽暗城。你可以问问那儿的守卫，请求他们的帮助。",
    ["There's a Skinning Trainer in Orgrimmar.  To get there head north up the road out of Razor Hill.  Ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for directions when you arrive."] = "在奥格瑞玛有一名剥皮训练者。出了剃刀岭往北走，当你到达奥格瑞玛时问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。",
    ["There's a great cook who works at the Pig and Whistle Tavern in Old Town.  I've watched him use a knife when he cooks and just between you and me, I don't think he's always been a cook.  Don't get me wrong... if you still want to learn, he's the best we have."] = "有一名优秀的厨师在旧城区的猪与哨声旅店工作。我曾在他身旁看他在烹饪时使用刀具，但是我可不认为他只是一名厨师。别误会我的意思……如果你想学厨艺的话，他会是你最好的老师。",
    ["There's a mage at the Thunderbrew Distillery who might be able to teach you some new spells.  I believe his name is Magis Sparkmantle."] = "住在雷酒酿造厂的一名法师或许能教你一些新的魔法。我想他名叫玛济斯·石衣。",
    ["There's an excellent skinner that lives up in the house by Crystal Lake.  She's bound to be able to show you how to get started in the skinner's profession."] = "在水晶湖畔居住着一名技艺高超的剥皮师。她可以教你这项专业的入门技能。",
    ["There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?"] = "有一名草药师跟炼金师一同居住在暴风城东面的山上。完美的搭配，不是吗？",
    ["There's no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you're thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow."] = "在凯尔达隆，你不能四处游荡、行乞、诅咒、斗殴，也不能随心所欲 。",
    ["There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather."] = "除了对色彩和细节的鉴别能力外，我没有什么可以教你的。跟西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈；他知道很多制皮的高级技能。",
    ["There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "我没有什么可教你的了。但是，我听说有位名叫安尼希尔的暗夜精灵也许能教你。她居住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。",
    ["There's nothing quite like communing with nature... or at least that's what the night elves tell me.  I'm not much for talking to flowers and trees, but I'm sure Tannysa could help you out.  She's over in the Mage Quarter outside of Alchemy Needs."] = "与自然的交流沟通是其他任何事情都无可比拟的……至少暗夜精灵是这么告诉我的。我并不擅长跟花草树木交谈，但是我想塔尼莎能帮助你。她居住在法师区外侧的炼金材料店。",
    ["There's one in Orgrimmar.  A grunt up there will know what directions to give you.  Just head north up the road here, you can't miss it."] = "在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。那儿的守卫会为你指明方向的。朝着北方的道路走，应该不会错过的。",
    ["There's one in Orgrimmar.  Go north and talk to one of their grunts."] = "在奥格瑞玛有你要找的人。朝着北方走，跟那儿的守卫谈谈。",
    ["There's one of those inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill.  Look for Rawrk."] = "拉乌克就在剃刀岭东边的兵营中。",
    ["There's only one hunter around here I would have ye talk to, and that would be Grif Wildheart.  Ye'll find him standing just outside the smithy in Kharanos."] = "这附近只有一名猎人，那就是格瑞夫。他就站在卡拉诺斯的铁匠铺外。",
    ["There's only one person I know of who is more learned in the art of tailoring than myself. Last I heard he could be found in Theramore Isle. He is the person you should seek."] = "我只知道有一个人能在裁缝技能上胜过我。我最后一次听说他在塞拉摩岛。你该去找他。",
    ["Therum Deepforge is the dwarf you want to talk to. One of the finest blacksmiths around if you ask me. You can find him in the heart of the Dwarven District."] = "你应该去找瑟鲁姆·深炉谈谈，他是我见过的最好的矮人铁匠。你可以在矮人区的中心地带找到他。",
    ["These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you're Horde or Alliance."] = "现在是危险时分，$r。远古的邪魔复活了，他可不管你是部落还是联盟。",
    ["These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly."] = "现在是危险时期，冒险者。多加小心。",
    ["These great beasts know paths that ye can't find on foot, they'll get ye there fast and maybe show ye something new at the same time."] = "这些巨兽比你更会寻找道路，它们能让你更快地到达目的地，而且还可轻松欣赏沿途的美景。",
    ["These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!"] = "这片美丽的森林受到了可怕的诅咒！腐化的力量将这儿变成了一片恐惧之地。如果你跟他们不是一伙的，或许你能帮助我夺回费伍德森林。",
    ["These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!"] = "这种车赛是展现我们高新科技的大好机会！",
    ["They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner."] = "他们差点把我的兄弟洛克希给派来了。他连自己的狗都照顾不了，还是让那些能够展现血色十字军实力的人来这里吧。",
    ["They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?"] = "他们说我愚蠢，我要证明自己的实力。我要关注所有的罐子，证明它们都能煮东西。我的好运就要来了！谁是愚蠢的人，嗯？嗯！？",
    ["They don't realize that they're dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.$B$BYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.$B$BNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.$B$BNow leave me to my sorrows."] = "他们并未意识到自己已经死了，$r。他们受到诅咒，在头脑中保留了这个城镇被毁灭之前的记忆，大部分是这样，还有一部分人更为不幸。$B$B你认为是亡灵天灾所为？那时亡灵天灾还不存在呢，就算是它们的话，我们也会与它们展开一场恶战的。$B$B不，这场恐怖而极具破坏性的瘟疫源于通灵学院，它摧毁了整座城镇，无人生还。$B$B让我独自承受这悲伤吧。",
    ["They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit."] = "他们将尸体交给了我，他将尸体投进了深坑。",
    ["They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival."] = "他们挂起灯笼是为了庆祝春节。",
    ["They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway."] = "他们说小洞不补大洞……什么来着？啊，我记不得了。反正是愚蠢的说法。",
    ["They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age."] = "他们说我被祝福了：新世纪需要被聆听的传讯者。",
    ["They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Booty Bay!"] = "晚上会有焰火表演，从下午6点直到第二天早上，藏宝海湾的天空将会绽开无数绚丽的花朵！",
    ["They're going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune'ara!"] = "整晚都会有烟花表演，从下午6点直到黎明，月神湖的上空将会绽放无数美丽的花朵！",
    ["They've been stolen, $r! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours."] = "被偷啦，$r！我们最珍贵的三卷卷轴。如果你能找回来的话，一定会得到丰厚的报酬的。",
    ["This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "这只熊漫步在一条靠近石爪小径的路上，在密斯特拉湖和联盟的银风避难所正西方。虽然他是你在灰谷遇到的三个动物之中最好对付的一个，对他也不能掉以轻心。他的出现对于逗留在灰谷和石爪山脉之间的旅客来说是一个巨大的威胁。",
    ["This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry."] = "这块美味的樱桃馅饼能让小侏儒喜极而泣。",
    ["This cultist is in a deep trance..."] = "这个信徒陷入了恍惚的状态……",
    ["This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What's it's name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff."] = "这个码头？你可以乘船前往暗夜精灵的领地。地名？嗯，我想是奥伯丁。我不太确定，我只是一名搬运工。",
    ["This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there."] = "这片森林容易使人迷路！要小心。",
    ["This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I've got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice."] = "这是用钱能够建造出的最好最先进的交通工具。什么？矿道地铁？侏儒？听着，朋友，如果你相信那种废物的话，我就把荆棘谷中的那尊雕像卖给你。那么，你到底是要走着去格罗姆高营地，还是乘坐这架精美的飞行机器？你选吧。",
    ["This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?"] = "还没准备好收拾这张皮。我希望做皮革不要花太多时间。肯定有办法削减等待的时间。这对我身体不太好，你知道吗？",
    ["This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here."] = "这是个危险的地方，$n。要小心。",
    ["This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there."] = "我们彼此都在浪费时间！如果你想接受训练的话，就去找格拉哈姆·范·塔伦吧！他就站在右边。",
    ["This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year."] = "这份工作明显不值16500的年薪。",
    ["This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680's maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot."] = "今天碰巧是你的幸运日；我完成了超级商人680型的维护工作，因此有大量物品以超低的价格出售。你自己去看看吧……我的兄弟考克认为他的贸易机器人1000型会胜过我的。",
    ["This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things."] = "这种工作胆小鬼做不了的。我有个叔叔丢了一只手！可怜的老胖子……无论如何，如果你还感兴趣我或许能给你看些东西？",
    ["This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late..."] = "或许这会令你震惊，但是近来的事情不是那么顺利……",
    ["This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated."] = "这只黑豹传言在暗夜精灵和他们的同盟面前很驯服，这使她成为一个更有价值的对手。萨杜布拉的猎杀路线把她从瑞恩伍德居所赶到了我们的西方，最终在那里的正西方登陆。她的皮毛是沥青一般的颜色，而她的速度也不能低估。",
    ["This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?"] = "这套装备真的让我眼前一亮，你觉得呢？显然，我有多种技能可以使用，我可以将贸易的一些诀窍与你分享。听好了。",
    ["This pie is so good, would you like some?"] = "这馅饼真好吃，你要尝尝吗？",
    ["This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what."] = "虽然每次我都使用了相同的成分，但配制出的药水似乎都达不到预期的治疗效果。这只能得出一个结论：植物发生了变化。我还不清楚具体原因。",
    ["This war's not over, it's only just begun!  We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, $n.  It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls."] = "这场战争还没有结束，它才刚刚开始！勇敢的士兵日日夜夜在安其拉与敌人血战，很快，这座其拉虫人的城市就要陷落了。",
    ["This was the site of a great battle.  Many great battles."] = "这儿就是那场声势浩大的战争的遗址。那些伟大的战争啊。",
    ["Thorfin Stoneshield came to us all the way from Ironforge to bring us his expertise in hunting.  If you don't mind breathing the smoke filled air of the Dwarven District then you'll find him at his house in the northeast area of the district."] = "索尔芬·石盾从铁炉堡而来，让我们见识到了什么叫真正的狩猎艺术。如果你不介意被烟熏得泪流满面，就到矮人区去找他吧。他的屋子就在那个区域的东北部。",
    ["Thorium Brotherhood or not, if one of them Dark Iron gets near to me they'll taste my mattock up the side of their head!  Now, where can I send ya $G lad : lass;?"] = "不管我是不是瑟银兄弟会的，只要有个黑铁矮人敢靠近我，我一定会让他们尝尝我的厉害！现在，你想去哪里呢，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？",
    ["Those filthy beasts are all over the place.$B$BIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance."] = "这些污秽的野兽爬满了四处。$B$B如果你喜欢户外狩猎的话，你可以轻松地在病木林和恐惧谷找到它们的，恶蛛隧道里也有大量生存。当然，任何东瘟疫之地的天灾营地里也都会有它们的身影。$B$B此外，如果你真是一个特别优秀的地下城冒险专家的话，你还能在斯坦索姆找到一些，而通灵学院里也有一些通灵魔。",
    ["Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman's Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury."] = "尽管我可以将覆盖着整个泰达希尔的草坪当作很好的床铺，但是工匠区中塞琳尼经营的旅馆对那些享受一下奢华生活的人来说再合适不过了。",
    ["Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?"] = "虽然十字路口似乎是贫瘠之地的中心地带，但是我更喜欢陶拉祖营地的安静。你想去哪儿？",
    ["Thrall has shown great kindness in granting me sanctuary within his domain.  I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate.  It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our leader."] = "萨尔在他的领地里给了我一片安身立命之所，展示出了无比的宽容与善良。我也不想在这里停留得过久。否则，如果我给我们的领袖带来了麻烦，那实在是太耻辱了。",
    ["Thrall's Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall's most accomplished and honored soldiers.$B$BI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.$B$BIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.$B$BA decision I would later regret."] = "作为萨尔手下最强大的二十名战士，我们被称为萨尔近卫军。$B$B在等待奥格瑞玛的命令时，我要求在诅咒之地边境建立一座营地。但是数星期过去了，酋长那里还是没有任何消息传来，我们开始变得有些焦躁不安了。$B$B$n，那是个错误的决定。我曾经年轻而又雄心勃勃，无所畏惧。这支部队在我的指挥下开进了诅咒之地。$B$B不久之后我就开始后悔了。",
    ["Throm'ka $c!  Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?"] = "你好，$c！你准备参加战歌峡谷的战斗了吗？为了部落！",
    ["Throm'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde's war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.$B$BIf you have questions, you should ask them."] = "你好，部落的$C。我是督军格尔库克，部落物资收集行动的指挥官。艰难的岁月就要来临，但我们还是会获胜的，胜利永远属于我们。$B$B如果你有什么问题，就去问问他们吧。",
    ["Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone."] = "你好, $c。我今天情绪很差，所以除非你能帮我，否则我更愿意自己呆着。",
    ["Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?"] = "你好！陌生人，你在找什么？",
    ["Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar's avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.$B$BYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.$B$BI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?"] = "通过研究，我发现在哈卡的化身被击败之后，他的力量也会随之减弱。但是哈卡的大部分力量仍保留在扭曲虚空的深处。$B$B你曾经击败过哈卡的化身，$n。或许再次击败他的话就可以进一步削弱他的力量，也许有一天我们就将面对他的真身。$B$B我为你准备了一张卷轴，你可以用它在堕神圣地中再次召唤哈卡的化身。你敢再次迎接哈卡的挑战吗？",
    ["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "在严格的训练中，我必须除去那些学生先前所学的所有知识，以便传授新知识。我所提供的服务越来越难以完成。为此，每次训练的费用也越来越昂贵。你愿意除去你先前学习的技能吗？",
    ["Through the milennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior's Terrace if you desire training."] = "通过千百次的锤炼，伊琳尼雅·月火已经掌握了若干种武器的使用方法，现在她为别人提供训练。如果你想接受训练的话，就去战士区找她吧。",
    ["Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag."] = "苏尔德将教你如何练习技能。去暗巷区的科多兽皮工店找他吧。",
    ["Ticket redemption here!  Get your tickets turned into prizes!  Step right up!"] = "兑换奖券啦！换取礼物啦！快来啊！",
    ["Time is running out for me... for us all..."] = "我的时间不多了……我们的时间都不多了……",
    ["Tips are always graciously accepted, friend."] = "朋友，招待生总是乐意收到小费的。",
    ["Tirth's not himself these days, and neither is his assistant."] = "这些天提尔斯和他的助手都变得怪怪的。",
    ["To catch Gahz'ranka, you'll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make 'em myself!$B$BBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!$B$BWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle's Point in Zul'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz'ranka is sure to come a'stomping!"] = "你需要一种特殊的臭泥鱼诱饵来捕捉加兹兰卡。这些鱼饵是我亲自制作的！$B$B但是除了鱼饵之外，你还需要臭泥鱼……你得把臭泥鱼放入诱饵，让它充满臭味！$B$B将做好的诱饵放到祖尔格拉布中的帕格渔点……然后就坐下来喝酒等待……你无需等太久，因为加兹兰卡肯定会迫不及待地上钩！",
    ["To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?  "] = "战死沙场是件光荣的事儿！但是，若是你能利用我教你的东西，或许你不会死得那么快，嗯？",
    ["To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need. "] = "为了让上来观光的旅行者安全地下去，我可以为你提供翅膀。",
    ["To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c.  For this, the Coins of Ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect.$B$BDuring this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders.  As you do so, you will acquire the Coins of Ancestry.  Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items."] = "尊重你的长辈同样也是尊重你的文化与人民，$c。而先祖硬币则是对遵循这样一条古老礼仪之道的人的赞许。$B$B在春节期间，你可以拜访许多长者，对他们表达你的尊敬。如果你这样做了，你将会得到先祖硬币。将这些硬币带回来，我会因你的勤奋而允许你从一些特殊的物品中选择一个作为奖励。",
    ["To learn to be one with Nature in the eyes of the Earth Mother, this is a matter of pride.  If your will is to learn the ways of the Hunter you must seek out Yaw Sharpmane at the north end of Bloodhoof Village."] = "在大地之母心目中，学习如何与自然融合一体是件荣耀的事儿。如果你想成为一名猎人，你必须去血蹄村北部找雅文·刺鬃。",
    ["To learn to cure leather and work with hides go to Orgrimmar to the north.  One of the Orgrimmar Grunts will be able to tell you the way to the Leatherworking Trainer."] = "要学习如何处理皮革，你得去北面的奥格瑞玛。那儿的守卫会告诉你如何找到制皮训练师的。",
    ["To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore."] = "为了与大陆保持联系，我们会定期派出角鹰兽在鲁瑟兰村和黑海岸之间传递信息的。",
    ["To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil."] = "想要找到鲁瑟兰村的渡船，你得先去达纳苏斯，通过传送门进入鲁瑟兰村。",
    ["To win this war, we can't sit idle and let the tides sweep us over.  We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours."] = "要赢得这场战争，我们不能坐在这里，静待战争之潮将我们淹没。我们必须果断出击，否则阿拉希永远也不会成为我们的囊中之物。",
    ["Tomas may not be the best cook around, but he has a few dishes that hit the spot.  He's currently working in the Lion's Pride Inn if you'd like to learn the profession."] = "托马斯也许不是最好的厨师，但是他确实能做一些精美的菜肴。如果你想学习厨艺的话，就去狮王之傲旅店找他吧。",
    ["Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?"] = "我们不能剥下人类及其联盟的皮，这真糟糕。这些皮都白白浪费掉了。尽管如此，谁想穿着你由此制造出的质地极差的皮革？",
    ["Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood."] = "可悲的是，正是因为萨尔的智慧才导致了恶魔之王和其它势力联合起来，特雷博的军队促成了恶魔之王、阴影议会和巨槌食人魔之间的联合。对于力量的无尽渴求使得他们签下了血契，对恶魔效忠。",
    ["Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me."] = "日复一日地坚持训练吧。当你熟练掌握所有技能的时候，再来找我。",
    ["Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students."] = "继续培训你已经超越我的能力了。与达纳苏斯工匠区的泰龙尼斯谈谈。他总是很愿意帮助有才能的学生。",
    ["Treat the wind rider well as it takes you to your destination.  May your ancestors watch over you $n."] = "当双足飞龙将你送达目的地之后，请好好款待它。愿你的祖先与你同在，$n。",
    ["Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.$B$BCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command."] = "你能以部落的名义冲锋陷阵，我可真羡慕你。我的职责是指挥部落的军队，而不是亲自上阵。$B$B当然，我年轻时也曾梦想着能安度晚年。现在，我痴迷于胜利的荣耀和失败的苦楚——这些都取决于我所指挥的士兵们。",
    ["Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the King to grant me audience.  Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards."] = "请尽量不要引起太多注目，我正在等待国王的召见。我并不介意多等一会儿，这儿到处是身材魁梧的守卫，我感到非常安全。",
    ["Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide."] = "尝尝樱桃馅饼吧，它会令你开怀大笑的。",
    ["Tucked away in the Mage Quarter, there is a little shop called Alchemy Needs.  You're bound to see all sort of strange shops on your way through the Mage Quarter, but if you stick to the outer rim you'll be sure to find it."] = "他在法师区，那儿有一间名叫炼金材料店的小商店。你会在前往法师区的沿途看到各种各样奇怪的商店，但是如果你沿着外围走的话，你一定会找到它的。",
    ["Tyrande sends her prayers. The Mother Moon blesses us all."] = "泰兰德送来了她的问候。月神与我们同在。",
    ["Ugh... these pests keep me busy night and day! Haven't you seen them?$B$BI wish I could just jump down a pipe to get away from them..."] = "啊……这些家伙让我整天都不得安宁！你看见他们了吗？$B$B我真希望自己能藏到地下，避开他们……",
    ["Uldaman can be found at the very northern end of the Badlands."] = "奥达曼位于荒芜之地最北端。",
    ["Um, hello!  If you are here about fee collection and/or a summons, then you must have me mistaken for someone else.  Terribly sorry!"] = "嗯，你好！如果你是来征收费用或者投递传票的，那你一定是将我认作别人了。非常抱歉！",
    ["Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!"] = "嗯，我能教的你已经都学会了。或许你该找其他人谈谈了。试一下达纳苏斯工匠区的暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她确实很有智慧！",
    ["Um... I think you're a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma'am;.  You'd likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!"] = "嗯……我认为你体型过大，不能乘坐机械陆行鸟，$g先生:女士;。你很可能会压碎这些精美的机器！",
    ["Un'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance."] = "安戈洛环形山在卡利姆多南部，位于塔纳利斯沙漠的西面。去寻找巨大的浮空石……它们是环形山入口的标志。但是要小心，那里可是很危险的，迅猛龙就在入口附近徘徊。",
    ["Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within $2113w days. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!"] = "没想到你竟如此精通协调管理。安其拉一战迫在眉睫，联盟和部落都已经做好了充分的准备工作。所有的战争物资将如约运往希利苏斯，预计将在$2113w天抵达。那是，会有一位英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时战争就真正打响了！",
    ["Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators.  Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions."] = "不幸的是，血蹄村中没人懂得裁缝技能，但是你可以在雷霆崖找到训练师。出了村子，沿着北面的道路走。乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部，然后问问那儿的守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。",
    ["Unfortunately you are not yet strong enough to survive in Warsong Gulch, $c."] = "很不幸，你还很年轻，无法在战歌峡谷中存活，$C。",
    ["Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "不幸的是，对于拥有像你这样经历的人来说我没有什么可教的，我的朋友。找到暗夜精灵希尔瓦娜·林月，她住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。",
    ["Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor.  To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff.  When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions."] = "用大地之母的果实配制药水来帮助我们进行持久抗争是一件光荣的行为。如果你想学习配制药水，就得去北方的雷霆崖。当你到达雷霆崖顶部时，去问问那儿的守卫，他们会给你详细的指引的。",
    ["Vengeance shall be mine."] = "我要复仇。",
    ["Very few seek me out... What may I do for you?"] = "很少有人能找到我……我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise."] = "想到这些可怜的亡灵灵魂的遭遇，我感到非常悲伤。你可以去灵魂高地之下的预见之池附近找大法师山姆。",
    ["Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin."] = "很好，开始学习裁缝吧。",
    ["Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there."] = "很好。从这些标本上再切下一块肉来。让我们看看你学到了什么，我们可以由此开始。",
    ["Vesprystus' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus."] = "维斯派塔斯的角鹰兽会送你到达目的地的。穿过达纳苏斯西部入口，去鲁瑟兰村找他吧。",
    ["Vira Younghoof keeps her practice inside the long house on the west side of the village."] = "维尔拉·幼蹄在村子西边的房子中进行训练。",
    ["Wanna buy a cockroach?"] = "想买蟑螂吗？",
    ["Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it."] = "想要成为一名铁匠？想要锻造出最好的武器？我可以帮你，希望你能对这门手艺投入最大的热情。",
    ["Want to learn leatherworking, eh? Simon Tanner would be able to teach you. He can be found in Old Town at the Protective Hide."] = "你想要学习制皮？西蒙·坦纳尔可以教你。你可以在旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里找到他。",
    ["Want to make your demons more powerful?  It'll cost you, but you've come to the right place."] = "想让你的恶魔变得更强大吗？这需要花钱的，但是你来对地方啦。",
    ["War is upon us, $n.  It's time for every member of the Horde to answer the call and join the fight against the cowardly Alliance."] = "战争即将来临，$n。每个部落成员都要响应号召，并肩击溃懦弱的联盟。",
    ["Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here."] = "战争之王萨尔亲自邀请我到这儿来。我感到非常荣幸，这并不困难。我不要求自己的职务高于斯通纳德。我只想找些生长在这儿的草药。",
    ["Warlocks, eh.  Well, you didn't hear it from me, but I've heard rumors that those types gather at a bar called the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter.  "] = "术士，嗯。我先前并未对你提及，但是我听说他们聚集在法师区中一间名为已宰的羔羊的酒吧中。",
    ["Warlocks... I don't care for their lot.  Like that Grimrizz who's set up shop outside the Thunderbrew Distillery. The ale will probably go flat there because of him!  Warlocks... bah!"] = "术士……我可不在乎他们。就像那个在雷酒酿制厂外开设商店的吉姆瑞兹。都是他，那儿的啤酒可能都跑了气！术士……呸！",
    ["Warriors can usually be found either at the Pig and Whistle Tavern or the Barracks in Old Town. Tell ya though, the tavern is probably a better place look."] = "战士们一般都在猪和哨声旅店或者在旧城区的兵营里出没。但我建议你还是到旅店去找找比较好。",
    ["Warsong Gulch you say? Well then, you'll be wanting to speak with fair Lylandris over in the Hall of Arms."] = "战歌峡谷？好吧，你应该去跟武器大厅的莱兰迪斯谈一谈。",
    ["Watch where you're stepping, $c, because I have a polymorph spell with your name on it..."] = "小心一点，$c，我有一个为你准备的变形术……",
    ["Watch your back, stranger."] = "陌生人，小心身后。",
    ["Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all..."] = "小心点，$g男孩:女孩;。主人能洞察一切……",
    ["Watch your step, $r. We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong.$B$BWoe unto those that would anger Korfax.$B$BNow if you have no business with me or the other members of the Brotherhood, please leave so that we may continue our meeting. "] = "小心，$r。在这种要与那些能毁灭世界的东西来一场决战的时候，我们圣光兄弟会可远没有其他同胞那样和善。$B$B任何的慈悲与怜悯都会激怒科尔法克斯。$B$B现在，如果你没有事情找我或者其他圣光兄弟会成员的话，就赶紧离开这里吧，我们还有会议要继续。",
    ["Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town."] = "小心点，陌生人。别在我们的镇子里惹事。",
    ["We already have a winner for our contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!There is always next Sunday for you to show your Angling skill!"] = "钓鱼大赛的赢家已经胜出，但是贾恩愿意收购你们钓到的可口鱼！  每周日都会有一场钓鱼大赛，你尽可再来展示自己的钓鱼技能！",
    ["We are all drawn here for different reasons, $c.$B$B<Rayne smiles.>$B$BI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands."] = "我们都因为不同的原因来到了这里，$c。$B$B<莱因笑了笑。>$B$B我来到这里是为了帮助陶土议会的雷布拉特。他有个很趣的理论，据说能净化这片土地。",
    ["We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible."] = "我们代表的是黑暗，永恒而无形。",
    ["We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can."] = "我们正控制着亡灵天灾——瘟疫至少还会侵扰它们一整天时间！但是我们得对此有足够的把握，因此你要尽可能地破坏锅炉。",
    ["We are the only supplier of healthy flowers in all of Stormwind. We provide beautiful blooms for any occasion."] = "我们是整个暴风城中唯一提供鲜花的地方。你可以在我们店里购买到各种美丽的花儿。",
    ["We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.$B$BThe war effort needs you!"] = "我们团结一致，为共同的目标而努力，$R。来自上古的邪灵威胁着卡利姆多，他妄图让整个世界陷入无尽的堕落……他仇视生命的缔造者——永恒的泰坦所创造的一切生物。$B$B我们是惟一能与克苏恩的大军抗衡的军队。如果我们不振作起来同仇敌忾的话，敌人一定会摧毁一切。$B$B为我们的作战物资储备尽自己的力吧！",
    ["We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that's right, EXPLORE the world."] = "我们选择了离开黑石深渊的保护出来探险……呃，我是说……嗯，我们这么做是对的，我们要探索整个世界。",
    ["We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don't you go see what he can teach you?"] = "我们当然欢迎多兰纳尔的厨师再多几个，但我并不是说扎瑞恩厨艺欠佳。你为什么不去找这个厨师看看他能教你什么？",
    ["We do not know.$B$BThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.$B$BFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.$B$BStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate. "] = "我们不知道。$B$B活下来的黑铁矮人们躲入深山，并开始重建他们的城市。$B$B索瑞森的废墟上又出现了黑石塔和新的黑铁王国。他们在灼热峡谷内建立了新的防御工事，就在众所周知的大熔炉地区。$B$B一个关于远古邪恶力量控制黑铁王国的故事开始流传。",
    ["We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?"] = "到我们这儿来的客人可不多。你对我感兴趣？",
    ["We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that.  At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity.  Once there ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions."] = "布瑞尔镇没有银行，你得去幽暗城找找。在南方的洛丹伦废墟后面的电梯能带你去幽暗城。你可以问问幽暗城守卫，他们会为你指明方向的。",
    ["We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.$b$bWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.$b$bWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.$b$bIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens."] = "我们对于树荫旅店被焚烧以及詹姆斯·海厄尔的妻子和孩子没能及时逃脱这些事情了解得并不多。$B$B我们想要找到詹姆斯的尸体，但是他却根本不在那堆废墟中。$B$B我们有一些线索，但是证据仍然很缺乏。我们希望能通过卫兵和塞拉摩人民的帮助让这件惨案得以大白天下。$B$B如果你也想帮忙的话，可以到贫瘠之地的边境那里调查一下旅店的废墟。",
    ["We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.$B$BInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning."] = "我们都亲眼目睹了无数可怕的灾难，但是我们不能由此绝望。$B$B记住这些往事，总有一天，我们会进行报复的。",
    ["We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!"] = "我们已经用亡灵天灾的瘟疫反攻他们了，但是我们撑不了多久了！去摧毁他们的锅炉吧！",
    ["We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $N.$B$BWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies."] = "在希利苏斯，我们的敌人不止一个，$n。$B$B虽然每个人的注意力都集中到异种虫类身上，但是我和我的兄弟密切注视着暮光之锤的一举一动。",
    ["We have no such place in the village.  The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though.  Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs.  There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher.  May your ancestors watch over you."] = "村子里可没这样的地方，在高高的雷霆崖上应该有。出了血蹄村沿着北面的道路走，乘坐雷霆崖电梯到达顶部，找那儿的守卫谈谈。愿你的祖先保佑你。",
    ["We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery."] = "眼下，我们在这片大陆上只有一处立足之地，但是人类是永远不可能打败我们的。他们很快就会受到报复。我们会割下他们说谎的舌头，惩戒他们的背叛行为。",
    ["We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde."] = "我们有自己的职责，$c。对部落应尽的职责。",
    ["We have seeded Darkmoon Cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the four suits.    If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the Greater Darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire."] = "我们在世界各地散发暗月卡片，看看有没有谁能集齐四套暗月卡片中的任何一套。若你设法集齐八张一套的卡片，我们就会奖励你一张高级暗月卡片，可作为饰品或是暗月马戏团的纪念。",
    ["We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive."] = "我们在此繁衍生息，生生死死，数年来大地却亘古不动。因此，这片土地并不属于我们，$n。我们是属于大地的。因此，我们守护着它，没有它我们就无法生存。",
    ["We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?"] = "我们可能遇到了旱季，但是供给并不缺乏！想看看我的货物吗？",
    ["We must eliminate the elves and their cowardly Alliance from Warsong Gulch. Go to the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak with Brakgul Deathbringer if you have what it takes to aid the Horde."] = "战场军官",
    ["We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it."] = "我们必须不惜一切代价保护这个营地的安全，$c！我们不能允许敌人再前进一步了！",
    ["We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!"] = "如果要孵化出我们的龙的话，我们必须集中精力！",
    ["We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi!  Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us."] = "我们绝不能让联盟在阿拉希扩张势力！既便是小小的避难谷地，在将来也可能对我们形成威胁。",
    ["We mustn't anger the Master. His is a wrath that is cruel beyond measure."] = "我们可不能惹恼了他。他发起火来就没有节制啦。",
    ["We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf's corpse.  It's that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  Now go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties."] = "我们种植蔬菜。野兔吃我们的蔬菜。狼群以野兔为食。我们捕杀狼群，从它们身上获得肉和兽皮。这就是神奇的生物链，或许你用别的什么词语来描述它。  去塞纳里奥区找泰龙尼斯吧，我得继续执行自己的职责了。",
    ["We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.$B$BThe war effort needs you!"] = "我们和联盟并肩作战，共同进退，$r。一个古老的邪恶力量正在准备将我们全部吞噬，首先是卡利姆多，然后是整个艾泽拉斯。这股邪恶是如此地古老，我们都已经忘记了它的存在。驱动它的力量的源泉，乃是对于造物之神泰坦以及一切由泰坦创造的事物的仇恨。$B$B我们是唯一能阻挡克苏恩的力量。我们要先发制人，击溃安其拉的虫人。让艾泽拉斯在部落和联盟的力量面前震撼吧。$B$B战备工作需要你的帮助！",
    ["We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. "] = "我们使用动物皮毛制作物品。",
    ["We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."] = "我们的工作就是保持平衡，如同塞纳留斯所教给我们的一样，$c。他就是指引我们前进的明灯，而我们必须竭尽所能保护它的光芒。",
    ["We're not really rude people, stranger, it's just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther's arrival. It's not often that the Lightbringer comes to town."] = "陌生人，我们并不是粗鲁的家伙，只是大家都忙于在乌瑟到来之前确保一切顺利。光明使者能来到我们的城镇，这可真难得。",
    ["We've done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we'll need for the Ahn'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and all of it will arrive within $2113w days. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!"] = "我们成功了，$G小伙子:姑娘;！联盟和部落已经集齐了安其拉一战所需的所有物资。现在这些物资都在运往希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的途中，预计将在$2113w天内达到。然后，会有一位勇敢的英雄使用流沙节杖敲响甲虫之台的铜锣，打开安其拉之门。那时，战争也就开始了！",
    ["We've gotta find out what the Qiraji are feeding those monsters! Look at the size of 'em!"] = "我们得看看其拉虫人到底给这些怪物吃的是什么！看看它们的个头！",
    ["We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.$B$BThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul'Gurub."] = "我们赞达拉巨魔长途跋涉来自此地，因为我们不能对威胁整个世界的危机视而不见。$B$B我们的远征队首领莫托尔带领我们来到荆棘谷海岸以北的尤亚姆巴岛，招募勇敢的英雄深入古老的巨魔城市……祖尔格拉布。",
    ["Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?"] = "$n，欢迎回到大锻炉。你是来拜访我的，还是准备进行下一阶段的训练？",
    ["Welcome to Blue Moon Odds and Ends, $c.  If you have any questions, please let me know."] = "欢迎你，$c。如果你有什么问题，尽管来问我。",
    ["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"] = "伙计，欢迎来到藏宝海湾。希望你在这儿度过一段快乐而……嗯，平静的日子。如果你口渴的话，我们这儿有很多饮料；如果你担惊受怕的话，我们这儿还有很多保镖。$B$B现在，我这个卑微的地精仆从能为你做些什么呢？呃，你又能为我做些什么呢？",
    ["Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger."] = "陌生人，欢迎来到凯尔达隆。",
    ["Welcome to Camp Mojache, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?"] = "勇敢的$c，欢迎来到莫沙彻营地。我能帮你什么忙吗？",
    ["Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger."] = "欢迎来到圣光之愿礼拜堂，陌生人。",
    ["Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls."] = "欢迎来到恶齿村，陌生的$c。我是断齿族长，这里的领袖。",
    ["Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n."] = "欢迎来到军情七处总部，$n。",
    ["Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!"] = "欢迎来到钢架补给站！",
    ["Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.$B$BIf you have business with me, then please proceed!"] = "欢迎来到暴风城！我是城市的一名长官，帮助城市的人口调查局登记居民。如果你想找人的话，我也许能帮上你。我能运用奥术和智慧拿到这些记录。$B$B如果你找我有事的话，那就开口吧！",
    ["Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?"] = "欢迎来暴风城。我们可是花了很长时间才将它重建起来的，但是这些工作都很值得。那么，你是来参观的还是有任务在身？",
    ["Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don't look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving."] = "欢迎来到塔纳利斯，$n。我能为你提供什么服务？你看起来可不像铁匠，但是我知道，人不可貌相。",
    ["Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!$B$BThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League."] = "欢迎来到塞尔萨玛，这儿是你在洛克莫丹的家！$B$B塞尔萨玛是个好地方，但是对那些相应召唤来到这儿的勇士来说，这里可不是个吃喝玩乐的地方！如果你想以联盟的名义挑战危险的话，就去读读贴在探险者协会塞尔萨玛分部外面的海报吧。",
    ["Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?"] = "欢迎来到我的商店。我能为你做什么？",
    ["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"] = "欢迎来到我的旅店，疲惫的旅行者。我能为您做点什么吗？",
    ["Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?"] = "欢迎来到我的帐篷。我可以帮你吗？",
    ["Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "欢迎来到达纳苏斯银行。我们提供金融帐户和存储贵重物品的保险箱。你要开户吗$g先生:女士;？",
    ["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "欢迎来到暴风城银行。我们竭诚为您提供最优质的服务，包括金融账户和绝对安全的储物箱。$g先生:女士;，您是否已经拥有了本银行的账户呢？",
    ["Welcome to the Blue Recluse, where the magically inclined gather to blow off steam. Though not literally of course. What can I get for you $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "欢迎来到蓝色隐士，这里是魔法汇集的地方。$g先生:女士;，我能帮你什么忙吗？",
    ["Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we choose the finest fisherman to be the Master Angler!Between 2pm and 4pm schools of tastyfish will appear up and down the coast of Stranglethorn.  While fishing if your fishing bobber lands in a tastyfish school then you will catch something from the school rather than the normal stranglethorn fishing fare."] = "欢迎参加藏宝海湾钓鱼比赛，每周我们都会选出一位最好的渔夫，授予他钓鱼大师的称号！  在下午2点到4点之间，大群的可口鱼会出现在荆棘谷海岸。如果你的鱼杆浮子落在可口鱼鱼群中，你肯定能钓上一些的，这比在荆棘谷的其它海域垂钓要有效得多。",
    ["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c."] = "欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。",
    ["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?"] = "欢迎来到塞纳里奥议会，$c。我要怎么帮你呢？",
    ["Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."] = "欢迎来到十字路口，$c。我叫索克——以酋长的名义，我负责在这儿进行防御。$B$B请你在这里随意一些。在你处理生意的时候，没人会对你占用空间有所异议的。$B$B我们的安全存在许多威胁。如果你想熟悉周围的情况的话，就跟其他人谈谈吧——或许他们会派给你一些任务的。",
    ["Welcome to the Explorer's League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out."] = "欢迎来到探险者联盟。如果你需要书面信息的话，我也许能帮你。",
    ["Welcome to the Faire young one!   We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal.   Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master...I mean I would be keenly interested in them."] = "年轻的$c，欢迎来到暗月马戏团！我们从世界各地收集到不少神奇的物品。啊，如果你能设法收集一套暗月卡片，就赶紧告诉我，因为主人……我是说我对这东西很感兴趣。",
    ["Welcome to the Pig and Whistle! Grab a drink my friend and pull up a seat, the more the merrier!"] = "欢迎来到猪和哨声旅店！和朋友在这里举杯畅饮，不亦乐乎！",
    ["Welcome to the Stormwind Guild Registry offices. What can I help you with today?"] = "欢迎来到暴风城公会注册办公室。有什么需要我帮忙的吗？",
    ["Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?"] = "欢迎来到幽暗城公会登记处。你需要什么帮助么？",
    ["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!$B$BOn the observance of Hallow's End, the Forsaken burn a wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repayed in full... with vengeance!$B$BThe burning of the Wickerman begins at 8:00 PM!"] = "欢迎来到稻草人庆典，$c！$B$B按照万圣节的习俗，被遗忘者要焚烧一个稻草人来纪念这个最崇高的时刻。就是在这一天，女妖之王将我们从巫妖王和天灾军团的魔掌中解救了出来，从那以后，我们就成了自由之身，直到今天。那些想要毁灭我们的敌人终将化为灰烬！$B$B焚烧稻草人的庆典将在晚上八点整开始！",
    ["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Point, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there."] = "欢迎来到前线，$c。暴风城及其盟国派我到这儿来对抗亡灵天灾。在冰风营地，我们日复一日在抗战中求生。$B$B如果你想证明自己是个英雄的话，机会是很多的……特别是在我们向安多哈尔和控制亡灵天灾的邪恶势力进军时，你可以好好把握。",
    ["Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there."] = "欢迎来到前线，$c。虽然他们的政客在暗地里密谋，但是他们会发现自己的计划在这里是行不通的。这儿是亡灵壁垒，我们会日以继日地为生存而抗争的。$B$B如果你想证明自己是个英雄的话，你会在这儿找到数不清的机遇的……特别是在我们向安多哈尔和控制着那儿的亡灵天灾的邪恶力量推进的过程中。",
    ["Welcome to the races!  Enjoy your stay, and don't bet all your money in one place!"] = "欢迎来观看赛车！希望你喜欢这里，但请记得不要把钱都压在一支车队上。",
    ["Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell."] = "欢迎来到避难所，$n。有些人来这里是有目的的，其余的是凑巧路过……但是每个到这里的人好像都有一个奇特的故事要讲。",
    ["Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!$B$BBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker..."] = "欢迎！欢迎来到亚布·尼比盖尔的暗月珍奇馆——这儿有来自世界各地的奇珍异宝！朋友，尽情参观吧！$B$B但是不要动手触摸！神圣的神器和可怕的野兽守护着这些展品！随意触碰的话，它们可能会烧伤你的手……",
    ["Welcome! Step right up, don't be shy. This here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain't she pretty? You look a little big around the mid section, but I think you'll fit. Flying is so much fun, want to learn how?"] = "欢迎！上前来，不要害羞。这是我最自豪的发明……冲击者5000型超级大炮！她难道不漂亮吗？她实在就是很漂亮啊！看起来对于炮管的中段来说，你的体型稍微大了一点，但是我想这不是什么大问题。飞行充满了乐趣，你想要学学吗？",
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.$B$BIt never hurts to reaffirm one's place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard."] = "欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B重申自己在这伟大的平衡中的地位总是无伤大雅的。作为这种平衡的守护者，我们必须努力保持清醒的头脑和坚定的信念。训练能使我们做到这一点。",
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere are rumors of strife within the Cenarion Circle, but you should pay such loose talk no heed.  Our Arch Druid, Fandral Staghelm, leads us and all of Teldrassil to glory!"] = "欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B据传塞纳里奥议会战事不断，但是你不该轻信这些谣言。我们的德鲁伊首领范达尔·鹿盔将领导我们和整个泰达希尔取得胜利！",
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place."] = "欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B来自翡翠梦境的召唤将很快占据你的心灵。你将冬眠数年，在最纯净的环境中生活。你将在那儿接受最终的训练。",
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this."] = "欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你是来接受训练的，那我很高兴能训练你。$B$B如塞纳留斯教导我们的一样，我们一直都是平衡的保护者。永远不要忘记这点。",
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this."] = "欢迎你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹;。如果你想接受训练，我会很乐意教你的。$B$B只要玛法里奥还在沉睡中，我们便永远是平衡的守卫者。别忘了这一点。",
    ["Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.  She'll take good care of any pets ye might have."] = "$g小伙子:姑娘;，你可以去卡拉诺斯雷酒酿制厂外找谢尔比·石火。她会好好照顾你的宠物的。",
    ["Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it's the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let's see if I can't teach you something."] = "干得好！在你眼中闪动的光芒……我很熟悉，我年少时也跟你一样！让我看看能不能教你点什么。",
    ["Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely."] = "干得好！你对药剂的理解进展不错。",
    ["Well done, soldier. A few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts for the cavalry to ride into combat!"] = "士兵，做得好。我们的马厩将塞满骑兵们的战斗坐骑！",
    ["Well hello again, $n!  I don't know how much longer I'm going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you've helped me out in the past, I'll show you some stuff you may find interesting!"] = "很高兴再见到你，$n！我不知道我还可以坚持多久来创建这样一个店。现在，由于你对我的帮助，我会给你看一些你会感兴趣的东西！",
    ["Well hi there!  Are you here to learn the proper technique of a new weapon?"] = "嗨！你是来这儿学习新武器的吗？",
    ["Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!"] = "很高兴遇到你，渔夫！如果你想要在钓鱼比赛中一展自己的钓鱼技能，那么就听好了！在本周日，荆棘谷将举办一场钓鱼大赛，选出一名真正的钓鱼大师！",
    ["Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."] = "你好，$c。我给你的建议是：当你在世界各地旅行的时候，要当心魔法，它会将不熟悉它的人烧成灰。",
    ["Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do..."] = "你好，$c。你想要一些建议？好吧，找个法师当朋友就对了！我们的袖口里藏着一些小把戏……",
    ["Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?"] = "很高兴见到你，$C。我想你是为安其拉之战而来的吧。我们急需帮助。$B$B联盟和部落需要同仇敌忾，共同对抗安其拉异种虫类和它们的首脑。我们在铁炉堡的军事区收集原料以制造各种战争物资，这些收集工作需要你的帮助。$B$B你可以跟我们的指挥官谈谈吗？",
    ["Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.$B$BI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?"] = "很高兴见到你，$c。除非你和我的女主人玛加萨之间有直接交易关系，否则别找我说话。$B$B我帮她处理大部分的事务，让她能集中精力处理更重要的事情。或许在你拜见她之前我们可以谈谈。",
    ["Well met, $n. We must be brief because there is much to do."] = "很高兴遇见你，$n。要做的事情还很多，我们必须抓紧时间。",
    ["Well met, friend!"] = "你好啊，朋友！",
    ["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!"] = "很高兴见到你，朋友。我是军官加鲁什，是银色黎明这一世界性组织的成员。我们的任务是毫不留情地消灭艾泽拉斯大陆上所有邪恶的势力。银色黎明不是一个政治机构，我们也不愿意成为政府机构。我们的目标很简单，我们将部落和联盟都看作自己的朋友——以铲除邪恶为目标的朋友！$B$B我的$g兄弟:姐妹;，为了黎明而战！",
    ["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is simple - fight swifty and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!"] = "你好，朋友。我是普尔哈特，隶属于银色黎明这个世界性的组织。我们的目标非常简单——与艾泽拉斯的一切邪恶力量进行顽强而持久的战斗。我们不是一个政治团体，也不想成为那样的团体。为了银色黎明的伟大目标，我们将联盟和部落的成员都当作并肩作战的朋友来看待！$B$B为了黎明而战，我的$G兄弟:姐妹;！",
    ["Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it."] = "好吧，$N，让我们来看看怎么对付这些瘟疫之锅！如果你要收集所需的成分，就带上一个玻璃聚焦装置吧。在鉴别从亡灵天灾的爪牙身上获取的资源时，你会用得着它的。$B$B你还需要找一份奥术催化剂。这东西可不便宜，而且也非常不稳定。一旦你得到药剂，就必须在15分钟内使用它，否则药剂就失效了。所以你可得留神别乱买。",
    ["Well now, ye'll need papers to form a guild, and Jondor Steelbrow can help you get started with the process.  He can be found over at the Ironforge Visitor's Center when yer ready to get started."] = "要建立公会的话是需要相应文件的，乔多·钢眉能帮助你处理这些程序。如果你都准备好了的话，就去铁炉堡访客中心找他吧。",
    ["Well then, it seems we're both looking for Hogral Bakkan.  He's a dwarf to be sure, so sooner or later he'll be heading for the Thunderbrew Distillery for an ale -- he might even be there now."] = "那么，似乎我们都是来找霍格拉尔·巴坎的。他是个矮人，他迟早会去 雷酒酿制厂喝酒的，没准他现在已经在那儿了。",
    ["Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes."] = "如果你想乘坐狮鹫的话，就去找暴风城的狮鹫管理员吧。当你进入英雄谷时，应该就能看见右边的狮鹫降落台。",
    ["Well well!  You've come to the right place to learn Mining, $gboyo : girlie;!  Geofram Bouldertoe himself resides at the Deepmountain Mining Guild.  Ye couldn't ask for a better instructor than him."] = "嗯！说到学习采矿的话，你来对地方啦，$g小伙子:姑娘;！吉尔弗拉姆·石趾居住在深山矿工协会。没有比他更好的老师了。",
    ["Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things..."] = "嗯，嗯，还不坏。或许我能让你看点什么……",
    ["Well ye'd be sure to find some training in the magical arts over in the Hall of Mysteries, north of the gates of Ironforge.  Juli Stormkettle can always be found there with her nose in a book."] = "去铁炉堡大门以北的神秘大厅，你会在那儿受到魔法训练的。朱莉·雷线总是在那儿埋头苦读。",
    ["Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe.  Let me teach you!"] = "不错，我确实知道一种罕见的炼金术配方。让我来教你吧！",
    ["Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time."] = "嗯，我声明！他是个新学生！只要你再多掌握一点技能，我会很乐意将我所知道的一切都教给你的。去跟格雷塔谈谈，好吗？她会教你如何速成技能的。",
    ["Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!"] = "好吧，我明白些了。但是，你有潜力，这点我不会否定。多加留心你或许就能学到什么东西！",
    ["Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!"] = "嗯，你这个聪明的家伙！我可以明确地告诉你，你知道的比我多！你可别为此自负，如果你想继续学习的话，就去暴风城找乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈吧。听说他是个很好的裁缝！",
    ["Well, if it isn't $n!  It's good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you've given me and my invention work to date.$B$BWhat can I do for you today?"] = "哦，这不是$n嘛！很高兴再见到你，我无法表达我对你的感激之情，你帮我及时完成了发明。$B$B我能为你做什么事吗？",
    ["Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!$B$BI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn't really running, more like hopping... The sand's so hot!$B$BAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off."] = "嗯，既然你提及了这一点，不错，昨天下午我确实看见了奇怪的事情！$B$B当我从东南方的巨魔废墟处跑过时……好吧，我其实不是跑过去的，应该说是跳过去的……沙地真是太烫了！$B$B总之，当我从废墟旁跳过的时候，我注意到那儿有一座营帐。我不得不说，在那儿设立营帐是件可笑的事儿……我本来要到那里去看看的，但是一只疯狂的大秃鹫把我赶走了。",
    ["Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.$B$BWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you've given me, and you'd be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.$B$BI'll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I."] = "嗯，依我看来，$n，要离开这个洞穴有两种选择。$B$B我们可以秘密潜逃——我利用你给我的披风，你用你自己的办法；或者，我们一起杀出去，但是我受伤了，这个方法或许比较困难。$B$B你更了解自己的实力，因此我让你来做选择。",
    ["Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You're looking for the Champions' Hall, and you'll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. If you're an officer you can enter the hall, otherwise you can still speak to Officer Areyn standing outside. Good luck!"] = "嗯，嗯，我们都生活在这个世界中，是吗？在Old Town的东南角落，你可以找到勇士大厅。如果你是官员的话，就可以直接进入大厅。如果不是的话，你也可以跟站在大厅外的Officer Areyn谈谈。祝你好运！",
    ["Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, $c?"] = "看看谁来了……有什么要我帮你的吗，$c？",
    ["Well, ye won't have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don't ye go ask a guard there."] = "嗯，似乎你在寻找裁缝时并不顺利。但是，有很多高明的裁缝都居住在铁炉堡。你为什么不去问问那里的守卫呢？",
    ["Well, you can find Theridan or Maldryn by the moonwell in the Park.  Just head to the western area of Stormwind, north of the Mage District, but west of the Cathedral Square."] = "你可以在花园区的月亮井旁边找到塞瑞德兰或者玛尔德利恩。到法师区的北边，教堂广场的西边就可以找到花园区了。",
    ["Well, you're just zooming right along! I can't teach you anything you don't already know, but Springspindle Fizzlegear sure can! You can find Springspindle in Ironforge. Good luck!"] = "嗯，你学得速度蛮快的！我没法教给你所有知识，但是宾斯匹德是可以的！你可以在铁炉堡中找到他。祝你好运！",
    ["Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car."] = "呃……虽然我不愿承认，但是你要想继续训练的话就必须跟我的姐妹谈谈。目前来说……我知道的没她多！她乘坐火箭车四处巡查。",
    ["What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but, my duty binds me."] = "我最不愿放弃的就是在这样的日子里到开阔的大草原上……但是，我的职责所在不容许我那样做。",
    ["What ISN'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, Sergeant Hartman in Southshore needs help against the Forsaken and their Wickerman Festival.$B$BOne more thing - I've heard that a sick little boy at the orphanage in Stormwind is looking for someone to help him gather treats for the holiday."] = "怎么玩？！$B$B世界各地的旅店老板都会将糖果分发给孩子们，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，南海镇的哈特曼中士需要帮助，他想要攻击那些被遗忘者，破坏他们的稻草人庆典。$B$B对了，我听说暴风城孤儿院里有个生病的小男孩，他想找人陪他玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏……或许你能帮帮他？",
    ["What ISN'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, there is the Wickerman Festival just outside the Undercity during the evenings.$B$BOne more thing - I've heard that a sick little girl at the orphanage here in Orgrimmar is looking for someone to help her gather treats for the holiday... maybe you could help her out?"] = "怎么玩？！$B$B世界各地的旅店老板都会将糖果分发给孩子们，许多城镇都将装饰一新，欢度节日！此外，幽暗城外还会在夜间举办稻草人庆典。$B$B对了，我听说奥格瑞玛孤儿院里有个生病的小女孩，她想找人陪她玩要糖果的恶作剧游戏……或许你能帮帮她？",
    ["What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design."] = "多好的天气！它让我有了创造新设计的灵感。",
    ["What am I doing?  Do you lack vision?  I am a dreamer, good $g sir : lady;, and I dream of a better future for us all.  Clearly, I am a visionary.$B$BThere are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality.  I told him that I was a dreamer, and Arch Druid Staghelm replied, 'Well, the world needs ditch diggers too.'$B$BUntil such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around."] = "什么？我在干什么？你眼睛不好使吗？我是一个梦想家，亲爱的$g先生:女士;，我梦想我们的将来会更加美好。很明显，我是个梦想家。$B$B然而，有些人却在想尽办法把我们困在平庸的泥沼里。我告诉过他，我是一个梦想家，而范达尔却回答说，“哦，我们似乎还缺一些挖水沟的。”$B$B我会帮助塞纳里奥议会弄走周围的泥堆，直到平庸的枷锁从我们身上卸下的那一天。",
    ["What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs."] = "你真的那么笨吗？你锻造出来的是什么东西？那最多算得上是一把水果刀罢了。我可不会花时间来训练一个菜鸟。",
    ["What are you looking for?"] = "你要找什么？",
    ["What brings you to the Cenarion Circle, $n?"] = "你找塞纳里奥议会有什么事，$n？",
    ["What brings you to the Tower?"] = "是什么使你来到塔楼的？",
    ["What brings you to this part of the world, $n?"] = "是什么把你带到这个地方的，$c？",
    ["What can I do for ya?"] = "我能为你做什么？",
    ["What can I do for you $c?"] = "我可以为你做什么吗，$c？",
    ["What can I do for you my child?"] = "我的孩子，我能为你做什么？",
    ["What can I do for you, $n?  Make it quick, I don't have all day!"] = "我能为你做些什么吗，$n？快说，我时间可不多。",
    ["What can I do for you?  No, wait!  What can you do for me?"] = "我能为你做些什么吗？不，等等！你能为我做些什么？",
    ["What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?"] = "我这个无足轻重的仆人能为你做什么，$n？需要训练吗？",
    ["What can you do at an inn?$B$BWell when you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become 'well rested' much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.$B$BYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."] = "你能在旅店里干什么？$B$B当你待在旅店里的时候，你就可以好好地休息。因此,你可以比留在野外更快地恢复到精力充沛的状态，这样就可以获得更多的经验值。$B$B另外你还可以通过和旅店老板交谈来获得一块炉石，以后就可以使用这块炉石快速回到你绑定的旅店里了。",
    ["What could you possibly need a bank for?  Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity.  When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions."] = "你需要银行做什么？好吧，你得穿越布瑞尔南部的洛丹伦废墟，乘坐电梯到达幽暗城。当你到达那儿后，询问自称为幽暗城守卫的行动缓慢的憎恶，请求它给予更详细的指示。",
    ["What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora."] = "我看起来像什么，附魔师普巴尔？你的技能还需要附魔大师的指导！去阿祖拉之塔找基塔·费温德。",
    ["What do you need directions to?"] = "你需要帮助吗？",
    ["What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!"] = "你认为我能教给你什么？罗克希克比我更适合做你的老师。你可以在奥格瑞玛找到他。出发吧。",
    ["What do you want, $c? I'm running late, and my employer doesn't look kindly on tardiness."] = "你要做什么，$c？我要迟到了，而我的雇主不喜欢拖沓。",
    ["What do you want?"] = "你想要什么？",
    ["What is happening to everyone?  I feel... cold..."] = "每个人都是怎么了？我感到……很冷……",
    ["What is it that you want, lemming? Get out of my sight before you find out why I am known as the Wrathcaster."] = "你想干什么，小松鼠？赶快从我眼前消失，不然你就有机会搞明白为什么他们叫我愤怒者了。",
    ["What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!"] = "你有什么事？你是来接受训练的吗？你是来寻找钢铁的秘密的吗？还是要学习锻造的技巧？快说！",
    ["What is it? Can't you see I'm busy?"] = "什么事？你没有看到我很忙吗？",
    ["What is the Brotherhood of the Light? Well... We are all members of the Argent Dawn at the core - members of the Argent Dawn that aren't held in check by morals, guilt and useless human emotion. Consider us Scarlet Crusade minus the stupidity, lack of leadership, and blind zealotry.$B$BDon't let the Scarlet Commander tell you otherwise.$B$BAnd don't let Tyrosus know I said that... It would be a terrible shame if I had to brutally maim him should a brawl break out."] = "什么是圣光兄弟会？好吧……简单来说，我们就是银色黎明的核心成员，一群不受虚伪的道德与懦弱的自省这类毫无用处的人类感情所限制的人。你可以把我们视作血色十字军，只是我们没有那么缺乏纪律性和领导力，也不那么愚蠢和盲目地狂热。$B$B别去询问血色十字军指挥官任何有关我们的话题。$B$B也别让泰罗索斯知道我刚才说了些什么，要不然，他要是找上门来，我还非得把他揍爬下不可……联军两大领袖打架可是个丑闻，会引起冲突的。",
    ["What kin I do for ya, mon?"] = "我可以为你效劳吗?",
    ["What kin I do for ye, $n?"] = "我可以为你效劳吗，$n？",
    ["What now?  Can't you see I'm rather busy?"] = "什么事？你没看见我很忙吗？",
    ["What you be expectin', mon?$B$BMaywiki only be dealin' with the druids and shaman."] = "你想要什么？$B$B梅维克只跟德鲁伊和萨满祭司往来。",
    ["What you be wanting? *hic*"] = "你想要什么？*嗝儿*",
    ["What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless."] = "你必须明白，像我这样活了一万年的人，对生命有独特的看法。眼下你经受的考验和磨难都是毫无意义的。",
    ["What's a young $c like you out visiting an old farmer like me?"] = "看啊，竟然有个年轻的$c来看像我这样的老农夫？",
    ["What, you can't port there?  Go to the Darkbriar Lodge next to the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "什么，你找不到那里？到精神谷湖里的黑石南小屋去，就在力量谷往上靠西的地方。",
    ["What?"] = "什么？",
    ["What?  But how?  No!  This is not possible!  I have been so careful... he could not know!$B$BYou lie!  You lie, and now you'll die for your deceit!"] = "什么？但是怎么可能呢？不！这不可能！我已经很小心了……他不可能知道的！$B$B你撒谎！你撒谎，你欺骗了我，去死吧！",
    ["What? I don't know of any warlock trainers in Stormwind. Although... There have been some sightings of demonic activity over by The Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter. I suppose you could check there."] = "什么？我不认为暴风城里有术士训练师。  不过……在法师区的那家名叫“已宰的羔羊”的旅店中有一些与恶魔有关的活动，我想你应该去那里看看。",
    ["What? Why are you bothering me? Why, I bet you can't even create a high quality robe! Go talk to Snang and come back when you're worthy of my talents!"] = "什么？你为什么在烦我？哎呀，我打赌你甚至不能制造一件高质量的长袍！去找斯诺恩谈谈，等你水平提高以后再来找我！",
    ["What? You want something?"] = "什么？你要什么东西？",
    ["When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand."] = "当我从墓穴中爬出来后，我本以为我的家人会热烈地欢迎我。相反，他们把我从村里赶了出去，用一种我听不懂的语言高声尖叫着。",
    ["When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, 'Save them.'"] = "第一次看见亡灵时，我哭了，我无法想象他们的恐惧和孤寂。大地之母在我耳边吟唱，她告诉我：“拯救他们吧。”",
    ["When I was wandering the crater after I crashed here, I remembered something that I once was told... 'Go up, up the mountain ahead,' said the voice in my head.$B$BListening to it is how I ended up here, $n!"] = "我在火山口游荡了许久，后来我想起曾有人告诉我……“继续往前，到山上去。”这个声音在我的脑海中出现。$B$B听了这话之后我就来到了这里，$n！",
    ["When Lolo doesn't wanna spill any o' his precious ale or get his lil' dress dirty, I'm called in. Yep. Ol' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil' bit o' justice an' a whole lotta pain."] = "当洛洛尔不想撒掉他宝贵的酒或者弄脏他衣服的时候，我就被召唤而来。是的。汉瑟尔就是别人口中正义和痛苦的结合体。",
    ["When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."] = "当坐在一个驭风者背上时，你就会发现它的力量和速度的确不是徒有虚名。",
    ["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest.  We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!"] = "当暗月马戏团开始展览的时候，他们会出现在艾尔文森林。我们的帐篷将驻扎在闪金镇的南边！",
    ["When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore.  We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!"] = "暗月马戏团将会在莫高雷开张，我们就在雷霆崖的西南方安营扎寨！",
    ["When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.$B$BWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!$B$BBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path."] = "当一个铁匠达到了你这样的专业水平的时候，我会提供给他们一个选择。$B$B虽然我并没有要求你必须做出选择，但我建议你最好还是做出抉择——毕竟，你想永远当一名新手吗？是大师级的铸甲师和武器铸造师给我们的军队提供补给，让我们赢得战争的胜利并获得荣耀！$B$B注意，$n，一旦你做出了决定并完成了指定的任务，就没有回头路了。一个人只能沿一条路走到底。",
    ["When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."] = "当我们使用动物的皮革时我们必须热爱食物或带给我们的保护，我们给大地母亲以荣誉并尊敬动物。查尔·硬皮会教给你这些事情。你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷找到他。",
    ["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande."] = "当你把爱情信物交给城镇里的居民时，你可以收到各种礼物作为回报。一些礼物最好留起来用，另一些则最好放在一起做成一个大礼品包！$B$B去找匹德菲特为你喜欢的英雄投票吧。$B$B你可以在伯瓦尔、麦格尼或者泰兰德身边找到匹德菲特。",
    ["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall."] = "当你把爱情信物交给城镇里的居民时，你可以收到各种礼物作为回报。一些礼物最好留起来用，另一些则最好放在一起做成一个大礼品包！$B$B去找匹德菲特为你喜欢的英雄投票吧。$B$B你可以在凯恩、希尔瓦娜斯或者萨尔身边找到匹德菲特。",
    ["When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen's Terrace for instruction on this skill."] = "当你没有医师来料理你的伤口时，急救知识可以救你的性命。我会请教工匠区的丹纳罗尔关于这门技艺的问题。",
    ["Where are you going?  Well if you're looking to get there quickly, then look no further!"] = "你去哪儿？如果你想快些到那里，那就别犹豫了！",
    ["Where better to look for a dark and brooding lot, than the dark section of Ironforge, aptly named The Forlorn Cavern.  Thistleheart is sure to be found there, likely summoning some manner of vile creature to do his bidding."] = "没有什么地方比铁炉堡最黑暗的荒弃的洞穴那粒更适合寻找那些阴暗的家伙了。你在那里肯定会找到瑟斯哈特，就象是召唤一个行径卑劣的动物去照他的吩咐办事。",
    ["Where can I send you today $c?"] = "今天要我送你去哪里，$c？",
    ["Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!"] = "你认为双足飞龙管理员会在哪儿？到力量谷的飞行塔的顶部去！",
    ["Where is it ye would like to go $g lad : lass;? For just a few coin my Gryphons can get ye there faster than even the swiftest horse."] = "$g先生:女士;，你想去哪里？只需要花几个小钱，你就可以搭乘狮鹫快速到达目的地。",
    ["Where is the Auction House?  Why it's right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye'll find it just across from The Vault."] = "拍卖行在哪儿？当你进入我们美丽的城市时它就在铁炉堡大门旁边。你会在银行的正对面找到它。",
    ["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "你想要飞往什么地方？",
    ["Where's my spinner? I just had it here somewhere..."] = "我的旋转诱饵在哪儿？我刚刚还把它放在这附近的……",
    ["Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!$B$BI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.$B$BWOOO HOOO!"] = "吆……我需要一根烟和找个好看的侏儒女人摸几下--倒不必非要按那个顺序！$B$B我被困在那个东西的肚子里已经有几个月了。今天几号了？啊，不要紧。重要的是我终于出来了。$B$B呜呼！",
    ["Which battleground are you interested in?"] = "你对哪个战场感兴趣？",
    ["Which battleground do you seek your glory in?"] = "你要找哪个战场？",
    ["Which class trainer are you looking for?"] = "你要寻找哪种职业的训练师？",
    ["Which profession trainer are you looking for?"] = "你在寻找哪种专业的训练师？",
    ["Which profession?"] = "哪一项专业？",
    ["Which trainer do you seek?"] = "你要找什么技能的训练师？",
    ["While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "塞恩德拉的态度非常和蔼，她的药剂也很不错。你可以在多兰纳尔旅店的东边找到她。",
    ["While Theramore is reknown for it's exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you."] = "虽然塞拉摩以它特有的武士培训闻名，我恐怕还是不能帮你。",
    ["While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity.  To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down.  Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."] = "虽然在布瑞尔没有工程学训练师，在幽暗城却有一位。要到那儿，朝村子的南边走，一直到洛丹伦废墟，然后坐电梯下去。一旦你到了那里，向一位幽暗城守卫询问详细的方位。",
    ["While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top."] = "虽然我们在血蹄村没有炼金术训练师，在北面的雷霆崖却有一位。沿着这条路去那儿，当你到达顶部时再向一位雷霆崖守卫询问具体方位。",
    ["Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?"] = "你是谁？为什么骚扰我？哦，是啦——你是学生吧。是的。我能为你做什么吗？",
    ["Who are you?  Where am I?  I feel... so weak..."] = "你是谁？我在哪儿？我感到……非常虚弱……",
    ["Who are you? What do you want from me?"] = "你是谁？你想从我这儿得到什么？",
    ["Who has the fastest car?  Who knows?!?"] = "哪个车队的赛车最快？天知道！",
    ["Who says orcs aren't smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!"] = "谁说兽人不聪明？当工程师很费脑筋的！",
    ["Who sent you here? You're not ready for my instruction yet! You'll be told when you're ready."] = "谁派你来的？你还没有准备好接受我的指令！当你们准备好以后会得到通知的。",
    ["Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth?  If you have one still that is.  Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer.  To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron."] = "既然所有东西对你来说吃起来都象是灰烬，为什么还要做饭呢？如果你还有一样东西不是这样的，那很好，到布瑞尔南边的幽暗城去问一位幽暗城的守卫，以进一步了解如何找到他们的烹饪培训师。要到那里你可以从洛丹伦废墟的后方乘电梯下去。",
    ["Why don't we see just what you're capable of? If you complete the task I shall be happy to further your training! "] = "为什么不让我们见识一下你的能耐呢？如果你完成任务我会很高兴对你继续深造！",
    ["Why don't you try looking in the Lion's Pride Inn?  The cook there might be able to teach you a few good recipes."] = "你为什么不到狮王之傲看看呢？那里的厨师可能会教你几道好菜。",
    ["Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?"] = "为什么当你要用到发条式同步协调陀螺仪的时候它们总是无影无踪呢？",
    ["Why now, $r? I just do not understand it. So much work to be done..."] = "为什么是现在，$R？我不明白。要做的事情还有很多……",
    ["Why would you want to talk to Kaplak?  Nevermind.  Look for him on top of the burrow in the southwest corner of Razor Hill.  Just make sure that you keep your hands in your own pockets!"] = "你为什么想找卡普拉克谈谈？没关系。到剃刀岭西南角的洞穴顶部找他。不过你一定不要把手放错地方！",
    ["Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It's like paradise down here. But don't tell my brother Zapetta that, he's bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn't have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don't get him started."] = "我不知道你为什么想要离开这阳光灿烂的沙滩和蓝色晶莹的水域。这里就象是天堂。但是不要告诉我的哥哥萨匹塔这些，他整天被困在提瑞斯法已经够难过的了。这里的地精飞艇目的地是奥格瑞玛，所以你不用担心得听他发牢骚。但是如果你到了提瑞斯法，要留意我的警告并且不要让他开始抱怨。",
    ["Why, you look like a common street urchin!"] = "哎呀，你看起来就像是一个普通的街头顽童！",
    ["Will you help us in our time of great need at Arathi Basin, $c?  The chance for increased honor and standing is greater than ever, and your assistance is sure to help to turn the tide against The Defilers.  Can we count on you?"] = "阿拉希盆地急需增援，你能帮助我们吗，$C？这是个获得荣誉、提升声望的大好机会。你的帮助定能扭转局势，帮助我们打败污染者。我们能将希望寄托到你身上吗？",
    ["Windsor was particularly ornery that day - and believe me, for Windsor, that's a monumental accomplishment. He kept telling me that 'something feels off.' Well he wasn't kidding!$B$BWe were in the middle of Blackrock Mountain when the filthy animals attacked. I'm talking about the orcs, of course. Pay attention, will ya? All you could hear were grunts and the clanging of steel as they rushed us. "] = "温德索尔那天特别爱跟人争吵——相信我，对温德索尔来说，那是一个有纪念意义的伟大成就。他一直在跟我说“感觉有些怪异”。他不是在开玩笑！$B$B当那些肮脏的野兽出击时，我们还在黑石山脉的中央。当然，我指的是兽人。你别分神，好吗？一时之间，叫喊声和铁器的敲击声四起。",
    ["Winterhoof? I hear he's living it up in Booty Bay."] = "冰蹄长者？我听说他在藏宝海湾。",
    ["With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon."] = "有奥格诺恩提供所需的供应，我可以不用寻找一株草药就能完成在这里的任务。如果我永远都不用再次看到自然的奇迹，这就不会很快发生。",
    ["With Ouro slain the way is clear to the final chamber. I am able to transport you there, if you desire."] = "奥罗死后，通向最后那个密室的道路已经彻底畅通了。如果你愿意的话，我可以把你传送到那边去。",
    ["With all of the fighting we do of course we have a First Aid Trainer in Razor Hill.  Find Rawrk inside the barracks on the east side of town."] = "因为我们经常战斗，我们当然有一个急救训练师在剃刀岭。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到拉乌克。",
    ["With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he's let a few of his own go if ye get me.  All the same he's still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices.  Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill's Depot."] = "布隆克总是在敲敲打打，他擅长修理最为精密的机械。你应该到钢架补给站拜访他一趟。",
    ["With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer."] = "很愿意……只是让我再多回味一下这一刻。",
    ["With some of the technology that was recovered by bold gnomes venturing into Gnomeregan, I have managed to construct my greatest invention:  The Matter Transporter!    All I need now is a skilled Gnomish Engineer to build a powerful beacon attuned to the transporter."] = "通过在诺莫瑞根中进行的探险行动，我找到了制作一种伟大发明的方法：物质传送器！我所需要的就是一个熟练的侏儒技师，让$g他:她;制造一个信标连接在这个传送器上。",
    ["With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin."] = "带着大地母亲的祝福，我们要开始了。",
    ["With the Emperors slain, the magical protection blocking teleportation within the temple has been greatly weakened. If you desire, I am able to translocate you to the Emperors' lair."] = "双子皇帝被杀之后，神庙中能够阻止传送法阵的魔法护罩已经远远被削弱了。如果你愿意，我可以将你直接传送到双子皇帝住所那里去。",
    ["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"] = "因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！$B$B向炼金师阿尔比顿询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！",
    ["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"] = "因为大熔炉被打开了缺口，我们现在能够把反作用剂释放到外界。这应该能让亡灵天灾尝尝他们自己药物的滋味，可以这么说！$B$B向炼金师迪瑟斯询问一下有关在大熔炉中所需要使用的试剂这方面的信息。我会处理所有的信息报告，以便于我们决定怎样把瘟疫用来对付亡灵天灾！",
    ["With the garments that Me'Lynn tailors, one might think that her needle was blessed by Elune herself.  Unless your needle is so blessed, you best pay her a visit and listen to her teachings.  You can find her in The Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."] = "穿着迈里恩缝制的衣服，人们可能会以为她的绣花针是被月神赐福过的。除非你的针也受过同样的祝福，否则你最好去拜访她一次并聆听她的教导。你可以在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区找到她。",
    ["With the sanction of Lord Varimathras, the Deathstalkers' numbers grow. More blades to strike at our enemies when they least expect it."] = "经瓦里玛萨斯大人批准，亡灵哨兵的数量增加了。我们将进一步加强打击敌人的力度。",
    ["Won't be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we're done."] = "暗月马戏团不久就会开张啦。别忘了待会回来，看看我们是否已准备停当。",
    ["Woo Ping's stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can't think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat."] = "吴平的精力真令人惊奇。我看着他连续练习了数小时技巧。他用双手击打练习用的假人，直到他的拳头沾满鲜血。我想不到还有谁比他更适合训练你的战斗技能。",
    ["Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  I think he's just off the reading room."] = "有消息说范斯·安德格鲁姆已经在城镇东南端的恐惧之末旅店楼上永久定下了一间房间。我想他刚刚离开了阅览室。",
    ["Wot kin I do fer ye?"] = "我可以为你做什么?",
    ["Would you believe that in my darkest hour, at the apex of my being, I failed.$B$BAs I fled from the wanton destruction of the forces that overwhelmed us, the only sounds I could hear were the screams of my soldiers and the rapid beat of my own heart.$B$BA short while later, I returned to the Blasted Lands in hopes of rescuing my men and restoring my honor. Instead I was captured and beaten until dead.$B$BWhat I found out during my inquisition and subsequent torture was horrifying."] = "你能相信作为精英战士的我居然失败了吗？$B$B我们的部队被无法抗拒的力量彻底摧毁，我所记得的一切就是不顾一切地逃跑，我所听到的一切只有我的战友撕心裂肺的惨叫和我自己的心跳。$B$B过了不久，我又回到了诅咒之地，希望能拯救我的伙伴。但是我被抓住了，最后被活活打死。$B$B这段日子中，我所能感受到的只有恐惧。",
    ["Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?"] = "你想飞回塞纳里奥议会的鲁瑟兰村吗？",
    ["Would you like a flight to Thunder Bluff, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?"] = "你需要飞往雷霆崖吗?",
    ["Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?"] = "你宁愿把你的货物交给一个地精吗?",
    ["Wow!  These kegs are filled with powerful stuff!  They lift me right out of my boots!"] = "哇！这酒真够劲！我快要撑不住了！",
    ["Wulan in Shadowprey Village can sell you the 'Expert Cookbook'.  You will need that if you are to better yourself."] = "葬影村的乌兰可以卖给你“中级烹饪教材”。如果你想要提高烹饪技能的话，就需要这本书。",
    ["Xon'cha will stable your extra pets.  Find him in the Valley of Honor at the stables between the arena and the Hunter's Hall.  Now begone!"] = "克苏卡会把你多余的宠物圈养起来的。到荣誉山谷的竞技场和猎人大厅之间的畜栏里找到他，现在走吧！",
    ["Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level."] = "嗨你，你是不是想要去詹迪亚的加迪植物园。我刚刚没有说清楚吗？哦，我肯定累了！只要沿着智慧谷里的阿索兰的市场后面的木制台阶到达暗巷区，你可以看到加迪就在那里的上层。",
    ["Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid."] = "你可能不会像一个银手骑士那样追寻光之踪迹，但是你总可以向我们寻求帮助。",
    ["Ya mon, I be Gadrin's assistant.  Dis here volunteer work be my way of gettin through Witch Doctor School.  Since you help him, I help ya for free.  Whatcha need fixin?"] = "啊是的，我就是加德林的助手。在这里的志愿工作就是我通过巫医学校课程的方式。既然你帮了他，我就免费帮你。需要修理什么吗？",
    ["Yap, I can teach ye to fish."] = "对，我可以教你钓鱼。",
    ["Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter."] = "雅文·刺鬃在村庄北面等你。他能教你猎人之道。",
    ["Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage."] = "你打扰我就是为了这个？你穿得真是跟垃圾一样，你还不如背着个死兔子到巨魔的洞里去跑一圈哪！",
    ["Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven't cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don't ye just have a look in the smithy."] = "当你在卡拉诺斯的时候，你可能会听到托格努斯在铁砧上敲打。然而，如果你还没有把耳朵里的蜡清理掉，那你为什么不到铁匠铺去看看呢？",
    ["Ye have the look of a Blacksmith to ye. Soot under the nails, steel in yer bones. Aye, very much the blood of a Blacksmith in yer veins. Which means ye've come to me looking to learn a thing or two, well $g lad : lass; grab a hammer. Let's see what I can teach ye."] = "你看上去就是一个天生的铁匠。你的指甲缝中都是煤灰，双手充满了钢铁般的力量。啊，我甚至可以感觉到铁匠的血液在你的血管中奔流。你应该是来这里学东西的，好吧，$g小伙子:小姑娘;，拿起锤子，让我看看我能教你些什么吧。",
    ["Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus."] = "你知道的比我还多，这一点很肯定。我告诉你接下来该怎么办，去和我的爸爸谈谈。他是个好的老师，但是他会要求你证明自己的实力。他的名字叫洛特加斯，你可以在本古斯的铁砧旁边找到他。",
    ["Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name's Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye'll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge."] = "你学得很快，$g小伙子:姑娘;，快得我已经远远跟不上你了。如果你想继续学习的话，我建议你去见见我的导师。他的名字叫洛特加斯，嗯，洛特加斯·石须。你可以在铁炉堡的大锻炉那里找到他。",
    ["Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already."] = "你在寻找霍格拉尔？那你找过旅店吗？啊！如果你在找一个潜行者，而他同时还是一个矮人，你应该从旅店开始！先去看一下。",
    ["Ye might not know it, but in addition to being a skilled tailor, Jormund is also a slayer of giants!  Why he must have overheard a few of us sharing stories when he shouted that he'd killed seven with one blow!  Ye should pay him a visit at his store on the north side of The Great Forge an' see if he'll tell ye the tale!"] = "你或许不知道，除了是一个娴熟的裁缝之外，约莫德还是一个巨人杀手！为什么说当他大喊他一拳打死了七个的时候可以断定他一定偷听到我们在一起讲的东西！  你应该到大熔炉北面他的店铺去拜访他一下，并看看他是否会在跟你讲他的传奇故事！",
    ["Ye need some training?  Well, Azar Stronghammer is always up for showing the younger paladins a thing or two.  Why don't ye go see him in the Thunderbrew Distillery."] = "你需要接受些训练？好吧，阿扎尔·战锤总是愿意教给年轻的圣骑士一点东西。你为什么不去雷酒酿制厂找他呢？",
    ["Ye should check over at Steelgrill's Depot for Bronk.  When he's not tinkering with some odd device, he's usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks."] = "你应该去钢架补给站找布隆克。当他不忙着修补一些奇怪装置的时候，他通常就在跟飞行员们聊些关于他们的蒸汽坦克的事。",
    ["Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there."] = "如果你一心想学附魔的话，你该到铁炉堡看看。我记得上次我到那里的时候曾看到狮鹫旁边有一家商店。",
    ["Ye sure ye don't want to learn to be a warrior?  Well, it's yer hide on the battlefield.  If ye really want to learn to waggle yer finger, ye best talk to Magis Sparkmantle in the Thunderbrew Distillery."] = "你肯定你不想当一名战士？那好吧，如果你真想学习动动手指的把戏，你最好去找雷酒酿制厂的玛济斯·石衣谈谈。",
    ["Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye?  Well don't stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!"] = "你想学习如何使用武器，是吗？嗨，$g小伙子:姑娘;，别在站在那儿发呆啦，大声说吧！",
    ["Ye won't find a gryphon master just anywhere around Dun Morogh, $glad : lass;.  Ye're going to have to go to Ironforge if ye want to take a gryphon somewhere."] = "丹莫罗一带是没有狮鹫管理员的，$g小伙子:姑娘;。如果你想骑狮鹫去什么地方的话，就必须去铁炉堡。",
    ["Ye won't find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they're mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye're looking to be trained."] = "丹莫罗这里可没有剥皮匠，$g小伙子:姑娘;，如果你想要学习剥皮的话，就到铁炉堡去找找吧。",
    ["Ye'll surely find Maxan Anvol tossin' back a few in the Thunderbrew Distillery.  Why don't ye go have yerself a pint and see if he'll teach ye something new."] = "你肯定可以在雷酒酿制厂看到马克萨恩·安沃尔大口喝酒。为什么你不去喝一点，顺便看看他能教你点什么新鲜东西呢？",
    ["Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!"] = "你确实是个不错的附魔师！现在你该继续了。我想让你与楼上的吉布·草须谈谈。他人有些古怪，但是他会继续指引你！",
    ["Ye're beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love."] = "我教不了你，$n。去找塔雷·浆泡；她是一个侏儒，住在铁炉堡的侏儒区。哦，既然你反正要去，请把我的爱带给卡利。",
    ["Ye've come to the right place $glad : lass;!  People come here from all o'er the world to train to be a blacksmith.  Ye'll find Bengus Deepforge hammering away at an anvil in the middle of our fine city by The Great Forge itself."] = "你算来对地方了，$g小伙子:姑娘;！人们从世界各地来此学习成为一名铁匠。你会看到本古斯·深炉在我们漂亮的城市中央的大熔炉的铁砧上埋头工作。",
    ["Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?"] = "你确实有点本事。我打赌你的技术足够让你学些东西了，我们来看看我有什么能教给你的，好吗？",
    ["Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing."] = "是的是的，我知道达丹加不喜欢烟。但从它身上的气味来看，达丹加好像还不喜欢洗澡。",
    ["Yeah, I need to drop off some things myself.  Find it by heading north up the road to Orgrimmar and then ask one of the grunts there."] = "是的，我自己也需要放置一些东西。要找到它你需要向北沿着去奥格瑞玛的路一直走，然后找那里的步兵询问一下。",
    ["Yeah, I'll show you a few things. We'll see how you do, maybe you'll surprise me!"] = "是的，我有些东西要给你看看。我们来看一下你做得怎么样，或许你会令我吃惊的！",
    ["Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol' Greatfather Winter what you'd like for this Winter's Veil.$B$BHo ho hurry up."] = "是的，当然，去告诉冬天爷爷你都想从这个冬幕中得到什么。$B$B赶紧些。",
    ["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town.  It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it."] = "是的，你应该去找奥斯蒂尔·德·蒙。他总住在城镇东南端的客栈里。它叫做恐惧之末旅店，你不会错过的。",
    ["Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind."] = "是的，你知道一些事情！如果你想学会更多的话就必须与暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。",
    ["Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill.  Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there.  We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year."] = "是的，你总是能看到克莱德·凯林在布瑞尔东边的澈水湖岸钓鱼。但当你到那里后要当心那些带着面具的变态者。我们去年就被迫关掉了孩子们的夏令营。",
    ["Yeah? Of course I'm a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!"] = "什么？我当然是一个铁匠。什么，你认为矮人是打铁最有效率的种族？好吧，可能是那样。去找一个矮人来帮你！",
    ["Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so."] = "什么？你打扰我了，你最好赶快找到一个说得过去的理由。",
    ["Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!"] = "多年的精心饲养和细致的品种培育使我能够有机会向你展示这些良种马。请慢慢挑选，马是你长期的伙伴，朋友。不要把自己低估了——今天就在这里找到你想要的马！",
    ["Yer looking for an Alchemy trainer are ye?  Just came from there, I did.  Ye'll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.  ::sigh:: ...why o' why didn't I take the blue potion."] = "你在寻找一个炼金术老师是不是？我也刚从那里回来。你会在侏儒集会的工匠区找到浆泡小姐的。  ：：叹气：：……为什么我没有服下蓝色药剂呢。",
    ["Yer looking to learn how to use a new weapon are ye?  Well, ye should be talking to Bixi or Buliwyf over at the Timberline Arms weapon shop then $glad : lass;.  They know their weapons from axes to... uh... zweihanders."] = "你想学习怎样使用一种新武器是吗？那么，你就应该与那边的密林武器店武器商店的比克斯和布里维夫谈谈，$g小伙子:姑娘;。他们对从斧头到……嗯……双手武器都非常了解。",
    ["Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn't even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe's : she's; a warrior.  Ha!"] = "你不是战士……你为什么在我的训练课程中一天都坚持不下去！$B$B一个以为自己是战士的$c，哈哈！",
    ["Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?"] = "怎么了，$g小伙子:姑娘;？我能帮你什么忙吗？",
    ["Yes, $c?"] = "找我有事吗，$c？",
    ["Yes, $c? Are you reporting in?"] = "什么事，$c？你在汇报吗？",
    ["Yes, I am. What's it to you?"] = "是的，我是阿斯托·哈德恩。你是？",
    ["Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol's Rod, abandoned in the forest.$B$BWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future."] = "是的，我曾盼望你能回来。早些时候，我派科兰出去，她发现了达图尔的魔棒被遗弃在森林里。$B$B我们竭力想要找回它，$n。请你小心以后不要掉了它。",
    ["Yes, I have seen the shaman you seek. Last I saw her, she was to the west of here. She hides in the hills above the Razormane tribe. If you're clever, you'll be able to find a path to her hut in the hills. It is not too far north of here. That path should allow you to find her without fighting through the quilboar."] = "是的，我看到你要寻找的萨满祭司了。上次我见到她的时候是在这里的西边，她隐居在钢鬃部族旁的小山上。如果你够聪明的话，就可以找到一条通往小屋的山路，就在北边不远的地方，那条路可以让你避开野猪人，直接找到她。",
    ["Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.$B$BI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life."] = "是的，我讲的语言你听得懂$r。我们不是动物，然而你们中大多数却仍然把我们像动物一样对待！可是我们的分歧比起降临到这片土地上的悲剧来显得微不足道。恳请你们把与我们存在的分歧搁置一边，倾听一下我临死前的请求。$B$B我来到这片土地尽我所能改善状况，而现在除非你能帮我，否则那即将要化为泡影。我用我生命的最后一息请你帮这个忙。",
    ["Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two."] = "是的，我认为你有潜力。或许我可以给你看看一两样东西？",
    ["Yes, I've been running this shop for some time now. Business has been pretty good lately. A lot of new adventurers coming through..."] = "是的，我现在已经经营这家店一段时间了。最近生意非常好。许多新的探险者来了……",
    ["Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results."] = "没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它非常有用！你要做的是用特别的种子来细心培育药草——而不是一遇到风吹草动就挥斧乱砍。虽然你即将得到的常青袋能让最没有经验的新手轻松进行种植工作，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的成果。",
    ["Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You'll be nurturing and cultivating special seeds.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even a novice to grow something, those who show some aptitude in herbalism will have more bountiful results."] = "没错，但是如果你精通草药学的话，你会发现它更有用！你可以培育出特别的草药来。虽然常青袋是个连新手都能轻松使用的工具，但那些对草药学有天资的冒险者将会得到更丰硕的报酬。",
    ["Yes, young one, you need not convince me of such things, the Warchief and I have much history. Your dedication, however, is noted.$B$BAs I was saying, Rend had found a new home for his people, and I was among those who would wearily follow.$B$BFrom one conflict arose others... countless others. It was in those battles for Blackrock Spire between the Blackrock clan and the Dark Iron dwarves that my sons were both slain. It was then that I realized my time among the Blackrock clan had come to an end."] = "是的，年轻人，你不需要让我相信这些事情，酋长和我有很多过去的故事要说。然而你所做的贡献是众所周知的。$B$B就象我说的那样，雷德已经为他的人民找到了新的家园，我也是那些不知疲倦跟随他的人中的一员。$B$B那一次冲突激起了其它……其它无数的冲突。就是在黑石氏族和黑铁矮人为了黑石塔的战斗中我的两个儿子被杀害了。就在那时我意识到了我在黑石氏族的日子结束了。",
    ["Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.$B$BI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days."] = "是的，那是真的，我好像一只蝙蝠一样瞎了！而且还醉得……呃，醉得好像喝了很多酒。$B$B我会告诉这个感受的，$r。是酒让我感觉灵敏。人人都知道如果你丧失了一种感觉，那么另外一个感觉会变得更加灵敏。我的饮酒感觉这两天非常灵敏。",
    ["Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."] = "你可以在血蹄村西北角的大帐篷里找到姚恩·深刺。",
    ["You act like this is the best junk I've ever seen. Sure it's ok, but I see stuff this 'OK' every day. Tell you what, you find a way to wow me, and I'll teach you things that make dwarves smile in their sleep."] = "好像这是我所见过的最好的垃圾。当然它还过得去，但我每天都看到这类‘还行’的东西。告诉你吧，你若能想办法让我叫好，我就会教给你能让矮人们在睡梦里都会笑的东西。",
    ["You aiming to be a taxidermist?  I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead.  No?  Good!  Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town.  To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection."] = "你想成为一个标本剥制师？我不喜欢那些从我身上获得材料然后运走的人，因为他们认为我死了。难道不讨厌吗？好了！到城镇东南边的一个营地找寻兰德·洛巴尔特。要找到他需要走布瑞尔东南方的路，然后在十字路口左拐。",
    ["You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now."] = "你是一个非常棒的附魔师。我恐怕已经超出我的才能了。到阿祖拉之塔找到基塔·费温德。现在只有她才配作你的导师。",
    ["You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you."] = "你已经超越我有限的能力了。到达纳苏斯的工匠区寻找暗夜精灵安尼希尔。她可以教给你更多知识。我很希望我可以跟你一起去。",
    ["You are certainly a long way from home, $r."] = "你离家还远着呢，$r。",
    ["You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. "] = "你很热心，这很好。然而，你还不够资格接受像我这样的人的培训。",
    ["You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage."] = "你很幸运来到达纳苏斯，因为你遇到了像祖卡斯特这样多才多艺的猎人作为你的培训师。我建议你到塞纳里奥区拜访她并寻求她的指导。",
    ["You are gonna want to head over to Old Town and drop by the Protective Hide if you are lookin' to learn skinning."] = "如果你要去学剥皮术，可以到旧城区的“护体皮甲”店里看看。",
    ["You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student."] = "不幸的是，对于拥有像你这样经历的人来说我没有什么可教的，我的朋友。去找暗夜精灵希尔瓦娜·林月，她住在达纳苏斯的工匠区。",
    ["You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake."] = "你在寻找尤萨恩·静水。你可以在村子的西面找到他，他就在石牛湖钓鱼。",
    ["You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo."] = "你并不为我的人民所知。科多兽是强大的坐骑，它是我的人民爱心和关怀的产物；所以它不能给陌生人。在雷霆崖的长老认为你的品德高尚之前，我不能卖给你科多兽。",
    ["You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she's standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment."] = "你还没有准备好。找贝蒂·奎恩谈谈，他就站在那边的楼梯旁边。当你提高以后再来找我。",
    ["You are not yet powerful enough, $c.  Move along."] = "你还不够强大，$C。继续努力吧。",
    ["You are ready for greater things! See Franklin Lloyd, to my right. He will guide you from now on."] = "你准备好迎接更大的挑战了！见见我右边的弗兰克林·洛伊德。从现在开始他会指导你。",
    ["You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!"] = "你真是一个意志坚定的学生。我很高兴给你提供指导！",
    ["You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there. "] = "你现在没有资格受我的培训，陌生人。先到我的助手夏格那里学习一段时间。",
    ["You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours."] = "你当心些，$c。尊重我们的方式，否则你和你的人们就会受到诅咒。",
    ["You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.$B$BWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts. "] = "你最好坐下，这是个很长的故事。$B$B当我们第一次来到希利苏斯时，玛尔利斯女士是塞纳里奥要塞中第一位加入远征队的暗夜精灵。我们的行程没有什么特别的：组队进入虫巢探险，寻找失落的神器。",
    ["You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession."] = "如果你想学习挖矿的话，最好前往暴风城的矮人区。那里的某个矮人肯定会教给你这门技能。",
    ["You can find Aldwin Laughlin at the Stormwind Vistor's Center in the Trade District."] = "你可以在贸易区的暴风城接待中心里找到奥德文·拉弗林。",
    ["You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you."] = "你可以在去达纳苏斯的路上看到拉德纳尔在他的屋外练习手艺。你应该停下来看看他有什么可以教你的。",
    ["You can find Tannysa standing outside Alchemy Needs in the Mage Quarter."] = "你可以在法师区的炼金材料店外面找到塔尼莎。",
    ["You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill."] = "你可以在布瑞尔东南边的恐惧之末旅店的楼上的一间房间找到范斯·安德格鲁姆。",
    ["You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."] = "你能在中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行外面找到一个邮筒。",
    ["You can find a mailbox right o'er by The Stonefire Tavern.  It's just north of the gates of Ironforge."] = "你会在那边的石火旅店旁边找到一个邮箱。那就在铁炉堡大门的北面。",
    ["You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back."] = "你可以从这个码头找到去塞拉摩的路。记住我的话，那些地方对从联盟去的人们是非常不安全的。一定要小心谨慎。",
    ["You can find the gryphon master on the northeast rampart overlooking the Valley of Heroes."] = "你可以在英雄谷东北边的那个城堡平台上找到狮鹫管理员。",
    ["You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don't you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you've gotten your feet wet!"] = "你总有一天能跟我学习……但现在还不是时候！为什么不先跟站在我右边的斯普莱特聊聊呢。入门之后再来找我！",
    ["You can learn to sew up in Orgrimmar.  That's to the north.  Maybe one of the Orgrimmar Grunts can help you."] = "你可以试着在奥格瑞玛解决你的问题，就在这里的北方。或许某个奥格瑞玛步兵可以帮你。",
    ["You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength."] = "你可以在力量谷中部的银行外面找到接收你情书的地方。",
    ["You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!$B$BSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!$B$BBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!"] = "你能看见我？你知道我一个人在这里游来荡去被忽视有多久了吗？就是没有没有人能看见我。能有人陪我说话真好！$B$B啊，你一定是我以前待过的那个雇佣兵团里的生还者派来的，我说的对不对？显然就对呀！$B$B好了好了，不多寒暄了，要想把灵魂还给瓦塔拉克公爵，并让一切纳入正轨，还有许多事情要做呢！",
    ["You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather."] = "阿拉辛是个值得信赖的人，让他来悉心照料你的任何宠物。他就住在猎人们聚集的塞纳里奥区。",
    ["You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria.  He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills."] = "你通常可以在铁匠铺的后面发现威尔海姆修士和里瑞亚互相讲故事。他总是很乐意向圣骑士们传授新的技艺。",
    ["You can't study my techniques until you've learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training."] = "你在学习好基础知识之前不能学我的技艺。如果你对训练感兴趣的话就去找卡玛瑞谈谈。",
    ["You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we've gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!"] = "你当然不会失望!现在既然我们已经把那个清除掉,你可以下达指令了!",
    ["You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him."] = "你来错地方了。去找那边的专家古丹谈谈。你可以从他那儿学到更多东西。",
    ["You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?"] = "你敢踏入拉文霍德庄园，可怜虫？",
    ["You desire to shape the bones of the Earth Mother into tools that will aid the Horde.  Good, good.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the elevator leading to the top of Thunder Bluff.  A Bluffwatcher there can give you further assistance."] = "你希望把大地母亲的骨头设计成可以帮助部落的工具。好的，好的。沿着北边的路走出血蹄村直到一部可以上到雷霆崖顶部的电梯那里。那里的守卫可以给你更多帮助。",
    ["You don't have the stomach for the gryphon ride, huh.  Well lucky for you, we have an alternative where you can keep your feet on the ground... more or less.  It's the gnomish mover of people, the Deeprun Tram.  Conveniently located in the back of the Dwarven District."] = "你不喜欢骑狮鹫，嗯。你很幸运，我们有一个替代品可以让你稳稳地立在地上。那就是侏儒们的公共交通工具，矿道地铁。在矮人区的后面，非常方便。",
    ["You don't look like a student..."] = "你看起来不像是个学生……",
    ["You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!"] = "你看起来不怎么像我，但谁知道呢，可能有一个附魔师藏在那里的什么地方！",
    ["You don't yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need."] = "你的技术太差了，还不能跟我学习。去跟那边的马丁医生谈谈，或者爬上斜坡到东南方去看看马尔什医生。他们是被遗忘者，可以给你所需的训练。",
    ["You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, $n. You be needin' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He'll help you out."] = "你的问题我都回答不了，$n。你需要与奥格瑞玛暗巷区的兽人耶尔玛克谈谈。他会帮你的。",
    ["You got the look of someone wantin' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an' I train other folks to handle adventures for me."] = "你看起来像是个喜欢冒险的人。而我，自从我们巨魔来到这里我就受够冒险了。现在我每天都是既来之则安之，而且我为自己训练其他家伙处理冒险的经历。",
    ["You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own."] = "你的进步已经超越了我能教授的技艺了。现在到辛特兰的鹰巢山去找矮人德拉克·石拳谈话。他的作品太棒了，比我的好多了。",
    ["You have certainly come a long way in your training. There is only one instructor who can train you further. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"] = "你的训练已经非常深入了。只有一个导师可以进一步地训练你。找到加基森的巴兹克·布拉斯温！",
    ["You have come to learn of battles won and lost on this field? There are no winners here..."] = "你是来学习战役案例的吧？听好了，我会为你讲解那些显赫的胜仗和耻辱的败仗的。",
    ["You have completed Teronis' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $n."] = "你已经完成了泰洛尼斯的任务，感谢你所做的一切，$n。",
    ["You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!"] = "你干的很好，旅行者。我能收你当徒弟令感到很骄傲！",
    ["You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there."] = "你赢得了到一个更高级的导师那里学习的权利。去见见我那边的朋友罗克希克。",
    ["You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts."] = "你已经学会了我现在能教你的所有知识，$n医生。当你获得更多经验的时候再来找我吧，我会传授给你更多高级的医学知识的。",
    ["You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor."] = "我的孩子，你学得很好。去幽暗城找一个名叫詹姆斯·范·布朗特的铁匠。他能传授给你更多的知识。我想他应该在战士训练大厅附近铸造武器。",
    ["You have nearly reached the pinnacle of your training. To become the greatest enchanter you can possibly be, you have one more instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman."] = "你差不多已经达到训练的顶峰了。为了成为你能做到的最伟大的附魔师，你还需见一位导师。她的名字叫做安诺拉，而你或许能在奥达曼找到她。",
    ["You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!"] = "你还没有资格接受我的培训。先去见见桑德，就在那张桌子旁边。当他说你可以了再来找我！",
    ["You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should."] = "你还没有学会基础知识，流浪者。你找我的助手拉琳娜·夏月谈话了吗？可能你需要跟她谈谈。",
    ["You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom."] = "我已经没什么可教你了。带着大地之母的祝福离开吧。在雷霆崖的中央高原西北方的商店找到牛头人塔恩。愿你得到他智慧的指引。",
    ["You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue."] = "你已经通过测试了，干得好！对你的培训可以继续了。",
    ["You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further..."] = "你在成为大师的旅途上又达到了新的高度。让我们看看能不能让你更上一层楼……",
    ["You have shown me your desire, and have payed with precious stone.  I will teach you..."] = "你已经表明了你的愿望，也支付了珍贵的石头。我会教你的……",
    ["You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."] = "你似乎正在寻求知识。也许你在找寻锻造之道，也许我能在这条道路上指引你。但是一旦你决定从事铁匠这个职业，你就应该学会聆听钢铁中的那些灵魂的呼喊。",
    ["You have truly excelled in your knowledge of enchanting. There is much more to learn, if you are willing. Speak to Taladan, in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."] = "你在魔法方面的知识真是很出色。如果你愿意的话，还有很多要学的。跟塔兰丹谈谈，他在达纳苏斯的工匠区。",
    ["You have truly grown more cunning, $n."] = "你真的变得狡猾多了，$n。",
    ["You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared."] = "你来找我求学是浪费了你我的时间，$n。我没时间教授基础技能。我们在这里战斗，而这里是一处前线。在你准备充分之前不要再来找我。",
    ["You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready."] = "你做得很好……是时候见见老板了。找到乔瑟夫并告诉他你准备好了。",
    ["You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider."] = "在你从驭风者背上往下俯瞰这个世界之前，不能说你真正活过。",
    ["You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise."] = "你没有浪费那些你必须杀死的动物，因此你赐予了这些动物的灵魂以荣誉。阿丝卡·迷雾行者将会给你演示怎么处理。她在高地上有个厨房。",
    ["You killed Ghost Howl.  You're a stud!"] = "你杀了鬼嚎。你这个傻瓜！",
    ["You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n."] = "你知道的已经够危险了，但是对我来说你看起来还需要训练，$n。",
    ["You know who's really smart? Nogg! Smarter than me, even. You go tell Nogg Thund sent you! You can find him by the control panel over there."] = "你知道谁是真正聪明的人吗？诺格！甚至比我还要聪明。你去告诉诺格是桑德派你来的！你可以在那边的控制台那里找到他。",
    ["You know, I could run an orc through or slice up a troll.  I could even carve my initials in an ogre's flank, but I just can't stand to skin an animal.  Go figure, eh.  Well, if you have the stomach for it, then go see Maris Granger at the Protective Hide in Old Town."] = "你知道，我可以刺穿一个兽人或是把一个巨魔切成碎片。我甚至可以把我名字的大写字母刻在食人魔的肚子上，但我就是不能忍受给动物剥皮。想一下都让我觉得恶心。  好的，如果你有这种兴趣，那就到老城的护体皮甲找马瑞斯·格兰治。",
    ["You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him."] = "你学得很快，这是件好事。但要注意按照工作的要求适当地完成工作。现在，我恐怕必须要把你送到斯纳尔那里多学些东西。你要学会所有他能教的，但不要听他的气话。当萨鲁的女儿笑话他时他就变成那样了。",
    ["You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily."] = "你喜欢这地毯吗？我亲自把动物杀死并剥皮的。但愿所有的半人马能被同样容易的击倒。",
    ["You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn."] = "看来你需要通过无尽之海的通道。那你算来对地方了，这儿就是少女之爱号的停泊处，她是这片水域上最好的客船。当船到达后，你就登上甲板，然后用不了多久你就可以躺在荆棘谷的沙滩上晒太阳了。",
    ["You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?"] = "你在看我吗，$g小伙子:姑娘;？",
    ["You looking for plucky?  Well, you didn't hear me say this, but... maybe if you ask Kronkrider up in the tower, he'll tell you..."] = "你在寻找约翰森？哦，我不该说太多，不过……或许你该问问塔顶的科鲁克莱德，他会告诉你……",
    ["You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city."] = "你可以在达纳苏斯银行找到你存放财物的地方，它就在我们神奇的城市中央。",
    ["You may not pass.  You are not our kin, nor have you issued the challenge."] = "你不能通过。你不是我们的人，也没有发出过挑战。",
    ["You may seek out Martin Lindsey inside the Pools of Vision, underneath the Spirit Rise.  He will assist you on your way to Arathi Basin."] = "去灵魂高地下面的预见之池找马丁·林塞。他会帮助你前往阿拉希盆地。",
    ["You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise."] = "你可以到中部高地的底层的雷霆崖银行存放你的财物。",
    ["You mean you can't smell the smoke of the Dwarven forges from here?  Well, you will be looking for Therum Deepforge if you want to learn blacksmithing.  He's over in the Dwarven District which is just north of the Cathedral Square."] = "你说你不能在这儿闻到矮人煅炉的烟味？哦，如果你想学习锻造的话就该找瑟鲁姆·深炉。他就在大教堂广场北边的矮人区。",
    ["You mean, you don't know? The sword that you carry on your back - it is known as Ashbringer; named after its original owner."] = "你是说，你完全不知道？你背上的那把剑，名叫灰烬使者，这个名字是从它原来的主人那里继承而来的。",
    ["You must be looking for Smith Argus.  He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training."] = "你一定是在寻找铁匠阿古斯。如果你需要接受训练的话，他通常在闪金镇监督铸造工作。",
    ["You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer."] = "你必须找一个更有经验的老师，因为你已经超越了我的能力了。我建议你找这里的莉琳希亚·夜风谈谈：她有更多知识可以传授给你。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the Forsaken of the Undercity before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被幽暗城的被遗忘者所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被铁炉堡的矮人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the gnomes of the Gnomeregan Exiles before I will teach you how to pilot a Mechanostrider, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被诺莫瑞根逃亡侏儒所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the humans of Stormwind before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被暴风城的人类所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the night elves of Darnassus before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被达纳苏斯的暗夜精灵所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the orcs of Orgrimmar before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被奥格瑞玛的兽人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the tauren of Thunder Bluff before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被雷霆崖的牛头人所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be exalted with the trolls of the Darkspear tribe before I will teach you a riding skill, $c."] = "在我教你骑术之前，你必须达到被暗矛部族的巨魔所崇拜的声望才行，$c。",
    ["You need to be stronger, $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."] = "你需要变得更强大才能帮助我们在奥特兰克山谷作战，$C。",
    ["You need to find Swart.  Look for him inside the barracks on the east side of Razor Hill."] = "你应该去找斯瓦特。到剃刀岭东边的兵营里找找看。",
    ["You need to learn from someone who knows more than I do. Go talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity. Well, what are you still doing here?"] = "你需要找一个比我懂得多的人。去找幽暗城的乔瑟夫·格里高利谈谈。那么，你还在这里干吗？",
    ["You need to make your stitches smaller, $n. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic."] = "你要把你的针法做得更小些，$n。这样你的箭袋和弹药袋就不会有东西掉出来。还有，没有人喜欢穿着鼓鼓囊囊的外衣的。",
    ["You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!"] = "你需要开始学习一些我的专门技术之外的东西！跟那边帐篷前面的利廉姆·火轴谈谈。他会让你步入正轨的！",
    ["You probably weren't expecting to find me in this cave, were you?$B$BMy name's J.D., and I really can't tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this cave is my home now!$B$BI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater."] = "你大概没想到会在洞穴中找到我，是吗？$B$B我叫科琳，我实在没法告诉你我是怎么到这儿来的，但是我可以告诉你，这个洞穴现在就是我家了！$B$B我在这儿研究环形山里随处可见的奇怪水晶。",
    ["You require the instruction of a true master! Go to Daryl Stack in Tarren Mill and embrace your destiny!"] = "你需要一个真正大师的指导！到塔伦米尔的达瑞尔·斯塔克那儿去试试你的运气！",
    ["You scared the fish away!  What do you want?"] = "你把我的鱼吓走了！你到底要怎么样？",
    ["You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I'm not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I'm sure you'll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done."] = "你所要做的就是铸造萨弗隆战锤和找到萨弗拉斯之眼。将萨弗拉斯之眼和萨弗隆战锤结合在一起就能成为萨弗拉斯！我不会告诉你任何关于萨弗拉斯之眼的信息。我想你自己能找到的。在这张合约上签字，让我们达成交易。",
    ["You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave?  Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow.  There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag."] = "你在寻找格罗达尔和暗火营地？在被称作暗影裂口的地下洞穴里找到他们。有两条通道可以进入洞穴，一条在智慧谷的南面，另一条在暗巷区里面。",
    ["You seek Kardris Dreamseeker.  She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "你想找的是卡德里斯。她和其余的萨满正在智慧谷萨尔的要塞的入口房间那里。",
    ["You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby..."] = "你寻求更高级的知识。坦帕拥有这种知识。她应该就站在附近……",
    ["You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "你在找寻一个潜行者？我认为詹诺克很适合你的描述。你为什么不到多兰纳尔的旅馆里去找他谈谈呢？",
    ["You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek."] = "你寻找一个喜欢动物的人？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅馆的外面寻找瑟里亚迪。她就是你找的那个人。",
    ["You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "你在寻找一个德鲁伊的训练师？那么你应该到多兰纳尔旅店南面的月亮井去见见卡尔。",
    ["You seek to lower our global defenses in order to appease a paranoid magistrate and an encampment of riff-raff that are most probably suffering from heat stroke."] = "你是说为了满足一个妄想狂的地方官和一群没准正在遭受中暑之苦的乌合之众的愿望，我们就得把世界各地的部队都调回来，然后给他派过去吗？",
    ["You should talk to Winstone. I hear he's looking for thieves with your skill."] = "你该与温斯顿谈谈。我听说他在寻找一个与你有相同技能的潜行者。",
    ["You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!$B$BThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it's Hallow's End.  Their 'celebration' will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you've got the time, we really could use your help!"] = "你！你看起来身体强健……南海镇需要你的帮助！$B$B万圣节到了，那些受诅咒的被遗忘者蠢蠢欲动。他们把所谓的庆典开到我们家门口来了。如果你有时间的话，我们真的需要你的帮助！",
    ["You there... it is in your best interest to aid the Forsaken during these dire times.  Listen closely, as I dislike repeating myself.$B$BWe currently find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  Bandages and simple textiles are running low, and donations are being accepted to bolster sagging inventories.  While you'll not receive financial compensation - hence what donation means - your aid will not go unnoticed."] = "你……现在是你帮助被遗忘者最好的时机。好好听着，我不喜欢重复我说过的话。$B$B我们现在极度缺乏布料。绷带和任何布料储存量都很低，我们希望接受捐赠来补充库存。你的捐赠不会有任何经济补偿——这就是捐赠的含义——你的捐赠一定会为我们所赏识。",
    ["You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, $c?  I hope so.  What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?"] = "你认为你能摧毁阿拉索联军吗，$c？希望如此。你究竟是想要干些什么呢，还是根本就是来浪费我的时间的？",
    ["You think you're smart enough? You think you got what it takes? Let's find out!"] = "你认为你很聪明吗？你认为你得到了吗？让我们查明真相！",
    ["You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth."] = "你把尸体翻过来然后看到她武器上的标志——她的护甲已经都损毁了，她的头发披散在她的脸上。$B$B根据曼科里克对于她的描述，你可以确定这就是她的妻子。$B$B他一定会为这个消息而感到悲伤，但是你相信他还是希望知道真相的。",
    ["You want Zamja at Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength."] = "扎姆沙在暗巷区上层的博斯坦的火坑。当你从力量谷进入暗巷区时走左边的楼梯。",
    ["You want my help? You got it. What do you need?"] = "你需要我的帮助？可以。你需要什么？",
    ["You want the Hall of Legends. It's high above the Valley of Strength on the west side. If you're not an officer you can't get in, but you can still talk to Sergeant Ba'sha outside."] = "你要去传说大厅？它就在西边的力量谷之上。如果你不是官员的话，你是不能进入传说大厅的，但是你可以跟大厅外的巴沙谈谈。",
    ["You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We've also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed."] = "你想知道收集工作的进度吗？很好。我得到的最新消息称，部落已经收集到$2095w个瘦狼排、$2102w条斑点黄尾鱼和$2105w条烤鲑鱼，而总的需求量分别是$2096w、$2103w和$2106w。",
    ["You want to learn to be a tailor?  Hmmm... I believe there's a tailor over in the Eastvale Logging Camp that may be able to get you started.  "] = "你想学习成为一个裁缝？嗯……我相信在东谷伐木场有一个裁缝可以教你。",
    ["You want to talk to Osborne then. No finer teacher of the stealth arts than him in Stormwind. Look for him over in Old Town."] = "你应该和奥斯伯谈谈。暴风城没有比他更擅长潜行艺术了，那家伙就在旧城区里。",
    ["You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!"] = "你想学习？跟着我？太棒了！唯一比装配子弹和炸药装置有趣的事情就是与别人分享那种知识！我们开始吧！",
    ["You were. The Eye is never wrong.$B$BYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.$B$BYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?"] = "是的。眼睛绝不会弄错的。$B$B毕竟，你是一名牧师。如果眼睛向你展示了这段恐怖的记忆，那么你肯定是一名强大的牧师。$B$B你是来救赎的，但是你甚至还没有意识到这一点……对吗？",
    ["You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave."] = "你可以在村庄西北角的大帐篷里找到派尔·沉默行者。他可以教给你你想要的。",
    ["You will find Sildinair at the Warrior's Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city.  "] = "你会在战士区的护卫队中找到希达奈尔，她敏锐的眼睛扫视着森林，寻找着胆敢进入我们美丽的城市的敌人。",
    ["You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?"] = "你可以在多兰纳尔周围找到众多的训练师，他们有丰富的经验可以传授给你。你想要找哪一位？",
    ["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."] = "你需要去尘泥沼泽找纳特·帕格接受训练，提高自己的能力。",
    ["You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor."] = "你不会失望的，旅行者。裁缝是一种充满乐趣的工作。",
    ["You wish to aid The Defilers in their fight against The League of Arathor in Arathi Basin?  Very well, you should ask Martin Lindsey for his assistance then.  Look for him in the Pools of Vision."] = "你想要帮助阿拉希盆地的污染者打败阿拉索联军吗？很好，去预见之池找马丁·林塞寻求帮助吧。",
    ["You wish to help the Forsaken with their fight against the humans in Arathi Basin?  Then go to the Hall of the Brave and speak with Deze Snowbane."] = "你想要帮助阿拉希盆地的被遗忘者打败人类吗？那就去勇者大厅找迪兹·斯诺班谈谈。",
    ["You wish to learn the old craft?  You wish to smelt dark iron?$B$BAppease me, $r.  Show me a sacrifice and I will consider it!"] = "你想要学习这项古老的手艺？你希望冶炼黑铁？$B$B给我一样祭品我就会考虑的！",
    ["You won't learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?"] = "你在我这里学不到新的东西了；你知道的已经很多了。如果你想得到更多培训的话，去找雷霆崖中央高原西北方商店里的牛头人尤纳谈谈。替我向她致意，怎么样？",
    ["You would certainly be looking for Me'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen's Terrace in northeastern Darnassus."] = "如果你有希望学成一位裁缝的话你当然应该去找迈里恩。她住在达纳苏斯东北方的工匠区。",
    ["You'd better not be causing trouble, $n!"] = "你最好别找麻烦，$n！",
    ["You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town.  Why don't you go see if you can help her?"] = "你会在城镇西北端发现卡罗莱·安尼斯正试图炸掉她的房屋。为什么你不去看看你能否帮她？",
    ["You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas."] = "恐怖图腾长者在菲拉斯的拉瑞斯小厅那里。",
    ["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."] = "星林长者在荆棘谷的祖尔格拉布大门外面。",
    ["You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town."] = "你可以在穿过城镇的道路东南端的恐惧之末旅店里面找到旅店老板瑞尼。",
    ["You'll find no finer rat kabob this side of Khaz Modan!"] = "你在卡兹莫丹不会找到更好的老鼠肉烧烤店的！",
    ["You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength."] = "你会在力量谷中央的奥格瑞玛银行外面找到它们中的一个。",
    ["You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor."] = "你会在荣誉谷找到那个地精和他的玩具商店的。",
    ["You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill.  I guess he checked in too late to get a room."] = "你可以在恐惧之末旅店楼上的平台找到法师训练师凯恩·火歌的，恐惧之末旅店就在布瑞尔的东南端。我猜你现在去的话有点晚了，他不会再登记给你房间了。",
    ["You'll find the Wind Rider Master in Orgrimmar.  Go north up the road to get there and ask an Orgrimmar Grunt for further directions."] = "你会在奥格瑞玛找到双足飞龙管理员的。沿着公路向北走到那里去，并向一个奥格瑞玛步兵询问更多指示。",
    ["You'll have to be patient with me, $n. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.$B$BOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him."] = "你必须耐心一些，$n。我的间谍机器人正在进行非常精密的操作，马上就帮你搞定。$B$B哦，帮我个忙，尽量不要让莱斯科瓦看到你……我们要伏击他。",
    ["You'll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I'll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!"] = "你必须给我一点时间，$c，纳迦正在攻击我们。搞定他们之后再来找我！",
    ["You'll need more training before I can share my knowledge with you, I'm afraid. "] = "我恐怕在我可以教授你知识之前你要需要更多的训练。",
    ["You'll need to head to Orgrimmar for that.  Just follow the road heading out of Razor Hill to the north through the canyon and you'll come to it.  When you get there ask one of their grunts for further directions."] = "为此你需要到奥格瑞玛去。只需沿着从剃刀岭出去的路穿过峡谷就会到达那里。到了那里,你可以问问步兵以得到进一步的指引。",
    ["You'll want to learn from Zamja.  Head to Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength."] = "你肯定会想从扎姆沙那里学些什么的。当你从力量谷进来的时候走左边的楼梯到暗巷区上层的博斯坦的火坑去。",
    ["You're a hunter?  Well anyway, you'll find Thotar hiding from the sun inside the burrow at the southwest corner of town."] = "你是个猎人？你会发现索塔尔为了躲避太阳就藏在城镇西南角上的洞穴里。",
    ["You're a leatherworker by trade, aren't you?  It's that faint smell of cured hides, I'd recognize it anywhere.$B$BMy father used to talk about a famous artisan who lived in Southwind Village centuries ago.  It's a shame the place is in ruins now."] = "你是个皮革商吧？我对兽皮的味道再熟悉不过了。$B$B我的父亲过去常常跟我谈起数世纪前一位居住在南风村的著名工匠。很遗憾，那儿已是一片废墟了。",
    ["You're back already!  What can I do for you now?"] = "你已经回来了！现在，我能为你做什么呢？",
    ["You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Ainethil, a night elf lady who lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "你做得比我要好！你需要一个经验比我还要多的人。那就是安尼希尔，一个在达纳苏斯工匠区生活的暗夜精灵女士。",
    ["You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "你操纵得比我要好！你需要一个经验比我还要多的人。那就是赫伯特·哈尔希医生，一个在幽暗城炼金房工作的亡灵。",
    ["You're doing very well in the art of tailoring, I must admit. Now, let's see how good you REALLY are..."] = "你在缝纫艺术方面做得很好，我必须承认。现在，让我们看看你到底有多棒……",
    ["You're hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let's hope your luck is better than theirs."] = "你是在猎杀死亡弯钩吧，$n？我记得很清楚。这周我手下的两个家伙就是被她杀死的。希望你的运气比他们好。",
    ["You're into leather, eh?  Sounds like you should talk to Simon Tanner over in Old Town.  He runs a shop there called the Protective Hide."] = "你想要穿皮革对吗？听起来你该与旧城区的西蒙·坦纳尔谈谈。他在那儿开了一家叫做护体皮甲的商店。",
    ["You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!"] = "你在开玩笑，是吗？我认为你在寻找那个矮家伙，索恩斯·火石。他就在楼下。现在快逃吧！",
    ["You're looking for Lau'Tiki.  You'll find him on Darkspear Strand out beyond Sen'jin Village to the south."] = "你在寻找劳迪克。你会在南面的森金村外的暗矛海滩找到他。",
    ["You're looking for Mishiki.  She has a hut to the south in Sen'jin Village."] = "你在寻找米什基。她在森金村南面有一间小屋。",
    ["You're looking for Tai'jin.  Find her in the barracks on the east side of town."] = "你应该是在寻找泰金。在城镇东面的兵营里可以找到她。",
    ["You're looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength."] = "你在寻找部落大使馆里的乌特伦。在力量谷的西边你可以找到他。",
    ["You're no warlock and I've no time for you.  Begone!"] = "你不是术士而且我没时间理你。走开！",
    ["You're not a druid!"] = "你不是德鲁伊！",
    ["You're not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. "] = "你还不坏，但让我耍耍几个小把戏，你可能会觉得很方便实用的。",
    ["You're shaping up nicely, $n. I've heard good things..."] = "你一直进行得不错，$n。我听到好消息了……",
    ["You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words."] = "你找错兽人了。我不训练新手。去问问那边的小伍特……谦虚一点。",
    ["You're working your way up... higher than me, at this point! You should talk to Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge! (He'll? She'll?) show you more than I ever could!"] = "你在努力上进……现在甚至已经超过我了！你应该与铁炉堡的宾斯匹德谈话！（他会？她会？）让你见识那些我所做不到的！",
    ["You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it. "] = "你已经为我做了很多事情，$n。谢谢你。$B$B现在我至少可以告诉你，我是怎么来到这里的。我和我的好朋友特雷·莱弗治潜入加德纳尔调查暗影议会，然后就在毫无准备的情况下被他们抓住了。他们把特雷带到暗影堡的深处，并把我关在这里，他们把我们所有的装备都拿走了……我仍然可以听到他的惨叫，$n。他们……简直丧心病狂。我不知道他们都对他做了些什么，但他们会为此付出代价的。",
    ["You've already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher."] = "你已经学会了我能教给你的所有东西，$n。如果你还想继续学习的话，去找暴风城法师区的暗夜精灵莉琳希亚·夜风谈话。我听说她是个好老师。",
    ["You've become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!$B$BYou're welcome here any time."] = "你已经成为一个出色的猎手了，$n！你不但证明了你的技能，你还胜过了达瑞尔，这是你在我的名册中得到了额外的分数！$B$B欢迎你随时来到这里。",
    ["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"] = "你来接受训练为的是把它传递到你的宠物身上？",
    ["You've come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most."] = "你已经比许多人都走得更远了，$n。敬畏大自然的力量，你就会取得比大多数人都要伟大的成就。",
    ["You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.$B$BFarewell!"] = "你已经完成我要求你做的事情，$n。我这里没有什么需要你做的了。如果你想继续为瑟银兄弟会服务的话，和黑石深渊的黑铁酒吧的罗克图斯·暗契谈谈。$B$B再见！",
    ["You've got money and we've got food.  What are you waiting for?!"] = "你有金钱，我们有食物。那么你还在等什么？！",
    ["You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar."] = "你没经过适当的训练就来找我，说明你勇气有余而智慧不足。去找个接近你的技术水平的人谈话，像兽人卡玛瑞，他住在奥格瑞玛的暗巷区。",
    ["You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you."] = "你已经掌握了它的用法。我没有什么要教你的了，但是找亚瑟·摩尔谈谈，他是在幽暗城潜行者区工作的一位被遗忘者。告诉他是我派你去的。",
    ["You've heard about the Tram have you?  What a ride that thing is!  You'll find it in the Dwarven District towards the back.  Oh, and be sure to keep your arms and legs inside the tram while the tram is in motion."] = "你听说地铁了是吗？那可真是一样不错的交通工具！你会在矮人区的后部找到它。哦，一定记得在地铁行进时把你的胳膊和腿放到地铁里面。",
    ["You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n."] = "你有了一个好的开始，但是你要学的还有很多，$n。",
    ["You've not had a steed until you've taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They'll serve you well, believe me."] = "在驾驭过一头受过良好训练的山羊之前，就别夸口说你已经拥有了真正的坐骑，我的朋友。请随意看看这些杰出的坐骑吧。它们会让你满意的，相信我。",
    ["You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit."] = "你正行进在一条光荣的道路上，$n。我的祖先尊敬你的意愿，但你在完成我所交付的任务之前我不会对你有任何认可的。$B$B如果你希望证明在精神层面是一个猎手的话你该知道你必须做什么。",
    ["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."] = "你看上去很疲惫。在我们的屋里休息一会儿吧，让艾露恩引领你进入甜美的梦乡。",
    ["Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest."] = "你学习的能力已经超过我了。你需要找那边的本娜·冰蹄谈谈以获得更多指示。但请不要占用她太多时间。她需要休息。",
    ["Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!"] = "旅行者，你有充分的理由让自己充满信心。现在你真正的培训开始了！",
    ["Your current aptitude exceeds my instructional capabilities. You should enquire further with my fellow Gnome Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge!"] = "你目前的智能超出了我的指导能力。你该找我在铁炉堡的侏儒同伴特里克希询问一下！",
    ["Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments."] = "你的培训进展很好。你该为你的成就感到自豪。",
    ["Your errand must mean much, $c, to draw you so deep into the marsh..."] = "你的使命一定意义非凡，$c，它需要你深入沼泽……",
    ["Your future is clouded.  Concentrate, and ask again."] = "你的未来乌云密布。集中精力，再问一次。",
    ["Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good."] = "你的打扰在占用我的宝贵时间，你最好带来的是好消息。",
    ["Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity."] = "你的知识很渊博，旅行者。你必须向一个比我更聪明的人学习。关于乔瑟夫·格里高利的智慧的故事广为流传。你可以在幽暗城找到他。",
    ["Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further."] = "你对药剂的知识已经远胜于我，但你还有很多要学的。上楼去到东南面见见马尔什医生。他会交给你真正的苦痛——啊咳。他是一个被遗忘者，他能进一步训练你。",
    ["Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?"] = "你的精神不够集中。你对我隐瞒着什么吗?",
    ["Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people's plight."] = "你制造药剂的技术已经在我之上。去幽暗城的炼金房找亡灵赫伯特·哈尔希医生。他可以继续你的训练，而你也可以亲眼目睹他的人民所遭受的苦难。",
    ["Your search is almost completed.  Seek your truth in the entrance room of Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "你的搜寻基本结束了。到智慧谷的萨尔的要塞入口房间里找寻真知吧。",
    ["Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there."] = "你制造药剂的技能需要再高超一些才能当我的学生。在此期间，在那边的希尔瓦娜·林月或米拉·法拉科纳可能会帮助你。",
    ["Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content."] = "你的技能显示你一直喜爱我们的艺术，但是我想看到你所做承诺的进一步证据。我会分配给你一项任务。完成它就会令我满意。",
    ["Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'.  That is sure to help you increase your skill."] = "我没什么可以教你的了。我听说藏宝海湾有个名叫海明威的老头，他在出售《鲈鱼与你》这本书，它对你提高钓鱼技能大有帮助。",
    ["Your skill in blacksmithing is exceptional, $n. The time has come to make a decision. There are two paths you may choose: The way of the weaponsmith or the art of the armorsmith.$B$BBe warned, when you have chosen to dedicate yourself to a path, there is no going back. The discipline each path requires leaves no room for hybrids."] = "你在锻造方面的技术已经非常高超了，$n。该做出决定了。有两条路你可以选择：武器制造工匠或是装甲制造工匠。$B$B注意，当你做出决定以后，就不能回头了。每个方向的守则都不允许你三心二意。",
    ["Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there."] = "你的技能已经非我能及。现在你该接受新的挑战了。塔兰丹会帮你准备。他就站在那里的桌子旁边。",
    ["Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you'll be running a leather shop of your own. I'll be glad for the help, $n. My hands are only so fast, you know? There's so much work to do!"] = "你的技术在进步,很快你就会拥有一家你自己的皮革商店。我很高兴能帮你，$n。我的速度就只能这么快了，你知道吗？有那么多工作要做！",
    ["Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons."] = "你的技艺不足以学会我所教授的。去找那边的玛克谈谈。他可以帮你直到你准备好学习更高级的课程。",
    ["Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can. "] = "你的技艺胜过我的水平了，陌生人。与石爪山脉烈日石居的赫加斯谈谈。他会传授你比我还要多的知识。",
    ["Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training..."] = "你的技能正变得非同寻常。现在，继续你的训练……",
    ["Your skills in alchemy aren't yet high enough to benefit from my teachings.  Perhaps if you speak with me later..."] = "你的炼金技能还不足以理解我所传授的知识。也许你应该晚些时候再来找我谈谈……",
    ["Your stench will attract every dragon for miles.  Tell me what you want, and quickly."] = "你的臭气会把数英里内的所有龙都招来的。告诉我你想要什么，快些。",
    ["Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student."] = "你的智慧胜于我，朋友。与这里的塔恩谈话；他对皮革的知识比我要丰富得多。我肯定他会欢迎新学生的。",
    ["Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction."] = "你的才能出众！你真是有灵性。你要想继续追求知识的话，找暴风城的乔吉奥·波利罗谈谈。他深受众人尊敬，而且他能深化对你的指导。",
    ["Your talents in cooking are a little too low.  Maybe with some practice I can teach you what I know."] = "你的烹饪水平实在是太低了。再去训练一段时间，也许我就可以教你一些我所知道的东西。",
    ["Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents."] = "你对皮革的理解比我要深刻。可能你应该拜访一下贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的牛头人克鲁姆·满月。对你这么聪明的学生他有很多知识要教给你。",
    ["Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength."] = "你的嗓子喊哑了是吗？在力量谷就可以找到奥格瑞玛拍卖行。",
    ["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c."] = "你的意志不足以操纵我们控制的军队，$c。",
    ["Your will is strong, and your intent is clear.$B$BPerhaps you are worthy..."] = "你的意志很坚强，而且你的意图很明显。$B$B可能你的确有资格……",
    ["Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells.  He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion's Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he's in."] = "扎尔迪玛可能会教你一些新的法术。他最近喜欢待在狮王之傲旅店，你可以去那里的房间看看他在不在。",
    ["Zando'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando'zan help you? He can't! He won't!"] = "碎手氏族的赞杜沙。赞杜沙怎么会帮你？他不能！也绝对不会！",
    ["Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. This magic will help you in defeating Hakkar and his minions.$B$BI only ask that you bring me two items."] = "赞扎能制造古老的附魔物品。这种魔法可以帮助你打败哈卡和他的爪牙。$B$B我只要你帮我找3种东西。我承认有一样东西不是必需的，但是我想净化那些高等精灵的魔法。",
    ["Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don't you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "扎瑞恩看起来很了解烹饪行业。为什么你不去看看他是否会给你一些食谱呢？他通常在多兰纳尔的旅店旁边烹饪。",
    ["Zayus and his priests are in the Spirit Lodge, which is in the Valley of Spirits.  Look for it on the lake up above and to west of the Valley of Strength."] = "萨尤斯与他的牧师在精神谷那的灵魂小屋里。去力量谷上方西侧的湖泊那里可以找到他。",
    ["Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You'll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself."] = "你好，勇敢的$c！我有世界上最训练有素的狼供你挑选。你到哪里都不会发现能与狼拥有同样的耐力和生存本能的动物！你亲自来看看它们吧。",
    ["Zug zug, my friend!  I am Kelm Hargunth, the main supplier for the Warsong Outriders.  As you improve your standing with the Outriders, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."] = "你好，我的朋友！我是哈古斯，战歌前锋部队的军需官。随着你在战歌氏族中的声望不断提升，我可以为你提供一些可在战歌峡谷中使用的商品。如果你需要修理装备的话，我也可以提供这样的服务。",
    ["Zul'Farrak in Tanaris Desert is Elder Wildmane's home."] = "蛮鬃长者的家在塔纳里斯沙漠的祖尔法拉克。",
    ["Zul'jin shall return one day, $r. Mark my words. Until then, we all hold our positions and do what we can to keep the forest troll population intact.$B$BWith that said, as master huntsman of Revantusk Village, it is my responsibility to insure that the world around us is safe for habitation.$B$BThe beasts of this area must be kept in check.$B$BAre you looking for work?"] = "祖尔金总有一天会回来的，$r。记住我的话。在那一天到来之前，我们会尽我们的所能保证森林巨魔族群的昌盛。$B$B作为恶齿村的猎人头领，我的责任就是保证我们的安全。$B$B我必须对这一带的野兽进行监控。$B$B你是不是来找些活干的？",
}
